</tbody></table>

</section></section><section data-mw-section-id="5" id="mwBOs" aria-labelledby="Focus_particles_and_nucleus_splitting"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Focus_particles_and_nucleus_splitting">Focus particles and nucleus splitting</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Japanese_conjugation&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5" title="Edit section: Focus particles and nucleus splitting"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwBOw">The <b id="mwBO0">nucleus</b> of a sentence, or a <b id="mwBO4">nuclear sentence</b>, requires nothing more than a verb, adjective, or noun-copula phrase, to stand on its own as a complete, grammatical utterance:<sup about="#mwt399" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTEMartin200429_43-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;group&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;FOOTNOTEMartin200429&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEMartin200429-43&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;sfnp&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Sfnp&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Martin&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;2004&quot;},&quot;p&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;29&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTEMartin200429-43" id="mwBO8"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBPA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBPE">[</span>41<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBPI">]</span></span></a></sup></p>
<ul id="mwBPM"><li id="mwBPQ">Verbal nucleus: <span title="Hepburn transliteration" about="#mwt402" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBPU" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:nihongo&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;nihongo&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;呼ぶ&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Yobu&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;{{gloss|[subject] calls [object]}}&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><i lang="ja-Latn">Yobu</i></span><span style="font-weight: normal" about="#mwt402" id="mwBPY"> (<span title="Japanese-language text"><span lang="ja">呼ぶ</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text">; <span class="gloss-quot">'</span><span class="gloss-text">[subject] calls [object]</span><span class="gloss-quot">'</span>)</span>: I (will) call him, she calls me, she will call me, etc.</li>
<li id="mwBPc">Adjectival nucleus: <span title="Hepburn transliteration" about="#mwt403" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBPg" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:nihongo&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;nihongo&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;大きい&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Ōkii&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;{{gloss|[subject] is big}}&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><i lang="ja-Latn">Ōkii</i></span><span style="font-weight: normal" about="#mwt403" id="mwBPk"> (<span title="Japanese-language text"><span lang="ja">大きい</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text">; <span class="gloss-quot">'</span><span class="gloss-text">[subject] is big</span><span class="gloss-quot">'</span>)</span>: it is big, they are big, etc.</li>
<li id="mwBPo">Nominal nucleus: <span title="Hepburn transliteration" about="#mwt404" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBPs" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:nihongo&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;nihongo&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;本だ&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Hon da&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;{{gloss|[subject] is a book}}&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><i lang="ja-Latn">Hon da</i></span><span style="font-weight: normal" about="#mwt404" id="mwBPw"> (<span title="Japanese-language text"><span lang="ja">本だ</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text">; <span class="gloss-quot">'</span><span class="gloss-text">[subject] is a book</span><span class="gloss-quot">'</span>)</span>: this is a book, those are books, etc.</li></ul>

<p id="mwBP0">Notice how there are no mentions of explicit subjects or objects, whether they be nouns or <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pro-drop_language" title="Pro-drop language" id="mwBP4">pronouns</a>, in the above examples, unlike in the possible English translations. The nucleus is the only essential part of discourse, with other information, such the subject and the object, being supplementally built on top of it:</p>
<ul id="mwBP8"><li id="mwBQA"><span title="Hepburn transliteration" about="#mwt405" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBQE" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:nihongo&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;nihongo&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;呼ぶ&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Yobu&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;{{gloss|[subject] calls [object]}}&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><i lang="ja-Latn">Yobu</i></span><span style="font-weight: normal" about="#mwt405" id="mwBQI"> (<span title="Japanese-language text"><span lang="ja">呼ぶ</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text">; <span class="gloss-quot">'</span><span class="gloss-text">[subject] calls [object]</span><span class="gloss-quot">'</span>)</span>
<ul id="mwBQM"><li id="mwBQQ">→ <span title="Hepburn transliteration" about="#mwt406" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBQU" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:nihongo&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;nihongo&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;母が呼ぶ&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Haha ga yobu&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;{{gloss|The mother calls [object]}}&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><i lang="ja-Latn">Haha ga yobu</i></span><span style="font-weight: normal" about="#mwt406" id="mwBQY"> (<span title="Japanese-language text"><span lang="ja">母が呼ぶ</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text">; <span class="gloss-quot">'</span><span class="gloss-text">The mother calls [object]</span><span class="gloss-quot">'</span>)</span></li>
<li id="mwBQc">→ <span title="Hepburn transliteration" about="#mwt407" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBQg" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:nihongo&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;nihongo&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;子供を呼ぶ&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Kodomo o yobu&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;{{gloss|[subject] calls the child}}&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><i lang="ja-Latn">Kodomo o yobu</i></span><span style="font-weight: normal" about="#mwt407" id="mwBQk"> (<span title="Japanese-language text"><span lang="ja">子供を呼ぶ</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text">; <span class="gloss-quot">'</span><span class="gloss-text">[subject] calls the child</span><span class="gloss-quot">'</span>)</span>
<ul id="mwBQo"><li id="mwBQs">→ <span title="Hepburn transliteration" about="#mwt408" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBQw" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:nihongo&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;nihongo&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;母が子供を呼ぶ&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Haha ga kodomo o yobu&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;{{gloss|The mother calls the child}}&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><i lang="ja-Latn">Haha ga kodomo o yobu</i></span><span style="font-weight: normal" about="#mwt408" id="mwBQ0"> (<span title="Japanese-language text"><span lang="ja">母が子供を呼ぶ</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text">; <span class="gloss-quot">'</span><span class="gloss-text">The mother calls the child</span><span class="gloss-quot">'</span>)</span></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>

<p id="mwBQ4">Certain <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Japanese_particle" title="Japanese particle" class="mw-redirect" id="mwBQ8">Japanese particles</a> allow what <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#CITEREFMartin2004" about="#mwt409" typeof="mw:Transclusion" class="mw-selflink-fragment" id="mwBRA" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;harvcoltxt&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Harvcoltxt&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Martin&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;2004&quot;},&quot;pp&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;316–326&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}">Martin (2004</a><span about="#mwt409">:316–326)</span><span class="error harv-error" style="display: none; font-size:100%" about="#mwt409"> harvcoltxt error: no target: CITEREFMartin2004 (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category:Harv_and_Sfn_template_errors" title="Category:Harv and Sfn template errors">help</a>)</span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Harv_and_Sfn_no-target_errors" about="#mwt409" id="mwBRE"> calls "nucleus splitting." When a nucleus is split, a focus particle is inserted between its <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Japanese_conjugation_(ren'yōkei_base)#Infinitive" title="Japanese conjugation (ren'yōkei base)" id="mwBRI">infinitive</a> and its auxiliary, the latter of which normally either fuses with the former into a single contraction, or does not surface at all:<sup about="#mwt410" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FOOTNOTEMartin2004316_44-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Extension/ref" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;group&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;FOOTNOTEMartin2004316&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEMartin2004316-44&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;sfnp&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Sfnp&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Martin&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;2004&quot;},&quot;p&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;316&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><a href="#cite_note-FOOTNOTEMartin2004316-44" id="mwBRM"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBRQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBRU">[</span>42<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBRY">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<table class="wikitable" id="mwBRc">
<tbody id="mwBRg"><tr id="mwBRk">
<th id="mwBRo"></th>
<th id="mwBRs">"Fused" nucleus</th>
<th colspan="3" id="mwBRw">"Split" nucleus</th></tr>
<tr id="mwBR0">
<th id="mwBR4">Verbal</th>
<td style="text-align:right" id="mwBR8"><span title="Hepburn transliteration" about="#mwt413" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBSA" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:nihongo&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;nihongo&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;呼ぶ&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;yobu&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><i lang="ja-Latn">yobu</i></span><span style="font-weight: normal" about="#mwt413" id="mwBSE"> (<span title="Japanese-language text"><span lang="ja">呼ぶ</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text">)</span></td>
<td style="text-align:right;border-right:none" id="mwBSI"><span title="Hepburn transliteration" about="#mwt414" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBSM" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:nihongo&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;nihongo&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;呼び&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;yobi&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><i lang="ja-Latn">yobi</i></span><span style="font-weight: normal" about="#mwt414" id="mwBSQ"> (<span title="Japanese-language text"><span lang="ja">呼び</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text">)</span></td>
<td style="border-left:none;border-right:none" id="mwBSU">[focus particle]</td>
<td style="border-left:none" id="mwBSY"><span title="Hepburn transliteration" about="#mwt415" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBSc" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:nihongo&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;nihongo&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;する&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;suru&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;{{gloss|do}}&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><i lang="ja-Latn">suru</i></span><span style="font-weight: normal" about="#mwt415" id="mwBSg"> (<span title="Japanese-language text"><span lang="ja">する</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text">; <span class="gloss-quot">'</span><span class="gloss-text">do</span><span class="gloss-quot">'</span>)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="mwBSk">
<th id="mwBSo">Adjectival</th>
<td style="text-align:right" id="mwBSs"><span title="Hepburn transliteration" about="#mwt416" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBSw" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:nihongo&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;nihongo&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;大きい&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;ōkii&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><i lang="ja-Latn">ōkii</i></span><span style="font-weight: normal" about="#mwt416" id="mwBS0"> (<span title="Japanese-language text"><span lang="ja">大きい</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text">)</span></td>
<td style="text-align:right;border-right:none" id="mwBS4"><span title="Hepburn transliteration" about="#mwt417" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBS8" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:nihongo&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;nihongo&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;大きく&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;ōkiku&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><i lang="ja-Latn">ōkiku</i></span><span style="font-weight: normal" about="#mwt417" id="mwBTA"> (<span title="Japanese-language text"><span lang="ja">大きく</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text">)</span></td>
<td style="border-left:none;border-right:none" id="mwBTE">[focus particle]</td>
<td style="border-left:none" id="mwBTI"><span title="Hepburn transliteration" about="#mwt418" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBTM" data-mw="{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:nihongo&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;nihongo&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;ある&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;aru&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;{{gloss|exist; be}}&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><i lang="ja-Latn">aru</i></span><span style="font-weight: normal" about="#mwt418" id="mwBTQ"> (<span title="Japanese-language text"><span lang="ja">ある</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text">; <span class="gloss-quot">'</span><span class="gloss-text">exist; be</span><span class="gloss-quot">'</span>)</span></td></tr>
