i></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E3%83%A8%E3%83%8F%E3%83%8D%3Cruby%3E%E7%AC%AC%3Crp%3E%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%A0%E3%81%84%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E4%B8%80%3Crp%3E%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%84%E3%81%A4%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E6%9B%B8%3Crp%3E%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%97%E3%82%88%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%94%B9%E8%A8%B3%E6%96%B0%E7%B4%84%E8%81%96%E6%9B%B8&amp;rft.pub=Japan+Bible+Society&amp;rft.date=1917-10-05&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fja.wikisource.org%2Fwiki%2F%25E3%2583%25A8%25E3%2583%258F%25E3%2583%258D%25E3%2581%25AE%25E7%25AC%25AC%25E4%25B8%2580%25E3%2581%25AE%25E6%259B%25B8%28%25E6%2596%2587%25E8%25AA%259E%25E8%25A8%25B3%29%233%3A14&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt345" id="mwKOw"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt345" id="mwKO0"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt345" id="mwKO4"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-34" id="cite_note-34" data-mw-footnote-number="33"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwKO8"><a href="#cite_ref-34" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwKPA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwKPE">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-34" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt349" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwKPI" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;language=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:聖書&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Holy Bible&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:ヨハネの<ruby>第<rp></rp><rt>だい</rt><rp></rp></ruby>一の<ruby>手<rp></rp><rt>て</rt><rp></rp></ruby><ruby>紙<rp></rp><rt>がみ</rt><rp></rp></ruby>&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-chapter=The First Epistle of John&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=1955&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:わたしたちは、<ruby>兄<rp></rp><rt>きよう</rt><rp></rp></ruby><ruby>弟<rp></rp><rt>だい</rt><rp></rp></ruby>を<ruby>愛<rp></rp><rt>あい</rt><rp></rp></ruby>しているので、<ruby>死<rp></rp><rt>し</rt><rp></rp></ruby>からいのちへ<ruby>移<rp></rp><rt>うつ</rt><rp></rp></ruby>ってきたことを、<ruby>知<rp></rp><rt>し</rt><rp></rp></ruby>っている。<ruby>愛<rp></rp><rt>あい</rt><rp></rp></ruby>さない<ruby>者<rp></rp><rt>もの</rt><rp></rp></ruby>は、<ruby>死<rp></rp><rt>し</rt><rp></rp></ruby>のうちにとどまっている。&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Chūō, Tokyo]]&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Japan Bible Society&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=379&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt349" id="mwKPM"> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwKPQ">ヨハネの<ruby id="mwKPU">第<rp id="mwKPY"></rp><rt id="mwKPc">だい</rt><rp id="mwKPg"></rp></ruby>一の<ruby id="mwKPk">手<rp id="mwKPo"></rp><rt id="mwKPs">て</rt><rp id="mwKPw"></rp></ruby><ruby id="mwKP0">紙<rp id="mwKP4"></rp><rt id="mwKP8">がみ</rt><rp id="mwKQA"></rp></ruby></bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKQE">[</span>The First Epistle of John<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKQI">]</span>. <i id="mwKQM">Holy Bible</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwKQQ">聖書</bdi> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chūō,_Tokyo" title="Chūō, Tokyo" id="mwKQU">Chūō, Tokyo</a>: Japan Bible Society. 1955. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKQY">&nbsp;</span>379.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwKQc">わたしたちは、<ruby id="mwKQg">兄<rp id="mwKQk"></rp><rt id="mwKQo">きよう</rt><rp id="mwKQs"></rp></ruby><ruby id="mwKQw">弟<rp id="mwKQ0"></rp><rt id="mwKQ4">だい</rt><rp id="mwKQ8"></rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwKRA">愛<rp id="mwKRE"></rp><rt id="mwKRI">あい</rt><rp id="mwKRM"></rp></ruby>しているので、<ruby id="mwKRQ">死<rp id="mwKRU"></rp><rt id="mwKRY">し</rt><rp id="mwKRc"></rp></ruby>からいのちへ<ruby id="mwKRg">移<rp id="mwKRk"></rp><rt id="mwKRo">うつ</rt><rp id="mwKRs"></rp></ruby>ってきたことを、<ruby id="mwKRw">知<rp id="mwKR0"></rp><rt id="mwKR4">し</rt><rp id="mwKR8"></rp></ruby>っている。<ruby id="mwKSA">愛<rp id="mwKSE"></rp><rt id="mwKSI">あい</rt><rp id="mwKSM"></rp></ruby>さない<ruby id="mwKSQ">者<rp id="mwKSU"></rp><rt id="mwKSY">もの</rt><rp id="mwKSc"></rp></ruby>は、<ruby id="mwKSg">死<rp id="mwKSk"></rp><rt id="mwKSo">し</rt><rp id="mwKSs"></rp></ruby>のうちにとどまっている。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E3%83%A8%E3%83%8F%E3%83%8D%E3%81%AE%3Cruby%3E%E7%AC%AC%3Crp%3E%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%A0%E3%81%84%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%E4%B8%80%E3%81%AE%3Cruby%3E%E6%89%8B%3Crp%3E%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%A6%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E7%B4%99%3Crp%3E%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%8C%E3%81%BF%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E&amp;rft.btitle=Holy+Bible+%E8%81%96%E6%9B%B8&amp;rft.place=Ch%C5%AB%C5%8D%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=379&amp;rft.pub=Japan+Bible+Society&amp;rft.date=1955&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt349" id="mwKSw"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt349" id="mwKS0"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt349" id="mwKS4"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-nishino-1994-35" id="cite_note-nishino-1994-35" data-mw-footnote-number="34"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwKS8"><a href="#cite_ref-nishino-1994_35-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwKTA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwKTE">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-nishino-1994-35" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt354" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwKTI" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;language=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:竪刁は料理番ですが、わが君がまだ召し上がってないのは人間の肉だけと知ると、なんと自分の長男を殺して蒸焼きにし、勧めました。わが子を愛さぬ者はありません。わが子さえ愛せぬ者が、どうしてご主君を愛せましょう。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote=Shudiao is a cook who, after learning that his lord had not had human flesh, slaughtered his own eldest son, casseroled him, then served him up. No man does not love his own son. If he is not capable of loving even his own son, in what way could he ever love his lord?&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=108&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:八五、わが子を蒸焼きにした男&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-chapter=85, The man who casseroled his own son&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:韓非子&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=[[Han Feizi]]&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|中国古典百言百話}}&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=2&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Nishino&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Hiroyoshi&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=15 April 1994&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=PHP Institute&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Kōtō]], Tokyo&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;isbn=4-569-56628-6&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFNishino1994" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt354">Nishino, Hiroyoshi (15 April 1994).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwKTM">八五、わが子を蒸焼きにした男</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKTQ">[</span>85, The man who casseroled his own son<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKTU">]</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwKTY">韓非子</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKTc">[</span><i id="mwKTg"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Han_Feizi" title="Han Feizi" id="mwKTk">Han Feizi</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKTo">]</span>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwKTs"><span lang="ja" id="mwKTw">中国古典百言百話</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwKT0"> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKT4">&nbsp;</span>2. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kōtō" title="Kōtō" id="mwKT8">Kōtō</a>, Tokyo: PHP Institute. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKUA">&nbsp;</span>108. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)" title="ISBN (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwKUE">ISBN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKUI">&nbsp;</span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/4-569-56628-6" title="Special:BookSources/4-569-56628-6" id="mwKUM"><bdi id="mwKUQ">4-569-56628-6</bdi></a>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwKUU">竪刁は料理番ですが、わが君がまだ召し上がってないのは人間の肉だけと知ると、なんと自分の長男を殺して蒸焼きにし、勧めました。わが子を愛さぬ者はありません。わが子さえ愛せぬ者が、どうしてご主君を愛せましょう。</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKUY">[</span>Shudiao is a cook who, after learning that his lord had not had human flesh, slaughtered his own eldest son, casseroled him, then served him up. No man does not love his own son. If he is not capable of loving even his own son, in what way could he ever love his lord?<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKUc">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E5%85%AB%E4%BA%94%E3%80%81%E3%82%8F%E3%81%8C%E5%AD%90%E3%82%92%E8%92%B8%E7%84%BC%E3%81%8D%E3%81%AB%E3%81%97%E3%81%9F%E7%94%B7&amp;rft.btitle=%E9%9F%93%E9%9D%9E%E5%AD%90&amp;rft.place=K%C5%8Dt%C5%8D%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%8F%A4%E5%85%B8%E7%99%BE%E8%A8%80%E7%99%BE%E8%A9%B1%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=108&amp;rft.pub=PHP+Institute&amp;rft.date=1994-04-15&amp;rft.isbn=4-569-56628-6&amp;rft.aulast=Nishino&amp;rft.aufirst=Hiroyoshi&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt354" id="mwKUg"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt354" id="mwKUk"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt354" id="mwKUo"></span></li>
