dentifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwKe0">ISBN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKe4">&nbsp;</span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/4-08-873621-4" title="Special:BookSources/4-08-873621-4" id="mwKe8"><bdi id="mwKfA">4-08-873621-4</bdi></a>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwKfE"><ruby id="mwKfI">僕<rp id="mwKfM">(</rp><rt id="mwKfQ">ぼく</rt><rp id="mwKfU">)</rp></ruby>が<br id="mwKfY"><ruby id="mwKfc">私<rp id="mwKfg">(</rp><rt id="mwKfk">わたし</rt><rp id="mwKfo">)</rp></ruby>が<br id="mwKfs"><ruby id="mwKfw">正<rp id="mwKf0">(</rp><rt id="mwKf4">せい</rt><rp id="mwKf8">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwKgA">義<rp id="mwKgE">(</rp><rt id="mwKgI">ぎ</rt><rp id="mwKgM">)</rp></ruby>だ‼</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKgQ">[</span>I am<br id="mwKgU">I am<br id="mwKgY">justice‼<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKgc">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%EF%BD%90%EF%BD%81%EF%BD%87%EF%BD%85%EF%BC%8E%EF%BC%92+%3Cruby%3E%EF%BC%AC%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%82%A8%E3%83%AB%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E&amp;rft.btitle=%3Cruby%3EDEATH+NOTE%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%83%87%E3%82%B9%E3%83%8E%E3%83%BC%E3%83%88%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%E3%80%80%E9%80%80%E5%B1%88&amp;rft.place=Chiyoda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=80&amp;rft.pub=Shueisha&amp;rft.date=2004-04-07&amp;rft.isbn=4-08-873621-4&amp;rft.aulast=Ohba&amp;rft.aufirst=Tsugumi&amp;rft.au=Obata%2C+Takeshi&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" id="mwKgg"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" id="mwKgk"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" id="mwKgo"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-kume-1922-52" id="cite_note-kume-1922-52" data-mw-footnote-number="49"><span rel="mw:referencedBy" class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwKgs"><a href="#cite_ref-kume-1922_52-0" id="mwKgw"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwKg0">1</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-kume-1922_52-1" id="mwKg4"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwKg8">2</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-kume-1922-52" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt792" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwKhA" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:'''ハム'''。生か死か……それが問題だ。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote='''Ham'''. To be, or not to be, that is the question:&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=84&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/968980/1/47&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:第一場 場內の一室&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=Scene I. A room in the Castle.&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:ハムレット&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Hamlet&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-link=Masao Kume&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Masao&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Kume&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=William Shakespeare&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=William&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Shakespeare&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=31 December 1922&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Shinchosha&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Ushigome]], Tokyo&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFShakespeare1922" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt792"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Shakespeare" title="William Shakespeare" id="mwKhE">Shakespeare, William</a> (31 December 1922). "Scene I. A room in the Castle." <bdi lang="ja" id="mwKhI">第一場 場內の一室</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/968980/1/47" class="external text" id="mwKhM"><i id="mwKhQ">Hamlet</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwKhU">ハムレット</bdi></a> (in Japanese). Translated by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Masao_Kume" title="Masao Kume" id="mwKhY">Kume, Masao</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ushigome" title="Ushigome" id="mwKhc">Ushigome</a>, Tokyo: Shinchosha. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKhg">&nbsp;</span>84. <q id="mwKhk"><b id="mwKho">Ham</b>. To be, or not to be, that is the question:</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwKhs"><b id="mwKhw">ハム</b>。生か死か……それが問題だ。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=Scene+I.+A+room+in+the+Castle.+%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%A0%B4+%E5%A0%B4%E5%85%A7%E3%81%AE%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%A4&amp;rft.btitle=Hamlet+%E3%83%8F%E3%83%A0%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88&amp;rft.place=Ushigome%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=84&amp;rft.pub=Shinchosha&amp;rft.date=1922-12-31&amp;rft.aulast=Shakespeare&amp;rft.aufirst=William&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F968980%2F1%2F47&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt792" id="mwKh0"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt792" id="mwKh4"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt792" id="mwKh8"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-seta-tanaka-1992-b2-p2-53" id="cite_note-seta-tanaka-1992-b2-p2-53" data-mw-footnote-number="50"><span rel="mw:referencedBy" class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwKiA"><a href="#cite_ref-seta-tanaka-1992-b2-p2_53-0" id="mwKiE"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwKiI">1</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-seta-tanaka-1992-b2-p2_53-1" id="mwKiM"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwKiQ">2</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-seta-tanaka-1992-b2-p2-53" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt807" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwKiU" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「きさまは渡ることはできぬ。」と、かれはいいました。オークどもはじっと立ちつくし、死の静けさがあたりをみたしました。「わしは神秘の火に仕える者、アノールの焰の使い手じゃ。きさまは渡ることはできぬ。暗き火、ウドゥンの焰はきさまの助けとはならぬ。常つ闇に戻るがよい！　きさまは渡れぬぞ。」<br/>[…]<br/>「きさまは通すことができぬ！」と、かれはいいました。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pages=29–30&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=‘You cannot pass,’ he said. The orcs stood still, and a dead silence fell. ‘I am a servant of the Secret Fire, wielder of the flame of Anor. You cannot pass. The dark fire will not avail you, flame of Udûn. Go back to the Shadow! You cannot pass.’<br/>[…]<br/>‘You cannot pass!’ he said.&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:五 カザド゠ドゥムの橋&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=V The Bridge of Khazad-dûm&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:旅の仲間　下２&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=[[The Fellowship of the Ring|The Travelling Fellowship]]: Book 2, Part 2&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=4&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;edition=10th&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|指輪物語}}&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Seta&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Teiji&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first2=Akiko&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last2=Tanaka&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=J. R. R. Tolkien&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=John Ronald Reuel&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Tolkien&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Hyōronsha&quot;},&quot;21&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=10 May 2002&quot;},&quot;22&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;orig-date=30 July 1992&quot;},&quot;23&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Shinjuku]], Tokyo&quot;},&quot;24&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;isbn=4-566-02365-6&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFTolkien2002" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt807"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/J._R._R._Tolkien" title="J. R. R. Tolkien" id="mwKiY">Tolkien, John Ronald Reuel</a> (10 May 2002) [30 July 1992]. "V The Bridge of Khazad-dûm" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwKic">五 カザド゠ドゥムの橋</bdi>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwKig">旅の仲間　下２</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKik">[</span><i id="mwKio"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Fellowship_of_the_Ring" title="The Fellowship of the Ring" id="mwKis">The Travelling Fellowship</a>: Book 2, Part 2</i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKiw">]</span>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwKi0"><span lang="ja" id="mwKi4">指輪物語</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwKi8"> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKjA">&nbsp;</span>4. Translated by Seta, Teiji; Tanaka, Akiko (10th<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKjE">&nbsp;</span>ed.). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shinjuku" title="Shinjuku" id="mwKjI">Shinjuku</a>, Tokyo: Hyōronsha. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKjM">&nbsp;</span><span class="nowrap" id="mwKjQ">29–</span>30. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)" title="ISBN (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwKjU">ISBN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKjY">&nbsp;</span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/4-566-02365-6" title="Special:BookSources/4-566-02365-6" id="mwKjc"><bdi id="mwKjg">4-566-02365-6</bdi></a>. <q id="mwKjk"><span class="cs1-kern-left" id="mwKjo"></span>'You cannot pass,' he said. The orcs stood still, and a dead silence fell. 'I am a servant of the Secret Fire, wielder of the flame of Anor. You cannot pass. The dark fire will not avail you, flame of Udûn. Go back to the Shadow! You cannot pass.'<br id="mwKjs">[…]<br id="mwKjw">'You cannot pass!' he said.</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwKj0">「きさまは渡ることはできぬ。」と、かれはいいました。オークどもはじっと立ちつくし、死の静けさがあたりをみたしました。「わしは神秘の火に仕える者、アノールの焰の使い手じゃ。きさまは渡ることはできぬ。暗き火、ウドゥンの焰はきさまの助けとはならぬ。常つ闇に戻るがよい！　きさまは渡れぬぞ。」<br id="mwKj4">[…]<br id="mwKj8">「きさまは通すことができぬ！」と、かれはいいました。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=V+The+Bridge+of+Khazad-d%C3%BBm+%E4%BA%94+%E3%82%AB%E3%82%B6%E3%83%89%E3%82%A0%E3%83%89%E3%82%A5%E3%83%A0%E3%81%AE%E6%A9%8B&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%97%85%E3%81%AE%E4%BB%B2%E9%96%93%E3%80%80%E4%B8%8B%EF%BC%92&amp;rft.place=Shinjuku%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E6%8C%87%E8%BC%AA%E7%89%A9%E8%AA%9E%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=29-30&amp;rft.edition=10th&amp;rft.pub=Hy%C5%8Dronsha&amp;rft.date=2002-05-10&amp;rft.isbn=4-566-02365-6&amp;rft.aulast=Tolkien&amp;rft.aufirst=John+Ronald+Reuel&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt807" id="mwKkA"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt807" id="mwKkE"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt807" id="mwKkI"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-54" id="cite_note-54" data-mw-footnote-number="51"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwKkM"><a href="#cite_ref-54" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwKkQ"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwKkU">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-54" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt473" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwKkY" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"><cite id="CITEREFSorachi2004" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hideaki_Sorachi" title="Hideaki Sorachi" id="mwKkc">Sorachi, Hideaki</a> (7 April 2004).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwKkg"><ruby id="mwKkk">第<rp id="mwKko">(</rp><rt id="mwKks">だい</rt><rp id="mwKkw">)</rp></ruby>五<ruby id="mwKk0">訓<rp id="mwKk4">(</rp><rt id="mwKk8">くん</rt><rp id="mwKlA">)</rp></ruby> ジジイになってもあだ<ruby id="mwKlE">名<rp id="mwKlI">(</rp><rt id="mwKlM">な</rt><rp id="mwKlQ">)</rp></ruby>で<ruby id="mwKlU">呼<rp id="mwKlY">(</rp><rt id="mwKlc">よ</rt><rp id="mwKlg">)</rp></ruby>び<ruby id="mwKlk">合<rp id="mwKlo">(</rp><rt id="mwKls">あ</rt><rp id="mwKlw">)</rp></ruby>える<ruby id="mwKl0">友<rp id="mwKl4">(</rp><rt id="mwKl8">とも</rt><rp id="mwKmA">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwKmE">達<rp id="mwKmI">(</rp><rt id="mwKmM">だち</rt><rp id="mwKmQ">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwKmU">作<rp id="mwKmY">(</rp><rt id="mwKmc">つく</rt><rp id="mwKmg">)</rp></ruby>れ</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKmk">[</span>Lesson 5: Make Friends You Can Go by Nicknames with, Even If They’re a Codger<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKmo">]</span>. In Homesha (ed.).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwKms"><ruby id="mwKmw">銀魂<rp id="mwKm0">(</rp><rt id="mwKm4">ぎんたま</rt><rp id="mwKm8">)</rp></ruby>　<ruby id="mwKnA">天<rp id="mwKnE">(</rp><rt id="mwKnI">てん</rt><rp id="mwKnM">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwKnQ">然<rp id="mwKnU">(</rp><rt id="mwKnY">ねん</rt><rp id="mwKnc">)</rp></ruby>パーマに<ruby id="mwKng">悪<rp id="mwKnk">(</rp><rt id="mwKno">わる</rt><rp id="mwKns">)</rp></ruby>い<ruby id="mwKnw">奴<rp id="mwKn0">(</rp><rt id="mwKn4">やつ</rt><rp id="mwKn8">)</rp></ruby>はいない</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKoA">[</span><i id="mwKoE"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gintama" title="Gintama" id="mwKoI">Silver Soul</a>: No Such Thing as a Bad Guy with a Natural Perm</i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKoM">]</span> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKoQ">&nbsp;</span>1. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiyoda,_Tokyo" title="Chiyoda, Tokyo" id="mwKoU">Chiyoda, Tokyo</a>: Shueisha. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKoY">&nbsp;</span>142. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)" title="ISBN (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwKoc">ISBN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKog">&nbsp;</span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/4-08-873623-0" title="Special:BookSources/4-08-873623-0" id="mwKok"><bdi id="mwKoo">4-08-873623-0</bdi></a>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwKos">おまっ…ヅラ<ruby id="mwKow">小<rp id="mwKo0">(</rp><rt id="mwKo4">こ</rt><rp id="mwKo8">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwKpA">太<rp id="mwKpE">(</rp><rt id="mwKpI">た</rt><rp id="mwKpM">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwKpQ">郎<rp id="mwKpU">(</rp><rt id="mwKpY">ろう</rt><rp id="mwKpc">)</rp></ruby>か⁉<br id="mwKpg">ヅラじゃない　<ruby id="mwKpk">桂<rp id="mwKpo">(</rp><rt id="mwKps">かつら</rt><rp id="mwKpw">)</rp></ruby>だァァ‼<br id="mwKp0">ぶふォ‼</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKp4">[</span>You… Zura Kotarō⁉<br id="mwKp8">It’s not Zura, it’s Katsuraaa‼<br id="mwKqA">Oof‼<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwKqE">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%3Cruby%3E%E7%AC%AC%3C