<li about="#cite_note-101" id="cite_note-101" data-mw-footnote-number="90"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLJI"><a href="#cite_ref-101" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwLJM"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLJQ">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-101" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt748" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwLJU" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:このとき，観察や面接（聴き取り）はデータ採取の方法であり，量的研究の用語では「測定」である．[…]<br/>これに対する答えは，No でありYes である．[…]これは分析手続きだけでなく，データ採取から理論化までの研究デザイン全体を規定するフレームワークであり，あらゆる領域で世界的に用いられる優れた手法である．&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=155&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.jstage.jst.go.jp/article/kansei/10/3/10_155/_pdf/-char/ja&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Ōtani&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Takashi&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:SCAT: Steps for Coding and Theorization　― 明示的手続きで着手しやすく小規模データに適用可能な質的データ分析手法―&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:感性工学&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=10&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=3&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=2011&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFŌtani2011" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt748">Ōtani, Takashi (2011). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.jstage.jst.go.jp/article/kansei/10/3/10_155/_pdf/-char/ja" class="external text" id="mwLJY"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwLJc">SCAT: Steps for Coding and Theorization　― 明示的手続きで着手しやすく小規模データに適用可能な質的データ分析手法―</bdi></a>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLJg">感性工学</bdi> (in Japanese). <b id="mwLJk">10</b> (3): 155.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLJo">このとき，観察や面接（聴き取り）はデータ採取の方法であり，量的研究の用語では「測定」である．[…]<br id="mwLJs">これに対する答えは，No でありYes である．[…]これは分析手続きだけでなく，データ採取から理論化までの研究デザイン全体を規定するフレームワークであり，あらゆる領域で世界的に用いられる優れた手法である．</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=SCAT%3A+Steps+for+Coding+and+Theorization%E3%80%80%E2%80%95+%E6%98%8E%E7%A4%BA%E7%9A%84%E6%89%8B%E7%B6%9A%E3%81%8D%E3%81%A7%E7%9D%80%E6%89%8B%E3%81%97%E3%82%84%E3%81%99%E3%81%8F%E5%B0%8F%E8%A6%8F%E6%A8%A1%E3%83%87%E3%83%BC%E3%82%BF%E3%81%AB%E9%81%A9%E7%94%A8%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E3%81%AA%E8%B3%AA%E7%9A%84%E3%83%87%E3%83%BC%E3%82%BF%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E6%89%8B%E6%B3%95%E2%80%95&amp;rft.volume=10&amp;rft.issue=3&amp;rft.pages=155&amp;rft.date=2011&amp;rft.aulast=%C5%8Ctani&amp;rft.aufirst=Takashi&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.jstage.jst.go.jp%2Farticle%2Fkansei%2F10%2F3%2F10_155%2F_pdf%2F-char%2Fja&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt748" id="mwLJw"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt748" id="mwLJ0"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt748" id="mwLJ4"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-102" id="cite_note-102" data-mw-footnote-number="91"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLJ8"><a href="#cite_ref-102" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwLKA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLKE">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-102" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt751" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwLKI" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:ただし、人前で質問することをいつまでも恥ずかしがっていることも問題ではあり、大学教育だけの問題ではないが、自分の考えを人前でも述べられるように指導していくことも重要であると感じた。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=57&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:オンライン講義と対面講義における学生の意識比較&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Comparison of students' attitude against online and face-to-face lecture&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last1=Takahara&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first1=Toshiyuki&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last2=Miyazato&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first2=Shin'ichi&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:工学教育研究&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal=KIT Progress&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=29&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=2021&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=http://kitir.kanazawa-it.ac.jp/infolib/cont/01/G0000002repository/000/000/000000257.pdf&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFTakaharaMiyazato2021" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt751">Takahara, Toshiyuki; Miyazato, Shin'ichi (2021). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="http://kitir.kanazawa-it.ac.jp/infolib/cont/01/G0000002repository/000/000/000000257.pdf" class="external text" id="mwLKM">"Comparison of students' attitude against online and face-to-face lecture" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLKQ">オンライン講義と対面講義における学生の意識比較</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwLKU">(PDF)</span>. <i id="mwLKY">KIT Progress</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLKc">工学教育研究</bdi> (in Japanese) (29): 57.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLKg">ただし、人前で質問することをいつまでも恥ずかしがっていることも問題ではあり、大学教育だけの問題ではないが、自分の考えを人前でも述べられるように指導していくことも重要であると感じた。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=KIT+Progress&amp;rft.atitle=Comparison+of+students%27+attitude+against+online+and+face-to-face+lecture+%E3%82%AA%E3%83%B3%E3%83%A9%E3%82%A4%E3%83%B3%E8%AC%9B%E7%BE%A9%E3%81%A8%E5%AF%BE%E9%9D%A2%E8%AC%9B%E7%BE%A9%E3%81%AB%E3%81%8A%E3%81%91%E3%82%8B%E5%AD%A6%E7%94%9F%E3%81%AE%E6%84%8F%E8%AD%98%E6%AF%94%E8%BC%83&amp;rft.issue=29&amp;rft.pages=57&amp;rft.date=2021&amp;rft.aulast=Takahara&amp;rft.aufirst=Toshiyuki&amp;rft.au=Miyazato%2C+Shin%27ichi&amp;rft_id=http%3A%2F%2Fkitir.kanazawa-it.ac.jp%2Finfolib%2Fcont%2F01%2FG0000002repository%2F000%2F000%2F000000257.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt751" id="mwLKk"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt751" id="mwLKo"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt751" id="mwLKs"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-103" id="cite_note-103" data-mw-footnote-number="92"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLKw"><a href="#cite_ref-103" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwLK0"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLK4">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-103" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt756" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwLK8" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:ジェネリックスキルの育成を目指す場合、授業のアクティブ化は必要条件ではあっても十分条件ではありません。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.innov.nagasaki-u.ac.jp/teacher/files/Int_yamaji.pdf&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Yamaji&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Hiroki&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:アクティブ・ラーニングの実質化に向けて&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:長崎大学におけるアクティブ・ラーニングの事例&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=1&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=2013&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Nagasaki University&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFYamaji2013" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt756">Yamaji, Hiroki (2013). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.innov.nagasaki-u.ac.jp/teacher/files/Int_yamaji.pdf" class="external text" id="mwLLA"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwLLE">アクティブ・ラーニングの実質化に向けて</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwLLI">(PDF)</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLLM">長崎大学におけるアクティブ・ラーニングの事例</bdi> (in Japanese). <b id="mwLLQ">1</b>. Nagasaki University.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLLU">ジェネリックスキルの育成を目指す場合、授業のアクティブ化は必要条件ではあっても十分条件ではありません。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E3%82%A2%E3%82%AF%E3%83%86%E3%82%A3%E3%83%96%E3%83%BB%E3%83%A9%E3%83%BC%E3%83%8B%E3%83%B3%E3%82%B0%E3%81%AE%E5%AE%9F%E8%B3%AA%E5%8C%96%E3%81%AB%E5%90%91%E3%81%91%E3%81%A6&amp;rft.volume=1&amp;rft.date=2013&amp;rft.aulast=Yamaji&amp;rft.aufirst=Hiroki&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.innov.nagasaki-u.ac.jp%2Fteacher%2Ffiles%2FInt_yamaji.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt756" id="mwLLY"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt756" id="mwLLc"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt756" id="mwLLg"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-104" id="cite_note-104" data-mw-footnote-number="93"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLLk"><a href="#cite_ref-104" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwLLo"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLLs">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-104" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt759" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwLLw" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:PC 及びクラウド活用が日常化した学級の授業であっても，例えば PC やクラウドの活用を目的とするような新しい学習活動はみられなかった．&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=212&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.jstage.jst.go.jp/article/jjet/45/Suppl./45_S45101/_pdf/-char/ja&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last1=Murakami&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first1=Yuito&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last2=Todoroki&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first2=Rina&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last3=Takahashi&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first3=Jun&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:日常的に1人1台端末及びクラウドを活用している学級の授業における児童の PC 活用の特徴に関する事例分析&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:日本教育工学会論文誌&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=45&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=6 July 2021&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFMurakamiTodorokiTakahashi2021" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt759">Murakami, Yuito; Todoroki, Rina; Takahashi, Jun (6 July 2021). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.jstage.jst.go.jp/article/jjet/45/Suppl./45_S45101/_pdf/-char/ja" class="external text" id="mwLL0"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwLL4">日常的に1人1台端末及びクラウドを活用している学級の授業における児童の PC 活用の特徴に関する事例分析</bdi></a>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLL8">日本教育工学会論文誌</bdi> (in Japanese) (45): 212.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLMA">PC 及びクラウド活用が日常化した学級の授業であっても，例えば PC やクラウドの活用を目的とするような新しい学習活動はみられなかった．</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E6%97%A5%E5%B8%B8%E7%9A%84%E3%81%AB1%E4%BA%BA1%E5%8F%B0%E7%AB%AF%E6%9C%AB%E5%8F%8A%E3%81%B3%E3%82%AF%E3%83%A9%E3%82%A6%E3%83%89%E3%82%92%E6%B4%BB%E7%94%A8%E3%81%97%E3%81%A6%E3%81%84%E3%82%8B%E5%AD%A6%E7%B4%9A%E3%81%AE%E6%8E%88%E6%A5%AD%E3%81%AB%E3%81%8A%E3%81%91%E3%82%8B%E5%85%90%E7%AB%A5%E3%81%AE+PC+%E6%B4%BB%E7%94%A8%E3%81%AE%E7%89%B9%E5%BE%B4%E3%81%AB%E9%96%A2%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B%E4%BA%8B%E4%BE%8B%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90&amp;rft.issue=45&amp;rft.pages=212&amp;rft.date=2021-07-06&amp;rft.aulast=Murakami&amp;rft.aufirst=Yuito&amp;rft.au=Todoroki%2C+Rina&amp;rft.au=Takahashi%2C+Jun&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.jstage.jst.go.jp%2Farticle%2Fjjet%2F45%2FSuppl.%2F45_S45101%2F_pdf%2F-char%2Fja&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt759" id="mwLME"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt759" id="mwLMI"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt759" id="mwLMM"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-105" id="cite_note-105" data-mw-footnote-number="94"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLMQ"><a href="#cite_ref-105" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwLMU"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLMY">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-105" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt762" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwLMc" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:酒も見事だ、<ruby>盃<rp>(</rp><rt>コップ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も上等<br/>似あった同士がひっついて、<br/>酒じゃあっても、<ruby>盃<rp>(</rp><rt>コップ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じゃないぞ！<br/><ruby>盃<rp>(</rp><rt>コップ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じゃあっても、酒じゃない！&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=“Clear’s the wine, the cup’s fine;<br/>Like to like they combine:<br/>It is wine and not cup!<br/>‘Tis a cup and not wine!”&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:千夜一夜物語&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=[[One Thousand and One Nights|Tales of One Thousand and One Nights]]&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=2&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Gutenberg21&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Setagaya]], Tokyo&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=29 March 2013&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Richard Francis Burton&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Richard Francis&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Burton&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Masafumi&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Ōba&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:仕立屋の話の結び&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=The End of the Tailor’s Tale.&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=The Book of the Thousand Nights and a Night&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFBurton2013" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt762"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Richard_Francis_Burton" title="Richard Francis Burton" id="mwLMg">Burton, Richard Francis</a> (29 March 2013). "The End of the Tailor's Tale." <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLMk">仕立屋の話の結び</bdi>. <i id="mwLMo">The Book of the Thousand Nights and a Night</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLMs">千夜一夜物語</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLMw">[</span><i id="mwLM0"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Thousand_and_One_Nights" title="One Thousand and One Nights" id="mwLM4">Tales of One Thousand and One Nights</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLM8">]</span> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLNA">&nbsp;</span>2. Translated by Ōba, Masafumi. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Setagaya" title="Setagaya" id="mwLNE">Setagaya</a>, Tokyo: Gutenberg21. <q id="mwLNI"><span class="cs1-kern-left" id="mwLNM"></span>"Clear's the wine, the cup's fine;<br id="mwLNQ">Like to like they combine:<br id="mwLNU">It is wine and not cup!<br id="mwLNY">'Tis a cup and not wine!"<span class="cs1-kern-right" id="mwLNc"></span></q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLNg">酒も見事だ、<ruby id="mwLNk">盃<rp id="mwLNo">(</rp><rt id="mwLNs">コップ</rt><rp id="mwLNw">)</rp></ruby>も上等<br id="mwLN0">似あった同士がひっついて、<br id="mwLN4">酒じゃあっても、<ruby id="mwLN8">盃<rp id="mwLOA">(</rp><rt id="mwLOE">コップ</rt><rp id="mwLOI">)</rp></ruby>じゃないぞ！<br id="mwLOM"><ruby id="mwLOQ">盃<rp id="mwLOU">(</rp><rt id="mwLOY">コップ</rt><rp id="mwLOc">)</rp></ruby>じゃあっても、酒じゃない！</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=The+End+of+the+Tailor%E2%80%99s+Tale.+%E4%BB%95%E7%AB%8B%E5%B1%8B%E3%81%AE%E8%A9%B1%E3%81%AE%E7%B5%90%E3%81%B3&amp;rft.btitle=The+Book+of+the+Thousand+Nights+and+a+Night+%E5%8D%83%E5%A4%9C%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%9C%E7%89%A9%E8%AA%9E&amp;rft.place=Setagaya%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pub=Gutenberg21&amp;rft.date=2013-03-29&amp;rft.aulast=Burton&amp;rft.aufirst=Richard+Francis&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt762" id="mwLOg"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt762" id="mwLOk"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt762" id="mwLOo"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-FOOTNOTEMartin20041028-106" id="cite_note-FOOTNOTEMartin20041028-106" data-mw-footnote-number="95"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLOs"><a href="#cite_ref-FOOTNOTEMartin20041028_106-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwLOw"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLO0">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEMartin20041028-106" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#CITEREFMartin2004" class="mw-selflink-fragment" id="mwLO4">Martin (2004)</a>, p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLO8">&nbsp;</span>1028.<span class="error harv-error" style="display: none; font-size:100%" id="mwLPA"> sfnp error: no target: CITEREFMartin2004 (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category:Harv_and_Sfn_template_errors" title="Category:Harv and Sfn template errors" id="mwLPE">help</a>)</span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Harv_and_Sfn_no-target_errors" id="mwLPI"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-107" id="cite_note-107" data-mw-footnote-number="96"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLPM"><a href="#cite_ref-107" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwLPQ"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLPU">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-107" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt770" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwLPY" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;citation&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Citation&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;language&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;ja&quot;},&quot;script-quote&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;ja:起業家の輩出という点では、私ども大学関係者に非常に大きな課題というものが突きつけられているわけでありまして、今回のフォーラムは、起業家の輩出のために、大学、そしてビジネス教育に携わる教員、それからその教育の受け手となる学生の皆さんが、どういう問題意識で、どういう課題に対処して取り組んでいけばいいのかということを明らかにして、今後の方向性を示すものと確信しています。<br/>[…]<br/>したがいまして、今回の産研フォーラムはそうした関係で、極めてタイムリーな企画でありまして、本学として、今申し上げた起業家育成促進事業をするキックオフになるものと思っており、その意味で非常に有意義な企画だと考えております。&quot;},&quot;page&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;5&quot;},&quot;url&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;https://waseda.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/14615/files/SankenForamu_40_Nakamura1.pdf&quot;},&quot;last&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Nakamura&quot;},&quot;first&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Nobuo&quot;},&quot;script-title&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;ja:挨拶&quot;},&quot;publisher&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Waseda University&quot;},&quot;year&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;2015&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFNakamura2015" class="citation cs2 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt770">Nakamura, Nobuo (2015), <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://waseda.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/14615/files/SankenForamu_40_Nakamura1.pdf" class="external text" id="mwLPc"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwLPg">挨拶</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwLPk">(PDF)</span> (in Japanese), Waseda University, p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLPo">&nbsp;</span>5,  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLPs">起業家の輩出という点では、私ども大学関係者に非常に大きな課題というものが突きつけられているわけでありまして、今回のフォーラムは、起業家の輩出のために、大学、そしてビジネス教育に携わる教員、それからその教育の受け手となる学生の皆さんが、どういう問題意識で、どういう課題に対処して取り組んでいけばいいのかということを明らかにして、今後の方向性を示すものと確信しています。<br id="mwLPw">[…]<br id="mwLP0">したがいまして、今回の産研フォーラムはそうした関係で、極めてタイムリーな企画でありまして、本学として、今申し上げた起業家育成促進事業をするキックオフになるものと思っており、その意味で非常に有意義な企画だと考えております。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%8C%A8%E6%8B%B6&amp;rft.pages=5&amp;rft.pub=Waseda+University&amp;rft.date=2015&amp;rft.aulast=Nakamura&amp;rft.aufirst=Nobuo&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwaseda.repo.nii.ac.jp%2Frecord%2F14615%2Ffiles%2FSankenForamu_40_Nakamura1.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt770" id="mwLP4"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt770" id="mwLP8"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt770" id="mwLQA"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-108" id="cite_note-108" data-mw-footnote-number="97"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLQE"><a href="#cite_ref-108" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwLQI"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLQM">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-108" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt773" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwLQQ" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:これを高いと思うか、低いと思うかは様々かと思いますが、もう少しいてくれると嬉しいというところではありまして、本学の学生は能動的なリサーチなどは少し避けがちなのかもしれないという印象を持ちました。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=71&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Nishigaki&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Junko&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://ocu-omu.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/2017272/files/13492152-16-2-71.pdf&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:学士課程学生調査からみる本学学生の学修 －2016年度上級生調査を中心に－&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Osaka City University&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:大学教育&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=16&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=2&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=April 2019&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFNishigaki2019" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt773">Nishigaki, Junko (April 2019). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://ocu-omu.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/2017272/files/13492152-16-2-71.pdf" class="external text" id="mwLQU"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwLQY">学士課程学生調査からみる本学学生の学修 －2016年度上級生調査を中心に－</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwLQc">(PDF)</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLQg">大学教育</bdi> (in Japanese). <b id="mwLQk">16</b> (2). Osaka City University: 71.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLQo">これを高いと思うか、低いと思うかは様々かと思いますが、もう少しいてくれると嬉しいというところではありまして、本学の学生は能動的なリサーチなどは少し避けがちなのかもしれないという印象を持ちました。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E5%AD%A6%E5%A3%AB%E8%AA%B2%E7%A8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E7%94%9F%E8%AA%BF%E6%9F%BB%E3%81%8B%E3%82%89%E3%81%BF%E3%82%8B%E6%9C%AC%E5%AD%A6%E5%AD%A6%E7%94%9F%E3%81%AE%E5%AD%A6%E4%BF%AE+%EF%BC%8D2016%E5%B9%B4%E5%BA%A6%E4%B8%8A%E7%B4%9A%E7%94%9F%E8%AA%BF%E6%9F%BB%E3%82%92%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83%E3%81%AB%EF%BC%8D&amp;rft.volume=16&amp;rft.issue=2&amp;rft.pages=71&amp;rft.date=2019-04&amp;rft.aulast=Nishigaki&amp;rft.aufirst=Junko&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Focu-omu.repo.nii.ac.jp%2Frecord%2F2017272%2Ffiles%2F13492152-16-2-71.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt773" id="mwLQs"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt773" id="mwLQw"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt773" id="mwLQ0"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-109" id="cite_note-109" data-mw-footnote-number="98"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLQ4"><a href="#cite_ref-109" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwLQ8"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLRA">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-109" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt776" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwLRE" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:おんぼろの<ruby>婆<rp>(</rp><rt>ばゞあ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぢやありましてございますが、<ruby>一<rp>(</rp><rt>いつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>生<rp>(</rp><rt>しやう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>懸<rp>(</rp><rt>けん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>命<rp>(</rp><rt>めい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、あんな<ruby>役<rp>(</rp><rt>やく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>雜<rp>(</rp><rt>ざ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>な<ruby>三<rp>(</rp><rt>しや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>味<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>線<rp>(</rp><rt>せん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でも、<ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ひなしか、あの<ruby>時<rp>(</rp><rt>とき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くらゐ、<ruby>隅<rp>(</rp><rt>すみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>田<rp>(</rp><rt>だ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>川<rp>(</rp><rt>がは</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>水<rp>(</rp><rt>みづ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にだつて、<ruby>冴<rp>(</rp><rt>さ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えに<ruby>調<rp>(</rp><rt>てう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>で</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たことがございませんよ。」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:式部小路&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Kyōka Izumi&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Kyōtarō&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Izumi&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1682845/1/179&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=10 November 1941&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;orig-date=January 1906&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Iwanami Shoten&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Kanda, Tokyo]]&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:鏡花全集&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=6&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=348&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFIzumi1941" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt776"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kyōka_Izumi" title="Kyōka Izumi" id="mwLRI">Izumi, Kyōtarō</a> (10 November 1941) [January 1906].  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLRM">式部小路</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1682845/1/179" class="external text" id="mwLRQ"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwLRU">鏡花全集</bdi></a> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLRY">&nbsp;</span>6. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kanda,_Tokyo" title="Kanda, Tokyo" id="mwLRc">Kanda, Tokyo</a>: Iwanami Shoten. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLRg">&nbsp;</span>348.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLRk">おんぼろの<ruby id="mwLRo">婆<rp id="mwLRs">(</rp><rt id="mwLRw">ばゞあ</rt><rp id="mwLR0">)</rp></ruby>ぢやありましてございますが、<ruby id="mwLR4">一<rp id="mwLR8">(</rp><rt id="mwLSA">いつ</rt><rp id="mwLSE">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwLSI">生<rp id="mwLSM">(</rp><rt id="mwLSQ">しやう</rt><rp id="mwLSU">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwLSY">懸<rp id="mwLSc">(</rp><rt id="mwLSg">けん</rt><rp id="mwLSk">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwLSo">命<rp id="mwLSs">(</rp><rt id="mwLSw">めい</rt><rp id="mwLS0">)</rp></ruby>、あんな<ruby id="mwLS4">役<rp id="mwLS8">(</rp><rt id="mwLTA">やく</rt><rp id="mwLTE">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwLTI">雜<rp id="mwLTM">(</rp><rt id="mwLTQ">ざ</rt><rp id="mwLTU">)</rp></ruby>な<ruby id="mwLTY">三<rp id="mwLTc">(</rp><rt id="mwLTg">しや</rt><rp id="mwLTk">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwLTo">味<rp id="mwLTs">(</rp><rt id="mwLTw">み</rt><rp id="mwLT0">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwLT4">線<rp id="mwLT8">(</rp><rt id="mwLUA">せん</rt><rp id="mwLUE">)</rp></ruby>でも、<ruby id="mwLUI">思<rp id="mwLUM">(</rp><rt id="mwLUQ">おも</rt><rp id="mwLUU">)</rp></ruby>ひなしか、あの<ruby id="mwLUY">時<rp id="mwLUc">(</rp><rt id="mwLUg">とき</rt><rp id="mwLUk">)</rp></ruby>くらゐ、<ruby id="mwLUo">隅<rp id="mwLUs">(</rp><rt id="mwLUw">すみ</rt><rp id="mwLU0">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwLU4">田<rp id="mwLU8">(</rp><rt id="mwLVA">だ</rt><rp id="mwLVE">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwLVI">川<rp id="mwLVM">(</rp><rt id="mwLVQ">がは</rt><rp id="mwLVU">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwLVY">水<rp id="mwLVc">(</rp><rt id="mwLVg">みづ</rt><rp id="mwLVk">)</rp></ruby>にだつて、<ruby id="mwLVo">冴<rp id="mwLVs">(</rp><rt id="mwLVw">さ</rt><rp id="mwLV0">)</rp></ruby>えに<ruby id="mwLV4">調<rp id="mwLV8">(</rp><rt id="mwLWA">てう</rt><rp id="mwLWE">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwLWI">子<rp id="mwLWM">(</rp><rt id="mwLWQ">し</rt><rp id="mwLWU">)</rp></ruby>は<ruby id="mwLWY">出<rp id="mwLWc">(</rp><rt id="mwLWg">で</rt><rp id="mwLWk">)</rp></ruby>たことがございませんよ。」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E5%BC%8F%E9%83%A8%E5%B0%8F%E8%B7%AF&amp;rft.btitle=%E9%8F%A1%E8%8A%B1%E5%85%A8%E9%9B%86&amp;rft.place=Kanda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=348&amp;rft.pub=Iwanami+Shoten&amp;rft.date=1941-11-10&amp;rft.aulast=Izumi&amp;rft.aufirst=Ky%C5%8Dtar%C5%8D&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1682845%2F1%2F179&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt776" id="mwLWo"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt776" id="mwLWs"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt776" id="mwLWw"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-FOOTNOTEMartin2004495,_1028-110" id="cite_note-FOOTNOTEMartin2004495,_1028-110" data-mw-footnote-number="99"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLW0"><a href="#cite_ref-FOOTNOTEMartin2004495,_1028_110-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwLW4"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLW8">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEMartin2004495,_1028-110" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#CITEREFMartin2004" class="mw-selflink-fragment" id="mwLXA">Martin (2004)</a>, pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLXE">&nbsp;</span>495, 1028.<span class="error harv-error" style="display: none; font-size:100%" id="mwLXI"> sfnp error: no target: CITEREFMartin2004 (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category:Harv_and_Sfn_template_errors" title="Category:Harv and Sfn template errors" id="mwLXM">help</a>)</span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Harv_and_Sfn_no-target_errors" id="mwLXQ"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-nakayama-1948-111" id="cite_note-nakayama-1948-111" data-mw-footnote-number="100"><span rel="mw:referencedBy" class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLXU"><a href="#cite_ref-nakayama-1948_111-0" id="mwLXY"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLXc">1</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-nakayama-1948_111-1" id="mwLXg"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLXk">2</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-nakayama-1948-111" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt925" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwLXo" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「いんえ、ここへぢやありましねえ……。アレクセーエフカの向ふに知つてる所があるんです……、<ruby>松鷄<rp>(</rp><rt>えぞやまどり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にや、ここよりあ、ずゐぶん好いんでして！」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=— Нет, не сюда… Мне за Алексеевкой места известны… многим лучше здешних для тетеревов!&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote=“No, not here…… I know some places beyond Alexeyevka……, much better for black grouse than here!”&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=258&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1704025/1/134&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:<ruby>生<rp>(</rp><rt>いき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>神<rp>(</rp><rt>がみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>樣<rp>(</rp><rt>さま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=Живые мощи&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-chapter=A Living Relic&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:あひびき&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=The Tryst&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Свидание&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Ivan Sergeyevich&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Turgenev&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Ivan Turgenev&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Shōzaburō&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Nakayama&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=20 November 1948&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Seijisya&quot;},&quot;21&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Chiyoda, Tokyo]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFTurgenev1948" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt925"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ivan_Turgenev" title="Ivan Turgenev" id="mwLXs">Turgenev, Ivan Sergeyevich</a> (20 November 1948). "Живые мощи" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLXw"><ruby id="mwLX0">生<rp id="mwLX4">(</rp><rt id="mwLX8">いき</rt><rp id="mwLYA">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwLYE">神<rp id="mwLYI">(</rp><rt id="mwLYM">がみ</rt><rp id="mwLYQ">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwLYU">樣<rp id="mwLYY">(</rp><rt id="mwLYc">さま</rt><rp id="mwLYg">)</rp></ruby></bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLYk">[</span>A Living Relic<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLYo">]</span>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1704025/1/134" class="external text" id="mwLYs"><i id="mwLYw">Свидание</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLY0">あひびき</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLY4">[</span><i id="mwLY8">The Tryst</i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLZA">]</span> (in Japanese). Translated by Nakayama, Shōzaburō. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiyoda,_Tokyo" title="Chiyoda, Tokyo" id="mwLZE">Chiyoda, Tokyo</a>: Seijisya. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLZI">&nbsp;</span>258. <q id="mwLZM">— Нет, не сюда… Мне за Алексеевкой места известны… многим лучше здешних для тетеревов!</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLZQ">「いんえ、ここへぢやありましねえ……。アレクセーエフカの向ふに知つてる所があるんです……、<ruby id="mwLZU">松鷄<rp id="mwLZY">(</rp><rt id="mwLZc">えぞやまどり</rt><rp id="mwLZg">)</rp></ruby>にや、ここよりあ、ずゐぶん好いんでして！」</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLZk">[</span>“No, not here…… I know some places beyond Alexeyevka……, much better for black grouse than here!”<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLZo">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%D0%96%D0%B8%D0%B2%D1%8B%D0%B5+%D0%BC%D0%BE%D1%89%D0%B8+%3Cruby%3E%E7%94%9F%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%84%E3%81%8D%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E7%A5%9E%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%8C%E3%81%BF%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E6%A8%A3%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%95%E3%81%BE%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E&amp;rft.btitle=%D0%A1%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%B4%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5+%E3%81%82%E3%81%B2%E3%81%B3%E3%81%8D&amp;rft.place=Chiyoda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=258&amp;rft.pub=Seijisya&amp;rft.date=1948-11-20&amp;rft.aulast=Turgenev&amp;rft.aufirst=Ivan+Sergeyevich&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1704025%2F1%2F134&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt925" id="mwLZs"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt925" id="mwLZw"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt925" id="mwLZ0"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-112" id="cite_note-112" data-mw-footnote-number="101"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLZ4"><a href="#cite_ref-112" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwLZ8"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLaA">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-112" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt784" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwLaE" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:そのとき、私の念頭に浮かんだのは、ロバート・ベラーの『心の習慣』（邦訳、みすず書房）の付録「公共哲学としての社会科学」のイメージでして、まさに理念やヴィジョンと社会研究を統合する学問として公共哲学を捉えたわけです。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=30&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://researchmap.jp/19490326/misc/16281723/attachment_file.pdf&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Naoshi&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Yamawaki&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:公共哲学とは何か&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:ちくま新書&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=2004&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFYamawaki2004" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt784">Yamawaki, Naoshi (2004). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://researchmap.jp/19490326/misc/16281723/attachment_file.pdf" class="external text" id="mwLaI"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwLaM">公共哲学とは何か</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwLaQ">(PDF)</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLaU">ちくま新書</bdi> (in Japanese): 30.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLaY">そのとき、私の念頭に浮かんだのは、ロバート・ベラーの『心の習慣』（邦訳、みすず書房）の付録「公共哲学としての社会科学」のイメージでして、まさに理念やヴィジョンと社会研究を統合する学問として公共哲学を捉えたわけです。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E5%93%B2%E5%AD%A6%E3%81%A8%E3%81%AF%E4%BD%95%E3%81%8B&amp;rft.pages=30&amp;rft.date=2004&amp;rft.aulast=Yamawaki&amp;rft.aufirst=Naoshi&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fresearchmap.jp%2F19490326%2Fmisc%2F16281723%2Fattachment_file.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt784" id="mwLac"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt784" id="mwLag"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt784" id="mwLak"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-washiyama-1956-113" id="cite_note-washiyama-1956-113" data-mw-footnote-number="102"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLao"><a href="#cite_ref-washiyama-1956_113-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwLas"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLaw">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-washiyama-1956-113" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt795" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwLa0" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1169120/1/44&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=72&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:第三部 眞實は强し&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-chapter=Part 3: The Truth Is Powerful&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:ハムレット&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Hamlet&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|物語シェイクスピア}}&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Fukumura Shoten&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=William Shakespeare&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first1=William&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last1=Shakespeare&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last2=Washiyama&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first2=Daisaburō&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Bunkyō]], Tokyo&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=10 August 1956&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「在るべきか、なかるべきか、それが問題だ。[...]」&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=“To be, or not to be, that is the question. [...]”&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFShakespeareWashiyama1956" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt795"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Shakespeare" title="William Shakespeare" id="mwLa4">Shakespeare, William</a>; Washiyama, Daisaburō (10 August 1956).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLa8">第三部 眞實は强し</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLbA">[</span>Part 3: The Truth Is Powerful<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLbE">]</span>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1169120/1/44" class="external text" id="mwLbI"><i id="mwLbM">Hamlet</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLbQ">ハムレット</bdi></a>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwLbU"><span lang="ja" id="mwLbY">物語シェイクスピア</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwLbc"> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bunkyō" title="Bunkyō" id="mwLbg">Bunkyō</a>, Tokyo: Fukumura Shoten. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLbk">&nbsp;</span>72. <q id="mwLbo"><span class="cs1-kern-left" id="mwLbs"></span>"To be, or not to be, that is the question. [...]"<span class="cs1-kern-right" id="mwLbw"></span></q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLb0">「在るべきか、なかるべきか、それが問題だ。[...]」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E9%83%A8+%E7%9C%9E%E5%AF%A6%E3%81%AF%E5%BC%BA%E3%81%97&amp;rft.btitle=Hamlet+%E3%83%8F%E3%83%A0%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88&amp;rft.place=Bunky%C5%8D%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E7%89%A9%E8%AA%9E%E3%82%B7%E3%82%A7%E3%82%A4%E3%82%AF%E3%82%B9%E3%83%94%E3%82%A2%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=72&amp;rft.pub=Fukumura+Shoten&amp;rft.date=1956-08-10&amp;rft.aulast=Shakespeare&amp;rft.aufirst=William&amp;rft.au=Washiyama%2C+Daisabur%C5%8D&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1169120%2F1%2F44&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt795" id="mwLb4"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt795" id="mwLb8"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt795" id="mwLcA"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-114" id="cite_note-114" data-mw-footnote-number="103"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLcE"><a href="#cite_ref-114" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwLcI"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLcM">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-114" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt801" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwLcQ" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「<ruby>生<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きてゐるか、ゐないか、それが<ruby>問<rp>(</rp><rt>もん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>題<rp>(</rp><rt>だい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じや。[…]」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=“To be, or not to be, that is the question. […]”&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pages=46–47&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1168431/1/33&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:ハムレット&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Hamlet&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last1=Shakespeare&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first1=William&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=William Shakespeare&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last2=Washiyama&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first2=Daisaburō&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|少年シェイクスピア叢書}}&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Fukumura Shoten&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=20 February 1940&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Ushigome]], Tokyo&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFShakespeareWashiyama1940" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt801"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Shakespeare" title="William Shakespeare" id="mwLcU">Shakespeare, William</a>; Washiyama, Daisaburō (20 February 1940). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1168431/1/33" class="external text" id="mwLcY"><i id="mwLcc">Hamlet</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLcg">ハムレット</bdi></a>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwLck"><span lang="ja" id="mwLco">少年シェイクスピア叢書</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwLcs"> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ushigome" title="Ushigome" id="mwLcw">Ushigome</a>, Tokyo: Fukumura Shoten. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLc0">&nbsp;</span><span class="nowrap" id="mwLc4">46–</span>47. <q id="mwLc8"><span class="cs1-kern-left" id="mwLdA"></span>"To be, or not to be, that is the question. […]"<span class="cs1-kern-right" id="mwLdE"></span></q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLdI">「<ruby id="mwLdM">生<rp id="mwLdQ">(</rp><rt id="mwLdU">い</rt><rp id="mwLdY">)</rp></ruby>きてゐるか、ゐないか、それが<ruby id="mwLdc">問<rp id="mwLdg">(</rp><rt id="mwLdk">もん</rt><rp id="mwLdo">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwLds">題<rp id="mwLdw">(</rp><rt id="mwLd0">だい</rt><rp id="mwLd4">)</rp></ruby>じや。[…]」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=Hamlet+%E3%83%8F%E3%83%A0%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88&amp;rft.place=Ushigome%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E5%B0%91%E5%B9%B4%E3%82%B7%E3%82%A7%E3%82%A4%E3%82%AF%E3%82%B9%E3%83%94%E3%82%A2%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=46-47&amp;rft.pub=Fukumura+Shoten&amp;rft.date=1940-02-20&amp;rft.aulast=Shakespeare&amp;rft.aufirst=William&amp;rft.au=Washiyama%2C+Daisabur%C5%8D&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1168431%2F1%2F33&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt801" id="mwLd8"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt801" id="mwLeA"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt801" id="mwLeE"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-tsubouchi-1958-hamlet-115" id="cite_note-tsubouchi-1958-hamlet-115" data-mw-footnote-number="104"><span rel="mw:referencedBy" class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLeI"><a href="#cite_ref-tsubouchi-1958-hamlet_115-0" id="mwLeM"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLeQ">1</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-tsubouchi-1958-hamlet_115-1" id="mwLeU"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLeY">2</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-tsubouchi-1958-hamlet-115" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt804" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwLec" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:'''ハム'''　世に在る、世に在らぬ、それが疑問ぢゃ。[…]<br/>'''甲'''　生きとる中は女の人ぢゃったが、[[Nianfo|なんまみだぶ]]、<ruby>死<rp>(</rp><rt>ご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ねてしまひましたがな。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote='''Ham.''' To be, or not to be, that is the question:<br/>[…]<br/>'''First Clo.''' One that was a woman, sir; but, rest her soul, she’s dead.&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pages=89, 179&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1664852/1/50&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Hamlet, Prince of Denmark&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:ハムレット&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=William Shakespeare&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=William&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Shakespeare&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-link=Tsubouchi Shōyō&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Tsubouchi&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Shōyō&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|シェークスピヤ全集}}&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Shinjusha&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=[[Hamlet]]&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=30 April 1958&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Bunkyō]], Tokyo&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFShakespeare1958" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt804"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Shakespeare" title="William Shakespeare" id="mwLeg">Shakespeare, William</a> (30 April 1958). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1664852/1/50" class="external text" id="mwLek"><i id="mwLeo">Hamlet, Prince of Denmark</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLes">ハムレット</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLew">[</span><i id="mwLe0"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hamlet" title="Hamlet" id="mwLe4">Hamlet</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLe8">]</span>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwLfA"><span lang="ja" id="mwLfE">シェークスピヤ全集</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwLfI"> (in Japanese). Translated by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tsubouchi_Shōyō" title="Tsubouchi Shōyō" id="mwLfM">Tsubouchi, Shōyō</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bunkyō" title="Bunkyō" id="mwLfQ">Bunkyō</a>, Tokyo: Shinjusha. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLfU">&nbsp;</span>89, 179. <q id="mwLfY"><b id="mwLfc">Ham.</b> To be, or not to be, that is the question:<br id="mwLfg">[…]<br id="mwLfk"><b id="mwLfo">First Clo.</b> One that was a woman, sir; but, rest her soul, she's dead.</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLfs"><b id="mwLfw">ハム</b>　世に在る、世に在らぬ、それが疑問ぢゃ。[…]<br id="mwLf0"><b id="mwLf4">甲</b>　生きとる中は女の人ぢゃったが、<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nianfo" title="Nianfo" id="mwLf8">なんまみだぶ</a>、<ruby id="mwLgA">死<rp id="mwLgE">(</rp><rt id="mwLgI">ご</rt><rp id="mwLgM">)</rp></ruby>ねてしまひましたがな。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=Hamlet%2C+Prince+of+Denmark+%E3%83%8F%E3%83%A0%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88&amp;rft.place=Bunky%C5%8D%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E3%82%B7%E3%82%A7%E3%83%BC%E3%82%AF%E3%82%B9%E3%83%94%E3%83%A4%E5%85%A8%E9%9B%86%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=89%2C+179&amp;rft.pub=Shinjusha&amp;rft.date=1958-04-30&amp;rft.aulast=Shakespeare&amp;rft.aufirst=William&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1664852%2F1%2F50&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt804" id="mwLgQ"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt804" id="mwLgU"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt804" id="mwLgY"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-jackson-2014-116" id="cite_note-jackson-2014-116" data-mw-footnote-number="105"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLgc"><a href="#cite_ref-jackson-2014_116-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwLgg"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLgk">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-jackson-2014-116" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt810" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwLgo" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;av media&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:この先は通さん！<br/>ガンダルフ！<br/>我は神秘の火に仕える者、アノールの炎の使い手じゃ。貴様の放つ火は、儂には通じん！闇の底に戻るがよい。ここは断じて通さん！&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote=You will not pass from this point!<br/>Gandalf!<br/>I am a servant of the Secret Fire, wielder of the flame of Anor. The fire you set will not reach me! You had better go back to the depths of the Shadow. You shall not pass this place!&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=You cannot pass!<br/>Gandalf!<br/>I am a servant of the Secret Fire, wielder of the flame of Anor. The dark fire will not avail you, flame of Udûn! Go back to the Shadow. You shall not pass!&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=[[The Lord of the Rings: The Fellowship of the Ring]]&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:ロード・オブ・ザ・リング&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=Lord of the Rings&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=19 February 2014&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Peter Jackson&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Peter Robert&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Jackson&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFJackson2014" class="citation audio-visual cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt810"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peter_Jackson" title="Peter Jackson" id="mwLgs">Jackson, Peter Robert</a> (19 February 2014). <i id="mwLgw"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Lord_of_the_Rings:_The_Fellowship_of_the_Ring" title="The Lord of the Rings: The Fellowship of the Ring" id="mwLg0">The Lord of the Rings: The Fellowship of the Ring</a></i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLg4">ロード・オブ・ザ・リング</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLg8">[</span><i id="mwLhA">Lord of the Rings</i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLhE">]</span> (in Japanese). <q id="mwLhI">You cannot pass!<br id="mwLhM">Gandalf!<br id="mwLhQ">I am a servant of the Secret Fire, wielder of the flame of Anor. The dark fire will not avail you, flame of Udûn! Go back to the Shadow. You shall not pass!</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLhU">この先は通さん！<br id="mwLhY">ガンダルフ！<br id="mwLhc">我は神秘の火に仕える者、アノールの炎の使い手じゃ。貴様の放つ火は、儂には通じん！闇の底に戻るがよい。ここは断じて通さん！</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLhg">[</span>You will not pass from this point!<br id="mwLhk">Gandalf!<br id="mwLho">I am a servant of the Secret Fire, wielder of the flame of Anor. The fire you set will not reach me! You had better go back to the depths of the Shadow. You shall not pass this place!<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLhs">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=The+Lord+of+the+Rings%3A+The+Fellowship+of+the+Ring+%E3%83%AD%E3%83%BC%E3%83%89%E3%83%BB%E3%82%AA%E3%83%96%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B6%E3%83%BB%E3%83%AA%E3%83%B3%E3%82%B0&amp;rft.date=2014-02-19&amp;rft.aulast=Jackson&amp;rft.aufirst=Peter+Robert&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt810" id="mwLhw"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt810" id="mwLh0"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt810" id="mwLh4"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-117" id="cite_note-117" data-mw-footnote-number="106"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLh8"><a href="#cite_ref-117" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwLiA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLiE">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-117" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt815" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwLiI" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;web&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://kotobank.jp/word/%E3%81%A7%E3%81%82%E3%82%8A%E3%81%BE%E3%81%99-573271&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;language=ja&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:であります&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-website=ja:コトバンク&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite class="citation web cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt815" id="mwLiM"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://kotobank.jp/word/%E3%81%A7%E3%81%82%E3%82%8A%E3%81%BE%E3%81%99-573271" class="external text" id="mwLiQ"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwLiU">であります</bdi></a>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLiY">コトバンク</bdi> (in Japanese).</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=%E3%81%A7%E3%81%82%E3%82%8A%E3%81%BE%E3%81%99&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fkotobank.jp%2Fword%2F%25E3%2581%25A7%25E3%2581%2582%25E3%2582%258A%25E3%2581%25BE%25E3%2581%2599-573271&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt815" id="mwLic"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt815" id="mwLig"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt815" id="mwLik"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-118" id="cite_note-118" data-mw-footnote-number="107"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLio"><a href="#cite_ref-118" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwLis"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLiw">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-118" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt818" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwLi0" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:昔，照葉樹林文化とブナ林文化の比較がありましたけれども，そういった自然環境と文化の差が，地場産業の初期的な立地に非常に大きな影響を与えているということは確かであります．<br/>[…]いわゆる資本のメカニズムを貫徹するための研究であります．&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pages=4, 7&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:地場産業研究の課題&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://u-gakugei.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/29014/files/AN00038703_65_3.pdf&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Ueno&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Kazuhiko&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:学芸地理&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=65&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;orig-year=2010&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=20 April 2012&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Tokyo Gakugei University&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFUeno2012" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt818">Ueno, Kazuhiko (20 April 2012) [2010]. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://u-gakugei.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/29014/files/AN00038703_65_3.pdf" class="external text" id="mwLi4"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwLi8">地場産業研究の課題</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwLjA">(PDF)</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLjE">学芸地理</bdi> (in Japanese) (65). Tokyo Gakugei University: 4, 7.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLjI">昔，照葉樹林文化とブナ林文化の比較がありましたけれども，そういった自然環境と文化の差が，地場産業の初期的な立地に非常に大きな影響を与えているということは確かであります．<br id="mwLjM">[…]いわゆる資本のメカニズムを貫徹するための研究であります．</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E5%9C%B0%E5%A0%B4%E7%94%A3%E6%A5%AD%E7%A0%94%E7%A9%B6%E3%81%AE%E8%AA%B2%E9%A1%8C&amp;rft.issue=65&amp;rft.pages=4%2C+7&amp;rft.date=2012-04-20&amp;rft.aulast=Ueno&amp;rft.aufirst=Kazuhiko&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fu-gakugei.repo.nii.ac.jp%2Frecord%2F29014%2Ffiles%2FAN00038703_65_3.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt818" id="mwLjQ"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt818" id="mwLjU"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt818" id="mwLjY"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-119" id="cite_note-119" data-mw-footnote-number="108"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLjc"><a href="#cite_ref-119" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwLjg"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLjk">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-119" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt821" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwLjo" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:公路「着想や展開はどうってことないのを、インタビューという形式で楽しく読ませる。感服しました。景山さんの奥さんも旅行好きだけど、まさかご自分のことじゃありますまいね。──これ、<ruby>冗<rp>(</rp><rt>じよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>談<rp>(</rp><rt>だん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:第二章 用意&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|角川文庫}}&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:悪妻に捧げるレクイエム&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Jirō&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Akagawa&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=12 April 2002&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;orig-date=30 October 1981&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Kadokawa Shoten&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Chiyoda, Tokyo]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFAkagawa2002" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt821">Akagawa, Jirō (12 April 2002) [30 October 1981].  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLjs">第二章 用意</bdi>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLjw">悪妻に捧げるレクイエム</bdi>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwLj0"><span lang="ja" id="mwLj4">角川文庫</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwLj8"> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiyoda,_Tokyo" title="Chiyoda, Tokyo" id="mwLkA">Chiyoda, Tokyo</a>: Kadokawa Shoten.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLkE">公路「着想や展開はどうってことないのを、インタビューという形式で楽しく読ませる。感服しました。景山さんの奥さんも旅行好きだけど、まさかご自分のことじゃありますまいね。──これ、<ruby id="mwLkI">冗<rp id="mwLkM">(</rp><rt id="mwLkQ">じよう</rt><rp id="mwLkU">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwLkY">談<rp id="mwLkc">(</rp><rt id="mwLkg">だん</rt><rp id="mwLkk">)</rp></ruby>です」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E7%AB%A0+%E7%94%A8%E6%84%8F&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%82%AA%E5%A6%BB%E3%81%AB%E6%8D%A7%E3%81%92%E3%82%8B%E3%83%AC%E3%82%AF%E3%82%A4%E3%82%A8%E3%83%A0&amp;rft.place=Chiyoda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E8%A7%92%E5%B7%9D%E6%96%87%E5%BA%AB%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pub=Kadokawa+Shoten&amp;rft.date=2002-04-12&amp;rft.aulast=Akagawa&amp;rft.aufirst=Jir%C5%8D&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt821" id="mwLko"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt821" id="mwLks"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt821" id="mwLkw"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-120" id="cite_note-120" data-mw-footnote-number="109"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLk0"><a href="#cite_ref-120" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwLk4"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLk8">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-120" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt829" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwLlA" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:設立記念講演などと大変僭越ではありますが，設立に携わった者として，また微力ではありますがこれからの学会の運営を担うものとして，この学会が大きく個性豊かに育つことを祈念し，この学会に託す思いを述べさせていただければと思います．<br/>[…]<br/>ところで，原語のまま用いるのであるならば，クリティカルケア看護の定義が必要と思われます．現時点での私見ではありますが，クリティカルケア看護とは，『あらゆる治療・療養の場，あらゆる病期・病態にある人々に生じた，急激な生命の危機状態に対して，専門性の高い看護ケアを提供することで，生命と生活の質（QOL）の向上をめざす』と定義致しました．&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pages=15–16&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.jstage.jst.go.jp/article/jaccn/1/1/1_1_15/_pdf&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Tomoko&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Inoue&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:蓄積から挑戦へ&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:日本クリティカルケア看護学会誌&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal=Journal of Japan Academy of Critical Care Nursing&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=1&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=1&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=2005 &quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;doi=10.11153/jaccn.1.1_15&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFInoue2005" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt829">Inoue, Tomoko (2005). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.jstage.jst.go.jp/article/jaccn/1/1/1_1_15/_pdf" class="external text" id="mwLlE"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwLlI">蓄積から挑戦へ</bdi></a>. <i id="mwLlM">Journal of Japan Academy of Critical Care Nursing</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLlQ">日本クリティカルケア看護学会誌</bdi> (in Japanese). <b id="mwLlU">1</b> (1): <span class="nowrap" id="mwLlY">15–</span>16. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doi_(identifier)" title="Doi (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwLlc">doi</a>:<a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://doi.org/10.11153%2Fjaccn.1.1_15" class="external text" id="mwLlg">10.11153/jaccn.1.1_15</a>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLlk">設立記念講演などと大変僭越ではありますが，設立に携わった者として，また微力ではありますがこれからの学会の運営を担うものとして，この学会が大きく個性豊かに育つことを祈念し，この学会に託す思いを述べさせていただければと思います．<br id="mwLlo">[…]<br id="mwLls">ところで，原語のまま用いるのであるならば，クリティカルケア看護の定義が必要と思われます．現時点での私見ではありますが，クリティカルケア看護とは，『あらゆる治療・療養の場，あらゆる病期・病態にある人々に生じた，急激な生命の危機状態に対して，専門性の高い看護ケアを提供することで，生命と生活の質（QOL）の向上をめざす』と定義致しました．</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Journal+of+Japan+Academy+of+Critical+Care+Nursing&amp;rft.atitle=%E8%93%84%E7%A9%8D%E3%81%8B%E3%82%89%E6%8C%91%E6%88%A6%E3%81%B8&amp;rft.volume=1&amp;rft.issue=1&amp;rft.pages=15-16&amp;rft.date=2005&amp;rft_id=info%3Adoi%2F10.11153%2Fjaccn.1.1_15&amp;rft.aulast=Inoue&amp;rft.aufirst=Tomoko&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.jstage.jst.go.jp%2Farticle%2Fjaccn%2F1%2F1%2F1_1_15%2F_pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt829" id="mwLlw"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt829" id="mwLl0"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt829" id="mwLl4"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-122" id="cite_note-122" data-mw-footnote-number="110"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLl8"><a href="#cite_ref-122" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwLmA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLmE">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-122" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt839" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwLmI" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:<ruby>慥<rp>(</rp><rt>たしか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なる心にて、[…]それからペテルブルグへ送るためにきわめて高潔なる弁明の手紙を書いて、[…]」[…]このような偉大な改革を迎えてはロシア人のだれしもが感激するのは当然であるといった意味の言葉をさしはさんだ。[…]民族性なるものは、[…]でっぷりふとって健康そうな旅行中のひとりの大佐が腰をおろして、[…]イワン・オーシッポヴィチはささやくような小声で遠回しに話をはじめたが、[…]「[…]君は善良な、高潔な心の持ち主だ」[…]いったいなんなのかね。あんな熱に浮かされたような突飛な行為に、「[…]一般的に言ってロシアの行政官なるものがどういうものか、[…]宙ぶらりんな曖昧な状態は、[…]ニコライ・スタヴローギン君の生涯における<ruby>曖<rp>(</rp><rt>あい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>昧<rp>(</rp><rt>まい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なる一時期、[…]私はロシアが偉大なる寓話詩人クルィローフを所有し、[…]そうして私はあなたのもっとも忠実な親友にはちがいありませんが、[…]スタヴローギンの内なる憎悪は、[…]せっかちな中ぐらいの無能な男です、そこで僕はもっとも無能なるやり方でむりやり会話をかっさらってしまった。[…]《はじめは単なる友情から忠実なる大学生として、[…]》&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=2&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:悪霊&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Demons&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Fyodor Dostoevsky&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Fyodor Mikhailovich&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Dostoevsky&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Kentarō&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Ikeda&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=6 March 2015&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Gutenberg21&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Setagaya]], Tokyo&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFDostoevsky2015" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt839"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fyodor_Dostoevsky" title="Fyodor Dostoevsky" id="mwLmM">Dostoevsky, Fyodor Mikhailovich</a> (6 March 2015). <i id="mwLmQ">Demons</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLmU">悪霊</bdi> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLmY">&nbsp;</span>2. Translated by Ikeda, Kentarō. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Setagaya" title="Setagaya" id="mwLmc">Setagaya</a>, Tokyo: Gutenberg21.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLmg"><ruby id="mwLmk">慥<rp id="mwLmo">(</rp><rt id="mwLms">たしか</rt><rp id="mwLmw">)</rp></ruby>なる心にて、[…]それからペテルブルグへ送るためにきわめて高潔なる弁明の手紙を書いて、[…]」[…]このような偉大な改革を迎えてはロシア人のだれしもが感激するのは当然であるといった意味の言葉をさしはさんだ。[…]民族性なるものは、[…]でっぷりふとって健康そうな旅行中のひとりの大佐が腰をおろして、[…]イワン・オーシッポヴィチはささやくような小声で遠回しに話をはじめたが、[…]「[…]君は善良な、高潔な心の持ち主だ」[…]いったいなんなのかね。あんな熱に浮かされたような突飛な行為に、「[…]一般的に言ってロシアの行政官なるものがどういうものか、[…]宙ぶらりんな曖昧な状態は、[…]ニコライ・スタヴローギン君の生涯における<ruby id="mwLm0">曖<rp id="mwLm4">(</rp><rt id="mwLm8">あい</rt><rp id="mwLnA">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwLnE">昧<rp id="mwLnI">(</rp><rt id="mwLnM">まい</rt><rp id="mwLnQ">)</rp></ruby>なる一時期、[…]私はロシアが偉大なる寓話詩人クルィローフを所有し、[…]そうして私はあなたのもっとも忠実な親友にはちがいありませんが、[…]スタヴローギンの内なる憎悪は、[…]せっかちな中ぐらいの無能な男です、そこで僕はもっとも無能なるやり方でむりやり会話をかっさらってしまった。[…]《はじめは単なる友情から忠実なる大学生として、[…]》</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=Demons+%E6%82%AA%E9%9C%8A&amp;rft.place=Setagaya%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pub=Gutenberg21&amp;rft.date=2015-03-06&amp;rft.aulast=Dostoevsky&amp;rft.aufirst=Fyodor+Mikhailovich&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt839" id="mwLnU"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt839" id="mwLnY"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt839" id="mwLnc"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-123" id="cite_note-123" data-mw-footnote-number="111"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLng"><a href="#cite_ref-123" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwLnk"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLno">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-123" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt847" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwLns" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;web&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:中央環境審議会廃棄物・リサイクル部会廃棄物処理制度専門委員会（第１０回）&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.env.go.jp/council/former2013/03haiki/y0320-10a.html&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=15 September 2009&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=[[Ministry of the Environment (Japan)|Ministry of the Environment]]&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:また、処理の定義の明確化、帳簿の記載内容の明確化でありますとか、一方、事業者側といたしましては、多大な負担を課すことになる新たな帳簿の作成・保存制度は創設すべきでないでありますとか、製造事業者の活動を阻害するような規制は実施すべきでないといった、そういったご意見をいただいております。&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite class="citation web cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt847" id="mwLnw"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.env.go.jp/council/former2013/03haiki/y0320-10a.html" class="external text" id="mwLn0"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwLn4">中央環境審議会廃棄物・リサイクル部会廃棄物処理制度専門委員会（第１０回）</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ministry_of_the_Environment_(Japan)" title="Ministry of the Environment (Japan)" id="mwLn8">Ministry of the Environment</a>. 15 September 2009.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLoA">また、処理の定義の明確化、帳簿の記載内容の明確化でありますとか、一方、事業者側といたしましては、多大な負担を課すことになる新たな帳簿の作成・保存制度は創設すべきでないでありますとか、製造事業者の活動を阻害するような規制は実施すべきでないといった、そういったご意見をいただいております。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%AE%E7%92%B0%E5%A2%83%E5%AF%A9%E8%AD%B0%E4%BC%9A%E5%BB%83%E6%A3%84%E7%89%A9%E3%83%BB%E3%83%AA%E3%82%B5%E3%82%A4%E3%82%AF%E3%83%AB%E9%83%A8%E4%BC%9A%E5%BB%83%E6%A3%84%E7%89%A9%E5%87%A6%E7%90%86%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%E5%B0%82%E9%96%80%E5%A7%94%E5%93%A1%E4%BC%9A%EF%BC%88%E7%AC%AC%EF%BC%91%EF%BC%90%E5%9B%9E%EF%BC%89&amp;rft.pub=Ministry+of+the+Environment&amp;rft.date=2009-09-15&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.env.go.jp%2Fcouncil%2Fformer2013%2F03haiki%2Fy0320-10a.html&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt847" id="mwLoE"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt847" id="mwLoI"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt847" id="mwLoM"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-124" id="cite_note-124" data-mw-footnote-number="112"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLoQ"><a href="#cite_ref-124" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwLoU"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLoY">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-124" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt850" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwLoc" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「……？　何を言っているでありますか？　ちゃんとしているではないでありますか」<br/>[…]<br/>「了解したでありますが、アレン殿は冒険者ではないでありますから、手数料が倍かかってしまうでありますよ？　今ならば簡単に登録出来るでありますが？」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:冒険者ギルドの受付嬢&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:出来損ないと呼ばれた元英雄は、実家から追放されたので好き勝手に生きることにした&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=[[The Banished Former Hero Lives as He Pleases]]&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=17 April 2020&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;edition={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|１～５巻合本版}}&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Kōzuki&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Shin&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=TO Books&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFKōzuki2020" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt850">Kōzuki, Shin (17 April 2020).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLog">冒険者ギルドの受付嬢</bdi>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLok">出来損ないと呼ばれた元英雄は、実家から追放されたので好き勝手に生きることにした</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLoo">[</span><i id="mwLos"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Banished_Former_Hero_Lives_as_He_Pleases" title="The Banished Former Hero Lives as He Pleases" id="mwLow">The Banished Former Hero Lives as He Pleases</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLo0">]</span> (in Japanese) (<span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwLo4"><span lang="ja" id="mwLo8">１～５巻合本版</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwLpA"><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLpE">&nbsp;</span>ed.). TO Books.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLpI">「……？　何を言っているでありますか？　ちゃんとしているではないでありますか」<br id="mwLpM">[…]<br id="mwLpQ">「了解したでありますが、アレン殿は冒険者ではないでありますから、手数料が倍かかってしまうでありますよ？　今ならば簡単に登録出来るでありますが？」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E5%86%92%E9%99%BA%E8%80%85%E3%82%AE%E3%83%AB%E3%83%89%E3%81%AE%E5%8F%97%E4%BB%98%E5%AC%A2&amp;rft.btitle=%E5%87%BA%E6%9D%A5%E6%90%8D%E3%81%AA%E3%81%84%E3%81%A8%E5%91%BC%E3%81%B0%E3%82%8C%E3%81%9F%E5%85%83%E8%8B%B1%E9%9B%84%E3%81%AF%E3%80%81%E5%AE%9F%E5%AE%B6%E3%81%8B%E3%82%89%E8%BF%BD%E6%94%BE%E3%81%95%E3%82%8C%E3%81%9F%E3%81%AE%E3%81%A7%E5%A5%BD%E3%81%8D%E5%8B%9D%E6%89%8B%E3%81%AB%E7%94%9F%E3%81%8D%E3%82%8B%E3%81%93%E3%81%A8%E3%81%AB%E3%81%97%E3%81%9F&amp;rft.edition=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%EF%BC%91%EF%BD%9E%EF%BC%95%E5%B7%BB%E5%90%88%E6%9C%AC%E7%89%88%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pub=TO+Books&amp;rft.date=2020-04-17&amp;rft.aulast=K%C5%8Dzuki&amp;rft.aufirst=Shin&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt850" id="mwLpU"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt850" id="mwLpY"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt850" id="mwLpc"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-125" id="cite_note-125" data-mw-footnote-number="113"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLpg"><a href="#cite_ref-125" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwLpk"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLpo">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-125" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt853" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwLps" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「そうなのか、じゃないであります！」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://ncode.syosetu.com/n3722ev/10/&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:ここは俺に任せて先に行けと言ってから10年がたったら伝説になっていた。&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=30 June 2018&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=10&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;author=Ezo Gingitsune&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|小説家になろう}}&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFEzo_Gingitsune2018" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt853">Ezo Gingitsune (30 June 2018). "10". <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://ncode.syosetu.com/n3722ev/10/" class="external text" id="mwLpw"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwLp0">ここは俺に任せて先に行けと言ってから10年がたったら伝説になっていた。</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwLp4"><span lang="ja" id="mwLp8">小説家になろう</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwLqA">.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLqE">「そうなのか、じゃないであります！」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=10&amp;rft.btitle=%E3%81%93%E3%81%93%E3%81%AF%E4%BF%BA%E3%81%AB%E4%BB%BB%E3%81%9B%E3%81%A6%E5%85%88%E3%81%AB%E8%A1%8C%E3%81%91%E3%81%A8%E8%A8%80%E3%81%A3%E3%81%A6%E3%81%8B%E3%82%8910%E5%B9%B4%E3%81%8C%E3%81%9F%E3%81%A3%E3%81%9F%E3%82%89%E4%BC%9D%E8%AA%AC%E3%81%AB%E3%81%AA%E3%81%A3%E3%81%A6%E3%81%84%E3%81%9F%E3%80%82&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E5%B0%8F%E8%AA%AC%E5%AE%B6%E3%81%AB%E3%81%AA%E3%82%8D%E3%81%86%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.date=2018-06-30&amp;rft.au=Ezo+Gingitsune&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fncode.syosetu.com%2Fn3722ev%2F10%2F&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt853" id="mwLqI"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt853" id="mwLqM"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt853" id="mwLqQ"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-126" id="cite_note-126" data-mw-footnote-number="114"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLqU"><a href="#cite_ref-126" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwLqY"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLqc">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-126" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt860" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwLqg" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:citation&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;citation&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:まず、ないわけではなくあります。ですが、維持修繕等に活用するような内容を全て網羅してございませんので、そちらのほうを活用はしていないということでございます。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.town.mitane.akita.jp/material/files/group/16/02-r02-03t-02-0312.pdf&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=65&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Shindō&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Atsushi&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=12 March 2020&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:令和２年３月三種町議会定例会会議録&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Mitane, Akita]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFShindō2020" class="citation cs2 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt860">Shindō, Atsushi (12 March 2020), <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.town.mitane.akita.jp/material/files/group/16/02-r02-03t-02-0312.pdf" class="external text" id="mwLqk"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwLqo">令和２年３月三種町議会定例会会議録</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwLqs">(PDF)</span> (in Japanese), <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mitane,_Akita" title="Mitane, Akita" id="mwLqw">Mitane, Akita</a>, p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLq0">&nbsp;</span>65,  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLq4">まず、ないわけではなくあります。ですが、維持修繕等に活用するような内容を全て網羅してございませんので、そちらのほうを活用はしていないということでございます。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=%E4%BB%A4%E5%92%8C%EF%BC%92%E5%B9%B4%EF%BC%93%E6%9C%88%E4%B8%89%E7%A8%AE%E7%94%BA%E8%AD%B0%E4%BC%9A%E5%AE%9A%E4%BE%8B%E4%BC%9A%E4%BC%9A%E8%AD%B0%E9%8C%B2&amp;rft.place=Mitane%2C+Akita&amp;rft.pages=65&amp;rft.date=2020-03-12&amp;rft.aulast=Shind%C5%8D&amp;rft.aufirst=Atsushi&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.town.mitane.akita.jp%2Fmaterial%2Ffiles%2Fgroup%2F16%2F02-r02-03t-02-0312.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt860" id="mwLq8"></span><span class="cs1-maint citation-comment" about="#mwt860" id="mwLrA"><code class="cs1-code" id="mwLrE">{{<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Template:Citation" title="Template:Citation" id="mwLrI">citation</a>}}</code>:  CS1 maint: location missing publisher (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category:CS1_maint:_location_missing_publisher" title="Category:CS1 maint: location missing publisher" id="mwLrM">link</a>)</span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_maint:_location_missing_publisher" about="#mwt860" id="mwLrQ"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt860" id="mwLrU"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt860" id="mwLrY"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-127" id="cite_note-127" data-mw-footnote-number="115"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLrc"><a href="#cite_ref-127" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwLrg"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLrk">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-127" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt864" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwLro" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:citation&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;citation&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:まとまった状態でなくありますけれども、そういうような面で二小のことなんかについても非常に活用するのに、ただただこの半年後に閉まってしまった、すぐに何もないというのではなくて、何かいろいろ活用が考えられたらということで聞いているわけであります。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=42&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.town.nagatoro.saitama.jp/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/1210ec94b451732e0b4bbea63bad19fd.pdf&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:令和５年第５回長瀞町議会定例会会議録目次&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=13 September 2023&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Arai&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Toshirō&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Nagatoro, Saitama]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFArai2023" class="citation cs2 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt864">Arai, Toshirō (13 September 2023), <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.town.nagatoro.saitama.jp/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/1210ec94b451732e0b4bbea63bad19fd.pdf" class="external text" id="mwLrs"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwLrw">令和５年第５回長瀞町議会定例会会議録目次</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwLr0">(PDF)</span> (in Japanese), <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nagatoro,_Saitama" title="Nagatoro, Saitama" id="mwLr4">Nagatoro, Saitama</a>, p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLr8">&nbsp;</span>42,  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLsA">まとまった状態でなくありますけれども、そういうような面で二小のことなんかについても非常に活用するのに、ただただこの半年後に閉まってしまった、すぐに何もないというのではなくて、何かいろいろ活用が考えられたらということで聞いているわけであります。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=%E4%BB%A4%E5%92%8C%EF%BC%95%E5%B9%B4%E7%AC%AC%EF%BC%95%E5%9B%9E%E9%95%B7%E7%80%9E%E7%94%BA%E8%AD%B0%E4%BC%9A%E5%AE%9A%E4%BE%8B%E4%BC%9A%E4%BC%9A%E8%AD%B0%E9%8C%B2%E7%9B%AE%E6%AC%A1&amp;rft.place=Nagatoro%2C+Saitama&amp;rft.pages=42&amp;rft.date=2023-09-13&amp;rft.aulast=Arai&amp;rft.aufirst=Toshir%C5%8D&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.town.nagatoro.saitama.jp%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F12%2F1210ec94b451732e0b4bbea63bad19fd.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt864" id="mwLsE"></span><span class="cs1-maint citation-comment" about="#mwt864" id="mwLsI"><code class="cs1-code" id="mwLsM">{{<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Template:Citation" title="Template:Citation" id="mwLsQ">citation</a>}}</code>:  CS1 maint: location missing publisher (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category:CS1_maint:_location_missing_publisher" title="Category:CS1 maint: location missing publisher" id="mwLsU">link</a>)</span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_maint:_location_missing_publisher" about="#mwt864" id="mwLsY"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt864" id="mwLsc"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt864" id="mwLsg"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-128" id="cite_note-128" data-mw-footnote-number="116"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLsk"><a href="#cite_ref-128" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwLso"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLss">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-128" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt868" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwLsw" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;web&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:現実問題、クラブが終わって生徒が帰って7時頃から会議をするというのは別段不思議じゃなくありますのでね。本当にそういう時間をどのように確保するかというのは大変重要かと思います。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.mext.go.jp/b_menu/shingi/chukyo/chukyo3/075/siryo/1382075.htm&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:教育課程部会　高等学校部会（第4回）　議事録&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=16 June 2016&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-work=ja:文部科学省&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;work=Ministry of Education, Culture, Sports, Science and Technology-Japan&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite class="citation web cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt868" id="mwLs0"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.mext.go.jp/b_menu/shingi/chukyo/chukyo3/075/siryo/1382075.htm" class="external text" id="mwLs4"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwLs8">教育課程部会　高等学校部会（第4回）　議事録</bdi></a>. <i id="mwLtA">Ministry of Education, Culture, Sports, Science and Technology-Japan</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLtE">文部科学省</bdi> (in Japanese). 16 June 2016.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLtI">現実問題、クラブが終わって生徒が帰って7時頃から会議をするというのは別段不思議じゃなくありますのでね。本当にそういう時間をどのように確保するかというのは大変重要かと思います。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Ministry+of+Education%2C+Culture%2C+Sports%2C+Science+and+Technology-Japan&amp;rft.atitle=%E6%95%99%E8%82%B2%E8%AA%B2%E7%A8%8B%E9%83%A8%E4%BC%9A%E3%80%80%E9%AB%98%E7%AD%89%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A1%E9%83%A8%E4%BC%9A%EF%BC%88%E7%AC%AC4%E5%9B%9E%EF%BC%89%E3%80%80%E8%AD%B0%E4%BA%8B%E9%8C%B2&amp;rft.date=2016-06-16&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.mext.go.jp%2Fb_menu%2Fshingi%2Fchukyo%2Fchukyo3%2F075%2Fsiryo%2F1382075.htm&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt868" id="mwLtM"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt868" id="mwLtQ"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt868" id="mwLtU"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-129" id="cite_note-129" data-mw-footnote-number="117"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLtY"><a href="#cite_ref-129" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwLtc"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLtg">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-129" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt873" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwLtk" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:彼は、結婚における今日の所謂變愛なるものを罵つて曰く、結婚における文明的變愛とは、一ケ月の終りには、怒らくは結婚の第二日には、心の一切の幻覺から醒めてしまつて、ただ家庭的紐帶に連なつてゐる純粹の殘忍性、偶然の交合のほかの何ものでもあらないと。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=289&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/752725/1/152&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:性のユトピア&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:自由人は斯く語る&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Kōshin&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Murobuse&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=9 June 1924&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Hihyōsha&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Kyōbashi, Tokyo]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFMurobuse1924" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt873">Murobuse, Kōshin (9 June 1924).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLto">性のユトピア</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/752725/1/152" class="external text" id="mwLts"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwLtw">自由人は斯く語る</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kyōbashi,_Tokyo" title="Kyōbashi, Tokyo" id="mwLt0">Kyōbashi, Tokyo</a>: Hihyōsha. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLt4">&nbsp;</span>289.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLt8">彼は、結婚における今日の所謂變愛なるものを罵つて曰く、結婚における文明的變愛とは、一ケ月の終りには、怒らくは結婚の第二日には、心の一切の幻覺から醒めてしまつて、ただ家庭的紐帶に連なつてゐる純粹の殘忍性、偶然の交合のほかの何ものでもあらないと。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E6%80%A7%E3%81%AE%E3%83%A6%E3%83%88%E3%83%94%E3%82%A2&amp;rft.btitle=%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E4%BA%BA%E3%81%AF%E6%96%AF%E3%81%8F%E8%AA%9E%E3%82%8B&amp;rft.place=Ky%C5%8Dbashi%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=289&amp;rft.pub=Hihy%C5%8Dsha&amp;rft.date=1924-06-09&amp;rft.aulast=Murobuse&amp;rft.aufirst=K%C5%8Dshin&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F752725%2F1%2F152&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt873" id="mwLuA"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt873" id="mwLuE"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt873" id="mwLuI"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-130" id="cite_note-130" data-mw-footnote-number="118"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLuM"><a href="#cite_ref-130" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwLuQ"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLuU">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-130" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt876" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwLuY" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1884417/1/16&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:それ故白齒の首は、おはぐろつけて給はれと賴まれておじやつたが、首もこはいものではあらない。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;language=ja&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=23&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:ある戰國女性の生活…………おあん物語&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:わが愛讀文章&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Kan Kikuchi&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Kan&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Kikuchi&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|非凡閣}}&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=10 April 1944&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFKikuchi1944" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt876"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kan_Kikuchi" title="Kan Kikuchi" id="mwLuc">Kikuchi, Kan</a> (10 April 1944).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLug">ある戰國女性の生活…………おあん物語</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1884417/1/16" class="external text" id="mwLuk"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwLuo">わが愛讀文章</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwLus"><span lang="ja" id="mwLuw">非凡閣</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwLu0">. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLu4">&nbsp;</span>23.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLu8">それ故白齒の首は、おはぐろつけて給はれと賴まれておじやつたが、首もこはいものではあらない。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E3%81%82%E3%82%8B%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%8B%E5%A5%B3%E6%80%A7%E3%81%AE%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB%E2%80%A6%E2%80%A6%E2%80%A6%E2%80%A6%E3%81%8A%E3%81%82%E3%82%93%E7%89%A9%E8%AA%9E&amp;rft.btitle=%E3%82%8F%E3%81%8C%E6%84%9B%E8%AE%80%E6%96%87%E7%AB%A0&amp;rft.pages=23&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E9%9D%9E%E5%87%A1%E9%96%A3%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.date=1944-04-10&amp;rft.aulast=Kikuchi&amp;rft.aufirst=Kan&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1884417%2F1%2F16&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt876" id="mwLvA"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt876" id="mwLvE"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt876" id="mwLvI"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-131" id="cite_note-131" data-mw-footnote-number="119"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLvM"><a href="#cite_ref-131" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwLvQ"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLvU">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-131" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt879" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwLvY" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:このお寺は唯のお寺ではあらない。[…]その坊様は<ruby>真<rp>(</rp><rt>まこと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の人間ではあらない。[…]いやいや、<ruby>天<rp>(</rp><rt>てん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>狗<rp>(</rp><rt>ぐ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>様でもあらない。[…]ほんまに嘘ではあらないと云ふのぢやな。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:南蛮寺門前&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Mokutarō Kinoshita&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Mokutarō&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Kinoshita&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.aozora.gr.jp/cards/000120/files/626_22343.html&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=10 November 1985&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;orig-date=5 April 1970&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFKinoshita1985" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt879"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mokutarō_Kinoshita" title="Mokutarō Kinoshita" id="mwLvc">Kinoshita, Mokutarō</a> (10 November 1985) [5 April 1970]. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.aozora.gr.jp/cards/000120/files/626_22343.html" class="external text" id="mwLvg"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwLvk">南蛮寺門前</bdi></a> (in Japanese).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLvo">このお寺は唯のお寺ではあらない。[…]その坊様は<ruby id="mwLvs">真<rp id="mwLvw">(</rp><rt id="mwLv0">まこと</rt><rp id="mwLv4">)</rp></ruby>の人間ではあらない。[…]いやいや、<ruby id="mwLv8">天<rp id="mwLwA">(</rp><rt id="mwLwE">てん</rt><rp id="mwLwI">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwLwM">狗<rp id="mwLwQ">(</rp><rt id="mwLwU">ぐ</rt><rp id="mwLwY">)</rp></ruby>様でもあらない。[…]ほんまに嘘ではあらないと云ふのぢやな。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=%E5%8D%97%E8%9B%AE%E5%AF%BA%E9%96%80%E5%89%8D&amp;rft.date=1985-11-10&amp;rft.aulast=Kinoshita&amp;rft.aufirst=Mokutar%C5%8D&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.aozora.gr.jp%2Fcards%2F000120%2Ffiles%2F626_22343.html&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt879" id="mwLwc"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt879" id="mwLwg"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt879" id="mwLwk"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-132" id="cite_note-132" data-mw-footnote-number="120"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLwo"><a href="#cite_ref-132" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwLws"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLww">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-132" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt882" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwLw0" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:というのも，書物は現実また世界を理解するための重要な手段であり，作家は今の世界を忠実にとらえるためには常に新しい小説の作者であらなくてはいけないと言うことになる。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=66&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://kansai-u.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/13426/files/KU-1100-19840228-04.pdf&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Nakai&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Hideaki&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:「批評としての小説」 —ビュトールをめぐる作品論&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:仏語仏文学&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=14&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=1984&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFNakai1984" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt882">Nakai, Hideaki (1984). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://kansai-u.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/13426/files/KU-1100-19840228-04.pdf" class="external text" id="mwLw4"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwLw8">「批評としての小説」 —ビュトールをめぐる作品論</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwLxA">(PDF)</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLxE">仏語仏文学</bdi> (in Japanese) (14): 66.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLxI">というのも，書物は現実また世界を理解するための重要な手段であり，作家は今の世界を忠実にとらえるためには常に新しい小説の作者であらなくてはいけないと言うことになる。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E3%80%8C%E6%89%B9%E8%A9%95%E3%81%A8%E3%81%97%E3%81%A6%E3%81%AE%E5%B0%8F%E8%AA%AC%E3%80%8D+%E2%80%94%E3%83%93%E3%83%A5%E3%83%88%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%82%92%E3%82%81%E3%81%90%E3%82%8B%E4%BD%9C%E5%93%81%E8%AB%96&amp;rft.issue=14&amp;rft.pages=66&amp;rft.date=1984&amp;rft.aulast=Nakai&amp;rft.aufirst=Hideaki&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fkansai-u.repo.nii.ac.jp%2Frecord%2F13426%2Ffiles%2FKU-1100-19840228-04.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt882" id="mwLxM"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt882" id="mwLxQ"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt882" id="mwLxU"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-133" id="cite_note-133" data-mw-footnote-number="121"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLxY"><a href="#cite_ref-133" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwLxc"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLxg">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-133" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt885" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwLxk" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:現代の宗教教育は、そういうものであらなくてはならない。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=116&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://hiroshima.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/2000114/files/ChildStudy_60-5_546.pdf&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Machida&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Sōhō&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:実験的教育論［4］ 宗教教育は不可能か&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:児童心理&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=60&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=5&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=2006&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFMachida2006" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt885">Machida, Sōhō (2006). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://hiroshima.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/2000114/files/ChildStudy_60-5_546.pdf" class="external text" id="mwLxo"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwLxs">実験的教育論［4］ 宗教教育は不可能か</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwLxw">(PDF)</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLx0">児童心理</bdi> (in Japanese). <b id="mwLx4">60</b> (5): 116.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLx8">現代の宗教教育は、そういうものであらなくてはならない。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E5%AE%9F%E9%A8%93%E7%9A%84%E6%95%99%E8%82%B2%E8%AB%96%EF%BC%BB4%EF%BC%BD+%E5%AE%97%E6%95%99%E6%95%99%E8%82%B2%E3%81%AF%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E3%81%8B&amp;rft.volume=60&amp;rft.issue=5&amp;rft.pages=116&amp;rft.date=2006&amp;rft.aulast=Machida&amp;rft.aufirst=S%C5%8Dh%C5%8D&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fhiroshima.repo.nii.ac.jp%2Frecord%2F2000114%2Ffiles%2FChildStudy_60-5_546.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt885" id="mwLyA"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt885" id="mwLyE"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt885" id="mwLyI"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-murakami-2017-134" id="cite_note-murakami-2017-134" data-mw-footnote-number="122"><span rel="mw:referencedBy" class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwLyM"><a href="#cite_ref-murakami-2017_134-0" id="mwLyQ"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLyU">1</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-murakami-2017_134-1" id="mwLyY"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwLyc">2</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-murakami-2017-134" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt888" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwLyg" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「あたしは何も絵の中から抜け出してきたわけではあらないよ」[…]雨田先生はもうおぼろで平和な世界に移行してしまっておられるし、騎士団長だって商標登録とかされているわけじゃあらない。[…]騎士団長以外の何ものでもあらない。[…]「いや、それほど簡単ではあらない。[…]」[…]あたしは霊ではあらない。[…]「あたしは夢なんかじゃあらないよ、もちろん」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote=\&quot;It is not like I escaped from the painting,\&quot; […] Mr. Amada has gone on to a hazy, peaceful world, and the Commendatore is not trademarked. […] Nothing other than the Commendatore. […] \&quot;No, it is not that simple. […]\&quot; […] I am no spirit. […] \&quot;I am no dream, I can tell you. Negative. Of course,\&quot;&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=349–353, 359&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:騎士団長殺し&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=[[Killing Commendatore]]&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|第1部 顕れるイデア編}}&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Haruki Murakami&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Murakami&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Haruki&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Shinchosha&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;isbn=978-4-10-353432-7&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Shinjuku]], Tokyo&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=25 February 2017&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Philip&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Gabriel&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first2=Ted&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last2=Goossen&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFMurakami2017" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-long-vol cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt888"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haruki_Murakami" title="Haruki Murakami" id="mwLyk">Murakami, Haruki</a> (25 February 2017).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLyo">騎士団長殺し</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLys">[</span><i id="mwLyw"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Killing_Commendatore" title="Killing Commendatore" id="mwLy0">Killing Commendatore</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLy4">]</span> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLy8">&nbsp;</span><span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwLzA"><span lang="ja" id="mwLzE">第1部 顕れるイデア編</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwLzI">. Translated by Gabriel, Philip; Goossen, Ted. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shinjuku" title="Shinjuku" id="mwLzM">Shinjuku</a>, Tokyo: Shinchosha. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLzQ">&nbsp;</span>349–353, 359. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)" title="ISBN (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwLzU">ISBN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLzY">&nbsp;</span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-4-10-353432-7" title="Special:BookSources/978-4-10-353432-7" id="mwLzc"><bdi id="mwLzg">978-4-10-353432-7</bdi></a>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwLzk">「あたしは何も絵の中から抜け出してきたわけではあらないよ」[…]雨田先生はもうおぼろで平和な世界に移行してしまっておられるし、騎士団長だって商標登録とかされているわけじゃあらない。[…]騎士団長以外の何ものでもあらない。[…]「いや、それほど簡単ではあらない。[…]」[…]あたしは霊ではあらない。[…]「あたしは夢なんかじゃあらないよ、もちろん」</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLzo">[</span>It is not like I escaped from the painting," […] Mr. Amada has gone on to a hazy, peaceful world, and the Commendatore is not trademarked. […] Nothing other than the Commendatore. […] "No, it is not that simple. […]" […] I am no spirit. […] "I am no dream, I can tell you. Negative. Of course,<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwLzs">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=%E9%A8%8E%E5%A3%AB%E5%9B%A3%E9%95%B7%E6%AE%BA%E3%81%97&amp;rft.place=Shinjuku%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=349-353%2C+359&amp;rft.pub=Shinchosha&amp;rft.date=2017-02-25&amp;rft.isbn=978-4-10-353432-7&amp;rft.aulast=Murakami&amp;rft.aufirst=Haruki&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt888" id="mwLzw"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt888" id="mwLz0"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1:_long_volume_value" about="#mwt888" id="mwLz4"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt888" id="mwLz8"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-nakajima-1935-135" id="cite_note-nakajima-1935-135" data-mw-footnote-number="123"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwL0A"><a href="#cite_ref-nakajima-1935_135-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwL0E"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwL0I">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-nakajima-1935-135" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt894" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwL0M" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:あのいとしい心もな、もうあんた樣に逢ひ度え逢ひ度えと云つて、<span style=text-emphasis:sesame>どきどき</span>してもゐましねえ。<ruby>其<rp>(</rp><rt>そこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>邊<rp>(</rp><rt>いら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の室にでも忍んでゐて、私の話の終るのを、お伽噺の終るのを、待つてるんでもありましねえ。[…]<br/>『もう此上あんた樣に云ふ事は何もありましねえ。』&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote=The dear heart beats no more with eagerness to see you. Not in a nearby chamber is she waiting for how my narrative, or fable, ends. […]<br/>“I have nothing more to tell you.”&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=Das liebe Herz ſchlägt nicht mehr vor Ungeduld, Sie zu ſehen, nicht etwa in einer benachbarten Kammer wartet ſie auf den Ausgang meiner Erzählung, oder meines Märchens; […] Jch habe Jhnen weiter nichts zu ſagen,&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=205&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1237456/1/110&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:第七卷&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=Siebentes Buch&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-chapter=Seventh Book&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:ヸルヘルム・マイステルの修行時代&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=[[Wilhelm Meister’s Apprenticeship]]&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Wilhelm Meiſters Lehrjahre&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Nakajima&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Kiyoshi&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Johann Wolfgang von Goethe&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Johann Wolfgang&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=von Goethe&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|ゲーテ全集刊行會}}&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Yodobashi]], Tokyo&quot;},&quot;21&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=2&quot;},&quot;22&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|ゲーテ全集}}&quot;},&quot;23&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=15 September 1935&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFvon_Goethe1935" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt894"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Johann_Wolfgang_von_Goethe" title="Johann Wolfgang von Goethe" id="mwL0Q">von Goethe, Johann Wolfgang</a> (15 September 1935). "Siebentes Buch" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwL0U">第七卷</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwL0Y">[</span>Seventh Book<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwL0c">]</span>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1237456/1/110" class="external text" id="mwL0g"><i id="mwL0k">Wilhelm Meiſters Lehrjahre</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwL0o">ヸルヘルム・マイステルの修行時代</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwL0s">[</span><i id="mwL0w"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wilhelm_Meister’s_Apprenticeship" title="Wilhelm Meister’s Apprenticeship" class="mw-redirect" id="mwL00">Wilhelm Meister’s Apprenticeship</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwL04">]</span>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwL08"><span lang="ja" id="mwL1A">ゲーテ全集</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwL1E"> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwL1I">&nbsp;</span>2. Translated by Nakajima, Kiyoshi. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yodobashi" title="Yodobashi" id="mwL1M">Yodobashi</a>, Tokyo: <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwL1Q"><span lang="ja" id="mwL1U">ゲーテ全集刊行會</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwL1Y">. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwL1c">&nbsp;</span>205. <q id="mwL1g">Das liebe Herz ſchlägt nicht mehr vor Ungeduld, Sie zu ſehen, nicht etwa in einer benachbarten Kammer wartet ſie auf den Ausgang meiner Erzählung, oder meines Märchens; […] Jch habe Jhnen weiter nichts zu ſagen,</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwL1k">あのいとしい心もな、もうあんた樣に逢ひ度え逢ひ度えと云つて、<span style="text-emphasis:sesame" id="mwL1o">どきどき</span>してもゐましねえ。<ruby id="mwL1s">其<rp id="mwL1w">(</rp><rt id="mwL10">そこ</rt><rp id="mwL14">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwL18">邊<rp id="mwL2A">(</rp><rt id="mwL2E">いら</rt><rp id="mwL2I">)</rp></ruby>の室にでも忍んでゐて、私の話の終るのを、お伽噺の終るのを、待つてるんでもありましねえ。[…]<br id="mwL2M">『もう此上あんた樣に云ふ事は何もありましねえ。』</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwL2Q">[</span>The dear heart beats no more with eagerness to see you. Not in a nearby chamber is she waiting for how my narrative, or fable, ends. […]<br id="mwL2U">“I have nothing more to tell you.”<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwL2Y">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=Siebentes+Buch+%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%83%E5%8D%B7&amp;rft.btitle=Wilhelm+Mei%C5%BFters+Lehrjahre+%E3%83%B8%E3%83%AB%E3%83%98%E3%83%AB%E3%83%A0%E3%83%BB%E3%83%9E%E3%82%A4%E3%82%B9%E3%83%86%E3%83%AB%E3%81%AE%E4%BF%AE%E8%A1%8C%E6%99%82%E4%BB%A3&amp;rft.place=Yodobashi%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E3%82%B2%E3%83%BC%E3%83%86%E5%85%A8%E9%9B%86%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=205&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E3%82%B2%E3%83%BC%E3%83%86%E5%85%A8%E9%9B%86%E5%88%8A%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%83%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.date=1935-09-15&amp;rft.aulast=von+Goethe&amp;rft.aufirst=Johann+Wolfgang&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1237456%2F1%2F110&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt894" id="mwL2c"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt894" id="mwL2g"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt894" id="mwL2k"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-shinjo-1941-136" id="cite_note-shinjo-1941-136" data-mw-footnote-number="124"><span rel="mw:referencedBy" class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwL2o"><a href="#cite_ref-shinjo-1941_136-0" id="mwL2s"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwL2w">1</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-shinjo-1941_136-1" id="mwL20"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwL24">2</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-shinjo-1941-136" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt916" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwL28" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「ランドの小作人が籠に卵を入れておきましたから、それを下さいと賴んだら、私の機嫌をとるために吳れましたゞ。まあいゝ人ぢやありましねえか。」<br/>[…]<br/>「あらまあ、お孃さまつたら、魂の拔け出したやうな眼付をしていらつしやるだ。そんな風に人を見るものでありましねえ。」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=— Le fermier de la Lande en avait dans son panier, je les lui ai demandés, et il me les a donnés pour m’être agréable, le mignon.<br/>[…]<br/>— Sainte Vierge, mademoiselle, vous avez les yeux à la perdition de votre âme ! Ne regardez donc pas le monde comme ça.&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote=“The farmer from Lande had some eggs in his basket, and when I asked him for some, he gave them to me just to please me. Isn’t he a nice chap?”<br/>[…]<br/>“Goodness me, mademoiselle, your gaze feels as though your soul had escaped you. Don’t look at me like that.”&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pages=113, 231&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1136629/1/65&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:純愛&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Eugénie Grandet&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=[[Eugénie Grandet|Pure Love]]&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Honoré de Balzac&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Honoré&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=de Balzac&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Waichi&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Shinjō&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=18 November 1941&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Tokyodo&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Kanda, Tokyo]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFde_Balzac1941" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt916"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Honoré_de_Balzac" title="Honoré de Balzac" id="mwL3A">de Balzac, Honoré</a> (18 November 1941). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1136629/1/65" class="external text" id="mwL3E"><i id="mwL3I">Eugénie Grandet</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwL3M">純愛</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwL3Q">[</span><i id="mwL3U"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eugénie_Grandet" title="Eugénie Grandet" id="mwL3Y">Pure Love</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwL3c">]</span> (in Japanese). Translated by Shinjō, Waichi. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kanda,_Tokyo" title="Kanda, Tokyo" id="mwL3g">Kanda, Tokyo</a>: Tokyodo. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwL3k">&nbsp;</span>113, 231. <q id="mwL3o">— Le fermier de la Lande en avait dans son panier, je les lui ai demandés, et il me les a donnés pour m'être agréable, le mignon.<br id="mwL3s">[…]<br id="mwL3w">— Sainte Vierge, mademoiselle, vous avez les yeux à la perdition de votre âme<span typeof="mw:DisplaySpace" id="mwL30">&nbsp;</span>! Ne regardez donc pas le monde comme ça.</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwL34">「ランドの小作人が籠に卵を入れておきましたから、それを下さいと賴んだら、私の機嫌をとるために吳れましたゞ。まあいゝ人ぢやありましねえか。」<br id="mwL38">[…]<br id="mwL4A">「あらまあ、お孃さまつたら、魂の拔け出したやうな眼付をしていらつしやるだ。そんな風に人を見るものでありましねえ。」</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwL4E">[</span>“The farmer from Lande had some eggs in his basket, and when I asked him for some, he gave them to me just to please me. Isn’t he a nice chap?”<br id="mwL4I">[…]<br id="mwL4M">“Goodness me, mademoiselle, your gaze feels as though your soul had escaped you. Don’t look at me like that.”<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwL4Q">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=Eug%C3%A9nie+Grandet+%E7%B4%94%E6%84%9B&amp;rft.place=Kanda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=113%2C+231&amp;rft.pub=Tokyodo&amp;rft.date=1941-11-18&amp;rft.aulast=de+Balzac&amp;rft.aufirst=Honor%C3%A9&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1136629%2F1%2F65&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt916" id="mwL4U"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt916" id="mwL4Y"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt916" id="mwL4c"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-137" id="cite_note-137" data-mw-footnote-number="125"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwL4g"><a href="#cite_ref-137" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwL4k"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwL4o">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-137" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt898" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwL4s" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「だけんど、パーウェル・イワーノヸッチ、馬に蹄鐵をうたなきやなりましねえでがせう。」<br/>「えい、この、ぼんくらの豚め！　木偶の坊め！　それならそれと、なぜ前に言はなかつたんだ？　それだけの暇がなかつたとでもいふのかっ？」<br/>「それあ、暇がなかつたちふ譯ではありましねえがね……。それから車の輪でがすがね、パーウェル・イワーノヸッチ、あれも輪鐵をすつかり取つ替へなきや駄目でがせうなあ、なにせ、今頃は道路がでこぼこで、どこへ行つてもガタガタと搖れますだから……。それから、これも一言いはせて貰ひますが、馬車の前の方が、まるでぐらぐらになつてをりましてね、あれぢやあ、たうてい二丁場とはもちますめえよ。」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote=“Paul Ivanovitch, we need to shoe the horses.”<br/>“You doltish swine! Worthless fool! Why did you not tell me of that before? Was there no spare time to do it?”<br/>“I suppose there was time…… Also, one of the wheels, Paul Ivanovitch, we need to get a new tire for it, too, ’cause the roads’re bumpy and we’re shaking to and fro everywhere we go now…… Also, if you’ll let me say this, the front of the britchka is so rickety that, at this rate, it won’t make it to two more stations.”&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=— Да ведь, Павел Иванович, нужно будет лошадей ковать.<br/>— Ах ты чушка! чурбан! а прежде зачем об этом не сказал? Не было разве времени?<br/>— Да время-то было… Да вот и колесо тоже, Павел Иванович, шину нужно будет совсем перетянуть, потому что теперь дорога ухабиста, шибень такой везде пошел… Да если позволите доложить: перед у брички совсем расшатался, так что она, может быть, и двух станций не сделает.&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pages=162–163&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1137041/1/83&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:第十一章&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=Глава XI&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-chapter=Chapter XI&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:死せる魂&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=[[Dead Souls]]&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Мертвыя души&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=2&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Nikolai Vasilyevich&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Gogol&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Nikolai Gogol&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Hajime&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Hirai&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|岩波文庫}}&quot;},&quot;21&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Iwanami Shoten&quot;},&quot;22&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=10 November 1948&quot;},&quot;23&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Chiyoda, Tokyo]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFGogol1948" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt898"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nikolai_Gogol" title="Nikolai Gogol" id="mwL4w">Gogol, Nikolai Vasilyevich</a> (10 November 1948). "Глава XI" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwL40">第十一章</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwL44">[</span>Chapter XI<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwL48">]</span>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1137041/1/83" class="external text" id="mwL5A"><i id="mwL5E">Мертвыя души</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwL5I">死せる魂</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwL5M">[</span><i id="mwL5Q"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dead_Souls" title="Dead Souls" id="mwL5U">Dead Souls</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwL5Y">]</span>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwL5c"><span lang="ja" id="mwL5g">岩波文庫</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwL5k"> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwL5o">&nbsp;</span>2. Translated by Hirai, Hajime. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiyoda,_Tokyo" title="Chiyoda, Tokyo" id="mwL5s">Chiyoda, Tokyo</a>: Iwanami Shoten. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwL5w">&nbsp;</span><span class="nowrap" id="mwL50">162–</span>163. <q id="mwL54">— Да ведь, Павел Иванович, нужно будет лошадей ковать.<br id="mwL58">— Ах ты чушка! чурбан! а прежде зачем об этом не сказал? Не было разве времени?<br id="mwL6A">— Да время-то было… Да вот и колесо тоже, Павел Иванович, шину нужно будет совсем перетянуть, потому что теперь дорога ухабиста, шибень такой везде пошел… Да если позволите доложить: перед у брички совсем расшатался, так что она, может быть, и двух станций не сделает.</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwL6E">「だけんど、パーウェル・イワーノヸッチ、馬に蹄鐵をうたなきやなりましねえでがせう。」<br id="mwL6I">「えい、この、ぼんくらの豚め！　木偶の坊め！　それならそれと、なぜ前に言はなかつたんだ？　それだけの暇がなかつたとでもいふのかっ？」<br id="mwL6M">「それあ、暇がなかつたちふ譯ではありましねえがね……。それから車の輪でがすがね、パーウェル・イワーノヸッチ、あれも輪鐵をすつかり取つ替へなきや駄目でがせうなあ、なにせ、今頃は道路がでこぼこで、どこへ行つてもガタガタと搖れますだから……。それから、これも一言いはせて貰ひますが、馬車の前の方が、まるでぐらぐらになつてをりましてね、あれぢやあ、たうてい二丁場とはもちますめえよ。」</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwL6Q">[</span>“Paul Ivanovitch, we need to shoe the horses.”<br id="mwL6U">“You doltish swine! Worthless fool! Why did you not tell me of that before? Was there no spare time to do it?”<br id="mwL6Y">“I suppose there was time…… Also, one of the wheels, Paul Ivanovitch, we need to get a new tire for it, too, ’cause the roads’re bumpy and we’re shaking to and fro everywhere we go now…… Also, if you’ll let me say this, the front of the britchka is so rickety that, at this rate, it won’t make it to two more stations.”<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwL6c">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%D0%93%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B0+XI+%E7%AC%AC%E5%8D%81%E4%B8%80%E7%AB%A0&amp;rft.btitle=%D0%9C%D0%B5%D1%80%D1%82%D0%B2%D1%8B%D1%8F+%D0%B4%D1%83%D1%88%D0%B8+%E6%AD%BB%E3%81%9B%E3%82%8B%E9%AD%82&amp;rft.place=Chiyoda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E5%B2%A9%E6%B3%A2%E6%96%87%E5%BA%AB%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=162-163&amp;rft.pub=Iwanami+Shoten&amp;rft.date=1948-11-10&amp;rft.aulast=Gogol&amp;rft.aufirst=Nikolai+Vasilyevich&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1137041%2F1%2F83&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt898" id="mwL6g"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt898" id="mwL6k"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt898" id="mwL6o"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-138" id="cite_note-138" data-mw-footnote-number="126"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwL6s"><a href="#cite_ref-138" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwL6w"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwL60">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-138" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt901" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwL64" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:<small>（口眞似する）</small>何でもありましねえだと……何がなんでもありましねえんだか、後でうんと敎へてくれるぞ！&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote=<small>(Mockingly)</small> “Nuthin’ at all”…… You better let me know what’s nuthin’ at all later!&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=''(Дразнит.)'' Ничаво… Я тебе задам — ничаво!&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=72&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1692598/1/38&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:熊&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-chapter=[[The Bear (play)|The Bear]]&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=Медведь&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:熊　他二篇&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=The Bear, and Two More Plays&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|角川文庫}}&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Anton Pavlovich&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Chekhov&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Anton Chekhov&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Masao&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Yonekawa&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=20 January 1955&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Chiyoda, Tokyo]]&quot;},&quot;21&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Kadokawa Shoten&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFChekhov1955" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt901"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anton_Chekhov" title="Anton Chekhov" id="mwL68">Chekhov, Anton Pavlovich</a> (20 January 1955). "Медведь" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwL7A">熊</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwL7E">[</span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Bear_(play)" title="The Bear (play)" id="mwL7I">The Bear</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwL7M">]</span>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1692598/1/38" class="external text" id="mwL7Q"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwL7U">熊　他二篇</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwL7Y">[</span><i id="mwL7c">The Bear, and Two More Plays</i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwL7g">]</span>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwL7k"><span lang="ja" id="mwL7o">角川文庫</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwL7s"> (in Japanese). Translated by Yonekawa, Masao. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiyoda,_Tokyo" title="Chiyoda, Tokyo" id="mwL7w">Chiyoda, Tokyo</a>: Kadokawa Shoten. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwL70">&nbsp;</span>72. <q id="mwL74"><i id="mwL78">(Дразнит.)</i> Ничаво… Я тебе задам — ничаво!</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwL8A"><small id="mwL8E">（口眞似する）</small>何でもありましねえだと……何がなんでもありましねえんだか、後でうんと敎へてくれるぞ！</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwL8I">[</span><small id="mwL8M">(Mockingly)</small> “Nuthin’ at all”…… You better let me know what’s nuthin’ at all later!<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwL8Q">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%D0%9C%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%B2%D0%B5%D0%B4%D1%8C+%E7%86%8A&amp;rft.btitle=%E7%86%8A%E3%80%80%E4%BB%96%E4%BA%8C%E7%AF%87&amp;rft.place=Chiyoda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E8%A7%92%E5%B7%9D%E6%96%87%E5%BA%AB%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=72&amp;rft.pub=Kadokawa+Shoten&amp;rft.date=1955-01-20&amp;rft.aulast=Chekhov&amp;rft.aufirst=Anton+Pavlovich&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1692598%2F1%2F38&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt901" id="mwL8U"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt901" id="mwL8Y"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt901" id="mwL8c"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-139" id="cite_note-139" data-mw-footnote-number="127"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwL8g"><a href="#cite_ref-139" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwL8k"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwL8o">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-139" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt904" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwL8s" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「<ruby>早<rp>(</rp><rt>は</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>や、これは<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>ど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うも、<ruby>曩<rp>(</rp><rt>さつき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>細<rp>(</rp><rt>ほそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いのと<ruby>言<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ひましたは<ruby>恁麼<rp>(</rp><rt>こんな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ことぢやあありましねえ、<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も<ruby>足<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>すだから、お<ruby>前<rp>(</rp><rt>めえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>樣<rp>(</rp><rt>さま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も<ruby>一<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>握<rp>(</rp><rt>にぎり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>だ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さつせえ、<ruby>然<rp>(</rp><rt>さう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して、<ruby>豪<rp>(</rp><rt>えれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>え<ruby>先<rp>(</rp><rt>せん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>生<rp>(</rp><rt>せい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で、<ruby>澤<rp>(</rp><rt>たく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>山<rp>(</rp><rt>さん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>て<ruby>貰<rp>(</rp><rt>もら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ひ<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>て</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のあるやうに、<ruby>机<rp>(</rp><rt>つくゑ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>うへ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>へ<ruby>並<rp>(</rp><rt>なら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べて<ruby>置<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くといふ<ruby>謀計<rp>(</rp><rt>たくらみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ださ、もし、<ruby>早<rp>(</rp><rt>はや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>繼<rp>(</rp><rt>つぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>粉<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でも、<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>切<rp>(</rp><rt>きり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>賣<rp>(</rp><rt>もの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>瀨<rp>(</rp><rt>せ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>戶<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>物<rp>(</rp><rt>もの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でも、<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さつせえ<ruby>皆<rp>(</rp><rt>みな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>積<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んである、あれだよお<ruby>前<rp>(</rp><rt>めえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>樣<rp>(</rp><rt>さま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>。」と<ruby>正<rp>(</rp><rt>しやう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>直<rp>(</rp><rt>ぢき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>辭<rp>(</rp><rt>じ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>退<rp>(</rp><rt>たい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=12&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1682847/1/11&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:袖屛風&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;orig-date=November 1901&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Kyōka Izumi&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Kyōtarō&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Izumi&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=22 July 1942&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Iwanami Shoten&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Kanda, Tokyo]]&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:鏡花全集&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=7&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFIzumi1942" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt904"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kyōka_Izumi" title="Kyōka Izumi" id="mwL8w">Izumi, Kyōtarō</a> (22 July 1942) [November 1901].  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwL80">袖屛風</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1682847/1/11" class="external text" id="mwL84"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwL88">鏡花全集</bdi></a> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwL9A">&nbsp;</span>7. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kanda,_Tokyo" title="Kanda, Tokyo" id="mwL9E">Kanda, Tokyo</a>: Iwanami Shoten. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwL9I">&nbsp;</span>12.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwL9M">「<ruby id="mwL9Q">早<rp id="mwL9U">(</rp><rt id="mwL9Y">は</rt><rp id="mwL9c">)</rp></ruby>や、これは<ruby id="mwL9g">何<rp id="mwL9k">(</rp><rt id="mwL9o">ど</rt><rp id="mwL9s">)</rp></ruby>うも、<ruby id="mwL9w">曩<rp id="mwL90">(</rp><rt id="mwL94">さつき</rt><rp id="mwL98">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwL-A">細<rp id="mwL-E">(</rp><rt id="mwL-I">ほそ</rt><rp id="mwL-M">)</rp></ruby>いのと<ruby id="mwL-Q">言<rp id="mwL-U">(</rp><rt id="mwL-Y">い</rt><rp id="mwL-c">)</rp></ruby>ひましたは<ruby id="mwL-g">恁麼<rp id="mwL-k">(</rp><rt id="mwL-o">こんな</rt><rp id="mwL-s">)</rp></ruby>ことぢやあありましねえ、<ruby id="mwL-w">私<rp id="mwL-0">(</rp><rt id="mwL-4">わたし</rt><rp id="mwL-8">)</rp></ruby>も<ruby id="mwL_A">足<rp id="mwL_E">(</rp><rt id="mwL_I">た</rt><rp id="mwL_M">)</rp></ruby>すだから、お<ruby id="mwL_Q">前<rp id="mwL_U">(</rp><rt id="mwL_Y">めえ</rt><rp id="mwL_c">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwL_g">樣<rp id="mwL_k">(</rp><rt id="mwL_o">さま</rt><rp id="mwL_s">)</rp></ruby>も<ruby id="mwL_w">一<rp id="mwL_0">(</rp><rt id="mwL_4">ひと</rt><rp id="mwL_8">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwMAA">握<rp id="mwMAE">(</rp><rt id="mwMAI">にぎり</rt><rp id="mwMAM">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwMAQ">出<rp id="mwMAU">(</rp><rt id="mwMAY">だ</rt><rp id="mwMAc">)</rp></ruby>さつせえ、<ruby id="mwMAg">然<rp id="mwMAk">(</rp><rt id="mwMAo">さう</rt><rp id="mwMAs">)</rp></ruby>して、<ruby id="mwMAw">豪<rp id="mwMA0">(</rp><rt id="mwMA4">えれ</rt><rp id="mwMA8">)</rp></ruby>え<ruby id="mwMBA">先<rp id="mwMBE">(</rp><rt id="mwMBI">せん</rt><rp id="mwMBM">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwMBQ">生<rp id="mwMBU">(</rp><rt id="mwMBY">せい</rt><rp id="mwMBc">)</rp></ruby>で、<ruby id="mwMBg">澤<rp id="mwMBk">(</rp><rt id="mwMBo">たく</rt><rp id="mwMBs">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwMBw">山<rp id="mwMB0">(</rp><rt id="mwMB4">さん</rt><rp id="mwMB8">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwMCA">見<rp id="mwMCE">(</rp><rt id="mwMCI">み</rt><rp id="mwMCM">)</rp></ruby>て<ruby id="mwMCQ">貰<rp id="mwMCU">(</rp><rt id="mwMCY">もら</rt><rp id="mwMCc">)</rp></ruby>ひ<ruby id="mwMCg">人<rp id="mwMCk">(</rp><rt id="mwMCo">て</rt><rp id="mwMCs">)</rp></ruby>のあるやうに、<ruby id="mwMCw">机<rp id="mwMC0">(</rp><rt id="mwMC4">つくゑ</rt><rp id="mwMC8">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwMDA">上<rp id="mwMDE">(</rp><rt id="mwMDI">うへ</rt><rp id="mwMDM">)</rp></ruby>へ<ruby id="mwMDQ">並<rp id="mwMDU">(</rp><rt id="mwMDY">なら</rt><rp id="mwMDc">)</rp></ruby>べて<ruby id="mwMDg">置<rp id="mwMDk">(</rp><rt id="mwMDo">お</rt><rp id="mwMDs">)</rp></ruby>くといふ<ruby id="mwMDw">謀計<rp id="mwMD0">(</rp><rt id="mwMD4">たくらみ</rt><rp id="mwMD8">)</rp></ruby>ださ、もし、<ruby id="mwMEA">早<rp id="mwMEE">(</rp><rt id="mwMEI">はや</rt><rp id="mwMEM">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwMEQ">繼<rp id="mwMEU">(</rp><rt id="mwMEY">つぎ</rt><rp id="mwMEc">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwMEg">粉<rp id="mwMEk">(</rp><rt id="mwMEo">こ</rt><rp id="mwMEs">)</rp></ruby>でも、<ruby id="mwMEw">見<rp id="mwME0">(</rp><rt id="mwME4">み</rt><rp id="mwME8">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwMFA">切<rp id="mwMFE">(</rp><rt id="mwMFI">きり</rt><rp id="mwMFM">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwMFQ">賣<rp id="mwMFU">(</rp><rt id="mwMFY">もの</rt><rp id="mwMFc">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwMFg">瀨<rp id="mwMFk">(</rp><rt id="mwMFo">せ</rt><rp id="mwMFs">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwMFw">戶<rp id="mwMF0">(</rp><rt id="mwMF4">と</rt><rp id="mwMF8">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwMGA">物<rp id="mwMGE">(</rp><rt id="mwMGI">もの</rt><rp id="mwMGM">)</rp></ruby>でも、<ruby id="mwMGQ">見<rp id="mwMGU">(</rp><rt id="mwMGY">み</rt><rp id="mwMGc">)</rp></ruby>さつせえ<ruby id="mwMGg">皆<rp id="mwMGk">(</rp><rt id="mwMGo">みな</rt><rp id="mwMGs">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwMGw">積<rp id="mwMG0">(</rp><rt id="mwMG4">つ</rt><rp id="mwMG8">)</rp></ruby>んである、あれだよお<ruby id="mwMHA">前<rp id="mwMHE">(</rp><rt id="mwMHI">めえ</rt><rp id="mwMHM">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwMHQ">樣<rp id="mwMHU">(</rp><rt id="mwMHY">さま</rt><rp id="mwMHc">)</rp></ruby>。」と<ruby id="mwMHg">正<rp id="mwMHk">(</rp><rt id="mwMHo">しやう</rt><rp id="mwMHs">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwMHw">直<rp id="mwMH0">(</rp><rt id="mwMH4">ぢき</rt><rp id="mwMH8">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwMIA">辭<rp id="mwMIE">(</rp><rt id="mwMII">じ</rt><rp id="mwMIM">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwMIQ">退<rp id="mwMIU">(</rp><rt id="mwMIY">たい</rt><rp id="mwMIc">)</rp></ruby>する。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E8%A2%96%E5%B1%9B%E9%A2%A8&amp;rft.btitle=%E9%8F%A1%E8%8A%B1%E5%85%A8%E9%9B%86&amp;rft.place=Kanda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=12&amp;rft.pub=Iwanami+Shoten&amp;rft.date=1942-07-22&amp;rft.aulast=Izumi&amp;rft.aufirst=Ky%C5%8Dtar%C5%8D&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1682847%2F1%2F11&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt904" id="mwMIg"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt904" id="mwMIk"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt904" id="mwMIo"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-140" id="cite_note-140" data-mw-footnote-number="128"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwMIs"><a href="#cite_ref-140" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwMIw"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwMI0">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-140" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt907" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwMI4" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:<ruby>噓<rp>(</rp><rt>うそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぢやアありましない<ruby>埋<rp>(</rp><rt>うま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つてある<ruby>所<rp>(</rp><rt>ところ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はチヤーンと分かつて<ruby>居<rp>(</rp><rt>ゐ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>るのです、&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/937144/1/344&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=673&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:<ruby>滿<rp>(</rp><rt>まん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>地<rp>(</rp><rt>ち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>黃<rp>(</rp><rt>わう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>金<rp>(</rp><rt>ごん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:篁村叢書&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=13 September 1912&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Aeba Kōson&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Aeba&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Kōson&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Hakubunkan&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Nihonbashi]], Tokyo&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFAeba1912" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt907"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aeba_Kōson" title="Aeba Kōson" id="mwMI8">Aeba, Kōson</a> (13 September 1912).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMJA"><ruby id="mwMJE">滿<rp id="mwMJI">(</rp><rt id="mwMJM">まん</rt><rp id="mwMJQ">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwMJU">地<rp id="mwMJY">(</rp><rt id="mwMJc">ち</rt><rp id="mwMJg">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwMJk">黃<rp id="mwMJo">(</rp><rt id="mwMJs">わう</rt><rp id="mwMJw">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwMJ0">金<rp id="mwMJ4">(</rp><rt id="mwMJ8">ごん</rt><rp id="mwMKA">)</rp></ruby></bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/937144/1/344" class="external text" id="mwMKE"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwMKI">篁村叢書</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nihonbashi" title="Nihonbashi" id="mwMKM">Nihonbashi</a>, Tokyo: Hakubunkan. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMKQ">&nbsp;</span>673.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMKU"><ruby id="mwMKY">噓<rp id="mwMKc">(</rp><rt id="mwMKg">うそ</rt><rp id="mwMKk">)</rp></ruby>ぢやアありましない<ruby id="mwMKo">埋<rp id="mwMKs">(</rp><rt id="mwMKw">うま</rt><rp id="mwMK0">)</rp></ruby>つてある<ruby id="mwMK4">所<rp id="mwMK8">(</rp><rt id="mwMLA">ところ</rt><rp id="mwMLE">)</rp></ruby>はチヤーンと分かつて<ruby id="mwMLI">居<rp id="mwMLM">(</rp><rt id="mwMLQ">ゐ</rt><rp id="mwMLU">)</rp></ruby>るのです、</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%3Cruby%3E%E6%BB%BF%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%BE%E3%82%93%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E5%9C%B0%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%A1%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E9%BB%83%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%82%8F%E3%81%86%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E9%87%91%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%94%E3%82%93%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E&amp;rft.btitle=%E7%AF%81%E6%9D%91%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8&amp;rft.place=Nihonbashi%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=673&amp;rft.pub=Hakubunkan&amp;rft.date=1912-09-13&amp;rft.aulast=Aeba&amp;rft.aufirst=K%C5%8Dson&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F937144%2F1%2F344&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt907" id="mwMLY"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt907" id="mwMLc"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt907" id="mwMLg"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-141" id="cite_note-141" data-mw-footnote-number="129"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwMLk"><a href="#cite_ref-141" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwMLo"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwMLs">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-141" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt910" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwMLw" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:'''ベ'''ッ'''チイ'''　まア、それはママーに訊いてご覽なさい。兄さんの爲めなら犬に五百ルーブル出すのも高いと思はないけれど、着物の百ルーブルは高いんですとさ。わたしさう〱馬鹿な役廻りは勤めてゐられないわ！〔百姓等を指して〕　これは一體誰？<br/>'''グリゴーリイ'''　百姓らでございます。何か土地を買ふとか申しまして。<br/>'''ベ'''ッ'''チイ'''　わたし獵師かと思つた。お前がたは獵師ぢやないの？<br/>'''第一の百姓'''　決してさうぢやアありましねえ、お孃さま。わしらア土地賣買の契約さ行ふべえと思つて、旦那さまのとこさ上りましただ。<br/>'''ベ'''ッ'''チイ'''　どういふ譯だらう、兄さんのところへ獵師が來る筈になつてるのに。お前がた本當に獵師ぢやないんだね？〔百姓ら無言〕　何て馬鹿な人達だらう！〔戶口に近寄り〕　兄さん！〔聲高に笑ふ〕&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=Бетси. А вот спросите у мама. Для Вово за собак заплатить пятьсот рублей не дорого, а платье сто рублей дорого. А не могу же я играть чучелой! ''(На мужиков.)'' А это кто такие?<br/>Григорий. Мужики, землю покупают какую-то.<br/>Бетси. А я думала, охотники. Вы не охотники?<br/>1-й мужик. Никак нет-с, госпожа. Мы насчет свершения продажи акта земли, к Леониду Федоровичу.<br/>Бетси. Как же, к Вово должны были прийти охотники? Да вы наверное не охотники?<p style=text-align:center>Мужики молчат.</p>Какие глупые! ''(Подходит к двери.)'' Вово! ''(Хохочет.)''&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote='''Betsy''' Well, you’d better ask Mama about that. Though she doesn’t mind the five hundred rubles for my brother’s dog, one hundred for a dress’s too much. I can’t play my part looking like an idiot! [Pointing at Peasants] Who are these?<br/>'''Gregory''' They are some peasants who said they wanted to buy some land.<br/>'''Betsy''' I thought they were hunters. Are you not hunters?<br/>'''First Peasant''' Not at all, Miss. We came to see the Mister ’bout finalizin’ the title deeds to some land.<br/>'''Betsy''' How come? Some hunters were supposed to come to my brother’s. Are you really not hunters? [The Peasants are silent] What idiots! [Goes to the door] Vovo! [Laughs loudly]&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=210&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/2627943/1/111&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:文明の果實&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=Плоды просвещения&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-chapter=[[The Fruits of Enlightenment]]&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:トルストイ戲曲全集&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=The Complete Tolstoy Dramatic Collection&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Masao&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Yonekawa&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Leo Tolstoy&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Leo&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Tolstoy&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=28 October 1924&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Kanda, Tokyo]]&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Iwanami Shoten&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFTolstoy1924" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt910"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leo_Tolstoy" title="Leo Tolstoy" id="mwML0">Tolstoy, Leo</a> (28 October 1924). "Плоды просвещения" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwML4">文明の果實</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwML8">[</span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Fruits_of_Enlightenment" title="The Fruits of Enlightenment" id="mwMMA">The Fruits of Enlightenment</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMME">]</span>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/2627943/1/111" class="external text" id="mwMMI"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwMMM">トルストイ戲曲全集</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMMQ">[</span><i id="mwMMU">The Complete Tolstoy Dramatic Collection</i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMMY">]</span> (in Japanese). Translated by Yonekawa, Masao. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kanda,_Tokyo" title="Kanda, Tokyo" id="mwMMc">Kanda, Tokyo</a>: Iwanami Shoten. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMMg">&nbsp;</span>210. <q id="mwMMk">Бетси. А вот спросите у мама. Для Вово за собак заплатить пятьсот рублей не дорого, а платье сто рублей дорого. А не могу же я играть чучелой! <i id="mwMMo">(На мужиков.)</i> А это кто такие?<br id="mwMMs">Григорий. Мужики, землю покупают какую-то.<br id="mwMMw">Бетси. А я думала, охотники. Вы не охотники?<br id="mwMM0">1-й мужик. Никак нет-с, госпожа. Мы насчет свершения продажи акта земли, к Леониду Федоровичу.<br id="mwMM4">Бетси. Как же, к Вово должны были прийти охотники? Да вы наверное не охотники?<p style="text-align:center" id="mwMM8">Мужики молчат.</p>Какие глупые! <i id="mwMNA">(Подходит к двери.)</i> Вово! <i id="mwMNE">(Хохочет.)</i></q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMNI"><b id="mwMNM">ベ</b>ッ<b id="mwMNQ">チイ</b>　まア、それはママーに訊いてご覽なさい。兄さんの爲めなら犬に五百ルーブル出すのも高いと思はないけれど、着物の百ルーブルは高いんですとさ。わたしさう〱馬鹿な役廻りは勤めてゐられないわ！〔百姓等を指して〕　これは一體誰？<br id="mwMNU"><b id="mwMNY">グリゴーリイ</b>　百姓らでございます。何か土地を買ふとか申しまして。<br id="mwMNc"><b id="mwMNg">ベ</b>ッ<b id="mwMNk">チイ</b>　わたし獵師かと思つた。お前がたは獵師ぢやないの？<br id="mwMNo"><b id="mwMNs">第一の百姓</b>　決してさうぢやアありましねえ、お孃さま。わしらア土地賣買の契約さ行ふべえと思つて、旦那さまのとこさ上りましただ。<br id="mwMNw"><b id="mwMN0">ベ</b>ッ<b id="mwMN4">チイ</b>　どういふ譯だらう、兄さんのところへ獵師が來る筈になつてるのに。お前がた本當に獵師ぢやないんだね？〔百姓ら無言〕　何て馬鹿な人達だらう！〔戶口に近寄り〕　兄さん！〔聲高に笑ふ〕</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMN8">[</span><b id="mwMOA">Betsy</b> Well, you’d better ask Mama about that. Though she doesn’t mind the five hundred rubles for my brother’s dog, one hundred for a dress’s too much. I can’t play my part looking like an idiot! [Pointing at Peasants] Who are these?<br id="mwMOE"><b id="mwMOI">Gregory</b> They are some peasants who said they wanted to buy some land.<br id="mwMOM"><b id="mwMOQ">Betsy</b> I thought they were hunters. Are you not hunters?<br id="mwMOU"><b id="mwMOY">First Peasant</b> Not at all, Miss. We came to see the Mister ’bout finalizin’ the title deeds to some land.<br id="mwMOc"><b id="mwMOg">Betsy</b> How come? Some hunters were supposed to come to my brother’s. Are you really not hunters? [The Peasants are silent] What idiots! [Goes to the door] Vovo! [Laughs loudly]<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMOk">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%D0%9F%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B4%D1%8B+%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%89%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F+%E6%96%87%E6%98%8E%E3%81%AE%E6%9E%9C%E5%AF%A6&amp;rft.btitle=%E3%83%88%E3%83%AB%E3%82%B9%E3%83%88%E3%82%A4%E6%88%B2%E6%9B%B2%E5%85%A8%E9%9B%86&amp;rft.place=Kanda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=210&amp;rft.pub=Iwanami+Shoten&amp;rft.date=1924-10-28&amp;rft.aulast=Tolstoy&amp;rft.aufirst=Leo&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F2627943%2F1%2F111&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt910" id="mwMOo"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt910" id="mwMOs"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt910" id="mwMOw"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-142" id="cite_note-142" data-mw-footnote-number="130"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwMO0"><a href="#cite_ref-142" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwMO4"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwMO8">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-142" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt913" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwMPA" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「あれは誰だい？」と私はエルモライに訊いて見た。<br/>「あれかね？　ネドピュースキン・チーホン・イワーヌィチでさ。チェルトプハーノフんとこにゐますんで。」<br/>「どんな男だね、貧乏人かえ？」<br/>「金持ぢやありましねえ。けんど、チェルトプハーノフにだつて、鐚一文ねえんぢやありませんか。」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote=“Who’s that?” I asked Yermolai.<br/>“That? Nedopyuskin, Tihon Ivanitch. He lives at Tchertop-hanov’s.”<br/>“What is he, a poor man?”<br/>“He ain’t rich. But Tchertop-hanov ain’t got no brass penny either.”&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=— Кто это? — спросил я Ермолая.<br/>— Это? Недопюскин, Тихон Иваныч. У Чертопханова живет.<br/>— Что он, бедный человек?<br/>— Небогатый; да ведь и у Чертопханова-то гроша нет медного.&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pages=75–76&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1137159/1/40&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:チェルトプハーノフとネドピュースキン&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-chapter=Tchertop-hanov and Nedopyuskin&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=Чертопханов и Недопюскин&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:獵人日記&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=[[A Sportsman's Sketches|A Sportman’s Sketches]]&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Записки охотника&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=3&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Ivan Sergeyevich&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Turgenev&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Ivan Turgenev&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Shōzaburō&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Nakayama&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|岩波文庫}}&quot;},&quot;21&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Iwanami Shoten&quot;},&quot;22&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=20 September 1948&quot;},&quot;23&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;edition=2nd&quot;},&quot;24&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;orig-date=16 February 1940&quot;},&quot;25&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Chiyoda, Tokyo]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="mwMPE" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt913" data-x-id="CITEREFTurgenev1948"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ivan_Turgenev" title="Ivan Turgenev" id="mwMPI">Turgenev, Ivan Sergeyevich</a> (20 September 1948) [16 February 1940]. "Чертопханов и Недопюскин" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMPM">チェルトプハーノフとネドピュースキン</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMPQ">[</span>Tchertop-hanov and Nedopyuskin<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMPU">]</span>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1137159/1/40" class="external text" id="mwMPY"><i id="mwMPc">Записки охотника</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMPg">獵人日記</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMPk">[</span><i id="mwMPo"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Sportsman's_Sketches" title="A Sportsman's Sketches" id="mwMPs">A Sportman’s Sketches</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMPw">]</span>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwMP0"><span lang="ja" id="mwMP4">岩波文庫</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwMP8"> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMQA">&nbsp;</span>3. Translated by Nakayama, Shōzaburō (2nd<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMQE">&nbsp;</span>ed.). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiyoda,_Tokyo" title="Chiyoda, Tokyo" id="mwMQI">Chiyoda, Tokyo</a>: Iwanami Shoten. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMQM">&nbsp;</span><span class="nowrap" id="mwMQQ">75–</span>76. <q id="mwMQU">— Кто это? — спросил я Ермолая.<br id="mwMQY">— Это? Недопюскин, Тихон Иваныч. У Чертопханова живет.<br id="mwMQc">— Что он, бедный человек?<br id="mwMQg">— Небогатый; да ведь и у Чертопханова-то гроша нет медного.</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMQk">「あれは誰だい？」と私はエルモライに訊いて見た。<br id="mwMQo">「あれかね？　ネドピュースキン・チーホン・イワーヌィチでさ。チェルトプハーノフんとこにゐますんで。」<br id="mwMQs">「どんな男だね、貧乏人かえ？」<br id="mwMQw">「金持ぢやありましねえ。けんど、チェルトプハーノフにだつて、鐚一文ねえんぢやありませんか。」</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMQ0">[</span>“Who’s that?” I asked Yermolai.<br id="mwMQ4">“That? Nedopyuskin, Tihon Ivanitch. He lives at Tchertop-hanov’s.”<br id="mwMQ8">“What is he, a poor man?”<br id="mwMRA">“He ain’t rich. But Tchertop-hanov ain’t got no brass penny either.”<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMRE">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%D0%A7%D0%B5%D1%80%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BF%D1%85%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B2+%D0%B8+%D0%9D%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%BE%D0%BF%D1%8E%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%BD+%E3%83%81%E3%82%A7%E3%83%AB%E3%83%88%E3%83%97%E3%83%8F%E3%83%BC%E3%83%8E%E3%83%95%E3%81%A8%E3%83%8D%E3%83%89%E3%83%94%E3%83%A5%E3%83%BC%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AD%E3%83%B3&amp;rft.btitle=%D0%97%D0%B0%D0%BF%D0%B8%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8+%D0%BE%D1%85%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%B0+%E7%8D%B5%E4%BA%BA%E6%97%A5%E8%A8%98&amp;rft.place=Chiyoda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E5%B2%A9%E6%B3%A2%E6%96%87%E5%BA%AB%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=75-76&amp;rft.edition=2nd&amp;rft.pub=Iwanami+Shoten&amp;rft.date=1948-09-20&amp;rft.aulast=Turgenev&amp;rft.aufirst=Ivan+Sergeyevich&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1137159%2F1%2F40&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt913" id="mwMRI"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt913" id="mwMRM"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt913" id="mwMRQ"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-masuda-1942-143" id="cite_note-masuda-1942-143" data-mw-footnote-number="131"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwMRU"><a href="#cite_ref-masuda-1942_143-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwMRY"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwMRc">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-masuda-1942-143" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt919" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwMRg" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「へい<ruby>俺<rp>(</rp><rt>わし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かな、之れでも五年位下がつてゐますべい。でもお蔭樣で痛くも痒くもありましない」<br/>[…]<br/>「別に氣にもかけましないが、生徒さんが<ruby>痰<rp>(</rp><rt>たん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>瘤<rp>(</rp><rt>こぶ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>爺々々々つて面白がつて引張りますので時に痛くしやすよ」<br/>[…]<br/>「先生がなあ瘤ぢやありますめい。瘤は<ruby>俺<rp>(</rp><rt>わし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>共<rp>(</rp><rt>ども</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の樣な下等のやつに出來る化物で、先生なんぞに出來る等のもんぢやありましないや」[…]「まるで俺がな菎蒻でがす。之れで<ruby>內<rp>(</rp><rt>なか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に何があるもんでやんすがな。瘤は出來ても別に金持に成りさうにもありましない」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pages=139–140&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1128594/1/76&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:短篇&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:草笛&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=19 July 1942&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;editor-last=Hagiwara&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;editor-first=Ragetsu&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Masuda, Nao&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Masuda&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Kyūka&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Fukiage, Saitama]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFMasuda1942" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt919">Masuda, Kyūka (19 July 1942).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMRk">短篇</bdi>. In Hagiwara, Ragetsu (ed.). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1128594/1/76" class="external text" id="mwMRo"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwMRs">草笛</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fukiage,_Saitama" title="Fukiage, Saitama" id="mwMRw">Fukiage, Saitama</a>: Masuda, Nao. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMR0">&nbsp;</span><span class="nowrap" id="mwMR4">139–</span>140.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMR8">「へい<ruby id="mwMSA">俺<rp id="mwMSE">(</rp><rt id="mwMSI">わし</rt><rp id="mwMSM">)</rp></ruby>かな、之れでも五年位下がつてゐますべい。でもお蔭樣で痛くも痒くもありましない」<br id="mwMSQ">[…]<br id="mwMSU">「別に氣にもかけましないが、生徒さんが<ruby id="mwMSY">痰<rp id="mwMSc">(</rp><rt id="mwMSg">たん</rt><rp id="mwMSk">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwMSo">瘤<rp id="mwMSs">(</rp><rt id="mwMSw">こぶ</rt><rp id="mwMS0">)</rp></ruby>爺々々々つて面白がつて引張りますので時に痛くしやすよ」<br id="mwMS4">[…]<br id="mwMS8">「先生がなあ瘤ぢやありますめい。瘤は<ruby id="mwMTA">俺<rp id="mwMTE">(</rp><rt id="mwMTI">わし</rt><rp id="mwMTM">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwMTQ">共<rp id="mwMTU">(</rp><rt id="mwMTY">ども</rt><rp id="mwMTc">)</rp></ruby>の樣な下等のやつに出來る化物で、先生なんぞに出來る等のもんぢやありましないや」[…]「まるで俺がな菎蒻でがす。之れで<ruby id="mwMTg">內<rp id="mwMTk">(</rp><rt id="mwMTo">なか</rt><rp id="mwMTs">)</rp></ruby>に何があるもんでやんすがな。瘤は出來ても別に金持に成りさうにもありましない」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E7%9F%AD%E7%AF%87&amp;rft.btitle=%E8%8D%89%E7%AC%9B&amp;rft.place=Fukiage%2C+Saitama&amp;rft.pages=139-140&amp;rft.pub=Masuda%2C+Nao&amp;rft.date=1942-07-19&amp;rft.aulast=Masuda&amp;rft.aufirst=Ky%C5%ABka&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1128594%2F1%2F76&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt919" id="mwMTw"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt919" id="mwMT0"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt919" id="mwMT4"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-144" id="cite_note-144" data-mw-footnote-number="132"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwMT8"><a href="#cite_ref-144" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwMUA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwMUE">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-144" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt922" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwMUI" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:旦那衆の考へと言ふものは、私のやうな百姓にはわからんもんでさあ、私は自分でやることは――分つてますが、あの連中のしたがることは――知れませんわい。長い間念入りに旦那面をして、百姓の皮をひんむいて置きながら、不意に――眼が覺めたと言つて百姓に眼をこすらせようと言ふんでさ。私はお伽話といふ奴が好きぢやありましねえ、がこれと來ちや――全くお伽話でさあ。私にやどんな旦那も緣遠いものです。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=Их господские мысли мне, мужику, неведомы. Что сам я делаю — я знаю, а чего они хотят — это мне неизвестно. Тысячу лет люди аккуратно господами были, с мужика шкуру драли, а вдруг — проснулись и давай мужику глаза протирать. Я, брат, до сказок не охотник, а это — вроде сказки. От меня всякие господа далеко.&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote=The gentlemen’s thought is beyond a peasant like me. What I do myself――I know, what they want――I don’t get. For a long time, they put on their preening gentleman front, while flaying the peasant’s skin, then all of a sudden――they say they’ve woken up and they want to rub the peasant’s eyes. I don’t care for fairy tales, and that there――sounds mighty like a fairy tale. I’m a long way away from any gentleman.&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1137046/1/127&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=245&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=XXV&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:二十五&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:母&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=[[Mother (novel)|Mother]]&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Мать&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Maxim Gorky&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Maxim&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Gorky&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=1&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=15 January 1947&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Murata&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Harumi&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Dai-Ichi Shuppan&quot;},&quot;21&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Kanda, Tokyo]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFGorky1947" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt922"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maxim_Gorky" title="Maxim Gorky" id="mwMUM">Gorky, Maxim</a> (15 January 1947). "XXV" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMUQ">二十五</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1137046/1/127" class="external text" id="mwMUU"><i id="mwMUY">Мать</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMUc">母</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMUg">[</span><i id="mwMUk"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mother_(novel)" title="Mother (novel)" id="mwMUo">Mother</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMUs">]</span> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMUw">&nbsp;</span>1. Translated by Murata, Harumi. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kanda,_Tokyo" title="Kanda, Tokyo" id="mwMU0">Kanda, Tokyo</a>: Dai-Ichi Shuppan. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMU4">&nbsp;</span>245. <q id="mwMU8">Их господские мысли мне, мужику, неведомы. Что сам я делаю — я знаю, а чего они хотят — это мне неизвестно. Тысячу лет люди аккуратно господами были, с мужика шкуру драли, а вдруг — проснулись и давай мужику глаза протирать. Я, брат, до сказок не охотник, а это — вроде сказки. От меня всякие господа далеко.</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMVA">旦那衆の考へと言ふものは、私のやうな百姓にはわからんもんでさあ、私は自分でやることは――分つてますが、あの連中のしたがることは――知れませんわい。長い間念入りに旦那面をして、百姓の皮をひんむいて置きながら、不意に――眼が覺めたと言つて百姓に眼をこすらせようと言ふんでさ。私はお伽話といふ奴が好きぢやありましねえ、がこれと來ちや――全くお伽話でさあ。私にやどんな旦那も緣遠いものです。</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMVE">[</span>The gentlemen’s thought is beyond a peasant like me. What I do myself――I know, what they want――I don’t get. For a long time, they put on their preening gentleman front, while flaying the peasant’s skin, then all of a sudden――they say they’ve woken up and they want to rub the peasant’s eyes. I don’t care for fairy tales, and that there――sounds mighty like a fairy tale. I’m a long way away from any gentleman.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMVI">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=XXV+%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%94&amp;rft.btitle=%D0%9C%D0%B0%D1%82%D1%8C+%E6%AF%8D&amp;rft.place=Kanda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=245&amp;rft.pub=Dai-Ichi+Shuppan&amp;rft.date=1947-01-15&amp;rft.aulast=Gorky&amp;rft.aufirst=Maxim&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1137046%2F1%2F127&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt922" id="mwMVM"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt922" id="mwMVQ"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt922" id="mwMVU"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-145" id="cite_note-145" data-mw-footnote-number="133"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwMVY"><a href="#cite_ref-145" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwMVc"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwMVg">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-145" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt936" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwMVk" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:我勝たぬは敵のよく守る處で、負る處は勝つ處であらぬ。<br/>[…]「天は自ら助くるものを助く」<br/>の心得は千古不滅の眞理であらぬばならぬ。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pages=115, 194&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1125968/1/65&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:皇國劍道史&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Ozawa&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Aijirō&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=5 October 1944&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|田中誠光堂}}&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Kōjimachi]], Tokyo&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFOzawa1944" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt936">Ozawa, Aijirō (5 October 1944). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1125968/1/65" class="external text" id="mwMVo"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwMVs">皇國劍道史</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kōjimachi" title="Kōjimachi" id="mwMVw">Kōjimachi</a>, Tokyo: <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwMV0"><span lang="ja" id="mwMV4">田中誠光堂</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwMV8">. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMWA">&nbsp;</span>115, 194.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMWE">我勝たぬは敵のよく守る處で、負る處は勝つ處であらぬ。<br id="mwMWI">[…]「天は自ら助くるものを助く」<br id="mwMWM">の心得は千古不滅の眞理であらぬばならぬ。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=%E7%9A%87%E5%9C%8B%E5%8A%8D%E9%81%93%E5%8F%B2&amp;rft.place=K%C5%8Djimachi%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=115%2C+194&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E7%94%B0%E4%B8%AD%E8%AA%A0%E5%85%89%E5%A0%82%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.date=1944-10-05&amp;rft.aulast=Ozawa&amp;rft.aufirst=Aijir%C5%8D&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1125968%2F1%2F65&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt936" id="mwMWQ"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt936" id="mwMWU"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt936" id="mwMWY"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-146" id="cite_note-146" data-mw-footnote-number="134"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwMWc"><a href="#cite_ref-146" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwMWg"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwMWk">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-146" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt939" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwMWo" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:由來山は遊覽の地ではあらぬ。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=107&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1060546/1/58&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:朝鮮の佛蹟を訪ねて&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=25 November 1946&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:山河大地&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Iwami&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Mamoru&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Nagata Bunshōdō&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=Kyoto&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFIwami1946" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt939">Iwami, Mamoru (25 November 1946).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMWs">朝鮮の佛蹟を訪ねて</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1060546/1/58" class="external text" id="mwMWw"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwMW0">山河大地</bdi></a> (in Japanese). Kyoto: Nagata Bunshōdō. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMW4">&nbsp;</span>107.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMW8">由來山は遊覽の地ではあらぬ。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E6%9C%9D%E9%AE%AE%E3%81%AE%E4%BD%9B%E8%B9%9F%E3%82%92%E8%A8%AA%E3%81%AD%E3%81%A6&amp;rft.btitle=%E5%B1%B1%E6%B2%B3%E5%A4%A7%E5%9C%B0&amp;rft.place=Kyoto&amp;rft.pages=107&amp;rft.pub=Nagata+Bunsh%C5%8Dd%C5%8D&amp;rft.date=1946-11-25&amp;rft.aulast=Iwami&amp;rft.aufirst=Mamoru&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1060546%2F1%2F58&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt939" id="mwMXA"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt939" id="mwMXE"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt939" id="mwMXI"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-147" id="cite_note-147" data-mw-footnote-number="135"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwMXM"><a href="#cite_ref-147" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwMXQ"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwMXU">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-147" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt942" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwMXY" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:第六章は第五章へと展開されることになった「からだ，こころ，他者」についてのノートであり，サルトル等に依拠しつつ，「からだ」の四つの位相が紹介されるとともに，モノの即自存在が「誠実」という有り様を示すのに対し，自然的（没反省的）態度を生きる人間は「私があるところのものであらぬ」存在，つまりは「自己欺瞞」のなかで生きざるをえないことが明らかにされ，この自己欺瞞を免れるには「自然的態変のエポケー」を「対自化」する「異化」（意味の脱日常化）が必要であることが説かれる。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:学位論文要旨および審査要旨&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:立命館産業社会論集&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=188&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/8732017/1/1&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=40&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=2&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=September 2004&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Yang&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Insil&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFYang2004" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt942">Yang, Insil (September 2004). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/8732017/1/1" class="external text" id="mwMXc"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwMXg">学位論文要旨および審査要旨</bdi></a>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMXk">立命館産業社会論集</bdi> (in Japanese). <b id="mwMXo">40</b> (2): 188.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMXs">第六章は第五章へと展開されることになった「からだ，こころ，他者」についてのノートであり，サルトル等に依拠しつつ，「からだ」の四つの位相が紹介されるとともに，モノの即自存在が「誠実」という有り様を示すのに対し，自然的（没反省的）態度を生きる人間は「私があるところのものであらぬ」存在，つまりは「自己欺瞞」のなかで生きざるをえないことが明らかにされ，この自己欺瞞を免れるには「自然的態変のエポケー」を「対自化」する「異化」（意味の脱日常化）が必要であることが説かれる。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E5%AD%A6%E4%BD%8D%E8%AB%96%E6%96%87%E8%A6%81%E6%97%A8%E3%81%8A%E3%82%88%E3%81%B3%E5%AF%A9%E6%9F%BB%E8%A6%81%E6%97%A8&amp;rft.volume=40&amp;rft.issue=2&amp;rft.pages=188&amp;rft.date=2004-09&amp;rft.aulast=Yang&amp;rft.aufirst=Insil&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F8732017%2F1%2F1&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt942" id="mwMXw"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt942" id="mwMX0"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt942" id="mwMX4"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-148" id="cite_note-148" data-mw-footnote-number="136"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwMX8"><a href="#cite_ref-148" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwMYA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwMYE">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-148" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt945" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwMYI" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:ある高校生は偏差値ではあらぬ。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=50&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://hokkyodai.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/6439/files/66-2-zinbun-04.pdf&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Gotō&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Yoshiya&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:天と地のあいだで，死すべきものたちの一人として ——善悪の彼岸からの帰還——&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Between Heaven and Earth, as One of the Mortals: Return from the State beyond Good and Evil&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:北海道教育大学紀要（人文科学・社会科学編）&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal=Journal of Hokkaido University of Education (Humanities and Social Sciences)&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=66&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=2&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=February 2016&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Department of Ethics, Hakodate Campus, Hokkaido University of Education&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFGotō2016" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt945">Gotō, Yoshiya (February 2016). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://hokkyodai.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/6439/files/66-2-zinbun-04.pdf" class="external text" id="mwMYM">"Between Heaven and Earth, as One of the Mortals: Return from the State beyond Good and Evil" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMYQ">天と地のあいだで，死すべきものたちの一人として ——善悪の彼岸からの帰還——</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwMYU">(PDF)</span>. <i id="mwMYY">Journal of Hokkaido University of Education (Humanities and Social Sciences)</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMYc">北海道教育大学紀要（人文科学・社会科学編）</bdi> (in Japanese). <b id="mwMYg">66</b> (2). Department of Ethics, Hakodate Campus, Hokkaido University of Education: 50.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMYk">ある高校生は偏差値ではあらぬ。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Journal+of+Hokkaido+University+of+Education+%28Humanities+and+Social+Sciences%29&amp;rft.atitle=Between+Heaven+and+Earth%2C+as+One+of+the+Mortals%3A+Return+from+the+State+beyond+Good+and+Evil+%E5%A4%A9%E3%81%A8%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%AE%E3%81%82%E3%81%84%E3%81%A0%E3%81%A7%EF%BC%8C%E6%AD%BB%E3%81%99%E3%81%B9%E3%81%8D%E3%82%82%E3%81%AE%E3%81%9F%E3%81%A1%E3%81%AE%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%BA%E3%81%A8%E3%81%97%E3%81%A6+%E2%80%94%E2%80%94%E5%96%84%E6%82%AA%E3%81%AE%E5%BD%BC%E5%B2%B8%E3%81%8B%E3%82%89%E3%81%AE%E5%B8%B0%E9%82%84%E2%80%94%E2%80%94&amp;rft.volume=66&amp;rft.issue=2&amp;rft.pages=50&amp;rft.date=2016-02&amp;rft.aulast=Got%C5%8D&amp;rft.aufirst=Yoshiya&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fhokkyodai.repo.nii.ac.jp%2Frecord%2F6439%2Ffiles%2F66-2-zinbun-04.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt945" id="mwMYo"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt945" id="mwMYs"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt945" id="mwMYw"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-149" id="cite_note-149" data-mw-footnote-number="137"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwMY0"><a href="#cite_ref-149" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwMY4"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwMY8">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-149" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt948" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwMZA" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「ま、まさか。……た、<ruby>戯<rp>(</rp><rt>たわむ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れを」<br/>「<ruby>戯<rp>(</rp><rt>たわぶ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れ<ruby>言<rp>(</rp><rt>ごと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ではあらぬ。<ruby>川<rp>(</rp><rt>かわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>場<rp>(</rp><rt>ば</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>擾<rp>(</rp><rt>じよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>乱<rp>(</rp><rt>らん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が起こる前、先代の嫡男である旧主を<ruby>葬<rp>(</rp><rt>ほうむ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ったのは誰であったろうか。金子殿、そなたではないのか？」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:第二道 瓦解&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:我、<ruby>六道<rp>(</rp><rt>りくどう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>懼<rp>(</rp><rt>おそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れず 【立国篇】真田昌幸 連戦記&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Kaitō&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Ryūichirō&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=11 March 2016&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;isbn=978-4-569-82754-4&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=PHP Institute&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Kōtō]], Tokyo&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFKaitō2016" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt948">Kaitō, Ryūichirō (11 March 2016).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMZE">第二道 瓦解</bdi>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMZI">我、<ruby id="mwMZM">六道<rp id="mwMZQ">(</rp><rt id="mwMZU">りくどう</rt><rp id="mwMZY">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwMZc">懼<rp id="mwMZg">(</rp><rt id="mwMZk">おそ</rt><rp id="mwMZo">)</rp></ruby>れず 【立国篇】真田昌幸 連戦記</bdi> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kōtō" title="Kōtō" id="mwMZs">Kōtō</a>, Tokyo: PHP Institute. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)" title="ISBN (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwMZw">ISBN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMZ0">&nbsp;</span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-4-569-82754-4" title="Special:BookSources/978-4-569-82754-4" id="mwMZ4"><bdi id="mwMZ8">978-4-569-82754-4</bdi></a>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMaA">「ま、まさか。……た、<ruby id="mwMaE">戯<rp id="mwMaI">(</rp><rt id="mwMaM">たわむ</rt><rp id="mwMaQ">)</rp></ruby>れを」<br id="mwMaU">「<ruby id="mwMaY">戯<rp id="mwMac">(</rp><rt id="mwMag">たわぶ</rt><rp id="mwMak">)</rp></ruby>れ<ruby id="mwMao">言<rp id="mwMas">(</rp><rt id="mwMaw">ごと</rt><rp id="mwMa0">)</rp></ruby>ではあらぬ。<ruby id="mwMa4">川<rp id="mwMa8">(</rp><rt id="mwMbA">かわ</rt><rp id="mwMbE">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwMbI">場<rp id="mwMbM">(</rp><rt id="mwMbQ">ば</rt><rp id="mwMbU">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwMbY">擾<rp id="mwMbc">(</rp><rt id="mwMbg">じよう</rt><rp id="mwMbk">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwMbo">乱<rp id="mwMbs">(</rp><rt id="mwMbw">らん</rt><rp id="mwMb0">)</rp></ruby>が起こる前、先代の嫡男である旧主を<ruby id="mwMb4">葬<rp id="mwMb8">(</rp><rt id="mwMcA">ほうむ</rt><rp id="mwMcE">)</rp></ruby>ったのは誰であったろうか。金子殿、そなたではないのか？」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E9%81%93+%E7%93%A6%E8%A7%A3&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%88%91%E3%80%81%3Cruby%3E%E5%85%AD%E9%81%93%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%82%8A%E3%81%8F%E3%81%A9%E3%81%86%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%E3%82%92%3Cruby%3E%E6%87%BC%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%8A%E3%81%9D%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%E3%82%8C%E3%81%9A+%E3%80%90%E7%AB%8B%E5%9B%BD%E7%AF%87%E3%80%91%E7%9C%9F%E7%94%B0%E6%98%8C%E5%B9%B8+%E9%80%A3%E6%88%A6%E8%A8%98&amp;rft.place=K%C5%8Dt%C5%8D%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pub=PHP+Institute&amp;rft.date=2016-03-11&amp;rft.isbn=978-4-569-82754-4&amp;rft.aulast=Kait%C5%8D&amp;rft.aufirst=Ry%C5%ABichir%C5%8D&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt948" id="mwMcI"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt948" id="mwMcM"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt948" id="mwMcQ"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-150" id="cite_note-150" data-mw-footnote-number="138"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwMcU"><a href="#cite_ref-150" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwMcY"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwMcc">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-150" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt951" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwMcg" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;AV media&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:長らく知り合う人も私を分からぬように<br/>聡明な人も いつも満点じゃあらぬように<br/>誰も彼も何もを分かりはしない<br/>己すらも何もを分かりはしない&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:何も分かりはしなかった。&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0GBthI0J2E0&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;author={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|慧ノふい}}&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;website=YouTube&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=5 November 2023&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREF慧ノふいCategory:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text2023" class="citation audio-visual cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt951"><span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwMck"><span lang="ja" id="mwMco">慧ノふい</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwMcs"> (5 November 2023). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0GBthI0J2E0" class="external text" id="mwMcw"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwMc0">何も分かりはしなかった。</bdi></a>. <i id="mwMc4">YouTube</i> (in Japanese).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMc8">長らく知り合う人も私を分からぬように<br id="mwMdA">聡明な人も いつも満点じゃあらぬように<br id="mwMdE">誰も彼も何もを分かりはしない<br id="mwMdI">己すらも何もを分かりはしない</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=%E4%BD%95%E3%82%82%E5%88%86%E3%81%8B%E3%82%8A%E3%81%AF%E3%81%97%E3%81%AA%E3%81%8B%E3%81%A3%E3%81%9F%E3%80%82&amp;rft.date=2023-11-05&amp;rft.au=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E6%85%A7%E3%83%8E%E3%81%B5%E3%81%84%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fwatch%3Fv%3D0GBthI0J2E0&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt951" id="mwMdM"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt951" id="mwMdQ"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt951" id="mwMdU"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-151" id="cite_note-151" data-mw-footnote-number="139"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwMdY"><a href="#cite_ref-151" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwMdc"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwMdg">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-151" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt954" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwMdk" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;web&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:……いかんな、このままじゃあらぬ誤解が広まってしまいそうだ。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:第84話 お昼休みの訪問者たち&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://kakuyomu.jp/works/16816452221029879202/episodes/16817330648742811309&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-website=ja:カクヨム&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;author=Hamubane&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFHamubane" class="citation web cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt954">Hamubane. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://kakuyomu.jp/works/16816452221029879202/episodes/16817330648742811309" class="external text" id="mwMdo"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwMds">第84話 お昼休みの訪問者たち</bdi></a>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMdw">カクヨム</bdi> (in Japanese).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMd0">……いかんな、このままじゃあらぬ誤解が広まってしまいそうだ。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=%E7%AC%AC84%E8%A9%B1+%E3%81%8A%E6%98%BC%E4%BC%91%E3%81%BF%E3%81%AE%E8%A8%AA%E5%95%8F%E8%80%85%E3%81%9F%E3%81%A1&amp;rft.au=Hamubane&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fkakuyomu.jp%2Fworks%2F16816452221029879202%2Fepisodes%2F16817330648742811309&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt954" id="mwMd4"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt954" id="mwMd8"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt954" id="mwMeA"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-152" id="cite_note-152" data-mw-footnote-number="140"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwMeE"><a href="#cite_ref-152" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwMeI"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwMeM">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-152" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt959" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwMeQ" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:父上もまた、あの者どものおこないが死罪に値することをよくご存知ではありませぬか。[…]ご自身の敵が、そしてこの私の敵が、おそば近くにうごめいているにもかかわらず、何ら手を打とうとはなされぬでありませんか。いかにもヴァスピウールは不正を企みはいたしましたけれどもそこまで愚かではありませんでした。[…]しかしもしもお考えを改められませぬなら、わたくしは神様に、願わくは父上が、お聞きいただきましたあの物語の中で語られた男の身に降りかかった運命よりもましな、あの男よりもめでたい運命をめぐまれるようなことのありませぬように、とお祈りいたしますぞ。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pages=234–235&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://agu.repo.nii.ac.jp/?action=repository_action_common_download&amp;item_id=633&amp;item_no=1&amp;attribute_id=22&amp;file_no=2&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Hasegawa&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Hiroshi&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:ローマ七賢人物語続編『カッシドールス物語』所収1「nutrix」試訳 ——付・七賢人と王子が語る他の物語の梗概——&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:愛知学院大学語研紀要&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=34&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=1&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=2009&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFHasegawa2009" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt959">Hasegawa, Hiroshi (2009). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://agu.repo.nii.ac.jp/?action=repository_action_common_download&amp;item_id=633&amp;item_no=1&amp;attribute_id=22&amp;file_no=2" class="external text" id="mwMeU"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwMeY">ローマ七賢人物語続編『カッシドールス物語』所収1「nutrix」試訳 ——付・七賢人と王子が語る他の物語の梗概——</bdi></a>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMec">愛知学院大学語研紀要</bdi> (in Japanese). <b id="mwMeg">34</b> (1): <span class="nowrap" id="mwMek">234–</span>235.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMeo">父上もまた、あの者どものおこないが死罪に値することをよくご存知ではありませぬか。[…]ご自身の敵が、そしてこの私の敵が、おそば近くにうごめいているにもかかわらず、何ら手を打とうとはなされぬでありませんか。いかにもヴァスピウールは不正を企みはいたしましたけれどもそこまで愚かではありませんでした。[…]しかしもしもお考えを改められませぬなら、わたくしは神様に、願わくは父上が、お聞きいただきましたあの物語の中で語られた男の身に降りかかった運命よりもましな、あの男よりもめでたい運命をめぐまれるようなことのありませぬように、とお祈りいたしますぞ。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E3%83%AD%E3%83%BC%E3%83%9E%E4%B8%83%E8%B3%A2%E4%BA%BA%E7%89%A9%E8%AA%9E%E7%B6%9A%E7%B7%A8%E3%80%8E%E3%82%AB%E3%83%83%E3%82%B7%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%82%B9%E7%89%A9%E8%AA%9E%E3%80%8F%E6%89%80%E5%8F%8E1%E3%80%8Cnutrix%E3%80%8D%E8%A9%A6%E8%A8%B3+%E2%80%94%E2%80%94%E4%BB%98%E3%83%BB%E4%B8%83%E8%B3%A2%E4%BA%BA%E3%81%A8%E7%8E%8B%E5%AD%90%E3%81%8C%E8%AA%9E%E3%82%8B%E4%BB%96%E3%81%AE%E7%89%A9%E8%AA%9E%E3%81%AE%E6%A2%97%E6%A6%82%E2%80%94%E2%80%94&amp;rft.volume=34&amp;rft.issue=1&amp;rft.pages=234-235&amp;rft.date=2009&amp;rft.aulast=Hasegawa&amp;rft.aufirst=Hiroshi&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fagu.repo.nii.ac.jp%2F%3Faction%3Drepository_action_common_download%26item_id%3D633%26item_no%3D1%26attribute_id%3D22%26file_no%3D2&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt959" id="mwMes"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt959" id="mwMew"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt959" id="mwMe0"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-153" id="cite_note-153" data-mw-footnote-number="141"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwMe4"><a href="#cite_ref-153" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwMe8"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwMfA">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-153" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt962" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwMfE" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「申し訳ありませぬ」[…]「気休めを言っているのではありませぬか」[…]「余り良くありませぬ。[…]」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:淡海乃海 水面が揺れる時 三英傑に嫌われた不運な男、朽木基綱の逆襲&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=TO Books&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=10&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;author=Israfil&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=10 February 2021&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFIsrafil2021" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt962">Israfil (10 February 2021).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMfI">淡海乃海 水面が揺れる時 三英傑に嫌われた不運な男、朽木基綱の逆襲</bdi> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMfM">&nbsp;</span>10. TO Books.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMfQ">「申し訳ありませぬ」[…]「気休めを言っているのではありませぬか」[…]「余り良くありませぬ。[…]」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%B7%A1%E6%B5%B7%E4%B9%83%E6%B5%B7+%E6%B0%B4%E9%9D%A2%E3%81%8C%E6%8F%BA%E3%82%8C%E3%82%8B%E6%99%82+%E4%B8%89%E8%8B%B1%E5%82%91%E3%81%AB%E5%AB%8C%E3%82%8F%E3%82%8C%E3%81%9F%E4%B8%8D%E9%81%8B%E3%81%AA%E7%94%B7%E3%80%81%E6%9C%BD%E6%9C%A8%E5%9F%BA%E7%B6%B1%E3%81%AE%E9%80%86%E8%A5%B2&amp;rft.pub=TO+Books&amp;rft.date=2021-02-10&amp;rft.au=Israfil&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt962" id="mwMfU"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt962" id="mwMfY"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt962" id="mwMfc"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-154" id="cite_note-154" data-mw-footnote-number="142"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwMfg"><a href="#cite_ref-154" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwMfk"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwMfo">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-154" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt965" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwMfs" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:『いや、伯爵、私は商人じゃありませぬ。たとえ不要のボロ一つだって売るわけには参りません。そりゃ、あなたに敬意を表するため、女房を差上げるくらいの覚悟はありますが、<ruby>眉目よし<rp>(</rp><rt>ミロヴィートカ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だけは<ruby>平<rp>(</rp><rt>ひら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に御容赦……いっそこの身が<ruby>虜<rp>(</rp><rt>とりこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>になった方がましなくらいです』&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=— «Нет, граф, говорит, я не купец: тряпицы ненужной не продам, а из чести хоть жену готов уступить, только не Миловидку… Скорее себя самого в полон отдам».&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote=“No, Count, I’m no tradesman. I don’t sell useless rags. Out of respect to you I’m even willing to offer my wife, but please spare Milovidka…… I’d sooner give myself into bondage”&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=1&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:猟人日記&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Записки охотника&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=[[A Sportsman's Sketches|A Sportsman’s Sketches]]&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:郷士オフシャニコフ&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=Однодворец Овсяников&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-chapter=The Yeoman Ovsyanikov&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Ivan Sergeyevich&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Turgenev&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Ivan Turgenev&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Sasaki&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Akira&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Gutenberg21&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Setagaya]], Tokyo&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=19 December 2012&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFTurgenev2012" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt965"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ivan_Turgenev" title="Ivan Turgenev" id="mwMfw">Turgenev, Ivan Sergeyevich</a> (19 December 2012). "Однодворец Овсяников" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMf0">郷士オフシャニコフ</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMf4">[</span>The Yeoman Ovsyanikov<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMf8">]</span>. <i id="mwMgA">Записки охотника</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMgE">猟人日記</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMgI">[</span><i id="mwMgM"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Sportsman's_Sketches" title="A Sportsman's Sketches" id="mwMgQ">A Sportsman’s Sketches</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMgU">]</span> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMgY">&nbsp;</span>1. Translated by Sasaki, Akira. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Setagaya" title="Setagaya" id="mwMgc">Setagaya</a>, Tokyo: Gutenberg21. <q id="mwMgg">— «Нет, граф, говорит, я не купец: тряпицы ненужной не продам, а из чести хоть жену готов уступить, только не Миловидку… Скорее себя самого в полон отдам».</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMgk">『いや、伯爵、私は商人じゃありませぬ。たとえ不要のボロ一つだって売るわけには参りません。そりゃ、あなたに敬意を表するため、女房を差上げるくらいの覚悟はありますが、<ruby id="mwMgo">眉目よし<rp id="mwMgs">(</rp><rt id="mwMgw">ミロヴィートカ</rt><rp id="mwMg0">)</rp></ruby>だけは<ruby id="mwMg4">平<rp id="mwMg8">(</rp><rt id="mwMhA">ひら</rt><rp id="mwMhE">)</rp></ruby>に御容赦……いっそこの身が<ruby id="mwMhI">虜<rp id="mwMhM">(</rp><rt id="mwMhQ">とりこ</rt><rp id="mwMhU">)</rp></ruby>になった方がましなくらいです』</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMhY">[</span>“No, Count, I’m no tradesman. I don’t sell useless rags. Out of respect to you I’m even willing to offer my wife, but please spare Milovidka…… I’d sooner give myself into bondage”<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMhc">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%D0%9E%D0%B4%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%B2%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B5%D1%86+%D0%9E%D0%B2%D1%81%D1%8F%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B2+%E9%83%B7%E5%A3%AB%E3%82%AA%E3%83%95%E3%82%B7%E3%83%A3%E3%83%8B%E3%82%B3%E3%83%95&amp;rft.btitle=%D0%97%D0%B0%D0%BF%D0%B8%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8+%D0%BE%D1%85%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%B0+%E7%8C%9F%E4%BA%BA%E6%97%A5%E8%A8%98&amp;rft.place=Setagaya%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pub=Gutenberg21&amp;rft.date=2012-12-19&amp;rft.aulast=Turgenev&amp;rft.aufirst=Ivan+Sergeyevich&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt965" id="mwMhg"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt965" id="mwMhk"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt965" id="mwMho"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-155" id="cite_note-155" data-mw-footnote-number="143"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwMhs"><a href="#cite_ref-155" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwMhw"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwMh0">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-155" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt971" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwMh4" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:また同時に「私のこころ」と呼ばれる「知覚する何か」自体が，「知覚され」ない限り，「私のこころ」すなわち「自我」は「観念」ではあらず，諸観念の全体的集合であるとされる森羅万象の内に含まれることは論理的にできない。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=16&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://ndu-rep.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/533/files/29-2.pdf&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Sakai&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Sayaka&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:哲学と自然神学の間—バークリにおける「存在」の問題&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Between Philosophy and Natural Theology—The problem of \&quot;Being\&quot; in Berkeley&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:日本歯科大学紀要&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=29&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=March 2000&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Nippon Dental University&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Chiyoda, Tokyo]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFSakai2000" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt971">Sakai, Sayaka (March 2000). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://ndu-rep.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/533/files/29-2.pdf" class="external text" id="mwMh8">"Between Philosophy and Natural Theology—The problem of "Being" in Berkeley" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMiA">哲学と自然神学の間—バークリにおける「存在」の問題</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwMiE">(PDF)</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMiI">日本歯科大学紀要</bdi> (in Japanese) (29). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiyoda,_Tokyo" title="Chiyoda, Tokyo" id="mwMiM">Chiyoda, Tokyo</a>: Nippon Dental University: 16.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMiQ">また同時に「私のこころ」と呼ばれる「知覚する何か」自体が，「知覚され」ない限り，「私のこころ」すなわち「自我」は「観念」ではあらず，諸観念の全体的集合であるとされる森羅万象の内に含まれることは論理的にできない。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=Between+Philosophy+and+Natural+Theology%E2%80%94The+problem+of+%22Being%22+in+Berkeley+%E5%93%B2%E5%AD%A6%E3%81%A8%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6%E7%A5%9E%E5%AD%A6%E3%81%AE%E9%96%93%E2%80%94%E3%83%90%E3%83%BC%E3%82%AF%E3%83%AA%E3%81%AB%E3%81%8A%E3%81%91%E3%82%8B%E3%80%8C%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E3%80%8D%E3%81%AE%E5%95%8F%E9%A1%8C&amp;rft.issue=29&amp;rft.pages=16&amp;rft.date=2000-03&amp;rft.aulast=Sakai&amp;rft.aufirst=Sayaka&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fndu-rep.repo.nii.ac.jp%2Frecord%2F533%2Ffiles%2F29-2.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt971" id="mwMiU"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt971" id="mwMiY"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt971" id="mwMic"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-156" id="cite_note-156" data-mw-footnote-number="144"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwMig"><a href="#cite_ref-156" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwMik"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwMio">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-156" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt974" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwMis" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:何ものもそれ自体それだけではあらず、全てのものも全ての様態も、相互の交わりのうちに、動から生じる。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=245&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://ycu.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/2001949/files/%E4%BA%BA%E6%96%8756-3%EF%BC%88%E6%A3%9F%E5%B0%BE%EF%BC%89.pdf&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Muneo&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Masatoshi&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:正義と美の相対性は『テアイテトス』において論駁されているか&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:横浜市立大学論叢 人文科学系列&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=56&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=3&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=2004&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFMuneo2004" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt974">Muneo, Masatoshi (2004). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://ycu.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/2001949/files/%E4%BA%BA%E6%96%8756-3%EF%BC%88%E6%A3%9F%E5%B0%BE%EF%BC%89.pdf" class="external text" id="mwMiw"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwMi0">正義と美の相対性は『テアイテトス』において論駁されているか</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwMi4">(PDF)</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMi8">横浜市立大学論叢 人文科学系列</bdi> (in Japanese). <b id="mwMjA">56</b> (3): 245.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMjE">何ものもそれ自体それだけではあらず、全てのものも全ての様態も、相互の交わりのうちに、動から生じる。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E6%AD%A3%E7%BE%A9%E3%81%A8%E7%BE%8E%E3%81%AE%E7%9B%B8%E5%AF%BE%E6%80%A7%E3%81%AF%E3%80%8E%E3%83%86%E3%82%A2%E3%82%A4%E3%83%86%E3%83%88%E3%82%B9%E3%80%8F%E3%81%AB%E3%81%8A%E3%81%84%E3%81%A6%E8%AB%96%E9%A7%81%E3%81%95%E3%82%8C%E3%81%A6%E3%81%84%E3%82%8B%E3%81%8B&amp;rft.volume=56&amp;rft.issue=3&amp;rft.pages=245&amp;rft.date=2004&amp;rft.aulast=Muneo&amp;rft.aufirst=Masatoshi&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fycu.repo.nii.ac.jp%2Frecord%2F2001949%2Ffiles%2F%25E4%25BA%25BA%25E6%2596%258756-3%25EF%25BC%2588%25E6%25A3%259F%25E5%25B0%25BE%25EF%25BC%2589.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt974" id="mwMjI"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt974" id="mwMjM"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt974" id="mwMjQ"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-157" id="cite_note-157" data-mw-footnote-number="145"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwMjU"><a href="#cite_ref-157" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwMjY"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwMjc">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-157" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt977" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwMjg" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:カオスでなければ人であらずというようなありさまで。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=481&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://repository.kulib.kyoto-u.ac.jp/bitstream/2433/110138/1/KJ00004706440.pdf&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:蔵本由紀教授 最終講義録 「非線形科学の形成 — その一断面」 2004年3月12日 京都大学理学部6号館にて&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:物性研究&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=83&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=4&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=January 2005&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Yoshiki Kuramoto&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Yoshiki&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Kuramoto&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFKuramoto2005" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt977"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yoshiki_Kuramoto" title="Yoshiki Kuramoto" id="mwMjk">Kuramoto, Yoshiki</a> (January 2005). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://repository.kulib.kyoto-u.ac.jp/bitstream/2433/110138/1/KJ00004706440.pdf" class="external text" id="mwMjo"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwMjs">蔵本由紀教授 最終講義録 「非線形科学の形成 — その一断面」 2004年3月12日 京都大学理学部6号館にて</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwMjw">(PDF)</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMj0">物性研究</bdi> (in Japanese). <b id="mwMj4">83</b> (4): 481.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMj8">カオスでなければ人であらずというようなありさまで。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E8%94%B5%E6%9C%AC%E7%94%B1%E7%B4%80%E6%95%99%E6%8E%88+%E6%9C%80%E7%B5%82%E8%AC%9B%E7%BE%A9%E9%8C%B2+%E3%80%8C%E9%9D%9E%E7%B7%9A%E5%BD%A2%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%A6%E3%81%AE%E5%BD%A2%E6%88%90+%E2%80%94+%E3%81%9D%E3%81%AE%E4%B8%80%E6%96%AD%E9%9D%A2%E3%80%8D+2004%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%8812%E6%97%A5+%E4%BA%AC%E9%83%BD%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E7%90%86%E5%AD%A6%E9%83%A86%E5%8F%B7%E9%A4%A8%E3%81%AB%E3%81%A6&amp;rft.volume=83&amp;rft.issue=4&amp;rft.pages=481&amp;rft.date=2005-01&amp;rft.aulast=Kuramoto&amp;rft.aufirst=Yoshiki&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Frepository.kulib.kyoto-u.ac.jp%2Fbitstream%2F2433%2F110138%2F1%2FKJ00004706440.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt977" id="mwMkA"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt977" id="mwMkE"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt977" id="mwMkI"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-158" id="cite_note-158" data-mw-footnote-number="146"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwMkM"><a href="#cite_ref-158" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwMkQ"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwMkU">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-158" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt980" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwMkY" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:しかし、真正の詩人は、自らの詩法の更新に意識的であらずにはいられない。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=60&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:「空無」の形象化 ——那珂太郎論——&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://tamagawa.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/387/files/7_2014_56-74.pdf&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Makoto&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Takayanagi&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:玉川大学リベラルアーツ学部研究紀要&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=8&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=March 2015&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFTakayanagi2015" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt980">Takayanagi, Makoto (March 2015). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://tamagawa.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/387/files/7_2014_56-74.pdf" class="external text" id="mwMkc"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwMkg">「空無」の形象化 ——那珂太郎論——</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwMkk">(PDF)</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMko">玉川大学リベラルアーツ学部研究紀要</bdi> (in Japanese) (8): 60.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMks">しかし、真正の詩人は、自らの詩法の更新に意識的であらずにはいられない。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E3%80%8C%E7%A9%BA%E7%84%A1%E3%80%8D%E3%81%AE%E5%BD%A2%E8%B1%A1%E5%8C%96+%E2%80%94%E2%80%94%E9%82%A3%E7%8F%82%E5%A4%AA%E9%83%8E%E8%AB%96%E2%80%94%E2%80%94&amp;rft.issue=8&amp;rft.pages=60&amp;rft.date=2015-03&amp;rft.aulast=Takayanagi&amp;rft.aufirst=Makoto&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Ftamagawa.repo.nii.ac.jp%2Frecord%2F387%2Ffiles%2F7_2014_56-74.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt980" id="mwMkw"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt980" id="mwMk0"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt980" id="mwMk4"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-159" id="cite_note-159" data-mw-footnote-number="147"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwMk8"><a href="#cite_ref-159" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwMlA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwMlE">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-159" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt983" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwMlI" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:（4）については、高見・久野（2014）は、テアル文の適格性は、単に動詞の意味のみに依存するわけではあらず、文脈による判断することが必要であると提示し、A型テアル文の成立に必要とする意味的機能的制約として、（5）のように述べている。[…]従って、裵氏が提唱した「Cタイプ」は、ラレテアル文の特有なものではあらず、テアル文に対応するものであることが明らかになる。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=227&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://k-rain.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/2000078/files/higashiajia_09_015.pdf&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Han&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Jipeng&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:「動詞の受動形+テアル」構文についての一考察&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=A Study of the \&quot;Intransitive Verb + -raretearu\&quot; Construction in Japanese&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:東アジア文化研究&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=9&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=2023&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFHan2023" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt983">Han, Jipeng (2023). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://k-rain.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/2000078/files/higashiajia_09_015.pdf" class="external text" id="mwMlM">"A Study of the "Intransitive Verb + -raretearu" Construction in Japanese" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMlQ">「動詞の受動形+テアル」構文についての一考察</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwMlU">(PDF)</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMlY">東アジア文化研究</bdi> (in Japanese) (9): 227.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMlc">（4）については、高見・久野（2014）は、テアル文の適格性は、単に動詞の意味のみに依存するわけではあらず、文脈による判断することが必要であると提示し、A型テアル文の成立に必要とする意味的機能的制約として、（5）のように述べている。[…]従って、裵氏が提唱した「Cタイプ」は、ラレテアル文の特有なものではあらず、テアル文に対応するものであることが明らかになる。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=A+Study+of+the+%22Intransitive+Verb+%2B+-raretearu%22+Construction+in+Japanese+%E3%80%8C%E5%8B%95%E8%A9%9E%E3%81%AE%E5%8F%97%E5%8B%95%E5%BD%A2%2B%E3%83%86%E3%82%A2%E3%83%AB%E3%80%8D%E6%A7%8B%E6%96%87%E3%81%AB%E3%81%A4%E3%81%84%E3%81%A6%E3%81%AE%E4%B8%80%E8%80%83%E5%AF%9F&amp;rft.issue=9&amp;rft.pages=227&amp;rft.date=2023&amp;rft.aulast=Han&amp;rft.aufirst=Jipeng&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fk-rain.repo.nii.ac.jp%2Frecord%2F2000078%2Ffiles%2Fhigashiajia_09_015.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt983" id="mwMlg"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt983" id="mwMlk"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt983" id="mwMlo"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-avril-160" id="cite_note-avril-160" data-mw-footnote-number="148"><span rel="mw:referencedBy" class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwMls"><a href="#cite_ref-avril_160-0" id="mwMlw"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwMl0">1</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-avril_160-1" id="mwMl4"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwMl8">2</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-avril-160" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt986" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwMmA" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「好きじゃない、じゃない。嫌いだよ。あいつ等は、『魔法使いであらずんば、人間じゃあらず』そんなクソみたいな標語をモットーにしてる屑どもだ。私みたいな魔法不全者はもちろん、単属性魔法使いや変わり種魔法を使える奴らも、劣等劣性魔法使いって差別してる。分かる、シンシア?&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://ncode.syosetu.com/n8201kd/56/&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:混沌&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=28 April 2025&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:追放魔術師と欠陥魔法使い、伝統主義社会を破壊する。後ついでに世界を救う。&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;author=Avril&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|小説家になろう}}&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFAvril2025" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt986">Avril (28 April 2025).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMmE">混沌</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://ncode.syosetu.com/n8201kd/56/" class="external text" id="mwMmI"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwMmM">追放魔術師と欠陥魔法使い、伝統主義社会を破壊する。後ついでに世界を救う。</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwMmQ"><span lang="ja" id="mwMmU">小説家になろう</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwMmY">.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMmc">「好きじゃない、じゃない。嫌いだよ。あいつ等は、『魔法使いであらずんば、人間じゃあらず』そんなクソみたいな標語をモットーにしてる屑どもだ。私みたいな魔法不全者はもちろん、単属性魔法使いや変わり種魔法を使える奴らも、劣等劣性魔法使いって差別してる。分かる、シンシア?</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E6%B7%B7%E6%B2%8C&amp;rft.btitle=%E8%BF%BD%E6%94%BE%E9%AD%94%E8%A1%93%E5%B8%AB%E3%81%A8%E6%AC%A0%E9%99%A5%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E4%BD%BF%E3%81%84%E3%80%81%E4%BC%9D%E7%B5%B1%E4%B8%BB%E7%BE%A9%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E3%82%92%E7%A0%B4%E5%A3%8A%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B%E3%80%82%E5%BE%8C%E3%81%A4%E3%81%84%E3%81%A7%E3%81%AB%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E3%82%92%E6%95%91%E3%81%86%E3%80%82&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E5%B0%8F%E8%AA%AC%E5%AE%B6%E3%81%AB%E3%81%AA%E3%82%8D%E3%81%86%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.date=2025-04-28&amp;rft.au=Avril&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fncode.syosetu.com%2Fn8201kd%2F56%2F&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt986" id="mwMmg"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt986" id="mwMmk"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt986" id="mwMmo"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-161" id="cite_note-161" data-mw-footnote-number="149"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwMms"><a href="#cite_ref-161" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwMmw"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwMm0">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-161" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt992" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwMm4" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;citation&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Citation&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;language&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;ja&quot;},&quot;script-quote&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;ja:それから東洋学と申しましても、本学のことでありますので、しぜん仏教のことになりますが、私は仏教信者ではあっても仏教学者ではありませず、したがってその点また何かとおきき苦しいことも多かろうと存じます。その辺のところもあらかじめおことわり致しておきまして、これから暫くご静聴下さるようお願い申します。&quot;},&quot;page&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;73&quot;},&quot;url&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;https://otani.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/2373/files/%E5%A4%A7%E8%B0%B7%E5%AD%B8%E5%A0%B1%20%E7%AC%AC53%E5%B7%BB%E7%AC%AC3%E5%8F%B7-8%E7%A5%9E%E7%94%B0.pdf&quot;},&quot;script-title&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;ja:東洋学における大谷大学の貢献&quot;},&quot;first&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Kiichirō&quot;},&quot;last&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Kanda&quot;},&quot;year&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;1973&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFKanda1973" class="citation cs2 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt992">Kanda, Kiichirō (1973), <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://otani.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/2373/files/%E5%A4%A7%E8%B0%B7%E5%AD%B8%E5%A0%B1%20%E7%AC%AC53%E5%B7%BB%E7%AC%AC3%E5%8F%B7-8%E7%A5%9E%E7%94%B0.pdf" class="external text" id="mwMm8"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwMnA">東洋学における大谷大学の貢献</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwMnE">(PDF)</span> (in Japanese), p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMnI">&nbsp;</span>73,  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMnM">それから東洋学と申しましても、本学のことでありますので、しぜん仏教のことになりますが、私は仏教信者ではあっても仏教学者ではありませず、したがってその点また何かとおきき苦しいことも多かろうと存じます。その辺のところもあらかじめおことわり致しておきまして、これから暫くご静聴下さるようお願い申します。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%9D%B1%E6%B4%8B%E5%AD%A6%E3%81%AB%E3%81%8A%E3%81%91%E3%82%8B%E5%A4%A7%E8%B0%B7%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E3%81%AE%E8%B2%A2%E7%8C%AE&amp;rft.pages=73&amp;rft.date=1973&amp;rft.aulast=Kanda&amp;rft.aufirst=Kiichir%C5%8D&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fotani.repo.nii.ac.jp%2Frecord%2F2373%2Ffiles%2F%25E5%25A4%25A7%25E8%25B0%25B7%25E5%25AD%25B8%25E5%25A0%25B1%2520%25E7%25AC%25AC53%25E5%25B7%25BB%25E7%25AC%25AC3%25E5%258F%25B7-8%25E7%25A5%259E%25E7%2594%25B0.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt992" id="mwMnQ"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt992" id="mwMnU"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt992" id="mwMnY"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-162" id="cite_note-162" data-mw-footnote-number="150"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwMnc"><a href="#cite_ref-162" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwMng"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwMnk">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-162" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt995" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwMno" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>通<rp>(</rp><rt>ゞほり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のない<ruby>土<rp>(</rp><rt>ど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>手<rp>(</rp><rt>て</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だつて、<ruby>軍鷄<rp>(</rp><rt>しやも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ばかり<ruby>置<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いて<ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きや、<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>ど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>處<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>へ<ruby>去<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つちまふも<ruby>知<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れたもんぢアありませずね。<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りや<ruby>溜<rp>(</rp><rt>ため</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>池<rp>(</rp><rt>いけ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>中<rp>(</rp><rt>なか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>舟<rp>(</rp><rt>ふね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>もあつたし、<ruby>材<rp>(</rp><rt>ざい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>木<rp>(</rp><rt>もく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>もありましたが、<ruby>水死人<rp>(</rp><rt>どざゑもん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>搜<rp>(</rp><rt>さが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>すやうに<ruby>鷄<rp>(</rp><rt>とり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>浮<rp>(</rp><rt>うか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しとく<ruby>數<rp>(</rp><rt>すう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぢやありませず、<ruby>持<rp>(</rp><rt>もち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>扱<rp>(</rp><rt>あつか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ひましたね、<ruby>全<rp>(</rp><rt>まった</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>く<ruby>氣<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>氣<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぢやあ<ruby>無<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かつたんで、一<ruby>羽<rp>(</rp><rt>は</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>抱<rp>(</rp><rt>かゝ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>へ<ruby>込<rp>(</rp><rt>のこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んで<ruby>跣<rp>(</rp><rt>はだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>足<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>池<rp>(</rp><rt>いけ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>緣<rp>(</rp><rt>ふち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をまご〱してる<ruby>風<rp>(</rp><rt>ふう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ツてのはありません、<ruby>我<rp>(</rp><rt>われ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ながら<ruby>薄<rp>(</rp><rt>うす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぼんやり、<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>ど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うしてるのかと<ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ひました。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:三枚續&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;orig-date=August 1900&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Kyōka Izumi&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Kyōtarō&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Izumi&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1883474/1/76&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=10 November 1941&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Iwanami Shoten&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Kanda, Tokyo]]&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:鏡花全集&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=6&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=143&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="mwMns" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt995" data-x-id="CITEREFIzumi1941"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kyōka_Izumi" title="Kyōka Izumi" id="mwMnw">Izumi, Kyōtarō</a> (10 November 1941) [August 1900].  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMn0">三枚續</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1883474/1/76" class="external text" id="mwMn4"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwMn8">鏡花全集</bdi></a> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMoA">&nbsp;</span>6. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kanda,_Tokyo" title="Kanda, Tokyo" id="mwMoE">Kanda, Tokyo</a>: Iwanami Shoten. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMoI">&nbsp;</span>143.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMoM"><ruby id="mwMoQ">人<rp id="mwMoU">(</rp><rt id="mwMoY">ひと</rt><rp id="mwMoc">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwMog">通<rp id="mwMok">(</rp><rt id="mwMoo">ゞほり</rt><rp id="mwMos">)</rp></ruby>のない<ruby id="mwMow">土<rp id="mwMo0">(</rp><rt id="mwMo4">ど</rt><rp id="mwMo8">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwMpA">手<rp id="mwMpE">(</rp><rt id="mwMpI">て</rt><rp id="mwMpM">)</rp></ruby>だつて、<ruby id="mwMpQ">軍鷄<rp id="mwMpU">(</rp><rt id="mwMpY">しやも</rt><rp id="mwMpc">)</rp></ruby>ばかり<ruby id="mwMpg">置<rp id="mwMpk">(</rp><rt id="mwMpo">お</rt><rp id="mwMps">)</rp></ruby>いて<ruby id="mwMpw">行<rp id="mwMp0">(</rp><rt id="mwMp4">い</rt><rp id="mwMp8">)</rp></ruby>きや、<ruby id="mwMqA">何<rp id="mwMqE">(</rp><rt id="mwMqI">ど</rt><rp id="mwMqM">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwMqQ">處<rp id="mwMqU">(</rp><rt id="mwMqY">こ</rt><rp id="mwMqc">)</rp></ruby>へ<ruby id="mwMqg">去<rp id="mwMqk">(</rp><rt id="mwMqo">い</rt><rp id="mwMqs">)</rp></ruby>つちまふも<ruby id="mwMqw">知<rp id="mwMq0">(</rp><rt id="mwMq4">し</rt><rp id="mwMq8">)</rp></ruby>れたもんぢアありませずね。<ruby id="mwMrA">見<rp id="mwMrE">(</rp><rt id="mwMrI">み</rt><rp id="mwMrM">)</rp></ruby>りや<ruby id="mwMrQ">溜<rp id="mwMrU">(</rp><rt id="mwMrY">ため</rt><rp id="mwMrc">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwMrg">池<rp id="mwMrk">(</rp><rt id="mwMro">いけ</rt><rp id="mwMrs">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwMrw">中<rp id="mwMr0">(</rp><rt id="mwMr4">なか</rt><rp id="mwMr8">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwMsA">舟<rp id="mwMsE">(</rp><rt id="mwMsI">ふね</rt><rp id="mwMsM">)</rp></ruby>もあつたし、<ruby id="mwMsQ">材<rp id="mwMsU">(</rp><rt id="mwMsY">ざい</rt><rp id="mwMsc">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwMsg">木<rp id="mwMsk">(</rp><rt id="mwMso">もく</rt><rp id="mwMss">)</rp></ruby>もありましたが、<ruby id="mwMsw">水死人<rp id="mwMs0">(</rp><rt id="mwMs4">どざゑもん</rt><rp id="mwMs8">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwMtA">搜<rp id="mwMtE">(</rp><rt id="mwMtI">さが</rt><rp id="mwMtM">)</rp></ruby>すやうに<ruby id="mwMtQ">鷄<rp id="mwMtU">(</rp><rt id="mwMtY">とり</rt><rp id="mwMtc">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwMtg">浮<rp id="mwMtk">(</rp><rt id="mwMto">うか</rt><rp id="mwMts">)</rp></ruby>しとく<ruby id="mwMtw">數<rp id="mwMt0">(</rp><rt id="mwMt4">すう</rt><rp id="mwMt8">)</rp></ruby>ぢやありませず、<ruby id="mwMuA">持<rp id="mwMuE">(</rp><rt id="mwMuI">もち</rt><rp id="mwMuM">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwMuQ">扱<rp id="mwMuU">(</rp><rt id="mwMuY">あつか</rt><rp id="mwMuc">)</rp></ruby>ひましたね、<ruby id="mwMug">全<rp id="mwMuk">(</rp><rt id="mwMuo">まった</rt><rp id="mwMus">)</rp></ruby>く<ruby id="mwMuw">氣<rp id="mwMu0">(</rp><rt id="mwMu4">き</rt><rp id="mwMu8">)</rp></ruby>が<ruby id="mwMvA">氣<rp id="mwMvE">(</rp><rt id="mwMvI">き</rt><rp id="mwMvM">)</rp></ruby>ぢやあ<ruby id="mwMvQ">無<rp id="mwMvU">(</rp><rt id="mwMvY">な</rt><rp id="mwMvc">)</rp></ruby>かつたんで、一<ruby id="mwMvg">羽<rp id="mwMvk">(</rp><rt id="mwMvo">は</rt><rp id="mwMvs">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwMvw">抱<rp id="mwMv0">(</rp><rt id="mwMv4">かゝ</rt><rp id="mwMv8">)</rp></ruby>へ<ruby id="mwMwA">込<rp id="mwMwE">(</rp><rt id="mwMwI">のこ</rt><rp id="mwMwM">)</rp></ruby>んで<ruby id="mwMwQ">跣<rp id="mwMwU">(</rp><rt id="mwMwY">はだ</rt><rp id="mwMwc">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwMwg">足<rp id="mwMwk">(</rp><rt id="mwMwo">し</rt><rp id="mwMws">)</rp></ruby>で<ruby id="mwMww">池<rp id="mwMw0">(</rp><rt id="mwMw4">いけ</rt><rp id="mwMw8">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwMxA">緣<rp id="mwMxE">(</rp><rt id="mwMxI">ふち</rt><rp id="mwMxM">)</rp></ruby>をまご〱してる<ruby id="mwMxQ">風<rp id="mwMxU">(</rp><rt id="mwMxY">ふう</rt><rp id="mwMxc">)</rp></ruby>ツてのはありません、<ruby id="mwMxg">我<rp id="mwMxk">(</rp><rt id="mwMxo">われ</rt><rp id="mwMxs">)</rp></ruby>ながら<ruby id="mwMxw">薄<rp id="mwMx0">(</rp><rt id="mwMx4">うす</rt><rp id="mwMx8">)</rp></ruby>ぼんやり、<ruby id="mwMyA">何<rp id="mwMyE">(</rp><rt id="mwMyI">ど</rt><rp id="mwMyM">)</rp></ruby>うしてるのかと<ruby id="mwMyQ">思<rp id="mwMyU">(</rp><rt id="mwMyY">おも</rt><rp id="mwMyc">)</rp></ruby>ひました。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E4%B8%89%E6%9E%9A%E7%BA%8C&amp;rft.btitle=%E9%8F%A1%E8%8A%B1%E5%85%A8%E9%9B%86&amp;rft.place=Kanda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=143&amp;rft.pub=Iwanami+Shoten&amp;rft.date=1941-11-10&amp;rft.aulast=Izumi&amp;rft.aufirst=Ky%C5%8Dtar%C5%8D&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1883474%2F1%2F76&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt995" id="mwMyg"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt995" id="mwMyk"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt995" id="mwMyo"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-okubo-takeuchi-1977-jatta-yuute-163" id="cite_note-okubo-takeuchi-1977-jatta-yuute-163" data-mw-footnote-number="151"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwMys"><a href="#cite_ref-okubo-takeuchi-1977-jatta-yuute_163-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwMyw"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwMy0">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-okubo-takeuchi-1977-jatta-yuute-163" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1004" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwMy4" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=375&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「勇敢な男じゃったよ、スカーレット。メラニーにもそういうてくれ。ウィルクス家の娘たちにも、そう書いて送るようにいうてほしい。じっさい、あんな年寄りだったが、軍人としては、りっぱなものじゃった。砲弾にあたったのじゃ。真上から落ちてきた砲弾のために馬も大けがをした――傷ついた馬は、わしが、この手で<ruby>射<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ち殺したが、かわいそうなやつじゃった。いい<ruby>牝<rp>(</rp><rt>め</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>馬<rp>(</rp><rt>うま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だった。おまえから、タールトン夫人に、そのことを書いてやってもらいたい。夫人は、あの牝馬を、とてもかわいがっていたからな。さあ、弁当を包んでくれ。わしは行かにゃならん。そう悲しむことはない。老人が若いものの仕事をやりながら死ぬなんて、こんなすばらしい死に方はないじゃないか」&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=“He was a brave man, Scarlett. Tell Melly that. Tell her to write it to his girls. And a good soldier for all his years. A shell got him. Came right down on him and his horse. Tore the horse’s— I shot the horse myself, poor creature. A fine little mare she was. You’d better write Mrs. Tarleton about that, too. She set a store on that mare. Wrap up my lunch, child. I must be going. There, dear, don’t take it so hard. What better way can an old man die than doing a young man’s work?”&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:風と共に去りぬ&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=[[Gone with the Wind (novel)|Gone with the Wind]]&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=Ⅰ&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Shueisha&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|世界文学全集}}&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;editor={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|綜合社}}&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Chiyoda, Tokyo]]&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=25 February 1978&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;orig-date=3 June 1977&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Ōkubo&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Yasuo&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first2=Michinosuke&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last2=Takeuchi&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Margaret Mitchell&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Margaret Munnerlyn&quot;},&quot;21&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Mitchell&quot;},&quot;22&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=Chapter XIX&quot;},&quot;23&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:19&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFMitchell1978" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1004"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Margaret_Mitchell" title="Margaret Mitchell" id="mwMy8">Mitchell, Margaret Munnerlyn</a> (25 February 1978) [3 June 1977]. "Chapter XIX" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMzA">19</bdi>. In <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwMzE"><span lang="ja" id="mwMzI">綜合社</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwMzM"> (ed.). <i id="mwMzQ"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gone_with_the_Wind_(novel)" title="Gone with the Wind (novel)" id="mwMzU">Gone with the Wind</a></i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwMzY">風と共に去りぬ</bdi>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwMzc"><span lang="ja" id="mwMzg">世界文学全集</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwMzk"> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMzo">&nbsp;</span>Ⅰ. Translated by Ōkubo, Yasuo; Takeuchi, Michinosuke. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiyoda,_Tokyo" title="Chiyoda, Tokyo" id="mwMzs">Chiyoda, Tokyo</a>: Shueisha. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwMzw">&nbsp;</span>375. <q id="mwMz0"><span class="cs1-kern-left" id="mwMz4"></span>"He was a brave man, Scarlett. Tell Melly that. Tell her to write it to his girls. And a good soldier for all his years. A shell got him. Came right down on him and his horse. Tore the horse's— I shot the horse myself, poor creature. A fine little mare she was. You'd better write Mrs. Tarleton about that, too. She set a store on that mare. Wrap up my lunch, child. I must be going. There, dear, don't take it so hard. What better way can an old man die than doing a young man's work?"<span class="cs1-kern-right" id="mwMz8"></span></q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwM0A">「勇敢な男じゃったよ、スカーレット。メラニーにもそういうてくれ。ウィルクス家の娘たちにも、そう書いて送るようにいうてほしい。じっさい、あんな年寄りだったが、軍人としては、りっぱなものじゃった。砲弾にあたったのじゃ。真上から落ちてきた砲弾のために馬も大けがをした――傷ついた馬は、わしが、この手で<ruby id="mwM0E">射<rp id="mwM0I">(</rp><rt id="mwM0M">う</rt><rp id="mwM0Q">)</rp></ruby>ち殺したが、かわいそうなやつじゃった。いい<ruby id="mwM0U">牝<rp id="mwM0Y">(</rp><rt id="mwM0c">め</rt><rp id="mwM0g">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwM0k">馬<rp id="mwM0o">(</rp><rt id="mwM0s">うま</rt><rp id="mwM0w">)</rp></ruby>だった。おまえから、タールトン夫人に、そのことを書いてやってもらいたい。夫人は、あの牝馬を、とてもかわいがっていたからな。さあ、弁当を包んでくれ。わしは行かにゃならん。そう悲しむことはない。老人が若いものの仕事をやりながら死ぬなんて、こんなすばらしい死に方はないじゃないか」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=Chapter+XIX+19&amp;rft.btitle=Gone+with+the+Wind+%E9%A2%A8%E3%81%A8%E5%85%B1%E3%81%AB%E5%8E%BB%E3%82%8A%E3%81%AC&amp;rft.place=Chiyoda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E6%96%87%E5%AD%A6%E5%85%A8%E9%9B%86%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=375&amp;rft.pub=Shueisha&amp;rft.date=1978-02-25&amp;rft.aulast=Mitchell&amp;rft.aufirst=Margaret+Munnerlyn&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1004" id="mwM00"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1004" id="mwM04"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1004" id="mwM08"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-seta-tanaka-1992-b2-p1-164" id="cite_note-seta-tanaka-1992-b2-p1-164" data-mw-footnote-number="152"><span rel="mw:referencedBy" class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwM1A"><a href="#cite_ref-seta-tanaka-1992-b2-p1_164-0" id="mwM1E"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwM1I">1</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-seta-tanaka-1992-b2-p1_164-1" id="mwM1M"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwM1Q">2</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-seta-tanaka-1992-b2-p1-164" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1007" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwM1U" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「そうじゃろ。あんたは気が遠くなりかけておった。」と、ガンダルフは答えました。「あやうくあの傷に滅されるところじゃったのよ。もう数時間おそければ、わしらの救助も及ばなかったはずじゃ。ところが、わがホビット君よ、たしかにあんたの中には力がひそんでおる！塚山で示したようにな。<ruby>間<rp>(</rp><rt>かん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>一<rp>(</rp><rt>いつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>髪<rp>(</rp><rt>ぱつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じゃった。きっともっとも危ない瞬間じゃったろうなあ。風見が丘で踏み止まることができればよかったがのう。」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pages=10–11&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=‘Yes, it would. You were beginning to fade,’ answered Gandalf. ‘The wound was overcoming you at last. A few more hours and you would have been beyond our aid. But you have some strength in you, my dear hobbit! As you showed in the Barrow. That was touch and go: perhaps the most dangerous moment of all. I wish you could have held out at Weathertop.’&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:一 数々の出会い&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=I Many Meetings&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:旅の仲間　下１&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=[[The Fellowship of the Ring|The Travelling Fellowship]]: Book 2, Part 1&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=3&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|指輪物語}}&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Seta&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Teiji&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first2=Akiko&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last2=Tanaka&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=J. R. R. Tolkien&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=John Ronald Reuel&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Tolkien&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Hyōronsha&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=30 April 2002&quot;},&quot;21&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;edition=9th&quot;},&quot;22&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;orig-date=30 July 1992&quot;},&quot;23&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Shinjuku]], Tokyo&quot;},&quot;24&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;isbn=4-566-02364-8&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="mwM1Y" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1007" data-x-id="CITEREFTolkien2002"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/J._R._R._Tolkien" title="J. R. R. Tolkien" id="mwM1c">Tolkien, John Ronald Reuel</a> (30 April 2002) [30 July 1992]. "I Many Meetings" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwM1g">一 数々の出会い</bdi>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwM1k">旅の仲間　下１</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwM1o">[</span><i id="mwM1s"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Fellowship_of_the_Ring" title="The Fellowship of the Ring" id="mwM1w">The Travelling Fellowship</a>: Book 2, Part 1</i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwM10">]</span>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwM14"><span lang="ja" id="mwM18">指輪物語</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwM2A"> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwM2E">&nbsp;</span>3. Translated by Seta, Teiji; Tanaka, Akiko (9th<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwM2I">&nbsp;</span>ed.). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shinjuku" title="Shinjuku" id="mwM2M">Shinjuku</a>, Tokyo: Hyōronsha. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwM2Q">&nbsp;</span><span class="nowrap" id="mwM2U">10–</span>11. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)" title="ISBN (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwM2Y">ISBN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwM2c">&nbsp;</span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/4-566-02364-8" title="Special:BookSources/4-566-02364-8" id="mwM2g"><bdi id="mwM2k">4-566-02364-8</bdi></a>. <q id="mwM2o"><span class="cs1-kern-left" id="mwM2s"></span>'Yes, it would. You were beginning to fade,' answered Gandalf. 'The wound was overcoming you at last. A few more hours and you would have been beyond our aid. But you have some strength in you, my dear hobbit! As you showed in the Barrow. That was touch and go: perhaps the most dangerous moment of all. I wish you could have held out at Weathertop.'<span class="cs1-kern-right" id="mwM2w"></span></q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwM20">「そうじゃろ。あんたは気が遠くなりかけておった。」と、ガンダルフは答えました。「あやうくあの傷に滅されるところじゃったのよ。もう数時間おそければ、わしらの救助も及ばなかったはずじゃ。ところが、わがホビット君よ、たしかにあんたの中には力がひそんでおる！塚山で示したようにな。<ruby id="mwM24">間<rp id="mwM28">(</rp><rt id="mwM3A">かん</rt><rp id="mwM3E">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwM3I">一<rp id="mwM3M">(</rp><rt id="mwM3Q">いつ</rt><rp id="mwM3U">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwM3Y">髪<rp id="mwM3c">(</rp><rt id="mwM3g">ぱつ</rt><rp id="mwM3k">)</rp></ruby>じゃった。きっともっとも危ない瞬間じゃったろうなあ。風見が丘で踏み止まることができればよかったがのう。」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=I+Many+Meetings+%E4%B8%80+%E6%95%B0%E3%80%85%E3%81%AE%E5%87%BA%E4%BC%9A%E3%81%84&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%97%85%E3%81%AE%E4%BB%B2%E9%96%93%E3%80%80%E4%B8%8B%EF%BC%91&amp;rft.place=Shinjuku%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E6%8C%87%E8%BC%AA%E7%89%A9%E8%AA%9E%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=10-11&amp;rft.edition=9th&amp;rft.pub=Hy%C5%8Dronsha&amp;rft.date=2002-04-30&amp;rft.isbn=4-566-02364-8&amp;rft.aulast=Tolkien&amp;rft.aufirst=John+Ronald+Reuel&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1007" id="mwM3o"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1007" id="mwM3s"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1007" id="mwM3w"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-165" id="cite_note-165" data-mw-footnote-number="153"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwM30"><a href="#cite_ref-165" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwM34"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwM38">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-165" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1018" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwM4A" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「凄いな、この大会。去年もこんな感じだったのですか?」<br/>「いやいや、ここまでではなかったであります!　恐らく、ベータちゃんのせん----はっ!」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://ncode.syosetu.com/n7957jj/50/&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:第50話 今年の大会はめちゃくちゃ大規模らしい配信&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=15 November 2024&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:スローライフ配信をしてたら、相方のゴーレムがアップをはじめたようです&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;author=Akki&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|小説家になろう}}&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFAkki2024" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1018">Akki (15 November 2024).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwM4E">第50話 今年の大会はめちゃくちゃ大規模らしい配信</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://ncode.syosetu.com/n7957jj/50/" class="external text" id="mwM4I"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwM4M">スローライフ配信をしてたら、相方のゴーレムがアップをはじめたようです</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwM4Q"><span lang="ja" id="mwM4U">小説家になろう</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwM4Y">.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwM4c">「凄いな、この大会。去年もこんな感じだったのですか?」<br id="mwM4g">「いやいや、ここまでではなかったであります!　恐らく、ベータちゃんのせん----はっ!」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E7%AC%AC50%E8%A9%B1+%E4%BB%8A%E5%B9%B4%E3%81%AE%E5%A4%A7%E4%BC%9A%E3%81%AF%E3%82%81%E3%81%A1%E3%82%83%E3%81%8F%E3%81%A1%E3%82%83%E5%A4%A7%E8%A6%8F%E6%A8%A1%E3%82%89%E3%81%97%E3%81%84%E9%85%8D%E4%BF%A1&amp;rft.btitle=%E3%82%B9%E3%83%AD%E3%83%BC%E3%83%A9%E3%82%A4%E3%83%95%E9%85%8D%E4%BF%A1%E3%82%92%E3%81%97%E3%81%A6%E3%81%9F%E3%82%89%E3%80%81%E7%9B%B8%E6%96%B9%E3%81%AE%E3%82%B4%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%A0%E3%81%8C%E3%82%A2%E3%83%83%E3%83%97%E3%82%92%E3%81%AF%E3%81%98%E3%82%81%E3%81%9F%E3%82%88%E3%81%86%E3%81%A7%E3%81%99&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E5%B0%8F%E8%AA%AC%E5%AE%B6%E3%81%AB%E3%81%AA%E3%82%8D%E3%81%86%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.date=2024-11-15&amp;rft.au=Akki&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fncode.syosetu.com%2Fn7957jj%2F50%2F&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1018" id="mwM4k"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1018" id="mwM4o"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1018" id="mwM4s"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-166" id="cite_note-166" data-mw-footnote-number="154"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwM4w"><a href="#cite_ref-166" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwM40"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwM44">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-166" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1021" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwM48" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「砦は使わないでありますが……あ、そういうことでありますか！我々は特に拠点は必要ないと事前にお伝えしていたでありますが、もしかしてお聞きでなかったでありますか？」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://ncode.syosetu.com/n1914hp/820/&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:第182話 エインヘリアの援軍&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:覇王になってから異世界に来てしまった！　～エディットしたゲームキャラ達と異世界を蹂躙する我覇王～&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=9 May 2025&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;author=Hitohira&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|小説家になろう}}&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFHitohira2025" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1021">Hitohira (9 May 2025).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwM5A">第182話 エインヘリアの援軍</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://ncode.syosetu.com/n1914hp/820/" class="external text" id="mwM5E"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwM5I">覇王になってから異世界に来てしまった！　～エディットしたゲームキャラ達と異世界を蹂躙する我覇王～</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwM5M"><span lang="ja" id="mwM5Q">小説家になろう</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwM5U">.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwM5Y">「砦は使わないでありますが……あ、そういうことでありますか！我々は特に拠点は必要ないと事前にお伝えしていたでありますが、もしかしてお聞きでなかったでありますか？」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E7%AC%AC182%E8%A9%B1+%E3%82%A8%E3%82%A4%E3%83%B3%E3%83%98%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2%E3%81%AE%E6%8F%B4%E8%BB%8D&amp;rft.btitle=%E8%A6%87%E7%8E%8B%E3%81%AB%E3%81%AA%E3%81%A3%E3%81%A6%E3%81%8B%E3%82%89%E7%95%B0%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E3%81%AB%E6%9D%A5%E3%81%A6%E3%81%97%E3%81%BE%E3%81%A3%E3%81%9F%EF%BC%81%E3%80%80%EF%BD%9E%E3%82%A8%E3%83%87%E3%82%A3%E3%83%83%E3%83%88%E3%81%97%E3%81%9F%E3%82%B2%E3%83%BC%E3%83%A0%E3%82%AD%E3%83%A3%E3%83%A9%E9%81%94%E3%81%A8%E7%95%B0%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E3%82%92%E8%B9%82%E8%BA%99%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B%E6%88%91%E8%A6%87%E7%8E%8B%EF%BD%9E&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E5%B0%8F%E8%AA%AC%E5%AE%B6%E3%81%AB%E3%81%AA%E3%82%8D%E3%81%86%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.date=2025-05-09&amp;rft.au=Hitohira&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fncode.syosetu.com%2Fn1914hp%2F820%2F&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1021" id="mwM5c"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1021" id="mwM5g"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1021" id="mwM5k"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-167" id="cite_note-167" data-mw-footnote-number="155"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwM5o"><a href="#cite_ref-167" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwM5s"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwM5w">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-167" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1024" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwM50" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;web&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「そういえば、これは、ワタシが自分で落としたのでありました。サムライに、とられたわけじゃなかったであります……」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://yomeruba.com/hiroba/reading/kirby-setsunanomikiri/entry-13919.html&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:【スペシャルれんさい】『星のカービィ 刹那の見斬りで悪を断て！』第４回　なぞなぞ仮面あらわる&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=17 February 2023&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-work=ja:ヨメルバひろば&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=KADOKAWA Group&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite class="citation web cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1024" id="mwM54"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://yomeruba.com/hiroba/reading/kirby-setsunanomikiri/entry-13919.html" class="external text" id="mwM58"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwM6A">【スペシャルれんさい】『星のカービィ 刹那の見斬りで悪を断て！』第４回　なぞなぞ仮面あらわる</bdi></a>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwM6E">ヨメルバひろば</bdi> (in Japanese). KADOKAWA Group. 17 February 2023.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwM6I">「そういえば、これは、ワタシが自分で落としたのでありました。サムライに、とられたわけじゃなかったであります……」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=%E3%80%90%E3%82%B9%E3%83%9A%E3%82%B7%E3%83%A3%E3%83%AB%E3%82%8C%E3%82%93%E3%81%95%E3%81%84%E3%80%91%E3%80%8E%E6%98%9F%E3%81%AE%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%93%E3%82%A3+%E5%88%B9%E9%82%A3%E3%81%AE%E8%A6%8B%E6%96%AC%E3%82%8A%E3%81%A7%E6%82%AA%E3%82%92%E6%96%AD%E3%81%A6%EF%BC%81%E3%80%8F%E7%AC%AC%EF%BC%94%E5%9B%9E%E3%80%80%E3%81%AA%E3%81%9E%E3%81%AA%E3%81%9E%E4%BB%AE%E9%9D%A2%E3%81%82%E3%82%89%E3%82%8F%E3%82%8B&amp;rft.pub=KADOKAWA+Group&amp;rft.date=2023-02-17&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fyomeruba.com%2Fhiroba%2Freading%2Fkirby-setsunanomikiri%2Fentry-13919.html&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1024" id="mwM6M"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1024" id="mwM6Q"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1024" id="mwM6U"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-168" id="cite_note-168" data-mw-footnote-number="156"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwM6Y"><a href="#cite_ref-168" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwM6c"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwM6g">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-168" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1031" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwM6k" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:そんな日々、有名な家相家のアドバイスで、鬼門、裏鬼門などの条件をすべてクリアし幸せが約束されたはずの施主が、完成した家に入居するや大君こかかったり亡くなってしまったりするようなことが、一度や二度ではなくありました。占い師の言う通りに家相を取り入れても、幸せは約束されないどころか、不幸ごとが<ruby>嘲<rp>(</rp><rt>あざ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>笑<rp>(</rp><rt>わら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うように起きる。そんなケースをたくさん見ることになりました。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:日本人なら知っておきたい正しい家相の本　本当は間取りを変えずに鬼門は避けられる&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Koike&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Yasutoshi&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=29 October 2015&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=PRESIDENT Inc.&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFKoike2015" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1031">Koike, Yasutoshi (29 October 2015).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwM6o">日本人なら知っておきたい正しい家相の本　本当は間取りを変えずに鬼門は避けられる</bdi> (in Japanese). PRESIDENT Inc.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwM6s">そんな日々、有名な家相家のアドバイスで、鬼門、裏鬼門などの条件をすべてクリアし幸せが約束されたはずの施主が、完成した家に入居するや大君こかかったり亡くなってしまったりするようなことが、一度や二度ではなくありました。占い師の言う通りに家相を取り入れても、幸せは約束されないどころか、不幸ごとが<ruby id="mwM6w">嘲<rp id="mwM60">(</rp><rt id="mwM64">あざ</rt><rp id="mwM68">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwM7A">笑<rp id="mwM7E">(</rp><rt id="mwM7I">わら</rt><rp id="mwM7M">)</rp></ruby>うように起きる。そんなケースをたくさん見ることになりました。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E4%BA%BA%E3%81%AA%E3%82%89%E7%9F%A5%E3%81%A3%E3%81%A6%E3%81%8A%E3%81%8D%E3%81%9F%E3%81%84%E6%AD%A3%E3%81%97%E3%81%84%E5%AE%B6%E7%9B%B8%E3%81%AE%E6%9C%AC%E3%80%80%E6%9C%AC%E5%BD%93%E3%81%AF%E9%96%93%E5%8F%96%E3%82%8A%E3%82%92%E5%A4%89%E3%81%88%E3%81%9A%E3%81%AB%E9%AC%BC%E9%96%80%E3%81%AF%E9%81%BF%E3%81%91%E3%82%89%E3%82%8C%E3%82%8B&amp;rft.pub=PRESIDENT+Inc.&amp;rft.date=2015-10-29&amp;rft.aulast=Koike&amp;rft.aufirst=Yasutoshi&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1031" id="mwM7Q"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1031" id="mwM7U"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1031" id="mwM7Y"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-169" id="cite_note-169" data-mw-footnote-number="157"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwM7c"><a href="#cite_ref-169" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwM7g"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwM7k">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-169" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1034" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwM7o" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;web&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:いや、特にないと思いますね。前回も2か月先までやりましたよね。だから多分、その期間としては同じですね。前回からですかね、少し長めにしたのは。そうでないと、例えばまん延防止等重点措置が延長されても、その先のところの予約がフリーで、ものすごい人数に既に売っていて、それはキャンセルしなくてもいいという状況になると、まん延防止等重点措置がかかっているのに、なぜかものすごい人がいるよねという、この状況というのがやはり課題だというふうに指摘を、これは別に千葉県に限った話でなくありましたので、そういう中で、千葉県も含めて少し先を見て人数制限等をかけるような形になっていますので、これは特に何か、例えばオリンピックがあるからとか、そういうことではない、前回からの対応という形です。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.pref.chiba.lg.jp/kouhou/chijishitsu/teirei/r3/210618.html&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:知事臨時記者会見（令和3年6月18日）概要&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=18 June 2021&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Chiba Prefecture|Chiba]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite class="citation web cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1034" id="mwM7s"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.pref.chiba.lg.jp/kouhou/chijishitsu/teirei/r3/210618.html" class="external text" id="mwM7w"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwM70">知事臨時記者会見（令和3年6月18日）概要</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiba_Prefecture" title="Chiba Prefecture" id="mwM74">Chiba</a>. 18 June 2021.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwM78">いや、特にないと思いますね。前回も2か月先までやりましたよね。だから多分、その期間としては同じですね。前回からですかね、少し長めにしたのは。そうでないと、例えばまん延防止等重点措置が延長されても、その先のところの予約がフリーで、ものすごい人数に既に売っていて、それはキャンセルしなくてもいいという状況になると、まん延防止等重点措置がかかっているのに、なぜかものすごい人がいるよねという、この状況というのがやはり課題だというふうに指摘を、これは別に千葉県に限った話でなくありましたので、そういう中で、千葉県も含めて少し先を見て人数制限等をかけるような形になっていますので、これは特に何か、例えばオリンピックがあるからとか、そういうことではない、前回からの対応という形です。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=%E7%9F%A5%E4%BA%8B%E8%87%A8%E6%99%82%E8%A8%98%E8%80%85%E4%BC%9A%E8%A6%8B%EF%BC%88%E4%BB%A4%E5%92%8C3%E5%B9%B46%E6%9C%8818%E6%97%A5%EF%BC%89%E6%A6%82%E8%A6%81&amp;rft.place=Chiba&amp;rft.date=2021-06-18&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.pref.chiba.lg.jp%2Fkouhou%2Fchijishitsu%2Fteirei%2Fr3%2F210618.html&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1034" id="mwM8A"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1034" id="mwM8E"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1034" id="mwM8I"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-170" id="cite_note-170" data-mw-footnote-number="158"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwM8M"><a href="#cite_ref-170" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwM8Q"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwM8U">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-170" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1037" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwM8Y" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;web&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:一緒に働く仲間ですから、僕もその職について調べるじゃないですか。情報を提供すればその子だって喜んでくれるし、僕自身話を続ける内に興味が増して、知識だって増える。こういうことが、これまでに1人や2人じゃなくありました。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://fenixjob.jp/journal/voice/21816&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=23 March 2023&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:全スタッフの給与を、一律ベースアップ?!　誰もが頑張れる理由は、組織への強い信頼&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Matsuzaka&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Jirō&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;work=Fenix Job Journal&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Fenix Job&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFMatsuzaka2023" class="citation web cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1037">Matsuzaka, Jirō (23 March 2023). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://fenixjob.jp/journal/voice/21816" class="external text" id="mwM8c"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwM8g">全スタッフの給与を、一律ベースアップ?!　誰もが頑張れる理由は、組織への強い信頼</bdi></a>. <i id="mwM8k">Fenix Job Journal</i> (in Japanese). Fenix Job.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwM8o">一緒に働く仲間ですから、僕もその職について調べるじゃないですか。情報を提供すればその子だって喜んでくれるし、僕自身話を続ける内に興味が増して、知識だって増える。こういうことが、これまでに1人や2人じゃなくありました。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Fenix+Job+Journal&amp;rft.atitle=%E5%85%A8%E3%82%B9%E3%82%BF%E3%83%83%E3%83%95%E3%81%AE%E7%B5%A6%E4%B8%8E%E3%82%92%E3%80%81%E4%B8%80%E5%BE%8B%E3%83%99%E3%83%BC%E3%82%B9%E3%82%A2%E3%83%83%E3%83%97%3F%21%E3%80%80%E8%AA%B0%E3%82%82%E3%81%8C%E9%A0%91%E5%BC%B5%E3%82%8C%E3%82%8B%E7%90%86%E7%94%B1%E3%81%AF%E3%80%81%E7%B5%84%E7%B9%94%E3%81%B8%E3%81%AE%E5%BC%B7%E3%81%84%E4%BF%A1%E9%A0%BC&amp;rft.date=2023-03-23&amp;rft.aulast=Matsuzaka&amp;rft.aufirst=Jir%C5%8D&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Ffenixjob.jp%2Fjournal%2Fvoice%2F21816&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1037" id="mwM8s"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1037" id="mwM8w"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1037" id="mwM80"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-171" id="cite_note-171" data-mw-footnote-number="159"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwM84"><a href="#cite_ref-171" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwM88"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwM9A">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-171" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1042" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwM9E" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:溝した一因であらなかつたとは、&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=4&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/981302/1/11&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:一、甲斐の國學者 萩原元克&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:甲斐の國學者 萩原元克&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Yatomi&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Hamao&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=1 August 1926&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;editor-first=Raihei&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;editor-last=Hagiwara&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|甲斐志料編纂會}}&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Kōfu]], [[Yamanashi Prefecture|Yamanashi]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFYatomi1926" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1042">Yatomi, Hamao (1 August 1926).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwM9I">一、甲斐の國學者 萩原元克</bdi>. In Hagiwara, Raihei (ed.). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/981302/1/11" class="external text" id="mwM9M"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwM9Q">甲斐の國學者 萩原元克</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kōfu" title="Kōfu" id="mwM9U">Kōfu</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yamanashi_Prefecture" title="Yamanashi Prefecture" id="mwM9Y">Yamanashi</a>: <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwM9c"><span lang="ja" id="mwM9g">甲斐志料編纂會</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwM9k">. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwM9o">&nbsp;</span>4.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwM9s">溝した一因であらなかつたとは、</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E7%94%B2%E6%96%90%E3%81%AE%E5%9C%8B%E5%AD%B8%E8%80%85+%E8%90%A9%E5%8E%9F%E5%85%83%E5%85%8B&amp;rft.btitle=%E7%94%B2%E6%96%90%E3%81%AE%E5%9C%8B%E5%AD%B8%E8%80%85+%E8%90%A9%E5%8E%9F%E5%85%83%E5%85%8B&amp;rft.place=K%C5%8Dfu%2C+Yamanashi&amp;rft.pages=4&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E7%94%B2%E6%96%90%E5%BF%97%E6%96%99%E7%B7%A8%E7%BA%82%E6%9C%83%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.date=1926-08-01&amp;rft.aulast=Yatomi&amp;rft.aufirst=Hamao&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F981302%2F1%2F11&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1042" id="mwM9w"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1042" id="mwM90"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1042" id="mwM94"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-172" id="cite_note-172" data-mw-footnote-number="160"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwM98"><a href="#cite_ref-172" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwM-A"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwM-E">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-172" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1045" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwM-I" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:率直に言ふことを許さるれば、スミスに於ける自由貿易理論は尚ほ未だ全きものではあらなかつた。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pages=23–24&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1272097/1/19&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:第二章 世界經濟思想の由來&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=10 October 1931&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Fukami&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Giichi&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:世界經濟總論&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|世界經濟硏究}}&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=1&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Kanda, Tokyo]]&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|瞭文堂}}&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFFukami1931" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1045">Fukami, Giichi (10 October 1931).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwM-M">第二章 世界經濟思想の由來</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1272097/1/19" class="external text" id="mwM-Q"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwM-U">世界經濟總論</bdi></a>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwM-Y"><span lang="ja" id="mwM-c">世界經濟硏究</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwM-g"> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwM-k">&nbsp;</span>1. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kanda,_Tokyo" title="Kanda, Tokyo" id="mwM-o">Kanda, Tokyo</a>: <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwM-s"><span lang="ja" id="mwM-w">瞭文堂</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwM-0">. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwM-4">&nbsp;</span><span class="nowrap" id="mwM-8">23–</span>24.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwM_A">率直に言ふことを許さるれば、スミスに於ける自由貿易理論は尚ほ未だ全きものではあらなかつた。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E7%AB%A0+%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E7%B6%93%E6%BF%9F%E6%80%9D%E6%83%B3%E3%81%AE%E7%94%B1%E4%BE%86&amp;rft.btitle=%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E7%B6%93%E6%BF%9F%E7%B8%BD%E8%AB%96&amp;rft.place=Kanda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E7%B6%93%E6%BF%9F%E7%A1%8F%E7%A9%B6%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=23-24&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E7%9E%AD%E6%96%87%E5%A0%82%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.date=1931-10-10&amp;rft.aulast=Fukami&amp;rft.aufirst=Giichi&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1272097%2F1%2F19&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1045" id="mwM_E"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1045" id="mwM_I"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1045" id="mwM_M"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-173" id="cite_note-173" data-mw-footnote-number="161"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwM_Q"><a href="#cite_ref-173" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwM_U"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwM_Y">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-173" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1056" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwM_c" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:<ruby>風<rp>(</rp><rt>かぜ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はひゆーと吹いてゐました。そうしてあの<ruby>獄<rp>(</rp><rt>ごく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>舍<rp>(</rp><rt>しや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の周圍へ盛んに雪を吹きつけてゐました。けれどそれはもう私共を<ruby>苦<rp>(</rp><rt>くる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しめる<ruby>力<rp>(</rp><rt>ちから</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がありませんでした。<br/><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたくし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はハリスが好きでした。やればもつとうまく<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>で</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>來<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たことでありませう。しかし私はハリス以上に私に合ひ、あれだけの<ruby>滿<rp>(</rp><rt>まん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>足<rp>(</rp><rt>ぞく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を私に與へる者は他になかつたと<ruby>公<rp>(</rp><rt>こう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>言<rp>(</rp><rt>げん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>致<rp>(</rp><rt>いた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>します。メシツクはやゝ<ruby>高<rp>(</rp><rt>かう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>尙<rp>(</rp><rt>せう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>な<ruby>風<rp>(</rp><rt>ふう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>味<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>があつて大層よかつたのですが、<ruby>眞<rp>(</rp><rt>しん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>滋<rp>(</rp><rt>じ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>養<rp>(</rp><rt>やう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>といふこと、素質の旨味といふことでは私はハリスを<ruby>採<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ります。メシツクも長所はありました――それを<ruby>否<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>定<rp>(</rp><rt>てい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しやうとは<ruby>致<rp>(</rp><rt>いた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しませぬ。またそうしやうとも思ひませぬ――けれどこの人は朝食としては<ruby>木乃伊<rp>(</rp><rt>ミイラ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>位の味に過ぎませぬでした――<ruby>決<rp>(</rp><rt>けつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>してそれ以上のものではありませぬでした。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=The winds howled, and blew the snow wildly about our prison house, but they were powerless to distress us any more. I liked Harris. He might have been better done, perhaps, but I am free to say that no man ever agreed with me better than Harris, or afforded me so large a degree of satisfaction. Messick was very well, though rather high-flavored, but for genuine nutritiousness and delicacy of fiber, give me Harris. Messick had his good points—I will not attempt to deny it, nor do I wish to do it—but he was no more fitted for breakfast than a mummy would be, sir—not a bit.&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pages=96–98&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:車中奇談&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-chapter=A Strange Tale in the Cars&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=[[Cannibalism in the Cars]]&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/981802/1/54&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:世界を笑はせた皮肉な話&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=Ironic Stories That Made the World Laugh&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Mark Twain&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Mark&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Twain&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Kagatani&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Rinnosuke&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=9 June 1926&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Kanda, Tokyo]]&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Shōryūdō Shoten&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFTwain1926" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1056"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Twain" title="Mark Twain" id="mwM_g">Twain, Mark</a> (9 June 1926). "<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cannibalism_in_the_Cars" title="Cannibalism in the Cars" id="mwM_k">Cannibalism in the Cars</a>" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwM_o">車中奇談</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwM_s">[</span>A Strange Tale in the Cars<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwM_w">]</span>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/981802/1/54" class="external text" id="mwM_0"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwM_4">世界を笑はせた皮肉な話</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwM_8">[</span><i id="mwNAA">Ironic Stories That Made the World Laugh</i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNAE">]</span> (in Japanese). Translated by Kagatani, Rinnosuke. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kanda,_Tokyo" title="Kanda, Tokyo" id="mwNAI">Kanda, Tokyo</a>: Shōryūdō Shoten. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNAM">&nbsp;</span><span class="nowrap" id="mwNAQ">96–</span>98. <q id="mwNAU">The winds howled, and blew the snow wildly about our prison house, but they were powerless to distress us any more. I liked Harris. He might have been better done, perhaps, but I am free to say that no man ever agreed with me better than Harris, or afforded me so large a degree of satisfaction. Messick was very well, though rather high-flavored, but for genuine nutritiousness and delicacy of fiber, give me Harris. Messick had his good points—I will not attempt to deny it, nor do I wish to do it—but he was no more fitted for breakfast than a mummy would be, sir—not a bit.</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNAY"><ruby id="mwNAc">風<rp id="mwNAg">(</rp><rt id="mwNAk">かぜ</rt><rp id="mwNAo">)</rp></ruby>はひゆーと吹いてゐました。そうしてあの<ruby id="mwNAs">獄<rp id="mwNAw">(</rp><rt id="mwNA0">ごく</rt><rp id="mwNA4">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNA8">舍<rp id="mwNBA">(</rp><rt id="mwNBE">しや</rt><rp id="mwNBI">)</rp></ruby>の周圍へ盛んに雪を吹きつけてゐました。けれどそれはもう私共を<ruby id="mwNBM">苦<rp id="mwNBQ">(</rp><rt id="mwNBU">くる</rt><rp id="mwNBY">)</rp></ruby>しめる<ruby id="mwNBc">力<rp id="mwNBg">(</rp><rt id="mwNBk">ちから</rt><rp id="mwNBo">)</rp></ruby>がありませんでした。<br id="mwNBs"><ruby id="mwNBw">私<rp id="mwNB0">(</rp><rt id="mwNB4">わたくし</rt><rp id="mwNB8">)</rp></ruby>はハリスが好きでした。やればもつとうまく<ruby id="mwNCA">出<rp id="mwNCE">(</rp><rt id="mwNCI">で</rt><rp id="mwNCM">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNCQ">來<rp id="mwNCU">(</rp><rt id="mwNCY">き</rt><rp id="mwNCc">)</rp></ruby>たことでありませう。しかし私はハリス以上に私に合ひ、あれだけの<ruby id="mwNCg">滿<rp id="mwNCk">(</rp><rt id="mwNCo">まん</rt><rp id="mwNCs">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNCw">足<rp id="mwNC0">(</rp><rt id="mwNC4">ぞく</rt><rp id="mwNC8">)</rp></ruby>を私に與へる者は他になかつたと<ruby id="mwNDA">公<rp id="mwNDE">(</rp><rt id="mwNDI">こう</rt><rp id="mwNDM">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNDQ">言<rp id="mwNDU">(</rp><rt id="mwNDY">げん</rt><rp id="mwNDc">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNDg">致<rp id="mwNDk">(</rp><rt id="mwNDo">いた</rt><rp id="mwNDs">)</rp></ruby>します。メシツクはやゝ<ruby id="mwNDw">高<rp id="mwND0">(</rp><rt id="mwND4">かう</rt><rp id="mwND8">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNEA">尙<rp id="mwNEE">(</rp><rt id="mwNEI">せう</rt><rp id="mwNEM">)</rp></ruby>な<ruby id="mwNEQ">風<rp id="mwNEU">(</rp><rt id="mwNEY">ふう</rt><rp id="mwNEc">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNEg">味<rp id="mwNEk">(</rp><rt id="mwNEo">み</rt><rp id="mwNEs">)</rp></ruby>があつて大層よかつたのですが、<ruby id="mwNEw">眞<rp id="mwNE0">(</rp><rt id="mwNE4">しん</rt><rp id="mwNE8">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwNFA">滋<rp id="mwNFE">(</rp><rt id="mwNFI">じ</rt><rp id="mwNFM">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNFQ">養<rp id="mwNFU">(</rp><rt id="mwNFY">やう</rt><rp id="mwNFc">)</rp></ruby>といふこと、素質の旨味といふことでは私はハリスを<ruby id="mwNFg">採<rp id="mwNFk">(</rp><rt id="mwNFo">と</rt><rp id="mwNFs">)</rp></ruby>ります。メシツクも長所はありました――それを<ruby id="mwNFw">否<rp id="mwNF0">(</rp><rt id="mwNF4">ひ</rt><rp id="mwNF8">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNGA">定<rp id="mwNGE">(</rp><rt id="mwNGI">てい</rt><rp id="mwNGM">)</rp></ruby>しやうとは<ruby id="mwNGQ">致<rp id="mwNGU">(</rp><rt id="mwNGY">いた</rt><rp id="mwNGc">)</rp></ruby>しませぬ。またそうしやうとも思ひませぬ――けれどこの人は朝食としては<ruby id="mwNGg">木乃伊<rp id="mwNGk">(</rp><rt id="mwNGo">ミイラ</rt><rp id="mwNGs">)</rp></ruby>位の味に過ぎませぬでした――<ruby id="mwNGw">決<rp id="mwNG0">(</rp><rt id="mwNG4">けつ</rt><rp id="mwNG8">)</rp></ruby>してそれ以上のものではありませぬでした。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=Cannibalism+in+the+Cars+%E8%BB%8A%E4%B8%AD%E5%A5%87%E8%AB%87&amp;rft.btitle=%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E3%82%92%E7%AC%91%E3%81%AF%E3%81%9B%E3%81%9F%E7%9A%AE%E8%82%89%E3%81%AA%E8%A9%B1&amp;rft.place=Kanda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=96-98&amp;rft.pub=Sh%C5%8Dry%C5%ABd%C5%8D+Shoten&amp;rft.date=1926-06-09&amp;rft.aulast=Twain&amp;rft.aufirst=Mark&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F981802%2F1%2F54&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1056" id="mwNHA"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1056" id="mwNHE"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1056" id="mwNHI"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-174" id="cite_note-174" data-mw-footnote-number="162"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwNHM"><a href="#cite_ref-174" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwNHQ"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwNHU">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-174" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1062" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwNHY" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:けれども、<ruby>何時<rp>(</rp><rt>いつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>までも、お<ruby>煎<rp>(</rp><rt>せん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>餠<rp>(</rp><rt>べい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は、ギシ〱一<ruby>杯<rp>(</rp><rt>ぱい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ではあらなんだ。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=170&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/962855/1/103&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:<ruby>靑<rp>(</rp><rt>あを</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>チヨツキ<ruby>先<rp>(</rp><rt>せん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>生<rp>(</rp><rt>せい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:砲臺島&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Shigeru Kuzuhara&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Shigeru&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Kuzuhara&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Hakubunkan&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=4 November 1919&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Nihonbashi]], Tokyo&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFKuzuhara1919" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1062"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shigeru_Kuzuhara" title="Shigeru Kuzuhara" id="mwNHc">Kuzuhara, Shigeru</a> (4 November 1919).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNHg"><ruby id="mwNHk">靑<rp id="mwNHo">(</rp><rt id="mwNHs">あを</rt><rp id="mwNHw">)</rp></ruby>チヨツキ<ruby id="mwNH0">先<rp id="mwNH4">(</rp><rt id="mwNH8">せん</rt><rp id="mwNIA">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNIE">生<rp id="mwNII">(</rp><rt id="mwNIM">せい</rt><rp id="mwNIQ">)</rp></ruby></bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/962855/1/103" class="external text" id="mwNIU"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwNIY">砲臺島</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nihonbashi" title="Nihonbashi" id="mwNIc">Nihonbashi</a>, Tokyo: Hakubunkan. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNIg">&nbsp;</span>170.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNIk">けれども、<ruby id="mwNIo">何時<rp id="mwNIs">(</rp><rt id="mwNIw">いつ</rt><rp id="mwNI0">)</rp></ruby>までも、お<ruby id="mwNI4">煎<rp id="mwNI8">(</rp><rt id="mwNJA">せん</rt><rp id="mwNJE">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNJI">餠<rp id="mwNJM">(</rp><rt id="mwNJQ">べい</rt><rp id="mwNJU">)</rp></ruby>は、ギシ〱一<ruby id="mwNJY">杯<rp id="mwNJc">(</rp><rt id="mwNJg">ぱい</rt><rp id="mwNJk">)</rp></ruby>ではあらなんだ。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%3Cruby%3E%E9%9D%91%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%82%E3%82%92%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%E3%83%81%E3%83%A8%E3%83%84%E3%82%AD%3Cruby%3E%E5%85%88%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%9B%E3%82%93%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E7%94%9F%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%9B%E3%81%84%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E&amp;rft.btitle=%E7%A0%B2%E8%87%BA%E5%B3%B6&amp;rft.place=Nihonbashi%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=170&amp;rft.pub=Hakubunkan&amp;rft.date=1919-11-04&amp;rft.aulast=Kuzuhara&amp;rft.aufirst=Shigeru&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F962855%2F1%2F103&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1062" id="mwNJo"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1062" id="mwNJs"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1062" id="mwNJw"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-175" id="cite_note-175" data-mw-footnote-number="163"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwNJ0"><a href="#cite_ref-175" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwNJ4"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwNJ8">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-175" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1065" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwNKA" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:（三）政府經營は特に有効であらなんだにしても低廉ではなかつた。凡て許可を得て交通狀態の差異により私設鐵道は運賃を低減して居る。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pages=175–176&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1259037/1/105&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:十二 鐵道國有史&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:交通地理學&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Inoue&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Chōtarō&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Meiji Tosho&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=15 June 1930&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Kyōbashi, Tokyo]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFInoue1930" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1065">Inoue, Chōtarō (15 June 1930).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNKE">十二 鐵道國有史</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1259037/1/105" class="external text" id="mwNKI"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwNKM">交通地理學</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kyōbashi,_Tokyo" title="Kyōbashi, Tokyo" id="mwNKQ">Kyōbashi, Tokyo</a>: Meiji Tosho. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNKU">&nbsp;</span><span class="nowrap" id="mwNKY">175–</span>176.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNKc">（三）政府經營は特に有効であらなんだにしても低廉ではなかつた。凡て許可を得て交通狀態の差異により私設鐵道は運賃を低減して居る。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%8C+%E9%90%B5%E9%81%93%E5%9C%8B%E6%9C%89%E5%8F%B2&amp;rft.btitle=%E4%BA%A4%E9%80%9A%E5%9C%B0%E7%90%86%E5%AD%B8&amp;rft.place=Ky%C5%8Dbashi%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=175-176&amp;rft.pub=Meiji+Tosho&amp;rft.date=1930-06-15&amp;rft.aulast=Inoue&amp;rft.aufirst=Ch%C5%8Dtar%C5%8D&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1259037%2F1%2F105&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1065" id="mwNKg"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1065" id="mwNKk"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1065" id="mwNKo"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-akutagawa-1948-176" id="cite_note-akutagawa-1948-176" data-mw-footnote-number="164"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwNKs"><a href="#cite_ref-akutagawa-1948_176-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwNKw"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwNK0">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-akutagawa-1948-176" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1068" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwNK4" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:去んぬる頃、日本長崎の「さんた・るちや」と申す「えけれしや」（寺院）に、「ろおれんぞ」と申すこの國の少年がござつた。これは或年御降誕の祭の夜、その「えけれしや」の戶口に、餓ゑ疲れてうち伏して居つたを、參詣の<ruby>奉<rp>(</rp><rt>ほう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>敎<rp>(</rp><rt>けう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>にん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>衆が介抱し、それより<ruby>伴<rp>(</rp><rt>ば</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>天<rp>(</rp><rt>て</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>連<rp>(</rp><rt>れん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の憐みにて、寺中に養はれる事となつたげでござるが、何故かその身の素性を問へば、<ruby>故<rp>(</rp><rt>ふる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>鄕<rp>(</rp><rt>さと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は「はらいそ」（天國）父の名は「でうす」（天主）などと、何時も事もなげな笑に紛らいて、とんとまことは明した事もござない。なれど親の代から「ぜんちよ」（異敎徒）の<ruby>輩<rp>(</rp><rt>やから</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>であらなんだ事だけは、手くびにかけた<ruby>靑<rp>(</rp><rt>あを</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>玉<rp>(</rp><rt>だま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の「こんたつ」（念珠）を見ても、知れたと申す。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote=Once upon a time, at an “igreja” (church) named “Santa Lúcia” in Nagasaki, Japan, there was a boy named “Lourenço”. As he was lying listless from starvation at the entrance to the “igreja” on a Christmas night, a group of Christian pilgrims found and cared for him, and then, the padres took him in to the church out of pity. But for whatever reason, whenever asked about his origin, he would never tell the truth, but deflect with such glib jokes as that he came from “Paraíso” (Heaven) and his father was known as “Deus” (God). However, seeing that he had some blue “contas” (beads) around his wrist, it could be gleaned that his parents were no mere “gentios” (heathens).&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=3&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1133071/1/6&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:奉敎人の死&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-chapter=The Death of a Christian&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:奉敎人の死&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=The Death of a Christian&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Hosokawa Shoten&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=5 July 1948&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Ryūnosuke Akutagawa&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Ryūnosuke&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Akutagawa&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Chiyoda, Tokyo]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFAkutagawa1948" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1068"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ryūnosuke_Akutagawa" title="Ryūnosuke Akutagawa" id="mwNK8">Akutagawa, Ryūnosuke</a> (5 July 1948).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNLA">奉敎人の死</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNLE">[</span>The Death of a Christian<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNLI">]</span>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1133071/1/6" class="external text" id="mwNLM"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwNLQ">奉敎人の死</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNLU">[</span><i id="mwNLY">The Death of a Christian</i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNLc">]</span> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiyoda,_Tokyo" title="Chiyoda, Tokyo" id="mwNLg">Chiyoda, Tokyo</a>: Hosokawa Shoten. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNLk">&nbsp;</span>3.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNLo">去んぬる頃、日本長崎の「さんた・るちや」と申す「えけれしや」（寺院）に、「ろおれんぞ」と申すこの國の少年がござつた。これは或年御降誕の祭の夜、その「えけれしや」の戶口に、餓ゑ疲れてうち伏して居つたを、參詣の<ruby id="mwNLs">奉<rp id="mwNLw">(</rp><rt id="mwNL0">ほう</rt><rp id="mwNL4">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNL8">敎<rp id="mwNMA">(</rp><rt id="mwNME">けう</rt><rp id="mwNMI">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNMM">人<rp id="mwNMQ">(</rp><rt id="mwNMU">にん</rt><rp id="mwNMY">)</rp></ruby>衆が介抱し、それより<ruby id="mwNMc">伴<rp id="mwNMg">(</rp><rt id="mwNMk">ば</rt><rp id="mwNMo">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNMs">天<rp id="mwNMw">(</rp><rt id="mwNM0">て</rt><rp id="mwNM4">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNM8">連<rp id="mwNNA">(</rp><rt id="mwNNE">れん</rt><rp id="mwNNI">)</rp></ruby>の憐みにて、寺中に養はれる事となつたげでござるが、何故かその身の素性を問へば、<ruby id="mwNNM">故<rp id="mwNNQ">(</rp><rt id="mwNNU">ふる</rt><rp id="mwNNY">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNNc">鄕<rp id="mwNNg">(</rp><rt id="mwNNk">さと</rt><rp id="mwNNo">)</rp></ruby>は「はらいそ」（天國）父の名は「でうす」（天主）などと、何時も事もなげな笑に紛らいて、とんとまことは明した事もござない。なれど親の代から「ぜんちよ」（異敎徒）の<ruby id="mwNNs">輩<rp id="mwNNw">(</rp><rt id="mwNN0">やから</rt><rp id="mwNN4">)</rp></ruby>であらなんだ事だけは、手くびにかけた<ruby id="mwNN8">靑<rp id="mwNOA">(</rp><rt id="mwNOE">あを</rt><rp id="mwNOI">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNOM">玉<rp id="mwNOQ">(</rp><rt id="mwNOU">だま</rt><rp id="mwNOY">)</rp></ruby>の「こんたつ」（念珠）を見ても、知れたと申す。</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNOc">[</span>Once upon a time, at an “igreja” (church) named “Santa Lúcia” in Nagasaki, Japan, there was a boy named “Lourenço”. As he was lying listless from starvation at the entrance to the “igreja” on a Christmas night, a group of Christian pilgrims found and cared for him, and then, the padres took him in to the church out of pity. But for whatever reason, whenever asked about his origin, he would never tell the truth, but deflect with such glib jokes as that he came from “Paraíso” (Heaven) and his father was known as “Deus” (God). However, seeing that he had some blue “contas” (beads) around his wrist, it could be gleaned that his parents were no mere “gentios” (heathens).<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNOg">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E5%A5%89%E6%95%8E%E4%BA%BA%E3%81%AE%E6%AD%BB&amp;rft.btitle=%E5%A5%89%E6%95%8E%E4%BA%BA%E3%81%AE%E6%AD%BB&amp;rft.place=Chiyoda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=3&amp;rft.pub=Hosokawa+Shoten&amp;rft.date=1948-07-05&amp;rft.aulast=Akutagawa&amp;rft.aufirst=Ry%C5%ABnosuke&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1133071%2F1%2F6&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1068" id="mwNOk"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1068" id="mwNOo"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1068" id="mwNOs"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-177" id="cite_note-177" data-mw-footnote-number="165"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwNOw"><a href="#cite_ref-177" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwNO0"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwNO4">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-177" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1073" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwNO8" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=No fueron tan vanas nueſtras oraciones que no fueſſen oydas del cielo, que en nueſtro fauor luego boluio el viento tranquilo el mar, combidandonos a que tornaſſemos alegres a proſeguir nueſtro començado viage. […] Dificil ſeñor ſe hizo de creer la cõtinencia del moço, pero ella lo afirmò con tantas veras, que fueron parte para que el deſconſolado padre ſe conſolaſſe, no haziendo cuẽta de las riquezas q̃ le lleuauan: pues le auian dexado a ſu hija con la joya, que ſi vna vez ſe pierde no dexa eſperança de que jamas ſe cobre.&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちの<ruby>祈<rp>(</rp><rt>いの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りは<ruby>天<rp>(</rp><rt>てん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>屆<rp>(</rp><rt>とゞ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かぬほどに<ruby>效<rp>(</rp><rt>かひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ないものではありませなんだ。<ruby>間<rp>(</rp><rt>ま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>もなく<ruby>風<rp>(</rp><rt>かぜ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>順<rp>(</rp><rt>じゆん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>風<rp>(</rp><rt>ぷう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>變<rp>(</rp><rt>へん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じ、<ruby>海<rp>(</rp><rt>うみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>靜<rp>(</rp><rt>しづ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まつて、<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちを<ruby>元<rp>(</rp><rt>げん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>氣<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>よく<ruby>再<rp>(</rp><rt>ふたゝ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>び<ruby>航<rp>(</rp><rt>かう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>海<rp>(</rp><rt>かい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をつゞけるように<ruby>誘<rp>(</rp><rt>さそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ひました。[…]<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちに<ruby>取<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つてはその<ruby>若<rp>(</rp><rt>わか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>者<rp>(</rp><rt>もの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>節<rp>(</rp><rt>せつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>慾<rp>(</rp><rt>よく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>信<rp>(</rp><rt>しん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ずることは<ruby>容<rp>(</rp><rt>よう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>易<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でありませなんだ。しかしレアンドラは一<ruby>生<rp>(</rp><rt>せい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>懸<rp>(</rp><rt>けん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>命<rp>(</rp><rt>めい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にそれを<ruby>辯<rp>(</rp><rt>べん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>護<rp>(</rp><rt>ご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しましたので、その<ruby>落<rp>(</rp><rt>らく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>膽<rp>(</rp><rt>たん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>してゐる<ruby>父<rp>(</rp><rt>ちゝ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>親<rp>(</rp><rt>おや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>もそれをせめてもの<ruby>慰<rp>(</rp><rt>なぐさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めとしました。<ruby>父<rp>(</rp><rt>ちゝ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>親<rp>(</rp><rt>おや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は、一<ruby>度<rp>(</rp><rt>ど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>失<rp>(</rp><rt>うしな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はるれば<ruby>未<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>來<rp>(</rp><rt>らい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>永<rp>(</rp><rt>えい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>劫<rp>(</rp><rt>がふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>囘<rp>(</rp><rt>くわい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>復<rp>(</rp><rt>ふく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>されない<ruby>寶<rp>(</rp><rt>たから</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>自<rp>(</rp><rt>じ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>分<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>娘<rp>(</rp><rt>むすめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>殘<rp>(</rp><rt>のこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>されてある<ruby>以<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>じやう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は、その<ruby>外<rp>(</rp><rt>ほか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>盜<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まれた<ruby>物<rp>(</rp><rt>もの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>とも<ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はなんだのです。&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote=Our prayers were not so in vain as not to reach Heaven. In our favor the wind soon changed, the sea calmed, inviting us again to resume our voyage with good vigor. […] It was not easy for us to credit the young man’s continence. But Leandra affirmed it so earnestly that at least her disconsolate father found it consoling. Since the jewel, which would be forever unrecoverable once lost, had been left to his daughter, he did not think much of his other stolen goods.&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;p=752, 906&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/945515/1/424&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:ドン・キホーテ&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=[[Don Quixote]]&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=EL INGENIOSO HIDALGO DON QVIXOTE DE LA MANCHA&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Miguel&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=de Cervantes Saavedra&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Miguel de Cervantes&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=1&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=13 November 1915&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;edition=2nd&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-link=Hōgetsu Shimamura&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Hōgetsu&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Shimamura&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-link2=Noburu Katagami&quot;},&quot;21&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first2=Noburu&quot;},&quot;22&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last2=Katagami&quot;},&quot;23&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Uetake Shoin&quot;},&quot;24&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Kōjimachi]], Tokyo&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFde_Cervantes_Saavedra1915" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1073"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Miguel_de_Cervantes" title="Miguel de Cervantes" id="mwNPA">de Cervantes Saavedra, Miguel</a> (13 November 1915). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/945515/1/424" class="external text" id="mwNPE"><i id="mwNPI">EL INGENIOSO HIDALGO DON QVIXOTE DE LA MANCHA</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNPM">ドン・キホーテ</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNPQ">[</span><i id="mwNPU"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Don_Quixote" title="Don Quixote" id="mwNPY">Don Quixote</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNPc">]</span> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNPg">&nbsp;</span>1. Translated by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hōgetsu_Shimamura" title="Hōgetsu Shimamura" id="mwNPk">Shimamura, Hōgetsu</a>; <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Noburu_Katagami" title="Noburu Katagami" id="mwNPo">Katagami, Noburu</a> (2nd<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNPs">&nbsp;</span>ed.). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kōjimachi" title="Kōjimachi" id="mwNPw">Kōjimachi</a>, Tokyo: Uetake Shoin. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNP0">&nbsp;</span>752, 906. <q id="mwNP4">No fueron tan vanas nueſtras oraciones que no fueſſen oydas del cielo, que en nueſtro fauor luego boluio el viento tranquilo el mar, combidandonos a que tornaſſemos alegres a proſeguir nueſtro començado viage. […] Dificil ſeñor ſe hizo de creer la cõtinencia del moço, pero ella lo afirmò con tantas veras, que fueron parte para que el deſconſolado padre ſe conſolaſſe, no haziendo cuẽta de las riquezas q̃ le lleuauan: pues le auian dexado a ſu hija con la joya, que ſi vna vez ſe pierde no dexa eſperança de que jamas ſe cobre.</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNP8"><ruby id="mwNQA">私<rp id="mwNQE">(</rp><rt id="mwNQI">わたし</rt><rp id="mwNQM">)</rp></ruby>たちの<ruby id="mwNQQ">祈<rp id="mwNQU">(</rp><rt id="mwNQY">いの</rt><rp id="mwNQc">)</rp></ruby>りは<ruby id="mwNQg">天<rp id="mwNQk">(</rp><rt id="mwNQo">てん</rt><rp id="mwNQs">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwNQw">屆<rp id="mwNQ0">(</rp><rt id="mwNQ4">とゞ</rt><rp id="mwNQ8">)</rp></ruby>かぬほどに<ruby id="mwNRA">效<rp id="mwNRE">(</rp><rt id="mwNRI">かひ</rt><rp id="mwNRM">)</rp></ruby>ないものではありませなんだ。<ruby id="mwNRQ">間<rp id="mwNRU">(</rp><rt id="mwNRY">ま</rt><rp id="mwNRc">)</rp></ruby>もなく<ruby id="mwNRg">風<rp id="mwNRk">(</rp><rt id="mwNRo">かぜ</rt><rp id="mwNRs">)</rp></ruby>は<ruby id="mwNRw">順<rp id="mwNR0">(</rp><rt id="mwNR4">じゆん</rt><rp id="mwNR8">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNSA">風<rp id="mwNSE">(</rp><rt id="mwNSI">ぷう</rt><rp id="mwNSM">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwNSQ">變<rp id="mwNSU">(</rp><rt id="mwNSY">へん</rt><rp id="mwNSc">)</rp></ruby>じ、<ruby id="mwNSg">海<rp id="mwNSk">(</rp><rt id="mwNSo">うみ</rt><rp id="mwNSs">)</rp></ruby>は<ruby id="mwNSw">靜<rp id="mwNS0">(</rp><rt id="mwNS4">しづ</rt><rp id="mwNS8">)</rp></ruby>まつて、<ruby id="mwNTA">私<rp id="mwNTE">(</rp><rt id="mwNTI">わたし</rt><rp id="mwNTM">)</rp></ruby>たちを<ruby id="mwNTQ">元<rp id="mwNTU">(</rp><rt id="mwNTY">げん</rt><rp id="mwNTc">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNTg">氣<rp id="mwNTk">(</rp><rt id="mwNTo">き</rt><rp id="mwNTs">)</rp></ruby>よく<ruby id="mwNTw">再<rp id="mwNT0">(</rp><rt id="mwNT4">ふたゝ</rt><rp id="mwNT8">)</rp></ruby>び<ruby id="mwNUA">航<rp id="mwNUE">(</rp><rt id="mwNUI">かう</rt><rp id="mwNUM">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNUQ">海<rp id="mwNUU">(</rp><rt id="mwNUY">かい</rt><rp id="mwNUc">)</rp></ruby>をつゞけるように<ruby id="mwNUg">誘<rp id="mwNUk">(</rp><rt id="mwNUo">さそ</rt><rp id="mwNUs">)</rp></ruby>ひました。[…]<ruby id="mwNUw">私<rp id="mwNU0">(</rp><rt id="mwNU4">わたし</rt><rp id="mwNU8">)</rp></ruby>たちに<ruby id="mwNVA">取<rp id="mwNVE">(</rp><rt id="mwNVI">と</rt><rp id="mwNVM">)</rp></ruby>つてはその<ruby id="mwNVQ">若<rp id="mwNVU">(</rp><rt id="mwNVY">わか</rt><rp id="mwNVc">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNVg">者<rp id="mwNVk">(</rp><rt id="mwNVo">もの</rt><rp id="mwNVs">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwNVw">節<rp id="mwNV0">(</rp><rt id="mwNV4">せつ</rt><rp id="mwNV8">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNWA">慾<rp id="mwNWE">(</rp><rt id="mwNWI">よく</rt><rp id="mwNWM">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwNWQ">信<rp id="mwNWU">(</rp><rt id="mwNWY">しん</rt><rp id="mwNWc">)</rp></ruby>ずることは<ruby id="mwNWg">容<rp id="mwNWk">(</rp><rt id="mwNWo">よう</rt><rp id="mwNWs">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNWw">易<rp id="mwNW0">(</rp><rt id="mwNW4">い</rt><rp id="mwNW8">)</rp></ruby>でありませなんだ。しかしレアンドラは一<ruby id="mwNXA">生<rp id="mwNXE">(</rp><rt id="mwNXI">せい</rt><rp id="mwNXM">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNXQ">懸<rp id="mwNXU">(</rp><rt id="mwNXY">けん</rt><rp id="mwNXc">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNXg">命<rp id="mwNXk">(</rp><rt id="mwNXo">めい</rt><rp id="mwNXs">)</rp></ruby>にそれを<ruby id="mwNXw">辯<rp id="mwNX0">(</rp><rt id="mwNX4">べん</rt><rp id="mwNX8">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNYA">護<rp id="mwNYE">(</rp><rt id="mwNYI">ご</rt><rp id="mwNYM">)</rp></ruby>しましたので、その<ruby id="mwNYQ">落<rp id="mwNYU">(</rp><rt id="mwNYY">らく</rt><rp id="mwNYc">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNYg">膽<rp id="mwNYk">(</rp><rt id="mwNYo">たん</rt><rp id="mwNYs">)</rp></ruby>してゐる<ruby id="mwNYw">父<rp id="mwNY0">(</rp><rt id="mwNY4">ちゝ</rt><rp id="mwNY8">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNZA">親<rp id="mwNZE">(</rp><rt id="mwNZI">おや</rt><rp id="mwNZM">)</rp></ruby>もそれをせめてもの<ruby id="mwNZQ">慰<rp id="mwNZU">(</rp><rt id="mwNZY">なぐさ</rt><rp id="mwNZc">)</rp></ruby>めとしました。<ruby id="mwNZg">父<rp id="mwNZk">(</rp><rt id="mwNZo">ちゝ</rt><rp id="mwNZs">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNZw">親<rp id="mwNZ0">(</rp><rt id="mwNZ4">おや</rt><rp id="mwNZ8">)</rp></ruby>は、一<ruby id="mwNaA">度<rp id="mwNaE">(</rp><rt id="mwNaI">ど</rt><rp id="mwNaM">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNaQ">失<rp id="mwNaU">(</rp><rt id="mwNaY">うしな</rt><rp id="mwNac">)</rp></ruby>はるれば<ruby id="mwNag">未<rp id="mwNak">(</rp><rt id="mwNao">み</rt><rp id="mwNas">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNaw">來<rp id="mwNa0">(</rp><rt id="mwNa4">らい</rt><rp id="mwNa8">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNbA">永<rp id="mwNbE">(</rp><rt id="mwNbI">えい</rt><rp id="mwNbM">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNbQ">劫<rp id="mwNbU">(</rp><rt id="mwNbY">がふ</rt><rp id="mwNbc">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNbg">囘<rp id="mwNbk">(</rp><rt id="mwNbo">くわい</rt><rp id="mwNbs">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNbw">復<rp id="mwNb0">(</rp><rt id="mwNb4">ふく</rt><rp id="mwNb8">)</rp></ruby>されない<ruby id="mwNcA">寶<rp id="mwNcE">(</rp><rt id="mwNcI">たから</rt><rp id="mwNcM">)</rp></ruby>が<ruby id="mwNcQ">自<rp id="mwNcU">(</rp><rt id="mwNcY">じ</rt><rp id="mwNcc">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNcg">分<rp id="mwNck">(</rp><rt id="mwNco">ぶん</rt><rp id="mwNcs">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwNcw">娘<rp id="mwNc0">(</rp><rt id="mwNc4">むすめ</rt><rp id="mwNc8">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwNdA">殘<rp id="mwNdE">(</rp><rt id="mwNdI">のこ</rt><rp id="mwNdM">)</rp></ruby>されてある<ruby id="mwNdQ">以<rp id="mwNdU">(</rp><rt id="mwNdY">い</rt><rp id="mwNdc">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNdg">上<rp id="mwNdk">(</rp><rt id="mwNdo">じやう</rt><rp id="mwNds">)</rp></ruby>は、その<ruby id="mwNdw">外<rp id="mwNd0">(</rp><rt id="mwNd4">ほか</rt><rp id="mwNd8">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwNeA">盜<rp id="mwNeE">(</rp><rt id="mwNeI">ぬす</rt><rp id="mwNeM">)</rp></ruby>まれた<ruby id="mwNeQ">物<rp id="mwNeU">(</rp><rt id="mwNeY">もの</rt><rp id="mwNec">)</rp></ruby>は<ruby id="mwNeg">何<rp id="mwNek">(</rp><rt id="mwNeo">なん</rt><rp id="mwNes">)</rp></ruby>とも<ruby id="mwNew">思<rp id="mwNe0">(</rp><rt id="mwNe4">おも</rt><rp id="mwNe8">)</rp></ruby>はなんだのです。</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNfA">[</span>Our prayers were not so in vain as not to reach Heaven. In our favor the wind soon changed, the sea calmed, inviting us again to resume our voyage with good vigor. […] It was not easy for us to credit the young man’s continence. But Leandra affirmed it so earnestly that at least her disconsolate father found it consoling. Since the jewel, which would be forever unrecoverable once lost, had been left to his daughter, he did not think much of his other stolen goods.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNfE">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=EL+INGENIOSO+HIDALGO+DON+QVIXOTE+DE+LA+MANCHA+%E3%83%89%E3%83%B3%E3%83%BB%E3%82%AD%E3%83%9B%E3%83%BC%E3%83%86&amp;rft.place=K%C5%8Djimachi%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=752%2C+906&amp;rft.edition=2nd&amp;rft.pub=Uetake+Shoin&amp;rft.date=1915-11-13&amp;rft.aulast=de+Cervantes+Saavedra&amp;rft.aufirst=Miguel&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F945515%2F1%2F424&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1073" id="mwNfI"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1073" id="mwNfM"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1073" id="mwNfQ"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-shibata-1966-178" id="cite_note-shibata-1966-178" data-mw-footnote-number="166"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwNfU"><a href="#cite_ref-shibata-1966_178-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwNfY"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwNfc">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-shibata-1966-178" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1076" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwNfg" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:……わからなんだ。[…]「……しかし、わしの<ruby>憤<rp>(</rp><rt>り</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は、消えはせなんだ。[…]」[…]「……左様か。吉良殿が、そのような悪党とは、知らなんだな」[…]「わたしは、若様が、よもや、浮橋大夫と枕を交される、とは思うて居りませなんだ。……あれで、よろしゅうございました」[…]「いかにも――。その通りでは、ござらなんだかな？」[…]「まこと、失礼なおたずねをつかまつりますが、貴女様は、堀部安兵衛殿とは、一度も、契られませなんだか？」[…]実は、この男、忍びの者にて、つまり、赤穂藩へ仕えてはいたものの、家来ではありませなんだ。[…]「[…]<span style=text-emphasis:sesame>すが</span>には、もとより、何が書かれてあるのか、判る由もありませなんだが、もうおさむらい様は、もどっては来なさらぬ、と予感したと申します。はたして、安兵衛殿は、再びその家には、戻って参られなかった。[…]……つまり、<span style=text-emphasis:sesame>すが</span>と安兵衛殿とは、たったそれだけの縁しか持って居りませなんだ」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pp=33–34, 177, 183, 251, 254, 257–258&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:裏返し忠臣蔵&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|柴錬立川文庫}}&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Renzaburō Shibata&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Renzaburō&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Shibata&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Bungeishunju&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=20 December 1966&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Chiyoda, Tokyo]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFShibata1966" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1076"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Renzaburō_Shibata" title="Renzaburō Shibata" id="mwNfk">Shibata, Renzaburō</a> (20 December 1966).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNfo">裏返し忠臣蔵</bdi>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwNfs"><span lang="ja" id="mwNfw">柴錬立川文庫</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwNf0"> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiyoda,_Tokyo" title="Chiyoda, Tokyo" id="mwNf4">Chiyoda, Tokyo</a>: Bungeishunju. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNf8">&nbsp;</span><span class="nowrap" id="mwNgA">33–</span>34, 177, 183, 251, 254, <span class="nowrap" id="mwNgE">257–</span>258.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNgI">……わからなんだ。[…]「……しかし、わしの<ruby id="mwNgM">憤<rp id="mwNgQ">(</rp><rt id="mwNgU">り</rt><rp id="mwNgY">)</rp></ruby>は、消えはせなんだ。[…]」[…]「……左様か。吉良殿が、そのような悪党とは、知らなんだな」[…]「わたしは、若様が、よもや、浮橋大夫と枕を交される、とは思うて居りませなんだ。……あれで、よろしゅうございました」[…]「いかにも――。その通りでは、ござらなんだかな？」[…]「まこと、失礼なおたずねをつかまつりますが、貴女様は、堀部安兵衛殿とは、一度も、契られませなんだか？」[…]実は、この男、忍びの者にて、つまり、赤穂藩へ仕えてはいたものの、家来ではありませなんだ。[…]「[…]<span style="text-emphasis:sesame" id="mwNgc">すが</span>には、もとより、何が書かれてあるのか、判る由もありませなんだが、もうおさむらい様は、もどっては来なさらぬ、と予感したと申します。はたして、安兵衛殿は、再びその家には、戻って参られなかった。[…]……つまり、<span style="text-emphasis:sesame" id="mwNgg">すが</span>と安兵衛殿とは、たったそれだけの縁しか持って居りませなんだ」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=%E8%A3%8F%E8%BF%94%E3%81%97%E5%BF%A0%E8%87%A3%E8%94%B5&amp;rft.place=Chiyoda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E6%9F%B4%E9%8C%AC%E7%AB%8B%E5%B7%9D%E6%96%87%E5%BA%AB%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=33-34%2C+177%2C+183%2C+251%2C+254%2C+257-258&amp;rft.pub=Bungeishunju&amp;rft.date=1966-12-20&amp;rft.aulast=Shibata&amp;rft.aufirst=Renzabur%C5%8D&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1076" id="mwNgk"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1076" id="mwNgo"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1076" id="mwNgs"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-kaionji-1989-masenanda-179" id="cite_note-kaionji-1989-masenanda-179" data-mw-footnote-number="167"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwNgw"><a href="#cite_ref-kaionji-1989-masenanda_179-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwNg0"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwNg4">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-kaionji-1989-masenanda-179" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1079" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwNg8" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:頼りに思う大猷院様（三代家光）は上様が六つになられた年にあえなくおなくなりなさるし、それからのわしの苦労は一通りではありませなんだ。あの頃は、上様が今日のようなご身分におなり遊ばそうとは、誰も思うておりませなんだ。[…]「お名前は存じませなんだが、あの人ならば、わたくしも感心しておりました」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pages=19, 39, 126&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:柳沢騒動&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Chōgorō Kaionji&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Chōgorō&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Kaionji&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|時代小説文庫}}&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=162&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Fujimi Shobō&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=1 February 1989&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFKaionji1989" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1079"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chōgorō_Kaionji" title="Chōgorō Kaionji" id="mwNhA">Kaionji, Chōgorō</a> (1 February 1989).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNhE">柳沢騒動</bdi>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwNhI"><span lang="ja" id="mwNhM">時代小説文庫</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwNhQ"> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNhU">&nbsp;</span>162. Fujimi Shobō. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNhY">&nbsp;</span>19, 39, 126.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNhc">頼りに思う大猷院様（三代家光）は上様が六つになられた年にあえなくおなくなりなさるし、それからのわしの苦労は一通りではありませなんだ。あの頃は、上様が今日のようなご身分におなり遊ばそうとは、誰も思うておりませなんだ。[…]「お名前は存じませなんだが、あの人ならば、わたくしも感心しておりました」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%9F%B3%E6%B2%A2%E9%A8%92%E5%8B%95&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E6%99%82%E4%BB%A3%E5%B0%8F%E8%AA%AC%E6%96%87%E5%BA%AB%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=19%2C+39%2C+126&amp;rft.pub=Fujimi+Shob%C5%8D&amp;rft.date=1989-02-01&amp;rft.aulast=Kaionji&amp;rft.aufirst=Ch%C5%8Dgor%C5%8D&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1079" id="mwNhg"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1079" id="mwNhk"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1079" id="mwNho"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-180" id="cite_note-180" data-mw-footnote-number="168"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwNhs"><a href="#cite_ref-180" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwNhw"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwNh0">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-180" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1082" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwNh4" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「——そのようなわけで、あのレインと申す<ruby>輩<rp>(</rp><rt>やから</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がドラゴンスレイヤーなのはもはや確実です。我が配下を一撃で倒したあの力、<ruby>侮<rp>(</rp><rt>あなど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ることは出来ないかと。あのような者がついているとなると、王女暗殺は最初から暗殺ギルドなどの手に負える仕事ではありませなんだ。我らの判断ミスです」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:プロローグ 密談&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:レイン　世界を君に&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=4&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Takumi&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Yoshino&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=10 December 2006&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=AlphaPolis&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;edition=2nd&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFYoshino2006" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1082">Yoshino, Takumi (10 December 2006).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNh8">プロローグ 密談</bdi>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNiA">レイン　世界を君に</bdi> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNiE">&nbsp;</span>4 (2nd<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNiI">&nbsp;</span>ed.). AlphaPolis.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNiM">「——そのようなわけで、あのレインと申す<ruby id="mwNiQ">輩<rp id="mwNiU">(</rp><rt id="mwNiY">やから</rt><rp id="mwNic">)</rp></ruby>がドラゴンスレイヤーなのはもはや確実です。我が配下を一撃で倒したあの力、<ruby id="mwNig">侮<rp id="mwNik">(</rp><rt id="mwNio">あなど</rt><rp id="mwNis">)</rp></ruby>ることは出来ないかと。あのような者がついているとなると、王女暗殺は最初から暗殺ギルドなどの手に負える仕事ではありませなんだ。我らの判断ミスです」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E3%83%97%E3%83%AD%E3%83%AD%E3%83%BC%E3%82%B0+%E5%AF%86%E8%AB%87&amp;rft.btitle=%E3%83%AC%E3%82%A4%E3%83%B3%E3%80%80%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E3%82%92%E5%90%9B%E3%81%AB&amp;rft.edition=2nd&amp;rft.pub=AlphaPolis&amp;rft.date=2006-12-10&amp;rft.aulast=Yoshino&amp;rft.aufirst=Takumi&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1082" id="mwNiw"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1082" id="mwNi0"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1082" id="mwNi4"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-181" id="cite_note-181" data-mw-footnote-number="169"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwNi8"><a href="#cite_ref-181" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwNjA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwNjE">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-181" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1085" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwNjI" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:『<ruby>好<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きは<ruby>好<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きでしたから<ruby>無<rp>(</rp><rt>む</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>論<rp>(</rp><rt>ろん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>嫌<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>やぢやありませなんだけど、<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>といつたつてまだ<ruby>漸<rp>(</rp><rt>や</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つと十六だつたんですもの、<span style='text-emphasis:open sesame'>ぼか〱ちやん</span>の<ruby>方<rp>(</rp><rt>はう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>當然<rp>(</rp><rt>あたりまへ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でせう。[…]』&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pp=111–112&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1018359/1/58&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:三、<ruby>蘇<rp>(</rp><rt>そ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>生<rp>(</rp><rt>せい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>闇<rp>(</rp><rt>あん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>鬪<rp>(</rp><rt>たう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>へ&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:<ruby>最終<rp>(</rp><rt>をはり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まで<ruby>忍<rp>(</rp><rt>しの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べ&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Takako&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Katayama&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|正愛社}}&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=1 December 1925&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Yokohama]], [[Kanagawa Prefecture|Kanagawa]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFKatayama1925" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1085">Katayama, Takako (1 December 1925).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNjM">三、<ruby id="mwNjQ">蘇<rp id="mwNjU">(</rp><rt id="mwNjY">そ</rt><rp id="mwNjc">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNjg">生<rp id="mwNjk">(</rp><rt id="mwNjo">せい</rt><rp id="mwNjs">)</rp></ruby>から<ruby id="mwNjw">闇<rp id="mwNj0">(</rp><rt id="mwNj4">あん</rt><rp id="mwNj8">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNkA">鬪<rp id="mwNkE">(</rp><rt id="mwNkI">たう</rt><rp id="mwNkM">)</rp></ruby>へ</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1018359/1/58" class="external text" id="mwNkQ"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwNkU"><ruby id="mwNkY">最終<rp id="mwNkc">(</rp><rt id="mwNkg">をはり</rt><rp id="mwNkk">)</rp></ruby>まで<ruby id="mwNko">忍<rp id="mwNks">(</rp><rt id="mwNkw">しの</rt><rp id="mwNk0">)</rp></ruby>べ</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yokohama" title="Yokohama" id="mwNk4">Yokohama</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kanagawa_Prefecture" title="Kanagawa Prefecture" id="mwNk8">Kanagawa</a>: <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwNlA"><span lang="ja" id="mwNlE">正愛社</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwNlI">. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNlM">&nbsp;</span><span class="nowrap" id="mwNlQ">111–</span>112.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNlU">『<ruby id="mwNlY">好<rp id="mwNlc">(</rp><rt id="mwNlg">す</rt><rp id="mwNlk">)</rp></ruby>きは<ruby id="mwNlo">好<rp id="mwNls">(</rp><rt id="mwNlw">す</rt><rp id="mwNl0">)</rp></ruby>きでしたから<ruby id="mwNl4">無<rp id="mwNl8">(</rp><rt id="mwNmA">む</rt><rp id="mwNmE">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNmI">論<rp id="mwNmM">(</rp><rt id="mwNmQ">ろん</rt><rp id="mwNmU">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNmY">嫌<rp id="mwNmc">(</rp><rt id="mwNmg">い</rt><rp id="mwNmk">)</rp></ruby>やぢやありませなんだけど、<ruby id="mwNmo">何<rp id="mwNms">(</rp><rt id="mwNmw">なん</rt><rp id="mwNm0">)</rp></ruby>といつたつてまだ<ruby id="mwNm4">漸<rp id="mwNm8">(</rp><rt id="mwNnA">や</rt><rp id="mwNnE">)</rp></ruby>つと十六だつたんですもの、<span style="text-emphasis:open sesame" id="mwNnI">ぼか〱ちやん</span>の<ruby id="mwNnM">方<rp id="mwNnQ">(</rp><rt id="mwNnU">はう</rt><rp id="mwNnY">)</rp></ruby>が<ruby id="mwNnc">當然<rp id="mwNng">(</rp><rt id="mwNnk">あたりまへ</rt><rp id="mwNno">)</rp></ruby>でせう。[…]』</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E4%B8%89%E3%80%81%3Cruby%3E%E8%98%87%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%9D%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E7%94%9F%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%9B%E3%81%84%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%E3%81%8B%E3%82%89%3Cruby%3E%E9%97%87%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%82%E3%82%93%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E9%AC%AA%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%9F%E3%81%86%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%E3%81%B8&amp;rft.btitle=%3Cruby%3E%E6%9C%80%E7%B5%82%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%82%92%E3%81%AF%E3%82%8A%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%E3%81%BE%E3%81%A7%3Cruby%3E%E5%BF%8D%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%97%E3%81%AE%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%E3%81%B9&amp;rft.place=Yokohama%2C+Kanagawa&amp;rft.pages=111-112&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E6%AD%A3%E6%84%9B%E7%A4%BE%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.date=1925-12-01&amp;rft.aulast=Katayama&amp;rft.aufirst=Takako&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1018359%2F1%2F58&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1085" id="mwNns"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1085" id="mwNnw"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1085" id="mwNn0"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-yamamoto-1996-182" id="cite_note-yamamoto-1996-182" data-mw-footnote-number="170"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwNn4"><a href="#cite_ref-yamamoto-1996_182-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwNn8"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwNoA">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-yamamoto-1996-182" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1088" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwNoE" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=The new old gentleman says:<br/>“If you please, let me explain. Nobody can read my hand but my brother there—so he copies for me. It’s ''his'' hand you’ve got there, not mine.”&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:新しく来たほうの紳士が言った。<br/>「よろしければ、説明させてもらいたい。私の字を読めるのは、ここの私の弟だけで――私の清書をしてくれるのです。あなたがお持ちの手紙は<span style=text-emphasis:sesame>弟の</span>筆跡で私のじゃありませなんだ」&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Mark Twain&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Mark&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Twain&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:第二十九章　ほんものとにせもの――王様、金袋の紛失を説明する――筆跡の疑問――死骸を掘り返す――ハック、逃げる&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=Chapter XXIX. Contested Relationship.—The King Explains the Loss.—A Question of Handwriting.—Digging up the Corpse.—Huck Escapes.&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series=Mark Twain Collection&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=7&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Yamamoto&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Chōichi&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Sairyusha&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=[[Adventures of Huckleberry Finn]]&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:ハックルベリィ・フィンの冒険&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=30 March 1996&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFTwain1996" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1088"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Twain" title="Mark Twain" id="mwNoI">Twain, Mark</a> (30 March 1996). "Chapter XXIX. Contested Relationship.—The King Explains the Loss.—A Question of Handwriting.—Digging up the Corpse.—Huck Escapes." <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNoM">第二十九章　ほんものとにせもの――王様、金袋の紛失を説明する――筆跡の疑問――死骸を掘り返す――ハック、逃げる</bdi>. <i id="mwNoQ"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adventures_of_Huckleberry_Finn" title="Adventures of Huckleberry Finn" id="mwNoU">Adventures of Huckleberry Finn</a></i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNoY">ハックルベリィ・フィンの冒険</bdi>. Mark Twain Collection (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNoc">&nbsp;</span>7. Translated by Yamamoto, Chōichi. Sairyusha. <q id="mwNog">The new old gentleman says:<br id="mwNok">"If you please, let me explain. Nobody can read my hand but my brother there—so he copies for me. It's <i id="mwNoo">his</i> hand you've got there, not mine."<span class="cs1-kern-right" id="mwNos"></span></q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNow">新しく来たほうの紳士が言った。<br id="mwNo0">「よろしければ、説明させてもらいたい。私の字を読めるのは、ここの私の弟だけで――私の清書をしてくれるのです。あなたがお持ちの手紙は<span style="text-emphasis:sesame" id="mwNo4">弟の</span>筆跡で私のじゃありませなんだ」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=Chapter+XXIX.+Contested+Relationship.%E2%80%94The+King+Explains+the+Loss.%E2%80%94A+Question+of+Handwriting.%E2%80%94Digging+up+the+Corpse.%E2%80%94Huck+Escapes.+%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E4%B9%9D%E7%AB%A0%E3%80%80%E3%81%BB%E3%82%93%E3%82%82%E3%81%AE%E3%81%A8%E3%81%AB%E3%81%9B%E3%82%82%E3%81%AE%E2%80%95%E2%80%95%E7%8E%8B%E6%A7%98%E3%80%81%E9%87%91%E8%A2%8B%E3%81%AE%E7%B4%9B%E5%A4%B1%E3%82%92%E8%AA%AC%E6%98%8E%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B%E2%80%95%E2%80%95%E7%AD%86%E8%B7%A1%E3%81%AE%E7%96%91%E5%95%8F%E2%80%95%E2%80%95%E6%AD%BB%E9%AA%B8%E3%82%92%E6%8E%98%E3%82%8A%E8%BF%94%E3%81%99%E2%80%95%E2%80%95%E3%83%8F%E3%83%83%E3%82%AF%E3%80%81%E9%80%83%E3%81%92%E3%82%8B&amp;rft.btitle=Adventures+of+Huckleberry+Finn+%E3%83%8F%E3%83%83%E3%82%AF%E3%83%AB%E3%83%99%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A3%E3%83%BB%E3%83%95%E3%82%A3%E3%83%B3%E3%81%AE%E5%86%92%E9%99%BA&amp;rft.series=Mark+Twain+Collection&amp;rft.pub=Sairyusha&amp;rft.date=1996-03-30&amp;rft.aulast=Twain&amp;rft.aufirst=Mark&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1088" id="mwNo8"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1088" id="mwNpA"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1088" id="mwNpE"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-184" id="cite_note-184" data-mw-footnote-number="171"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwNpI"><a href="#cite_ref-184" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwNpM"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwNpQ">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-184" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1099" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwNpU" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:もしほんとうに、死というものが、（事実そうなのでございましょうが、）宿命の定める避け難い必然でありませば、かくかくの時間にかくかくの死方をするということは、神の聖なるみ心だと〔<ruby>一<rp>(</rp><rt>いつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>半<rp>(</rp><rt>ぱん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は神々の思召し、他半は我々の自由意志に属するものと〕考えて居ります。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=142&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|岩波文庫}}&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:第二三章 嵐が終り、パニュルジュが陽気者ぶりを見せること&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:第四之書 パンタグリュエル物語&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=4&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Iwanami Shoten&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=The Fourth Book: The Tales of [[Pantagruel]]&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Le QVART LIVRE ''des faicts et dicts Heroıques du bon Pantagruel.''&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=François&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Rabelais&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=François Rabelais&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Kazuo&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Watanabe&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=20 July 1975&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;orig-date=6 November 1974&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;edition=2nd&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Chiyoda, Tokyo]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFRabelais1975" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1099"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/François_Rabelais" title="François Rabelais" id="mwNpY">Rabelais, François</a> (20 July 1975) [6 November 1974].  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNpc">第二三章 嵐が終り、パニュルジュが陽気者ぶりを見せること</bdi>. <i id="mwNpg">Le QVART LIVRE </i>des faicts et dicts Heroıques du bon Pantagruel.<i id="mwNpk"><span id="mwNpo"></span></i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNps">第四之書 パンタグリュエル物語</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNpw">[</span><i id="mwNp0">The Fourth Book: The Tales of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pantagruel" title="Pantagruel" class="mw-redirect" id="mwNp4">Pantagruel</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNp8">]</span>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwNqA"><span lang="ja" id="mwNqE">岩波文庫</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwNqI"> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNqM">&nbsp;</span>4. Translated by Watanabe, Kazuo (2nd<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNqQ">&nbsp;</span>ed.). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiyoda,_Tokyo" title="Chiyoda, Tokyo" id="mwNqU">Chiyoda, Tokyo</a>: Iwanami Shoten. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNqY">&nbsp;</span>142.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNqc">もしほんとうに、死というものが、（事実そうなのでございましょうが、）宿命の定める避け難い必然でありませば、かくかくの時間にかくかくの死方をするということは、神の聖なるみ心だと〔<ruby id="mwNqg">一<rp id="mwNqk">(</rp><rt id="mwNqo">いつ</rt><rp id="mwNqs">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNqw">半<rp id="mwNq0">(</rp><rt id="mwNq4">ぱん</rt><rp id="mwNq8">)</rp></ruby>は神々の思召し、他半は我々の自由意志に属するものと〕考えて居ります。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E4%B8%89%E7%AB%A0+%E5%B5%90%E3%81%8C%E7%B5%82%E3%82%8A%E3%80%81%E3%83%91%E3%83%8B%E3%83%A5%E3%83%AB%E3%82%B8%E3%83%A5%E3%81%8C%E9%99%BD%E6%B0%97%E8%80%85%E3%81%B6%E3%82%8A%E3%82%92%E8%A6%8B%E3%81%9B%E3%82%8B%E3%81%93%E3%81%A8&amp;rft.btitle=Le+QVART+LIVRE+des+faicts+et+dicts+Hero%C4%B1ques+du+bon+Pantagruel.+%E7%AC%AC%E5%9B%9B%E4%B9%8B%E6%9B%B8+%E3%83%91%E3%83%B3%E3%82%BF%E3%82%B0%E3%83%AA%E3%83%A5%E3%82%A8%E3%83%AB%E7%89%A9%E8%AA%9E&amp;rft.place=Chiyoda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E5%B2%A9%E6%B3%A2%E6%96%87%E5%BA%AB%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=142&amp;rft.edition=2nd&amp;rft.pub=Iwanami+Shoten&amp;rft.date=1975-07-20&amp;rft.aulast=Rabelais&amp;rft.aufirst=Fran%C3%A7ois&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1099" id="mwNrA"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1099" id="mwNrE"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1099" id="mwNrI"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-FOOTNOTEMartin2004555-185" id="cite_note-FOOTNOTEMartin2004555-185" data-mw-footnote-number="172"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwNrM"><a href="#cite_ref-FOOTNOTEMartin2004555_185-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwNrQ"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwNrU">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEMartin2004555-185" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#CITEREFMartin2004" class="mw-selflink-fragment" id="mwNrY">Martin (2004)</a>, p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNrc">&nbsp;</span>555.<span class="error harv-error" style="display: none; font-size:100%" id="mwNrg"> sfnp error: no target: CITEREFMartin2004 (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category:Harv_and_Sfn_template_errors" title="Category:Harv and Sfn template errors" id="mwNrk">help</a>)</span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Harv_and_Sfn_no-target_errors" id="mwNro"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-186" id="cite_note-186" data-mw-footnote-number="173"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwNrs"><a href="#cite_ref-186" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwNrw"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwNr0">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-186" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1107" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwNr4" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:視覚障がい者との議論で、歩行支援であれば1ｍ程度の位置推定精度が望ましいという意見がありました。[…]提案手法ではあれば、歩行経路さえ定めれば、支援者は視覚障がい者と同行する必要はなく、それに先立って時間のある時にその経路に沿って映像を撮影して来るだけでよいのです。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=41&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.jstage.jst.go.jp/article/jais/22/1/22_40/_article/-char/ja/&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Kameda&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Yoshinari&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal=福祉のまちづくり研究 &quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:視覚障がい者の外出のための歩行者ナビゲーション支援技術の研究&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:福祉のまちづくり研究&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=22&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=1&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=2020 &quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;doi=10.18975/jais.22.1_40&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFKameda2020" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1107">Kameda, Yoshinari (2020). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.jstage.jst.go.jp/article/jais/22/1/22_40/_article/-char/ja/" class="external text" id="mwNr8"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwNsA">視覚障がい者の外出のための歩行者ナビゲーション支援技術の研究</bdi></a>. <i id="mwNsE">福祉のまちづくり研究</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNsI">福祉のまちづくり研究</bdi> (in Japanese). <b id="mwNsM">22</b> (1): 41. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doi_(identifier)" title="Doi (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwNsQ">doi</a>:<a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://doi.org/10.18975%2Fjais.22.1_40" class="external text" id="mwNsU">10.18975/jais.22.1_40</a>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNsY">視覚障がい者との議論で、歩行支援であれば1ｍ程度の位置推定精度が望ましいという意見がありました。[…]提案手法ではあれば、歩行経路さえ定めれば、支援者は視覚障がい者と同行する必要はなく、それに先立って時間のある時にその経路に沿って映像を撮影して来るだけでよいのです。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=%E7%A6%8F%E7%A5%89%E3%81%AE%E3%81%BE%E3%81%A1%E3%81%A5%E3%81%8F%E3%82%8A%E7%A0%94%E7%A9%B6&amp;rft.atitle=%E8%A6%96%E8%A6%9A%E9%9A%9C%E3%81%8C%E3%81%84%E8%80%85%E3%81%AE%E5%A4%96%E5%87%BA%E3%81%AE%E3%81%9F%E3%82%81%E3%81%AE%E6%AD%A9%E8%A1%8C%E8%80%85%E3%83%8A%E3%83%93%E3%82%B2%E3%83%BC%E3%82%B7%E3%83%A7%E3%83%B3%E6%94%AF%E6%8F%B4%E6%8A%80%E8%A1%93%E3%81%AE%E7%A0%94%E7%A9%B6&amp;rft.volume=22&amp;rft.issue=1&amp;rft.pages=41&amp;rft.date=2020&amp;rft_id=info%3Adoi%2F10.18975%2Fjais.22.1_40&amp;rft.aulast=Kameda&amp;rft.aufirst=Yoshinari&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.jstage.jst.go.jp%2Farticle%2Fjais%2F22%2F1%2F22_40%2F_article%2F-char%2Fja%2F&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1107" id="mwNsc"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1107" id="mwNsg"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1107" id="mwNsk"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-187" id="cite_note-187" data-mw-footnote-number="174"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwNso"><a href="#cite_ref-187" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwNss"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwNsw">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-187" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1112" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwNs0" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:<ruby>此<rp></rp><rt>この</rt><rp></rp></ruby><ruby>火<rp></rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp></rp></ruby><ruby>箸<rp></rp><rt>ばし</rt><rp></rp></ruby>は<ruby>羽<rp></rp><rt>は</rt><rp></rp></ruby><ruby>箒<rp></rp><rt>ばうき</rt><rp></rp></ruby>と、<ruby>其<rp></rp><rt>その</rt><rp></rp></ruby><ruby>長<rp></rp><rt>ちやう</rt><rp></rp></ruby><ruby>短<rp></rp><rt>たん</rt><rp></rp></ruby>、<ruby>大<rp></rp><rt>たい</rt><rp></rp></ruby><ruby>抵<rp></rp><rt>てい</rt><rp></rp></ruby><ruby>同<rp></rp><rt>どう</rt><rp></rp></ruby><ruby>樣<rp></rp><rt>やう</rt><rp></rp></ruby>のものではりますれば、<ruby>前<rp></rp><rt>まへ</rt><rp></rp></ruby>の<ruby>端<rp></rp><rt>はし</rt><rp></rp></ruby>を<ruby>揃<rp></rp><rt>そろ</rt><rp></rp></ruby>へる<ruby>樣<rp></rp><rt>やう</rt><rp></rp></ruby>に<ruby>並<rp></rp><rt>なら</rt><rp></rp></ruby>べます。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/949480/1/104&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pages=180–181&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:第參編 炭手前&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:通俗 茶の湯早まなび&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=26 April 1914&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Tanaka&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Senshō&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|茶禪房}}&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Hongō, Tokyo]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFTanaka1914" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1112">Tanaka, Senshō (26 April 1914).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNs4">第參編 炭手前</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/949480/1/104" class="external text" id="mwNs8"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwNtA">通俗 茶の湯早まなび</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hongō,_Tokyo" title="Hongō, Tokyo" id="mwNtE">Hongō, Tokyo</a>: <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwNtI"><span lang="ja" id="mwNtM">茶禪房</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwNtQ">. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwNtU">&nbsp;</span><span class="nowrap" id="mwNtY">180–</span>181.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNtc"><ruby id="mwNtg">此<rp id="mwNtk"></rp><rt id="mwNto">この</rt><rp id="mwNts"></rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNtw">火<rp id="mwNt0"></rp><rt id="mwNt4">ひ</rt><rp id="mwNt8"></rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNuA">箸<rp id="mwNuE"></rp><rt id="mwNuI">ばし</rt><rp id="mwNuM"></rp></ruby>は<ruby id="mwNuQ">羽<rp id="mwNuU"></rp><rt id="mwNuY">は</rt><rp id="mwNuc"></rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNug">箒<rp id="mwNuk"></rp><rt id="mwNuo">ばうき</rt><rp id="mwNus"></rp></ruby>と、<ruby id="mwNuw">其<rp id="mwNu0"></rp><rt id="mwNu4">その</rt><rp id="mwNu8"></rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNvA">長<rp id="mwNvE"></rp><rt id="mwNvI">ちやう</rt><rp id="mwNvM"></rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNvQ">短<rp id="mwNvU"></rp><rt id="mwNvY">たん</rt><rp id="mwNvc"></rp></ruby>、<ruby id="mwNvg">大<rp id="mwNvk"></rp><rt id="mwNvo">たい</rt><rp id="mwNvs"></rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNvw">抵<rp id="mwNv0"></rp><rt id="mwNv4">てい</rt><rp id="mwNv8"></rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNwA">同<rp id="mwNwE"></rp><rt id="mwNwI">どう</rt><rp id="mwNwM"></rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNwQ">樣<rp id="mwNwU"></rp><rt id="mwNwY">やう</rt><rp id="mwNwc"></rp></ruby>のものではりますれば、<ruby id="mwNwg">前<rp id="mwNwk"></rp><rt id="mwNwo">まへ</rt><rp id="mwNws"></rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwNww">端<rp id="mwNw0"></rp><rt id="mwNw4">はし</rt><rp id="mwNw8"></rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwNxA">揃<rp id="mwNxE"></rp><rt id="mwNxI">そろ</rt><rp id="mwNxM"></rp></ruby>へる<ruby id="mwNxQ">樣<rp id="mwNxU"></rp><rt id="mwNxY">やう</rt><rp id="mwNxc"></rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwNxg">並<rp id="mwNxk"></rp><rt id="mwNxo">なら</rt><rp id="mwNxs"></rp></ruby>べます。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E7%AC%AC%E5%8F%83%E7%B7%A8+%E7%82%AD%E6%89%8B%E5%89%8D&amp;rft.btitle=%E9%80%9A%E4%BF%97+%E8%8C%B6%E3%81%AE%E6%B9%AF%E6%97%A9%E3%81%BE%E3%81%AA%E3%81%B3&amp;rft.place=Hong%C5%8D%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=180-181&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E8%8C%B6%E7%A6%AA%E6%88%BF%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.date=1914-04-26&amp;rft.aulast=Tanaka&amp;rft.aufirst=Sensh%C5%8D&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F949480%2F1%2F104&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1112" id="mwNxw"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1112" id="mwNx0"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1112" id="mwNx4"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-188" id="cite_note-188" data-mw-footnote-number="175"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwNx8"><a href="#cite_ref-188" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwNyA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwNyE">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-188" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1115" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwNyI" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「この度の闘いにあなたは含まれておりませんが、後日、私の弟との決闘の場を設けましょう。友人を公言なさるアマディスの仇敵でありますれば、ひとたび彼と当たれば二度とそのような減らず口はきけますまい。」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:第六十一章 煮えたぎる湖の島へ戦さをしかけて囚われのアルバン・デ・ノルガーレス王とアングリオテ・デ・エストラバウスを解放したい意向をリスアルテ王が騎士達と語らった次第そんなおりしも海からやってきた巨人の女がアマディスがアルダン・カニレオと闘うように王妃と廷臣の前で国王に要請し、アルダン・カニレオが敗れれば島は国王に恭順を示し、救出を待っている囚人を解放しよう。もしまたアマディスが敗れれば要求はただひとつ、その首級をマダシマのもとへ送ることだと言上した経緯&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:アマディス・デ・ガウラ&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Amadís de Gaula&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Garci&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Rodríguez de Montalvo&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Garci Rodríguez de Montalvo&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Kunikazu&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Iwane&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Sairyusha Publishing Company&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=17 September 2019&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFRodríguez_de_Montalvo2019" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1115"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Garci_Rodríguez_de_Montalvo" title="Garci Rodríguez de Montalvo" id="mwNyM">Rodríguez de Montalvo, Garci</a> (17 September 2019).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNyQ">第六十一章 煮えたぎる湖の島へ戦さをしかけて囚われのアルバン・デ・ノルガーレス王とアングリオテ・デ・エストラバウスを解放したい意向をリスアルテ王が騎士達と語らった次第そんなおりしも海からやってきた巨人の女がアマディスがアルダン・カニレオと闘うように王妃と廷臣の前で国王に要請し、アルダン・カニレオが敗れれば島は国王に恭順を示し、救出を待っている囚人を解放しよう。もしまたアマディスが敗れれば要求はただひとつ、その首級をマダシマのもとへ送ることだと言上した経緯</bdi>. <i id="mwNyU">Amadís de Gaula</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNyY">アマディス・デ・ガウラ</bdi> (in Japanese). Translated by Iwane, Kunikazu. Sairyusha Publishing Company.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNyc">「この度の闘いにあなたは含まれておりませんが、後日、私の弟との決闘の場を設けましょう。友人を公言なさるアマディスの仇敵でありますれば、ひとたび彼と当たれば二度とそのような減らず口はきけますまい。」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E7%AC%AC%E5%85%AD%E5%8D%81%E4%B8%80%E7%AB%A0+%E7%85%AE%E3%81%88%E3%81%9F%E3%81%8E%E3%82%8B%E6%B9%96%E3%81%AE%E5%B3%B6%E3%81%B8%E6%88%A6%E3%81%95%E3%82%92%E3%81%97%E3%81%8B%E3%81%91%E3%81%A6%E5%9B%9A%E3%82%8F%E3%82%8C%E3%81%AE%E3%82%A2%E3%83%AB%E3%83%90%E3%83%B3%E3%83%BB%E3%83%87%E3%83%BB%E3%83%8E%E3%83%AB%E3%82%AC%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%82%B9%E7%8E%8B%E3%81%A8%E3%82%A2%E3%83%B3%E3%82%B0%E3%83%AA%E3%82%AA%E3%83%86%E3%83%BB%E3%83%87%E3%83%BB%E3%82%A8%E3%82%B9%E3%83%88%E3%83%A9%E3%83%90%E3%82%A6%E3%82%B9%E3%82%92%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE%E3%81%97%E3%81%9F%E3%81%84%E6%84%8F%E5%90%91%E3%82%92%E3%83%AA%E3%82%B9%E3%82%A2%E3%83%AB%E3%83%86%E7%8E%8B%E3%81%8C%E9%A8%8E%E5%A3%AB%E9%81%94%E3%81%A8%E8%AA%9E%E3%82%89%E3%81%A3%E3%81%9F%E6%AC%A1%E7%AC%AC%E3%81%9D%E3%82%93%E3%81%AA%E3%81%8A%E3%82%8A%E3%81%97%E3%82%82%E6%B5%B7%E3%81%8B%E3%82%89%E3%82%84%E3%81%A3%E3%81%A6%E3%81%8D%E3%81%9F%E5%B7%A8%E4%BA%BA%E3%81%AE%E5%A5%B3%E3%81%8C%E3%82%A2%E3%83%9E%E3%83%87%E3%82%A3%E3%82%B9%E3%81%8C%E3%82%A2%E3%83%AB%E3%83%80%E3%83%B3%E3%83%BB%E3%82%AB%E3%83%8B%E3%83%AC%E3%82%AA%E3%81%A8%E9%97%98%E3%81%86%E3%82%88%E3%81%86%E3%81%AB%E7%8E%8B%E5%A6%83%E3%81%A8%E5%BB%B7%E8%87%A3%E3%81%AE%E5%89%8D%E3%81%A7%E5%9B%BD%E7%8E%8B%E3%81%AB%E8%A6%81%E8%AB%8B%E3%81%97%E3%80%81%E3%82%A2%E3%83%AB%E3%83%80%E3%83%B3%E3%83%BB%E3%82%AB%E3%83%8B%E3%83%AC%E3%82%AA%E3%81%8C%E6%95%97%E3%82%8C%E3%82%8C%E3%81%B0%E5%B3%B6%E3%81%AF%E5%9B%BD%E7%8E%8B%E3%81%AB%E6%81%AD%E9%A0%86%E3%82%92%E7%A4%BA%E3%81%97%E3%80%81%E6%95%91%E5%87%BA%E3%82%92%E5%BE%85%E3%81%A3%E3%81%A6%E3%81%84%E3%82%8B%E5%9B%9A%E4%BA%BA%E3%82%92%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE%E3%81%97%E3%82%88%E3%81%86%E3%80%82%E3%82%82%E3%81%97%E3%81%BE%E3%81%9F%E3%82%A2%E3%83%9E%E3%83%87%E3%82%A3%E3%82%B9%E3%81%8C%E6%95%97%E3%82%8C%E3%82%8C%E3%81%B0%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E3%81%AF%E3%81%9F%E3%81%A0%E3%81%B2%E3%81%A8%E3%81%A4%E3%80%81%E3%81%9D%E3%81%AE%E9%A6%96%E7%B4%9A%E3%82%92%E3%83%9E%E3%83%80%E3%82%B7%E3%83%9E%E3%81%AE%E3%82%82%E3%81%A8%E3%81%B8%E9%80%81%E3%82%8B%E3%81%93%E3%81%A8%E3%81%A0%E3%81%A8%E8%A8%80%E4%B8%8A%E3%81%97%E3%81%9F%E7%B5%8C%E7%B7%AF&amp;rft.btitle=Amad%C3%ADs+de+Gaula+%E3%82%A2%E3%83%9E%E3%83%87%E3%82%A3%E3%82%B9%E3%83%BB%E3%83%87%E3%83%BB%E3%82%AC%E3%82%A6%E3%83%A9&amp;rft.pub=Sairyusha+Publishing+Company&amp;rft.date=2019-09-17&amp;rft.aulast=Rodr%C3%ADguez+de+Montalvo&amp;rft.aufirst=Garci&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1115" id="mwNyg"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1115" id="mwNyk"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1115" id="mwNyo"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-189" id="cite_note-189" data-mw-footnote-number="176"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwNys"><a href="#cite_ref-189" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwNyw"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwNy0">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-189" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1118" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwNy4" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「アルサルめの抵抗は想定外でしたが……ええ、ええ、結果は上々でございます。なにが〝銀穹の勇者〟でしょうか。星空は星空でも、あやつこそ<ruby>凶<rp></rp><rt>まがつ</rt><rp></rp></ruby><ruby>星<rp></rp><rt>ぼし</rt><rp></rp></ruby>の申し子。世に不幸を撒き散らす悪鬼でありますれば。国外へ追放できたのは、まことによきことと存じます」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:●3 宮廷聖術士と、辺境の村の災難&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:最終兵器勇者 ～異世界で魔王を倒した後も大人しくしていたのに、いきなり処刑されそうになったので反逆します。国を捨ててスローライフの旅に出たのですが、なんか成り行きで新世界の魔王になりそうです～&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=TO Books&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=20 January 2025&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Kunihiro&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Sengi&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFKunihiro2025" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1118">Kunihiro, Sengi (20 January 2025).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNy8">●3 宮廷聖術士と、辺境の村の災難</bdi>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNzA">最終兵器勇者 ～異世界で魔王を倒した後も大人しくしていたのに、いきなり処刑されそうになったので反逆します。国を捨ててスローライフの旅に出たのですが、なんか成り行きで新世界の魔王になりそうです～</bdi> (in Japanese). TO Books.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwNzE">「アルサルめの抵抗は想定外でしたが……ええ、ええ、結果は上々でございます。なにが〝銀穹の勇者〟でしょうか。星空は星空でも、あやつこそ<ruby id="mwNzI">凶<rp id="mwNzM"></rp><rt id="mwNzQ">まがつ</rt><rp id="mwNzU"></rp></ruby><ruby id="mwNzY">星<rp id="mwNzc"></rp><rt id="mwNzg">ぼし</rt><rp id="mwNzk"></rp></ruby>の申し子。世に不幸を撒き散らす悪鬼でありますれば。国外へ追放できたのは、まことによきことと存じます」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E2%97%8F3+%E5%AE%AE%E5%BB%B7%E8%81%96%E8%A1%93%E5%A3%AB%E3%81%A8%E3%80%81%E8%BE%BA%E5%A2%83%E3%81%AE%E6%9D%91%E3%81%AE%E7%81%BD%E9%9B%A3&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%9C%80%E7%B5%82%E5%85%B5%E5%99%A8%E5%8B%87%E8%80%85+%EF%BD%9E%E7%95%B0%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E3%81%A7%E9%AD%94%E7%8E%8B%E3%82%92%E5%80%92%E3%81%97%E3%81%9F%E5%BE%8C%E3%82%82%E5%A4%A7%E4%BA%BA%E3%81%97%E3%81%8F%E3%81%97%E3%81%A6%E3%81%84%E3%81%9F%E3%81%AE%E3%81%AB%E3%80%81%E3%81%84%E3%81%8D%E3%81%AA%E3%82%8A%E5%87%A6%E5%88%91%E3%81%95%E3%82%8C%E3%81%9D%E3%81%86%E3%81%AB%E3%81%AA%E3%81%A3%E3%81%9F%E3%81%AE%E3%81%A7%E5%8F%8D%E9%80%86%E3%81%97%E3%81%BE%E3%81%99%E3%80%82%E5%9B%BD%E3%82%92%E6%8D%A8%E3%81%A6%E3%81%A6%E3%82%B9%E3%83%AD%E3%83%BC%E3%83%A9%E3%82%A4%E3%83%95%E3%81%AE%E6%97%85%E3%81%AB%E5%87%BA%E3%81%9F%E3%81%AE%E3%81%A7%E3%81%99%E3%81%8C%E3%80%81%E3%81%AA%E3%82%93%E3%81%8B%E6%88%90%E3%82%8A%E8%A1%8C%E3%81%8D%E3%81%A7%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E3%81%AE%E9%AD%94%E7%8E%8B%E3%81%AB%E3%81%AA%E3%82%8A%E3%81%9D%E3%81%86%E3%81%A7%E3%81%99%EF%BD%9E&amp;rft.pub=TO+Books&amp;rft.date=2025-01-20&amp;rft.aulast=Kunihiro&amp;rft.aufirst=Sengi&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1118" id="mwNzo"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1118" id="mwNzs"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1118" id="mwNzw"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-190" id="cite_note-190" data-mw-footnote-number="177"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwNz0"><a href="#cite_ref-190" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwNz4"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwNz8">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-190" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1123" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwN0A" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:例えば第3表で，仮に 3{{prime}} での β 線の吸収程度が 5{{prime}} に於けると同じではあるならば，3{{prime}} の C.P.M. は 29×(17.5/10.3)=49 となる筈であるが，実測値は 42 である．&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=565&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.jstage.jst.go.jp/article/nogeikagaku1924/34/7/34_7_563/_pdf&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last1=Yoshiwara&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first1=Ichirō&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last2=Sugisaki&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first2=Akio&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last3=Kandatsu&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first3=Makoto&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:大腸内に於ける硫酸バリウム及び酸化クロームの移動について* （消化と吸収の研究法の検討 第3報）&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:日本農芸化学会誌&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=34&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=7&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=July 1960&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFYoshiwaraSugisakiKandatsu1960" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1123">Yoshiwara, Ichirō; Sugisaki, Akio; Kandatsu, Makoto (July 1960). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.jstage.jst.go.jp/article/nogeikagaku1924/34/7/34_7_563/_pdf" class="external text" id="mwN0E"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwN0I">大腸内に於ける硫酸バリウム及び酸化クロームの移動について* （消化と吸収の研究法の検討 第3報）</bdi></a>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwN0M">日本農芸化学会誌</bdi> (in Japanese). <b id="mwN0Q">34</b> (7): 565.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwN0U">例えば第3表で，仮に 3<span class="nowrap" style="padding-left:0.15em;" id="mwN0Y">′</span> での β 線の吸収程度が 5<span class="nowrap" style="padding-left:0.15em;" id="mwN0c">′</span> に於けると同じではあるならば，3<span class="nowrap" style="padding-left:0.15em;" id="mwN0g">′</span> の C.P.M. は 29×(17.5/10.3)=49 となる筈であるが，実測値は 42 である．</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E5%A4%A7%E8%85%B8%E5%86%85%E3%81%AB%E6%96%BC%E3%81%91%E3%82%8B%E7%A1%AB%E9%85%B8%E3%83%90%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A6%E3%83%A0%E5%8F%8A%E3%81%B3%E9%85%B8%E5%8C%96%E3%82%AF%E3%83%AD%E3%83%BC%E3%83%A0%E3%81%AE%E7%A7%BB%E5%8B%95%E3%81%AB%E3%81%A4%E3%81%84%E3%81%A6%2A+%EF%BC%88%E6%B6%88%E5%8C%96%E3%81%A8%E5%90%B8%E5%8F%8E%E3%81%AE%E7%A0%94%E7%A9%B6%E6%B3%95%E3%81%AE%E6%A4%9C%E8%A8%8E+%E7%AC%AC3%E5%A0%B1%EF%BC%89&amp;rft.volume=34&amp;rft.issue=7&amp;rft.pages=565&amp;rft.date=1960-07&amp;rft.aulast=Yoshiwara&amp;rft.aufirst=Ichir%C5%8D&amp;rft.au=Sugisaki%2C+Akio&amp;rft.au=Kandatsu%2C+Makoto&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.jstage.jst.go.jp%2Farticle%2Fnogeikagaku1924%2F34%2F7%2F34_7_563%2F_pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1123" id="mwN0k"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1123" id="mwN0o"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1123" id="mwN0s"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-191" id="cite_note-191" data-mw-footnote-number="178"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwN0w"><a href="#cite_ref-191" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwN00"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwN04">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-191" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1126" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwN08" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:局相として偏りと歪みを含みながらも全体として均質であり、構造からはその性格を特定することができないし、あらゆる対象を併呑しようとする領域であるなら、外殻からその宇宙を記述することはできない。[…]そしてそれらの助力が有効であるなら、その探求の営為は個別主題領域として異化され、中心部から離れることにならないだろうか。[…]しかし、この帰結が誤りであるならそれまでだし、妥当なのであればそれもそれだけのことであるから、この帰結から出発し、先へと進むことがより一層、重要である。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pages=126, 128, 133&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://aska-r.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/5726/files/0021035201003123134.pdf&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Muranushi&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Tomohide&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:情報学の中核にあるもの —— 根源からの再出発を企図して ——&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=An exploration into the core of the information science&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Aichi Shukutoku University&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:愛知淑徳大学論集—文学部・文学研究科篇—&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=March 2010&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=35&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFMuranushi2010" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1126">Muranushi, Tomohide (March 2010). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://aska-r.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/5726/files/0021035201003123134.pdf" class="external text" id="mwN1A">"An exploration into the core of the information science" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwN1E">情報学の中核にあるもの —— 根源からの再出発を企図して ——</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwN1I">(PDF)</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwN1M">愛知淑徳大学論集—文学部・文学研究科篇—</bdi> (in Japanese) (35). Aichi Shukutoku University: 126, 128, 133.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwN1Q">局相として偏りと歪みを含みながらも全体として均質であり、構造からはその性格を特定することができないし、あらゆる対象を併呑しようとする領域であるなら、外殻からその宇宙を記述することはできない。[…]そしてそれらの助力が有効であるなら、その探求の営為は個別主題領域として異化され、中心部から離れることにならないだろうか。[…]しかし、この帰結が誤りであるならそれまでだし、妥当なのであればそれもそれだけのことであるから、この帰結から出発し、先へと進むことがより一層、重要である。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=An+exploration+into+the+core+of+the+information+science+%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1%E5%AD%A6%E3%81%AE%E4%B8%AD%E6%A0%B8%E3%81%AB%E3%81%82%E3%82%8B%E3%82%82%E3%81%AE+%E2%80%94%E2%80%94+%E6%A0%B9%E6%BA%90%E3%81%8B%E3%82%89%E3%81%AE%E5%86%8D%E5%87%BA%E7%99%BA%E3%82%92%E4%BC%81%E5%9B%B3%E3%81%97%E3%81%A6+%E2%80%94%E2%80%94&amp;rft.issue=35&amp;rft.pages=126%2C+128%2C+133&amp;rft.date=2010-03&amp;rft.aulast=Muranushi&amp;rft.aufirst=Tomohide&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Faska-r.repo.nii.ac.jp%2Frecord%2F5726%2Ffiles%2F0021035201003123134.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1126" id="mwN1U"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1126" id="mwN1Y"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1126" id="mwN1c"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-192" id="cite_note-192" data-mw-footnote-number="179"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwN1g"><a href="#cite_ref-192" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwN1k"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwN1o">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-192" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1129" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwN1s" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:あるいは報われないものであるならば，いますぐ離職した方が良いのか。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=37&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.jil.go.jp/institute/zassi/backnumber/2010/09/pdf/027-038.pdf&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Igami&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Hiroshi&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:ノンエリート大学生に伝えるべきこと ──「マージナル大学」の社会的意義&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:日本労働研究雑誌&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=602&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=September 2010&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFIgami2010" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1129">Igami, Hiroshi (September 2010). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.jil.go.jp/institute/zassi/backnumber/2010/09/pdf/027-038.pdf" class="external text" id="mwN1w"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwN10">ノンエリート大学生に伝えるべきこと ──「マージナル大学」の社会的意義</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwN14">(PDF)</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwN18">日本労働研究雑誌</bdi> (in Japanese) (602): 37.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwN2A">あるいは報われないものであるならば，いますぐ離職した方が良いのか。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E3%83%8E%E3%83%B3%E3%82%A8%E3%83%AA%E3%83%BC%E3%83%88%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E7%94%9F%E3%81%AB%E4%BC%9D%E3%81%88%E3%82%8B%E3%81%B9%E3%81%8D%E3%81%93%E3%81%A8+%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E3%80%8C%E3%83%9E%E3%83%BC%E3%82%B8%E3%83%8A%E3%83%AB%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E3%80%8D%E3%81%AE%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E7%9A%84%E6%84%8F%E7%BE%A9&amp;rft.issue=602&amp;rft.pages=37&amp;rft.date=2010-09&amp;rft.aulast=Igami&amp;rft.aufirst=Hiroshi&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.jil.go.jp%2Finstitute%2Fzassi%2Fbacknumber%2F2010%2F09%2Fpdf%2F027-038.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1129" id="mwN2E"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1129" id="mwN2I"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1129" id="mwN2M"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-193" id="cite_note-193" data-mw-footnote-number="180"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwN2Q"><a href="#cite_ref-193" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwN2U"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwN2Y">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-193" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1132" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwN2c" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:では薩摩藩士なのか、そうではあるなら、赤松暗殺は仲間内の粛清ということになる。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=18&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://uedawjc.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/1994/files/ueda_gakkai_6_01.pdf&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Tetsunori&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Iwashita&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:赤松小三郎と坂本龍馬の国家構想とその死について&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:総合文化研究所所報学海&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=6&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=2020&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFIwashita2020" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1132">Iwashita, Tetsunori (2020). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://uedawjc.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/1994/files/ueda_gakkai_6_01.pdf" class="external text" id="mwN2g"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwN2k">赤松小三郎と坂本龍馬の国家構想とその死について</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwN2o">(PDF)</span>.