<li about="#cite_note-194" id="cite_note-194" data-mw-footnote-number="181"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwN3A"><a href="#cite_ref-194" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwN3E"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwN3I">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-194" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1137" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwN3M" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:若しも 実際にその一なる生命、一なる光明の表現である他の生物に冷酷でありますならば、どうして私達は幸福や喜びを得ることができましょう。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pages=122, 123&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://hiroshima.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/2015462/files/HABITUS_27_108.pdf&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote=How can we ourselves obtain happiness and joy if we are cruel to other forms which are really expressions of the One Life and the One Light.&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Miyajima&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Masako&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:近代日本における霊性論 （2）鈴木ビアトリスの霊性&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal=Habitus&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=27&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=20 March 2023&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFMiyajima2023" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1137">Miyajima, Masako (20 March 2023). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://hiroshima.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/2015462/files/HABITUS_27_108.pdf" class="external text" id="mwN3Q"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwN3U">近代日本における霊性論 （2）鈴木ビアトリスの霊性</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwN3Y">(PDF)</span>. <i id="mwN3c">Habitus</i> (in Japanese). <b id="mwN3g">27</b>: 122, 123.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwN3k">若しも 実際にその一なる生命、一なる光明の表現である他の生物に冷酷でありますならば、どうして私達は幸福や喜びを得ることができましょう。</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwN3o">[</span>How can we ourselves obtain happiness and joy if we are cruel to other forms which are really expressions of the One Life and the One Light.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwN3s">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Habitus&amp;rft.atitle=%E8%BF%91%E4%BB%A3%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E3%81%AB%E3%81%8A%E3%81%91%E3%82%8B%E9%9C%8A%E6%80%A7%E8%AB%96+%EF%BC%882%EF%BC%89%E9%88%B4%E6%9C%A8%E3%83%93%E3%82%A2%E3%83%88%E3%83%AA%E3%82%B9%E3%81%AE%E9%9C%8A%E6%80%A7&amp;rft.volume=27&amp;rft.pages=122%2C+123&amp;rft.date=2023-03-20&amp;rft.aulast=Miyajima&amp;rft.aufirst=Masako&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fhiroshima.repo.nii.ac.jp%2Frecord%2F2015462%2Ffiles%2FHABITUS_27_108.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1137" id="mwN3w"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1137" id="mwN30"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1137" id="mwN34"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-195" id="cite_note-195" data-mw-footnote-number="182"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwN38"><a href="#cite_ref-195" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwN4A"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwN4E">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-195" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1140" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwN4I" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:従って右が、単なる軍司令官の希望でありますなら、私の考えを断行いたします。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=144&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:第三章 指揮官としての成長&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:今村均 敗戦日本の不敗の司令官&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Iwai&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Shūichirō&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=PHP Institute&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Kōtō]], Tokyo&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=28 July 2023&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;isbn=978-4-569-85508-0&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFIwai2023" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1140">Iwai, Shūichirō (28 July 2023).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwN4M">第三章 指揮官としての成長</bdi>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwN4Q">今村均 敗戦日本の不敗の司令官</bdi> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kōtō" title="Kōtō" id="mwN4U">Kōtō</a>, Tokyo: PHP Inst