<li about="#cite_note-205" id="cite_note-205" data-mw-footnote-number="192"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwOMs"><a href="#cite_ref-205" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwOMw"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwOM0">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-205" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1178" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwOM4" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:『そりやつまらないことですわ、<ruby>卑<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>劣<rp>(</rp><rt>れつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>な<ruby>仕<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>打<rp>(</rp><rt>うち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぢやありませうけど。』&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:'''<ruby>第<rp>(</rp><rt>だい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>四十<ruby>章<rp>(</rp><rt>しやう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>'''　<small>夜半。サア・ウイロビイとリティティア。クロスジエ、は寢臺掛の下に<ruby>潛伏<rp>(</rp><rt>かく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れて。</small>&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=265&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/953545/1/137&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:<ruby>我意の人<rp>(</rp><rt>エゴイスト</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=George Meredith&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=George&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Meredith&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Tokuboku&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Hirata&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=15 June 1918&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|國民文庫刊行會}}&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=3&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Kanda, Tokyo]]&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=The Egoist: A Comedy in Narrative&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=Chapter XI. Midnight: Sir Willoughby and Lætitia: with Young Crossjay under a Coverlet&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=“That would be idle, though it would be base.”&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFMeredith1918" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1178"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/George_Meredith" title="George Meredith" id="mwOM8">Meredith, George</a> (15 June 1918). "Chapter XI. Midnight: Sir Willoughby and Lætitia: with Young Crossjay under a Coverlet" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwONA"><b id="mwONE"><ruby id="mwONI">第<rp id="mwONM">(</rp><rt id="mwONQ">だい</rt><rp id="mwONU">)</rp></ruby>四十<ruby id="mwONY">章<rp id="mwONc">(</rp><rt id="mwONg">しやう</rt><rp id="mwONk">)</rp></ruby></b>　<small id="mwONo">夜半。サア・ウイロビイとリティティア。クロスジエ、は寢臺掛の下に<ruby id="mwONs">潛伏<rp id="mwONw">(</rp><rt id="mwON0">かく</rt><rp id="mwON4">)</rp></ruby>れて。</small></bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/953545/1/137" class="external text" id="mwON8"><i id="mwOOA">The Egoist: A Comedy in Narrative</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOOE"><ruby id="mwOOI">我意の人<rp id="mwOOM">(</rp><rt id="mwOOQ">エゴイスト</rt><rp id="mwOOU">)</rp></ruby></bdi></a> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOOY">&nbsp;</span>3. Translated by Hirata, Tokuboku. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kanda,_Tokyo" title="Kanda, Tokyo" id="mwOOc">Kanda, Tokyo</a>: <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwOOg"><span lang="ja" id="mwOOk">國民文庫刊行會</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwOOo">. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOOs">&nbsp;</span>265. <q id="mwOOw"><span class="cs1-kern-left" id="mwOO0"></span>"That would be idle, though it would be base."<span class="cs1-kern-right" id="mwOO4"></span></q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOO8">『そりやつまらないことですわ、<ruby id="mwOPA">卑<rp id="mwOPE">(</rp><rt id="mwOPI">ひ</rt><rp id="mwOPM">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwOPQ">劣<rp id="mwOPU">(</rp><rt id="mwOPY">れつ</rt><rp id="mwOPc">)</rp></ruby>な<ruby id="mwOPg">仕<rp id="mwOPk">(</rp><rt id="mwOPo">し</rt><rp id="mwOPs">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwOPw">打<rp id="mwOP0">(</rp><rt id="mwOP4">うち</rt><rp id="mwOP8">)</rp></ruby>ぢやありませうけど。』</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=Chapter+XI.+Midnight%3A+Sir+Willoughby+and+L%C3%A6titia%3A+with+Young+Crossjay+under+a+Coverlet+%3Cruby%3E%E7%AC%AC%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%A0%E3%81%84%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%E5%9B%9B%E5%8D%81%3Cruby%3E%E7%AB%A0%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%97%E3%82%84%E3%81%86%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%E3%80%80%3Csmall%3E%E5%A4%9C%E5%8D%8A%E3%80%82%E3%82%B5%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BB%E3%82%A6%E3%82%A4%E3%83%AD%E3%83%93%E3%82%A4%E3%81%A8%E3%83%AA%E3%83%86%E3%82%A3%E3%83%86%E3%82%A3%E3%82%A2%E3%80%82%E3%82%AF%E3%83%AD%E3%82%B9%E3%82%B8%E3%82%A8%E3%80%81%E3%81%AF%E5%AF%A2%E8%87%BA%E6%8E%9B%E3%81%AE%E4%B8%8B%E3%81%AB%3Cruby%3E%E6%BD%9B%E4%BC%8F%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%8B%E3%81%8F%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%E3%82%8C%E3%81%A6%E3%80%82%3C%2Fsmall%3E&amp;rft.btitle=The+Egoist%3A+A+Comedy+in+Narrative+%3Cruby%3E%E6%88%91%E6%84%8F%E3%81%AE%E4%BA%BA%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%82%A8%E3%82%B4%E3%82%A4%E3%82%B9%E3%83%88%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E&amp;rft.place=Kanda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=265&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E5%9C%8B%E6%B0%91%E6%96%87%E5%BA%AB%E5%88%8A%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%83%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.date=1918-06-15&amp;rft.aulast=Meredith&amp;rft.aufirst=George&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F953545%2F1%2F137&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1178" id="mwOQA"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1178" id="mwOQE"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1178" id="mwOQI"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-206" id="cite_note-206" data-mw-footnote-number="193"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwOQM"><a href="#cite_ref-206" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwOQQ"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwOQU">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-206" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1184" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwOQY" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:これらは，あくまで例外的なものであり，教育上必要と認められた場合の特殊な事例と捉えられるべきであるだろう。[…]提示後にレポート課題を与え，学習者の興味・関心の所在や理解度を測定することも，学習者の理解を深める点において有効であるだろう。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pages=188, 192&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://barrel.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/639/files/TUJI.pdf&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Tsuji&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Yoshihito&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:視聴覚メディア教材を用いた教育活動の展望 ——教材の運営・管理と著作権——&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:小樽商科大学人文研究&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=115&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=2008&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFTsuji2008" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1184">Tsuji, Yoshihito (2008). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://barrel.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/639/files/TUJI.pdf" class="external text" id="mwOQc"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwOQg">視聴覚メディア教材を用いた教育活動の展望 ——教材の運営・管理と著作権——</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwOQk">(PDF)</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOQo">小樽商科大学人文研究</bdi> (in Japanese) (115): 188, 192.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOQs">これらは，あくまで例外的なものであり，教育上必要と認められた場合の特殊な事例と捉えられるべきであるだろう。[…]提示後にレポート課題を与え，学習者の興味・関心の所在や理解度を測定することも，学習者の理解を深める点において有効であるだろう。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E8%A6%96%E8%81%B4%E8%A6%9A%E3%83%A1%E3%83%87%E3%82%A3%E3%82%A2%E6%95%99%E6%9D%90%E3%82%92%E7%94%A8%E3%81%84%E3%81%9F%E6%95%99%E8%82%B2%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95%E3%81%AE%E5%B1%95%E6%9C%9B+%E2%80%94%E2%80%94%E6%95%99%E6%9D%90%E3%81%AE%E9%81%8B%E5%96%B6%E3%83%BB%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E3%81%A8%E8%91%97%E4%BD%9C%E6%A8%A9%E2%80%94%E2%80%94&amp;rft.issue=115&amp;rft.pages=188%2C+192&amp;rft.date=2008&amp;rft.aulast=Tsuji&amp;rft.aufirst=Yoshihito&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fbarrel.repo.nii.ac.jp%2Frecord%2F639%2Ffiles%2FTUJI.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1184" id="mwOQw"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1184" id="mwOQ0"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1184" id="mwOQ4"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-207" id="cite_note-207" data-mw-footnote-number="194"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwOQ8"><a href="#cite_ref-207" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwORA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwORE">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-207" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1187" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwORI" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:勢い、議論はさまざまな可能性を考慮し、慎重に言葉を重ねていくことになる。他方、第3章の「金がない」という主張も社会の本流ではあるだろう。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=101&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.jstage.jst.go.jp/article/ritsumeikanasiajapan/5/0/5_5_98/_pdf&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Chiaki&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Kagawa&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:『良い死/唯の生』 立岩真也＊著、ちくま学芸文庫、2022 年&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:立命館アジア・日本研究学術年報&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=5&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=2024&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFKagawa2024" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1187">Kagawa, Chiaki (2024). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.jstage.jst.go.jp/article/ritsumeikanasiajapan/5/0/5_5_98/_pdf" class="external text" id="mwORM"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwORQ">『良い死/唯の生』 立岩真也＊著、ちくま学芸文庫、2022 年</bdi></a>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwORU">立命館アジア・日本研究学術年報</bdi> (in Japanese) (5): 101.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwORY">勢い、議論はさまざまな可能性を考慮し、慎重に言葉を重ねていくことになる。他方、第3章の「金がない」という主張も社会の本流ではあるだろう。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E3%80%8E%E8%89%AF%E3%81%84%E6%AD%BB%2F%E5%94%AF%E3%81%AE%E7%94%9F%E3%80%8F+%E7%AB%8B%E5%B2%A9%E7%9C%9F%E4%B9%9F%EF%BC%8A%E8%91%97%E3%80%81%E3%81%A1%E3%81%8F%E3%81%BE%E5%AD%A6%E8%8A%B8%E6%96%87%E5%BA%AB%E3%80%812022+%E5%B9%B4&amp;rft.issue=5&amp;rft.pages=101&amp;rft.date=2024&amp;rft.aulast=Kagawa&amp;rft.aufirst=Chiaki&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.jstage.jst.go.jp%2Farticle%2Fritsumeikanasiajapan%2F5%2F0%2F5_5_98%2F_pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1187" id="mwORc"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1187" id="mwORg"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1187" id="mwORk"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-208" id="cite_note-208" data-mw-footnote-number="195"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwORo"><a href="#cite_ref-208" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwORs"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwORw">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-208" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1190" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwOR0" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:ギリギリまで戦えよと思ったけど、1人でダガー片手に大量のスライムに囲まれたら時間の問題じゃあるだろう。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://ncode.syosetu.com/n8450gq/1847/&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;author=Miyabi&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:限定迷宮 ２２&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=7 June 2024&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:最強の荷物持ちの追放からはじまるハーレムライフ ～役立たずと勇者パーティーを追放されたけど、スキルも開眼して余裕です～&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|小説家になろう}}&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFMiyabi2024" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1190">Miyabi (7 June 2024).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOR4">限定迷宮 ２２</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://ncode.syosetu.com/n8450gq/1847/" class="external text" id="mwOR8"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwOSA">最強の荷物持ちの追放からはじまるハーレムライフ ～役立たずと勇者パーティーを追放されたけど、スキルも開眼して余裕です～</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwOSE"><span lang="ja" id="mwOSI">小説家になろう</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwOSM">.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOSQ">ギリギリまで戦えよと思ったけど、1人でダガー片手に大量のスライムに囲まれたら時間の問題じゃあるだろう。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E9%99%90%E5%AE%9A%E8%BF%B7%E5%AE%AE+%EF%BC%92%EF%BC%92&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%9C%80%E5%BC%B7%E3%81%AE%E8%8D%B7%E7%89%A9%E6%8C%81%E3%81%A1%E3%81%AE%E8%BF%BD%E6%94%BE%E3%81%8B%E3%82%89%E3%81%AF%E3%81%98%E3%81%BE%E3%82%8B%E3%83%8F%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%A0%E3%83%A9%E3%82%A4%E3%83%95+%EF%BD%9E%E5%BD%B9%E7%AB%8B%E3%81%9F%E3%81%9A%E3%81%A8%E5%8B%87%E8%80%85%E3%83%91%E3%83%BC%E3%83%86%E3%82%A3%E3%83%BC%E3%82%92%E8%BF%BD%E6%94%BE%E3%81%95%E3%82%8C%E3%81%9F%E3%81%91%E3%81%A9%E3%80%81%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AD%E3%83%AB%E3%82%82%E9%96%8B%E7%9C%BC%E3%81%97%E3%81%A6%E4%BD%99%E8%A3%95%E3%81%A7%E3%81%99%EF%BD%9E&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E5%B0%8F%E8%AA%AC%E5%AE%B6%E3%81%AB%E3%81%AA%E3%82%8D%E3%81%86%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.date=2024-06-07&amp;rft.au=Miyabi&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fncode.syosetu.com%2Fn8450gq%2F1847%2F&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1190" id="mwOSU"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1190" id="mwOSY"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1190" id="mwOSc"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-209" id="cite_note-209" data-mw-footnote-number="196"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwOSg"><a href="#cite_ref-209" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwOSk"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwOSo">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-209" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1195" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwOSs" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:<ruby>皆<rp></rp><rt>みな</rt><rp></rp></ruby><ruby>樣<rp></rp><rt>さま</rt><rp></rp></ruby>、<ruby>親<rp></rp><rt><span style=\&quot;font-family: 'Noto Serif Hentaigana','BabelStone Han','UniHentaiKana','IPAmj明朝','花園明朝A',HanaMinA, HanaMinB,'和田研中丸ゴシック2004絵文字','WadaLabChuMaruGo2004Emoji','和田研細丸ゴシック2004絵文字','WadaLabMaruGo2004Emoji',mincho,serif\&quot;>𛀕</span>や</rt><rp></rp></ruby>の<ruby>心<rp></rp><rt>こゝろ</rt><rp></rp></ruby>を<ruby>安<rp></rp><rt>やす</rt><rp></rp></ruby>んじ、<ruby>親<rp></rp><rt><span style=\&quot;font-family: 'Noto Serif Hentaigana','BabelStone Han','UniHentaiKana','IPAmj明朝','花園明朝A',HanaMinA, HanaMinB,'和田研中丸ゴシック2004絵文字','WadaLabChuMaruGo2004Emoji','和田研細丸ゴシック2004絵文字','WadaLabMaruGo2004Emoji',mincho,serif\&quot;>𛀕</span>や</rt><rp></rp></ruby>の<ruby>氣<rp></rp><rt>き</rt><rp></rp></ruby>に入ろうと<ruby>思<rp></rp><rt><span style=\&quot;font-family: 'Noto Serif Hentaigana','BabelStone Han','UniHentaiKana','IPAmj明朝','花園明朝A',HanaMinA, HanaMinB,'和田研中丸ゴシック2004絵文字','WadaLabChuMaruGo2004Emoji','和田研細丸ゴシック2004絵文字','WadaLabMaruGo2004Emoji',mincho,serif\&quot;>𛀕</span>も</rt><rp></rp></ruby>ふには、どうするのが、一<ruby>番<rp></rp><rt>ばん</rt><rp></rp></ruby><ruby>近<rp></rp><rt>ちか</rt><rp></rp></ruby><ruby>道<rp></rp><rt>みち</rt><rp></rp></ruby>でありますだろうか。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/865692/1/6&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=3&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:追弔會演說一 （追弔會に對する一般國民の心得を談ず）&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:戰時追弔慰問演說&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=15 May 1905&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Kawasaki&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Kenryō&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Hōzōkan&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=Tokyo&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFKawasaki1905" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1195">Kawasaki, Kenryō (15 May 1905).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOSw">追弔會演說一 （追弔會に對する一般國民の心得を談ず）</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/865692/1/6" class="external text" id="mwOS0"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwOS4">戰時追弔慰問演說</bdi></a> (in Japanese). Tokyo: Hōzōkan. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOS8">&nbsp;</span>3.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOTA"><ruby id="mwOTE">皆<rp id="mwOTI"></rp><rt id="mwOTM">みな</rt><rp id="mwOTQ"></rp></ruby><ruby id="mwOTU">樣<rp id="mwOTY"></rp><rt id="mwOTc">さま</rt><rp id="mwOTg"></rp></ruby>、<ruby id="mwOTk">親<rp id="mwOTo"></rp><rt id="mwOTs"><span style="font-family: 'Noto Serif Hentaigana','BabelStone Han','UniHentaiKana','IPAmj明朝','花園明朝A',HanaMinA, HanaMinB,'和田研中丸ゴシック2004絵文字','WadaLabChuMaruGo2004Emoji','和田研細丸ゴシック2004絵文字','WadaLabMaruGo2004Emoji',mincho,serif" id="mwOTw">𛀕</span>や</rt><rp id="mwOT0"></rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwOT4">心<rp id="mwOT8"></rp><rt id="mwOUA">こゝろ</rt><rp id="mwOUE"></rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwOUI">安<rp id="mwOUM"></rp><rt id="mwOUQ">やす</rt><rp id="mwOUU"></rp></ruby>んじ、<ruby id="mwOUY">親<rp id="mwOUc"></rp><rt id="mwOUg"><span style="font-family: 'Noto Serif Hentaigana','BabelStone Han','UniHentaiKana','IPAmj明朝','花園明朝A',HanaMinA, HanaMinB,'和田研中丸ゴシック2004絵文字','WadaLabChuMaruGo2004Emoji','和田研細丸ゴシック2004絵文字','WadaLabMaruGo2004Emoji',mincho,serif" id="mwOUk">𛀕</span>や</rt><rp id="mwOUo"></rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwOUs">氣<rp id="mwOUw"></rp><rt id="mwOU0">き</rt><rp id="mwOU4"></rp></ruby>に入ろうと<ruby id="mwOU8">思<rp id="mwOVA"></rp><rt id="mwOVE"><span style="font-family: 'Noto Serif Hentaigana','BabelStone Han','UniHentaiKana','IPAmj明朝','花園明朝A',HanaMinA, HanaMinB,'和田研中丸ゴシック2004絵文字','WadaLabChuMaruGo2004Emoji','和田研細丸ゴシック2004絵文字','WadaLabMaruGo2004Emoji',mincho,serif" id="mwOVI">𛀕</span>も</rt><rp id="mwOVM"></rp></ruby>ふには、どうするのが、一<ruby id="mwOVQ">番<rp id="mwOVU"></rp><rt id="mwOVY">ばん</rt><rp id="mwOVc"></rp></ruby><ruby id="mwOVg">近<rp id="mwOVk"></rp><rt id="mwOVo">ちか</rt><rp id="mwOVs"></rp></ruby><ruby id="mwOVw">道<rp id="mwOV0"></rp><rt id="mwOV4">みち</rt><rp id="mwOV8"></rp></ruby>でありますだろうか。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E8%BF%BD%E5%BC%94%E6%9C%83%E6%BC%94%E8%AA%AA%E4%B8%80+%EF%BC%88%E8%BF%BD%E5%BC%94%E6%9C%83%E3%81%AB%E5%B0%8D%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E5%9C%8B%E6%B0%91%E3%81%AE%E5%BF%83%E5%BE%97%E3%82%92%E8%AB%87%E3%81%9A%EF%BC%89&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%88%B0%E6%99%82%E8%BF%BD%E5%BC%94%E6%85%B0%E5%95%8F%E6%BC%94%E8%AA%AA&amp;rft.place=Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=3&amp;rft.pub=H%C5%8Dz%C5%8Dkan&amp;rft.date=1905-05-15&amp;rft.aulast=Kawasaki&amp;rft.aufirst=Kenry%C5%8D&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F865692%2F1%2F6&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1195" id="mwOWA"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1195" id="mwOWE"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1195" id="mwOWI"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-210" id="cite_note-210" data-mw-footnote-number="197"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwOWM"><a href="#cite_ref-210" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwOWQ"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwOWU">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-210" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1200" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwOWY" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:しかし、宇宙がこれをおしつぶすときにも、人間は、人間を殺すものよりもいっそう高貴であるであろう。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=4&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://kansai-u.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/1501/files/KU-0400-%2020111011-01.pdf&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Katsuhito&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Inoue&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:西欧的知性とその運命 ——東アジア的叡智に託するもの——&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:関西大学東西学術研究所創立六十周年記念論文集&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=2011&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFInoue2011" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1200">Inoue, Katsuhito (2011). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://kansai-u.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/1501/files/KU-0400-%2020111011-01.pdf" class="external text" id="mwOWc"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwOWg">西欧的知性とその運命 ——東アジア的叡智に託するもの——</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwOWk">(PDF)</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOWo">関西大学東西学術研究所創立六十周年記念論文集</bdi> (in Japanese): 4.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOWs">しかし、宇宙がこれをおしつぶすときにも、人間は、人間を殺すものよりもいっそう高貴であるであろう。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E8%A5%BF%E6%AC%A7%E7%9A%84%E7%9F%A5%E6%80%A7%E3%81%A8%E3%81%9D%E3%81%AE%E9%81%8B%E5%91%BD+%E2%80%94%E2%80%94%E6%9D%B1%E3%82%A2%E3%82%B8%E3%82%A2%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%A1%E6%99%BA%E3%81%AB%E8%A8%97%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B%E3%82%82%E3%81%AE%E2%80%94%E2%80%94&amp;rft.pages=4&amp;rft.date=2011&amp;rft.aulast=Inoue&amp;rft.aufirst=Katsuhito&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fkansai-u.repo.nii.ac.jp%2Frecord%2F1501%2Ffiles%2FKU-0400-%252020111011-01.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1200" id="mwOWw"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1200" id="mwOW0"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1200" id="mwOW4"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-211" id="cite_note-211" data-mw-footnote-number="198"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwOW8"><a href="#cite_ref-211" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwOXA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwOXE">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-211" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1203" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwOXI" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:マドリッドは、もちろん観光都市としての性格もあるので、そうした利害から現状のような景観を求めたということも一面ではあるであろう（日本の京都と同じように）が、それは本質論ではない。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=29&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://aichi-pu.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/2116/files/(06)_Y02%E5%A4%A7%E5%A1%9A.pdf&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:【海外からの風】 マドリッドで考えたこと ──スペイン国際政治学研究所への出張報告──&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Ōtsuka&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Eiji&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:愛知県立大学日本文化学部論集（歴史文化学科編）&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=6&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=2015&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFŌtsuka2015" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1203">Ōtsuka, Eiji (2015). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://aichi-pu.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/2116/files/(06)_Y02%E5%A4%A7%E5%A1%9A.pdf" class="external text" id="mwOXM"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwOXQ">【海外からの風】 マドリッドで考えたこと ──スペイン国際政治学研究所への出張報告──</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwOXU">(PDF)</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOXY">愛知県立大学日本文化学部論集（歴史文化学科編）</bdi> (in Japanese) (6): 29.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOXc">マドリッドは、もちろん観光都市としての性格もあるので、そうした利害から現状のような景観を求めたということも一面ではあるであろう（日本の京都と同じように）が、それは本質論ではない。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E3%80%90%E6%B5%B7%E5%A4%96%E3%81%8B%E3%82%89%E3%81%AE%E9%A2%A8%E3%80%91+%E3%83%9E%E3%83%89%E3%83%AA%E3%83%83%E3%83%89%E3%81%A7%E8%80%83%E3%81%88%E3%81%9F%E3%81%93%E3%81%A8+%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E3%82%B9%E3%83%9A%E3%82%A4%E3%83%B3%E5%9B%BD%E9%9A%9B%E6%94%BF%E6%B2%BB%E5%AD%A6%E7%A0%94%E7%A9%B6%E6%89%80%E3%81%B8%E3%81%AE%E5%87%BA%E5%BC%B5%E5%A0%B1%E5%91%8A%E2%94%80%E2%94%80&amp;rft.issue=6&amp;rft.pages=29&amp;rft.date=2015&amp;rft.aulast=%C5%8Ctsuka&amp;rft.aufirst=Eiji&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Faichi-pu.repo.nii.ac.jp%2Frecord%2F2116%2Ffiles%2F%2806%29_Y02%25E5%25A4%25A7%25E5%25A1%259A.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1203" id="mwOXg"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1203" id="mwOXk"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1203" id="mwOXo"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-212" id="cite_note-212" data-mw-footnote-number="199"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwOXs"><a href="#cite_ref-212" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwOXw"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwOX0">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-212" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1208" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwOX4" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:みなさんのご認識がどうなのか伺ってみたいですが，このように考えるならば武道は文化であるでしょうし，「日本的」であることは間違いありません。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=52&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.jstage.jst.go.jp/article/budo/43/2/43_2_41/_pdf&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Yasushi&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Ogasawara&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:武道とはいかなる意味で日本的なのか —国際化を『モノ』と『こと』から考える—&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:武道学研究&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=43&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=2&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=2011&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFOgasawara2011" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1208">Ogasawara, Yasushi (2011). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.jstage.jst.go.jp/article/budo/43/2/43_2_41/_pdf" class="external text" id="mwOX8"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwOYA">武道とはいかなる意味で日本的なのか —国際化を『モノ』と『こと』から考える—</bdi></a>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOYE">武道学研究</bdi> (in Japanese). <b id="mwOYI">43</b> (2): 52.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOYM">みなさんのご認識がどうなのか伺ってみたいですが，このように考えるならば武道は文化であるでしょうし，「日本的」であることは間違いありません。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E6%AD%A6%E9%81%93%E3%81%A8%E3%81%AF%E3%81%84%E3%81%8B%E3%81%AA%E3%82%8B%E6%84%8F%E5%91%B3%E3%81%A7%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E7%9A%84%E3%81%AA%E3%81%AE%E3%81%8B+%E2%80%94%E5%9B%BD%E9%9A%9B%E5%8C%96%E3%82%92%E3%80%8E%E3%83%A2%E3%83%8E%E3%80%8F%E3%81%A8%E3%80%8E%E3%81%93%E3%81%A8%E3%80%8F%E3%81%8B%E3%82%89%E8%80%83%E3%81%88%E3%82%8B%E2%80%94&amp;rft.volume=43&amp;rft.issue=2&amp;rft.pages=52&amp;rft.date=2011&amp;rft.aulast=Ogasawara&amp;rft.aufirst=Yasushi&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.jstage.jst.go.jp%2Farticle%2Fbudo%2F43%2F2%2F43_2_41%2F_pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1208" id="mwOYQ"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1208" id="mwOYU"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1208" id="mwOYY"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-213" id="cite_note-213" data-mw-footnote-number="200"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwOYc"><a href="#cite_ref-213" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwOYg"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwOYk">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-213" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1211" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwOYo" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:それは，農業じゃないかもしれませんが，『農的な生活』ではあるでしょう。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=209&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.jstage.jst.go.jp/article/arp/40/4/40_205/_pdf&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last1=Ichinose&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first1=Tomohiro&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last2=Endō&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first2=Kazuko&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first3=Hideharu&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last3=Kurita&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last4=Yamashita&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first4=Ryōhei&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last5=Hōri&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first5=Juri&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last6=Aruga&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first6=Yū&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:こうありたい未来の農村計画 ─ 20 期学会長 × 20 期学会誌編集委員=対話座談会 ─&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:農村計画学会誌&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=40&quot;},&quot;21&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=4&quot;},&quot;22&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=2022&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFIchinoseEndōKuritaYamashita2022" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1211">Ichinose, Tomohiro; Endō, Kazuko; Kurita, Hideharu; Yamashita, Ryōhei; Hōri, Juri; Aruga, Yū (2022). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.jstage.jst.go.jp/article/arp/40/4/40_205/_pdf" class="external text" id="mwOYs"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwOYw">こうありたい未来の農村計画 ─ 20 期学会長 × 20 期学会誌編集委員=対話座談会 ─</bdi></a>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOY0">農村計画学会誌</bdi> (in Japanese). <b id="mwOY4">40</b> (4): 209.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOY8">それは，農業じゃないかもしれませんが，『農的な生活』ではあるでしょう。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E3%81%93%E3%81%86%E3%81%82%E3%82%8A%E3%81%9F%E3%81%84%E6%9C%AA%E6%9D%A5%E3%81%AE%E8%BE%B2%E6%9D%91%E8%A8%88%E7%94%BB+%E2%94%80+20+%E6%9C%9F%E5%AD%A6%E4%BC%9A%E9%95%B7+%C3%97+20+%E6%9C%9F%E5%AD%A6%E4%BC%9A%E8%AA%8C%E7%B7%A8%E9%9B%86%E5%A7%94%E5%93%A1%3D%E5%AF%BE%E8%A9%B1%E5%BA%A7%E8%AB%87%E4%BC%9A+%E2%94%80&amp;rft.volume=40&amp;rft.issue=4&amp;rft.pages=209&amp;rft.date=2022&amp;rft.aulast=Ichinose&amp;rft.aufirst=Tomohiro&amp;rft.au=End%C5%8D%2C+Kazuko&amp;rft.au=Kurita%2C+Hideharu&amp;rft.au=Yamashita%2C+Ry%C5%8Dhei&amp;rft.au=H%C5%8Dri%2C+Juri&amp;rft.au=Aruga%2C+Y%C5%AB&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.jstage.jst.go.jp%2Farticle%2Farp%2F40%2F4%2F40_205%2F_pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1211" id="mwOZA"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1211" id="mwOZE"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1211" id="mwOZI"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-214" id="cite_note-214" data-mw-footnote-number="201"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwOZM"><a href="#cite_ref-214" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwOZQ"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwOZU">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-214" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1214" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwOZY" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;citation&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Citation&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;language&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;ja&quot;},&quot;script-quote&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;ja:相手方が法的根拠はないと言っているんです。錯誤無効じゃあるでしょう、認めているんだもの。&quot;},&quot;page&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;14&quot;},&quot;script-title&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;ja:土木森林環境委員会会議録&quot;},&quot;url&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;https://www.pref.yamanashi.jp/documents/48228/h24_6_29_dobokusinrin_kaigiroku_.pdf&quot;},&quot;date&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;June 2012&quot;},&quot;last&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Tanzawa&quot;},&quot;first&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Kazuhira&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFTanzawa2012" class="citation cs2 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1214">Tanzawa, Kazuhira (June 2012), <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.pref.yamanashi.jp/documents/48228/h24_6_29_dobokusinrin_kaigiroku_.pdf" class="external text" id="mwOZc"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwOZg">土木森林環境委員会会議録</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwOZk">(PDF)</span> (in Japanese), p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOZo">&nbsp;</span>14,  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOZs">相手方が法的根拠はないと言っているんです。錯誤無効じゃあるでしょう、認めているんだもの。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=%E5%9C%9F%E6%9C%A8%E6%A3%AE%E6%9E%97%E7%92%B0%E5%A2%83%E5%A7%94%E5%93%A1%E4%BC%9A%E4%BC%9A%E8%AD%B0%E9%8C%B2&amp;rft.pages=14&amp;rft.date=2012-06&amp;rft.aulast=Tanzawa&amp;rft.aufirst=Kazuhira&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.pref.yamanashi.jp%2Fdocuments%2F48228%2Fh24_6_29_dobokusinrin_kaigiroku_.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1214" id="mwOZw"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1214" id="mwOZ0"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1214" id="mwOZ4"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-215" id="cite_note-215" data-mw-footnote-number="202"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwOZ8"><a href="#cite_ref-215" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwOaA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwOaE">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-215" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1219" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwOaI" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;citation&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Citation&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;language&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;ja&quot;},&quot;script-quote&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;ja:松本大臣は、8月の会期内に退陣をすべきだというようなお考えでありますでしょうか。&quot;},&quot;page&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;3&quot;},&quot;url&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;https://www.reconstruction.go.jp/topics/20110628kaiken.pdf&quot;},&quot;script-title&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;ja:松本大臣等記者会見録&quot;},&quot;date&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;28 June 2011&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite class="citation cs2 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1219" id="mwOaM"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.reconstruction.go.jp/topics/20110628kaiken.pdf" class="external text" id="mwOaQ"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwOaU">松本大臣等記者会見録</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwOaY">(PDF)</span> (in Japanese), 28 June 2011, p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOac">&nbsp;</span>3,  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOag">松本大臣は、8月の会期内に退陣をすべきだというようなお考えでありますでしょうか。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%9D%BE%E6%9C%AC%E5%A4%A7%E8%87%A3%E7%AD%89%E8%A8%98%E8%80%85%E4%BC%9A%E8%A6%8B%E9%8C%B2&amp;rft.pages=3&amp;rft.date=2011-06-28&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.reconstruction.go.jp%2Ftopics%2F20110628kaiken.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1219" id="mwOak"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1219" id="mwOao"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1219" id="mwOas"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-216" id="cite_note-216" data-mw-footnote-number="203"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwOaw"><a href="#cite_ref-216" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwOa0"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwOa4">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-216" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1222" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwOa8" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;citation&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Citation&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;language&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;ja&quot;},&quot;script-quote&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;ja:仮にもし皆様方が、そういったことや何やらで、例えば厳しい値に問題があるとかいうときには、先程米原委員がご説明された現存被ばく状況の話や等級別取り扱いというような形でそれらを考えて、少し高目に設定するというのも方法ではありますでしょうし、あるいは統一的な基準になると、どうしても低目でないと、安全じゃないとか皆様も安心されないというようなところも出てくるかもしれません。&quot;},&quot;page&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;22&quot;},&quot;script-title&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;ja:砕石及び砂利の出荷基準に関する専門検討会（第2回）議事録&quot;},&quot;url&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/6016965/1/2&quot;},&quot;date&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;28 February 2012&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite class="citation cs2 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1222" id="mwObA"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/6016965/1/2" class="external text" id="mwObE"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwObI">砕石及び砂利の出荷基準に関する専門検討会（第2回）議事録</bdi></a> (in Japanese), 28 February 2012, p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwObM">&nbsp;</span>22,  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwObQ">仮にもし皆様方が、そういったことや何やらで、例えば厳しい値に問題があるとかいうときには、先程米原委員がご説明された現存被ばく状況の話や等級別取り扱いというような形でそれらを考えて、少し高目に設定するというのも方法ではありますでしょうし、あるいは統一的な基準になると、どうしても低目でないと、安全じゃないとか皆様も安心されないというようなところも出てくるかもしれません。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=%E7%A0%95%E7%9F%B3%E5%8F%8A%E3%81%B3%E7%A0%82%E5%88%A9%E3%81%AE%E5%87%BA%E8%8D%B7%E5%9F%BA%E6%BA%96%E3%81%AB%E9%96%A2%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B%E5%B0%82%E9%96%80%E6%A4%9C%E8%A8%8E%E4%BC%9A%EF%BC%88%E7%AC%AC2%E5%9B%9E%EF%BC%89%E8%AD%B0%E4%BA%8B%E9%8C%B2&amp;rft.pages=22&amp;rft.date=2012-02-28&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F6016965%2F1%2F2&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1222" id="mwObU"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1222" id="mwObY"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1222" id="mwObc"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-217" id="cite_note-217" data-mw-footnote-number="204"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwObg"><a href="#cite_ref-217" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwObk"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwObo">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-217" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1227" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwObs" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:大分遠い親族ではあるでありませうけれ共、兔も角も、姻族の續柄であります所の者であります。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=210&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/951873/1/125&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:贈趙協律晢&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:李義山詩講義&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=1&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Bunkaidō Shoten&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Kainan&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Mori&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=20 January 1914&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Kanda, Tokyo]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFMori1914" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1227">Mori, Kainan (20 January 1914).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwObw">贈趙協律晢</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/951873/1/125" class="external text" id="mwOb0"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwOb4">李義山詩講義</bdi></a> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOb8">&nbsp;</span>1. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kanda,_Tokyo" title="Kanda, Tokyo" id="mwOcA">Kanda, Tokyo</a>: Bunkaidō Shoten. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOcE">&nbsp;</span>210.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOcI">大分遠い親族ではあるでありませうけれ共、兔も角も、姻族の續柄であります所の者であります。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E8%B4%88%E8%B6%99%E5%8D%94%E5%BE%8B%E6%99%A2&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%9D%8E%E7%BE%A9%E5%B1%B1%E8%A9%A9%E8%AC%9B%E7%BE%A9&amp;rft.place=Kanda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=210&amp;rft.pub=Bunkaid%C5%8D+Shoten&amp;rft.date=1914-01-20&amp;rft.aulast=Mori&amp;rft.aufirst=Kainan&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F951873%2F1%2F125&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1227" id="mwOcM"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1227" id="mwOcQ"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1227" id="mwOcU"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-218" id="cite_note-218" data-mw-footnote-number="205"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwOcY"><a href="#cite_ref-218" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwOcc"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwOcg">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-218" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1230" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwOck" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:そしてこの世においてはしばしば徳よりも悖徳に一層大きな報酬が供せられるのでありますから、もし神を畏れず、また來世を期待しないならば、利よりも正を好む者は少數であるでありませう。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:書簡 聖なるパリ神學部のいとも明識にしていとも高名なる學部長並びに博士諸賢に&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=Cumque ſæpe in hac vita majora vitiis, quam virtutibus præmia proponantur, pauci rectum utili præferrent, ſi nec Deum timerent, nec aliam vitam expectarent:&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote=And since often in this life there are greater rewards for the vices than for the virtues, few will prefer what is right to what is useful, if they neither fear God nor expect an afterlife.&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=EPISTOLA SAPIENTISSIMIS Clarißimiſque viris SACRÆ FACULTATIS Theologiæ Pariſienſis Decano &amp; Doctoribus.&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-chapter=Letter to the Most Bright and Famed Men, the Deans and Doctors of the Sacred Faculty of Theology of Paris&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:省察 神の存在、及び人間の靈魂と肉體との區別を論證する、第一哲學についての&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=René Descartes&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=René&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Descartes&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.aozora.gr.jp/cards/001029/files/4730_58083.html&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=MEDITATIONES DE PRIMA PHILOSOPHIA IN QVA DEI EXISTENTIA ET ANIMÆ IMMORTALITAS DEMONSTRATVR&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=[[Meditations on First Philosophy]] in Which the Existence of God and the Distinction of the Human Soul from the Body Are Demonstrated&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Miki&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Kiyoshi&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=20 October 1949&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFDescartes1949" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1230"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/René_Descartes" title="René Descartes" id="mwOco">Descartes, René</a> (20 October 1949). "EPISTOLA SAPIENTISSIMIS Clarißimiſque viris SACRÆ FACULTATIS Theologiæ Pariſienſis Decano &amp; Doctoribus." <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOcs">書簡 聖なるパリ神學部のいとも明識にしていとも高名なる學部長並びに博士諸賢に</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOcw">[</span>Letter to the Most Bright and Famed Men, the Deans and Doctors of the Sacred Faculty of Theology of Paris<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOc0">]</span>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.aozora.gr.jp/cards/001029/files/4730_58083.html" class="external text" id="mwOc4"><i id="mwOc8">MEDITATIONES DE PRIMA PHILOSOPHIA IN QVA DEI EXISTENTIA ET ANIMÆ IMMORTALITAS DEMONSTRATVR</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOdA">省察 神の存在、及び人間の靈魂と肉體との區別を論證する、第一哲學についての</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOdE">[</span><i id="mwOdI"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meditations_on_First_Philosophy" title="Meditations on First Philosophy" id="mwOdM">Meditations on First Philosophy</a> in Which the Existence of God and the Distinction of the Human Soul from the Body Are Demonstrated</i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOdQ">]</span> (in Japanese). Translated by Miki, Kiyoshi. <q id="mwOdU">Cumque ſæpe in hac vita majora vitiis, quam virtutibus præmia proponantur, pauci rectum utili præferrent, ſi nec Deum timerent, nec aliam vitam expectarent:</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOdY">そしてこの世においてはしばしば徳よりも悖徳に一層大きな報酬が供せられるのでありますから、もし神を畏れず、また來世を期待しないならば、利よりも正を好む者は少數であるでありませう。</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOdc">[</span>And since often in this life there are greater rewards for the vices than for the virtues, few will prefer what is right to what is useful, if they neither fear God nor expect an afterlife.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOdg">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=EPISTOLA+SAPIENTISSIMIS+Clari%C3%9Fimi%C5%BFque+viris+SACR%C3%86+FACULTATIS+Theologi%C3%A6+Pari%C5%BFien%C5%BFis+Decano+%26+Doctoribus.+%E6%9B%B8%E7%B0%A1+%E8%81%96%E3%81%AA%E3%82%8B%E3%83%91%E3%83%AA%E7%A5%9E%E5%AD%B8%E9%83%A8%E3%81%AE%E3%81%84%E3%81%A8%E3%82%82%E6%98%8E%E8%AD%98%E3%81%AB%E3%81%97%E3%81%A6%E3%81%84%E3%81%A8%E3%82%82%E9%AB%98%E5%90%8D%E3%81%AA%E3%82%8B%E5%AD%B8%E9%83%A8%E9%95%B7%E4%B8%A6%E3%81%B3%E3%81%AB%E5%8D%9A%E5%A3%AB%E8%AB%B8%E8%B3%A2%E3%81%AB&amp;rft.btitle=MEDITATIONES+DE+PRIMA+PHILOSOPHIA+IN+QVA+DEI+EXISTENTIA+ET+ANIM%C3%86+IMMORTALITAS+DEMONSTRATVR+%E7%9C%81%E5%AF%9F+%E7%A5%9E%E3%81%AE%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E3%80%81%E5%8F%8A%E3%81%B3%E4%BA%BA%E9%96%93%E3%81%AE%E9%9D%88%E9%AD%82%E3%81%A8%E8%82%89%E9%AB%94%E3%81%A8%E3%81%AE%E5%8D%80%E5%88%A5%E3%82%92%E8%AB%96%E8%AD%89%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B%E3%80%81%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%93%B2%E5%AD%B8%E3%81%AB%E3%81%A4%E3%81%84%E3%81%A6%E3%81%AE&amp;rft.date=1949-10-20&amp;rft.aulast=Descartes&amp;rft.aufirst=Ren%C3%A9&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.aozora.gr.jp%2Fcards%2F001029%2Ffiles%2F4730_58083.html&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1230" id="mwOdk"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1230" id="mwOdo"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1230" id="mwOds"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-ikeda-1993-219" id="cite_note-ikeda-1993-219" data-mw-footnote-number="206"><span rel="mw:referencedBy" class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwOdw"><a href="#cite_ref-ikeda-1993_219-0" id="mwOd0"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwOd4">1</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-ikeda-1993_219-1" id="mwOd8"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwOeA">2</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-ikeda-1993-219" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2617" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwOeE" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;citation&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:法華経には、しばしばドラムやトランペットのような楽器が登場するのも、それらの響きが生きんとする意志への励ましであるとすれば、よく納得できます。そして、その仏の命の力用が、「君よ、強くあれ。君よ、善くあれ、賢明であれ」との、人間復権へのメッセージであることは申すまでもありません。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;p=3&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.sokagakkai.jp/daisakuikeda/assets/pdf/koen/harvard02.pdf&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:「21世紀文明と大乗仏教」&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=24 September 1993&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|池田大作先生の足跡}}&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Daisaku Ikeda&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Daisaku&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Ikeda&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Mahayana Buddhism and twenty-first century civilization&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFIkeda1993" class="citation cs2 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2617"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Daisaku_Ikeda" title="Daisaku Ikeda" id="mwOeI">Ikeda, Daisaku</a> (24 September 1993), <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.sokagakkai.jp/daisakuikeda/assets/pdf/koen/harvard02.pdf" class="external text" id="mwOeM"><i id="mwOeQ">Mahayana Buddhism and twenty-first century civilization</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOeU">「21世紀文明と大乗仏教」</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwOeY">(PDF)</span> (in Japanese), <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwOec"><span lang="ja" id="mwOeg">池田大作先生の足跡</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwOek">, p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOeo">&nbsp;</span>3,  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOes">法華経には、しばしばドラムやトランペットのような楽器が登場するのも、それらの響きが生きんとする意志への励ましであるとすれば、よく納得できます。そして、その仏の命の力用が、「君よ、強くあれ。君よ、善くあれ、賢明であれ」との、人間復権へのメッセージであることは申すまでもありません。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=Mahayana+Buddhism+and+twenty-first+century+civilization+%E3%80%8C21%E4%B8%96%E7%B4%80%E6%96%87%E6%98%8E%E3%81%A8%E5%A4%A7%E4%B9%97%E4%BB%8F%E6%95%99%E3%80%8D&amp;rft.pages=3&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E6%B1%A0%E7%94%B0%E5%A4%A7%E4%BD%9C%E5%85%88%E7%94%9F%E3%81%AE%E8%B6%B3%E8%B7%A1%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.date=1993-09-24&amp;rft.aulast=Ikeda&amp;rft.aufirst=Daisaku&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.sokagakkai.jp%2Fdaisakuikeda%2Fassets%2Fpdf%2Fkoen%2Fharvard02.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2617" id="mwOew"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2617" id="mwOe0"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2617" id="mwOe4"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-220" id="cite_note-220" data-mw-footnote-number="207"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwOe8"><a href="#cite_ref-220" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwOfA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwOfE">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-220" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1236" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwOfI" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;AV media&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:幸せであれ&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Atsushi&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Shindō&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=16 June 1999&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:君よ 幸せであれ&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFShindō1999" class="citation audio-visual cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1236">Shindō, Atsushi (16 June 1999).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOfM">幸せであれ</bdi> (in Japanese).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOfQ">君よ 幸せであれ</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=%E5%B9%B8%E3%81%9B%E3%81%A7%E3%81%82%E3%82%8C&amp;rft.date=1999-06-16&amp;rft.aulast=Shind%C5%8D&amp;rft.aufirst=Atsushi&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1236" id="mwOfU"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1236" id="mwOfY"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1236" id="mwOfc"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-221" id="cite_note-221" data-mw-footnote-number="208"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwOfg"><a href="#cite_ref-221" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwOfk"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwOfo">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-221" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1239" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwOfs" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:死者の場合でも同じで，単なる物体と化した死体ではなく，死者ではあれ，従って物理的な動き・作用は見られないとしても，そこに人として活動していた痕跡が見られ，それはある種の「動性」を示すものと<span style=\&quot;text-emphasis:sesame\&quot;>感じられている</span>のだと主張することはできよう。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=85&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://osu.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/1234/files/KJ00009500204.pdf&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Hirao&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Masahiro&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:《いる》——日本語からの哲学・試論——（1）&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title='Iru'. A philosophical investigation based on Japanese language（Part Ⅰ）&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:大阪産業大学論集 人文・社会科学編&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal=Journal of Osaka Sangyo University: Humanities &amp; Social Sciences&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=22&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=1 October 2014&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFHirao2014" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1239">Hirao, Masahiro (1 October 2014). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://osu.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/1234/files/KJ00009500204.pdf" class="external text" id="mwOfw">"<span class="cs1-kern-left" id="mwOf0"></span>'Iru'. A philosophical investigation based on Japanese language（Part Ⅰ）" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOf4">《いる》——日本語からの哲学・試論——（1）</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwOf8">(PDF)</span>. <i id="mwOgA">Journal of Osaka Sangyo University: Humanities &amp; Social Sciences</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOgE">大阪産業大学論集 人文・社会科学編</bdi> (in Japanese). <b id="mwOgI">22</b>: 85.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOgM">死者の場合でも同じで，単なる物体と化した死体ではなく，死者ではあれ，従って物理的な動き・作用は見られないとしても，そこに人として活動していた痕跡が見られ，それはある種の「動性」を示すものと<span style="text-emphasis:sesame" id="mwOgQ">感じられている</span>のだと主張することはできよう。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Journal+of+Osaka+Sangyo+University%3A+Humanities+%26+Social+Sciences&amp;rft.atitle=%27Iru%27.+A+philosophical+investigation+based+on+Japanese+language%EF%BC%88Part+%E2%85%A0%EF%BC%89+%E3%80%8A%E3%81%84%E3%82%8B%E3%80%8B%E2%80%94%E2%80%94%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E8%AA%9E%E3%81%8B%E3%82%89%E3%81%AE%E5%93%B2%E5%AD%A6%E3%83%BB%E8%A9%A6%E8%AB%96%E2%80%94%E2%80%94%EF%BC%881%EF%BC%89&amp;rft.volume=22&amp;rft.pages=85&amp;rft.date=2014-10-01&amp;rft.aulast=Hirao&amp;rft.aufirst=Masahiro&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fosu.repo.nii.ac.jp%2Frecord%2F1234%2Ffiles%2FKJ00009500204.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1239" id="mwOgU"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1239" id="mwOgY"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1239" id="mwOgc"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-222" id="cite_note-222" data-mw-footnote-number="209"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwOgg"><a href="#cite_ref-222" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwOgk"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwOgo">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-222" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1242" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwOgs" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;AV media&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;author=[[Kyuso Nekokami]]&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:NO MORE 劣化実写化&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SJwOnThUt9I&amp;list=RDSJwOnThUt9I&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Victor Entertainment&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=24 July 2017&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;website=YouTube&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:せめて監督は原作漫画のファンであれ&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFKyuso_Nekokami2017" class="citation audio-visual cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1242"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kyuso_Nekokami" title="Kyuso Nekokami" id="mwOgw">Kyuso Nekokami</a> (24 July 2017). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SJwOnThUt9I&amp;list=RDSJwOnThUt9I" class="external text" id="mwOg0"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwOg4">NO MORE 劣化実写化</bdi></a>. <i id="mwOg8">YouTube</i> (in Japanese). Victor Entertainment.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOhA">せめて監督は原作漫画のファンであれ</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=NO+MORE+%E5%8A%A3%E5%8C%96%E5%AE%9F%E5%86%99%E5%8C%96&amp;rft.pub=Victor+Entertainment&amp;rft.date=2017-07-24&amp;rft.au=Kyuso+Nekokami&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fwatch%3Fv%3DSJwOnThUt9I%26list%3DRDSJwOnThUt9I&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1242" id="mwOhE"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1242" id="mwOhI"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1242" id="mwOhM"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-223" id="cite_note-223" data-mw-footnote-number="210"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwOhQ"><a href="#cite_ref-223" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwOhU"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwOhY">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-223" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1245" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwOhc" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:いずれにせよ、導入前とは言うものの、そのタイミングは相対的ではあれ、実際の導入時期に近くなっているように思われる。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=36&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.jil.go.jp/institute/research/2024/documents/0242.pdf&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:新しいデジタル技術導入と労使コミュニケーションに関する研究（2）&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Japan Institute for Labour Policy and Training&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|JILPT 調査シリーズ}}&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=242&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=March 2024&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:第4節 新しいデジタル技術の導入・その際の対応&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Nishimura&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Itaru&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFNishimura2024" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1245">Nishimura, Itaru (March 2024).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOhg">第4節 新しいデジタル技術の導入・その際の対応</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.jil.go.jp/institute/research/2024/documents/0242.pdf" class="external text" id="mwOhk"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwOho">新しいデジタル技術導入と労使コミュニケーションに関する研究（2）</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwOhs">(PDF)</span>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwOhw"><span lang="ja" id="mwOh0">JILPT 調査シリーズ</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwOh4"> (in Japanese). Japan Institute for Labour Policy and Training. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOh8">&nbsp;</span>36.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOiA">いずれにせよ、導入前とは言うものの、そのタイミングは相対的ではあれ、実際の導入時期に近くなっているように思われる。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E7%AC%AC4%E7%AF%80+%E6%96%B0%E3%81%97%E3%81%84%E3%83%87%E3%82%B8%E3%82%BF%E3%83%AB%E6%8A%80%E8%A1%93%E3%81%AE%E5%B0%8E%E5%85%A5%E3%83%BB%E3%81%9D%E3%81%AE%E9%9A%9B%E3%81%AE%E5%AF%BE%E5%BF%9C&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%96%B0%E3%81%97%E3%81%84%E3%83%87%E3%82%B8%E3%82%BF%E3%83%AB%E6%8A%80%E8%A1%93%E5%B0%8E%E5%85%A5%E3%81%A8%E5%8A%B4%E4%BD%BF%E3%82%B3%E3%83%9F%E3%83%A5%E3%83%8B%E3%82%B1%E3%83%BC%E3%82%B7%E3%83%A7%E3%83%B3%E3%81%AB%E9%96%A2%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B%E7%A0%94%E7%A9%B6%EF%BC%882%EF%BC%89&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3EJILPT+%E8%AA%BF%E6%9F%BB%E3%82%B7%E3%83%AA%E3%83%BC%E3%82%BA%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=36&amp;rft.pub=Japan+Institute+for+Labour+Policy+and+Training&amp;rft.date=2024-03&amp;rft.aulast=Nishimura&amp;rft.aufirst=Itaru&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.jil.go.jp%2Finstitute%2Fresearch%2F2024%2Fdocuments%2F0242.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1245" id="mwOiE"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1245" id="mwOiI"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1245" id="mwOiM"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-224" id="cite_note-224" data-mw-footnote-number="211"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwOiQ"><a href="#cite_ref-224" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwOiU"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwOiY">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-224" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1248" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwOic" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;AV media&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:与党であれ、野党であれ、<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>心<rp>(</rp><rt>しん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を捨ててですね。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:【会見LIVE】山本太郎がなぜ議員辞職するのか？（2022年4月15日）&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|れいわ新選組 公式チャンネル}}&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=15 April 2022&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7YMYfKqt0xg&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Mari Kushibuchi&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Mari&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Kushibuchi&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFKushibuchi2022" class="citation audio-visual cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1248"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mari_Kushibuchi" title="Mari Kushibuchi" id="mwOig">Kushibuchi, Mari</a> (15 April 2022). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7YMYfKqt0xg" class="external text" id="mwOik"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwOio">【会見LIVE】山本太郎がなぜ議員辞職するのか？（2022年4月15日）</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwOis"><span lang="ja" id="mwOiw">れいわ新選組 公式チャンネル</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwOi0">.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOi4">与党であれ、野党であれ、<ruby id="mwOi8">私<rp id="mwOjA">(</rp><rt id="mwOjE">し</rt><rp id="mwOjI">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwOjM">心<rp id="mwOjQ">(</rp><rt id="mwOjU">しん</rt><rp id="mwOjY">)</rp></ruby>を捨ててですね。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=%E3%80%90%E4%BC%9A%E8%A6%8BLIVE%E3%80%91%E5%B1%B1%E6%9C%AC%E5%A4%AA%E9%83%8E%E3%81%8C%E3%81%AA%E3%81%9C%E8%AD%B0%E5%93%A1%E8%BE%9E%E8%81%B7%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B%E3%81%AE%E3%81%8B%EF%BC%9F%EF%BC%882022%E5%B9%B44%E6%9C%8815%E6%97%A5%EF%BC%89&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E3%82%8C%E3%81%84%E3%82%8F%E6%96%B0%E9%81%B8%E7%B5%84+%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E3%83%81%E3%83%A3%E3%83%B3%E3%83%8D%E3%83%AB%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.date=2022-04-15&amp;rft.aulast=Kushibuchi&amp;rft.aufirst=Mari&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fwatch%3Fv%3D7YMYfKqt0xg&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1248" id="mwOjc"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1248" id="mwOjg"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1248" id="mwOjk"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-225" id="cite_note-225" data-mw-footnote-number="212"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwOjo"><a href="#cite_ref-225" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwOjs"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwOjw">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-225" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1253" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwOj0" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:それで若し彼等が爾は何でありませ、爾が由て以て存在しますその本體は朽つべきでないとするならば、卽ち此等の所言皆僞で又詛ふべきである。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote=So then, should they assume Thy Substance whereby Thou art, whatsoever Thou be, to be incorruptible, then all these statements are false and execrable.&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=Itaque si te, quidquid es, id est substantiam tuam, qua es, incorruptibilem dicerent, falsa esse illa omnia et exsecrabilia;&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=178&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1038873/1/108&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:第七卷&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=Liber VII&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-chapter=Book VII&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:アウグスチヌス懴悔錄&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=[[Confessions (Augustine)|Augustine’s Confessions]]&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Augustini Confessiones&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;author=[[Augustine]]&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Uchimura&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Tatsusaburō&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Shunjūsha&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=8 September 1946&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Nihonbashi]], Tokyo&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFAugustine1946" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1253"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Augustine" title="Augustine" class="mw-redirect" id="mwOj4">Augustine</a> (8 September 1946). "Liber VII" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOj8">第七卷</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOkA">[</span>Book VII<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOkE">]</span>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1038873/1/108" class="external text" id="mwOkI"><i id="mwOkM">Augustini Confessiones</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOkQ">アウグスチヌス懴悔錄</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOkU">[</span><i id="mwOkY"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Confessions_(Augustine)" title="Confessions (Augustine)" id="mwOkc">Augustine’s Confessions</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOkg">]</span> (in Japanese). Translated by Uchimura, Tatsusaburō. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nihonbashi" title="Nihonbashi" id="mwOkk">Nihonbashi</a>, Tokyo: Shunjūsha. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOko">&nbsp;</span>178. <q id="mwOks">Itaque si te, quidquid es, id est substantiam tuam, qua es, incorruptibilem dicerent, falsa esse illa omnia et exsecrabilia;</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOkw">それで若し彼等が爾は何でありませ、爾が由て以て存在しますその本體は朽つべきでないとするならば、卽ち此等の所言皆僞で又詛ふべきである。</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOk0">[</span>So then, should they assume Thy Substance whereby Thou art, whatsoever Thou be, to be incorruptible, then all these statements are false and execrable.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOk4">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=Liber+VII+%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%83%E5%8D%B7&amp;rft.btitle=Augustini+Confessiones+%E3%82%A2%E3%82%A6%E3%82%B0%E3%82%B9%E3%83%81%E3%83%8C%E3%82%B9%E6%87%B4%E6%82%94%E9%8C%84&amp;rft.place=Nihonbashi%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=178&amp;rft.pub=Shunj%C5%ABsha&amp;rft.date=1946-09-08&amp;rft.au=Augustine&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1038873%2F1%2F108&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1253" id="mwOk8"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1253" id="mwOlA"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1253" id="mwOlE"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-226" id="cite_note-226" data-mw-footnote-number="213"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwOlI"><a href="#cite_ref-226" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwOlM"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwOlQ">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-226" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1284" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwOlU" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"><cite id="CITEREFItō2012" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source">Itō, Chihaya (9 May 2012).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOlY">第５章 パンの耳はひのせの主食⁉</bdi>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOlc">ちゅーちゅーエンジェル</bdi> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kōtō" title="Kōtō" id="mwOlg">Kōtō</a>, Tokyo: PHP Institute.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E7%AC%AC%EF%BC%95%E7%AB%A0+%E3%83%91%E3%83%B3%E3%81%AE%E8%80%B3%E3%81%AF%E3%81%B2%E3%81%AE%E3%81%9B%E3%81%AE%E4%B8%BB%E9%A3%9F%E2%81%89&amp;rft.btitle=%E3%81%A1%E3%82%85%E3%83%BC%E3%81%A1%E3%82%85%E3%83%BC%E3%82%A8%E3%83%B3%E3%82%B8%E3%82%A7%E3%83%AB&amp;rft.place=K%C5%8Dt%C5%8D%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pub=PHP+Institute&amp;rft.date=2012-05-09&amp;rft.aulast=It%C5%8D&amp;rft.aufirst=Chihaya&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" id="mwOlk"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" id="mwOlo"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" id="mwOls"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-ito-2010-227" id="cite_note-ito-2010-227" data-mw-footnote-number="214"><span rel="mw:referencedBy" class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwOlw"><a href="#cite_ref-ito-2010_227-0" id="mwOl0"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwOl4">1</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-ito-2010_227-1" id="mwOl8"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwOmA">2</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-ito-2010-227" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1290" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwOmE" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"><cite id="CITEREFItō2010" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source">Itō, Hiroshi (2010).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOmI">第一章 狂虎の咆哮</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOmM">[</span>Chapter One: The Roar of the Mad Tiger<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOmQ">]</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOmU">安土大乱記　狂気の終焉</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOmY">[</span><i id="mwOmc">The Great <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Azuchi" title="Azuchi" class="mw-redirect" id="mwOmg">Azuchi</a> Rebellion: The End of the Madness</i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOmk">]</span>. Rekishi Gunzo Books (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOmo">&nbsp;</span>2. Gakken.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOms">「今晩はここで野営とする。早く飯を食って、早く寝よ」<br id="mwOmw">織田勢の使い番たちは、あまり例のない命令を触れて回った。夜襲を警戒せよとの命令はよく出るが、早く寝よなどという、子どもに注意するような命令は異例であった。<br id="mwOm0">秋の夜は長い、あまり早く寝すぎると、夜中に目が覚めてしまって、そのあと眠ることができなくなり、かえって疲れることも多い。寝るにもころあいの時間というものがあった。<br id="mwOm4">とにかく、早く寝よとの信長の命令であったから、飯を食い終わると早々に誰しもが寝た。<br id="mwOm8"><ruby id="mwOnA">丑<rp id="mwOnE">(</rp><rt id="mwOnI">うし</rt><rp id="mwOnM">)</rp></ruby>の刻（午前二時ごろ）になると、信長の本営から使いが走り出し、各部隊の責任者を起こして回った。<br id="mwOnQ">「起きよ、すぐに兵を起こせ。物音を立てず静かに起こすのだ」<br id="mwOnU">眠気眼をこすっている者たちが、次々と起きだしていく。夜中に起こされたのであるから、次の行動はおおよそ想像が付く。</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOnY">[</span>“We are camping here tonight. Eat dinner and go to sleep early.”<br id="mwOnc">The messengers among the Oda troops passed the highly unprecedented order around. Orders to be on guard against night raids were common, but one to sleep early, as would be issued to children, was unusual.<br id="mwOng">Autumnal nights were long, thus if one slept too early, one would end up awake in the middle of the night, unable to fall back asleep, and ultimately all the more tired. There was an appropriate time for sleep.<br id="mwOnk">At all events, since Nobunaga’s order was to sleep early, everyone finished dinner and promptly went to sleep.<br id="mwOno">During the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ox_(zodiac)#Hour_of_the_Ox" title="Ox (zodiac)" id="mwOns">hours of the Ox</a> (around 2 AM), a messenger ran out from Nobunaga’s headquarters and woke up the leader of each unit.<br id="mwOnw">“Rise, wake up your men at once. Quietly, without making any noise.”<br id="mwOn0">The men were rubbing their sleepy eyes as they rose one after another. Since they were woken up in the middle of the night, one could imagine what they would be doing next.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOn4">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E7%AB%A0+%E7%8B%82%E8%99%8E%E3%81%AE%E5%92%86%E5%93%AE&amp;rft.btitle=%E5%AE%89%E5%9C%9F%E5%A4%A7%E4%B9%B1%E8%A8%98%E3%80%80%E7%8B%82%E6%B0%97%E3%81%AE%E7%B5%82%E7%84%89&amp;rft.series=Rekishi+Gunzo+Books&amp;rft.pub=Gakken&amp;rft.date=2010&amp;rft.aulast=It%C5%8D&amp;rft.aufirst=Hiroshi&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" id="mwOn8"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" id="mwOoA"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" id="mwOoE"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-228" id="cite_note-228" data-mw-footnote-number="215"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwOoI"><a href="#cite_ref-228" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwOoM"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwOoQ">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-228" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1296" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwOoU" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"><cite id="CITEREFShakespeareHirata1947" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Shakespeare" title="William Shakespeare" id="mwOoY">Shakespeare, William</a>; Hirata, Tokuboku (30 April 1947). "King Lear" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOoc">リヤ王</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1168434/1/80" class="external text" id="mwOog"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwOok">シェイクスピア物語</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOoo">[</span><i id="mwOos">Shakespeare’s Tales</i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOow">]</span> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chūō,_Tokyo" title="Chūō, Tokyo" id="mwOo0">Chūō, Tokyo</a>: <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwOo4"><span lang="ja" id="mwOo8">文壽堂出版部</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwOpA">. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOpE">&nbsp;</span>149.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=King+Lear+%E3%83%AA%E3%83%A4%E7%8E%8B&amp;rft.btitle=%E3%82%B7%E3%82%A7%E3%82%A4%E3%82%AF%E3%82%B9%E3%83%94%E3%82%A2%E7%89%A9%E8%AA%9E&amp;rft.place=Ch%C5%AB%C5%8D%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=149&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E6%96%87%E5%A3%BD%E5%A0%82%E5%87%BA%E7%89%88%E9%83%A8%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.date=1947-04-30&amp;rft.aulast=Shakespeare&amp;rft.aufirst=William&amp;rft.au=Hirata%2C+Tokuboku&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1168434%2F1%2F80&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" id="mwOpI"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" id="mwOpM"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" id="mwOpQ"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-229" id="cite_note-229" data-mw-footnote-number="216"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwOpU"><a href="#cite_ref-229" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwOpY"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwOpc">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-229" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1302" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwOpg" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"><cite id="CITEREFWatanabe" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source">Watanabe, Saburō.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOpk"><ruby id="mwOpo">龍<rp id="mwOps">(</rp><rt id="mwOpw">りう</rt><rp id="mwOp0">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwOp4">宮<rp id="mwOp8">(</rp><rt id="mwOqA">ぐう</rt><rp id="mwOqE">)</rp></ruby>へ行つた木こり</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1717525/1/23" class="external text" id="mwOqI"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwOqM">南方童話の旅</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kanda,_Tokyo" title="Kanda, Tokyo" id="mwOqQ">Kanda, Tokyo</a>: <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwOqU"><span lang="ja" id="mwOqY">帝敎書房</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwOqc">. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOqg">&nbsp;</span>35.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOqk">山の神樣の仕合せなやうすを見て、ねたましく思つた神さまがあつたのです。それは、水の神樣でした。水の神樣は、多ぜいの<ruby id="mwOqo">家<rp id="mwOqs">(</rp><rt id="mwOqw">け</rt><rp id="mwOq0">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwOq4">來<rp id="mwOq8">(</rp><rt id="mwOrA">らい</rt><rp id="mwOrE">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwOrI">命<rp id="mwOrM">(</rp><rt id="mwOrQ">めい</rt><rp id="mwOrU">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwOrY">令<rp id="mwOrc">(</rp><rt id="mwOrg">れい</rt><rp id="mwOrk">)</rp></ruby>しました。<br id="mwOro">「あの山の城をくずしてしまへ！　雨よ降れ。風よ吹け。」<br id="mwOrs">さあ、かうなると大へんです。見る見るうちに大空はまつ黑な雲がおひかぶさつて、ドツドツとはげしい風が吹き出し、ザアツザアツと强い雨が振り出しました。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%3Cruby%3E%E9%BE%8D%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%82%8A%E3%81%86%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E5%AE%AE%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%90%E3%81%86%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%E3%81%B8%E8%A1%8C%E3%81%A4%E3%81%9F%E6%9C%A8%E3%81%93%E3%82%8A&amp;rft.btitle=%E5%8D%97%E6%96%B9%E7%AB%A5%E8%A9%B1%E3%81%AE%E6%97%85&amp;rft.place=Kanda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=35&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E5%B8%9D%E6%95%8E%E6%9B%B8%E6%88%BF%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.aulast=Watanabe&amp;rft.aufirst=Sabur%C5%8D&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1717525%2F1%2F23&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" id="mwOrw"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" id="mwOr0"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" id="mwOr4"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-230" id="cite_note-230" data-mw-footnote-number="217"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwOr8"><a href="#cite_ref-230" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwOsA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwOsE">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-230" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1308" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwOsI" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"><cite id="CITEREFTezuka2000" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Osamu_Tezuka" title="Osamu Tezuka" id="mwOsM">Tezuka, Osamu</a> (10 May 2000).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOsQ">ボンバ！</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOsU">[</span><i id="mwOsY"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bomba!" title="Bomba!" id="mwOsc">Bomba!</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOsg">]</span>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwOsk"><span lang="ja" id="mwOso">手塚治虫漫画全集</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwOss"> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOsw">&nbsp;</span>93 (8th<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOs0">&nbsp;</span>ed.). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bunkyō" title="Bunkyō" id="mwOs4">Bunkyō</a>, Tokyo: Kodansha. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOs8">&nbsp;</span><span class="nowrap" id="mwOtA">79–</span>80. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)" title="ISBN (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwOtE">ISBN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOtI">&nbsp;</span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/4-06-108693-6" title="Special:BookSources/4-06-108693-6" id="mwOtM"><bdi id="mwOtQ">4-06-108693-6</bdi></a>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOtU">先生……先生――っ！だれが殺した……だれが殺したんだ‼そいつは殺人犯だ　おれが……復讐してやるぞ　先生をおしつぶしたやつら‼みんな死ね　死ね　死んじまえっ　ボンバ‼やつらを殺せっ　ひとリのこらず殺すんだ‼</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOtY">[</span>Miss…… Miss Mizushima――! Who did it…… Who murdered her⁉ They’re murderers! I’ll…… make them pay! All you bastards that <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Crowd_collapses_and_crushes" title="Crowd collapses and crushes" id="mwOtc">crushed</a> her‼ Die, die, just die‼ Bomba‼ Kill them‼ All of them‼<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOtg">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=%E3%83%9C%E3%83%B3%E3%83%90%EF%BC%81&amp;rft.place=Bunky%C5%8D%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E6%89%8B%E5%A1%9A%E6%B2%BB%E8%99%AB%E6%BC%AB%E7%94%BB%E5%85%A8%E9%9B%86%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=79-80&amp;rft.edition=8th&amp;rft.pub=Kodansha&amp;rft.date=2000-05-10&amp;rft.isbn=4-06-108693-6&amp;rft.aulast=Tezuka&amp;rft.aufirst=Osamu&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" id="mwOtk"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" id="mwOto"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" id="mwOts"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-231" id="cite_note-231" data-mw-footnote-number="218"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwOtw"><a href="#cite_ref-231" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwOt0"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwOt4">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-231" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1314" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwOt8" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"><cite id="mwOuA" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" data-x-id="CITEREFTezuka2000"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Osamu_Tezuka" title="Osamu Tezuka" id="mwOuE">Tezuka, Osamu</a> (20 January 2000).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOuI">ブラック・ジャック</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOuM">[</span><i id="mwOuQ"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Jack_(manga)" title="Black Jack (manga)" id="mwOuU">Black Jack</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOuY">]</span>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwOuc"><span lang="ja" id="mwOug">手塚治虫漫画全集</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwOuk"> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOuo">&nbsp;</span>11 (8th<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOus">&nbsp;</span>ed.). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bunkyō" title="Bunkyō" id="mwOuw">Bunkyō</a>, Tokyo: Kodansha. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOu0">&nbsp;</span><span class="nowrap" id="mwOu4">94–</span>95. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)" title="ISBN (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwOu8">ISBN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOvA">&nbsp;</span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/4-06-108761-4" title="Special:BookSources/4-06-108761-4" id="mwOvE"><bdi id="mwOvI">4-06-108761-4</bdi></a>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOvM">うそです　先生はお金たくさんもらうからなおすんだ<br id="mwOvQ">先生　お金もらうだめ　手術やるだめ　お願いです<br id="mwOvU">先生　悪い人に味方するいけない　あいつ助けないの‼<br id="mwOvY">金をもらうのがなぜ悪い？おおきなお世話だっ<br id="mwOvc">ケネス死ね　先生も死んじゃえ‼</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOvg">[</span>You’re lying! You’re only treating him because he’s paying you a lot of money!<br id="mwOvk">Doctor, don’t take his money, don’t do the surgery, please!<br id="mwOvo">You can’t side with the bad guy! Don’t help him‼<br id="mwOvs">What’s wrong with taking money? It’s none of your damn business!<br id="mwOvw">Drop dead, Kenneth! You die too, Doctor‼<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOv0">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=%E3%83%96%E3%83%A9%E3%83%83%E3%82%AF%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B8%E3%83%A3%E3%83%83%E3%82%AF&amp;rft.place=Bunky%C5%8D%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E6%89%8B%E5%A1%9A%E6%B2%BB%E8%99%AB%E6%BC%AB%E7%94%BB%E5%85%A8%E9%9B%86%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=94-95&amp;rft.edition=8th&amp;rft.pub=Kodansha&amp;rft.date=2000-01-20&amp;rft.isbn=4-06-108761-4&amp;rft.aulast=Tezuka&amp;rft.aufirst=Osamu&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" id="mwOv4"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" id="mwOv8"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" id="mwOwA"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-mori-1943-232" id="cite_note-mori-1943-232" data-mw-footnote-number="219"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwOwE"><a href="#cite_ref-mori-1943_232-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwOwI"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwOwM">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-mori-1943-232" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1320" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwOwQ" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"><cite id="CITEREFRizal_Mercado_y_Alonso_Realonda1943" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/José_Rizal" title="José Rizal" id="mwOwU">Rizal Mercado y Alonso Realonda, José Protasio</a> (20 January 1943). "XXXIV La comida" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOwY">34　午餐會</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOwc">[</span>34 The Luncheon<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOwg">]</span>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1136958/1/174" class="external text" id="mwOwk"><i id="mwOwo">Noli me tángere</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOws">黎明を待つ</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOww">[</span><i id="mwOw0"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Noli_Me_Tángere_(novel)" title="Noli Me Tángere (novel)" id="mwOw4">Awaiting Dawn</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOw8">]</span> (in Japanese). Translated by Mōri, Yasotarō. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kyōbashi,_Tokyo" title="Kyōbashi, Tokyo" id="mwOxA">Kyōbashi, Tokyo</a>: Dainippon Shuppan. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOxE">&nbsp;</span>321. <q id="mwOxI">—Mi corazón late tranquilo, mi mano va segura…<br id="mwOxM">Y mirando alrededor suyo:<br id="mwOxQ">—Antes, ¿hay entre vosotros alguno que no haya amado a su padre, que haya odiado su memoria, alguno nacido en la vergüenza y la humillación…? ¿Ves?, ¿oyes ese silencio? Sacerdote de un Dios de paz, que tienes la boca llena de santidad y religión, y el corazón de miseria, tú no debiste conocer lo que es un padre… ¡hubieras pensado en el tuyo! ¿Ves? ¡Entre esa multitud que tú desprecias no hay uno como tú! ¡Estás juzgado!</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOxU">「僕は氣持は靜かで、手もとも狂つちやゐない」と彼は四邊を見廻しながら云つた。「先づ、諸君の中で、自分の父を愛さなかつた者があるか、父の想ひ出を嫌ふやうな屈辱な生れかたをした者があるか。見給へ、諸君はこの沈默がお解りだらう？　平和の神の僧となつて、神聖とか宗敎とか年中口にしながら、腹の黑い貴樣のやうな奴は父の何たるを知らないんだ。さもなけりや貴樣、自分の父のことを考へても見ろ！　貴樣が馬鹿にしてる、この會衆の中に貴樣のやうな奴は一人も居ないぞツ。貴樣は奈落の底へ落つべき奴だ！」</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOxY">[</span>“My mind is calm, my hand is steady,” he said, looking around. “First, is there one among you who has not loved his father, who was born in such humiliation that he hates his memory? See? You understand this silence? Priest of a God of peace, your mouth is full of sanctity and religion, yet you black-hearted knave do not know what a father is supposed to be. If not, think of your own father for a change! In this crowd which you scorn there is not a single knave like you. You deserve to go to the depths of hell!”<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwOxc">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=XXXIV+La+comida+34%E3%80%80%E5%8D%88%E9%A4%90%E6%9C%83&amp;rft.btitle=Noli+me+t%C3%A1ngere+%E9%BB%8E%E6%98%8E%E3%82%92%E5%BE%85%E3%81%A4&amp;rft.place=Ky%C5%8Dbashi%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=321&amp;rft.pub=Dainippon+Shuppan&amp;rft.date=1943-01-20&amp;rft.aulast=Rizal+Mercado+y+Alonso+Realonda&amp;rft.aufirst=Jos%C3%A9+Protasio&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1136958%2F1%2F174&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" id="mwOxg"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" id="mwOxk"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" id="mwOxo"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-233" id="cite_note-233" data-mw-footnote-number="220"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwOxs"><a href="#cite_ref-233" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwOxw"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwOx0">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-233" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1331" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwOx4" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"><cite class="citation web cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" id="mwOx8"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://kotobank.jp/word/%E3%81%8A%E5%B8%B0%E3%82%8A%E3%81%AA%E3%81%95%E3%81%84-3227453" class="external text" id="mwOyA"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwOyE">お帰りなさい</bdi></a>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwOyI">コトバンク</bdi> (in Japanese).</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=%E3%81%8A%E5%B8%B0%E3%82%8A%E3%81%AA%E3%81%95%E3%81%84&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fkotobank.jp%2Fword%2F%25E3%2581%258A%25E5%25B8%25B0%25E3%2582%258A%25E3%2581%25AA%25E3%2581%2595%25E3%2581%2584-3227453&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" id="mwOyM"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" id="mwOyQ"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" id="mwOyU"></span></li>
