<li about="#cite_note-298" id="cite_note-298" data-mw-footnote-number="278"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwP2A"><a href="#cite_ref-298" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwP2E"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwP2I">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-298" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1678" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwP2M" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.u-tokyo.ac.jp/content/400239115.pdf&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=University of Tokyo&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:入学試験問題 国語（文科）&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:（切り離さないで用いよ。）[…]後の設問に答えよ。[…]現代語訳せよ。[…]説明せよ。&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=25 February 2025&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script" about="#mwt1678" id="mwP2Q"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.u-tokyo.ac.jp/content/400239115.pdf" class="external text" id="mwP2U"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwP2Y">入学試験問題 国語（文科）</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwP2c">(PDF)</span>. University of Tokyo. 25 February 2025.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwP2g">（切り離さないで用いよ。）[…]後の設問に答えよ。[…]現代語訳せよ。[…]説明せよ。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=%E5%85%A5%E5%AD%A6%E8%A9%A6%E9%A8%93%E5%95%8F%E9%A1%8C+%E5%9B%BD%E8%AA%9E%EF%BC%88%E6%96%87%E7%A7%91%EF%BC%89&amp;rft.pub=University+of+Tokyo&amp;rft.date=2025-02-25&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.u-tokyo.ac.jp%2Fcontent%2F400239115.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1678" id="mwP2k"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1678" id="mwP2o"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-299" id="cite_note-299" data-mw-footnote-number="279"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwP2s"><a href="#cite_ref-299" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwP2w"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwP20">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-299" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1681" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwP24" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:以下の(75)の句構造規則を用いよ。また、(77)の意味解釈規則を参照せよ。[…]Aux と考えよ。&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=44&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:問題を通して学ぶ生成文法&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Abe&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Jun&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=21 March 2008&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFAbe2008" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script" about="#mwt1681">Abe, Jun (21 March 2008).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwP28">問題を通して学ぶ生成文法</bdi>. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwP3A">&nbsp;</span>44.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwP3E">以下の(75)の句構造規則を用いよ。また、(77)の意味解釈規則を参照せよ。[…]Aux と考えよ。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=%E5%95%8F%E9%A1%8C%E3%82%92%E9%80%9A%E3%81%97%E3%81%A6%E5%AD%A6%E3%81%B6%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E6%96%87%E6%B3%95&amp;rft.pages=44&amp;rft.date=2008-03-21&amp;rft.aulast=Abe&amp;rft.aufirst=Jun&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1681" id="mwP3I"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1681" id="mwP3M"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-300" id="cite_note-300" data-mw-footnote-number="280"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwP3Q"><a href="#cite_ref-300" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwP3U"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwP3Y">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-300" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1684" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwP3c" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;AV media&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:まずは「視」すべしと言われてるんですよ。「視」。何？どう見えるか。その人の外側を視よと、ね？外部及び、行動ですよね。外に現れてるもの。何をしてるのって、何をしてるの、その人っていう、どういうひと？どんなビジュアルで、どんな格好で、どんな風にみえる？外側をまず見てください。言うわけですね？&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HOO6nbFz74I&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:【論語と算盤②】成功に必要なのは常識と習慣！&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=NAKATA UNIVERSITY&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;website=YouTube&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=26 October 2019&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Nakata&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Atsuhiko&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFNakata2019" class="citation audio-visual cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1684">Nakata, Atsuhiko (26 October 2019). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HOO6nbFz74I" class="external text" id="mwP3g"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwP3k">【論語と算盤②】成功に必要なのは常識と習慣！</bdi></a>. <i id="mwP3o">YouTube</i> (in Japanese). NAKATA UNIVERSITY.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwP3s">まずは「視」すべしと言われてるんですよ。「視」。何？どう見えるか。その人の外側を視よと、ね？外部及び、行動ですよね。外に現れてるもの。何をしてるのって、何をしてるの、その人っていう、どういうひと？どんなビジュアルで、どんな格好で、どんな風にみえる？外側をまず見てください。言うわけですね？</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=%E3%80%90%E8%AB%96%E8%AA%9E%E3%81%A8%E7%AE%97%E7%9B%A4%E2%91%A1%E3%80%91%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%E3%81%AB%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E3%81%AA%E3%81%AE%E3%81%AF%E5%B8%B8%E8%AD%98%E3%81%A8%E7%BF%92%E6%85%A3%EF%BC%81&amp;rft.pub=NAKATA+UNIVERSITY&amp;rft.date=2019-10-26&amp;rft.aulast=Nakata&amp;rft.aufirst=Atsuhiko&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fwatch%3Fv%3DHOO6nbFz74I&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1684" id="mwP3w"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1684" id="mwP30"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1684" id="mwP34"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-301" id="cite_note-301" data-mw-footnote-number="281"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwP38"><a href="#cite_ref-301" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwP4A"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwP4E">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-301" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1687" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwP4I" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;AV media&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:まず私たちの無意識のうちの考え方を生き方を転換せよということがあるんですね&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:「奪う人」から「与える人」へ 〜幸せを引き寄せる菩薩行とは〜&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IYI2i0RuWiM&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|大愚和尚の一問一答}}/Osho Taigu's Heart of Buddha&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;website=YouTube&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=3 February 2022&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;author=Taigu Oshō&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFTaigu_Oshō2022" class="citation audio-visual cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1687">Taigu Oshō (3 February 2022). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IYI2i0RuWiM" class="external text" id="mwP4M"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwP4Q">「奪う人」から「与える人」へ 〜幸せを引き寄せる菩薩行とは〜</bdi></a>. <i id="mwP4U">YouTube</i> (in Japanese). <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwP4Y"><span lang="ja" id="mwP4c">大愚和尚の一問一答</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwP4g">/Osho Taigu's Heart of Buddha.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwP4k">まず私たちの無意識のうちの考え方を生き方を転換せよということがあるんですね</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=%E3%80%8C%E5%A5%AA%E3%81%86%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%8D%E3%81%8B%E3%82%89%E3%80%8C%E4%B8%8E%E3%81%88%E3%82%8B%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%8D%E3%81%B8+%E3%80%9C%E5%B9%B8%E3%81%9B%E3%82%92%E5%BC%95%E3%81%8D%E5%AF%84%E3%81%9B%E3%82%8B%E8%8F%A9%E8%96%A9%E8%A1%8C%E3%81%A8%E3%81%AF%E3%80%9C&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E5%A4%A7%E6%84%9A%E5%92%8C%E5%B0%9A%E3%81%AE%E4%B8%80%E5%95%8F%E4%B8%80%E7%AD%94%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text%2FOsho+Taigu%27s+Heart+of+Buddha&amp;rft.date=2022-02-03&amp;rft.au=Taigu+Osh%C5%8D&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fwatch%3Fv%3DIYI2i0RuWiM&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1687" id="mwP4o"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1687" id="mwP4s"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1687" id="mwP4w"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-302" id="cite_note-302" data-mw-footnote-number="282"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwP40"><a href="#cite_ref-302" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwP44"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwP48">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-302" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1690" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwP5A" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;AV media&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lbIxyB1TSto&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:西暦1つ変えれば全て反映する年間カレンダーを作ろう（Excel中級）&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Kawashima&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Reiko&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|いなわく}}TV&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;website=YouTube&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:それ以外は空白にせよという意味になります&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=18 February 2022&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFKawashima2022" class="citation audio-visual cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1690">Kawashima, Reiko (18 February 2022). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lbIxyB1TSto" class="external text" id="mwP5E"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwP5I">西暦1つ変えれば全て反映する年間カレンダーを作ろう（Excel中級）</bdi></a>. <i id="mwP5M">YouTube</i> (in Japanese). <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwP5Q"><span lang="ja" id="mwP5U">いなわく</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwP5Y">TV.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwP5c">それ以外は空白にせよという意味になります</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=%E8%A5%BF%E6%9A%A61%E3%81%A4%E5%A4%89%E3%81%88%E3%82%8C%E3%81%B0%E5%85%A8%E3%81%A6%E5%8F%8D%E6%98%A0%E3%81%99%E3%82%8B%E5%B9%B4%E9%96%93%E3%82%AB%E3%83%AC%E3%83%B3%E3%83%80%E3%83%BC%E3%82%92%E4%BD%9C%E3%82%8D%E3%81%86%EF%BC%88Excel%E4%B8%AD%E7%B4%9A%EF%BC%89&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E3%81%84%E3%81%AA%E3%82%8F%E3%81%8F%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+textTV&amp;rft.date=2022-02-18&amp;rft.aulast=Kawashima&amp;rft.aufirst=Reiko&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fwatch%3Fv%3DlbIxyB1TSto&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1690" id="mwP5g"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1690" id="mwP5k"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1690" id="mwP5o"></span></li>
