="external text" id="mwP6A"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwP6E">【LIVE】山本太郎 れいわ新選組代表 不定例記者会見 衆議院議員 たがや亮、大石あきこ、くしぶち万里（国会内 2022年6月15日）</bdi></a>. <i id="mwP6I">YouTube</i> (in Japanese). <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwP6M"><span lang="ja" id="mwP6Q">れいわ新選組 公式チャンネル</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwP6U">.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwP6Y">ま現場からも同様の額で改善をせよという声がたくさん上がっています</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=%E3%80%90LIVE%E3%80%91%E5%B1%B1%E6%9C%AC%E5%A4%AA%E9%83%8E+%E3%82%8C%E3%81%84%E3%82%8F%E6%96%B0%E9%81%B8%E7%B5%84%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8+%E4%B8%8D%E5%AE%9A%E4%BE%8B%E8%A8%98%E8%80%85%E4%BC%9A%E8%A6%8B+%E8%A1%86%E8%AD%B0%E9%99%A2%E8%AD%B0%E5%93%A1+%E3%81%9F%E3%81%8C%E3%82%84%E4%BA%AE%E3%80%81%E5%A4%A7%E7%9F%B3%E3%81%82%E3%81%8D%E3%81%93%E3%80%81%E3%81%8F%E3%81%97%E3%81%B6%E3%81%A1%E4%B8%87%E9%87%8C%EF%BC%88%E5%9B%BD%E4%BC%9A%E5%86%85+2022%E5%B9%B46%E6%9C%8815%E6%97%A5%EF%BC%89&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E3%82%8C%E3%81%84%E3%82%8F%E6%96%B0%E9%81%B8%E7%B5%84+%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E3%83%81%E3%83%A3%E3%83%B3%E3%83%8D%E3%83%AB%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.date=2022-06-15&amp;rft.aulast=%C5%8Cishi&amp;rft.aufirst=Akiko&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fwatch%3Fv%3D0HnvE4SHlK0&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1693" id="mwP6c"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1693" id="mwP6g"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1693" id="mwP6k"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-304" id="cite_note-304" data-mw-footnote-number="284"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwP6o"><a href="#cite_ref-304" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwP6s"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwP6w">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-304" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1696" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwP60" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;AV media&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:自分のしたこととしなかったことのみを見よという言葉があるんですね&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=24 March 2024&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:【法話】自分に正直に生きていく&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lEBywYlWG70&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|須磨寺小池陽人の随想録}}&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Koike&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Yōnin&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;website=YouTube&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFKoike2024" class="citation audio-visual cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1696">Koike, Yōnin (24 March 2024). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lEBywYlWG70" class="external text" id="mwP64"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwP68">【法話】自分に正直に生きていく</bdi></a>. <i id="mwP7A">YouTube</i> (in Japanese). <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwP7E"><span lang="ja" id="mwP7I">須磨寺小池陽人の随想録</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwP7M">.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwP7Q">自分のしたこととしなかったことのみを見よという言葉があるんですね</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=%E3%80%90%E6%B3%95%E8%A9%B1%E3%80%91%E8%87%AA%E5%88%86%E3%81%AB%E6%AD%A3%E7%9B%B4%E3%81%AB%E7%94%9F%E3%81%8D%E3%81%A6%E3%81%84%E3%81%8F&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E9%A0%88%E7%A3%A8%E5%AF%BA%E5%B0%8F%E6%B1%A0%E9%99%BD%E4%BA%BA%E3%81%AE%E9%9A%8F%E6%83%B3%E9%8C%B2%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.date=2024-03-24&amp;rft.aulast=Koike&amp;rft.aufirst=Y%C5%8Dnin&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fwatch%3Fv%3DlEBywYlWG70&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1696" id="mwP7U"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1696" id="mwP7Y"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1696" id="mwP7c"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-305" id="cite_note-305" data-mw-footnote-number="285"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwP7g"><a href="#cite_ref-305" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwP7k"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwP7o">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-305" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1699" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwP7s" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:芭蕉の「松のことは松にならへ、竹のことは竹にならへ」という言葉に対して、西谷はそれらを単に観察したり、研究したりするのではなく、それぞれの自体的なあり方に自分自身もなって、そのところでそれらを見よと述べる。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=11&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Yanagawa&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Taiki&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:西谷啓治のいけばな論：いけ手と切り花が一つになる&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:成城美学美術史&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=29&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=2023&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://seijo.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/2000062/files/art-029-01.pdf&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFYanagawa2023" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1699">Yanagawa, Taiki (2023). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://seijo.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/2000062/files/art-029-01.pdf" class="external text" id="mwP7w"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwP70">西谷啓治のいけばな論：いけ手と切り花が一つになる</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwP74">(PDF)</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwP78">成城美学美術史</bdi> (in Japanese) (29): 11.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwP8A">芭蕉の「松のことは松にならへ、竹のことは竹にならへ」という言葉に対して、西谷はそれらを単に観察したり、研究したりするのではなく、それぞれの自体的なあり方に自分自身もなって、そのところでそれらを見よと述べる。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E8%A5%BF%E8%B0%B7%E5%95%93%E6%B2%BB%E3%81%AE%E3%81%84%E3%81%91%E3%81%B0%E3%81%AA%E8%AB%96%EF%BC%9A%E3%81%84%E3%81%91%E6%89%8B%E3%81%A8%E5%88%87%E3%82%8A%E8%8A%B1%E3%81%8C%E4%B8%80%E3%81%A4%E3%81%AB%E3%81%AA%E3%82%8B&amp;rft.issue=29&amp;rft.pages=11&amp;rft.date=2023&amp;rft.aulast=Yanagawa&amp;rft.aufirst=Taiki&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fseijo.repo.nii.ac.jp%2Frecord%2F2000062%2Ffiles%2Fart-029-01.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1699" id="mwP8E"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1699" id="mwP8I"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1699" id="mwP8M"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-306" id="cite_note-306" data-mw-footnote-number="286"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwP8Q"><a href="#cite_ref-306" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwP8U"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwP8Y">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-306" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1702" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwP8c" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:徳や悪徳という言葉はビジネス社会の中に自然に溶け込んでいる。それにも関わらず、いざ徳のある企業を具体的に列挙せよ、徳に適う企業実践の実例を列挙せよと問われてみると、これに答えることが容易ではないことに気がつく。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote=The words virtue and vice are naturally integrated into the business world. Nevertheless, when asked to list specific examples of virtuous companies or examples of virtuous corporate practices, we find that it is not easy to answer.&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=53&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:ビジネスにおける徳と悪徳の論じ方 —その難しさをめぐって—&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=A Study on How to Discuss Virtue and Vice in Business: On its difficulty&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Ōtsuka&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Yūichi&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://shujitsu.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/2000207/files/10_5.pdf&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:就実経営研究&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=10&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=2025&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFŌtsuka2025" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1702">Ōtsuka, Yūichi (2025). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://shujitsu.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/2000207/files/10_5.pdf" class="external text" id="mwP8g">"A Study on How to Discuss Virtue and Vice in Business: On its difficulty" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwP8k">ビジネスにおける徳と悪徳の論じ方 —その難しさをめぐって—</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwP8o">(PDF)</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwP8s">就実経営研究</bdi> (in Japanese). <b id="mwP8w">10</b>: 53.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwP80">徳や悪徳という言葉はビジネス社会の中に自然に溶け込んでいる。それにも関わらず、いざ徳のある企業を具体的に列挙せよ、徳に適う企業実践の実例を列挙せよと問われてみると、これに答えることが容易ではないことに気がつく。</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwP84">[</span>The words virtue and vice are naturally integrated into the business world. Nevertheless, when asked to list specific examples of virtuous companies or examples of virtuous corporate practices, we find that it is not easy to answer.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwP88">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=A+Study+on+How+to+Discuss+Virtue+and+Vice+in+Business%3A+On+its+difficulty+%E3%83%93%E3%82%B8%E3%83%8D%E3%82%B9%E3%81%AB%E3%81%8A%E3%81%91%E3%82%8B%E5%BE%B3%E3%81%A8%E6%82%AA%E5%BE%B3%E3%81%AE%E8%AB%96%E3%81%98%E6%96%B9+%E2%80%94%E3%81%9D%E3%81%AE%E9%9B%A3%E3%81%97%E3%81%95%E3%82%92%E3%82%81%E3%81%90%E3%81%A3%E3%81%A6%E2%80%94&amp;rft.volume=10&amp;rft.pages=53&amp;rft.date=2025&amp;rft.aulast=%C5%8Ctsuka&amp;rft.aufirst=Y%C5%ABichi&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fshujitsu.repo.nii.ac.jp%2Frecord%2F2000207%2Ffiles%2F10_5.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1702" id="mwP9A"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1702" id="mwP9E"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1702" id="mwP9I"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-307" id="cite_note-307" data-mw-footnote-number="287"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwP9M"><a href="#cite_ref-307" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwP9Q"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwP9U">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-307" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1705" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwP9Y" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:スポーツに見る競争の倫理&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:スポーツは、一見したところ、人間の闘争心・勝利欲・遊戯本能などを満たすにすぎないように見えるが、それを娯楽として観戦するにせよ、リクリエーションとして愛好するにせよ、またプロフェッショナルとして実践するにせよ、人々はどの型のスポーツにおいても、スポーツマンシップと呼ばれる人間性の形成や社会的規範を習得する機会を得るのである。&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=http://kakeiken.org/journal/jjrhe/66/066_10.pdf&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Shionoya&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Yūichi&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:家計経済研究&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=66&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=2005&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=83&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFShionoya2005" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1705">Shionoya, Yūichi (2005). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="http://kakeiken.org/journal/jjrhe/66/066_10.pdf" class="external text" id="mwP9c"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwP9g">スポーツに見る競争の倫理</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwP9k">(PDF)</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwP9o">家計経済研究</bdi> (in Japanese). <b id="mwP9s">66</b>: 83.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwP9w">スポーツは、一見したところ、人間の闘争心・勝利欲・遊戯本能などを満たすにすぎないように見えるが、それを娯楽として観戦するにせよ、リクリエーションとして愛好するにせよ、またプロフェッショナルとして実践するにせよ、人々はどの型のスポーツにおいても、スポーツマンシップと呼ばれる人間性の形成や社会的規範を習得する機会を得るのである。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E3%82%B9%E3%83%9D%E3%83%BC%E3%83%84%E3%81%AB%E8%A6%8B%E3%82%8B%E7%AB%B6%E4%BA%89%E3%81%AE%E5%80%AB%E7%90%86&amp;rft.volume=66&amp;rft.pages=83&amp;rft.date=2005&amp;rft.aulast=Shionoya&amp;rft.aufirst=Y%C5%ABichi&amp;rft_id=http%3A%2F%2Fkakeiken.org%2Fjournal%2Fjjrhe%2F66%2F066_10.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1705" id="mwP90"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1705" id="mwP94"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1705" id="mwP98"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-FOOTNOTEMartin2004960-309" id="cite_note-FOOTNOTEMartin2004960-309" data-mw-footnote-number="288"><span rel="mw:referencedBy" class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwP-A"><a href="#cite_ref-FOOTNOTEMartin2004960_309-0" id="mwP-E"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwP-I">1</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-FOOTNOTEMartin2004960_309-1" id="mwP-M"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwP-Q">2</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEMartin2004960-309" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#CITEREFMartin2004" class="mw-selflink-fragment" id="mwP-U">Martin (2004)</a>, p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwP-Y">&nbsp;</span>960.<span class="error harv-error" style="display: none; font-size:100%" id="mwP-c"> sfnp error: no target: CITEREFMartin2004 (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category:Harv_and_Sfn_template_errors" title="Category:Harv and Sfn template errors" id="mwP-g">help</a>)</span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Harv_and_Sfn_no-target_errors" id="mwP-k"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-310" id="cite_note-310" data-mw-footnote-number="289"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwP-o"><a href="#cite_ref-310" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwP-s"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwP-w">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-310" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1720" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwP-0" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;web&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://kotobank.jp/word/%E5%91%89%E3%82%8C%E3%82%8B-486875&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:呉れる&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-website=ja:コトバンク&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite class="citation web cs1 cs1-prop-script" about="#mwt1720" id="mwP-4"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://kotobank.jp/word/%E5%91%89%E3%82%8C%E3%82%8B-486875" class="external text" id="mwP-8"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwP_A">呉れる</bdi></a>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwP_E">コトバンク</bdi>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=%E5%91%89%E3%82%8C%E3%82%8B&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fkotobank.jp%2Fword%2F%25E5%2591%2589%25E3%2582%258C%25E3%2582%258B-486875&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1720" id="mwP_I"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1720" id="mwP_M"></span></li>
