Jōji (20 February 1971).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQDo">風の中の子供</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQDs">[</span>Children in the Wind<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQDw">]</span>. In Mizutō, Haruo (ed.).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQD0">風の中の子供</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQD4">[</span><i id="mwQD8">Children in the Wind</i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQEA">]</span>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwQEE"><span lang="ja" id="mwQEI">潮文庫</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwQEM"> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQEQ">&nbsp;</span>33. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shinjuku" title="Shinjuku" id="mwQEU">Shinjuku</a>, Tokyo: Ushio Publishing Co. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQEY">&nbsp;</span>21.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E9%A2%A8%E3%81%AE%E4%B8%AD%E3%81%AE%E5%AD%90%E4%BE%9B&amp;rft.btitle=%E9%A2%A8%E3%81%AE%E4%B8%AD%E3%81%AE%E5%AD%90%E4%BE%9B&amp;rft.place=Shinjuku%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E6%BD%AE%E6%96%87%E5%BA%AB%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=21&amp;rft.pub=Ushio+Publishing+Co.&amp;rft.date=1971-02-20&amp;rft.aulast=Tsubota&amp;rft.aufirst=J%C5%8Dji&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1774" id="mwQEc"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1774" id="mwQEg"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1774" id="mwQEk"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-yamamoto-1950-320" id="cite_note-yamamoto-1950-320" data-mw-footnote-number="298"><span rel="mw:referencedBy" class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwQEo"><a href="#cite_ref-yamamoto-1950_320-0" id="mwQEs"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQEw">1</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-yamamoto-1950_320-1" id="mwQE0"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQE4">2</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-yamamoto-1950-320" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1777" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwQE8" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「やかましい。汽車のこわいやつは、とっととおりろい。」<br/>[…]<br/>「なんでえ。よけいな口だしをするない。またサカズキをぶっつけられてえのか。」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote=“Shut up! If you’re scared of the train, get off quickly!”<br/>[…]<br/>“Why? Don’t butt in needlessly! Want Sakazuki to get beaten up again?”&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pp=84, 144&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:<ruby>路<rp>(</rp><rt>ろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>傍<rp>(</rp><rt>ぼう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>石<rp>(</rp><rt>いし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=A Roadside Stone&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Yūzō Yamamoto&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Yūzō&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Yamamoto&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=30 September 1975&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;edition=70th&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;orig-date=30 November 1950&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Shinchosha&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Shinjuku]], Tokyo&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|新潮文庫}}&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFYamamoto1975" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1777"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yūzō_Yamamoto" title="Yūzō Yamamoto" id="mwQFA">Yamamoto, Yūzō</a> (30 September 1975) [30 November 1950].  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQFE"><ruby id="mwQFI">路<rp id="mwQFM">(</rp><rt id="mwQFQ">ろ</rt><rp id="mwQFU">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwQFY">傍<rp id="mwQFc">(</rp><rt id="mwQFg">ぼう</rt><rp id="mwQFk">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwQFo">石<rp id="mwQFs">(</rp><rt id="mwQFw">いし</rt><rp id="mwQF0">)</rp></ruby></bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQF4">[</span><i id="mwQF8">A Roadside Stone</i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQGA">]</span>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwQGE"><span lang="ja" id="mwQGI">新潮文庫</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwQGM"> (in Japanese) (70th<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQGQ">&nbsp;</span>ed.). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shinjuku" title="Shinjuku" id="mwQGU">Shinjuku</a>, Tokyo: Shinchosha. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQGY">&nbsp;</span>84, 144.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQGc">「やかましい。汽車のこわいやつは、とっととおりろい。」<br id="mwQGg">[…]<br id="mwQGk">「なんでえ。よけいな口だしをするない。またサカズキをぶっつけられてえのか。」</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQGo">[</span>“Shut up! If you’re scared of the train, get off quickly!”<br id="mwQGs">[…]<br id="mwQGw">“Why? Don’t butt in needlessly! Want Sakazuki to get beaten up again?”<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQG0">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=%3Cruby%3E%E8%B7%AF%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%82%8D%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E5%82%8D%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%BC%E3%81%86%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%E3%81%AE%3Cruby%3E%E7%9F%B3%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%84%E3%81%97%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E&amp;rft.place=Shinjuku%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E6%96%B0%E6%BD%AE%E6%96%87%E5%BA%AB%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=84%2C+144&amp;rft.edition=70th&amp;rft.pub=Shinchosha&amp;rft.date=1975-09-30&amp;rft.aulast=Yamamoto&amp;rft.aufirst=Y%C5%ABz%C5%8D&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1777" id="mwQG4"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1777" id="mwQG8"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1777" id="mwQHA"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-FOOTNOTEAkimotoAkimotoIshikawaItoi200132–33-321" id="cite_note-FOOTNOTEAkimotoAkimotoIshikawaItoi200132–33-321" data-mw-footnote-number="299"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwQHE"><a href="#cite_ref-FOOTNOTEAkimotoAkimotoIshikawaItoi200132–33_321-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwQHI"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQHM">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEAkimotoAkimotoIshikawaItoi200132–33-321" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#CITEREFAkimotoAkimotoIshikawaItoi2001" class="mw-selflink-fragment" id="mwQHQ">Akimoto et al. (2001)</a>, p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQHU">&nbsp;</span>32–33.<span class="error harv-error" style="display: none; font-size:100%" id="mwQHY"> sfnp error: no target: CITEREFAkimotoAkimotoIshikawaItoi2001 (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category:Harv_and_Sfn_template_errors" title="Category:Harv and Sfn template errors" id="mwQHc">help</a>)</span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Harv_and_Sfn_no-target_errors" id="mwQHg"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-FOOTNOTEMartin2004934-322" id="cite_note-FOOTNOTEMartin2004934-322" data-mw-footnote-number="300"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwQHk"><a href="#cite_ref-FOOTNOTEMartin2004934_322-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwQHo"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQHs">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-FOOTNOTEMartin2004934-322" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#CITEREFMartin2004" class="mw-selflink-fragment" id="mwQHw">Martin (2004)</a>, p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQH0">&nbsp;</span>934.<span class="error harv-error" style="display: none; font-size:100%" id="mwQH4"> sfnp error: no target: CITEREFMartin2004 (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category:Harv_and_Sfn_template_errors" title="Category:Harv and Sfn template errors" id="mwQH8">help</a>)</span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Harv_and_Sfn_no-target_errors" id="mwQIA"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-kasuga-1939-323" id="cite_note-kasuga-1939-323" data-mw-footnote-number="301"><span rel="mw:referencedBy" class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwQIE"><a href="#cite_ref-kasuga-1939_323-0" id="mwQII"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQIM">1</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-kasuga-1939_323-1" id="mwQIQ"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQIU">2</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-kasuga-1939-323" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1782" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwQIY" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:○螢來い、田の蟲來い。行燈のかげから、簑きて笠きて、飛んで來い。<br/>○ほい〱螢來い。田の蟲來い。行燈の光で、笠きて來い。<br/>○螢來い、〱。行燈にかくれて、笠きて來い。柳にうたれて、飛んで來い。<br/>などが是である。尙<br/>○螢來い、山伏來い。あみだの光で、笠着て來い。<br/>などいふ變つたのもある。これらの種類のものは、近畿・中國・四國・東海・北陸及び東山の北部までも及んでゐる。<br/>さて此の「行燈の光」は多く「簑笠」と結びついてゐるが、もとはやはり獨立してゐたものであらう。螢自身の光を行燈に見立てて、其の光に依つて暗夜を辿り來よといふのが原形らしく、我が家の行燈の光を目當に來よといふのは、後の轉化であらう。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1255942/1/27&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;p=39&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:螢狩の童謠&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:青靄集&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Kasuga&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Masaji&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Iwanami Shoten&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=20 April 1939&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Kanda, Tokyo]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFKasuga1939" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1782">Kasuga, Masaji (20 April 1939).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQIc">螢狩の童謠</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1255942/1/27" class="external text" id="mwQIg"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwQIk">青靄集</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kanda,_Tokyo" title="Kanda, Tokyo" id="mwQIo">Kanda, Tokyo</a>: Iwanami Shoten. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQIs">&nbsp;</span>39.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQIw">○螢來い、田の蟲來い。行燈のかげから、簑きて笠きて、飛んで來い。<br id="mwQI0">○ほい〱螢來い。田の蟲來い。行燈の光で、笠きて來い。<br id="mwQI4">○螢來い、〱。行燈にかくれて、笠きて來い。柳にうたれて、飛んで來い。<br id="mwQI8">などが是である。尙<br id="mwQJA">○螢來い、山伏來い。あみだの光で、笠着て來い。<br id="mwQJE">などいふ變つたのもある。これらの種類のものは、近畿・中國・四國・東海・北陸及び東山の北部までも及んでゐる。<br id="mwQJI">さて此の「行燈の光」は多く「簑笠」と結びついてゐるが、もとはやはり獨立してゐたものであらう。螢自身の光を行燈に見立てて、其の光に依つて暗夜を辿り來よといふのが原形らしく、我が家の行燈の光を目當に來よといふのは、後の轉化であらう。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E8%9E%A2%E7%8B%A9%E3%81%AE%E7%AB%A5%E8%AC%A0&amp;rft.btitle=%E9%9D%92%E9%9D%84%E9%9B%86&amp;rft.place=Kanda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=39&amp;rft.pub=Iwanami+Shoten&amp;rft.date=1939-04-20&amp;rft.aulast=Kasuga&amp;rft.aufirst=Masaji&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1255942%2F1%2F27&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1782" id="mwQJM"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1782" id="mwQJQ"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1782" id="mwQJU"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-324" id="cite_note-324" data-mw-footnote-number="302"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwQJY"><a href="#cite_ref-324" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwQJc"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQJg">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-324" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1791" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwQJk" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;web&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://kotobank.jp/word/%E4%BD%95%E3%81%A7%E3%82%82%E5%BE%A1%E5%BA%A7%E3%82%8C-2095560&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:何でも御座れ&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-website=ja:コトバンク&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite class="citation web cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1791" id="mwQJo"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://kotobank.jp/word/%E4%BD%95%E3%81%A7%E3%82%82%E5%BE%A1%E5%BA%A7%E3%82%8C-2095560" class="external text" id="mwQJs"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwQJw">何でも御座れ</bdi></a>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQJ0">コトバンク</bdi> (in Japanese).</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=%E4%BD%95%E3%81%A7%E3%82%82%E5%BE%A1%E5%BA%A7%E3%82%8C&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fkotobank.jp%2Fword%2F%25E4%25BD%2595%25E3%2581%25A7%25E3%2582%2582%25E5%25BE%25A1%25E5%25BA%25A7%25E3%2582%258C-2095560&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1791" id="mwQJ4"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1791" id="mwQJ8"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1791" id="mwQKA"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-325" id="cite_note-325" data-mw-footnote-number="303"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwQKE"><a href="#cite_ref-325" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwQKI"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQKM">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-325" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1815" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwQKQ" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:ルカによる<ruby>福<rp>(</rp><rt>ふく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>音<rp>(</rp><rt>いん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>書<rp>(</rp><rt>しょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=[[Gospel according to Luke]]&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:新約聖書 新共同訳&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;author=Executive Committee of The Common Bible Translation&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=[[Japanese New Interconfessional Translation Bible|New Testament: The New Interconfessional Translation]]&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=1988&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Japan Bible Society&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「いと<ruby>高<rp>(</rp><rt>たか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きところには<ruby>栄<rp>(</rp><rt>えい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>光<rp>(</rp><rt>こう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、<ruby>神<rp>(</rp><rt>かみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にあれ、<ruby>地<rp>(</rp><rt>ち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>平<rp>(</rp><rt>へい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>和<rp>(</rp><rt>わ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、<ruby>御<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>心<rp>(</rp><rt>こころ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>適<rp>(</rp><rt>かな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>う<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にあれ。」&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="mwQKU" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1815" data-x-id="CITEREFExecutive_Committee_of_The_Common_Bible_Translation1988">Executive Committee of The Common Bible Translation (1988). "<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gospel_according_to_Luke" title="Gospel according to Luke" class="mw-redirect" id="mwQKY">Gospel according to Luke</a>" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQKc">ルカによる<ruby id="mwQKg">福<rp id="mwQKk">(</rp><rt id="mwQKo">ふく</rt><rp id="mwQKs">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwQKw">音<rp id="mwQK0">(</rp><rt id="mwQK4">いん</rt><rp id="mwQK8">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwQLA">書<rp id="mwQLE">(</rp><rt id="mwQLI">しょ</rt><rp id="mwQLM">)</rp></ruby></bdi>. <i id="mwQLQ"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Japanese_New_Interconfessional_Translation_Bible" title="Japanese New Interconfessional Translation Bible" id="mwQLU">New Testament: The New Interconfessional Translation</a></i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQLY">新約聖書 新共同訳</bdi> (in Japanese). Japan Bible Society.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQLc">「いと<ruby id="mwQLg">高<rp id="mwQLk">(</rp><rt id="mwQLo">たか</rt><rp id="mwQLs">)</rp></ruby>きところには<ruby id="mwQLw">栄<rp id="mwQL0">(</rp><rt id="mwQL4">えい</rt><rp id="mwQL8">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwQMA">光<rp id="mwQME">(</rp><rt id="mwQMI">こう</rt><rp id="mwQMM">)</rp></ruby>、<ruby id="mwQMQ">神<rp id="mwQMU">(</rp><rt id="mwQMY">かみ</rt><rp id="mwQMc">)</rp></ruby>にあれ、<ruby id="mwQMg">地<rp id="mwQMk">(</rp><rt id="mwQMo">ち</rt><rp id="mwQMs">)</rp></ruby>には<ruby id="mwQMw">平<rp id="mwQM0">(</rp><rt id="mwQM4">へい</rt><rp id="mwQM8">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwQNA">和<rp id="mwQNE">(</rp><rt id="mwQNI">わ</rt><rp id="mwQNM">)</rp></ruby>、<ruby id="mwQNQ">御