<li about="#cite_note-kaizu-326" id="cite_note-kaizu-326" data-mw-footnote-number="304"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwQOc"><a href="#cite_ref-kaizu_326-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwQOg"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQOk">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-kaizu-326" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1818" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwQOo" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pp=56–57&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:何物もこの世の死から救ってくれない。だから、いつも神に従ってあれ。[…]このおん方はお前に永遠の生命をお授け下さろう。[…]天の仲間のところへお連れ下さろう。&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:「死の像」におけるデューラーとホルバイン&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=\&quot;Imagines mortis\&quot; in Dürer and Holbein&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Kaizu&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Tadao&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|慶應義塾大学藝文学会}}&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=May 1970&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:藝文研究&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal=Journal of Arts and Letters&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=29&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFKaizu1970" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1818">Kaizu, Tadao (May 1970). "<span class="cs1-kern-left" id="mwQOs"></span>"Imagines mortis" in Dürer and Holbein" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQOw">「死の像」におけるデューラーとホルバイン</bdi>. <i id="mwQO0">Journal of Arts and Letters</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQO4">藝文研究</bdi> (in Japanese). <b id="mwQO8">29</b>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwQPA"><span lang="ja" id="mwQPE">慶應義塾大学藝文学会</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwQPI">: <span class="nowrap" id="mwQPM">56–</span>57.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQPQ">何物もこの世の死から救ってくれない。だから、いつも神に従ってあれ。[…]このおん方はお前に永遠の生命をお授け下さろう。[…]天の仲間のところへお連れ下さろう。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Journal+of+Arts+and+Letters&amp;rft.atitle=%22Imagines+mortis%22+in+D%C3%BCrer+and+Holbein+%E3%80%8C%E6%AD%BB%E3%81%AE%E5%83%8F%E3%80%8D%E3%81%AB%E3%81%8A%E3%81%91%E3%82%8B%E3%83%87%E3%83%A5%E3%83%BC%E3%83%A9%E3%83%BC%E3%81%A8%E3%83%9B%E3%83%AB%E3%83%90%E3%82%A4%E3%83%B3&amp;rft.volume=29&amp;rft.pages=56-57&amp;rft.date=1970-05&amp;rft.aulast=Kaizu&amp;rft.aufirst=Tadao&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1818" id="mwQPU"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1818" id="mwQPY"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1818" id="mwQPc"></span></li>
