<li about="#cite_note-kunieda-1976-kudasai-335" id="cite_note-kunieda-1976-kudasai-335" data-mw-footnote-number="312"><span rel="mw:referencedBy" class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwQTw"><a href="#cite_ref-kunieda-1976-kudasai_335-0" id="mwQT0"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQT4">1</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-kunieda-1976-kudasai_335-1" id="mwQT8"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQUA">2</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-kunieda-1976-kudasai-335" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1957" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwQUE" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:連れて行ってください！ 連れて行ってください！[…]<ruby>内<rp>(</rp><rt>なか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にはいってご覧ください[…]「何はともあれおはいりくだされ」[…]「二、三本どうぞお見せくだされ」[…]「しからばご随意にお選びくだされ」[…]貴殿もご随意にお取りくだされい[…]充分においでくだされ[…]「お菓子くだされお菓子くだされ！」[…]「返してくだされ！ 返してくだされ！」[…]「ご免くだされ」[…]まず、しばらくお待ちください。[…]どうぞ子宝をお授けください！&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pages=31, 85, 87, 89, 92, 100, 110–111, 229, 243&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.aozora.gr.jp/cards/000255/files/3041_32480.html&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:八ケ嶽の魔神&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|国枝史郎伝奇文庫}}&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=4&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Kunieda&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Shirō&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=12 April 1976&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Kodansha&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Bunkyō]], Tokyo&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFKunieda1976" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1957">Kunieda, Shirō (12 April 1976). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.aozora.gr.jp/cards/000255/files/3041_32480.html" class="external text" id="mwQUI"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwQUM">八ケ嶽の魔神</bdi></a>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwQUQ"><span lang="ja" id="mwQUU">国枝史郎伝奇文庫</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwQUY"> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQUc">&nbsp;</span>4. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bunkyō" title="Bunkyō" id="mwQUg">Bunkyō</a>, Tokyo: Kodansha. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQUk">&nbsp;</span>31, 85, 87, 89, 92, 100, <span class="nowrap" id="mwQUo">110–</span>111, 229, 243.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQUs">連れて行ってください！ 連れて行ってください！[…]<ruby id="mwQUw">内<rp id="mwQU0">(</rp><rt id="mwQU4">なか</rt><rp id="mwQU8">)</rp></ruby>にはいってご覧ください[…]「何はともあれおはいりくだされ」[…]「二、三本どうぞお見せくだされ」[…]「しからばご随意にお選びくだされ」[…]貴殿もご随意にお取りくだされい[…]充分においでくだされ[…]「お菓子くだされお菓子くだされ！」[…]「返してくだされ！ 返してくだされ！」[…]「ご免くだされ」[…]まず、しばらくお待ちください。[…]どうぞ子宝をお授けください！</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=%E5%85%AB%E3%82%B1%E5%B6%BD%E3%81%AE%E9%AD%94%E7%A5%9E&amp;rft.place=Bunky%C5%8D%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E5%9B%BD%E6%9E%9D%E5%8F%B2%E9%83%8E%E4%BC%9D%E5%A5%87%E6%96%87%E5%BA%AB%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=31%2C+85%2C+87%2C+89%2C+92%2C+100%2C+110-111%2C+229%2C+243&amp;rft.pub=Kodansha&amp;rft.date=1976-04-12&amp;rft.aulast=Kunieda&amp;rft.aufirst=Shir%C5%8D&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.aozora.gr.jp%2Fcards%2F000255%2Ffiles%2F3041_32480.html&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1957" id="mwQVA"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1957" id="mwQVE"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1957" id="mwQVI"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-sato-2016-kudasai-336" id="cite_note-sato-2016-kudasai-336" data-mw-footnote-number="313"><span rel="mw:referencedBy" class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwQVM"><a href="#cite_ref-sato-2016-kudasai_336-0" id="mwQVQ"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQVU">1</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-sato-2016-kudasai_336-1" id="mwQVY"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQVc">2</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-sato-2016-kudasai-336" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1960" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwQVg" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:阿弥陀によーく声をかけて下さい。[…]お守り下さいませ、と声をかけて下さい。[…]そのように言うておいて下され。[…]一言、話しておいて下され。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=14&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://komazawa-u.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/2012008/files/00018580.pdf&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Satō&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Noriaki&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:新潟市の女性シャーマンとその依頼者について&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:駒沢大学文化&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=34&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=2016&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="mwQVk" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1960" data-x-id="CITEREFSatō2016">Satō, Noriaki (2016). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://komazawa-u.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/2012008/files/00018580.pdf" class="external text" id="mwQVo"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwQVs">新潟市の女性シャーマンとその依頼者について</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwQVw">(PDF)</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQV0">駒沢大学文化</bdi> (in Japanese) (34): 14.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQV4">阿弥陀によーく声をかけて下さい。[…]お守り下さいませ、と声をかけて下さい。[…]そのように言うておいて下され。[…]一言、話しておいて下され。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E6%96%B0%E6%BD%9F%E5%B8%82%E3%81%AE%E5%A5%B3%E6%80%A7%E3%82%B7%E3%83%A3%E3%83%BC%E3%83%9E%E3%83%B3%E3%81%A8%E3%81%9D%E3%81%AE%E4%BE%9D%E9%A0%BC%E8%80%85%E3%81%AB%E3%81%A4%E3%81%84%E3%81%A6&amp;rft.issue=34&amp;rft.pages=14&amp;rft.date=2016&amp;rft.aulast=Sat%C5%8D&amp;rft.aufirst=Noriaki&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fkomazawa-u.repo.nii.ac.jp%2Frecord%2F2012008%2Ffiles%2F00018580.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1960" id="mwQV8"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1960" id="mwQWA"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1960" id="mwQWE"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-337" id="cite_note-337" data-mw-footnote-number="314"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwQWI"><a href="#cite_ref-337" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwQWM"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQWQ">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-337" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1974" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwQWU" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:ご遠慮なく腹いっぱい食いなされ<br/>………<br/>どうした……今さら　豚は食えないとは言わせませんぞ<br/>しかし脳……<br/>脳みそったって豚は豚<br/>さよう清国では豚の脳みそは貴人のご馳走と申すでな&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote=Come on now, eat yer fill<br/>………<br/>What’s the matter?…… Don’t be sayin’ you can’t eat pork now<br/>But the brain……<br/>It’s called brain miso, but pork’s still pork<br/>I heard pork brain miso’s actually a delicacy amongst the nobility in [[Qing dynasty|China]]&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Osamu Tezuka&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Osamu&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Tezuka&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=210&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:第６章 適塾の人々&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-chapter=Chapter 6: The People at [[Tekijuku]]&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:陽だまりの樹&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=[[Hidamari no Ki|The Sunlit Tree]]&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=15 June 1999&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;orig-date=17 November 1993&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Kodansha&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Bunkyō]], Tokyo&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;isbn=4-06-175926-4&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="mwQWY" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1974" data-x-id="CITEREFTezuka1999"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Osamu_Tezuka" title="Osamu Tezuka" id="mwQWc">Tezuka, Osamu</a> (15 June 1999) [17 November 1993].  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQWg">第６章 適塾の人々</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQWk">[</span>Chapter 6: The People at <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tekijuku" title="Tekijuku" id="mwQWo">Tekijuku</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQWs">]</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQWw">陽だまりの樹</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQW0">[</span><i id="mwQW4"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hidamari_no_Ki" title="Hidamari no Ki" id="mwQW8">The Sunlit Tree</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQXA">]</span> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bunkyō" title="Bunkyō" id="mwQXE">Bunkyō</a>, Tokyo: Kodansha. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQXI">&nbsp;</span>210. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)" title="ISBN (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwQXM">ISBN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQXQ">&nbsp;</span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/4-06-175926-4" title="Special:BookSources/4-06-175926-4" id="mwQXU"><bdi id="mwQXY">4-06-175926-4</bdi></a>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQXc">ご遠慮なく腹いっぱい食いなされ<br id="mwQXg">………<br id="mwQXk">どうした……今さら　豚は食えないとは言わせませんぞ<br id="mwQXo">しかし脳……<br id="mwQXs">脳みそったって豚は豚<br id="mwQXw">さよう清国では豚の脳みそは貴人のご馳走と申すでな</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQX0">[</span>Come on now, eat yer fill<br id="mwQX4">………<br id="mwQX8">What’s the matter?…… Don’t be sayin’ you can’t eat pork now<br id="mwQYA">But the brain……<br id="mwQYE">It’s called brain miso, but pork’s still pork<br id="mwQYI">I heard pork brain miso’s actually a delicacy amongst the nobility in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Qing_dynasty" title="Qing dynasty" id="mwQYM">China</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQYQ">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E7%AC%AC%EF%BC%96%E7%AB%A0+%E9%81%A9%E5%A1%BE%E3%81%AE%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%85&amp;rft.btitle=%E9%99%BD%E3%81%A0%E3%81%BE%E3%82%8A%E3%81%AE%E6%A8%B9&amp;rft.place=Bunky%C5%8D%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=210&amp;rft.pub=Kodansha&amp;rft.date=1999-06-15&amp;rft.isbn=4-06-175926-4&amp;rft.aulast=Tezuka&amp;rft.aufirst=Osamu&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1974" id="mwQYU"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1974" id="mwQYY"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1974" id="mwQYc"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-338" id="cite_note-338" data-mw-footnote-number="315"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwQYg"><a href="#cite_ref-338" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwQYk"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQYo">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-338" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1977" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwQYs" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:魔法のかかったバター（クイーンズ州）&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=Bewitched Butter (Queen’s County)&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;editor-first=William Butler&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;editor-last=Yeats&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;editor-link=W. B. Yeats&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=“I will tell you; as soon as the hour of twelve o’clock arrives to-night, do you go to the pasture, and take a couple of swift-running dogs with you; conceal yourself in some place convenient to the cattle; watch them carefully; and if you see anything, whether man or beast, approach the cows, set on the dogs, and if possible make them draw the blood of the intruder; then {{smallcaps|all}} will be accomplished. If nothing approaches before sunrise, you may return, and we will try something else.”&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「こうしなされ、今晩十二時になると同時に放牧場へ行きなされ、そうして、足の早い犬を一つがい連れてな、どこか牛を見るのに都合のいい場所に隠れるのですじゃ、注意して牛どもを見ていなされ。そしてな、人でも<ruby>獣<rp>(</rp><rt>けだもの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でもよい、何か牛どもに近づくのが見えたら、犬どもをけしかけなされ。そして、できたら、犬どもをその泥棒<ruby>奴<rp>(</rp><rt>め</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>咬<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みつかせて、血を流させておやりなされ。そうすれば万事がうまくいきますじゃ。もし夜明け前に何も近寄らなかったら、帰って来なされ。何かほかの<ruby>手段<rp>(</rp><rt>てだて</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を考えましょうや」&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:魔法のかかったプディング　アイルランド民話集&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=The Pudding Bewitched: Irish Folk Tales&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Fairy and Folk Tales of the Irish Peasantry&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Takabatake&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Fumio&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=15 January 2016&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Gutenberg21&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Setagaya]], Tokyo&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFYeats2016" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1977"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/W._B._Yeats" title="W. B. Yeats" id="mwQYw">Yeats, William Butler</a>, ed. (15 January 2016). "Bewitched Butter (Queen's County)" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQY0">魔法のかかったバター（クイーンズ州）</bdi>. <i id="mwQY4">Fairy and Folk Tales of the Irish Peasantry</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQY8">魔法のかかったプディング　アイルランド民話集</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQZA">[</span><i id="mwQZE">The Pudding Bewitched: Irish Folk Tales</i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQZI">]</span> (in Japanese). Translated by Takabatake, Fumio. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Setagaya" title="Setagaya" id="mwQZM">Setagaya</a>, Tokyo: Gutenberg21. <q id="mwQZQ"><span class="cs1-kern-left" id="mwQZU"></span>"I will tell you; as soon as the hour of twelve o'clock arrives to-night, do you go to the pasture, and take a couple of swift-running dogs with you; conceal yourself in some place convenient to the cattle; watch them carefully; and if you see anything, whether man or beast, approach the cows, set on the dogs, and if possible make them draw the blood of the intruder; then <span class="smallcaps" id="mwQZc">all</span> will be accomplished. If nothing approaches before sunrise, you may return, and we will try something else."<span class="cs1-kern-right" id="mwQZg"></span></q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQZk">「こうしなされ、今晩十二時になると同時に放牧場へ行きなされ、そうして、足の早い犬を一つがい連れてな、どこか牛を見るのに都合のいい場所に隠れるのですじゃ、注意して牛どもを見ていなされ。そしてな、人でも<ruby id="mwQZo">獣<rp id="mwQZs">(</rp><rt id="mwQZw">けだもの</rt><rp id="mwQZ0">)</rp></ruby>でもよい、何か牛どもに近づくのが見えたら、犬どもをけしかけなされ。そして、できたら、犬どもをその泥棒<ruby id="mwQZ4">奴<rp id="mwQZ8">(</rp><rt id="mwQaA">め</rt><rp id="mwQaE">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwQaI">咬<rp id="mwQaM">(</rp><rt id="mwQaQ">か</rt><rp id="mwQaU">)</rp></ruby>みつかせて、血を流させておやりなされ。そうすれば万事がうまくいきますじゃ。もし夜明け前に何も近寄らなかったら、帰って来なされ。何かほかの<ruby id="mwQaY">手段<rp id="mwQac">(</rp><rt id="mwQag">てだて</rt><rp id="mwQak">)</rp></ruby>を考えましょうや」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=Bewitched+Butter+%28Queen%E2%80%99s+County%29+%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E3%81%AE%E3%81%8B%E3%81%8B%E3%81%A3%E3%81%9F%E3%83%90%E3%82%BF%E3%83%BC%EF%BC%88%E3%82%AF%E3%82%A4%E3%83%BC%E3%83%B3%E3%82%BA%E5%B7%9E%EF%BC%89&amp;rft.btitle=Fairy+and+Folk+Tales+of+the+Irish+Peasantry+%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95%E3%81%AE%E3%81%8B%E3%81%8B%E3%81%A3%E3%81%9F%E3%83%97%E3%83%87%E3%82%A3%E3%83%B3%E3%82%B0%E3%80%80%E3%82%A2%E3%82%A4%E3%83%AB%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E6%B0%91%E8%A9%B1%E9%9B%86&amp;rft.place=Setagaya%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pub=Gutenberg21&amp;rft.date=2016-01-15&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1977" id="mwQao"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1977" id="mwQas"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1977" id="mwQaw"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-339" id="cite_note-339" data-mw-footnote-number="316"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwQa0"><a href="#cite_ref-339" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwQa4"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQa8">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-339" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1990" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwQbA" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:スーパー弁理士というのは，要するに，法律も語学も技術も，更には弁理士の業務に関連することは何でもござい，というような弁理士のことである。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://jpaa-patent.info/patents_files_old/200508/jpaapatent200508_068-068.pdf&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:私の目指す弁理士像 No. 93&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Shōbayashi&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Masayuki&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:パテント&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=58&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=8&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=August 2005&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=68&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFShōbayashi2005" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1990">Shōbayashi, Masayuki (August 2005). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://jpaa-patent.info/patents_files_old/200508/jpaapatent200508_068-068.pdf" class="external text" id="mwQbE"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwQbI">私の目指す弁理士像 No. 93</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwQbM">(PDF)</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQbQ">パテント</bdi> (in Japanese). <b id="mwQbU">58</b> (8): 68.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQbY">スーパー弁理士というのは，要するに，法律も語学も技術も，更には弁理士の業務に関連することは何でもござい，というような弁理士のことである。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E7%A7%81%E3%81%AE%E7%9B%AE%E6%8C%87%E3%81%99%E5%BC%81%E7%90%86%E5%A3%AB%E5%83%8F+No.+93&amp;rft.volume=58&amp;rft.issue=8&amp;rft.pages=68&amp;rft.date=2005-08&amp;rft.aulast=Sh%C5%8Dbayashi&amp;rft.aufirst=Masayuki&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fjpaa-patent.info%2Fpatents_files_old%2F200508%2Fjpaapatent200508_068-068.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1990" id="mwQbc"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1990" id="mwQbg"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1990" id="mwQbk"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-340" id="cite_note-340" data-mw-footnote-number="317"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwQbo"><a href="#cite_ref-340" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwQbs"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQbw">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-340" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1993" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwQb0" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:お人形　お<ruby>雛<rp>(</rp><rt>ひな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さん<br/>お<ruby>駕<rp>(</rp><rt>＊か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>籠<rp>(</rp><rt>ご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で　ござれ<br/>　山をこえたら<br/>　<ruby>ぼ<rp>(</rp><rt>＊</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くりでござれ<br/>　<ruby>桃<rp>(</rp><rt>もも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の山みて<br/>　<ruby>ほ<rp>(</rp><rt>＊</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くほくござれ&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote=My doll, my hina<br/>Come in a palaquin<br/>　When you cross the mountain<br/>　Come in wooden clogs<br/>　Come in delight<br/>　And view the mountain of peaches&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:おひなさん&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-chapter=My [[Hinamatsuri|Hina]]&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first1=Katsura&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last1=Shimizu&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;editor-first=Shōichirō&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;editor-last=Kami&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;editor-last2=Beppu&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;editor-first2=Akio&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink2=Yumeji Takehisa&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first2=Yumeji&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last2=Takehisa&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=83&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:靴が鳴る　清水かつら童謡集&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=The Shoes Squeak: Shimizu Katsura’s Nursery Rhymes&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Net Musashino&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=29 March 2008&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFShimizuTakehisa2008" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1993">Shimizu, Katsura; <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yumeji_Takehisa" title="Yumeji Takehisa" id="mwQb4">Takehisa, Yumeji</a> (29 March 2008).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQb8">おひなさん</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQcA">[</span>My <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hinamatsuri" title="Hinamatsuri" id="mwQcE">Hina</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQcI">]</span>. In Kami, Shōichirō; Beppu, Akio (eds.).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQcM">靴が鳴る　清水かつら童謡集</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQcQ">[</span><i id="mwQcU">The Shoes Squeak: Shimizu Katsura’s Nursery Rhymes</i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQcY">]</span> (in Japanese). Net Musashino. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQcc">&nbsp;</span>83.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQcg">お人形　お<ruby id="mwQck">雛<rp id="mwQco">(</rp><rt id="mwQcs">ひな</rt><rp id="mwQcw">)</rp></ruby>さん<br id="mwQc0">お<ruby id="mwQc4">駕<rp id="mwQc8">(</rp><rt id="mwQdA">＊か</rt><rp id="mwQdE">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwQdI">籠<rp id="mwQdM">(</rp><rt id="mwQdQ">ご</rt><rp id="mwQdU">)</rp></ruby>で　ござれ<br id="mwQdY">　山をこえたら<br id="mwQdc">　<ruby id="mwQdg">ぼ<rp id="mwQdk">(</rp><rt id="mwQdo">＊</rt><rp id="mwQds">)</rp></ruby>くりでござれ<br id="mwQdw">　<ruby id="mwQd0">桃<rp id="mwQd4">(</rp><rt id="mwQd8">もも</rt><rp id="mwQeA">)</rp></ruby>の山みて<br id="mwQeE">　<ruby id="mwQeI">ほ<rp id="mwQeM">(</rp><rt id="mwQeQ">＊</rt><rp id="mwQeU">)</rp></ruby>くほくござれ</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQeY">[</span>My doll, my hina<br id="mwQec">Come in a palaquin<br id="mwQeg">　When you cross the mountain<br id="mwQek">　Come in wooden clogs<br id="mwQeo">　Come in delight<br id="mwQes">　And view the mountain of peaches<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQew">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E3%81%8A%E3%81%B2%E3%81%AA%E3%81%95%E3%82%93&amp;rft.btitle=%E9%9D%B4%E3%81%8C%E9%B3%B4%E3%82%8B%E3%80%80%E6%B8%85%E6%B0%B4%E3%81%8B%E3%81%A4%E3%82%89%E7%AB%A5%E8%AC%A1%E9%9B%86&amp;rft.pages=83&amp;rft.pub=Net+Musashino&amp;rft.date=2008-03-29&amp;rft.aulast=Shimizu&amp;rft.aufirst=Katsura&amp;rft.au=Takehisa%2C+Yumeji&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1993" id="mwQe0"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1993" id="mwQe4"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1993" id="mwQe8"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-341" id="cite_note-341" data-mw-footnote-number="318"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwQfA"><a href="#cite_ref-341" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwQfE"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQfI">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-341" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1996" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwQfM" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:先代が焼鳥と海鮮料理の店として始めましたが、現在は、築地で寿司修業をした当代が引き継ぎ、焼鳥、寿司、刺身、天ぷら、うなぎと和食全般何でもござれ！と豊富なメニューが勢揃い。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:練馬支部会員のお店紹介&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:ねりまのお店に行こう ～練馬区内にある魅力的なお店をご紹介～&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=December 2019&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.tokyo-cci.or.jp/file.jsp?id=1020784&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|東京商工会議所 練馬支部}}&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt1996" id="mwQfQ"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.tokyo-cci.or.jp/file.jsp?id=1020784" class="external text" id="mwQfU"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwQfY">練馬支部会員のお店紹介</bdi></a>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQfc">ねりまのお店に行こう ～練馬区内にある魅力的なお店をご紹介～</bdi> (in Japanese). <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwQfg"><span lang="ja" id="mwQfk">東京商工会議所 練馬支部</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwQfo">. December 2019.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQfs">先代が焼鳥と海鮮料理の店として始めましたが、現在は、築地で寿司修業をした当代が引き継ぎ、焼鳥、寿司、刺身、天ぷら、うなぎと和食全般何でもござれ！と豊富なメニューが勢揃い。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E7%B7%B4%E9%A6%AC%E6%94%AF%E9%83%A8%E4%BC%9A%E5%93%A1%E3%81%AE%E3%81%8A%E5%BA%97%E7%B4%B9%E4%BB%8B&amp;rft.date=2019-12&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tokyo-cci.or.jp%2Ffile.jsp%3Fid%3D1020784&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt1996" id="mwQfw"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt1996" id="mwQf0"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt1996" id="mwQf4"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-342" id="cite_note-342" data-mw-footnote-number="319"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwQf8"><a href="#cite_ref-342" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwQgA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQgE">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-342" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2007" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwQgI" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:——考へ見い！——細い眼を輝かせながらマホーチンが言つた。——四年前だつて奴等惡黨は風呂場の金を集めたんだ。三千八百集つた。がその金はどうした？　風呂場なんか——ありやしない！&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote=——Think!——said Makhotin, his narrow eyes sparkling.——Four years ago those crooks collected money for a bathhouse. Three thousand eight hundred was collected. What happened to that money? Bathhouse——zero!&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=— Сообрази! — сказал Махотин, сверкая узкими глазами. — Четыре года тому назад они, жулье, на баню собирали. Три тысячи восемьсот было собрано. Где они? Бани — нет!&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;p=102&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1137046/1/56&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:十二&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=XII&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:母&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Мать&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=[[Mother (novel)|Mother]]&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Maxim Gorky&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Maxim&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Gorky&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=1&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Murata&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Harumi&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Kanda, Tokyo]]&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Dai-ichi Shuppan&quot;},&quot;21&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=15 January 1947&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="mwQgM" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2007" data-x-id="CITEREFGorky1947"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maxim_Gorky" title="Maxim Gorky" id="mwQgQ">Gorky, Maxim</a> (15 January 1947). "XII" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQgU">十二</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1137046/1/56" class="external text" id="mwQgY"><i id="mwQgc">Мать</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQgg">母</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQgk">[</span><i id="mwQgo"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mother_(novel)" title="Mother (novel)" id="mwQgs">Mother</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQgw">]</span> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQg0">&nbsp;</span>1. Translated by Murata, Harumi. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kanda,_Tokyo" title="Kanda, Tokyo" id="mwQg4">Kanda, Tokyo</a>: Dai-ichi Shuppan. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQg8">&nbsp;</span>102. <q id="mwQhA">— Сообрази! — сказал Махотин, сверкая узкими глазами. — Четыре года тому назад они, жулье, на баню собирали. Три тысячи восемьсот было собрано. Где они? Бани — нет!</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQhE">——考へ見い！——細い眼を輝かせながらマホーチンが言つた。——四年前だつて奴等惡黨は風呂場の金を集めたんだ。三千八百集つた。がその金はどうした？　風呂場なんか——ありやしない！</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQhI">[</span>——Think!——said Makhotin, his narrow eyes sparkling.——Four years ago those crooks collected money for a bathhouse. Three thousand eight hundred was collected. What happened to that money? Bathhouse——zero!<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQhM">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=XII+%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%8C&amp;rft.btitle=%D0%9C%D0%B0%D1%82%D1%8C+%E6%AF%8D&amp;rft.place=Kanda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=102&amp;rft.pub=Dai-ichi+Shuppan&amp;rft.date=1947-01-15&amp;rft.aulast=Gorky&amp;rft.aufirst=Maxim&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1137046%2F1%2F56&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2007" id="mwQhQ"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2007" id="mwQhU"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2007" id="mwQhY"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-343" id="cite_note-343" data-mw-footnote-number="320"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwQhc"><a href="#cite_ref-343" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwQhg"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQhk">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-343" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2010" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwQho" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:'''ロミオ'''　戀が<ruby>案內<rp>(</rp><rt>しるべ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぢゃ。尋ねて見い、と眞先に<ruby>促進<rp>(</rp><rt>すゝ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めたも戀なれば、智慧を借したも戀、目を借したも戀、<ruby>予<rp>(</rp><rt>わし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>舵<rp>(</rp><rt>かぢ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>取<rp>(</rp><rt>とり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ではないけれども、此樣な<ruby>貨<rp>(</rp><rt>たから</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を得ようためなら、千里萬里の荒海の、其先の濱へでも冐險しよう。<br/>[…]<br/>'''ヂュリ'''　おゝ、パリスどのと祝言をせう程なら、あの塔の上から飛んで見い、<ruby>山<rp>(</rp><rt>やま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>賊<rp>(</rp><rt>だち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>跳梁<rp>(</rp><rt>はびこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る夜道を行け、蛇の棲む<ruby>叢<rp>(</rp><rt>くさむら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に身を潛めいとも言はっしゃれ。[…]<br/>'''ピータ''' よいわ、今に見い、<ruby>身體<rp>(</rp><rt>からだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>中に鳴響くやうに支拂うてくれうぞ。<br/>[…]<br/>'''ピータ'''　何ぢゃ、劍を<ruby>藏<rp>(</rp><rt>しま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うて酒落を拔け？　よし！　すれば、名劍を藏うて名酒落で打<ruby>挫<rp>(</rp><rt>ひし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いでくれう。さ、男らしう試合うて見い。<br/>[…]　カピューレット！　モンタギュー！　‥‥見い、是皆<ruby>汝<rp>(</rp><rt>おぬし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>等<rp>(</rp><rt>たち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>相憎惡<rp>(</rp><rt>にくみあひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>懲罰<rp>(</rp><rt>こらしめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、天は<ruby>故<rp>(</rp><rt>わざ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と子供等を愛しあはせ、以て<ruby>汝<rp>(</rp><rt>おぬし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>等<rp>(</rp><rt>ら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>歡樂<rp>(</rp><rt>よろこび</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をば殺させられたわ。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote='''Rom.''' By love, that first did prompt me to enquire;<br/>He lent me counsel, and I lent him eyes.<br/>I am no pilot; yet, wert thou as far<br/>As that vast shore wash’d with the farthest sea,<br/>I would adventure for such merchandise.<br/>[…]<br/>'''Jul.''' O, bid me leap, rather than marry Paris,<br/>From off the battlements of yonder tower;<br/>Or walk in thievish ways; or bid me lurk<br/>Where serpents are; […]<br/>'''Pet.''' I will then give it you soundly.<br/>[…]<br/>'''Pet.''' Then have at you with my wit. I will dry-beat you with an iron wit, and put up my iron dagger. Answer me like men:<br/>[…] Capulet! Montague!<br/>See, what a scourge is laid upon your hate,<br/>That heaven finds means to kill your joys with love!&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1664849/1/34&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pp=57, 139, 157–158, 183&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Romeo and Juliet&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:ロミオとヂュリエット&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|シェークスピヤ全集}}&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Shinjusha&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=William Shakespeare&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=William&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Shakespeare&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-link=Tsubouchi Shōyō&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Tsubouchi&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Shōyō&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=15 July 1957&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Bunkyō]], Tokyo&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFShakespeare1957" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2010"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Shakespeare" title="William Shakespeare" id="mwQhs">Shakespeare, William</a> (15 July 1957). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1664849/1/34" class="external text" id="mwQhw"><i id="mwQh0">Romeo and Juliet</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQh4">ロミオとヂュリエット</bdi></a>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwQh8"><span lang="ja" id="mwQiA">シェークスピヤ全集</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwQiE"> (in Japanese). Translated by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tsubouchi_Shōyō" title="Tsubouchi Shōyō" id="mwQiI">Tsubouchi, Shōyō</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bunkyō" title="Bunkyō" id="mwQiM">Bunkyō</a>, Tokyo: Shinjusha. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQiQ">&nbsp;</span>57, 139, <span class="nowrap" id="mwQiU">157–</span>158, 183. <q id="mwQiY"><b id="mwQic">Rom.</b> By love, that first did prompt me to enquire;<br id="mwQig">He lent me counsel, and I lent him eyes.<br id="mwQik">I am no pilot; yet, wert thou as far<br id="mwQio">As that vast shore wash'd with the farthest sea,<br id="mwQis">I would adventure for such merchandise.<br id="mwQiw">[…]<br id="mwQi0"><b id="mwQi4">Jul.</b> O, bid me leap, rather than marry Paris,<br id="mwQi8">From off the battlements of yonder tower;<br id="mwQjA">Or walk in thievish ways; or bid me lurk<br id="mwQjE">Where serpents are; […]<br id="mwQjI"><b id="mwQjM">Pet.</b> I will then give it you soundly.<br id="mwQjQ">[…]<br id="mwQjU"><b id="mwQjY">Pet.</b> Then have at you with my wit. I will dry-beat you with an iron wit, and put up my iron dagger. Answer me like men:<br id="mwQjc">[…] Capulet! Montague!<br id="mwQjg">See, what a scourge is laid upon your hate,<br id="mwQjk">That heaven finds means to kill your joys with love!</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQjo"><b id="mwQjs">ロミオ</b>　戀が<ruby id="mwQjw">案內<rp id="mwQj0">(</rp><rt id="mwQj4">しるべ</rt><rp id="mwQj8">)</rp></ruby>ぢゃ。尋ねて見い、と眞先に<ruby id="mwQkA">促進<rp id="mwQkE">(</rp><rt id="mwQkI">すゝ</rt><rp id="mwQkM">)</rp></ruby>めたも戀なれば、智慧を借したも戀、目を借したも戀、<ruby id="mwQkQ">予<rp id="mwQkU">(</rp><rt id="mwQkY">わし</rt><rp id="mwQkc">)</rp></ruby>は<ruby id="mwQkg">舵<rp id="mwQkk">(</rp><rt id="mwQko">かぢ</rt><rp id="mwQks">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwQkw">取<rp id="mwQk0">(</rp><rt id="mwQk4">とり</rt><rp id="mwQk8">)</rp></ruby>ではないけれども、此樣な<ruby id="mwQlA">貨<rp id="mwQlE">(</rp><rt id="mwQlI">たから</rt><rp id="mwQlM">)</rp></ruby>を得ようためなら、千里萬里の荒海の、其先の濱へでも冐險しよう。<br id="mwQlQ">[…]<br id="mwQlU"><b id="mwQlY">ヂュリ</b>　おゝ、パリスどのと祝言をせう程なら、あの塔の上から飛んで見い、<ruby id="mwQlc">山<rp id="mwQlg">(</rp><rt id="mwQlk">やま</rt><rp id="mwQlo">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwQls">賊<rp id="mwQlw">(</rp><rt id="mwQl0">だち</rt><rp id="mwQl4">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwQl8">跳梁<rp id="mwQmA">(</rp><rt id="mwQmE">はびこ</rt><rp id="mwQmI">)</rp></ruby>る夜道を行け、蛇の棲む<ruby id="mwQmM">叢<rp id="mwQmQ">(</rp><rt id="mwQmU">くさむら</rt><rp id="mwQmY">)</rp></ruby>に身を潛めいとも言はっしゃれ。[…]<br id="mwQmc"><b id="mwQmg">ピータ</b> よいわ、今に見い、<ruby id="mwQmk">身體<rp id="mwQmo">(</rp><rt id="mwQms">からだ</rt><rp id="mwQmw">)</rp></ruby>中に鳴響くやうに支拂うてくれうぞ。<br id="mwQm0">[…]<br id="mwQm4"><b id="mwQm8">ピータ</b>　何ぢゃ、劍を<ruby id="mwQnA">藏<rp id="mwQnE">(</rp><rt id="mwQnI">しま</rt><rp id="mwQnM">)</rp></ruby>うて酒落を拔け？　よし！　すれば、名劍を藏うて名酒落で打<ruby id="mwQnQ">挫<rp id="mwQnU">(</rp><rt id="mwQnY">ひし</rt><rp id="mwQnc">)</rp></ruby>いでくれう。さ、男らしう試合うて見い。<br id="mwQng">[…]　カピューレット！　モンタギュー！　‥‥見い、是皆<ruby id="mwQnk">汝<rp id="mwQno">(</rp><rt id="mwQns">おぬし</rt><rp id="mwQnw">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwQn0">等<rp id="mwQn4">(</rp><rt id="mwQn8">たち</rt><rp id="mwQoA">)</rp></ruby>が<ruby id="mwQoE">相憎惡<rp id="mwQoI">(</rp><rt id="mwQoM">にくみあひ</rt><rp id="mwQoQ">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwQoU">懲罰<rp id="mwQoY">(</rp><rt id="mwQoc">こらしめ</rt><rp id="mwQog">)</rp></ruby>、天は<ruby id="mwQok">故<rp id="mwQoo">(</rp><rt id="mwQos">わざ</rt><rp id="mwQow">)</rp></ruby>と子供等を愛しあはせ、以て<ruby id="mwQo0">汝<rp id="mwQo4">(</rp><rt id="mwQo8">おぬし</rt><rp id="mwQpA">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwQpE">等<rp id="mwQpI">(</rp><rt id="mwQpM">ら</rt><rp id="mwQpQ">)</rp></ruby>が<ruby id="mwQpU">歡樂<rp id="mwQpY">(</rp><rt id="mwQpc">よろこび</rt><rp id="mwQpg">)</rp></ruby>をば殺させられたわ。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=Romeo+and+Juliet+%E3%83%AD%E3%83%9F%E3%82%AA%E3%81%A8%E3%83%82%E3%83%A5%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A8%E3%83%83%E3%83%88&amp;rft.place=Bunky%C5%8D%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E3%82%B7%E3%82%A7%E3%83%BC%E3%82%AF%E3%82%B9%E3%83%94%E3%83%A4%E5%85%A8%E9%9B%86%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=57%2C+139%2C+157-158%2C+183&amp;rft.pub=Shinjusha&amp;rft.date=1957-07-15&amp;rft.aulast=Shakespeare&amp;rft.aufirst=William&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1664849%2F1%2F34&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2010" id="mwQpk"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2010" id="mwQpo"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2010" id="mwQps"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-344" id="cite_note-344" data-mw-footnote-number="321"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwQpw"><a href="#cite_ref-344" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwQp0"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQp4">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-344" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2013" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwQp8" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:こういうサイコロを私にくれまして，さあこれで日本の将来の原子炉を設計して見いというわけです．&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;p=578&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/2307617/1/8&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:原子炉とその燃料*&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Eizaburō Nishibori&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Eizaburō&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Nishibori&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:電気化学&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal=Journal of the Electrochemical Society of Japan&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=The Electrochemical Society of Japan&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=27&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=11&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=November 1959&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFNishibori1959" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2013"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eizaburō_Nishibori" title="Eizaburō Nishibori" id="mwQqA">Nishibori, Eizaburō</a> (November 1959). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/2307617/1/8" class="external text" id="mwQqE"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwQqI">原子炉とその燃料*</bdi></a>. <i id="mwQqM">Journal of the Electrochemical Society of Japan</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQqQ">電気化学</bdi> (in Japanese). <b id="mwQqU">27</b> (11). The Electrochemical Society of Japan: 578.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQqY">こういうサイコロを私にくれまして，さあこれで日本の将来の原子炉を設計して見いというわけです．</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Journal+of+the+Electrochemical+Society+of+Japan&amp;rft.atitle=%E5%8E%9F%E5%AD%90%E7%82%89%E3%81%A8%E3%81%9D%E3%81%AE%E7%87%83%E6%96%99%2A&amp;rft.volume=27&amp;rft.issue=11&amp;rft.pages=578&amp;rft.date=1959-11&amp;rft.aulast=Nishibori&amp;rft.aufirst=Eizabur%C5%8D&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F2307617%2F1%2F8&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2013" id="mwQqc"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2013" id="mwQqg"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2013" id="mwQqk"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-345" id="cite_note-345" data-mw-footnote-number="322"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwQqo"><a href="#cite_ref-345" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwQqs"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQqw">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-345" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2039" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwQq0" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「社長、何を察しろとおつしやるんですか?」[…]お前の迷惑は、それや察しるが、こつちはこつちで守らなけやならない利益の問題がある。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pp=144, 168&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1707459/1/78&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:愛翼千里&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=30 October 1948&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Kunio Kishida&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Kunio&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Kishida&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Yakumo Shoten&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Itabashi]], Tokyo&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFKishida1948" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2039"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kunio_Kishida" title="Kunio Kishida" id="mwQq4">Kishida, Kunio</a> (30 October 1948). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1707459/1/78" class="external text" id="mwQq8"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwQrA">愛翼千里</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Itabashi" title="Itabashi" id="mwQrE">Itabashi</a>, Tokyo: Yakumo Shoten. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQrI">&nbsp;</span>144, 168.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQrM">「社長、何を察しろとおつしやるんですか?」[…]お前の迷惑は、それや察しるが、こつちはこつちで守らなけやならない利益の問題がある。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%84%9B%E7%BF%BC%E5%8D%83%E9%87%8C&amp;rft.place=Itabashi%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=144%2C+168&amp;rft.pub=Yakumo+Shoten&amp;rft.date=1948-10-30&amp;rft.aulast=Kishida&amp;rft.aufirst=Kunio&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1707459%2F1%2F78&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2039" id="mwQrQ"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2039" id="mwQrU"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2039" id="mwQrY"></span></li>
