<li about="#cite_note-347" id="cite_note-347" data-mw-footnote-number="324"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwQs0"><a href="#cite_ref-347" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwQs4"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQs8">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-347" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2051" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwQtA" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:<ruby>其<rp>(</rp><rt>そ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>死<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んだ<ruby>遊女<rp>(</rp><rt>おいらん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>言<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ひ、<ruby>實<rp>(</rp><rt>じつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>察<rp>(</rp><rt>さつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しる。[…]<ruby>此<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>彫<rp>(</rp><rt>てう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>刻<rp>(</rp><rt>こく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>家<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>心<rp>(</rp><rt>こゝろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>察<rp>(</rp><rt>さつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>せよ。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pp=478, 698&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/979015/1/358&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Kyōka Izumi&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Kyōtarō&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Izumi&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=1926&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Shunyodo&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:鏡花全集&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=9&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFIzumi1926" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2051"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kyōka_Izumi" title="Kyōka Izumi" id="mwQtE">Izumi, Kyōtarō</a> (1926). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/979015/1/358" class="external text" id="mwQtI"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwQtM">鏡花全集</bdi></a> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQtQ">&nbsp;</span>9. Shunyodo. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQtU">&nbsp;</span>478, 698.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQtY"><ruby id="mwQtc">其<rp id="mwQtg">(</rp><rt id="mwQtk">そ</rt><rp id="mwQto">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwQts">死<rp id="mwQtw">(</rp><rt id="mwQt0">し</rt><rp id="mwQt4">)</rp></ruby>んだ<ruby id="mwQt8">遊女<rp id="mwQuA">(</rp><rt id="mwQuE">おいらん</rt><rp id="mwQuI">)</rp></ruby>と<ruby id="mwQuM">言<rp id="mwQuQ">(</rp><rt id="mwQuU">い</rt><rp id="mwQuY">)</rp></ruby>ひ、<ruby id="mwQuc">實<rp id="mwQug">(</rp><rt id="mwQuk">じつ</rt><rp id="mwQuo">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwQus">察<rp id="mwQuw">(</rp><rt id="mwQu0">さつ</rt><rp id="mwQu4">)</rp></ruby>しる。[…]<ruby id="mwQu8">此<rp id="mwQvA">(</rp><rt id="mwQvE">こ</rt><rp id="mwQvI">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwQvM">彫<rp id="mwQvQ">(</rp><rt id="mwQvU">てう</rt><rp id="mwQvY">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwQvc">刻<rp id="mwQvg">(</rp><rt id="mwQvk">こく</rt><rp id="mwQvo">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwQvs">家<rp id="mwQvw">(</rp><rt id="mwQv0">か</rt><rp id="mwQv4">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwQv8">心<rp id="mwQwA">(</rp><rt id="mwQwE">こゝろ</rt><rp id="mwQwI">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwQwM">察<rp id="mwQwQ">(</rp><rt id="mwQwU">さつ</rt><rp id="mwQwY">)</rp></ruby>せよ。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=%E9%8F%A1%E8%8A%B1%E5%85%A8%E9%9B%86&amp;rft.pages=478%2C+698&amp;rft.pub=Shunyodo&amp;rft.date=1926&amp;rft.aulast=Izumi&amp;rft.aufirst=Ky%C5%8Dtar%C5%8D&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F979015%2F1%2F358&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2051" id="mwQwc"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2051" id="mwQwg"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2051" id="mwQwk"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-sanseido-1932-348" id="cite_note-sanseido-1932-348" data-mw-footnote-number="325"><span rel="mw:referencedBy" class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwQwo"><a href="#cite_ref-sanseido-1932_348-0" id="mwQws"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQww">1</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-sanseido-1932_348-1" id="mwQw0"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQw4">2</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-sanseido-1932_348-2" id="mwQw8"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQxA">3</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-sanseido-1932-348" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2063" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwQxE" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1275584/1/95&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=6&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:附錄第一 本書練習問題解答&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:分り易く・覺え易い日本文法の硏究&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Sanseidō&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=15 April 1932&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Kamei&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Torao&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;collaboration={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|三省堂編輯所}}&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFKamei1932" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2063">Kamei, Torao; et<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQxI">&nbsp;</span>al. (<span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwQxM"><span lang="ja" id="mwQxQ">三省堂編輯所</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwQxU">) (15 April 1932).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQxY">附錄第一 本書練習問題解答</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1275584/1/95" class="external text" id="mwQxc"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwQxg">分り易く・覺え易い日本文法の硏究</bdi></a> (in Japanese). Sanseidō. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQxk">&nbsp;</span>6.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E9%99%84%E9%8C%84%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80+%E6%9C%AC%E6%9B%B8%E7%B7%B4%E7%BF%92%E5%95%8F%E9%A1%8C%E8%A7%A3%E7%AD%94&amp;rft.btitle=%E5%88%86%E3%82%8A%E6%98%93%E3%81%8F%E3%83%BB%E8%A6%BA%E3%81%88%E6%98%93%E3%81%84%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E6%96%87%E6%B3%95%E3%81%AE%E7%A1%8F%E7%A9%B6&amp;rft.pages=6&amp;rft.pub=Sanseid%C5%8D&amp;rft.date=1932-04-15&amp;rft.aulast=Kamei&amp;rft.aufirst=Torao&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1275584%2F1%2F95&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2063" id="mwQxo"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2063" id="mwQxs"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2063" id="mwQxw"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-349" id="cite_note-349" data-mw-footnote-number="326"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwQx0"><a href="#cite_ref-349" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwQx4"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQx8">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-349" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2066" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwQyA" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:信じろ 信じるんだ タイラー！&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:いつわりの相手&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Sagara&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Kyōko&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Harlequin&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=1 October 2016&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFSagara2016" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2066">Sagara, Kyōko (1 October 2016).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQyE">いつわりの相手</bdi> (in Japanese). Harlequin.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQyI">信じろ 信じるんだ タイラー！</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=%E3%81%84%E3%81%A4%E3%82%8F%E3%82%8A%E3%81%AE%E7%9B%B8%E6%89%8B&amp;rft.pub=Harlequin&amp;rft.date=2016-10-01&amp;rft.aulast=Sagara&amp;rft.aufirst=Ky%C5%8Dko&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2066" id="mwQyM"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2066" id="mwQyQ"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2066" id="mwQyU"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-350" id="cite_note-350" data-mw-footnote-number="327"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwQyY"><a href="#cite_ref-350" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwQyc"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQyg">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-350" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2070" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwQyk" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.aozora.gr.jp/cards/000311/files/2927_9212.html&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:運命を信じよ。武者小路実篤の初期の作品には、そういう意味で女の生活の主張を鼓舞したものがあるが、実に興味ある点は、それらの作品が、屡々殿様対侍女という人物構成で扱われていることである。そして信じよ、と云われる運命が男の運命であり、それを信じることによって女の運命もひらかれるという視点から見られていることである。&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:五、分流（大正前期）&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:婦人と文学&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Miyamoto&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Yuriko&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Miyamoto Yuriko&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=1948&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFMiyamoto1948" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2070"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Miyamoto_Yuriko" title="Miyamoto Yuriko" id="mwQyo">Miyamoto, Yuriko</a> (1948).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQys">五、分流（大正前期）</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.aozora.gr.jp/cards/000311/files/2927_9212.html" class="external text" id="mwQyw"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwQy0">婦人と文学</bdi></a> (in Japanese).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQy4">運命を信じよ。武者小路実篤の初期の作品には、そういう意味で女の生活の主張を鼓舞したものがあるが、実に興味ある点は、それらの作品が、屡々殿様対侍女という人物構成で扱われていることである。そして信じよ、と云われる運命が男の運命であり、それを信じることによって女の運命もひらかれるという視点から見られていることである。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E4%BA%94%E3%80%81%E5%88%86%E6%B5%81%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%A7%E6%AD%A3%E5%89%8D%E6%9C%9F%EF%BC%89&amp;rft.btitle=%E5%A9%A6%E4%BA%BA%E3%81%A8%E6%96%87%E5%AD%A6&amp;rft.date=1948&amp;rft.aulast=Miyamoto&amp;rft.aufirst=Yuriko&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.aozora.gr.jp%2Fcards%2F000311%2Ffiles%2F2927_9212.html&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2070" id="mwQy8"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2070" id="mwQzA"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2070" id="mwQzE"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-351" id="cite_note-351" data-mw-footnote-number="328"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwQzI"><a href="#cite_ref-351" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwQzM"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQzQ">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-351" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2073" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwQzU" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「[…]如来が必ずたすけて下さると信じることだ。信じることが大切だ。そして、念仏を唱えるのだ」<br/>法然は、信じよ、信じるのだとくりかえした。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=38&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:越後&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:親鸞II&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=8 July 1976&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|丹羽文雄文学全集}}&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=27&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Kodansha&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Fumio Niwa&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Fumio&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Niwa&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Bunkyō]], Tokyo&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFNiwa1976" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2073"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fumio_Niwa" title="Fumio Niwa" id="mwQzY">Niwa, Fumio</a> (8 July 1976).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQzc">越後</bdi>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQzg">親鸞II</bdi>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwQzk"><span lang="ja" id="mwQzo">丹羽文雄文学全集</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwQzs"> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQzw">&nbsp;</span>27. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bunkyō" title="Bunkyō" id="mwQz0">Bunkyō</a>, Tokyo: Kodansha. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQz4">&nbsp;</span>38.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQz8">「[…]如来が必ずたすけて下さると信じることだ。信じることが大切だ。そして、念仏を唱えるのだ」<br id="mwQ0A">法然は、信じよ、信じるのだとくりかえした。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E8%B6%8A%E5%BE%8C&amp;rft.btitle=%E8%A6%AA%E9%B8%9EII&amp;rft.place=Bunky%C5%8D%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E4%B8%B9%E7%BE%BD%E6%96%87%E9%9B%84%E6%96%87%E5%AD%A6%E5%85%A8%E9%9B%86%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=38&amp;rft.pub=Kodansha&amp;rft.date=1976-07-08&amp;rft.aulast=Niwa&amp;rft.aufirst=Fumio&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2073" id="mwQ0E"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2073" id="mwQ0I"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2073" id="mwQ0M"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-352" id="cite_note-352" data-mw-footnote-number="329"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwQ0Q"><a href="#cite_ref-352" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwQ0U"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQ0Y">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-352" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2076" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwQ0c" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;thesis&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;degree=doctoral&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;doi=10.11501/3067494&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:どんな奇跡も、たとえそれが事実であろうとも、奇跡の生起した因果関係論証されない以上、どう信じよというのか。ディドロにとっては、理性の働きである論理性の方が、人間の生きた目よりも、より信じるに足るものなのだ。&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pp=78–79&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:⒉ 理性・感覚・判断&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:『ペルシャ人の手紙』研究 —モンテスキューと社会学—&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Nakae&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Keiko&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=24 March 1993&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/3067494/1/90&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFNakae1993" class="citation thesis cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2076">Nakae, Keiko (24 March 1993).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQ0g">⒉ 理性・感覚・判断</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/3067494/1/90" class="external text" id="mwQ0k"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwQ0o">『ペルシャ人の手紙』研究 —モンテスキューと社会学—</bdi></a> (doctoral thesis) (in Japanese). pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQ0s">&nbsp;</span><span class="nowrap" id="mwQ0w">78–</span>79. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doi_(identifier)" title="Doi (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwQ00">doi</a>:<a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://doi.org/10.11501%2F3067494" class="external text" id="mwQ04">10.11501/3067494</a>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQ08">どんな奇跡も、たとえそれが事実であろうとも、奇跡の生起した因果関係論証されない以上、どう信じよというのか。ディドロにとっては、理性の働きである論理性の方が、人間の生きた目よりも、より信じるに足るものなのだ。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Adissertation&amp;rft.title=%E3%80%8E%E3%83%9A%E3%83%AB%E3%82%B7%E3%83%A3%E4%BA%BA%E3%81%AE%E6%89%8B%E7%B4%99%E3%80%8F%E7%A0%94%E7%A9%B6+%E2%80%94%E3%83%A2%E3%83%B3%E3%83%86%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AD%E3%83%A5%E3%83%BC%E3%81%A8%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E5%AD%A6%E2%80%94&amp;rft.degree=doctoral&amp;rft.date=1993-03-24&amp;rft_id=info%3Adoi%2F10.11501%2F3067494&amp;rft.aulast=Nakae&amp;rft.aufirst=Keiko&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F3067494%2F1%2F90&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2076" id="mwQ1A"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2076" id="mwQ1E"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2076" id="mwQ1I"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-353" id="cite_note-353" data-mw-footnote-number="330"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwQ1M"><a href="#cite_ref-353" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwQ1Q"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQ1U">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-353" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2079" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwQ1Y" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「芸術家を信じるな、作品を信じよ」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=\&quot;Never trust the artist. Trust the tale.\&quot;&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=47&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Yoshio&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Nakamura&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://nagasaki-u.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/21431/files/kyoyoJ33_02_04_t.pdf&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:『楽園のこちら側』にみる知的統一&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Intellectual Unity in ''This Side of Paradise''&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:長崎大学教養部紀要（人文科学篇）&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=33&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=2&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=January 1993&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFNakamura1993" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2079">Nakamura, Yoshio (January 1993). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://nagasaki-u.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/21431/files/kyoyoJ33_02_04_t.pdf" class="external text" id="mwQ1c">"Intellectual Unity in <i id="mwQ1g">This Side of Paradise</i>" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQ1k">『楽園のこちら側』にみる知的統一</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwQ1o">(PDF)</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQ1s">長崎大学教養部紀要（人文科学篇）</bdi> (in Japanese). <b id="mwQ1w">33</b> (2): 47. <q id="mwQ10">Never trust the artist. Trust the tale.</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQ14">「芸術家を信じるな、作品を信じよ」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=Intellectual+Unity+in+This+Side+of+Paradise+%E3%80%8E%E6%A5%BD%E5%9C%92%E3%81%AE%E3%81%93%E3%81%A1%E3%82%89%E5%81%B4%E3%80%8F%E3%81%AB%E3%81%BF%E3%82%8B%E7%9F%A5%E7%9A%84%E7%B5%B1%E4%B8%80&amp;rft.volume=33&amp;rft.issue=2&amp;rft.pages=47&amp;rft.date=1993-01&amp;rft.aulast=Nakamura&amp;rft.aufirst=Yoshio&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fnagasaki-u.repo.nii.ac.jp%2Frecord%2F21431%2Ffiles%2FkyoyoJ33_02_04_t.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2079" id="mwQ18"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2079" id="mwQ2A"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2079" id="mwQ2E"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-354" id="cite_note-354" data-mw-footnote-number="331"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwQ2I"><a href="#cite_ref-354" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwQ2M"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQ2Q">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-354" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2082" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwQ2U" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:三つのことを信じるな。三つのことを信じよ。おまえさんの義理の父親（もしくは霧の母親）の愛を信じるな。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=627&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://minpaku.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/1836/files/SER45_019.pdf&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Eguchi&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Kazuhisa&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:ことば遊び&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:国立民族学博物館調査報告&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=45&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=2003&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFEguchi2003" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2082">Eguchi, Kazuhisa (2003). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://minpaku.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/1836/files/SER45_019.pdf" class="external text" id="mwQ2Y"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwQ2c">ことば遊び</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwQ2g">(PDF)</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQ2k">国立民族学博物館調査報告</bdi> (in Japanese) (45): 627.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQ2o">三つのことを信じるな。三つのことを信じよ。おまえさんの義理の父親（もしくは霧の母親）の愛を信じるな。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E3%81%93%E3%81%A8%E3%81%B0%E9%81%8A%E3%81%B3&amp;rft.issue=45&amp;rft.pages=627&amp;rft.date=2003&amp;rft.aulast=Eguchi&amp;rft.aufirst=Kazuhisa&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fminpaku.repo.nii.ac.jp%2Frecord%2F1836%2Ffiles%2FSER45_019.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2082" id="mwQ2s"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2082" id="mwQ2w"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2082" id="mwQ20"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-355" id="cite_note-355" data-mw-footnote-number="332"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwQ24"><a href="#cite_ref-355" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwQ28"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQ3A">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-355" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2085" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwQ3E" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;thesis&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:つまり、たとえば｢仏教とは要するにこんなものだよ」と過度に単純化してみせる一方で、「でも、私の説明を鵜呑みにしないで、自分で調べてみてください」といった感じて、つまり「我を信じよ」「我を信じるな」という両面から提示していくのです。[…]結局、「我を信じよ」「我を信じるな」の両面作戦で行くのがよいのではないかと思うのです。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=4&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Nakamura&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Keishi&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:信じない人のための＜宗教＞講義&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Kokushikan University Library and Information Commons&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=2015&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;degree=doctoral&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://kokushikan.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/7520/files/1343_2389_019_01.pdf&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="mwQ3I" class="citation thesis cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2085" data-x-id="CITEREFNakamura2015">Nakamura, Keishi (2015). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://kokushikan.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/7520/files/1343_2389_019_01.pdf" class="external text" id="mwQ3M"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwQ3Q">信じない人のための＜宗教＞講義</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwQ3U">(PDF)</span> (doctoral thesis) (in Japanese). Kokushikan University Library and Information Commons. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQ3Y">&nbsp;</span>4.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQ3c">つまり、たとえば｢仏教とは要するにこんなものだよ」と過度に単純化してみせる一方で、「でも、私の説明を鵜呑みにしないで、自分で調べてみてください」といった感じて、つまり「我を信じよ」「我を信じるな」という両面から提示していくのです。[…]結局、「我を信じよ」「我を信じるな」の両面作戦で行くのがよいのではないかと思うのです。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Adissertation&amp;rft.title=%E4%BF%A1%E3%81%98%E3%81%AA%E3%81%84%E4%BA%BA%E3%81%AE%E3%81%9F%E3%82%81%E3%81%AE%EF%BC%9C%E5%AE%97%E6%95%99%EF%BC%9E%E8%AC%9B%E7%BE%A9&amp;rft.degree=doctoral&amp;rft.inst=Kokushikan+University+Library+and+Information+Commons&amp;rft.date=2015&amp;rft.aulast=Nakamura&amp;rft.aufirst=Keishi&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fkokushikan.repo.nii.ac.jp%2Frecord%2F7520%2Ffiles%2F1343_2389_019_01.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2085" id="mwQ3g"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2085" id="mwQ3k"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2085" id="mwQ3o"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-356" id="cite_note-356" data-mw-footnote-number="333"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwQ3s"><a href="#cite_ref-356" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwQ3w"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwQ30">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-356" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2093" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwQ34" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:<ruby>聖<rp>(</rp><rt>しやう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>德<rp>(</rp><rt>とく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>太<rp>(</rp><rt>たい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は、<ruby>用<rp>(</rp><rt>よう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>明<rp>(</rp><rt>めい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>天<rp>(</rp><rt>てん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>皇<rp>(</rp><rt>のう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>皇<rp>(</rp><rt>わう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>じ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でゐらつしゃいます。<ruby>衆<rp>(</rp><rt>しう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>勝<rp>(</rp><rt>すぐ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れたお<ruby>方<rp>(</rp><rt>かた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で、<ruby>傳<rp>(</rp><rt>つた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ふるところに<ruby>依<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りますと、お<ruby>生<rp>(</rp><rt>うま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れになつて<ruby>間<rp>(</rp><rt>ま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>もなく、<br/>『<ruby>南<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>無<rp>(</rp><rt>む</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>！』<br/>と、ハツキリ<ruby>仰<rp>(</rp><rt>あふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>せになつたとか。<ruby>太<rp>(</rp><rt>たい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>非<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>常<rp>(</rp><rt>じやう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>佛<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>敎<rp>(</rp><rt>けう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をお<ruby>信<rp>(</rp><rt>しん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じになり、<br/>『<ruby>信<rp>(</rp><rt>しん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じれば、<ruby>心<rp>(</rp><rt>こゝろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>正<rp>(</rp><rt>たゞ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しく、<ruby>幸<rp>(</rp><rt>かう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>福<rp>(</rp><rt>ふく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>な<ruby>生<rp>(</rp><rt>しやう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>涯<rp>(</rp><rt>がい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>送<rp>(</rp><rt>おく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る<ruby>事<rp>(</rp><rt>こと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>で</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>來<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る。<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>誰<rp>(</rp><rt>たれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でも<ruby>佛<rp>(</rp><rt>ほとけ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>信<rp>(</rp><rt>しん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぜよ。』&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1716319/1/50&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=83&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:<ruby>聖<rp>(</rp><rt>しやう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>德<rp>(</rp><rt>とく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>太<rp>(</rp><rt>たい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>御<rp>(</rp><rt>ご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>憲<rp>(</rp><rt>けん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>法<rp>(</rp><rt>ぱふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:小學国史物語&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Motojima&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Eizō&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Hongō, Tokyo]]&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Shogakukan&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=25 June 1924&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFMotojima1924" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2093">Motojima, Eizō (25 June 1924).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQ38"><ruby id="mwQ4A">聖<rp id="mwQ4E">(</rp><rt id="mwQ4I">しやう</rt><rp id="mwQ4M">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwQ4Q">德<rp id="mwQ4U">(</rp><rt id="mwQ4Y">とく</rt><rp id="mwQ4c">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwQ4g">太<rp id="mwQ4k">(</rp><rt id="mwQ4o">たい</rt><rp id="mwQ4s">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwQ4w">子<rp id="mwQ40">(</rp><rt id="mwQ44">し</rt><rp id="mwQ48">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwQ5A">御<rp id="mwQ5E">(</rp><rt id="mwQ5I">ご</rt><rp id="mwQ5M">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwQ5Q">憲<rp id="mwQ5U">(</rp><rt id="mwQ5Y">けん</rt><rp id="mwQ5c">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwQ5g">法<rp id="mwQ5k">(</rp><rt id="mwQ5o">ぱふ</rt><rp id="mwQ5s">)</rp></ruby></bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1716319/1/50" class="external text" id="mwQ5w"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwQ50">小學国史物語</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hongō,_Tokyo" title="Hongō, Tokyo" id="mwQ54">Hongō, Tokyo</a>: Shogakukan. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwQ58">&nbsp;</span>83.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwQ6A"><ruby id="mwQ6E">聖<rp id="mwQ6I">(</rp><rt id="mwQ6M">しやう</rt><rp id="mwQ6Q">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwQ6U">德<rp id="mwQ6Y">(</rp><rt id="mwQ6c">とく</rt><rp id="mwQ6g">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwQ6k">太<rp id="mwQ6o">(</rp><rt id="mwQ6s">たい</rt><rp id="mwQ6w">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwQ60">子<rp id="mwQ64">(</rp><rt id="mwQ68">し</rt><rp id="mwQ7A">)</rp></ruby>は、<ruby id="mwQ7E">用<rp id="mwQ7I">(</rp><rt id="mwQ7M">よう</rt><rp id="mwQ7Q">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwQ7U">明<rp id="mwQ7Y">(</rp><rt id="mwQ7c">めい</rt><rp id="mwQ7g">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwQ7k">天<rp id="mwQ7o">(</rp><rt id="mwQ7s">てん</rt><rp id="mwQ7w">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwQ70">皇<rp id="mwQ74">(</rp><rt id="mwQ78">のう</rt><rp id="mwQ8A">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwQ8E">皇<rp id="mwQ8I">(</rp><rt id="mwQ8M">わう</rt><rp id="mwQ8Q">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwQ8U">子<rp id="mwQ8Y">(</rp><rt id="mwQ8c">じ</rt><rp id="mwQ8g">)</rp></ruby>でゐらつしゃいます。<ruby id="mwQ8k">衆<rp id="mwQ8o">(</rp><rt id="mwQ8s">しう</rt><rp id="mwQ8w">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwQ80">勝<rp id="mwQ84">(</rp><rt id="mwQ88">すぐ</rt><rp id="mwQ9A">)</rp></ruby>れたお<ruby id="mwQ9E">方<rp id="mwQ9I">(</rp><rt id="mwQ9M">かた</rt><rp id="mwQ9Q">)</rp></ruby>で、<ruby id="mwQ9U">傳<rp id="mwQ9Y">(</rp><rt id="mwQ9c">つた</rt><rp id="mwQ9g">)</rp></ruby>ふるところに<ruby id="mwQ9k">依<rp id="mwQ9o">(</rp><rt id="mwQ9s">よ</rt><rp id="mwQ9w">)</rp></ruby>りますと、お<ruby id="mwQ90">生<rp id="mwQ94">(</rp><rt id="mwQ98">うま</rt><rp id="mwQ-A">)</rp></ruby>れになつて<ruby id="mwQ-E">間<rp id="mwQ-I">(</rp><rt id="mwQ-M">ま</rt><rp id="mwQ-Q">)</rp></ruby>もなく、<br id="mwQ-U">『<ruby id="mwQ-Y">南<rp id="mwQ-c">(</rp><rt id="mwQ-g">な</rt><rp id="mwQ-k">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwQ-o">無<rp id="mwQ-s">(</rp><rt id="mwQ-w">む</rt><rp id="mwQ-0">)</rp></ruby>！』<br id="mwQ-4">と、ハツキリ<ruby id="mwQ-8">仰<rp id="mwQ_A">(</rp><rt id="mwQ_E">あふ</rt><rp id="mwQ_I">)</rp></ruby>せになつたとか。<ruby id="mwQ_M">太<rp id="mwQ_Q">(</rp><rt id="mwQ_U">たい</rt><rp id="mwQ_Y">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwQ_c">子<rp id="mwQ_g">(</rp><rt id="mwQ_k">し</rt><rp id="mwQ_o">)</rp></ruby>は<ruby id="mwQ_s">非<rp id="mwQ_w">(</rp><rt id="mwQ_0">ひ</rt><rp id="mwQ_4">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwQ_8">常<rp id="mwRAA">(</rp><rt id="mwRAE">じやう</rt><rp id="mwRAI">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwRAM">佛<rp id="mwRAQ">(</rp><rt id="mwRAU">ぶつ</rt><rp id="mwRAY">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRAc">敎<rp id="mwRAg">(</rp><rt id="mwRAk">けう</rt><rp id="mwRAo">)</rp></ruby>をお<ruby id="mwRAs">信<rp id="mwRAw">(</rp><rt id="mwRA0">しん</rt><rp id="mwRA4">)</rp></ruby>じになり、<br id="mwRA8">『<ruby id="mwRBA">信<rp id="mwRBE">(</rp><rt id="mwRBI">しん</rt><rp id="mwRBM">)</rp></ruby>じれば、<ruby id="mwRBQ">心<rp id="mwRBU">(</rp><rt id="mwRBY">こゝろ</rt><rp id="mwRBc">)</rp></ruby>は<ruby id="mwRBg">正<rp id="mwRBk">(</rp><rt id="mwRBo">たゞ</rt><rp id="mwRBs">)</rp></ruby>しく、<ruby id="mwRBw">幸<rp id="mwRB0">(</rp><rt id="mwRB4">かう</rt><rp id="mwRB8">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRCA">福<rp id="mwRCE">(</rp><rt id="mwRCI">ふく</rt><rp id="mwRCM">)</rp></ruby>な<ruby id="mwRCQ">生<rp id="mwRCU">(</rp><rt id="mwRCY">しやう</rt><rp id="mwRCc">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRCg">涯<rp id="mwRCk">(</rp><rt id="mwRCo">がい</rt><rp id="mwRCs">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwRCw">送<rp id="mwRC0">(</rp><rt id="mwRC4">おく</rt><rp id="mwRC8">)</rp></ruby>る<ruby id="mwRDA">事<rp id="mwRDE">(</rp><rt id="mwRDI">こと</rt><rp id="mwRDM">)</rp></ruby>が<ruby id="mwRDQ">出<rp id="mwRDU">(</rp><rt id="mwRDY">で</rt><rp id="mwRDc">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRDg">來<rp id="mwRDk">(</rp><rt id="mwRDo">き</rt><rp id="mwRDs">)</rp></ruby>る。<ruby id="mwRDw">人<rp id="mwRD0">(</rp><rt id="mwRD4">ひと</rt><rp id="mwRD8">)</rp></ruby>は<ruby id="mwREA">誰<rp id="mwREE">(</rp><rt id="mwREI">たれ</rt><rp id="mwREM">)</rp></ruby>でも<ruby id="mwREQ">佛<rp id="mwREU">(</rp><rt id="mwREY">ほとけ</rt><rp id="mwREc">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwREg">信<rp id="mwREk">(</rp><rt id="mwREo">しん</rt><rp id="mwREs">)</rp></ruby>ぜよ。』</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%3Cruby%3E%E8%81%96%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%97%E3%82%84%E3%81%86%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E5%BE%B7%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%A8%E3%81%8F%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E5%A4%AA%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%9F%E3%81%84%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E5%AD%90%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%97%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%E3%81%AE%3Cruby%3E%E5%BE%A1%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%94%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E6%86%B2%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%91%E3%82%93%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E6%B3%95%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%B1%E3%81%B5%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E&amp;rft.btitle=%E5%B0%8F%E5%AD%B8%E5%9B%BD%E5%8F%B2%E7%89%A9%E8%AA%9E&amp;rft.place=Hong%C5%8D%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=83&amp;rft.pub=Shogakukan&amp;rft.date=1924-06-25&amp;rft.aulast=Motojima&amp;rft.aufirst=Eiz%C5%8D&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1716319%2F1%2F50&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2093" id="mwREw"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2093" id="mwRE0"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2093" id="mwRE4"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-357" id="cite_note-357" data-mw-footnote-number="334"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwRE8"><a href="#cite_ref-357" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwRFA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwRFE">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-357" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2096" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwRFI" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:'''大尉''' なんにも！。決してなんにも分りはしない、唯信じるきりなんだ、さうぢやないか、ヨーナス？。信ぜよ、さらば<ruby>幸<rp>(</rp><rt>さひはひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>あらん！。幸？‥‥。いや、俺は知つてゐる、人は信じて不幸にもなり得るものだ！。それを俺は知つてゐる！。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=93&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:第三幕&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:父&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=20 January 1939&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;edition=12th&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Komiya&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Toyotaka&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Johan August&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Strindberg&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=August Strindberg&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|岩波文庫}}&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=62&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Iwanami Shoten&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Kanda, Tokyo]]&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Fadren&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1121740/1/48&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFStrindberg1939" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2096"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/August_Strindberg" title="August Strindberg" id="mwRFM">Strindberg, Johan August</a> (20 January 1939).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwRFQ">第三幕</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1121740/1/48" class="external text" id="mwRFU"><i id="mwRFY">Fadren</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwRFc">父</bdi></a>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwRFg"><span lang="ja" id="mwRFk">岩波文庫</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwRFo"> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwRFs">&nbsp;</span>62. Translated by Komiya, Toyotaka (12th<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwRFw">&nbsp;</span>ed.). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kanda,_Tokyo" title="Kanda, Tokyo" id="mwRF0">Kanda, Tokyo</a>: Iwanami Shoten. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwRF4">&nbsp;</span>93.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwRF8"><b id="mwRGA">大尉</b> なんにも！。決してなんにも分りはしない、唯信じるきりなんだ、さうぢやないか、ヨーナス？。信ぜよ、さらば<ruby id="mwRGE">幸<rp id="mwRGI">(</rp><rt id="mwRGM">さひはひ</rt><rp id="mwRGQ">)</rp></ruby>あらん！。幸？‥‥。いや、俺は知つてゐる、人は信じて不幸にもなり得るものだ！。それを俺は知つてゐる！。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E5%B9%95&amp;rft.btitle=Fadren+%E7%88%B6&amp;rft.place=Kanda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E5%B2%A9%E6%B3%A2%E6%96%87%E5%BA%AB%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=93&amp;rft.edition=12th&amp;rft.pub=Iwanami+Shoten&amp;rft.date=1939-01-20&amp;rft.aulast=Strindberg&amp;rft.aufirst=Johan+August&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1121740%2F1%2F48&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2096" id="mwRGU"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2096" id="mwRGY"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2096" id="mwRGc"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-358" id="cite_note-358" data-mw-footnote-number="335"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwRGg"><a href="#cite_ref-358" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwRGk"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwRGo">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-358" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2099" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwRGs" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=219&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「住民たちよ。火を信じるのをやめて、ただ一人の、<ruby>全<rp>(</rp><rt>ぜん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>能<rp>(</rp><rt>のう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の神を信ぜよ。」&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1168366/1/112&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:五、五<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>にん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>姉<rp>(</rp><rt>きょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>妹<rp>(</rp><rt>だい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はなし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:アラビヤンナイト物語&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Shufunotomo&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Kikuchi&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Kan&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Kan Kikuchi&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=25 August 1948&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Chiyoda, Tokyo]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFKikuchi1948" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2099"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kan_Kikuchi" title="Kan Kikuchi" id="mwRGw">Kikuchi, Kan</a> (25 August 1948).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwRG0">五、五<ruby id="mwRG4">人<rp id="mwRG8">(</rp><rt id="mwRHA">にん</rt><rp id="mwRHE">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRHI">姉<rp id="mwRHM">(</rp><rt id="mwRHQ">きょう</rt><rp id="mwRHU">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRHY">妹<rp id="mwRHc">(</rp><rt id="mwRHg">だい</rt><rp id="mwRHk">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwRHo">話<rp id="mwRHs">(</rp><rt id="mwRHw">はなし</rt><rp id="mwRH0">)</rp></ruby></bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1168366/1/112" class="external text" id="mwRH4"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwRH8">アラビヤンナイト物語</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiyoda,_Tokyo" title="Chiyoda, Tokyo" id="mwRIA">Chiyoda, Tokyo</a>: Shufunotomo. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwRIE">&nbsp;</span>219.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwRII">「住民たちよ。火を信じるのをやめて、ただ一人の、<ruby id="mwRIM">全<rp id="mwRIQ">(</rp><rt id="mwRIU">ぜん</rt><rp id="mwRIY">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRIc">能<rp id="mwRIg">(</rp><rt id="mwRIk">のう</rt><rp id="mwRIo">)</rp></ruby>の神を信ぜよ。」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E4%BA%94%E3%80%81%E4%BA%94%3Cruby%3E%E4%BA%BA%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%AB%E3%82%93%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E5%A7%89%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%8D%E3%82%87%E3%81%86%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E5%A6%B9%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%A0%E3%81%84%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%E3%81%AE%3Cruby%3E%E8%A9%B1%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%AF%E3%81%AA%E3%81%97%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E&amp;rft.btitle=%E3%82%A2%E3%83%A9%E3%83%93%E3%83%A4%E3%83%B3%E3%83%8A%E3%82%A4%E3%83%88%E7%89%A9%E8%AA%9E&amp;rft.place=Chiyoda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=219&amp;rft.pub=Shufunotomo&amp;rft.date=1948-08-25&amp;rft.aulast=Kikuchi&amp;rft.aufirst=Kan&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1168366%2F1%2F112&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2099" id="mwRIs"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2099" id="mwRIw"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2099" id="mwRI0"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-359" id="cite_note-359" data-mw-footnote-number="336"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwRI4"><a href="#cite_ref-359" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwRI8"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwRJA">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-359" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2102" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwRJE" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「作家を信じるな。作品を信ぜよ。批評家の正当な仕事は……作家から作品を救出することだ。……アメリカ作家からアメリカ小説を救出することだ」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=\&quot;Never trust the artist. Trust the tale. The proper function of a critic is to save the tale from the artist […] saving the American tale from the American artist.\&quot;&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=61&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://seijo.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/5146/files/055-04.pdf&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Yagi&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Toshio&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:『緋文字』論序説&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:成城文藝&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=55&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=1969&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFYagi1969" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2102">Yagi, Toshio (1969). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://seijo.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/5146/files/055-04.pdf" class="external text" id="mwRJI"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwRJM">『緋文字』論序説</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwRJQ">(PDF)</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwRJU">成城文藝</bdi> (in Japanese) (55): 61. <q id="mwRJY">Never trust the artist. Trust the tale. The proper function of a critic is to save the tale from the artist […] saving the American tale from the American artist.</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwRJc">「作家を信じるな。作品を信ぜよ。批評家の正当な仕事は……作家から作品を救出することだ。……アメリカ作家からアメリカ小説を救出することだ」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E3%80%8E%E7%B7%8B%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97%E3%80%8F%E8%AB%96%E5%BA%8F%E8%AA%AC&amp;rft.issue=55&amp;rft.pages=61&amp;rft.date=1969&amp;rft.aulast=Yagi&amp;rft.aufirst=Toshio&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fseijo.repo.nii.ac.jp%2Frecord%2F5146%2Ffiles%2F055-04.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2102" id="mwRJg"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2102" id="mwRJk"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2102" id="mwRJo"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-360" id="cite_note-360" data-mw-footnote-number="337"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwRJs"><a href="#cite_ref-360" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwRJw"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwRJ0">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-360" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2105" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwRJ4" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:決して芸術家を信じるな、物語を信ぜよ。批評家の正当な機能は、物語を創造する芸術家から、物語を救い出すことである&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=Never trust the artist. Trust the tale. The proper function of a critic is to save the tale from the artist who created it.&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=5&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://seijo.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/6204/files/084-01.pdf&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Takagi&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Narahide&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:ロレンス随想(II) 『虹』——dualism の彼方に——&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:成城文藝&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=84&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=1978&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFTakagi1978" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2105">Takagi, Narahide (1978). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://seijo.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/6204/files/084-01.pdf" class="external text" id="mwRJ8"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwRKA">ロレンス随想(II) 『虹』——dualism の彼方に——</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwRKE">(PDF)</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwRKI">成城文藝</bdi> (in Japanese) (84): 5. <q id="mwRKM">Never trust the artist. Trust the tale. The proper function of a critic is to save the tale from the artist who created it.</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwRKQ">決して芸術家を信じるな、物語を信ぜよ。批評家の正当な機能は、物語を創造する芸術家から、物語を救い出すことである</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E3%83%AD%E3%83%AC%E3%83%B3%E3%82%B9%E9%9A%8F%E6%83%B3%28II%29+%E3%80%8E%E8%99%B9%E3%80%8F%E2%80%94%E2%80%94dualism+%E3%81%AE%E5%BD%BC%E6%96%B9%E3%81%AB%E2%80%94%E2%80%94&amp;rft.issue=84&amp;rft.pages=5&amp;rft.date=1978&amp;rft.aulast=Takagi&amp;rft.aufirst=Narahide&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fseijo.repo.nii.ac.jp%2Frecord%2F6204%2Ffiles%2F084-01.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2105" id="mwRKU"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2105" id="mwRKY"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2105" id="mwRKc"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-361" id="cite_note-361" data-mw-footnote-number="338"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwRKg"><a href="#cite_ref-361" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwRKk"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwRKo">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-361" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2108" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwRKs" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「悔い改めて福音を信ぜよ。主イエスを信じるならばあなたは救われるだろう。」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=\&quot;Repent and believe the gospel. Believe on the Lord Jesus, and ye shall yet be saved\&quot;&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=70&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://wesley-methodism.com/pdf/gakkai2011/gakkai2011f.pdf&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Nomura&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Makoto&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:ウェスレーと地震&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:ウェスレー・メソジスト研究&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=12&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=2011&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFNomura2011" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2108">Nomura, Makoto (2011). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://wesley-methodism.com/pdf/gakkai2011/gakkai2011f.pdf" class="external text" id="mwRKw"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwRK0">ウェスレーと地震</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwRK4">(PDF)</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwRK8">ウェスレー・メソジスト研究</bdi> (in Japanese) (12): 70. <q id="mwRLA">Repent and believe the gospel. Believe on the Lord Jesus, and ye shall yet be saved</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwRLE">「悔い改めて福音を信ぜよ。主イエスを信じるならばあなたは救われるだろう。」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E3%82%A6%E3%82%A7%E3%82%B9%E3%83%AC%E3%83%BC%E3%81%A8%E5%9C%B0%E9%9C%87&amp;rft.issue=12&amp;rft.pages=70&amp;rft.date=2011&amp;rft.aulast=Nomura&amp;rft.aufirst=Makoto&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwesley-methodism.com%2Fpdf%2Fgakkai2011%2Fgakkai2011f.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2108" id="mwRLI"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2108" id="mwRLM"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2108" id="mwRLQ"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-koizumi-1944-362" id="cite_note-koizumi-1944-362" data-mw-footnote-number="339"><span rel="mw:referencedBy" class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwRLU"><a href="#cite_ref-koizumi-1944_362-0" id="mwRLY"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwRLc">1</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-koizumi-1944_362-1" id="mwRLg"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwRLk">2</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-koizumi-1944-362" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2133" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwRLo" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1705317/1/28&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:二、四段活用化の傾向に就いて&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pp=38–46&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:日本語文の性格&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=20 February 1944&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Tōzō&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Koizumi&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Ritsumei Shuppanbu&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Kamigyō-ku, Kyoto|Kamigyō, Kyoto]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFKoizumi1944" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2133">Koizumi, Tōzō (20 February 1944).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwRLs">二、四段活用化の傾向に就いて</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1705317/1/28" class="external text" id="mwRLw"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwRL0">日本語文の性格</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kamigyō-ku,_Kyoto" title="Kamigyō-ku, Kyoto" id="mwRL4">Kamigyō, Kyoto</a>: Ritsumei Shuppanbu. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwRL8">&nbsp;</span><span class="nowrap" id="mwRMA">38–</span>46.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E5%9B%9B%E6%AE%B5%E6%B4%BB%E7%94%A8%E5%8C%96%E3%81%AE%E5%82%BE%E5%90%91%E3%81%AB%E5%B0%B1%E3%81%84%E3%81%A6&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E8%AA%9E%E6%96%87%E3%81%AE%E6%80%A7%E6%A0%BC&amp;rft.place=Kamigy%C5%8D%2C+Kyoto&amp;rft.pages=38-46&amp;rft.pub=Ritsumei+Shuppanbu&amp;rft.date=1944-02-20&amp;rft.aulast=Koizumi&amp;rft.aufirst=T%C5%8Dz%C5%8D&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1705317%2F1%2F28&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2133" id="mwRME"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2133" id="mwRMI"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2133" id="mwRMM"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-tsukahara-1910-363" id="cite_note-tsukahara-1910-363" data-mw-footnote-number="340"><span rel="mw:referencedBy" class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwRMQ"><a href="#cite_ref-tsukahara-1910_363-0" id="mwRMU"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwRMY">1</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-tsukahara-1910_363-1" id="mwRMc"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwRMg">2</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-tsukahara-1910-363" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2136" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwRMk" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:<ruby>恁<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>う<ruby>歎息<rp>(</rp><rt>なげ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いて<ruby>居<rp>(</rp><rt>ゐ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たのが、<ruby>此<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>半<rp>(</rp><rt>はん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>月<rp>(</rp><rt>つき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>以<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>來<rp>(</rp><rt>らい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、その<ruby>粮<rp>(</rp><rt>かて</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>無<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しの<ruby>米<rp>(</rp><rt>こめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>飯<rp>(</rp><rt>めし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ちふを<ruby>病母<rp>(</rp><rt>はゝ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>進<rp>(</rp><rt>しん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぜることが<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>で</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>來<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>た。[…]<ruby>又<rp>(</rp><rt>ま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>た<ruby>其<rp>(</rp><rt>その</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>外<rp>(</rp><rt>ほか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に十<ruby>枚<rp>(</rp><rt>まい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>進<rp>(</rp><rt>しん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぜろ。[…]『<ruby>此<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れを<ruby>脇<rp>(</rp><rt>かな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>へて<ruby>下<rp>(</rp><rt>くだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さらば、<ruby>刀<rp>(</rp><rt>かたな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>進<rp>(</rp><rt>しん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ずる。<ruby>御<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>身<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>所望<rp>(</rp><rt>のぞみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>鄕<rp>(</rp><rt>がう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>進<rp>(</rp><rt>しん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ずる。<ruby>其<rp>(</rp><rt>その</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>外<rp>(</rp><rt>ほか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>家<rp>(</rp><rt>や</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>內<rp>(</rp><rt>うち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>有<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りと<ruby>有<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る<ruby>物品<rp>(</rp><rt>もの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、<ruby>殘<rp>(</rp><rt>のこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らず<ruby>進<rp>(</rp><rt>しん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ずる。』&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pp=266, 288, 688&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/886674/1/150&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=7 January 1910&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:澁柿叢書&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Jūshien&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Tsukahara&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Hakubunkan&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Nihonbashi]], Tokyo&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFTsukahara1910" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2136">Tsukahara, Jūshien (7 January 1910). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/886674/1/150" class="external text" id="mwRMo"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwRMs">澁柿叢書</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nihonbashi" title="Nihonbashi" id="mwRMw">Nihonbashi</a>, Tokyo: Hakubunkan. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwRM0">&nbsp;</span>266, 288, 688.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwRM4"><ruby id="mwRM8">恁<rp id="mwRNA">(</rp><rt id="mwRNE">か</rt><rp id="mwRNI">)</rp></ruby>う<ruby id="mwRNM">歎息<rp id="mwRNQ">(</rp><rt id="mwRNU">なげ</rt><rp id="mwRNY">)</rp></ruby>いて<ruby id="mwRNc">居<rp id="mwRNg">(</rp><rt id="mwRNk">ゐ</rt><rp id="mwRNo">)</rp></ruby>たのが、<ruby id="mwRNs">此<rp id="mwRNw">(</rp><rt id="mwRN0">こ</rt><rp id="mwRN4">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwRN8">半<rp id="mwROA">(</rp><rt id="mwROE">はん</rt><rp id="mwROI">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwROM">月<rp id="mwROQ">(</rp><rt id="mwROU">つき</rt><rp id="mwROY">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwROc">以<rp id="mwROg">(</rp><rt id="mwROk">い</rt><rp id="mwROo">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwROs">來<rp id="mwROw">(</rp><rt id="mwRO0">らい</rt><rp id="mwRO4">)</rp></ruby>、その<ruby id="mwRO8">粮<rp id="mwRPA">(</rp><rt id="mwRPE">かて</rt><rp id="mwRPI">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRPM">無<rp id="mwRPQ">(</rp><rt id="mwRPU">な</rt><rp id="mwRPY">)</rp></ruby>しの<ruby id="mwRPc">米<rp id="mwRPg">(</rp><rt id="mwRPk">こめ</rt><rp id="mwRPo">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwRPs">飯<rp id="mwRPw">(</rp><rt id="mwRP0">めし</rt><rp id="mwRP4">)</rp></ruby>ちふを<ruby id="mwRP8">病母<rp id="mwRQA">(</rp><rt id="mwRQE">はゝ</rt><rp id="mwRQI">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwRQM">進<rp id="mwRQQ">(</rp><rt id="mwRQU">しん</rt><rp id="mwRQY">)</rp></ruby>ぜることが<ruby id="mwRQc">出<rp id="mwRQg">(</rp><rt id="mwRQk">で</rt><rp id="mwRQo">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRQs">來<rp id="mwRQw">(</rp><rt id="mwRQ0">き</rt><rp id="mwRQ4">)</rp></ruby>た。[…]<ruby id="mwRQ8">又<rp id="mwRRA">(</rp><rt id="mwRRE">ま</rt><rp id="mwRRI">)</rp></ruby>た<ruby id="mwRRM">其<rp id="mwRRQ">(</rp><rt id="mwRRU">その</rt><rp id="mwRRY">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRRc">外<rp id="mwRRg">(</rp><rt id="mwRRk">ほか</rt><rp id="mwRRo">)</rp></ruby>に十<ruby id="mwRRs">枚<rp id="mwRRw">(</rp><rt id="mwRR0">まい</rt><rp id="mwRR4">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwRR8">進<rp id="mwRSA">(</rp><rt id="mwRSE">しん</rt><rp id="mwRSI">)</rp></ruby>ぜろ。[…]『<ruby id="mwRSM">此<rp id="mwRSQ">(</rp><rt id="mwRSU">こ</rt><rp id="mwRSY">)</rp></ruby>れを<ruby id="mwRSc">脇<rp id="mwRSg">(</rp><rt id="mwRSk">かな</rt><rp id="mwRSo">)</rp></ruby>へて<ruby id="mwRSs">下<rp id="mwRSw">(</rp><rt id="mwRS0">くだ</rt><rp id="mwRS4">)</rp></ruby>さらば、<ruby id="mwRS8">刀<rp id="mwRTA">(</rp><rt id="mwRTE">かたな</rt><rp id="mwRTI">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwRTM">進<rp id="mwRTQ">(</rp><rt id="mwRTU">しん</rt><rp id="mwRTY">)</rp></ruby>ずる。<ruby id="mwRTc">御<rp id="mwRTg">(</rp><rt id="mwRTk">お</rt><rp id="mwRTo">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRTs">身<rp id="mwRTw">(</rp><rt id="mwRT0">み</rt><rp id="mwRT4">)</rp></ruby>が<ruby id="mwRT8">所望<rp id="mwRUA">(</rp><rt id="mwRUE">のぞみ</rt><rp id="mwRUI">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwRUM">鄕<rp id="mwRUQ">(</rp><rt id="mwRUU">がう</rt><rp id="mwRUY">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwRUc">進<rp id="mwRUg">(</rp><rt id="mwRUk">しん</rt><rp id="mwRUo">)</rp></ruby>ずる。<ruby id="mwRUs">其<rp id="mwRUw">(</rp><rt id="mwRU0">その</rt><rp id="mwRU4">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRU8">外<rp id="mwRVA">(</rp><rt id="mwRVE">ほか</rt><rp id="mwRVI">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRVM">家<rp id="mwRVQ">(</rp><rt id="mwRVU">や</rt><rp id="mwRVY">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRVc">內<rp id="mwRVg">(</rp><rt id="mwRVk">うち</rt><rp id="mwRVo">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwRVs">有<rp id="mwRVw">(</rp><rt id="mwRV0">あ</rt><rp id="mwRV4">)</rp></ruby>りと<ruby id="mwRV8">有<rp id="mwRWA">(</rp><rt id="mwRWE">あ</rt><rp id="mwRWI">)</rp></ruby>る<ruby id="mwRWM">物品<rp id="mwRWQ">(</rp><rt id="mwRWU">もの</rt><rp id="mwRWY">)</rp></ruby>、<ruby id="mwRWc">殘<rp id="mwRWg">(</rp><rt id="mwRWk">のこ</rt><rp id="mwRWo">)</rp></ruby>らず<ruby id="mwRWs">進<rp id="mwRWw">(</rp><rt id="mwRW0">しん</rt><rp id="mwRW4">)</rp></ruby>ずる。』</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%BE%81%E6%9F%BF%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8&amp;rft.place=Nihonbashi%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=266%2C+288%2C+688&amp;rft.pub=Hakubunkan&amp;r