<li about="#cite_note-364" id="cite_note-364" data-mw-footnote-number="341"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwRXI"><a href="#cite_ref-364" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwRXM"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwRXQ">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-364" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2139" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwRXU" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:<ruby>山<rp>(</rp><rt>やま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>や<ruby>畑<rp>(</rp><rt>はたけ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>叩<rp>(</rp><rt>たゝ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>賣<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つて<ruby>返<rp>(</rp><rt>かへ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して<ruby>進<rp>(</rp><rt>しん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぜるのになア、[…]<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>とかしてお<ruby>二<rp>(</rp><rt>ふた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>り</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さアを<ruby>舊<rp>(</rp><rt>もと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>身<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にして<ruby>進<rp>(</rp><rt>しん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぜろ。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pp=19–20&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:｟四｠まごころ&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:鶴子姬&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Mokuzen&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Watanabe&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=6 June 1918&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Minami-ku, Sakai|Minami, Osaka]]&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Higuchi Ryū Bunkan&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFWatanabe1918" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2139">Watanabe, Mokuzen (6 June 1918).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwRXY">｟四｠まごころ</bdi>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwRXc">鶴子姬</bdi> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Minami-ku,_Sakai" title="Minami-ku, Sakai" id="mwRXg">Minami, Osaka</a>: Higuchi Ryū Bunkan. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwRXk">&nbsp;</span><span class="nowrap" id="mwRXo">19–</span>20.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwRXs"><ruby id="mwRXw">山<rp id="mwRX0">(</rp><rt id="mwRX4">やま</rt><rp id="mwRX8">)</rp></ruby>や<ruby id="mwRYA">畑<rp id="mwRYE">(</rp><rt id="mwRYI">はたけ</rt><rp id="mwRYM">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwRYQ">叩<rp id="mwRYU">(</rp><rt id="mwRYY">たゝ</rt><rp id="mwRYc">)</rp></ruby>き<ruby id="mwRYg">賣<rp id="mwRYk">(</rp><rt id="mwRYo">う</rt><rp id="mwRYs">)</rp></ruby>つて<ruby id="mwRYw">返<rp id="mwRY0">(</rp><rt id="mwRY4">かへ</rt><rp id="mwRY8">)</rp></ruby>して<ruby id="mwRZA">進<rp id="mwRZE">(</rp><rt id="mwRZI">しん</rt><rp id="mwRZM">)</rp></ruby>ぜるのになア、[…]<ruby id="mwRZQ">何<rp id="mwRZU">(</rp><rt id="mwRZY">なん</rt><rp id="mwRZc">)</rp></ruby>とかしてお<ruby id="mwRZg">二<rp id="mwRZk">(</rp><rt id="mwRZo">ふた</rt><rp id="mwRZs">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRZw">人<rp id="mwRZ0">(</rp><rt id="mwRZ4">り</rt><rp id="mwRZ8">)</rp></ruby>さアを<ruby id="mwRaA">舊<rp id="mwRaE">(</rp><rt id="mwRaI">もと</rt><rp id="mwRaM">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwRaQ">身<rp id="mwRaU">(</rp><rt id="mwRaY">み</rt><rp id="mwRac">)</rp></ruby>にして<ruby id="mwRag">進<rp id="mwRak">(</rp><rt id="mwRao">しん</rt><rp id="mwRas">)</rp></ruby>ぜろ。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%EF%BD%9F%E5%9B%9B%EF%BD%A0%E3%81%BE%E3%81%94%E3%81%93%E3%82%8D&amp;rft.btitle=%E9%B6%B4%E5%AD%90%E5%A7%AC&amp;rft.place=Minami%2C+Osaka&amp;rf