<li about="#cite_note-365" id="cite_note-365" data-mw-footnote-number="342"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwRa8"><a href="#cite_ref-365" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwRbA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwRbE">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-365" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2143" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwRbI" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:<ruby>熱<rp>(</rp><rt>あつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>飯<rp>(</rp><rt>めし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でも<ruby>焚<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かして<ruby>進<rp>(</rp><rt>しん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぜよ。二三<ruby>日<rp>(</rp><rt>にち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ゆつくり、<ruby>逗<rp>(</rp><rt>たう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>留<rp>(</rp><rt>りう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して、たとへ百の<ruby>小<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>遣<rp>(</rp><rt>づか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ひでも、<ruby>持<rp>(</rp><rt>も</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たしてこなたを<ruby>立<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たして<ruby>進<rp>(</rp><rt>しん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぜる。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=229&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:茶音頭&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:曾我迺家喜劇集&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Soganoya&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Gorohachi&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|南人社}}&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=25 November 1918&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Shitaya]], Tokyo&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/933264/1/128&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFSoganoya1918" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2143">Soganoya, Gorohachi (25 November 1918).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwRbM">茶音頭</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/933264/1/128" class="external text" id="mwRbQ"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwRbU">曾我迺家喜劇集</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shitaya" title="Shitaya" id="mwRbY">Shitaya</a>, Tokyo: <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwRbc"><span lang="ja" id="mwRbg">南人社</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwRbk">. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwRbo">&nbsp;</span>229.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwRbs"><ruby id="mwRbw">熱<rp id="mwRb0">(</rp><rt id="mwRb4">あつ</rt><rp id="mwRb8">)</rp></ruby>い<ruby id="mwRcA">飯<rp id="mwRcE">(</rp><rt id="mwRcI">めし</rt><rp id="mwRcM">)</rp></ruby>でも<ruby id="mwRcQ">焚<rp id="mwRcU">(</rp><rt id="mwRcY">た</rt><rp id="mwRcc">)</rp></ruby>かして<ruby id="mwRcg">進<rp id="mwRck">(</rp><rt id="mwRco">しん</rt><rp id="mwRcs">)</rp></ruby>ぜよ。二三<ruby id="mwRcw">日<rp id="mwRc0">(</rp><rt id="mwRc4">にち</rt><rp id="mwRc8">)</rp></ruby>ゆつくり、<ruby id="mwRdA">逗<rp id="mwRdE">(</rp><rt id="mwRdI">たう</rt><rp id="mwRdM">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRdQ">留<rp id="mwRdU">(</rp><rt id="mwRdY">りう</rt><rp id="mwRdc">)</rp></ruby>して、たとへ百の<ruby id="mwRdg">小<rp id="mwRdk">(</rp><rt id="mwRdo">こ</rt><rp id="mwRds">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRdw">遣<rp id="mwRd0">(</rp><rt id="mwRd4">づか</rt><rp id="mwRd8">)</rp></ruby>ひでも、<ruby id="mwReA">持<rp id="mwReE">(</rp><rt id="mwReI">も</rt><rp id="mwReM">)</rp></ruby>たしてこなたを<ruby id="mwReQ">立<rp id="mwReU">(</rp><rt id="mwReY">た</rt><rp id="mwRec">)</rp></ruby>たして<ruby id="mwReg">進<rp id="mwRek">(</rp><rt id="mwReo">しん</rt><rp id="mwRes">)</rp></ruby>ぜる。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E8%8C%B6%E9%9F%B3%E9%A0%AD&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%9B%BE%E6%88%91%E8%BF%BA%E5%AE%B6%E5%96%9C%E5%8A%87%E9%9B%86&amp;rft.place=Shitaya%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=229&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E5%8D%97%E4%BA%BA%E7%A4%BE%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.date=1918-11-25&amp;rft.aulast=Soganoya&amp;rft.aufirst=Gorohachi&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F933264%2F1%2F128&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2143" id="mwRew"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2143" id="mwRe0"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2143" id="mwRe4"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-366" id="cite_note-366" data-mw-footnote-number="343"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwRe8"><a href="#cite_ref-366" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwRfA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwRfE">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-366" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2154" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwRfI" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=<p style=text-align:center>Geßler</p><p style=text-align:right>Treibt ſie auseinander!</p><p>Was läuft das Volk zuſammen? Wer ruft Hilfe?</p><p style=text-align:center><small>(allgemeine Stille)</small></p><p>Wer wars? Jch will es wiſſen.</p><p style=text-align:center><small>(zu Frießhardt)</small></p><p style=text-align:right>Du tritt vor!</p><p>Wer biſt du und was hältſt du dieſen Mann?</p><p style=text-align:center><small>(er giebt den Falken einem Diener)</small></p>&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:ゲスレス<sup>[''[[sic]]'']</sup>　　下郞どもを追つ拂へ。何でまた寄り居つたのぢや。助けを呼んだのは誰ぢや。<br/>　皆默つている。<br/>さあ、誰ぢや。言はんか。〔フリイスハルトに向つて〕こら、前に出い。その方は何者ぢや。何でこやつを引つ捕へた。<br/>　ゲスレル鷹を家來に渡す。&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote=<span style=font-variant:small-caps>Gessler</span> Drive off the boors! Why are they gathering again? Who called for help?<br/><small>Everyone is silent.</small><br/>Who was it, now? Will he not speak up? <small>[To Friesshardt]</small> Come thou forth! Who art thou? Why didst thou seize this man?<br/><small>Gessler gives the falcon to a servant.</small>&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1180892/1/52&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pp=95–96&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:'''第三場'''　<small>アルトルフ近傍の草原。　　前景は木立。奧の方に、竿にかゝつた帽子。眺望はバンベルグの峰で限られ、その上に雪を頂いた山々が聳えてゐる。　フリイスハルトとロイトホルトとが、立番をしてゐる。</small>&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-chapter='''Third Scene''' <small>A meadow near [[Altdorf, Uri|Altdorf]].   Trees in the foreground. A hat on a pole at the far back. The prospect is bounded by the Bannberg, above which rises a snow-capped mountain.  Friesshardt and Leuthold on guard.</small>&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=Dritte Scene <small>Wieſe bei Altorf. Jm Vordergrund Bäume, in der Tiefe der Hut auf einer Stange. Der Proſpekt wird begrenzt durch den Bannberg, über welchem ein Schneegebirg emporragt.</small> Frießhardt <small>und</small> Leuthold <small>halten Wache</small>&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|新潮文庫}}&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=250&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:ウィルヘルム・テル&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Wilhelm Tell&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=[[William Tell (play)|William Tell]]&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Friedrich Schiller&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Johann Christoph Friedrich&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=von Schiller&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Hata&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Toyokichi&quot;},&quot;21&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=8 August 1937&quot;},&quot;22&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Shinchosha&quot;},&quot;23&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Ushigome]], Tokyo&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFvon_Schiller1937" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2154"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Friedrich_Schiller" title="Friedrich Schiller" id="mwRfM">von Schiller, Johann Christoph Friedrich</a> (8 August 1937). "Dritte Scene <small id="mwRfQ">Wieſe bei Altorf. Jm Vordergrund Bäume, in der Tiefe der Hut auf einer Stange. Der Proſpekt wird begrenzt durch den Bannberg, über welchem ein Schneegebirg emporragt.</small> Frießhardt <small id="mwRfU">und</small> Leuthold <small id="mwRfY">halten Wache</small>" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwRfc"><b id="mwRfg">第三場</b>　<small id="mwRfk">アルトルフ近傍の草原。　　前景は木立。奧の方に、竿にかゝつた帽子。眺望はバンベルグの峰で限られ、その上に雪を頂いた山々が聳えてゐる。　フリイスハルトとロイトホルトとが、立番をしてゐる。</small></bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwRfo">[</span><b id="mwRfs">Third Scene</b> <small id="mwRfw">A meadow near <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Altdorf,_Uri" title="Altdorf, Uri" id="mwRf0">Altdorf</a>.   Trees in the foreground. A hat on a pole at the far back. The prospect is bounded by the Bannberg, above which rises a snow-capped mountain.  Friesshardt and Leuthold on guard.</small><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwRf4">]</span>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1180892/1/52" class="external text" id="mwRf8"><i id="mwRgA">Wilhelm Tell</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwRgE">ウィルヘルム・テル</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwRgI">[</span><i id="mwRgM"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Tell_(play)" title="William Tell (play)" id="mwRgQ">William Tell</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwRgU">]</span>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwRgY"><span lang="ja" id="mwRgc">新潮文庫</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwRgg"> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwRgk">&nbsp;</span>250. Translated by Hata, Toyokichi. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ushigome" title="Ushigome" id="mwRgo">Ushigome</a>, Tokyo: Shinchosha. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwRgs">&nbsp;</span><span class="nowrap" id="mwRgw">95–</span>96. <q id="mwRg0"><p style="text-align:center" id="mwRg4">Geßler</p><p style="text-align:right" id="mwRg8">Treibt ſie auseinander!</p><p id="mwRhA">Was läuft das Volk zuſammen? Wer ruft Hilfe?</p><p style="text-align:center" id="mwRhE"><small id="mwRhI">(allgemeine Stille)</small></p><p id="mwRhM">Wer wars? Jch will es wiſſen.</p><p style="text-align:center" id="mwRhQ"><small id="mwRhU">(zu Frießhardt)</small></p><p style="text-align:right" id="mwRhY">Du tritt vor!</p><p id="mwRhc">Wer biſt du und was hältſt du dieſen Mann?</p><p style="text-align:center" id="mwRhg"><small id="mwRhk">(er giebt den Falken einem Diener)</small></p></q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwRho">ゲスレス<sup id="mwRhs">[<i id="mwRhw"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sic" title="Sic" id="mwRh0">sic</a></i>]</sup>　　下郞どもを追つ拂へ。何でまた寄り居つたのぢや。助けを呼んだのは誰ぢや。<br id="mwRh4">　皆默つている。<br id="mwRh8">さあ、誰ぢや。言はんか。〔フリイスハルトに向つて〕こら、前に出い。その方は何者ぢや。何でこやつを引つ捕へた。<br id="mwRiA">　ゲスレル鷹を家來に渡す。</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwRiE">[</span><span style="font-variant:small-caps" id="mwRiI">Gessler</span> Drive off the boors! Why are they gathering again? Who called for help?<br id="mwRiM"><small id="mwRiQ">Everyone is silent.</small><br id="mwRiU">Who was it, now? Will he not speak up? <small id="mwRiY">[To Friesshardt]</small> Come thou forth! Who art thou? Why didst thou seize this man?<br id="mwRic"><small id="mwRig">Gessler gives the falcon to a servant.</small><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwRik">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=Dritte+Scene+%3Csmall%3EWie%C5%BFe+bei+Altorf.+Jm+Vordergrund+B%C3%A4ume%2C+in+der+Tiefe+der+Hut+auf+einer+Stange.+Der+Pro%C5%BFpekt+wird+begrenzt+durch+den+Bannberg%2C+%C3%BCber+welchem+ein+Schneegebirg+emporragt.%3C%2Fsmall%3E+Frie%C3%9Fhardt+%3Csmall%3Eund%3C%2Fsmall%3E+Leuthold+%3Csmall%3Ehalten+Wache%3C%2Fsmall%3E+%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E5%A0%B4%E3%80%80%3Csmall%3E%E3%82%A2%E3%83%AB%E3%83%88%E3%83%AB%E3%83%95%E8%BF%91%E5%82%8D%E3%81%AE%E8%8D%89%E5%8E%9F%E3%80%82%E3%80%80%E3%80%80%E5%89%8D%E6%99%AF%E3%81%AF%E6%9C%A8%E7%AB%8B%E3%80%82%E5%A5%A7%E3%81%AE%E6%96%B9%E3%81%AB%E3%80%81%E7%AB%BF%E3%81%AB%E3%81%8B%E3%82%9D%E3%81%A4%E3%81%9F%E5%B8%BD%E5%AD%90%E3%80%82%E7%9C%BA%E6%9C%9B%E3%81%AF%E3%83%90%E3%83%B3%E3%83%99%E3%83%AB%E3%82%B0%E3%81%AE%E5%B3%B0%E3%81%A7%E9%99%90%E3%82%89%E3%82%8C%E3%80%81%E3%81%9D%E3%81%AE%E4%B8%8A%E3%81%AB%E9%9B%AA%E3%82%92%E9%A0%82%E3%81%84%E3%81%9F%E5%B1%B1%E3%80%85%E3%81%8C%E8%81%B3%E3%81%88%E3%81%A6%E3%82%90%E3%82%8B%E3%80%82%E3%80%80%E3%83%95%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A4%E3%82%B9%E3%83%8F%E3%83%AB%E3%83%88%E3%81%A8%E3%83%AD%E3%82%A4%E3%83%88%E3%83%9B%E3%83%AB%E3%83%88%E3%81%A8%E3%81%8C%E3%80%81%E7%AB%8B%E7%95%AA%E3%82%92%E3%81%97%E3%81%A6%E3%82%90%E3%82%8B%E3%80%82%3C%2Fsmall%3E&amp;rft.btitle=Wilhelm+Tell+%E3%82%A6%E3%82%A3%E3%83%AB%E3%83%98%E3%83%AB%E3%83%A0%E3%83%BB%E3%83%86%E3%83%AB&amp;rft.place=Ushigome%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E6%96%B0%E6%BD%AE%E6%96%87%E5%BA%AB%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=95-96&amp;rft.pub=Shinchosha&amp;rft.date=1937-08-08&amp;rft.aulast=von+Schiller&amp;rft.aufirst=Johann+Christoph+Friedrich&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1180892%2F1%2F52&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2154" id="mwRio"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2154" id="mwRis"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2154" id="mwRiw"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-367" id="cite_note-367" data-mw-footnote-number="344"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwRi0"><a href="#cite_ref-367" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwRi4"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwRi8">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-367" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2157" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwRjA" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:<ruby>父<rp>(</rp><rt>ちゝ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>眞<rp>(</rp><rt>まつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>靑<rp>(</rp><rt>さを</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>になつて、<br/>「こりや、とんでもないことが<ruby>起<rp>(</rp><rt>おこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つたわい。<ruby>豐<rp>(</rp><rt>とよ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>雄<rp>(</rp><rt>を</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>奴<rp>(</rp><rt>め</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は、<ruby>不<rp>(</rp><rt>ふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>斷<rp>(</rp><rt>だん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>毛<rp>(</rp><rt>け</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>一<rp>(</rp><rt>いつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>本<rp>(</rp><rt>ぽん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も<ruby>盗<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みをせぬ<ruby>奴<rp>(</rp><rt>やつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なのぢやが、<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>因<rp>(</rp><rt>いん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>果<rp>(</rp><rt>ぐわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でかやうな<ruby>惡<rp>(</rp><rt>あく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>心<rp>(</rp><rt>しん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>で</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たのぢやらう。<ruby>若<rp>(</rp><rt>も</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し<ruby>外<rp>(</rp><rt>ほか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>露<rp>(</rp><rt>ろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>顯<rp>(</rp><rt>けん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>したら、この<ruby>家<rp>(</rp><rt>いへ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も<ruby>斷<rp>(</rp><rt>だん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>絕<rp>(</rp><rt>ぜつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にならう。<ruby>御<rp>(</rp><rt>ご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>先<rp>(</rp><rt>せん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>祖<rp>(</rp><rt>ぞ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>様<rp>(</rp><rt>さま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>對<rp>(</rp><rt>たい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し、<ruby>又<rp>(</rp><rt>また</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>後<rp>(</rp><rt>あとの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>裔<rp>(</rp><rt>もの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のためにも、<ruby>不<rp>(</rp><rt>ふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>孝<rp>(</rp><rt>かう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の子<ruby>一人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひとり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>惜<rp>(</rp><rt>を</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しうない。<ruby>明日<rp>(</rp><rt>あす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>早<rp>(</rp><rt>さつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>速<rp>(</rp><rt>そく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>お<ruby>役<rp>(</rp><rt>やく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>所<rp>(</rp><rt>しよ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>へ<ruby>訴<rp>(</rp><rt>うつた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>へ<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>で</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い。」<br/>といふ。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pp=136–137&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1353678/1/75&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:<ruby>蛇<rp>(</rp><rt>じや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>性<rp>(</rp><rt>せい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>婬<rp>(</rp><rt>いん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:雨月物語&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|物語日本文學}}&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Ueda Akinari&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Ueda&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Akinari&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Shida&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Gishū&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Shibundō&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=20 November 1953&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Shinjuku]], Tokyo&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFUeda1953" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2157"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ueda_Akinari" title="Ueda Akinari" id="mwRjE">Ueda, Akinari</a> (20 November 1953).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwRjI"><ruby id="mwRjM">蛇<rp id="mwRjQ">(</rp><rt id="mwRjU">じや</rt><rp id="mwRjY">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRjc">性<rp id="mwRjg">(</rp><rt id="mwRjk">せい</rt><rp id="mwRjo">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwRjs">婬<rp id="mwRjw">(</rp><rt id="mwRj0">いん</rt><rp id="mwRj4">)</rp></ruby></bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1353678/1/75" class="external text" id="mwRj8"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwRkA">雨月物語</bdi></a>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwRkE"><span lang="ja" id="mwRkI">物語日本文學</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwRkM"> (in Japanese). Translated by Shida, Gishū. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shinjuku" title="Shinjuku" id="mwRkQ">Shinjuku</a>, Tokyo: Shibundō. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwRkU">&nbsp;</span><span class="nowrap" id="mwRkY">136–</span>137.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwRkc"><ruby id="mwRkg">父<rp id="mwRkk">(</rp><rt id="mwRko">ちゝ</rt><rp id="mwRks">)</rp></ruby>は<ruby id="mwRkw">眞<rp id="mwRk0">(</rp><rt id="mwRk4">まつ</rt><rp id="mwRk8">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRlA">靑<rp id="mwRlE">(</rp><rt id="mwRlI">さを</rt><rp id="mwRlM">)</rp></ruby>になつて、<br id="mwRlQ">「こりや、とんでもないことが<ruby id="mwRlU">起<rp id="mwRlY">(</rp><rt id="mwRlc">おこ</rt><rp id="mwRlg">)</rp></ruby>つたわい。<ruby id="mwRlk">豐<rp id="mwRlo">(</rp><rt id="mwRls">とよ</rt><rp id="mwRlw">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRl0">雄<rp id="mwRl4">(</rp><rt id="mwRl8">を</rt><rp id="mwRmA">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRmE">奴<rp id="mwRmI">(</rp><rt id="mwRmM">め</rt><rp id="mwRmQ">)</rp></ruby>は、<ruby id="mwRmU">不<rp id="mwRmY">(</rp><rt id="mwRmc">ふ</rt><rp id="mwRmg">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRmk">斷<rp id="mwRmo">(</rp><rt id="mwRms">だん</rt><rp id="mwRmw">)</rp></ruby>は<ruby id="mwRm0">毛<rp id="mwRm4">(</rp><rt id="mwRm8">け</rt><rp id="mwRnA">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRnE">一<rp id="mwRnI">(</rp><rt id="mwRnM">いつ</rt><rp id="mwRnQ">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRnU">本<rp id="mwRnY">(</rp><rt id="mwRnc">ぽん</rt><rp id="mwRng">)</rp></ruby>も<ruby id="mwRnk">盗<rp id="mwRno">(</rp><rt id="mwRns">ぬす</rt><rp id="mwRnw">)</rp></ruby>みをせぬ<ruby id="mwRn0">奴<rp id="mwRn4">(</rp><rt id="mwRn8">やつ</rt><rp id="mwRoA">)</rp></ruby>なのぢやが、<ruby id="mwRoE">何<rp id="mwRoI">(</rp><rt id="mwRoM">なん</rt><rp id="mwRoQ">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwRoU">因<rp id="mwRoY">(</rp><rt id="mwRoc">いん</rt><rp id="mwRog">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRok">果<rp id="mwRoo">(</rp><rt id="mwRos">ぐわ</rt><rp id="mwRow">)</rp></ruby>でかやうな<ruby id="mwRo0">惡<rp id="mwRo4">(</rp><rt id="mwRo8">あく</rt><rp id="mwRpA">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRpE">心<rp id="mwRpI">(</rp><rt id="mwRpM">しん</rt><rp id="mwRpQ">)</rp></ruby>が<ruby id="mwRpU">出<rp id="mwRpY">(</rp><rt id="mwRpc">で</rt><rp id="mwRpg">)</rp></ruby>たのぢやらう。<ruby id="mwRpk">若<rp id="mwRpo">(</rp><rt id="mwRps">も</rt><rp id="mwRpw">)</rp></ruby>し<ruby id="mwRp0">外<rp id="mwRp4">(</rp><rt id="mwRp8">ほか</rt><rp id="mwRqA">)</rp></ruby>から<ruby id="mwRqE">露<rp id="mwRqI">(</rp><rt id="mwRqM">ろ</rt><rp id="mwRqQ">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRqU">顯<rp id="mwRqY">(</rp><rt id="mwRqc">けん</rt><rp id="mwRqg">)</rp></ruby>したら、この<ruby id="mwRqk">家<rp id="mwRqo">(</rp><rt id="mwRqs">いへ</rt><rp id="mwRqw">)</rp></ruby>も<ruby id="mwRq0">斷<rp id="mwRq4">(</rp><rt id="mwRq8">だん</rt><rp id="mwRrA">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRrE">絕<rp id="mwRrI">(</rp><rt id="mwRrM">ぜつ</rt><rp id="mwRrQ">)</rp></ruby>にならう。<ruby id="mwRrU">御<rp id="mwRrY">(</rp><rt id="mwRrc">ご</rt><rp id="mwRrg">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRrk">先<rp id="mwRro">(</rp><rt id="mwRrs">せん</rt><rp id="mwRrw">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRr0">祖<rp id="mwRr4">(</rp><rt id="mwRr8">ぞ</rt><rp id="mwRsA">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRsE">様<rp id="mwRsI">(</rp><rt id="mwRsM">さま</rt><rp id="mwRsQ">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwRsU">對<rp id="mwRsY">(</rp><rt id="mwRsc">たい</rt><rp id="mwRsg">)</rp></ruby>し、<ruby id="mwRsk">又<rp id="mwRso">(</rp><rt id="mwRss">また</rt><rp id="mwRsw">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRs0">後<rp id="mwRs4">(</rp><rt id="mwRs8">あとの</rt><rp id="mwRtA">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRtE">裔<rp id="mwRtI">(</rp><rt id="mwRtM">もの</rt><rp id="mwRtQ">)</rp></ruby>のためにも、<ruby id="mwRtU">不<rp id="mwRtY">(</rp><rt id="mwRtc">ふ</rt><rp id="mwRtg">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRtk">孝<rp id="mwRto">(</rp><rt id="mwRts">かう</rt><rp id="mwRtw">)</rp></ruby>の子<ruby id="mwRt0">一人<rp id="mwRt4">(</rp><rt id="mwRt8">ひとり</rt><rp id="mwRuA">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRuE">惜<rp id="mwRuI">(</rp><rt id="mwRuM">を</rt><rp id="mwRuQ">)</rp></ruby>しうない。<ruby id="mwRuU">明日<rp id="mwRuY">(</rp><rt id="mwRuc">あす</rt><rp id="mwRug">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRuk">早<rp id="mwRuo">(</rp><rt id="mwRus">さつ</rt><rp id="mwRuw">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRu0">速<rp id="mwRu4">(</rp><rt id="mwRu8">そく</rt><rp id="mwRvA">)</rp></ruby>お<ruby id="mwRvE">役<rp id="mwRvI">(</rp><rt id="mwRvM">やく</rt><rp id="mwRvQ">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwRvU">所<rp id="mwRvY">(</rp><rt id="mwRvc">しよ</rt><rp id="mwRvg">)</rp></ruby>へ<ruby id="mwRvk">訴<rp id="mwRvo">(</rp><rt id="mwRvs">うつた</rt><rp id="mwRvw">)</rp></ruby>へ<ruby id="mwRv0">出<rp id="mwRv4">(</rp><rt id="mwRv8">で</rt><rp id="mwRwA">)</rp></ruby>い。」<br id="mwRwE">といふ。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%3Cruby%3E%E8%9B%87%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%98%E3%82%84%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E6%80%A7%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%9B%E3%81%84%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%E3%81%AE%3Cruby%3E%E5%A9%AC%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%84%E3%82%93%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E&amp;rft.btitle=%E9%9B%A8%E6%9C%88%E7%89%A9%E8%AA%9E&amp;rft.place=Shinjuku%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E7%89%A9%E8%AA%9E%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E6%96%87%E5%AD%B8%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=136-137&amp;rft.pub=Shibund%C5%8D&amp;rft.date=1953-11-20&amp;rft.aulast=Ueda&amp;rft.aufirst=Akinari&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1353678%2F1%2F75&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2157" id="mwRwI"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2157" id="mwRwM"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2157" id="mwRwQ"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-368" id="cite_note-368" data-mw-footnote-number="345"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwRwU"><a href="#cite_ref-368" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwRwY"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwRwc">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-368" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2160" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwRwg" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:'''妃'''　（數人の訴狀を一束ねにして）それから、其方たちは、保護職どのゝ<ruby>翼<rp>(</rp><rt>はね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の下で保護して貰ひたがる其方たちは、改めてあの仁へ願ひ出い。‥‥<br/>[…]<br/>'''王'''　前へ出い、グロースターの妻、<ruby>夫人<rp>(</rp><rt>とじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>エリナー・コバム。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote='''Mar.''' And as for you, that love to be protected<br/>Under the wings of our protector’s grace,<br/>Begin your suits anew, and sue to him.<br/>[…]<br/>'''King.''' Stand forth, Dame Eleanor Cobham, Gloucester’s wife:&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pp=28, 68&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1664867/1/20&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Second Part of King Henry VI&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:ヘンリー六世 第二部&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=[[Henry VI, Part 2]]&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|シェークスピヤ全集}}&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Shinjusha&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=William Shakespeare&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=William&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Shakespeare&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-link=Tsubouchi Shōyō&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Tsubouchi&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Shōyō&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=15 July 1958&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Bunkyō]], Tokyo&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="mwRwk" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2160" data-x-id="CITEREFShakespeare1958"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Shakespeare" title="William Shakespeare" id="mwRwo">Shakespeare, William</a> (15 July 1958). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1664867/1/20" class="external text" id="mwRws"><i id="mwRww">Second Part of King Henry VI</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwRw0">ヘンリー六世 第二部</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwRw4">[</span><i id="mwRw8"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Henry_VI,_Part_2" title="Henry VI, Part 2" id="mwRxA">Henry VI, Part 2</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwRxE">]</span>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwRxI"><span lang="ja" id="mwRxM">シェークスピヤ全集</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwRxQ"> (in Japanese). Translated by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tsubouchi_Shōyō" title="Tsubouchi Shōyō" id="mwRxU">Tsubouchi, Shōyō</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bunkyō" title="Bunkyō" id="mwRxY">Bunkyō</a>, Tokyo: Shinjusha. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwRxc">&nbsp;</span>28, 68. <q id="mwRxg"><b id="mwRxk">Mar.</b> And as for you, that love to be protected<br id="mwRxo">Under the wings of our protector's grace,<br id="mwRxs">Begin your suits anew, and sue to him.<br id="mwRxw">[…]<br id="mwRx0"><b id="mwRx4">King.</b> Stand forth, Dame Eleanor Cobham, Gloucester's wife:</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwRx8"><b id="mwRyA">妃</b>　（數人の訴狀を一束ねにして）それから、其方たちは、保護職どのゝ<ruby id="mwRyE">翼<rp id="mwRyI">(</rp><rt id="mwRyM">はね</rt><rp id="mwRyQ">)</rp></ruby>の下で保護して貰ひたがる其方たちは、改めてあの仁へ願ひ出い。‥‥<br id="mwRyU">[…]<br id="mwRyY"><b id="mwRyc">王</b>　前へ出い、グロースターの妻、<ruby id="mwRyg">夫人<rp id="mwRyk">(</rp><rt id="mwRyo">とじ</rt><rp id="mwRys">)</rp></ruby>エリナー・コバム。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=Second+Part+of+King+Henry+VI+%E3%83%98%E3%83%B3%E3%83%AA%E3%83%BC%E5%85%AD%E4%B8%96+%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E9%83%A8&amp;rft.place=Bunky%C5%8D%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E3%82%B7%E3%82%A7%E3%83%BC%E3%82%AF%E3%82%B9%E3%83%94%E3%83%A4%E5%85%A8%E9%9B%86%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=28%2C+68&amp;rft.pub=Shinjusha&amp;rft.date=1958-07-15&amp;rft.aulast=Shakespeare&amp;rft.aufirst=William&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1664867%2F1%2F20&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2160" id="mwRyw"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2160" id="mwRy0"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2160" id="mwRy4"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-oshikawa-1913-369" id="cite_note-oshikawa-1913-369" data-mw-footnote-number="346"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwRy8"><a href="#cite_ref-oshikawa-1913_369-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwRzA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwRzE">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-oshikawa-1913-369" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2169" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwRzI" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/13592458/1/75&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:ホシナ大探偵&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pp=16, 27, 93, 126, 128&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Shunrō&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Oshikawa&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Shunrō Oshikawa&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Hongō Shoin&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=29 April 1913&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:『<ruby>君<rp>(</rp><rt>きみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>云<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ふ<ruby>紳<rp>(</rp><rt>しん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>士<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>志<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>賀<rp>(</rp><rt>が</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>氏<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>左<rp>(</rp><rt>ひだり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>耳<rp>(</rp><rt>みみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>ど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うか<ruby>爲<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つて<ruby>居<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>や<ruby>仕<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ないか、<ruby>至<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>急<rp>(</rp><rt>きふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>夫<rp>(</rp><rt>それ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>調<rp>(</rp><rt>しら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べて<ruby>吳<rp>(</rp><rt>く</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れ』[…]<ruby>渡<rp>(</rp><rt>わたな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>邊<rp>(</rp><rt>べ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>君<rp>(</rp><rt>くん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、しつかり<ruby>遣<rp>(</rp><rt>や</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つて<ruby>吳<rp>(</rp><rt>く</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れよ、<ruby>僕<rp>(</rp><rt>ぼく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>等<rp>(</rp><rt>ら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>是<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れから<ruby>驚<rp>(</rp><rt>おどろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>く<ruby>可<rp>(</rp><rt>べ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>機<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>敏<rp>(</rp><rt>びん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>な<ruby>危<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>險<rp>(</rp><rt>けん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>な<ruby>怪<rp>(</rp><rt>くわい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>物<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>相<rp>(</rp><rt>あひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>手<rp>(</rp><rt>て</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>としなければならぬのだよ。[…]『<ruby>白<rp>(</rp><rt>しろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>よ<ruby>前<rp>(</rp><rt>ぜん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>途<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はまだ<ruby>遠<rp>(</rp><rt>とほ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い、しつかりして<ruby>吳<rp>(</rp><rt>く</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れよ』[…]『<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んだい、<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んか<ruby>用<rp>(</rp><rt>よう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>事<rp>(</rp><rt>じ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かい、<ruby>用<rp>(</rp><rt>よう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>事<rp>(</rp><rt>じ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なら<ruby>此<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>所<rp>(</rp><rt>ゝ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して<ruby>吳<rp>(</rp><rt>く</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れ』[…]<ruby>旣<rp>(</rp><rt>すで</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>覺<rp>(</rp><rt>かく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>悟<rp>(</rp><rt>ご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>定<rp>(</rp><rt>きま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つて<ruby>居<rp>(</rp><rt>ゐ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>るであらう、<ruby>立<rp>(</rp><rt>りつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>派<rp>(</rp><rt>ぱ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>犧牲<rp>(</rp><rt>いけに𛀁</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>となつて<ruby>吳<rp>(</rp><rt>く</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れろ。&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFOshikawa1913" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2169"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shunrō_Oshikawa" title="Shunrō Oshikawa" id="mwRzM">Oshikawa, Shunrō</a> (29 April 1913). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/13592458/1/75" class="external text" id="mwRzQ"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwRzU">ホシナ大探偵</bdi></a> (in Japanese). Hongō Shoin. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwRzY">&nbsp;</span>16, 27, 93, 126, 128.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwRzc">『<ruby id="mwRzg">君<rp id="mwRzk">(</rp><rt id="mwRzo">きみ</rt><rp id="mwRzs">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwRzw">云<rp id="mwRz0">(</rp><rt id="mwRz4">い</rt><rp id="mwRz8">)</rp></ruby>ふ<ruby id="mwR0A">紳<rp id="mwR0E">(</rp><rt id="mwR0I">しん</rt><rp id="mwR0M">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwR0Q">士<rp id="mwR0U">(</rp><rt id="mwR0Y">し</rt><rp id="mwR0c">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwR0g">志<rp id="mwR0k">(</rp><rt id="mwR0o">し</rt><rp id="mwR0s">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwR0w">賀<rp id="mwR00">(</rp><rt id="mwR04">が</rt><rp id="mwR08">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwR1A">氏<rp id="mwR1E">(</rp><rt id="mwR1I">し</rt><rp id="mwR1M">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwR1Q">左<rp id="mwR1U">(</rp><rt id="mwR1Y">ひだり</rt><rp id="mwR1c">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwR1g">耳<rp id="mwR1k">(</rp><rt id="mwR1o">みみ</rt><rp id="mwR1s">)</rp></ruby>が<ruby id="mwR1w">何<rp id="mwR10">(</rp><rt id="mwR14">ど</rt><rp id="mwR18">)</rp></ruby>うか<ruby id="mwR2A">爲<rp id="mwR2E">(</rp><rt id="mwR2I">な</rt><rp id="mwR2M">)</rp></ruby>つて<ruby id="mwR2Q">居<rp id="mwR2U">(</rp><rt id="mwR2Y">い</rt><rp id="mwR2c">)</rp></ruby>や<ruby id="mwR2g">仕<rp id="mwR2k">(</rp><rt id="mwR2o">し</rt><rp id="mwR2s">)</rp></ruby>ないか、<ruby id="mwR2w">至<rp id="mwR20">(</rp><rt id="mwR24">し</rt><rp id="mwR28">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwR3A">急<rp id="mwR3E">(</rp><rt id="mwR3I">きふ</rt><rp id="mwR3M">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwR3Q">夫<rp id="mwR3U">(</rp><rt id="mwR3Y">それ</rt><rp id="mwR3c">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwR3g">調<rp id="mwR3k">(</rp><rt id="mwR3o">しら</rt><rp id="mwR3s">)</rp></ruby>べて<ruby id="mwR3w">吳<rp id="mwR30">(</rp><rt id="mwR34">く</rt><rp id="mwR38">)</rp></ruby>れ』[…]<ruby id="mwR4A">渡<rp id="mwR4E">(</rp><rt id="mwR4I">わたな</rt><rp id="mwR4M">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwR4Q">邊<rp id="mwR4U">(</rp><rt id="mwR4Y">べ</rt><rp id="mwR4c">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwR4g">君<rp id="mwR4k">(</rp><rt id="mwR4o">くん</rt><rp id="mwR4s">)</rp></ruby>、しつかり<ruby id="mwR4w">遣<rp id="mwR40">(</rp><rt id="mwR44">や</rt><rp id="mwR48">)</rp></ruby>つて<ruby id="mwR5A">吳<rp id="mwR5E">(</rp><rt id="mwR5I">く</rt><rp id="mwR5M">)</rp></ruby>れよ、<ruby id="mwR5Q">僕<rp id="mwR5U">(</rp><rt id="mwR5Y">ぼく</rt><rp id="mwR5c">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwR5g">等<rp id="mwR5k">(</rp><rt id="mwR5o">ら</rt><rp id="mwR5s">)</rp></ruby>は<ruby id="mwR5w">是<rp id="mwR50">(</rp><rt id="mwR54">こ</rt><rp id="mwR58">)</rp></ruby>れから<ruby id="mwR6A">驚<rp id="mwR6E">(</rp><rt id="mwR6I">おどろ</rt><rp id="mwR6M">)</rp></ruby>く<ruby id="mwR6Q">可<rp id="mwR6U">(</rp><rt id="mwR6Y">べ</rt><rp id="mwR6c">)</rp></ruby>き<ruby id="mwR6g">機<rp id="mwR6k">(</rp><rt id="mwR6o">き</rt><rp id="mwR6s">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwR6w">敏<rp id="mwR60">(</rp><rt id="mwR64">びん</rt><rp id="mwR68">)</rp></ruby>な<ruby id="mwR7A">危<rp id="mwR7E">(</rp><rt id="mwR7I">き</rt><rp id="mwR7M">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwR7Q">險<rp id="mwR7U">(</rp><rt id="mwR7Y">けん</rt><rp id="mwR7c">)</rp></ruby>な<ruby id="mwR7g">怪<rp id="mwR7k">(</rp><rt id="mwR7o">くわい</rt><rp id="mwR7s">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwR7w">物<rp id="mwR70">(</rp><rt id="mwR74">ぶつ</rt><rp id="mwR78">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwR8A">相<rp id="mwR8E">(</rp><rt id="mwR8I">あひ</rt><rp id="mwR8M">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwR8Q">手<rp id="mwR8U">(</rp><rt id="mwR8Y">て</rt><rp id="mwR8c">)</rp></ruby>としなければならぬのだよ。[…]『<ruby id="mwR8g">白<rp id="mwR8k">(</rp><rt id="mwR8o">しろ</rt><rp id="mwR8s">)</rp></ruby>よ<ruby id="mwR8w">前<rp id="mwR80">(</rp><rt id="mwR84">ぜん</rt><rp id="mwR88">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwR9A">途<rp id="mwR9E">(</rp><rt id="mwR9I">と</rt><rp id="mwR9M">)</rp></ruby>はまだ<ruby id="mwR9Q">遠<rp id="mwR9U">(</rp><rt id="mwR9Y">とほ</rt><rp id="mwR9c">)</rp></ruby>い、しつかりして<ruby id="mwR9g">吳<rp id="mwR9k">(</rp><rt id="mwR9o">く</rt><rp id="mwR9s">)</rp></ruby>れよ』[…]『<ruby id="mwR9w">何<rp id="mwR90">(</rp><rt id="mwR94">な</rt><rp id="mwR98">)</rp></ruby>んだい、<ruby id="mwR-A">何<rp id="mwR-E">(</rp><rt id="mwR-I">な</rt><rp id="mwR-M">)</rp></ruby>んか<ruby id="mwR-Q">用<rp id="mwR-U">(</rp><rt id="mwR-Y">よう</rt><rp id="mwR-c">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwR-g">事<rp id="mwR-k">(</rp><rt id="mwR-o">じ</rt><rp id="mwR-s">)</rp></ruby>かい、<ruby id="mwR-w">用<rp id="mwR-0">(</rp><rt id="mwR-4">よう</rt><rp id="mwR-8">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwR_A">事<rp id="mwR_E">(</rp><rt id="mwR_I">じ</rt><rp id="mwR_M">)</rp></ruby>なら<ruby id="mwR_Q">此<rp id="mwR_U">(</rp><rt id="mwR_Y">こ</rt><rp id="mwR_c">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwR_g">所<rp id="mwR_k">(</rp><rt id="mwR_o">ゝ</rt><rp id="mwR_s">)</rp></ruby>で<ruby id="mwR_w">話<rp id="mwR_0">(</rp><rt id="mwR_4">はな</rt><rp id="mwR_8">)</rp></ruby>して<ruby id="mwSAA">吳<rp id="mwSAE">(</rp><rt id="mwSAI">く</rt><rp id="mwSAM">)</rp></ruby>れ』[…]<ruby id="mwSAQ">旣<rp id="mwSAU">(</rp><rt id="mwSAY">すで</rt><rp id="mwSAc">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwSAg">覺<rp id="mwSAk">(</rp><rt id="mwSAo">かく</rt><rp id="mwSAs">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSAw">悟<rp id="mwSA0">(</rp><rt id="mwSA4">ご</rt><rp id="mwSA8">)</rp></ruby>は<ruby id="mwSBA">定<rp id="mwSBE">(</rp><rt id="mwSBI">きま</rt><rp id="mwSBM">)</rp></ruby>つて<ruby id="mwSBQ">居<rp id="mwSBU">(</rp><rt id="mwSBY">ゐ</rt><rp id="mwSBc">)</rp></ruby>るであらう、<ruby id="mwSBg">立<rp id="mwSBk">(</rp><rt id="mwSBo">りつ</rt><rp id="mwSBs">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSBw">派<rp id="mwSB0">(</rp><rt id="mwSB4">ぱ</rt><rp id="mwSB8">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwSCA">犧牲<rp id="mwSCE">(</rp><rt id="mwSCI">いけに𛀁</rt><rp id="mwSCM">)</rp></ruby>となつて<ruby id="mwSCQ">吳<rp id="mwSCU">(</rp><rt id="mwSCY">く</rt><rp id="mwSCc">)</rp></ruby>れろ。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=%E3%83%9B%E3%82%B7%E3%83%8A%E5%A4%A7%E6%8E%A2%E5%81%B5&amp;rft.pages=16%2C+27%2C+93%2C+126%2C+128&amp;rft.pub=Hong%C5%8D+Shoin&amp;rft.date=1913-04-29&amp;rft.aulast=Oshikawa&amp;rft.aufirst=Shunr%C5%8D&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F13592458%2F1%2F75&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2169" id="mwSCg"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2169" id="mwSCk"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2169" id="mwSCo"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-370" id="cite_note-370" data-mw-footnote-number="347"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwSCs"><a href="#cite_ref-370" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwSCw"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwSC0">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-370" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2172" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwSC4" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「一遍お前の身内の人に会わしてくれろ」と、何度もそう云ったのですけれど、[…]そしてぜひとも熊谷と切れてくれろと云ったんです。[…]もう少し時期を待ってくれろと、何度も何度も僕に堅い約束をしました。[…]<ruby>明後日<rp>(</rp><rt>あさつて</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>大森へ来てくれろって云ったんですが、[…]「あたしは決して詫まりになんか行くもんか。誰か荷物を取って来てくれろ」と、ナオミはどこまでも強気に出る。[…]熊谷の義理があるもんだから、出てくれろとも云うわけに行かず、&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pp=14, 134–136, 156, 174&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.aozora.gr.jp/cards/001383/files/58093_62049.html&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:痴人の愛 卍&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Rokkō Shuppan&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Jun'ichirō Tanizaki&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Jun'ichirō&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Tanizaki&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|谷崎潤一郎文庫}}&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=7&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=15 June 1973&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Bunkyō]], Tokyo&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;orig-date=July 1925&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFTanizaki1973" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2172"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jun'ichirō_Tanizaki" title="Jun'ichirō Tanizaki" id="mwSC8">Tanizaki, Jun'ichirō</a> (15 June 1973) [July 1925]. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.aozora.gr.jp/cards/001383/files/58093_62049.html" class="external text" id="mwSDA"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwSDE">痴人の愛 卍</bdi></a>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwSDI"><span lang="ja" id="mwSDM">谷崎潤一郎文庫</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwSDQ"> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSDU">&nbsp;</span>7. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bunkyō" title="Bunkyō" id="mwSDY">Bunkyō</a>, Tokyo: Rokkō Shuppan. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSDc">&nbsp;</span>14, <span class="nowrap" id="mwSDg">134–</span>136, 156, 174.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSDk">「一遍お前の身内の人に会わしてくれろ」と、何度もそう云ったのですけれど、[…]そしてぜひとも熊谷と切れてくれろと云ったんです。[…]もう少し時期を待ってくれろと、何度も何度も僕に堅い約束をしました。[…]<ruby id="mwSDo">明後日<rp id="mwSDs">(</rp><rt id="mwSDw">あさつて</rt><rp id="mwSD0">)</rp></ruby>大森へ来てくれろって云ったんですが、[…]「あたしは決して詫まりになんか行くもんか。誰か荷物を取って来てくれろ」と、ナオミはどこまでも強気に出る。[…]熊谷の義理があるもんだから、出てくれろとも云うわけに行かず、</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=%E7%97%B4%E4%BA%BA%E3%81%AE%E6%84%9B+%E5%8D%8D&amp;rft.place=Bunky%C5%8D%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E8%B0%B7%E5%B4%8E%E6%BD%A4%E4%B8%80%E9%83%8E%E6%96%87%E5%BA%AB%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=14%2C+134-136%2C+156%2C+174&amp;rft.pub=Rokk%C5%8D+Shuppan&amp;rft.date=1973-06-15&amp;rft.aulast=Tanizaki&amp;rft.aufirst=Jun%27ichir%C5%8D&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.aozora.gr.jp%2Fcards%2F001383%2Ffiles%2F58093_62049.html&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2172" id="mwSD4"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2172" id="mwSD8"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2172" id="mwSEA"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-natsume-1936-371" id="cite_note-natsume-1936-371" data-mw-footnote-number="348"><span rel="mw:referencedBy" class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwSEE"><a href="#cite_ref-natsume-1936_371-0" id="mwSEI"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwSEM">1</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-natsume-1936_371-1" id="mwSEQ"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwSEU">2</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-natsume-1936-371" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2175" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwSEY" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「おい<ruby>是<rp>(</rp><rt>これ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>一寸<rp>(</rp><rt>ちよつと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>其<rp>(</rp><rt>そ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>所<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>へ<ruby>置<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いて<ruby>吳<rp>(</rp><rt>く</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れ」[…]<ruby>是<rp>(</rp><rt>これ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>からは<ruby>後<rp>(</rp><rt>ご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>生<rp>(</rp><rt>しやう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だから<ruby>叔<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>母<rp>(</rp><rt>ば</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さんに<ruby>免<rp>(</rp><rt>めん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じて、あぶない<ruby>惡<rp>(</rp><rt>わる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>承<rp>(</rp><rt>ふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>山<rp>(</rp><rt>ざ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>戲<rp>(</rp><rt>け</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>止<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して<ruby>御<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>吳<rp>(</rp><rt>く</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れよ[…]<ruby>母<rp>(</rp><rt>はゝ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>千<rp>(</rp><rt>ち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>代<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>生<rp>(</rp><rt>うま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れた<ruby>時<rp>(</rp><rt>とき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>吳<rp>(</rp><rt>く</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れろと<ruby>賴<rp>(</rp><rt>たの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んで<ruby>置<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いたのだから<ruby>貰<rp>(</rp><rt>もら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つたら<ruby>可<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いだらうと<ruby>云<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つて<ruby>僕<rp>(</rp><rt>ぼく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>驚<rp>(</rp><rt>おど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ろかした。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pp=109, 553, 637&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1883236/1/285&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:門 彼岸過迄&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|漱石全集}}&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=6&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=10 August 1936&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Natsume&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Sōseki&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Natsume Sōseki&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|漱石全集刊行會}}&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Kanda, Tokyo]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFNatsume1936" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2175"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Natsume_Sōseki" title="Natsume Sōseki" id="mwSEc">Natsume, Sōseki</a> (10 August 1936). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1883236/1/285" class="external text" id="mwSEg"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwSEk">門 彼岸過迄</bdi></a>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwSEo"><span lang="ja" id="mwSEs">漱石全集</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwSEw"> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSE0">&nbsp;</span>6. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kanda,_Tokyo" title="Kanda, Tokyo" id="mwSE4">Kanda, Tokyo</a>: <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwSE8"><span lang="ja" id="mwSFA">漱石全集刊行會</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwSFE">. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSFI">&nbsp;</span>109, 553, 637.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSFM">「おい<ruby id="mwSFQ">是<rp id="mwSFU">(</rp><rt id="mwSFY">これ</rt><rp id="mwSFc">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwSFg">一寸<rp id="mwSFk">(</rp><rt id="mwSFo">ちよつと</rt><rp id="mwSFs">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSFw">其<rp id="mwSF0">(</rp><rt id="mwSF4">そ</rt><rp id="mwSF8">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSGA">所<rp id="mwSGE">(</rp><rt id="mwSGI">こ</rt><rp id="mwSGM">)</rp></ruby>へ<ruby id="mwSGQ">置<rp id="mwSGU">(</rp><rt id="mwSGY">お</rt><rp id="mwSGc">)</rp></ruby>いて<ruby id="mwSGg">吳<rp id="mwSGk">(</rp><rt id="mwSGo">く</rt><rp id="mwSGs">)</rp></ruby>れ」[…]<ruby id="mwSGw">是<rp id="mwSG0">(</rp><rt id="mwSG4">これ</rt><rp id="mwSG8">)</rp></ruby>からは<ruby id="mwSHA">後<rp id="mwSHE">(</rp><rt id="mwSHI">ご</rt><rp id="mwSHM">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSHQ">生<rp id="mwSHU">(</rp><rt id="mwSHY">しやう</rt><rp id="mwSHc">)</rp></ruby>だから<ruby id="mwSHg">叔<rp id="mwSHk">(</rp><rt id="mwSHo">お</rt><rp id="mwSHs">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSHw">母<rp id="mwSH0">(</rp><rt id="mwSH4">ば</rt><rp id="mwSH8">)</rp></ruby>さんに<ruby id="mwSIA">免<rp id="mwSIE">(</rp><rt id="mwSII">めん</rt><rp id="mwSIM">)</rp></ruby>じて、あぶない<ruby id="mwSIQ">惡<rp id="mwSIU">(</rp><rt id="mwSIY">わる</rt><rp id="mwSIc">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSIg">承<rp id="mwSIk">(</rp><rt id="mwSIo">ふ</rt><rp id="mwSIs">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSIw">山<rp id="mwSI0">(</rp><rt id="mwSI4">ざ</rt><rp id="mwSI8">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSJA">戲<rp id="mwSJE">(</rp><rt id="mwSJI">け</rt><rp id="mwSJM">)</rp></ruby>は<ruby id="mwSJQ">止<rp id="mwSJU">(</rp><rt id="mwSJY">よ</rt><rp id="mwSJc">)</rp></ruby>して<ruby id="mwSJg">御<rp id="mwSJk">(</rp><rt id="mwSJo">お</rt><rp id="mwSJs">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSJw">吳<rp id="mwSJ0">(</rp><rt id="mwSJ4">く</rt><rp id="mwSJ8">)</rp></ruby>れよ[…]<ruby id="mwSKA">母<rp id="mwSKE">(</rp><rt id="mwSKI">はゝ</rt><rp id="mwSKM">)</rp></ruby>は<ruby id="mwSKQ">千<rp id="mwSKU">(</rp><rt id="mwSKY">ち</rt><rp id="mwSKc">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSKg">代<rp id="mwSKk">(</rp><rt id="mwSKo">よ</rt><rp id="mwSKs">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSKw">子<rp id="mwSK0">(</rp><rt id="mwSK4">こ</rt><rp id="mwSK8">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwSLA">生<rp id="mwSLE">(</rp><rt id="mwSLI">うま</rt><rp id="mwSLM">)</rp></ruby>れた<ruby id="mwSLQ">時<rp id="mwSLU">(</rp><rt id="mwSLY">とき</rt><rp id="mwSLc">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSLg">吳<rp id="mwSLk">(</rp><rt id="mwSLo">く</rt><rp id="mwSLs">)</rp></ruby>れろと<ruby id="mwSLw">賴<rp id="mwSL0">(</rp><rt id="mwSL4">たの</rt><rp id="mwSL8">)</rp></ruby>んで<ruby id="mwSMA">置<rp id="mwSME">(</rp><rt id="mwSMI">お</rt><rp id="mwSMM">)</rp></ruby>いたのだから<ruby id="mwSMQ">貰<rp id="mwSMU">(</rp><rt id="mwSMY">もら</rt><rp id="mwSMc">)</rp></ruby>つたら<ruby id="mwSMg">可<rp id="mwSMk">(</rp><rt id="mwSMo">い</rt><rp id="mwSMs">)</rp></ruby>いだらうと<ruby id="mwSMw">云<rp id="mwSM0">(</rp><rt id="mwSM4">い</rt><rp id="mwSM8">)</rp></ruby>つて<ruby id="mwSNA">僕<rp id="mwSNE">(</rp><rt id="mwSNI">ぼく</rt><rp id="mwSNM">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwSNQ">驚<rp id="mwSNU">(</rp><rt id="mwSNY">おど</rt><rp id="mwSNc">)</rp></ruby>ろかした。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=%E9%96%80+%E5%BD%BC%E5%B2%B8%E9%81%8E%E8%BF%84&amp;rft.place=Kanda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E6%BC%B1%E7%9F%B3%E5%85%A8%E9%9B%86%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=109%2C+553%2C+637&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E6%BC%B1%E7%9F%B3%E5%85%A8%E9%9B%86%E5%88%8A%E8%A1%8C%E6%9C%83%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.date=1936-08-10&amp;rft.aulast=Natsume&amp;rft.aufirst=S%C5%8Dseki&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1883236%2F1%2F285&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2175" id="mwSNg"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2175" id="mwSNk"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2175" id="mwSNo"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-372" id="cite_note-372" data-mw-footnote-number="349"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwSNs"><a href="#cite_ref-372" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwSNw"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwSN0">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-372" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2178" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwSN4" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:しかし彼は自分の忠僕に氣がついたらしく、微かに瞼をあげると、その眼を輝やかして、「さらばぢや、ステツィコ！　カテリーナに坊やを見棄てるなと言つて吳れい！　お前たち、忠義な家來たちも彼を見棄てないで吳れ！」さう言ひ終つて、彼は口を噤んだ。哥薩克がその由緖正しい五體から飛び去り、唇は蒼ざめて、彼は永遠の眠りについたのである。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=Но, видно, почуял верного слугу своего. Тихо приподнял веки, блеснул очами: «Прощай, Стецько! скажи Катерине, чтобы не покидала сына! Не покидайте и вы его, мои верные слуги!» — и затих. Вылетела козацкая душа из дворянского тела; посинели уста. Спит козак непробудно.&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote=But seemingly sensing his own faithful servant, he faintly raised his eyelids, and his eyes gleamed, “Farewell Stetsko! Tell Katerina not to forsake her son! And you, my faithful retainers, do not forsake him either!” and with that he fell silent. The Cossack’s soul flew off his noble body, his lips turned blue, and he passed into an eternal slumber.&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1705582/1/78&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;p=149&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:怖ろしき復讐&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=Страшная месть&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-chapter=[[A Terrible Vengeance]]&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=10 October 1948&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Kasumigaseki Shobō&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Nakano, Tokyo]]&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Hajime&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Hirai&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:ディカーニカ近鄕夜話&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=[[Evenings on a Farm Near Dikanka]]&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Вечера на хуторе близ Диканьки&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=2&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Nikolai Gogol&quot;},&quot;21&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Nikolai Vasilyevich&quot;},&quot;22&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Gogol&quot;},&quot;23&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|ゴーゴリ全集}}&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="mwSN8" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2178" data-x-id="CITEREFGogol1948"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nikolai_Gogol" title="Nikolai Gogol" id="mwSOA">Gogol, Nikolai Vasilyevich</a> (10 October 1948). "Страшная месть" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSOE">怖ろしき復讐</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSOI">[</span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Terrible_Vengeance" title="A Terrible Vengeance" id="mwSOM">A Terrible Vengeance</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSOQ">]</span>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1705582/1/78" class="external text" id="mwSOU"><i id="mwSOY">Вечера на хуторе близ Диканьки</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSOc">ディカーニカ近鄕夜話</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSOg">[</span><i id="mwSOk"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Evenings_on_a_Farm_Near_Dikanka" title="Evenings on a Farm Near Dikanka" id="mwSOo">Evenings on a Farm Near Dikanka</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSOs">]</span>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwSOw"><span lang="ja" id="mwSO0">ゴーゴリ全集</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwSO4"> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSO8">&nbsp;</span>2. Translated by Hirai, Hajime. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nakano,_Tokyo" title="Nakano, Tokyo" id="mwSPA">Nakano, Tokyo</a>: Kasumigaseki Shobō. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSPE">&nbsp;</span>149. <q id="mwSPI">Но, видно, почуял верного слугу своего. Тихо приподнял веки, блеснул очами: «Прощай, Стецько! скажи Катерине, чтобы не покидала сына! Не покидайте и вы его, мои верные слуги!» — и затих. Вылетела козацкая душа из дворянского тела; посинели уста. Спит козак непробудно.</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSPM">しかし彼は自分の忠僕に氣がついたらしく、微かに瞼をあげると、その眼を輝やかして、「さらばぢや、ステツィコ！　カテリーナに坊やを見棄てるなと言つて吳れい！　お前たち、忠義な家來たちも彼を見棄てないで吳れ！」さう言ひ終つて、彼は口を噤んだ。哥薩克がその由緖正しい五體から飛び去り、唇は蒼ざめて、彼は永遠の眠りについたのである。</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSPQ">[</span>But seemingly sensing his own faithful servant, he faintly raised his eyelids, and his eyes gleamed, “Farewell Stetsko! Tell Katerina not to forsake her son! And you, my faithful retainers, do not forsake him either!” and with that he fell silent. The Cossack’s soul flew off his noble body, his lips turned blue, and he passed into an eternal slumber.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSPU">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%D0%A1%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B0%D1%88%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%8F+%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D1%8C+%E6%80%96%E3%82%8D%E3%81%97%E3%81%8D%E5%BE%A9%E8%AE%90&amp;rft.btitle=%D0%92%D0%B5%D1%87%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B0+%D0%BD%D0%B0+%D1%85%D1%83%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B5+%D0%B1%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%B7+%D0%94%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%B0%D0%BD%D1%8C%D0%BA%D0%B8+%E3%83%87%E3%82%A3%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%8B%E3%82%AB%E8%BF%91%E9%84%95%E5%A4%9C%E8%A9%B1&amp;rft.place=Nakano%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E3%82%B4%E3%83%BC%E3%82%B4%E3%83%AA%E5%85%A8%E9%9B%86%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=149&amp;rft.pub=Kasumigaseki+Shob%C5%8D&amp;rft.date=1948-10-10&amp;rft.aulast=Gogol&amp;rft.aufirst=Nikolai+Vasilyevich&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1705582%2F1%2F78&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2178" id="mwSPY"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2178" id="mwSPc"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2178" id="mwSPg"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-373" id="cite_note-373" data-mw-footnote-number="350"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwSPk"><a href="#cite_ref-373" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwSPo"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwSPs">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-373" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2181" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwSPw" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:'''ロミオ'''　おゝ！　敎へてくれい、どうしたら忘れられるか？&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote='''Rom.''' O, teach me how I should forget to think.&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1664849/1/15&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;p=19&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:第一場　ヹローナ。街上。&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=Scene 1. Verona. A public place.&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Romeo and Juliet&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:ロミオとヂュリエット&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|シェークスピヤ全集}}&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Shinjusha&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=William Shakespeare&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=William&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Shakespeare&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-link=Tsubouchi Shōyō&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Tsubouchi&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Shōyō&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=15 July 1957&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Bunkyō]], Tokyo&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="mwSP0" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2181" data-x-id="CITEREFShakespeare1957"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Shakespeare" title="William Shakespeare" id="mwSP4">Shakespeare, William</a> (15 July 1957). "Scene 1. Verona. A public place." <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSP8">第一場　ヹローナ。街上。</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1664849/1/15" class="external text" id="mwSQA"><i id="mwSQE">Romeo and Juliet</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSQI">ロミオとヂュリエット</bdi></a>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwSQM"><span lang="ja" id="mwSQQ">シェークスピヤ全集</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwSQU"> (in Japanese). Translated by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tsubouchi_Shōyō" title="Tsubouchi Shōyō" id="mwSQY">Tsubouchi, Shōyō</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bunkyō" title="Bunkyō" id="mwSQc">Bunkyō</a>, Tokyo: Shinjusha. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSQg">&nbsp;</span>19. <q id="mwSQk"><b id="mwSQo">Rom.</b> O, teach me how I should forget to think.</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSQs"><b id="mwSQw">ロミオ</b>　おゝ！　敎へてくれい、どうしたら忘れられるか？</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=Scene+1.+Verona.+A+public+place.+%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%A0%B4%E3%80%80%E3%83%B9%E3%83%AD%E3%83%BC%E3%83%8A%E3%80%82%E8%A1%97%E4%B8%8A%E3%80%82&amp;rft.btitle=Romeo+and+Juliet+%E3%83%AD%E3%83%9F%E3%82%AA%E3%81%A8%E3%83%82%E3%83%A5%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A8%E3%83%83%E3%83%88&amp;rft.place=Bunky%C5%8D%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E3%82%B7%E3%82%A7%E3%83%BC%E3%82%AF%E3%82%B9%E3%83%94%E3%83%A4%E5%85%A8%E9%9B%86%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=19&amp;rft.pub=Shinjusha&amp;rft.date=1957-07-15&amp;rft.aulast=Shakespeare&amp;rft.aufirst=William&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1664849%2F1%2F15&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2181" id="mwSQ0"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2181" id="mwSQ4"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2181" id="mwSQ8"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-374" id="cite_note-374" data-mw-footnote-number="351"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwSRA"><a href="#cite_ref-374" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwSRE"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwSRI">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-374" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2184" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwSRM" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:私、もう帰るから、自動車賃くれろ。[…]……あんたも、もう帰つてくれろ。[…]帰つてくれろ？[…]あんたあお先い帰つてくれろ。[…]そして抵当なしでドンドン金貸してくれ。[…]なあ君、君は紙芝居であるけれどもが、君が辺見甚次君だろ、アハハハそんねな事、どうでもええわい、さ、ハーモニカ吹いちくれ！[…]見てやつちくれ。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.aozora.gr.jp/cards/001311/files/49829_38817.html&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:妻恋行&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:三好十郎の仕事&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=1&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Miyoshi&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Jūrō&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=1 July 1968&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFMiyoshi1968" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2184">Miyoshi, Jūrō (1 July 1968).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSRQ">妻恋行</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.aozora.gr.jp/cards/001311/files/49829_38817.html" class="external text" id="mwSRU"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwSRY">三好十郎の仕事</bdi></a> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSRc">&nbsp;</span>1.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSRg">私、もう帰るから、自動車賃くれろ。[…]……あんたも、もう帰つてくれろ。[…]帰つてくれろ？[…]あんたあお先い帰つてくれろ。[…]そして抵当なしでドンドン金貸してくれ。[…]なあ君、君は紙芝居であるけれどもが、君が辺見甚次君だろ、アハハハそんねな事、どうでもええわい、さ、ハーモニカ吹いちくれ！[…]見てやつちくれ。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E5%A6%BB%E6%81%8B%E8%A1%8C&amp;rft.btitle=%E4%B8%89%E5%A5%BD%E5%8D%81%E9%83%8E%E3%81%AE%E4%BB%95%E4%BA%8B&amp;rft.date=1968-07-01&amp;rft.aulast=Miyoshi&amp;rft.aufirst=J%C5%ABr%C5%8D&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.aozora.gr.jp%2Fcards%2F001311%2Ffiles%2F49829_38817.html&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2184" id="mwSRk"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2184" id="mwSRo"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2184" id="mwSRs"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-375" id="cite_note-375" data-mw-footnote-number="352"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwSRw"><a href="#cite_ref-375" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwSR0"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwSR4">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-375" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2187" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwSR8" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:十一月になって、貞之助は仕事のことで二三日東京へ行く用ができたので、始めて<ruby>渋<rp>(</rp><rt>しぶ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>谷<rp>(</rp><rt>や</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の本家を訪ねたが、子供たちはもうすっかり新しい生活に<ruby>馴<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れ、東京弁も<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>じよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>手<rp>(</rp><rt>ず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>になり、家庭と学校とで言葉の使い分けをするほどになっていて、辰雄夫婦も雪子も<ruby>機<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>嫌<rp>(</rp><rt>げん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をよくしてい、狭い所で窮屈だけれどもぜひ泊まって行ってくれろと、皆がすゝめるのであった。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;p=205&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:二十四&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:細雪&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=[[The Makioka Sisters|Light Snow]]&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=1&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=20 June 1970&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;orig-date=10 May 1969&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;edition=2nd&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Jun'ichirō Tanizaki&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Jun'ichirō&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Tanizaki&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Obunsha&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Shinjuku]], Tokyo&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFTanizaki1970" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2187"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jun'ichirō_Tanizaki" title="Jun'ichirō Tanizaki" id="mwSSA">Tanizaki, Jun'ichirō</a> (20 June 1970) [10 May 1969].  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSSE">二十四</bdi>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSSI">細雪</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSSM">[</span><i id="mwSSQ"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Makioka_Sisters" title="The Makioka Sisters" id="mwSSU">Light Snow</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSSY">]</span> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSSc">&nbsp;</span>1 (2nd<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSSg">&nbsp;</span>ed.). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shinjuku" title="Shinjuku" id="mwSSk">Shinjuku</a>, Tokyo: Obunsha. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSSo">&nbsp;</span>205.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSSs">十一月になって、貞之助は仕事のことで二三日東京へ行く用ができたので、始めて<ruby id="mwSSw">渋<rp id="mwSS0">(</rp><rt id="mwSS4">しぶ</rt><rp id="mwSS8">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSTA">谷<rp id="mwSTE">(</rp><rt id="mwSTI">や</rt><rp id="mwSTM">)</rp></ruby>の本家を訪ねたが、子供たちはもうすっかり新しい生活に<ruby id="mwSTQ">馴<rp id="mwSTU">(</rp><rt id="mwSTY">な</rt><rp id="mwSTc">)</rp></ruby>れ、東京弁も<ruby id="mwSTg">上<rp id="mwSTk">(</rp><rt id="mwSTo">じよう</rt><rp id="mwSTs">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSTw">手<rp id="mwST0">(</rp><rt id="mwST4">ず</rt><rp id="mwST8">)</rp></ruby>になり、家庭と学校とで言葉の使い分けをするほどになっていて、辰雄夫婦も雪子も<ruby id="mwSUA">機<rp id="mwSUE">(</rp><rt id="mwSUI">き</rt><rp id="mwSUM">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSUQ">嫌<rp id="mwSUU">(</rp><rt id="mwSUY">げん</rt><rp id="mwSUc">)</rp></ruby>をよくしてい、狭い所で窮屈だけれどもぜひ泊まって行ってくれろと、皆がすゝめるのであった。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B&amp;rft.btitle=%E7%B4%B0%E9%9B%AA&amp;rft.place=Shinjuku%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=205&amp;rft.edition=2nd&amp;rft.pub=Obunsha&amp;rft.date=1970-06-20&amp;rft.aulast=Tanizaki&amp;rft.aufirst=Jun%27ichir%C5%8D&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2187" id="mwSUg"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2187" id="mwSUk"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2187" id="mwSUo"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-376" id="cite_note-376" data-mw-footnote-number="353"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwSUs"><a href="#cite_ref-376" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwSUw"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwSU0">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-376" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2190" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwSU4" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「何を見てるんだい、<br/>いつもそこで。教えてくれよ」<br/>[…]<br/>「探り出してみせるぞ——教えてくれよ、なあ、お前」<br/>[…]<br/>「エイミー、今度はよその人の所へ行かんで、<br/>俺の話を聞いてくれ。ここから俺はおりないぞ」<br/>[…]<br/>「じゃあ、教えてくれよ」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=‘What is it you see<br/>From up there always—for I want to know.’<br/>[…]<br/>‘I will find out now—you must tell me, dear.’<br/>[…]<br/>‘Amy! Don’t go to someone else this time.<br/>Listen to me. I won’t come down the stairs.’<br/>[…]<br/>‘Help me, then.’&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pp=41–43, 45&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:家葬&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Home Burial&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Robert Lee&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Frost&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Robert Frost&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Matsuda&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Seishi&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:親和女子大学英語英文学&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=11&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=1991&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://kobe-shinwa.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/886/files/KJ00000702628.pdf&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFFrost1991" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2190"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robert_Frost" title="Robert Frost" id="mwSU8">Frost, Robert Lee</a> (1991). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://kobe-shinwa.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/886/files/KJ00000702628.pdf" class="external text" id="mwSVA">"Home Burial" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSVE">家葬</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwSVI">(PDF)</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSVM">親和女子大学英語英文学</bdi> (in Japanese) (11). Translated by Matsuda, Seishi: <span class="nowrap" id="mwSVQ">41–</span>43, 45. <q id="mwSVU"><span class="cs1-kern-left" id="mwSVY"></span>'What is it you see<br id="mwSVc">From up there always—for I want to know.'<br id="mwSVg">[…]<br id="mwSVk">'I will find out now—you must tell me, dear.'<br id="mwSVo">[…]<br id="mwSVs">'Amy! Don't go to someone else this time.<br id="mwSVw">Listen to me. I won't come down the stairs.'<br id="mwSV0">[…]<br id="mwSV4">'Help me, then.'<span class="cs1-kern-right" id="mwSV8"></span></q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSWA">「何を見てるんだい、<br id="mwSWE">いつもそこで。教えてくれよ」<br id="mwSWI">[…]<br id="mwSWM">「探り出してみせるぞ——教えてくれよ、なあ、お前」<br id="mwSWQ">[…]<br id="mwSWU">「エイミー、今度はよその人の所へ行かんで、<br id="mwSWY">俺の話を聞いてくれ。ここから俺はおりないぞ」<br id="mwSWc">[…]<br id="mwSWg">「じゃあ、教えてくれよ」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=Home+Burial+%E5%AE%B6%E8%91%AC&amp;rft.issue=11&amp;rft.pages=41-43%2C+45&amp;rft.date=1991&amp;rft.aulast=Frost&amp;rft.aufirst=Robert+Lee&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fkobe-shinwa.repo.nii.ac.jp%2Frecord%2F886%2Ffiles%2FKJ00000702628.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2190" id="mwSWk"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2190" id="mwSWo"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2190" id="mwSWs"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-377" id="cite_note-377" data-mw-footnote-number="354"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwSWw"><a href="#cite_ref-377" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwSW0"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwSW4">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-377" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2193" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwSW8" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:ヴァーシュが言った、「少しうしろへどいてくれろ、おいらの足を乾かせるようにな」彼はぼくをちょっとうしろへ押しやった。[…]<br/>「そこにじっとして、おいらに足を乾かさせてくれろよ」ヴァーシュが言った。[…]<br/>「このお盆を上へもっていってくれろ」ディルシーが言った。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=Versh said, “You move back some, so I can dry my legs off.” He shoved me back a little. […]<br/>“You be still there and let me dry my legs off.” Versh said. […]<br/>“Take this tray up,” Dilsey said.&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:響きと怒り&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=[[The Sound and the Fury]]&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=William Faulkner&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=William Cuthbert&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Faulkner&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Kenzaburō&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Ōhashi&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=20 May 2016&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Gutenberg21&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Setagaya]], Tokyo&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFFaulkner2016" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2193"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Faulkner" title="William Faulkner" id="mwSXA">Faulkner, William Cuthbert</a> (20 May 2016). <i id="mwSXE"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Sound_and_the_Fury" title="The Sound and the Fury" id="mwSXI">The Sound and the Fury</a></i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSXM">響きと怒り</bdi> (in Japanese). Translated by Ōhashi, Kenzaburō. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Setagaya" title="Setagaya" id="mwSXQ">Setagaya</a>, Tokyo: Gutenberg21. <q id="mwSXU">Versh said, "You move back some, so I can dry my legs off." He shoved me back a little. […]<br id="mwSXY">"You be still there and let me dry my legs off." Versh said. […]<br id="mwSXc">"Take this tray up," Dilsey said.</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSXg">ヴァーシュが言った、「少しうしろへどいてくれろ、おいらの足を乾かせるようにな」彼はぼくをちょっとうしろへ押しやった。[…]<br id="mwSXk">「そこにじっとして、おいらに足を乾かさせてくれろよ」ヴァーシュが言った。[…]<br id="mwSXo">「このお盆を上へもっていってくれろ」ディルシーが言った。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=The+Sound+and+the+Fury+%E9%9F%BF%E3%81%8D%E3%81%A8%E6%80%92%E3%82%8A&amp;rft.place=Setagaya%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pub=Gutenberg21&amp;rft.date=2016-05-20&amp;rft.aulast=Faulkner&amp;rft.aufirst=William+Cuthbert&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2193" id="mwSXs"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2193" id="mwSXw"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2193" id="mwSX0"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-378" id="cite_note-378" data-mw-footnote-number="355"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwSX4"><a href="#cite_ref-378" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwSX8"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwSYA">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-378" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2203" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwSYE" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote=He began his stretching exercise by shouting “one, two, one, two,” at times jabbing at the walls of her stomach. The [[Princess Iron Fan|Rakshasi]] grimaced while holding down her belly with both hands.<br/>“Aa, ow ow, spare my life, please!”<br/>“Why, you’re my dear sis-in-law, I’m not going to take your life. All you have to do is lend me your fan, but if you say no, watch this……”<br/>He put on undigested fish bones as skis, and schussed at full throttle from her stomach straight down to her duodenum. After that, he skied down her winding small and large instetines while performing amazing stunts like the jump, the Telemark and the slalom, and once he broke into her blind gut, it became unbearable for her. As one would expect, the Rakshasi burst out wailing and thrashed about on the floor in agony.<br/>“Ow ow, I’m going to die! I’ll lend you the fan, anything you want, please leave me be!”&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:オイチニ、オイチニの掛聲で<ruby>柔<rp>(</rp><rt>じう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>軟<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>體<rp>(</rp><rt>たい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>操<rp>(</rp><rt>さう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をはじめ、<ruby>胃<rp>(</rp><rt>ゐ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>壁<rp>(</rp><rt>へき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をちよいちよい突つつく。羅刹女は兩手で腹をおさへて<ruby>顰<rp>(</rp><rt>しか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めつ<ruby>面<rp>(</rp><rt>つら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>。<br/>「おお、痛い痛い、命だけは助けておくれい！」<br/>「なに親愛なる兄嫁ですもの、何も命を取るとはいやしませんよ。ただあの扇さへ貸してくれりやいいんです、いやだといへばこの通り……」<br/>まだ消化してゐない<ruby>肴<rp>(</rp><rt>さかな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の骨をスキーの代りに<ruby>穿<rp>(</rp><rt>は</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きなし、馬力をかけて、胃から十二指腸へ<ruby>直<rp>(</rp><rt>ちよく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>滑<rp>(</rp><rt>かつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>降<rp>(</rp><rt>かう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>。それからつづら折りなる小腸大腸をヂヤンプ、テレマーク、スロラームと妙技を振つて滑走し、果ては<ruby>盲<rp>(</rp><rt>まう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>腸<rp>(</rp><rt>ちやう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にまで暴れ込んだから堪りません。さすがの羅刹女おいおい聲をあげて泣き出し、<ruby>床<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の上をのた打ち廻つて苦しがる。<br/>「痛い痛い、死んでしまふよう。扇でも何でも貸すから、勘辨しておくれい！」&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1704774/1/28&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pp=40–41&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:二　芭蕉扇の偉力&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-chapter=2. The Power of the Banana Fan&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:新譯西遊記&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=[[Journey to the West]]: A New Translation&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=2&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Daini Shobō&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first2=Shōgaku&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last2=Yudate&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first3=Chōko&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last3=Kamoshita&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Wu&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Cheng'en&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Wu Cheng'en&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Setagaya]], Tokyo&quot;},&quot;21&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=20 May 1949&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFWuYudateKamoshita1949" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2203"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wu_Cheng'en" title="Wu Cheng'en" id="mwSYI">Wu, Cheng'en</a>; Yudate, Shōgaku; Kamoshita, Chōko (20 May 1949).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSYM">二　芭蕉扇の偉力</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSYQ">[</span>2. The Power of the Banana Fan<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSYU">]</span>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1704774/1/28" class="external text" id="mwSYY"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwSYc">新譯西遊記</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSYg">[</span><i id="mwSYk"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Journey_to_the_West" title="Journey to the West" id="mwSYo">Journey to the West</a>: A New Translation</i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSYs">]</span> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSYw">&nbsp;</span>2. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Setagaya" title="Setagaya" id="mwSY0">Setagaya</a>, Tokyo: Daini Shobō. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSY4">&nbsp;</span><span class="nowrap" id="mwSY8">40–</span>41.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSZA">オイチニ、オイチニの掛聲で<ruby id="mwSZE">柔<rp id="mwSZI">(</rp><rt id="mwSZM">じう</rt><rp id="mwSZQ">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSZU">軟<rp id="mwSZY">(</rp><rt id="mwSZc">なん</rt><rp id="mwSZg">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSZk">體<rp id="mwSZo">(</rp><rt id="mwSZs">たい</rt><rp id="mwSZw">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSZ0">操<rp id="mwSZ4">(</rp><rt id="mwSZ8">さう</rt><rp id="mwSaA">)</rp></ruby>をはじめ、<ruby id="mwSaE">胃<rp id="mwSaI">(</rp><rt id="mwSaM">ゐ</rt><rp id="mwSaQ">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSaU">壁<rp id="mwSaY">(</rp><rt id="mwSac">へき</rt><rp id="mwSag">)</rp></ruby>をちよいちよい突つつく。羅刹女は兩手で腹をおさへて<ruby id="mwSak">顰<rp id="mwSao">(</rp><rt id="mwSas">しか</rt><rp id="mwSaw">)</rp></ruby>めつ<ruby id="mwSa0">面<rp id="mwSa4">(</rp><rt id="mwSa8">つら</rt><rp id="mwSbA">)</rp></ruby>。<br id="mwSbE">「おお、痛い痛い、命だけは助けておくれい！」<br id="mwSbI">「なに親愛なる兄嫁ですもの、何も命を取るとはいやしませんよ。ただあの扇さへ貸してくれりやいいんです、いやだといへばこの通り……」<br id="mwSbM">まだ消化してゐない<ruby id="mwSbQ">肴<rp id="mwSbU">(</rp><rt id="mwSbY">さかな</rt><rp id="mwSbc">)</rp></ruby>の骨をスキーの代りに<ruby id="mwSbg">穿<rp id="mwSbk">(</rp><rt id="mwSbo">は</rt><rp id="mwSbs">)</rp></ruby>きなし、馬力をかけて、胃から十二指腸へ<ruby id="mwSbw">直<rp id="mwSb0">(</rp><rt id="mwSb4">ちよく</rt><rp id="mwSb8">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwScA">滑<rp id="mwScE">(</rp><rt id="mwScI">かつ</rt><rp id="mwScM">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwScQ">降<rp id="mwScU">(</rp><rt id="mwScY">かう</rt><rp id="mwScc">)</rp></ruby>。それからつづら折りなる小腸大腸をヂヤンプ、テレマーク、スロラームと妙技を振つて滑走し、果ては<ruby id="mwScg">盲<rp id="mwSck">(</rp><rt id="mwSco">まう</rt><rp id="mwScs">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwScw">腸<rp id="mwSc0">(</rp><rt id="mwSc4">ちやう</rt><rp id="mwSc8">)</rp></ruby>にまで暴れ込んだから堪りません。さすがの羅刹女おいおい聲をあげて泣き出し、<ruby id="mwSdA">床<rp id="mwSdE">(</rp><rt id="mwSdI">ゆか</rt><rp id="mwSdM">)</rp></ruby>の上をのた打ち廻つて苦しがる。<br id="mwSdQ">「痛い痛い、死んでしまふよう。扇でも何でも貸すから、勘辨しておくれい！」</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSdU">[</span>He began his stretching exercise by shouting “one, two, one, two,” at times jabbing at the walls of her stomach. The <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Princess_Iron_Fan" title="Princess Iron Fan" id="mwSdY">Rakshasi</a> grimaced while holding down her belly with both hands.<br id="mwSdc">“Aa, ow ow, spare my life, please!”<br id="mwSdg">“Why, you’re my dear sis-in-law, I’m not going to take your life. All you have to do is lend me your fan, but if you say no, watch this……”<br id="mwSdk">He put on undigested fish bones as skis, and schussed at full throttle from her stomach straight down to her duodenum. After that, he skied down her winding small and large instetines while performing amazing stunts like the jump, the Telemark and the slalom, and once he broke into her blind gut, it became unbearable for her. As one would expect, the Rakshasi burst out wailing and thrashed about on the floor in agony.<br id="mwSdo">“Ow ow, I’m going to die! I’ll lend you the fan, anything you want, please leave me be!”<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSds">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%80%E8%8A%AD%E8%95%89%E6%89%87%E3%81%AE%E5%81%89%E5%8A%9B&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%96%B0%E8%AD%AF%E8%A5%BF%E9%81%8A%E8%A8%98&amp;rft.place=Setagaya%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=40-41&amp;rft.pub=Daini+Shob%C5%8D&amp;rft.date=1949-05-20&amp;rft.aulast=Wu&amp;rft.aufirst=Cheng%27en&amp;rft.au=Yudate%2C+Sh%C5%8Dgaku&amp;rft.au=Kamoshita%2C+Ch%C5%8Dko&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1704774%2F1%2F28&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2203" id="mwSdw"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2203" id="mwSd0"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2203" id="mwSd4"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-tsubouchi-1958-alls-well-that-ends-well-379" id="cite_note-tsubouchi-1958-alls-well-that-ends-well-379" data-mw-footnote-number="356"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwSd8"><a href="#cite_ref-tsubouchi-1958-alls-well-that-ends-well_379-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwSeA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwSeE">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-tsubouchi-1958-alls-well-that-ends-well-379" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2206" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwSeI" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:'''ヘレナ'''　（フールに）ねえ、來とくれよ。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote='''Hel.''' [''to Fool''] I pray you.—Come, sirrah.&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;p=82&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1664863/1/47&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:末よければ總てよし&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=All’s Well That Ends Well&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-link=Tsubouchi Shōyō&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Tsubouchi&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Shōyō&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=William Shakespeare&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=William&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Shakespeare&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|シェークスピヤ全集}}&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Shinjusha&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=15 February 1958&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Bunkyō]], Tokyo&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:第四場　王宮中の別室。&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=Scene IV. Paris. The King’s Palace.&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="mwSeM" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2206" data-x-id="CITEREFShakespeare1958"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Shakespeare" title="William Shakespeare" id="mwSeQ">Shakespeare, William</a> (15 February 1958). "Scene IV. Paris. The King's Palace." <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSeU">第四場　王宮中の別室。</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1664863/1/47" class="external text" id="mwSeY"><i id="mwSec">All’s Well That Ends Well</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSeg">末よければ總てよし</bdi></a>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwSek"><span lang="ja" id="mwSeo">シェークスピヤ全集</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwSes"> (in Japanese). Translated by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tsubouchi_Shōyō" title="Tsubouchi Shōyō" id="mwSew">Tsubouchi, Shōyō</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bunkyō" title="Bunkyō" id="mwSe0">Bunkyō</a>, Tokyo: Shinjusha. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSe4">&nbsp;</span>82. <q id="mwSe8"><b id="mwSfA">Hel.</b> [<i id="mwSfE">to Fool</i>] I pray you.—Come, sirrah.</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSfI"><b id="mwSfM">ヘレナ</b>　（フールに）ねえ、來とくれよ。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=Scene+IV.+Paris.+The+King%E2%80%99s+Palace.+%E7%AC%AC%E5%9B%9B%E5%A0%B4%E3%80%80%E7%8E%8B%E5%AE%AE%E4%B8%AD%E3%81%AE%E5%88%A5%E5%AE%A4%E3%80%82&amp;rft.btitle=All%E2%80%99s+Well+That+Ends+Well+%E6%9C%AB%E3%82%88%E3%81%91%E3%82%8C%E3%81%B0%E7%B8%BD%E3%81%A6%E3%82%88%E3%81%97&amp;rft.place=Bunky%C5%8D%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E3%82%B7%E3%82%A7%E3%83%BC%E3%82%AF%E3%82%B9%E3%83%94%E3%83%A4%E5%85%A8%E9%9B%86%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=82&amp;rft.pub=Shinjusha&amp;rft.date=1958-02-15&amp;rft.aulast=Shakespeare&amp;rft.aufirst=William&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1664863%2F1%2F47&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2206" id="mwSfQ"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2206" id="mwSfU"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2206" id="mwSfY"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-tsubouchi-1958-henry-viii-teokure-380" id="cite_note-tsubouchi-1958-henry-viii-teokure-380" data-mw-footnote-number="357"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwSfc"><a href="#cite_ref-tsubouchi-1958-henry-viii-teokure_380-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwSfg"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwSfk">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-tsubouchi-1958-henry-viii-teokure-380" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2209" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwSfo" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:ペーシェンスよ、始終<ruby>傍<rp>(</rp><rt>そば</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にゐておくれ。‥‥もっと低くしとくれ。もう長いこと世話も掛けまい。‥‥グリフィスや、樂人どもにいひつけて、わたしがわたしの<ruby>弔<rp>(</rp><rt>とむらひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>鐘<rp>(</rp><rt>がね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と名を附けたあの哀れな譜を奏させとくれ。‥‥&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=Patience, be near me still; and set me lower:<br/>I have not long to trouble thee.—Good Griffith,<br/>Cause the musicians play me that sad note<br/>I named my knell, whilst I sit meditating<br/>On that celestial harmony I go to.&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;p=153&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1664875/1/82&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=[[Henry VIII (play)|Henry VIII]]&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:ヘンリー八世&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=King Henry VIII&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-link=Tsubouchi Shōyō&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Tsubouchi&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Shōyō&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=William Shakespeare&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=William&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Shakespeare&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink2=John Fletcher (playwright)&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first2=John&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last2=Fletcher&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|シェークスピヤ全集}}&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Shinjusha&quot;},&quot;21&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=15 October 1958&quot;},&quot;22&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Bunkyō]], Tokyo&quot;},&quot;23&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:第二場　キムボルトン。太后の居所。&quot;},&quot;24&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=Scene II. Kimbolton.&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="mwSfs" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2209" data-x-id="CITEREFShakespeareFletcher1958"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Shakespeare" title="William Shakespeare" id="mwSfw">Shakespeare, William</a>; <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Fletcher_(playwright)" title="John Fletcher (playwright)" id="mwSf0">Fletcher, John</a> (15 October 1958). "Scene II. Kimbolton." <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSf4">第二場　キムボルトン。太后の居所。</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1664875/1/82" class="external text" id="mwSf8"><i id="mwSgA">King Henry VIII</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSgE">ヘンリー八世</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSgI">[</span><i id="mwSgM"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Henry_VIII_(play)" title="Henry VIII (play)" id="mwSgQ">Henry VIII</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSgU">]</span>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwSgY"><span lang="ja" id="mwSgc">シェークスピヤ全集</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwSgg"> (in Japanese). Translated by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tsubouchi_Shōyō" title="Tsubouchi Shōyō" id="mwSgk">Tsubouchi, Shōyō</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bunkyō" title="Bunkyō" id="mwSgo">Bunkyō</a>, Tokyo: Shinjusha. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSgs">&nbsp;</span>153. <q id="mwSgw">Patience, be near me still; and set me lower:<br id="mwSg0">I have not long to trouble thee.—Good Griffith,<br id="mwSg4">Cause the musicians play me that sad note<br id="mwSg8">I named my knell, whilst I sit meditating<br id="mwShA">On that celestial harmony I go to.</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwShE">ペーシェンスよ、始終<ruby id="mwShI">傍<rp id="mwShM">(</rp><rt id="mwShQ">そば</rt><rp id="mwShU">)</rp></ruby>にゐておくれ。‥‥もっと低くしとくれ。もう長いこと世話も掛けまい。‥‥グリフィスや、樂人どもにいひつけて、わたしがわたしの<ruby id="mwShY">弔<rp id="mwShc">(</rp><rt id="mwShg">とむらひ</rt><rp id="mwShk">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSho">鐘<rp id="mwShs">(</rp><rt id="mwShw">がね</rt><rp id="mwSh0">)</rp></ruby>と名を附けたあの哀れな譜を奏させとくれ。‥‥</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=Scene+II.+Kimbolton.+%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E5%A0%B4%E3%80%80%E3%82%AD%E3%83%A0%E3%83%9C%E3%83%AB%E3%83%88%E3%83%B3%E3%80%82%E5%A4%AA%E5%90%8E%E3%81%AE%E5%B1%85%E6%89%80%E3%80%82&amp;rft.btitle=King+Henry+VIII+%E3%83%98%E3%83%B3%E3%83%AA%E3%83%BC%E5%85%AB%E4%B8%96&amp;rft.place=Bunky%C5%8D%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E3%82%B7%E3%82%A7%E3%83%BC%E3%82%AF%E3%82%B9%E3%83%94%E3%83%A4%E5%85%A8%E9%9B%86%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=153&amp;rft.pub=Shinjusha&amp;rft.date=1958-10-15&amp;rft.aulast=Shakespeare&amp;rft.aufirst=William&amp;rft.au=Fletcher%2C+John&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1664875%2F1%2F82&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2209" id="mwSh4"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2209" id="mwSh8"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2209" id="mwSiA"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-suzuki-2003-381" id="cite_note-suzuki-2003-381" data-mw-footnote-number="358"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwSiE"><a href="#cite_ref-suzuki-2003_381-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwSiI"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwSiM">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-suzuki-2003-381" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2212" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwSiQ" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「[…]　アア！　ジュヌヴィエーヴ、きみこそ善意の天使だ、そうだろ？　きみは男をこの上なくしあわせにしてくれる、だから相手は、もう人生が嫌になった、などと嘆くこともないし、もう永久の幸福なんて欲しがらなくなるじゃあないかな？　だから、ぼくを押しのける代りに、ぼくにほほ笑んでおくれ、ぼくのジュヌヴィエーヴ、きみの手をぼくの腕に当てておくれ、全身全霊、望みをこめてきみを望んでいる男に寄りかかっておくれ。ジュヌヴィエーヴ、ぼくの恋人、ぼくの命、ジュヌヴィエーヴ、もうきみの誓いなんか繰りかえさないでおくれ！」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote=“[…] Oh! Geneviève, thee, thou art an angel of goodness, dost thou want this? Dost thou want to make one man so happy that he no more regrets his life and no more desires eternal bliss? If so, instead of pushing me away, smile at me, my Geneviève, rest thy hand on mine arm, lean on the man who yearns for thee, putting his yearning into all his body and soul. Geneviève, my love, my life, Geneviève, take not back thy vow!”&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=— […] Oh ! Geneviève, toi, tu es un ange de bonté, veux-tu, dis ? veux-tu rendre un homme si heureux qu’il ne regrette plus la vie et qu’il ne désire plus le bonheur éternel ? Alors, au lieu de me repousser, souris-moi, ma Geneviève, laisse-moi appuyer ta main sur mon cœur, penche-toi vers celui qui t’aspire de toute sa puissance, de tous ses vœux, de toute son âme ; Geneviève, mon amour, ma vie, Geneviève, ne reprends pas ton serment !&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:三十二　神にかけて誓った誓約&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=XXXII. La foi jurée&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-chapter=XXXII. The Oath Sworn to God&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Gutenberg21&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Setagaya]], Tokyo&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:赤い館の騎士&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=[[Le Chevalier de Maison-Rouge]]&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=The Knight of Maison-Rouge&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=2&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Alexandre Dumas&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Alexandre&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Dumas&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Suzuki&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Yutaka&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;orig-date=15 October 2003&quot;},&quot;21&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=4 March 2015&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFDumas2015" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2212"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alexandre_Dumas" title="Alexandre Dumas" id="mwSiU">Dumas, Alexandre</a> (4 March 2015) [15 October 2003]. "XXXII. La foi jurée" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSiY">三十二　神にかけて誓った誓約</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSic">[</span>XXXII. The Oath Sworn to God<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSig">]</span>. <i id="mwSik"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Le_Chevalier_de_Maison-Rouge" title="Le Chevalier de Maison-Rouge" id="mwSio">Le Chevalier de Maison-Rouge</a></i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSis">赤い館の騎士</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSiw">[</span><i id="mwSi0">The Knight of Maison-Rouge</i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSi4">]</span> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSi8">&nbsp;</span>2. Translated by Suzuki, Yutaka. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Setagaya" title="Setagaya" id="mwSjA">Setagaya</a>, Tokyo: Gutenberg21. <q id="mwSjE">— […] Oh<span typeof="mw:DisplaySpace" id="mwSjI">&nbsp;</span>! Geneviève, toi, tu es un ange de bonté, veux-tu, dis<span typeof="mw:DisplaySpace" id="mwSjM">&nbsp;</span>? veux-tu rendre un homme si heureux qu'il ne regrette plus la vie et qu'il ne désire plus le bonheur éternel<span typeof="mw:DisplaySpace" id="mwSjQ">&nbsp;</span>? Alors, au lieu de me repousser, souris-moi, ma Geneviève, laisse-moi appuyer ta main sur mon cœur, penche-toi vers celui qui t'aspire de toute sa puissance, de tous ses vœux, de toute son âme<span typeof="mw:DisplaySpace" id="mwSjU">&nbsp;</span>; Geneviève, mon amour, ma vie, Geneviève, ne reprends pas ton serment<span typeof="mw:DisplaySpace" id="mwSjY">&nbsp;</span>!</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSjc">「[…]　アア！　ジュヌヴィエーヴ、きみこそ善意の天使だ、そうだろ？　きみは男をこの上なくしあわせにしてくれる、だから相手は、もう人生が嫌になった、などと嘆くこともないし、もう永久の幸福なんて欲しがらなくなるじゃあないかな？　だから、ぼくを押しのける代りに、ぼくにほほ笑んでおくれ、ぼくのジュヌヴィエーヴ、きみの手をぼくの腕に当てておくれ、全身全霊、望みをこめてきみを望んでいる男に寄りかかっておくれ。ジュヌヴィエーヴ、ぼくの恋人、ぼくの命、ジュヌヴィエーヴ、もうきみの誓いなんか繰りかえさないでおくれ！」</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSjg">[</span>“[…] Oh! Geneviève, thee, thou art an angel of goodness, dost thou want this? Dost thou want to make one man so happy that he no more regrets his life and no more desires eternal bliss? If so, instead of pushing me away, smile at me, my Geneviève, rest thy hand on mine arm, lean on the man who yearns for thee, putting his yearning into all his body and soul. Geneviève, my love, my life, Geneviève, take not back thy vow!”<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSjk">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=XXXII.+La+foi+jur%C3%A9e+%E4%B8%89%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%80%E7%A5%9E%E3%81%AB%E3%81%8B%E3%81%91%E3%81%A6%E8%AA%93%E3%81%A3%E3%81%9F%E8%AA%93%E7%B4%84&amp;rft.btitle=Le+Chevalier+de+Maison-Rouge+%E8%B5%A4%E3%81%84%E9%A4%A8%E3%81%AE%E9%A8%8E%E5%A3%AB&amp;rft.place=Setagaya%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pub=Gutenberg21&amp;rft.date=2015-03-04&amp;rft.aulast=Dumas&amp;rft.aufirst=Alexandre&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2212" id="mwSjo"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2212" id="mwSjs"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2212" id="mwSjw"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-382" id="cite_note-382" data-mw-footnote-number="359"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwSj0"><a href="#cite_ref-382" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwSj4"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwSj8">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-382" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2226" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwSkA" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:それから間なしに、<ruby>牡<rp>(</rp><rt>おん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>鷄<rp>(</rp><rt>どり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が庭でときをつくりはじめました。すると、伯爵は、奉公人をためしてみるつもりで、話しがてらに、『なア、<ruby>下<rp>(</rp><rt>げ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>郞<rp>(</rp><rt>ろう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>や、牡鷄は何といって鳴いたかな』、といってみました。すると奉公人は、<ruby>卽<rp>(</rp><rt>そく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>座<rp>(</rp><rt>ざ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に『お城は間もなく<ruby>沒<rp>(</rp><rt>ぼつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>落<rp>(</rp><rt>らく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>するだろう、と鷄は叫んでおりまする』、と答えました。ところが、伯爵はひどくかっと腹をたてて、いいました。『この<ruby>不<rp>(</rp><rt>ふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>届<rp>(</rp><rt>とどき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>者<rp>(</rp><rt>もの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めがツ。なぜその方は<ruby>予<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>禁<rp>(</rp><rt>きん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>令<rp>(</rp><rt>れい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をおかして、予がその方に禁じておいた魚を食べたのだ。それはならぬと申しつけておいたのに。その方はわしたちの<ruby>災<rp>(</rp><rt>さい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>難<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を承知なのだから、急げ！そして、難をのがれる時間にありつけるよう、わしの馬に<ruby>鞍<rp>(</rp><rt>くら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の用意をせいツ――。』&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote=Not long later, a rooster began to crow in the garden. The Count then wanted to test his servant in a conversation, said, “Hey page, what was the rooster crowing about?” The servant readily answered, “He cried that the castle will collapse in no time.” The Count exploded with rage, “Scoundrel! How dare you violate my prohibition and eat the fish which I forbade you to eat⁉ I kept telling you not to do so! Now that you know of the trouble in which we are, hurry! Prepare a saddle on my horse, so that we have time to escape――!”&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pp=173–174&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1168455/1/110&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:〈27〉　イーザング<ruby>伯<rp>(</rp><rt>はく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>爵<rp>(</rp><rt>しやく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-chapter=‹27› Count Isang&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=Graf Isang&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:祖稿グリム童話全集&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=The Complete First Drafts of [[Grimms' Fairy Tales|Grimms’ Fairy Tales]]&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Jacob Grimm&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Jacob Ludwig Karl&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Grimm&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink2=Wilhelm Carl Grimm&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first2=Wilhelm Carl&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last2=Grimm&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Tanaka&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Umekichi&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last3=Masuyama&quot;},&quot;21&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first3=Kyōko&quot;},&quot;22&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Tokyodo&quot;},&quot;23&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=15 November 1949&quot;},&quot;24&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Chiyoda, Tokyo]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFGrimmGrimmMasuyama1949" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2226"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jacob_Grimm" title="Jacob Grimm" id="mwSkE">Grimm, Jacob Ludwig Karl</a>; <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wilhelm_Carl_Grimm" title="Wilhelm Carl Grimm" class="mw-redirect" id="mwSkI">Grimm, Wilhelm Carl</a>; Masuyama, Kyōko (15 November 1949). "Graf Isang" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSkM">〈27〉　イーザング<ruby id="mwSkQ">伯<rp id="mwSkU">(</rp><rt id="mwSkY">はく</rt><rp id="mwSkc">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSkg">爵<rp id="mwSkk">(</rp><rt id="mwSko">しやく</rt><rp id="mwSks">)</rp></ruby></bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSkw">[</span>‹27› Count Isang<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSk0">]</span>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1168455/1/110" class="external text" id="mwSk4"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwSk8">祖稿グリム童話全集</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSlA">[</span><i id="mwSlE">The Complete First Drafts of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grimms'_Fairy_Tales" title="Grimms' Fairy Tales" id="mwSlI">Grimms’ Fairy Tales</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSlM">]</span> (in Japanese). Translated by Tanaka, Umekichi. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiyoda,_Tokyo" title="Chiyoda, Tokyo" id="mwSlQ">Chiyoda, Tokyo</a>: Tokyodo. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSlU">&nbsp;</span><span class="nowrap" id="mwSlY">173–</span>174.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSlc">それから間なしに、<ruby id="mwSlg">牡<rp id="mwSlk">(</rp><rt id="mwSlo">おん</rt><rp id="mwSls">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSlw">鷄<rp id="mwSl0">(</rp><rt id="mwSl4">どり</rt><rp id="mwSl8">)</rp></ruby>が庭でときをつくりはじめました。すると、伯爵は、奉公人をためしてみるつもりで、話しがてらに、『なア、<ruby id="mwSmA">下<rp id="mwSmE">(</rp><rt id="mwSmI">げ</rt><rp id="mwSmM">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSmQ">郞<rp id="mwSmU">(</rp><rt id="mwSmY">ろう</rt><rp id="mwSmc">)</rp></ruby>や、牡鷄は何といって鳴いたかな』、といってみました。すると奉公人は、<ruby id="mwSmg">卽<rp id="mwSmk">(</rp><rt id="mwSmo">そく</rt><rp id="mwSms">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSmw">座<rp id="mwSm0">(</rp><rt id="mwSm4">ざ</rt><rp id="mwSm8">)</rp></ruby>に『お城は間もなく<ruby id="mwSnA">沒<rp id="mwSnE">(</rp><rt id="mwSnI">ぼつ</rt><rp id="mwSnM">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSnQ">落<rp id="mwSnU">(</rp><rt id="mwSnY">らく</rt><rp id="mwSnc">)</rp></ruby>するだろう、と鷄は叫んでおりまする』、と答えました。ところが、伯爵はひどくかっと腹をたてて、いいました。『この<ruby id="mwSng">不<rp id="mwSnk">(</rp><rt id="mwSno">ふ</rt><rp id="mwSns">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSnw">届<rp id="mwSn0">(</rp><rt id="mwSn4">とどき</rt><rp id="mwSn8">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSoA">者<rp id="mwSoE">(</rp><rt id="mwSoI">もの</rt><rp id="mwSoM">)</rp></ruby>めがツ。なぜその方は<ruby id="mwSoQ">予<rp id="mwSoU">(</rp><rt id="mwSoY">よ</rt><rp id="mwSoc">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwSog">禁<rp id="mwSok">(</rp><rt id="mwSoo">きん</rt><rp id="mwSos">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSow">令<rp id="mwSo0">(</rp><rt id="mwSo4">れい</rt><rp id="mwSo8">)</rp></ruby>をおかして、予がその方に禁じておいた魚を食べたのだ。それはならぬと申しつけておいたのに。その方はわしたちの<ruby id="mwSpA">災<rp id="mwSpE">(</rp><rt id="mwSpI">さい</rt><rp id="mwSpM">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSpQ">難<rp id="mwSpU">(</rp><rt id="mwSpY">なん</rt><rp id="mwSpc">)</rp></ruby>を承知なのだから、急げ！そして、難をのがれる時間にありつけるよう、わしの馬に<ruby id="mwSpg">鞍<rp id="mwSpk">(</rp><rt id="mwSpo">くら</rt><rp id="mwSps">)</rp></ruby>の用意をせいツ――。』</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSpw">[</span>Not long later, a rooster began to crow in the garden. The Count then wanted to test his servant in a conversation, said, “Hey page, what was the rooster crowing about?” The servant readily answered, “He cried that the castle will collapse in no time.” The Count exploded with rage, “Scoundrel! How dare you violate my prohibition and eat the fish which I forbade you to eat⁉ I kept telling you not to do so! Now that you know of the trouble in which we are, hurry! Prepare a saddle on my horse, so that we have time to escape――!”<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSp0">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=Graf+Isang+%E3%80%8827%E3%80%89%E3%80%80%E3%82%A4%E3%83%BC%E3%82%B6%E3%83%B3%E3%82%B0%3Cruby%3E%E4%BC%AF%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%AF%E3%81%8F%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E7%88%B5%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%97%E3%82%84%E3%81%8F%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E&amp;rft.btitle=%E7%A5%96%E7%A8%BF%E3%82%B0%E3%83%AA%E3%83%A0%E7%AB%A5%E8%A9%B1%E5%85%A8%E9%9B%86&amp;rft.place=Chiyoda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=173-174&amp;rft.pub=Tokyodo&amp;rft.date=1949-11-15&amp;rft.aulast=Grimm&amp;rft.aufirst=Jacob+Ludwig+Karl&amp;rft.au=Grimm%2C+Wilhelm+Carl&amp;rft.au=Masuyama%2C+Ky%C5%8Dko&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1168455%2F1%2F110&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2226" id="mwSp4"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2226" id="mwSp8"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2226" id="mwSqA"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-383" id="cite_note-383" data-mw-footnote-number="360"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwSqE"><a href="#cite_ref-383" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwSqI"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwSqM">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-383" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2229" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwSqQ" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:'''カサン'''　女の兒も男の兒も中年者も<ruby>老<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>齡<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>者<rp>(</rp><rt>より</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も、泣くより外の藝のない赤んぼも、おれの<ruby>叫<rp>(</rp><rt>わめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くのを手傳ってくれ！　今に<ruby>大<rp>(</rp><rt>おほ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>哭<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きに泣かんけりゃならんのだから。さ、さ、先拂ひに泣いてくれ、泣いてくれ！　哭け、わめけ、トロイ人よ！　さ、さ、淚を出す稽古をせい。トロイは亡びんけりゃならんのだ、此立派なイリオンは倒れッちまはんけりゃならんのだ。<ruby>把火<rp>(</rp><rt>たいまつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の生れかはりのパリス兄さんが俺たちを燒き殺すんだ。哭け、わめけ！　トロイ人よ！　ヘレンめが斯んな不仕合せを持って來たんだ！　<ruby>哭<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>け、わめけ！　トロイが燃える。ヘレンめを<ruby>逐<rp>(</rp><rt>ぼ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ひ出さないと、トロイが燒ける、トロイが燒ける！&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote='''Cas.''' Virgins and boys, mid age and wrinkled eld,<br/>Soft infancy, that nothing canst but cry,<br/>Add to my clamours! let us pay betimes<br/>A moiety of that mass of moan to come.<br/>Cry, Trojans, cry! practise your eyes with tears!<br/>Troy must not be, nor goodly Ilion stand;<br/>Our firebrand brother, Paris, burns us all.<br/>Cry, Trojans, cry! a Helen and a woe:<br/>Cry, cry! Troy burns, or else let Helen go.&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;p=74&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1664869/1/43&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:第二場　トロイ城內。プライヤムの宮中。&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=Scene II. Troy. A room in Priam’s palace.&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|シェークスピヤ全集}}&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Troilus and Cressida&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:トロイラスとクレシダ&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=William Shakespeare&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=William&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Shakespeare&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-link=Tsubouchi Shōyō&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Tsubouchi&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Shōyō&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Shinjusha&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=30 June 1958&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Bunkyō]], Tokyo&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="mwSqU" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2229" data-x-id="CITEREFShakespeare1958"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Shakespeare" title="William Shakespeare" id="mwSqY">Shakespeare, William</a> (30 June 1958). "Scene II. Troy. A room in Priam's palace." <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSqc">第二場　トロイ城內。プライヤムの宮中。</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1664869/1/43" class="external text" id="mwSqg"><i id="mwSqk">Troilus and Cressida</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSqo">トロイラスとクレシダ</bdi></a>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwSqs"><span lang="ja" id="mwSqw">シェークスピヤ全集</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwSq0"> (in Japanese). Translated by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tsubouchi_Shōyō" title="Tsubouchi Shōyō" id="mwSq4">Tsubouchi, Shōyō</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bunkyō" title="Bunkyō" id="mwSq8">Bunkyō</a>, Tokyo: Shinjusha. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSrA">&nbsp;</span>74. <q id="mwSrE"><b id="mwSrI">Cas.</b> Virgins and boys, mid age and wrinkled eld,<br id="mwSrM">Soft infancy, that nothing canst but cry,<br id="mwSrQ">Add to my clamours! let us pay betimes<br id="mwSrU">A moiety of that mass of moan to come.<br id="mwSrY">Cry, Trojans, cry! practise your eyes with tears!<br id="mwSrc">Troy must not be, nor goodly Ilion stand;<br id="mwSrg">Our firebrand brother, Paris, burns us all.<br id="mwSrk">Cry, Trojans, cry! a Helen and a woe:<br id="mwSro">Cry, cry! Troy burns, or else let Helen go.</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSrs"><b id="mwSrw">カサン</b>　女の兒も男の兒も中年者も<ruby id="mwSr0">老<rp id="mwSr4">(</rp><rt id="mwSr8">と</rt><rp id="mwSsA">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSsE">齡<rp id="mwSsI">(</rp><rt id="mwSsM">し</rt><rp id="mwSsQ">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSsU">者<rp id="mwSsY">(</rp><rt id="mwSsc">より</rt><rp id="mwSsg">)</rp></ruby>も、泣くより外の藝のない赤んぼも、おれの<ruby id="mwSsk">叫<rp id="mwSso">(</rp><rt id="mwSss">わめ</rt><rp id="mwSsw">)</rp></ruby>くのを手傳ってくれ！　今に<ruby id="mwSs0">大<rp id="mwSs4">(</rp><rt id="mwSs8">おほ</rt><rp id="mwStA">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwStE">哭<rp id="mwStI">(</rp><rt id="mwStM">な</rt><rp id="mwStQ">)</rp></ruby>きに泣かんけりゃならんのだから。さ、さ、先拂ひに泣いてくれ、泣いてくれ！　哭け、わめけ、トロイ人よ！　さ、さ、淚を出す稽古をせい。トロイは亡びんけりゃならんのだ、此立派なイリオンは倒れッちまはんけりゃならんのだ。<ruby id="mwStU">把火<rp id="mwStY">(</rp><rt id="mwStc">たいまつ</rt><rp id="mwStg">)</rp></ruby>の生れかはりのパリス兄さんが俺たちを燒き殺すんだ。哭け、わめけ！　トロイ人よ！　ヘレンめが斯んな不仕合せを持って來たんだ！　<ruby id="mwStk">哭<rp id="mwSto">(</rp><rt id="mwSts">な</rt><rp id="mwStw">)</rp></ruby>け、わめけ！　トロイが燃える。ヘレンめを<ruby id="mwSt0">逐<rp id="mwSt4">(</rp><rt id="mwSt8">ぼ</rt><rp id="mwSuA">)</rp></ruby>ひ出さないと、トロイが燒ける、トロイが燒ける！</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=Scene+II.+Troy.+A+room+in+Priam%E2%80%99s+palace.+%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E5%A0%B4%E3%80%80%E3%83%88%E3%83%AD%E3%82%A4%E5%9F%8E%E5%85%A7%E3%80%82%E3%83%97%E3%83%A9%E3%82%A4%E3%83%A4%E3%83%A0%E3%81%AE%E5%AE%AE%E4%B8%AD%E3%80%82&amp;rft.btitle=Troilus+and+Cressida+%E3%83%88%E3%83%AD%E3%82%A4%E3%83%A9%E3%82%B9%E3%81%A8%E3%82%AF%E3%83%AC%E3%82%B7%E3%83%80&amp;rft.place=Bunky%C5%8D%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E3%82%B7%E3%82%A7%E3%83%BC%E3%82%AF%E3%82%B9%E3%83%94%E3%83%A4%E5%85%A8%E9%9B%86%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=74&amp;rft.pub=Shinjusha&amp;rft.date=1958-06-30&amp;rft.aulast=Shakespeare&amp;rft.aufirst=William&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1664869%2F1%2F43&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2229" id="mwSuE"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2229" id="mwSuI"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2229" id="mwSuM"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-384" id="cite_note-384" data-mw-footnote-number="361"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwSuQ"><a href="#cite_ref-384" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwSuU"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwSuY">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-384" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2232" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwSuc" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:『二人大名』では、男から太刀で脅された大名たちが、「鶏の蹴合う真似」をさせられ、素袍を脱がされ、さらに「狗の噛み合う真似をせい。」と命じられる。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;p=20&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:古典芸能を支える一原理　―反省的論理の排除について―&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Hirai&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Shūsei&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:常葉国文&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;issn=0385-2962&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=26&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Tokoha University Junior College&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=1 March 2002&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Shizuoka (city)|Shizuoka]], [[Shizuoka Prefecture|Shizuoka]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFHirai2002" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2232">Hirai, Shūsei (1 March 2002).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSug">古典芸能を支える一原理　―反省的論理の排除について―</bdi>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSuk">常葉国文</bdi> (in Japanese) (26). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shizuoka_(city)" title="Shizuoka (city)" id="mwSuo">Shizuoka</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shizuoka_Prefecture" title="Shizuoka Prefecture" id="mwSus">Shizuoka</a>: Tokoha University Junior College: 20. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISSN_(identifier)" title="ISSN (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwSuw">ISSN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSu0">&nbsp;</span><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://search.worldcat.org/issn/0385-2962" class="external text" id="mwSu4">0385-2962</a>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSu8">『二人大名』では、男から太刀で脅された大名たちが、「鶏の蹴合う真似」をさせられ、素袍を脱がされ、さらに「狗の噛み合う真似をせい。」と命じられる。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E5%8F%A4%E5%85%B8%E8%8A%B8%E8%83%BD%E3%82%92%E6%94%AF%E3%81%88%E3%82%8B%E4%B8%80%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%E3%80%80%E2%80%95%E5%8F%8D%E7%9C%81%E7%9A%84%E8%AB%96%E7%90%86%E3%81%AE%E6%8E%92%E9%99%A4%E3%81%AB%E3%81%A4%E3%81%84%E3%81%A6%E2%80%95&amp;rft.issue=26&amp;rft.pages=20&amp;rft.date=2002-03-01&amp;rft.issn=0385-2962&amp;rft.aulast=Hirai&amp;rft.aufirst=Sh%C5%ABsei&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2232" id="mwSvA"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2232" id="mwSvE"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2232" id="mwSvI"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-tanno-2005-385" id="cite_note-tanno-2005-385" data-mw-footnote-number="362"><span rel="mw:referencedBy" class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwSvM"><a href="#cite_ref-tanno-2005_385-0" id="mwSvQ"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwSvU">1</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-tanno-2005_385-1" id="mwSvY"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwSvc">2</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-tanno-2005-385" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2235" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwSvg" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:大抵こういう言葉になってしまう。そんな家族に、<br/>「子供にね、勉強せい、勉強せいと言っても勉強しないでしょう。あんただってそう言われて勉強したか？　それとおんなじことよ。リハビリせい、あれせい、これせい。それでやるわけないでしょ。まして、この問までいばってた人でしょ。命令されたら逆に腹が立つんだよ。なっ、父さん」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;p=84&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:３章　心が元気になれば体が元気になる&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:<ruby>幸<rp>(</rp><rt>しあわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>せな<ruby>生<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>方<rp>(</rp><rt>かた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、<ruby>死<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>方<rp>(</rp><rt>かた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=15 April 2005&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Tanno&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Tsuneaki&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Minato, Tokyo]]&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Nippon Kyobunsha&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;isbn=4-531-06398-8&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFTanno2005" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2235">Tanno, Tsuneaki (15 April 2005).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSvk">３章　心が元気になれば体が元気になる</bdi>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSvo"><ruby id="mwSvs">幸<rp id="mwSvw">(</rp><rt id="mwSv0">しあわ</rt><rp id="mwSv4">)</rp></ruby>せな<ruby id="mwSv8">生<rp id="mwSwA">(</rp><rt id="mwSwE">い</rt><rp id="mwSwI">)</rp></ruby>き<ruby id="mwSwM">方<rp id="mwSwQ">(</rp><rt id="mwSwU">かた</rt><rp id="mwSwY">)</rp></ruby>、<ruby id="mwSwc">死<rp id="mwSwg">(</rp><rt id="mwSwk">し</rt><rp id="mwSwo">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwSws">方<rp id="mwSww">(</rp><rt id="mwSw0">かた</rt><rp id="mwSw4">)</rp></ruby></bdi> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Minato,_Tokyo" title="Minato, Tokyo" id="mwSw8">Minato, Tokyo</a>: Nippon Kyobunsha. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSxA">&nbsp;</span>84. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)" title="ISBN (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwSxE">ISBN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSxI">&nbsp;</span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/4-531-06398-8" title="Special:BookSources/4-531-06398-8" id="mwSxM"><bdi id="mwSxQ">4-531-06398-8</bdi></a>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSxU">大抵こういう言葉になってしまう。そんな家族に、<br id="mwSxY">「子供にね、勉強せい、勉強せいと言っても勉強しないでしょう。あんただってそう言われて勉強したか？　それとおんなじことよ。リハビリせい、あれせい、これせい。それでやるわけないでしょ。まして、この問までいばってた人でしょ。命令されたら逆に腹が立つんだよ。なっ、父さん」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%EF%BC%93%E7%AB%A0%E3%80%80%E5%BF%83%E3%81%8C%E5%85%83%E6%B0%97%E3%81%AB%E3%81%AA%E3%82%8C%E3%81%B0%E4%BD%93%E3%81%8C%E5%85%83%E6%B0%97%E3%81%AB%E3%81%AA%E3%82%8B&amp;rft.btitle=%3Cruby%3E%E5%B9%B8%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%97%E3%81%82%E3%82%8F%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%E3%81%9B%E3%81%AA%3Cruby%3E%E7%94%9F%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%84%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%E3%81%8D%3Cruby%3E%E6%96%B9%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%8B%E3%81%9F%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%E3%80%81%3Cruby%3E%E6%AD%BB%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%97%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%E3%81%AB%3Cruby%3E%E6%96%B9%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%8B%E3%81%9F%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E&amp;rft.place=Minato%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=84&amp;rft.pub=Nippon+Kyobunsha&amp;rft.date=2005-04-15&amp;rft.isbn=4-531-06398-8&amp;rft.aulast=Tanno&amp;rft.aufirst=Tsuneaki&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2235" id="mwSxc"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2235" id="mwSxg"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2235" id="mwSxk"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-386" id="cite_note-386" data-mw-footnote-number="363"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwSxo"><a href="#cite_ref-386" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwSxs"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwSxw">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-386" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2238" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwSx0" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:'''岸本'''　それは別に出すとしてもね。競争的資金で大きな金をもらった人でどれだけいい研究をしたかです。論文は出ているかもしれませんよ、「ネイチャー」やらに。しかし、最終的にはやっぱり人類の役に立たなきゃいかんわけです。ライフサイエンス、生命科学は人類を病の苦しみから救うことがやっぱり一番の使命です。だから、役に立つ研究をせいというのは、そういう意味で捉えたら正しいわけです。しかし、それを短い期間で役に立つことをやれという。すぐ役に立つことはすぐ役に立たなくなります。そうではなしに、遠回りでも、最先端の研究の成果を実用化して人類の役に立てるというのが一番の目標でしょう。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;p=11&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:免疫のミステリーを解き明かした学問を新しい治療薬につなげる&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Tadamitsu Kishimoto&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Tadamitsu&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Kishimoto&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:産学官連携ジャーナル&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal=Journal of Industry-Academia-Government Collaboration&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=15 September 2015&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;issn=1880-4128&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=11&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=9&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Japan Science and Technology Agency&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;editor-last=Nonagase&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;editor-first=Yūji&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.jstage.jst.go.jp/article/sangakukanjournal/11/9/11_4/_pdf/-char/ja&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;doi=10.1241/sangakukanjournal.11.9_4&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFKishimoto2015" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2238"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tadamitsu_Kishimoto" title="Tadamitsu Kishimoto" id="mwSx4">Kishimoto, Tadamitsu</a> (15 September 2015). Nonagase, Yūji (ed.). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.jstage.jst.go.jp/article/sangakukanjournal/11/9/11_4/_pdf/-char/ja" class="external text" id="mwSx8"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwSyA">免疫のミステリーを解き明かした学問を新しい治療薬につなげる</bdi></a>. <i id="mwSyE">Journal of Industry-Academia-Government Collaboration</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSyI">産学官連携ジャーナル</bdi> (in Japanese). <b id="mwSyM">11</b> (9). Japan Science and Technology Agency: 11. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doi_(identifier)" title="Doi (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwSyQ">doi</a>:<a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://doi.org/10.1241%2Fsangakukanjournal.11.9_4" class="external text" id="mwSyU">10.1241/sangakukanjournal.11.9_4</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISSN_(identifier)" title="ISSN (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwSyY">ISSN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwSyc">&nbsp;</span><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://search.worldcat.org/issn/1880-4128" class="external text" id="mwSyg">1880-4128</a>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSyk"><b id="mwSyo">岸本</b>　それは別に出すとしてもね。競争的資金で大きな金をもらった人でどれだけいい研究をしたかです。論文は出ているかもしれませんよ、「ネイチャー」やらに。しかし、最終的にはやっぱり人類の役に立たなきゃいかんわけです。ライフサイエンス、生命科学は人類を病の苦しみから救うことがやっぱり一番の使命です。だから、役に立つ研究をせいというのは、そういう意味で捉えたら正しいわけです。しかし、それを短い期間で役に立つことをやれという。すぐ役に立つことはすぐ役に立たなくなります。そうではなしに、遠回りでも、最先端の研究の成果を実用化して人類の役に立てるというのが一番の目標でしょう。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Journal+of+Industry-Academia-Government+Collaboration&amp;rft.atitle=%E5%85%8D%E7%96%AB%E3%81%AE%E3%83%9F%E3%82%B9%E3%83%86%E3%83%AA%E3%83%BC%E3%82%92%E8%A7%A3%E3%81%8D%E6%98%8E%E3%81%8B%E3%81%97%E3%81%9F%E5%AD%A6%E5%95%8F%E3%82%92%E6%96%B0%E3%81%97%E3%81%84%E6%B2%BB%E7%99%82%E8%96%AC%E3%81%AB%E3%81%A4%E3%81%AA%E3%81%92%E3%82%8B&amp;rft.volume=11&amp;rft.issue=9&amp;rft.pages=11&amp;rft.date=2015-09-15&amp;rft_id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1241%2Fsangakukanjournal.11.9_4&amp;rft.issn=1880-4128&amp;rft.aulast=Kishimoto&amp;rft.aufirst=Tadamitsu&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.jstage.jst.go.jp%2Farticle%2Fsangakukanjournal%2F11%2F9%2F11_4%2F_pdf%2F-char%2Fja&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2238" id="mwSys"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2238" id="mwSyw"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2238" id="mwSy0"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-nishikawa-1925-387" id="cite_note-nishikawa-1925-387" data-mw-footnote-number="364"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwSy4"><a href="#cite_ref-nishikawa-1925_387-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwSy8"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwSzA">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-nishikawa-1925-387" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2254" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwSzE" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:<ruby>然<rp>(</rp><rt>しか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し<ruby>乍<rp>(</rp><rt>なが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ら、かうして<ruby>每<rp>(</rp><rt>まい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>晚<rp>(</rp><rt>ばん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>中<rp>(</rp><rt>ちう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>途<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>半<rp>(</rp><rt>はん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>端<rp>(</rp><rt>ぱ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>眠<rp>(</rp><rt>ねむ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りを<ruby>妨<rp>(</rp><rt>さまた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げるために、ギユリオは十<ruby>分<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>休<rp>(</rp><rt>きう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>息<rp>(</rp><rt>そく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>得<rp>(</rp><rt>え</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ることが<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>で</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>來<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ませんでした。<ruby>朝<rp>(</rp><rt>あさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、<ruby>起<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きる<ruby>時<rp>(</rp><rt>とき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も<ruby>疲<rp>(</rp><rt>つか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れてゐるし、<ruby>夕<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>方<rp>(</rp><rt>がた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>學<rp>(</rp><rt>がく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>校<rp>(</rp><rt>かう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>復習<rp>(</rp><rt>おさらひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をしてゐる<ruby>時<rp>(</rp><rt>とき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>など、<ruby>眼<rp>(</rp><rt>め</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>開<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けてゐるのも<ruby>辛<rp>(</rp><rt>つら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>位<rp>(</rp><rt>くらゐ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でした。<ruby>或<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る<ruby>晚<rp>(</rp><rt>ばん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、<ruby>生<rp>(</rp><rt>うま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れて<ruby>初<rp>(</rp><rt>はじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めて、<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>自<rp>(</rp><rt>じ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>分<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>習<rp>(</rp><rt>しふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>字<rp>(</rp><rt>じ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>帳<rp>(</rp><rt>てう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>うへ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>眠<rp>(</rp><rt>ねむ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りこけてしまひました。<br/>「しつかりしろ！　しつかりしろ！」と、お<ruby>父<rp>(</rp><rt>とう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>樣<rp>(</rp><rt>さま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は、<ruby>手<rp>(</rp><rt>て</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>拍<rp>(</rp><rt>たた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>乍<rp>(</rp><rt>なが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ら、<ruby>叫<rp>(</rp><rt>さけ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>び<ruby>立<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>てました。<br/>「<ruby>勉<rp>(</rp><rt>べん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>强<rp>(</rp><rt>きやう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>せい！」<br/>ギユリオは<ruby>身<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>震<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ひしてまた<ruby>勉<rp>(</rp><rt>べん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>强<rp>(</rp><rt>きやう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>懸<rp>(</rp><rt>かゝ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りました。けれど、<ruby>翌<rp>(</rp><rt>あるく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>晚<rp>(</rp><rt>ばん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も、その<ruby>次<rp>(</rp><rt>つぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>晚<rp>(</rp><rt>ばん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も、<ruby>同<rp>(</rp><rt>おな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じ<ruby>事<rp>(</rp><rt>こと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>起<rp>(</rp><rt>おこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つて、だん〱<ruby>惡<rp>(</rp><rt>わる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くなつて<ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きました。<ruby>書<rp>(</rp><rt>しよ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>物<rp>(</rp><rt>もつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>うへ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にまどろんだり、いつもより<ruby>朝<rp>(</rp><rt>あさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>寢<rp>(</rp><rt>ね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をしたり、<ruby>學<rp>(</rp><rt>がく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>課<rp>(</rp><rt>ゝわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>下<rp>(</rp><rt>した</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>調<rp>(</rp><rt>しら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べも<ruby>退<rp>(</rp><rt>たい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>屈<rp>(</rp><rt>くつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さうであつたり、<ruby>勉<rp>(</rp><rt>べん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>强<rp>(</rp><rt>きやう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>があき〱したやうに<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えました。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote=However, since he thus broke his sleep halfway through each night, Giulio did not get enough rest. He got up tired in the morning, and when he was doing schoolwork in the evening, he struggled to keep his eyes open. One evening, for the first time in his life, he fell asleep on his copybook.<br/>“Steady! Steady!” his father shouted, clapping his hands.<br/>“To work!”<br/>Giulio shook himself and got back to work. But the next evening and the ones after, the same thing happened and kept worsening. He dozed over his books, slept in more than usual, felt listless when preparing lessons, seemed sick and tired of study.&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=Senonchè, a rompersi così il sonno ogni notte, Giulio non riposava abbastanza, la mattina si levava stanco, e la sera, facendo il lavoro di scuola, stentava a tener gli occhi aperti. Una sera, — per la prima volta in vita sua, — s’addormentò sul quaderno. — Animo! animo! — gli gridò suo padre, battendo le mani, — al lavoro! — Egli si riscosse e si rimise al lavoro. Ma la sera dopo, e i giorni seguenti, fu la cosa medesima, e peggio: sonnecchiava sui libri, si levava più tardi del solito, studiava la lezione alla stracca, pareva svogliato dello studio.&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pp=200–201&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1016865/1/110&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:<ruby>少<rp>(</rp><rt>せう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>年<rp>(</rp><rt>ねん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>筆<rp>(</rp><rt>ひつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>工<rp>(</rp><rt>こう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-chapter=The Little Scribe&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=IL PICCOLO SCRIVANO FIORENTINO. (Racconto mensile.)&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:母をたずねて三千里　附錄　タングルウツド物語&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=[[Heart (novel)|Three Thousand Leagues in Search of Mother]], supplemented with [[Tanglewood Tales]]&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Cuore. Libro per i ragazzi&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Edmondo De Amicis&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Edmondo&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=De Amicis&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Nishikawa&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Tsutomu&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=30 March 1925&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|金塔社}}&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFDe_Amicis1925" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2254"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Edmondo_De_Amicis" title="Edmondo De Amicis" id="mwSzI">De Amicis, Edmondo</a> (30 March 1925). "IL PICCOLO SCRIVANO FIORENTINO. (Racconto mensile.)" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwSzM"><ruby id="mwSzQ">少<rp id="mwSzU">(</rp><rt id="mwSzY">せう</rt><rp id="mwSzc">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSzg">年<rp id="mwSzk">(</rp><rt id="mwSzo">ねん</rt><rp id="mwSzs">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwSzw">筆<rp id="mwSz0">(</rp><rt id="mwSz4">ひつ</rt><rp id="mwSz8">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwS0A">工<rp id="mwS0E">(</rp><rt id="mwS0I">こう</rt><rp id="mwS0M">)</rp></ruby></bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwS0Q">[</span>The Little Scribe<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwS0U">]</span>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1016865/1/110" class="external text" id="mwS0Y"><i id="mwS0c">Cuore. Libro per i ragazzi</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwS0g">母をたずねて三千里　附錄　タングルウツド物語</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwS0k">[</span><i id="mwS0o"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heart_(novel)" title="Heart (novel)" id="mwS0s">Three Thousand Leagues in Search of Mother</a>, supplemented with <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tanglewood_Tales" title="Tanglewood Tales" id="mwS0w">Tanglewood Tales</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwS00">]</span> (in Japanese). Translated by Nishikawa, Tsutomu. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwS04"><span lang="ja" id="mwS08">金塔社</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwS1A">. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwS1E">&nbsp;</span><span class="nowrap" id="mwS1I">200–</span>201. <q id="mwS1M">Senonchè, a rompersi così il sonno ogni notte, Giulio non riposava abbastanza, la mattina si levava stanco, e la sera, facendo il lavoro di scuola, stentava a tener gli occhi aperti. Una sera, — per la prima volta in vita sua, — s'addormentò sul quaderno. — Animo! animo! — gli gridò suo padre, battendo le mani, — al lavoro! — Egli si riscosse e si rimise al lavoro. Ma la sera dopo, e i giorni seguenti, fu la cosa medesima, e peggio: sonnecchiava sui libri, si levava più tardi del solito, studiava la lezione alla stracca, pareva svogliato dello studio.</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwS1Q"><ruby id="mwS1U">然<rp id="mwS1Y">(</rp><rt id="mwS1c">しか</rt><rp id="mwS1g">)</rp></ruby>し<ruby id="mwS1k">乍<rp id="mwS1o">(</rp><rt id="mwS1s">なが</rt><rp id="mwS1w">)</rp></ruby>ら、かうして<ruby id="mwS10">每<rp id="mwS14">(</rp><rt id="mwS18">まい</rt><rp id="mwS2A">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwS2E">晚<rp id="mwS2I">(</rp><rt id="mwS2M">ばん</rt><rp id="mwS2Q">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwS2U">中<rp id="mwS2Y">(</rp><rt id="mwS2c">ちう</rt><rp id="mwS2g">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwS2k">途<rp id="mwS2o">(</rp><rt id="mwS2s">と</rt><rp id="mwS2w">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwS20">半<rp id="mwS24">(</rp><rt id="mwS28">はん</rt><rp id="mwS3A">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwS3E">端<rp id="mwS3I">(</rp><rt id="mwS3M">ぱ</rt><rp id="mwS3Q">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwS3U">眠<rp id="mwS3Y">(</rp><rt id="mwS3c">ねむ</rt><rp id="mwS3g">)</rp></ruby>りを<ruby id="mwS3k">妨<rp id="mwS3o">(</rp><rt id="mwS3s">さまた</rt><rp id="mwS3w">)</rp></ruby>げるために、ギユリオは十<ruby id="mwS30">分<rp id="mwS34">(</rp><rt id="mwS38">ぶん</rt><rp id="mwS4A">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwS4E">休<rp id="mwS4I">(</rp><rt id="mwS4M">きう</rt><rp id="mwS4Q">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwS4U">息<rp id="mwS4Y">(</rp><rt id="mwS4c">そく</rt><rp id="mwS4g">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwS4k">得<rp id="mwS4o">(</rp><rt id="mwS4s">え</rt><rp id="mwS4w">)</rp></ruby>ることが<ruby id="mwS40">出<rp id="mwS44">(</rp><rt id="mwS48">で</rt><rp id="mwS5A">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwS5E">來<rp id="mwS5I">(</rp><rt id="mwS5M">き</rt><rp id="mwS5Q">)</rp></ruby>ませんでした。<ruby id="mwS5U">朝<rp id="mwS5Y">(</rp><rt id="mwS5c">あさ</rt><rp id="mwS5g">)</rp></ruby>、<ruby id="mwS5k">起<rp id="mwS5o">(</rp><rt id="mwS5s">お</rt><rp id="mwS5w">)</rp></ruby>きる<ruby id="mwS50">時<rp id="mwS54">(</rp><rt id="mwS58">とき</rt><rp id="mwS6A">)</rp></ruby>も<ruby id="mwS6E">疲<rp id="mwS6I">(</rp><rt id="mwS6M">つか</rt><rp id="mwS6Q">)</rp></ruby>れてゐるし、<ruby id="mwS6U">夕<rp id="mwS6Y">(</rp><rt id="mwS6c">ゆう</rt><rp id="mwS6g">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwS6k">方<rp id="mwS6o">(</rp><rt id="mwS6s">がた</rt><rp id="mwS6w">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwS60">學<rp id="mwS64">(</rp><rt id="mwS68">がく</rt><rp id="mwS7A">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwS7E">校<rp id="mwS7I">(</rp><rt id="mwS7M">かう</rt><rp id="mwS7Q">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwS7U">復習<rp id="mwS7Y">(</rp><rt id="mwS7c">おさらひ</rt><rp id="mwS7g">)</rp></ruby>をしてゐる<ruby id="mwS7k">時<rp id="mwS7o">(</rp><rt id="mwS7s">とき</rt><rp id="mwS7w">)</rp></ruby>など、<ruby id="mwS70">眼<rp id="mwS74">(</rp><rt id="mwS78">め</rt><rp id="mwS8A">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwS8E">開<rp id="mwS8I">(</rp><rt id="mwS8M">あ</rt><rp id="mwS8Q">)</rp></ruby>けてゐるのも<ruby id="mwS8U">辛<rp id="mwS8Y">(</rp><rt id="mwS8c">つら</rt><rp id="mwS8g">)</rp></ruby>い<ruby id="mwS8k">位<rp id="mwS8o">(</rp><rt id="mwS8s">くらゐ</rt><rp id="mwS8w">)</rp></ruby>でした。<ruby id="mwS80">或<rp id="mwS84">(</rp><rt id="mwS88">あ</rt><rp id="mwS9A">)</rp></ruby>る<ruby id="mwS9E">晚<rp id="mwS9I">(</rp><rt id="mwS9M">ばん</rt><rp id="mwS9Q">)</rp></ruby>、<ruby id="mwS9U">生<rp id="mwS9Y">(</rp><rt id="mwS9c">うま</rt><rp id="mwS9g">)</rp></ruby>れて<ruby id="mwS9k">初<rp id="mwS9o">(</rp><rt id="mwS9s">はじ</rt><rp id="mwS9w">)</rp></ruby>めて、<ruby id="mwS90">彼<rp id="mwS94">(</rp><rt id="mwS98">かれ</rt><rp id="mwS-A">)</rp></ruby>は<ruby id="mwS-E">自<rp id="mwS-I">(</rp><rt id="mwS-M">じ</rt><rp id="mwS-Q">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwS-U">分<rp id="mwS-Y">(</rp><rt id="mwS-c">ぶん</rt><rp id="mwS-g">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwS-k">習<rp id="mwS-o">(</rp><rt id="mwS-s">しふ</rt><rp id="mwS-w">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwS-0">字<rp id="mwS-4">(</rp><rt id="mwS-8">じ</rt><rp id="mwS_A">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwS_E">帳<rp id="mwS_I">(</rp><rt id="mwS_M">てう</rt><rp id="mwS_Q">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwS_U">上<rp id="mwS_Y">(</rp><rt id="mwS_c">うへ</rt><rp id="mwS_g">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwS_k">眠<rp id="mwS_o">(</rp><rt id="mwS_s">ねむ</rt><rp id="mwS_w">)</rp></ruby>りこけてしまひました。<br id="mwS_0">「しつかりしろ！　しつかりしろ！」と、お<ruby id="mwS_4">父<rp id="mwS_8">(</rp><rt id="mwTAA">とう</rt><rp id="mwTAE">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTAI">樣<rp id="mwTAM">(</rp><rt id="mwTAQ">さま</rt><rp id="mwTAU">)</rp></ruby>は、<ruby id="mwTAY">手<rp id="mwTAc">(</rp><rt id="mwTAg">て</rt><rp id="mwTAk">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwTAo">拍<rp id="mwTAs">(</rp><rt id="mwTAw">たた</rt><rp id="mwTA0">)</rp></ruby>き<ruby id="mwTA4">乍<rp id="mwTA8">(</rp><rt id="mwTBA">なが</rt><rp id="mwTBE">)</rp></ruby>ら、<ruby id="mwTBI">叫<rp id="mwTBM">(</rp><rt id="mwTBQ">さけ</rt><rp id="mwTBU">)</rp></ruby>び<ruby id="mwTBY">立<rp id="mwTBc">(</rp><rt id="mwTBg">た</rt><rp id="mwTBk">)</rp></ruby>てました。<br id="mwTBo">「<ruby id="mwTBs">勉<rp id="mwTBw">(</rp><rt id="mwTB0">べん</rt><rp id="mwTB4">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTB8">强<rp id="mwTCA">(</rp><rt id="mwTCE">きやう</rt><rp id="mwTCI">)</rp></ruby>せい！」<br id="mwTCM">ギユリオは<ruby id="mwTCQ">身<rp id="mwTCU">(</rp><rt id="mwTCY">み</rt><rp id="mwTCc">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTCg">震<rp id="mwTCk">(</rp><rt id="mwTCo">ぶる</rt><rp id="mwTCs">)</rp></ruby>ひしてまた<ruby id="mwTCw">勉<rp id="mwTC0">(</rp><rt id="mwTC4">べん</rt><rp id="mwTC8">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTDA">强<rp id="mwTDE">(</rp><rt id="mwTDI">きやう</rt><rp id="mwTDM">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwTDQ">懸<rp id="mwTDU">(</rp><rt id="mwTDY">かゝ</rt><rp id="mwTDc">)</rp></ruby>りました。けれど、<ruby id="mwTDg">翌<rp id="mwTDk">(</rp><rt id="mwTDo">あるく</rt><rp id="mwTDs">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTDw">晚<rp id="mwTD0">(</rp><rt id="mwTD4">ばん</rt><rp id="mwTD8">)</rp></ruby>も、その<ruby id="mwTEA">次<rp id="mwTEE">(</rp><rt id="mwTEI">つぎ</rt><rp id="mwTEM">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwTEQ">晚<rp id="mwTEU">(</rp><rt id="mwTEY">ばん</rt><rp id="mwTEc">)</rp></ruby>も、<ruby id="mwTEg">同<rp id="mwTEk">(</rp><rt id="mwTEo">おな</rt><rp id="mwTEs">)</rp></ruby>じ<ruby id="mwTEw">事<rp id="mwTE0">(</rp><rt id="mwTE4">こと</rt><rp id="mwTE8">)</rp></ruby>が<ruby id="mwTFA">起<rp id="mwTFE">(</rp><rt id="mwTFI">おこ</rt><rp id="mwTFM">)</rp></ruby>つて、だん〱<ruby id="mwTFQ">惡<rp id="mwTFU">(</rp><rt id="mwTFY">わる</rt><rp id="mwTFc">)</rp></ruby>くなつて<ruby id="mwTFg">行<rp id="mwTFk">(</rp><rt id="mwTFo">ゆ</rt><rp id="mwTFs">)</rp></ruby>きました。<ruby id="mwTFw">書<rp id="mwTF0">(</rp><rt id="mwTF4">しよ</rt><rp id="mwTF8">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTGA">物<rp id="mwTGE">(</rp><rt id="mwTGI">もつ</rt><rp id="mwTGM">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwTGQ">上<rp id="mwTGU">(</rp><rt id="mwTGY">うへ</rt><rp id="mwTGc">)</rp></ruby>にまどろんだり、いつもより<ruby id="mwTGg">朝<rp id="mwTGk">(</rp><rt id="mwTGo">あさ</rt><rp id="mwTGs">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTGw">寢<rp id="mwTG0">(</rp><rt id="mwTG4">ね</rt><rp id="mwTG8">)</rp></ruby>をしたり、<ruby id="mwTHA">學<rp id="mwTHE">(</rp><rt id="mwTHI">がく</rt><rp id="mwTHM">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTHQ">課<rp id="mwTHU">(</rp><rt id="mwTHY">ゝわ</rt><rp id="mwTHc">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwTHg">下<rp id="mwTHk">(</rp><rt id="mwTHo">した</rt><rp id="mwTHs">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTHw">調<rp id="mwTH0">(</rp><rt id="mwTH4">しら</rt><rp id="mwTH8">)</rp></ruby>べも<ruby id="mwTIA">退<rp id="mwTIE">(</rp><rt id="mwTII">たい</rt><rp id="mwTIM">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTIQ">屈<rp id="mwTIU">(</rp><rt id="mwTIY">くつ</rt><rp id="mwTIc">)</rp></ruby>さうであつたり、<ruby id="mwTIg">勉<rp id="mwTIk">(</rp><rt id="mwTIo">べん</rt><rp id="mwTIs">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTIw">强<rp id="mwTI0">(</rp><rt id="mwTI4">きやう</rt><rp id="mwTI8">)</rp></ruby>があき〱したやうに<ruby id="mwTJA">見<rp id="mwTJE">(</rp><rt id="mwTJI">み</rt><rp id="mwTJM">)</rp></ruby>えました。</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwTJQ">[</span>However, since he thus broke his sleep halfway through each night, Giulio did not get enough rest. He got up tired in the morning, and when he was doing schoolwork in the evening, he struggled to keep his eyes open. One evening, for the first time in his life, he fell asleep on his copybook.<br id="mwTJU">“Steady! Steady!” his father shouted, clapping his hands.<br id="mwTJY">“To work!”<br id="mwTJc">Giulio shook himself and got back to work. But the next evening and the ones after, the same thing happened and kept worsening. He dozed over his books, slept in more than usual, felt listless when preparing lessons, seemed sick and tired of study.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwTJg">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=IL+PICCOLO+SCRIVANO+FIORENTINO.+%28Racconto+mensile.%29+%3Cruby%3E%E5%B0%91%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%9B%E3%81%86%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E5%B9%B4%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%AD%E3%82%93%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E7%AD%86%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%B2%E3%81%A4%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E5%B7%A5%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%93%E3%81%86%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E&amp;rft.btitle=Cuore.+Libro+per+i+ragazzi+%E6%AF%8D%E3%82%92%E3%81%9F%E3%81%9A%E3%81%AD%E3%81%A6%E4%B8%89%E5%8D%83%E9%87%8C%E3%80%80%E9%99%84%E9%8C%84%E3%80%80%E3%82%BF%E3%83%B3%E3%82%B0%E3%83%AB%E3%82%A6%E3%83%84%E3%83%89%E7%89%A9%E8%AA%9E&amp;rft.pages=200-201&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E9%87%91%E5%A1%94%E7%A4%BE%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.date=1925-03-30&amp;rft.aulast=De+Amicis&amp;rft.aufirst=Edmondo&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1016865%2F1%2F110&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2254" id="mwTJk"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2254" id="mwTJo"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2254" id="mwTJs"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-388" id="cite_note-388" data-mw-footnote-number="365"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwTJw"><a href="#cite_ref-388" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwTJ0"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwTJ4">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-388" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2258" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwTJ8" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;news&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「先生，初速度はいくらですか」と新参の記者。糸川教授は「もう何度目の質問かな」と苦笑いをする。すかさず，強面のクラブ幹事が「ゼロだろうが，ゼロ。もっと勉強せい」と一喝する。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pp=12–13&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Shirahashi&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Seiichi&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:答えは「おおすみ」&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-work=ja:ISASニュース&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=February 2010&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=347&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;issn=0285-2861&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Institute of Space and Astronautical Science&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.isas.jaxa.jp/ISASnews/No.347/ISASnews347.pdf&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFShirahashi2010" class="citation news cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2258">Shirahashi, Seiichi (February 2010). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.isas.jaxa.jp/ISASnews/No.347/ISASnews347.pdf" class="external text" id="mwTKA"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwTKE">答えは「おおすみ」</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwTKI">(PDF)</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTKM">ISASニュース</bdi> (in Japanese). No.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwTKQ">&nbsp;</span>347. Institute of Space and Astronautical Science. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwTKU">&nbsp;</span><span class="nowrap" id="mwTKY">12–</span>13. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISSN_(identifier)" title="ISSN (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwTKc">ISSN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwTKg">&nbsp;</span><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://search.worldcat.org/issn/0285-2861" class="external text" id="mwTKk">0285-2861</a>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTKo">「先生，初速度はいくらですか」と新参の記者。糸川教授は「もう何度目の質問かな」と苦笑いをする。すかさず，強面のクラブ幹事が「ゼロだろうが，ゼロ。もっと勉強せい」と一喝する。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E7%AD%94%E3%81%88%E3%81%AF%E3%80%8C%E3%81%8A%E3%81%8A%E3%81%99%E3%81%BF%E3%80%8D&amp;rft.issue=347&amp;rft.pages=12-13&amp;rft.date=2010-02&amp;rft.issn=0285-2861&amp;rft.aulast=Shirahashi&amp;rft.aufirst=Seiichi&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.isas.jaxa.jp%2FISASnews%2FNo.347%2FISASnews347.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2258" id="mwTKs"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2258" id="mwTKw"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2258" id="mwTK0"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-389" id="cite_note-389" data-mw-footnote-number="366"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwTK4"><a href="#cite_ref-389" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwTK8"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwTLA">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-389" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2268" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwTLE" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:｢自分自身を愛するように他人を愛せ｣というキリスト教の倫理を転倒させ，｢他人を愛するように（同じことだが，他人が自分を愛するのと同程度で）自分自身を愛せ」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=8&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://ocu-omu.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/2002102/files/111C0000004-11102-2.pdf&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Shirogane&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Hisanori&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:アダム・スミスの方法：A Touch of Adam Smith&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:経済学雑誌 別冊&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=111&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=2&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=2010&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFShirogane2010" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2268">Shirogane, Hisanori (2010). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://ocu-omu.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/2002102/files/111C0000004-11102-2.pdf" class="external text" id="mwTLI"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwTLM">アダム・スミスの方法：A Touch of Adam Smith</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwTLQ">(PDF)</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTLU">経済学雑誌 別冊</bdi> (in Japanese). <b id="mwTLY">111</b> (2): 8.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTLc">｢自分自身を愛するように他人を愛せ｣というキリスト教の倫理を転倒させ，｢他人を愛するように（同じことだが，他人が自分を愛するのと同程度で）自分自身を愛せ」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E3%82%A2%E3%83%80%E3%83%A0%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%83%9F%E3%82%B9%E3%81%AE%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%EF%BC%9AA+Touch+of+Adam+Smith&amp;rft.volume=111&amp;rft.issue=2&amp;rft.pages=8&amp;rft.date=2010&amp;rft.aulast=Shirogane&amp;rft.aufirst=Hisanori&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Focu-omu.repo.nii.ac.jp%2Frecord%2F2002102%2Ffiles%2F111C0000004-11102-2.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2268" id="mwTLg"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2268" id="mwTLk"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2268" id="mwTLo"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-390" id="cite_note-390" data-mw-footnote-number="367"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwTLs"><a href="#cite_ref-390" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwTLw"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwTL0">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-390" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2275" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwTL4" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:支那人よ、支那を愛し、印度人よ、印度を愛し、英吉利人よ、英吉利を愛し、獨逸人よ、獨逸を愛しろ。我等わ祖國日本を愛する。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=254&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1098872/1/14&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:第二十五章 慈善と同情&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:純愛篇&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|人間理學講話}}&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=4&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=15 August 1936&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Rikichi&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Okamoto&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|美愛郷純真社}}&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Tsuzuki-ku, Yokohama|Tsuzuki, Kanagawa]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFOkamoto1936" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2275">Okamoto, Rikichi (15 August 1936).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTL8">第二十五章 慈善と同情</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1098872/1/14" class="external text" id="mwTMA"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwTME">純愛篇</bdi></a>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwTMI"><span lang="ja" id="mwTMM">人間理學講話</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwTMQ"> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwTMU">&nbsp;</span>4. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tsuzuki-ku,_Yokohama" title="Tsuzuki-ku, Yokohama" id="mwTMY">Tsuzuki, Kanagawa</a>: <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwTMc"><span lang="ja" id="mwTMg">美愛郷純真社</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwTMk">. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwTMo">&nbsp;</span>254.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTMs">支那人よ、支那を愛し、印度人よ、印度を愛し、英吉利人よ、英吉利を愛し、獨逸人よ、獨逸を愛しろ。我等わ祖國日本を愛する。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%94%E7%AB%A0+%E6%85%88%E5%96%84%E3%81%A8%E5%90%8C%E6%83%85&amp;rft.btitle=%E7%B4%94%E6%84%9B%E7%AF%87&amp;rft.place=Tsuzuki%2C+Kanagawa&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E4%BA%BA%E9%96%93%E7%90%86%E5%AD%B8%E8%AC%9B%E8%A9%B1%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=254&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E7%BE%8E%E6%84%9B%E9%83%B7%E7%B4%94%E7%9C%9F%E7%A4%BE%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.date=1936-08-15&amp;rft.aulast=Okamoto&amp;rft.aufirst=Rikichi&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1098872%2F1%2F14&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2275" id="mwTMw"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2275" id="mwTM0"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2275" id="mwTM4"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-391" id="cite_note-391" data-mw-footnote-number="368"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwTM8"><a href="#cite_ref-391" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwTNA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwTNE">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-391" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2283" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwTNI" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:聖書&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Holy Bible&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:マルコによる<ruby>福<rp></rp><rt>ふく</rt><rp></rp></ruby><ruby>音<rp></rp><rt>いん</rt><rp></rp></ruby><ruby>書<rp></rp><rt>しよ</rt><rp></rp></ruby>&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-chapter=The Gospel according to Mark&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=1955&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:<ruby>第<rp></rp><rt>だい</rt><rp></rp></ruby>二はこれである、『<ruby>自<rp></rp><rt>じ</rt><rp></rp></ruby><ruby>分<rp></rp><rt>ぶん</rt><rp></rp></ruby>を<ruby>愛<rp></rp><rt>あい</rt><rp></rp></ruby>するようにあなたの<ruby>隣<rp></rp><rt>とな</rt><rp></rp></ruby>り<ruby>人<rp></rp><rt>びと</rt><rp></rp></ruby>を<ruby>愛<rp></rp><rt>あい</rt><rp></rp></ruby>せよ』。&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Chūō, Tokyo]]&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Japan Bible Society&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=73&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2283" id="mwTNM"> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTNQ">マルコによる<ruby id="mwTNU">福<rp id="mwTNY"></rp><rt id="mwTNc">ふく</rt><rp id="mwTNg"></rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTNk">音<rp id="mwTNo"></rp><rt id="mwTNs">いん</rt><rp id="mwTNw"></rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTN0">書<rp id="mwTN4"></rp><rt id="mwTN8">しよ</rt><rp id="mwTOA"></rp></ruby></bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwTOE">[</span>The Gospel according to Mark<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwTOI">]</span>. <i id="mwTOM">Holy Bible</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTOQ">聖書</bdi> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chūō,_Tokyo" title="Chūō, Tokyo" id="mwTOU">Chūō, Tokyo</a>: Japan Bible Society. 1955. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwTOY">&nbsp;</span>73.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTOc"><ruby id="mwTOg">第<rp id="mwTOk"></rp><rt id="mwTOo">だい</rt><rp id="mwTOs"></rp></ruby>二はこれである、『<ruby id="mwTOw">自<rp id="mwTO0"></rp><rt id="mwTO4">じ</rt><rp id="mwTO8"></rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTPA">分<rp id="mwTPE"></rp><rt id="mwTPI">ぶん</rt><rp id="mwTPM"></rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwTPQ">愛<rp id="mwTPU"></rp><rt id="mwTPY">あい</rt><rp id="mwTPc"></rp></ruby>するようにあなたの<ruby id="mwTPg">隣<rp id="mwTPk"></rp><rt id="mwTPo">とな</rt><rp id="mwTPs"></rp></ruby>り<ruby id="mwTPw">人<rp id="mwTP0"></rp><rt id="mwTP4">びと</rt><rp id="mwTP8"></rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwTQA">愛<rp id="mwTQE"></rp><rt id="mwTQI">あい</rt><rp id="mwTQM"></rp></ruby>せよ』。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E3%83%9E%E3%83%AB%E3%82%B3%E3%81%AB%E3%82%88%E3%82%8B%3Cruby%3E%E7%A6%8F%3Crp%3E%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%B5%E3%81%8F%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E9%9F%B3%3Crp%3E%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%84%E3%82%93%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E6%9B%B8%3Crp%3E%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%97%E3%82%88%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E&amp;rft.btitle=Holy+Bible+%E8%81%96%E6%9B%B8&amp;rft.place=Ch%C5%AB%C5%8D%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=73&amp;rft.pub=Japan+Bible+Society&amp;rft.date=1955&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2283" id="mwTQQ"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2283" id="mwTQU"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2283" id="mwTQY"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-392" id="cite_note-392" data-mw-footnote-number="369"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwTQc"><a href="#cite_ref-392" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwTQg"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwTQk">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-392" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2299" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwTQo" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:けれどもそれを<ruby>橫<rp></rp><rt>よこ</rt><rp></rp></ruby><ruby>目<rp></rp><rt>め</rt><rp></rp></ruby>を<ruby>以<rp></rp><rt>もつ</rt><rp></rp></ruby>て<ruby>達<rp></rp><rt>たつ</rt><rp></rp></ruby>するといふことも<ruby>非<rp></rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp></rp></ruby><ruby>常<rp></rp><rt>じやう</rt><rp></rp></ruby>に<ruby>輕<rp></rp><rt>けい</rt><rp></rp></ruby><ruby>率<rp></rp><rt>そつ</rt><rp></rp></ruby>なことのやうに<ruby>見<rp></rp><rt>み</rt><rp></rp></ruby>える。[…]<ruby>町<rp></rp><rt>まち</rt><rp></rp></ruby><ruby>奉<rp></rp><rt>ぶ</rt><rp></rp></ruby><ruby>行<rp></rp><rt>ぎやう</rt><rp></rp></ruby>から<ruby>直<rp></rp><rt>ぢか</rt><rp></rp></ruby>に<ruby>御<rp></rp><rt>お</rt><rp></rp></ruby><ruby>長<rp></rp><rt>なが</rt><rp></rp></ruby><ruby>屋<rp></rp><rt>や</rt><rp></rp></ruby>を<ruby>立<rp></rp><rt>たち</rt><rp></rp></ruby><ruby>退<rp></rp><rt>の</rt><rp></rp></ruby>けといふことを<ruby>達<rp></rp><rt>たつ</rt><rp></rp></ruby>しろ、とでもいふことなんでせうか。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=165&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1234457/1/89&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:直木三十五の『南國太平記』&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:大衆文藝評判記&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Hanbunsha&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Engyo&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Mitamura&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=30 November 1933&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Kōjimachi]], Tokyo&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFMitamura1933" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2299">Mitamura, Engyo (30 November 1933).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTQs">直木三十五の『南國太平記』</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1234457/1/89" class="external text" id="mwTQw"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwTQ0">大衆文藝評判記</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kōjimachi" title="Kōjimachi" id="mwTQ4">Kōjimachi</a>, Tokyo: Hanbunsha. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwTQ8">&nbsp;</span>165.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTRA">けれどもそれを<ruby id="mwTRE">橫<rp id="mwTRI"></rp><rt id="mwTRM">よこ</rt><rp id="mwTRQ"></rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTRU">目<rp id="mwTRY"></rp><rt id="mwTRc">め</rt><rp id="mwTRg"></rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwTRk">以<rp id="mwTRo"></rp><rt id="mwTRs">もつ</rt><rp id="mwTRw"></rp></ruby>て<ruby id="mwTR0">達<rp id="mwTR4"></rp><rt id="mwTR8">たつ</rt><rp id="mwTSA"></rp></ruby>するといふことも<ruby id="mwTSE">非<rp id="mwTSI"></rp><rt id="mwTSM">ひ</rt><rp id="mwTSQ"></rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTSU">常<rp id="mwTSY"></rp><rt id="mwTSc">じやう</rt><rp id="mwTSg"></rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwTSk">輕<rp id="mwTSo"></rp><rt id="mwTSs">けい</rt><rp id="mwTSw"></rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTS0">率<rp id="mwTS4"></rp><rt id="mwTS8">そつ</rt><rp id="mwTTA"></rp></ruby>なことのやうに<ruby id="mwTTE">見<rp id="mwTTI"></rp><rt id="mwTTM">み</rt><rp id="mwTTQ"></rp></ruby>える。[…]<ruby id="mwTTU">町<rp id="mwTTY"></rp><rt id="mwTTc">まち</rt><rp id="mwTTg"></rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTTk">奉<rp id="mwTTo"></rp><rt id="mwTTs">ぶ</rt><rp id="mwTTw"></rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTT0">行<rp id="mwTT4"></rp><rt id="mwTT8">ぎやう</rt><rp id="mwTUA"></rp></ruby>から<ruby id="mwTUE">直<rp id="mwTUI"></rp><rt id="mwTUM">ぢか</rt><rp id="mwTUQ"></rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwTUU">御<rp id="mwTUY"></rp><rt id="mwTUc">お</rt><rp id="mwTUg"></rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTUk">長<rp id="mwTUo"></rp><rt id="mwTUs">なが</rt><rp id="mwTUw"></rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTU0">屋<rp id="mwTU4"></rp><rt id="mwTU8">や</rt><rp id="mwTVA"></rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwTVE">立<rp id="mwTVI"></rp><rt id="mwTVM">たち</rt><rp id="mwTVQ"></rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTVU">退<rp id="mwTVY"></rp><rt id="mwTVc">の</rt><rp id="mwTVg"></rp></ruby>けといふことを<ruby id="mwTVk">達<rp id="mwTVo"></rp><rt id="mwTVs">たつ</rt><rp id="mwTVw"></rp></ruby>しろ、とでもいふことなんでせうか。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E7%9B%B4%E6%9C%A8%E4%B8%89%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%94%E3%81%AE%E3%80%8E%E5%8D%97%E5%9C%8B%E5%A4%AA%E5%B9%B3%E8%A8%98%E3%80%8F&amp;rft.btitle=%E5%A4%A7%E8%A1%86%E6%96%87%E8%97%9D%E8%A9%95%E5%88%A4%E8%A8%98&amp;rft.place=K%C5%8Djimachi%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=165&amp;rft.pub=Hanbunsha&amp;rft.date=1933-11-30&amp;rft.aulast=Mitamura&amp;rft.aufirst=Engyo&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1234457%2F1%2F89&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2299" id="mwTV0"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2299" id="mwTV4"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2299" id="mwTV8"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-393" id="cite_note-393" data-mw-footnote-number="370"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwTWA"><a href="#cite_ref-393" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwTWE"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwTWI">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-393" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2307" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwTWM" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:1、唱歌敎授の眞の目的を達せよ。[…]前者は只其の目的を達する手段に過ぎないのである。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pp=44–45&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1455613/1/28&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:'''第五''' 各科學習上改善努力すべき點&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:改善を企圖せる我校經營方針&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=1 October 1928&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|香川縣高松市鶴屋町尋常小學校}}&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2307" id="mwTWQ"> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTWU"><b id="mwTWY">第五</b> 各科學習上改善努力すべき點</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1455613/1/28" class="external text" id="mwTWc"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwTWg">改善を企圖せる我校經營方針</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwTWk"><span lang="ja" id="mwTWo">香川縣高松市鶴屋町尋常小學校</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwTWs">. 1 October 1928. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwTWw">&nbsp;</span><span class="nowrap" id="mwTW0">44–</span>45.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTW4">1、唱歌敎授の眞の目的を達せよ。[…]前者は只其の目的を達する手段に過ぎないのである。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%94+%E5%90%84%E7%A7%91%E5%AD%B8%E7%BF%92%E4%B8%8A%E6%94%B9%E5%96%84%E5%8A%AA%E5%8A%9B%E3%81%99%E3%81%B9%E3%81%8D%E9%BB%9E&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%94%B9%E5%96%84%E3%82%92%E4%BC%81%E5%9C%96%E3%81%9B%E3%82%8B%E6%88%91%E6%A0%A1%E7%B6%93%E7%87%9F%E6%96%B9%E9%87%9D&amp;rft.pages=44-45&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E9%A6%99%E5%B7%9D%E7%B8%A3%E9%AB%98%E6%9D%BE%E5%B8%82%E9%B6%B4%E5%B1%8B%E7%94%BA%E5%B0%8B%E5%B8%B8%E5%B0%8F%E5%AD%B8%E6%A0%A1%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.date=1928-10-01&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1455613%2F1%2F28&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2307" id="mwTW8"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2307" id="mwTXA"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2307" id="mwTXE"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-394" id="cite_note-394" data-mw-footnote-number="371"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwTXI"><a href="#cite_ref-394" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwTXM"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwTXQ">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-394" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2320" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwTXU" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:察するに彼女は當人の言葉を籍りていふと、[…]「[…]尤も、わしがお前の惡口をいつたんでないことは察しろよ。」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pp=89, 256&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1704001/1/49&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:流浪の民 ロシア短篇珠玉集&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|世界文學叢書}}&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=26&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Sekai Bungaku Sha&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Nakayama&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Shōzaburō&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Alexander Sergeyevich&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Pushkin&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Alexander Pushkin&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=15 June 1948&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Shimogyō-ku, Kyoto|Shimogyō, Kyoto]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFPushkin1948" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2320"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alexander_Pushkin" title="Alexander Pushkin" id="mwTXY">Pushkin, Alexander Sergeyevich</a> (15 June 1948). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1704001/1/49" class="external text" id="mwTXc"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwTXg">流浪の民 ロシア短篇珠玉集</bdi></a>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwTXk"><span lang="ja" id="mwTXo">世界文學叢書</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwTXs"> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwTXw">&nbsp;</span>26. Translated by Nakayama, Shōzaburō. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shimogyō-ku,_Kyoto" title="Shimogyō-ku, Kyoto" id="mwTX0">Shimogyō, Kyoto</a>: Sekai Bungaku Sha. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwTX4">&nbsp;</span>89, 256.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTX8">察するに彼女は當人の言葉を籍りていふと、[…]「[…]尤も、わしがお前の惡口をいつたんでないことは察しろよ。」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%B5%81%E6%B5%AA%E3%81%AE%E6%B0%91+%E3%83%AD%E3%82%B7%E3%82%A2%E7%9F%AD%E7%AF%87%E7%8F%A0%E7%8E%89%E9%9B%86&amp;rft.place=Shimogy%C5%8D%2C+Kyoto&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E6%96%87%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=89%2C+256&amp;rft.pub=Sekai+Bungaku+Sha&amp;rft.date=1948-06-15&amp;rft.aulast=Pushkin&amp;rft.aufirst=Alexander+Sergeyevich&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1704001%2F1%2F49&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2320" id="mwTYA"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2320" id="mwTYE"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2320" id="mwTYI"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-395" id="cite_note-395" data-mw-footnote-number="372"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwTYM"><a href="#cite_ref-395" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwTYQ"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwTYU">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-395" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2338" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwTYY" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:オーランド ねえ君、僕が戀してることを、ほんとに君に信じてもらいたいよ。<br/>ロザリンド 僕に信じろ、つてかい。いつそ君の好きだという人に信じてもらう方が早いよ。保證するけれど、その女は口ではそう言わなくても、案外はやく信ずるものだよ。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=88&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=Orlando. Fair youth, I would I could make thee believe I love.<br/>Rosalind. Me believe it! you may as soon make her that you love believe it; which I warrant she is apter to do than to confess she does;&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://core.ac.uk/download/pdf/145770080.pdf&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Suzuki&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Shūji&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:シェクスピア喜劇に於ける扮装&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Disguises in Shakespeare's comedies&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:藝文研究&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal=Journal of Arts and Letters&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=8&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=October 1958&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|慶應義塾大学藝文学会}}&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFSuzuki1958" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2338">Suzuki, Shūji (October 1958). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://core.ac.uk/download/pdf/145770080.pdf" class="external text" id="mwTYc">"Disguises in Shakespeare's comedies" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTYg">シェクスピア喜劇に於ける扮装</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwTYk">(PDF)</span>. <i id="mwTYo">Journal of Arts and Letters</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTYs">藝文研究</bdi> (in Japanese). <b id="mwTYw">8</b>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwTY0"><span lang="ja" id="mwTY4">慶應義塾大学藝文学会</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwTY8">: 88. <q id="mwTZA">Orlando. Fair youth, I would I could make thee believe I love.<br id="mwTZE">Rosalind. Me believe it! you may as soon make her that you love believe it; which I warrant she is apter to do than to confess she does;</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTZI">オーランド ねえ君、僕が戀してることを、ほんとに君に信じてもらいたいよ。<br id="mwTZM">ロザリンド 僕に信じろ、つてかい。いつそ君の好きだという人に信じてもらう方が早いよ。保證するけれど、その女は口ではそう言わなくても、案外はやく信ずるものだよ。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Journal+of+Arts+and+Letters&amp;rft.atitle=Disguises+in+Shakespeare%27s+comedies+%E3%82%B7%E3%82%A7%E3%82%AF%E3%82%B9%E3%83%94%E3%82%A2%E5%96%9C%E5%8A%87%E3%81%AB%E6%96%BC%E3%81%91%E3%82%8B%E6%89%AE%E8%A3%85&amp;rft.volume=8&amp;rft.pages=88&amp;rft.date=1958-10&amp;rft.aulast=Suzuki&amp;rft.aufirst=Sh%C5%ABji&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fcore.ac.uk%2Fdownload%2Fpdf%2F145770080.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2338" id="mwTZQ"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2338" id="mwTZU"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2338" id="mwTZY"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-396" id="cite_note-396" data-mw-footnote-number="373"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwTZc"><a href="#cite_ref-396" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwTZg"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwTZk">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-396" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2347" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwTZo" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:その坊さんはいろんな古風な信仰のよくないことを說き聞かせ、予言や夢を信ずることに反対して、もっぱら<ruby>佛<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>陀<rp>(</rp><rt>だ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の敎えを信ぜよと說く人ですが、檀家からは非常に親しまれています。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=152&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:あたりまえのこと&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:小泉八雲代表作集 耳なし芳一&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|日本童話小說文庫}}&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=11&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Lafcadio Hearn&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Koizumi&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Yakumo&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Sangū&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Makoto&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1169083/1/89&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=20 June 1950&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Komine Shoten&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFKoizumi1950" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2347"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lafcadio_Hearn" title="Lafcadio Hearn" id="mwTZs">Koizumi, Yakumo</a> (20 June 1950).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTZw">あたりまえのこと</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1169083/1/89" class="external text" id="mwTZ0"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwTZ4">小泉八雲代表作集 耳なし芳一</bdi></a>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwTZ8"><span lang="ja" id="mwTaA">日本童話小說文庫</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwTaE"> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwTaI">&nbsp;</span>11. Translated by Sangū, Makoto. Komine Shoten. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwTaM">&nbsp;</span>152.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTaQ">その坊さんはいろんな古風な信仰のよくないことを說き聞かせ、予言や夢を信ずることに反対して、もっぱら<ruby id="mwTaU">佛<rp id="mwTaY">(</rp><rt id="mwTac">ぶつ</rt><rp id="mwTag">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTak">陀<rp id="mwTao">(</rp><rt id="mwTas">だ</rt><rp id="mwTaw">)</rp></ruby>の敎えを信ぜよと說く人ですが、檀家からは非常に親しまれています。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E3%81%82%E3%81%9F%E3%82%8A%E3%81%BE%E3%81%88%E3%81%AE%E3%81%93%E3%81%A8&amp;rft.btitle=%E5%B0%8F%E6%B3%89%E5%85%AB%E9%9B%B2%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%BD%9C%E9%9B%86+%E8%80%B3%E3%81%AA%E3%81%97%E8%8A%B3%E4%B8%80&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E7%AB%A5%E8%A9%B1%E5%B0%8F%E8%AA%AA%E6%96%87%E5%BA%AB%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=152&amp;rft.pub=Komine+Shoten&amp;rft.date=1950-06-20&amp;rft.aulast=Koizumi&amp;rft.aufirst=Yakumo&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1169083%2F1%2F89&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2347" id="mwTa0"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2347" id="mwTa4"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2347" id="mwTa8"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-397" id="cite_note-397" data-mw-footnote-number="374"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwTbA"><a href="#cite_ref-397" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwTbE"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwTbI">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-397" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2350" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwTbM" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「人間よ，汝自身を信ぜよ，（Glauben an dich selbst）汝が本質の内的感覚（innern sinn deines Wesens）を信ぜよ，然らば汝は神と不死を信ずる。」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=32&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://rose-ibadai.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/15992/files/CSI2010_2412.pdf&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Ōtani&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Tokinaka&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:自然、縁起、現実、個性と教育的人間像—その二、ペスタロッチの〝陰者の夕暮〟に於ける仏教思想的なひびきを中心として—&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:茨城大学教育学部紀要&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=11&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;year=1962&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFŌtani1962" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2350">Ōtani, Tokinaka (1962). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://rose-ibadai.repo.nii.ac.jp/record/15992/files/CSI2010_2412.pdf" class="external text" id="mwTbQ"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwTbU">自然、縁起、現実、個性と教育的人間像—その二、ペスタロッチの〝陰者の夕暮〟に於ける仏教思想的なひびきを中心として—</bdi></a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwTbY">(PDF)</span>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTbc">茨城大学教育学部紀要</bdi> (in Japanese) (11): 32.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTbg">「人間よ，汝自身を信ぜよ，（Glauben an dich selbst）汝が本質の内的感覚（innern sinn deines Wesens）を信ぜよ，然らば汝は神と不死を信ずる。」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6%E3%80%81%E7%B8%81%E8%B5%B7%E3%80%81%E7%8F%BE%E5%AE%9F%E3%80%81%E5%80%8B%E6%80%A7%E3%81%A8%E6%95%99%E8%82%B2%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E9%96%93%E5%83%8F%E2%80%94%E3%81%9D%E3%81%AE%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E3%83%9A%E3%82%B9%E3%82%BF%E3%83%AD%E3%83%83%E3%83%81%E3%81%AE%E3%80%9D%E9%99%B0%E8%80%85%E3%81%AE%E5%A4%95%E6%9A%AE%E3%80%9F%E3%81%AB%E6%96%BC%E3%81%91%E3%82%8B%E4%BB%8F%E6%95%99%E6%80%9D%E6%83%B3%E7%9A%84%E3%81%AA%E3%81%B2%E3%81%B3%E3%81%8D%E3%82%92%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83%E3%81%A8%E3%81%97%E3%81%A6%E2%80%94&amp;rft.issue=11&amp;rft.pages=32&amp;rft.date=1962&amp;rft.aulast=%C5%8Ctani&amp;rft.aufirst=Tokinaka&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Frose-ibadai.repo.nii.ac.jp%2Frecord%2F15992%2Ffiles%2FCSI2010_2412.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2350" id="mwTbk"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2350" id="mwTbo"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2350" id="mwTbs"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-398" id="cite_note-398" data-mw-footnote-number="375"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwTbw"><a href="#cite_ref-398" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwTb0"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwTb4">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-398" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2353" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwTb8" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:佛の法を信じよと言つても信ずる者は誰もない。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=168&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:立正安國論&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:立正安國論&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|日蓮上人遺文大講座}}&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=1&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Heibonsha&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1239916/1/89&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=8 September 1937&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Kobayashi&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Ichirō&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Nihonbashi]], Tokyo&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFKobayashi1937" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2353">Kobayashi, Ichirō (8 September 1937).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTcA">立正安國論</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1239916/1/89" class="external text" id="mwTcE"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwTcI">立正安國論</bdi></a>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwTcM"><span lang="ja" id="mwTcQ">日蓮上人遺文大講座</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwTcU"> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwTcY">&nbsp;</span>1. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nihonbashi" title="Nihonbashi" id="mwTcc">Nihonbashi</a>, Tokyo: Heibonsha. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwTcg">&nbsp;</span>168.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTck">佛の法を信じよと言つても信ずる者は誰もない。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E7%AB%8B%E6%AD%A3%E5%AE%89%E5%9C%8B%E8%AB%96&amp;rft.btitle=%E7%AB%8B%E6%AD%A3%E5%AE%89%E5%9C%8B%E8%AB%96&amp;rft.place=Nihonbashi%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E6%97%A5%E8%93%AE%E4%B8%8A%E4%BA%BA%E9%81%BA%E6%96%87%E5%A4%A7%E8%AC%9B%E5%BA%A7%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=168&amp;rft.pub=Heibonsha&amp;rft.date=1937-09-08&amp;rft.aulast=Kobayashi&amp;rft.aufirst=Ichir%C5%8D&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1239916%2F1%2F89&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2353" id="mwTco"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2353" id="mwTcs"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2353" id="mwTcw"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-399" id="cite_note-399" data-mw-footnote-number="376"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwTc0"><a href="#cite_ref-399" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwTc4"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwTc8">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-399" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2356" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwTdA" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:Sic michi credas, maganis promissoribus nil credas.（だから私の言うことを信じよ。貴方に多く約束をする人の言うことを，何も信ずるな。）&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=185&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://chukyo-u.repo.nii.ac.jp/?action=repository_action_common_download&amp;item_id=13060&amp;item_no=1&amp;attribute_id=20&amp;file_no=1&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Hashimoto&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Tadayoshi&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:ヨハネス・パウリ：冗談とまじめ(8)&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:中京大学教養論叢&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=34&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;number=4&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=May 1994&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFHashimoto1994" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2356">Hashimoto, Tadayoshi (May 1994). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://chukyo-u.repo.nii.ac.jp/?action=repository_action_common_download&amp;item_id=13060&amp;item_no=1&amp;attribute_id=20&amp;file_no=1" class="external text" id="mwTdE"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwTdI">ヨハネス・パウリ：冗談とまじめ(8)</bdi></a>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTdM">中京大学教養論叢</bdi> (in Japanese). <b id="mwTdQ">34</b> (4): 185.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTdU">Sic michi credas, maganis promissoribus nil credas.（だから私の言うことを信じよ。貴方に多く約束をする人の言うことを，何も信ずるな。）</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E3%83%A8%E3%83%8F%E3%83%8D%E3%82%B9%E3%83%BB%E3%83%91%E3%82%A6%E3%83%AA%EF%BC%9A%E5%86%97%E8%AB%87%E3%81%A8%E3%81%BE%E3%81%98%E3%82%81%288%29&amp;rft.volume=34&amp;rft.issue=4&amp;rft.pages=185&amp;rft.date=1994-05&amp;rft.aulast=Hashimoto&amp;rft.aufirst=Tadayoshi&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fchukyo-u.repo.nii.ac.jp%2F%3Faction%3Drepository_action_common_download%26item_id%3D13060%26item_no%3D1%26attribute_id%3D20%26file_no%3D1&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2356" id="mwTdY"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2356" id="mwTdc"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2356" id="mwTdg"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-400" id="cite_note-400" data-mw-footnote-number="377"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwTdk"><a href="#cite_ref-400" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwTdo"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwTds">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-400" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2384" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwTdw" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"><cite id="CITEREFAmano1915" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source">Amano, Fujio (30 July 1915).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTd0">第一五章 年中行事と俚謠</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/953873/1/248" class="external text" id="mwTd4"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwTd8">地方青年團の現在<small id="mwTeA">及</small>将来</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kōjimachi" title="Kōjimachi" id="mwTeE">Kōjimachi</a>, Tokyo: Rakuyōdō. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwTeI">&nbsp;</span>454.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTeM"><span style="text-emphasis:open circle" id="mwTeQ">すると此方へ來よと言はんばかりに炬火が招いてゐる。</span></bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%94%E7%AB%A0+%E5%B9%B4%E4%B8%AD%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%8B%E3%81%A8%E4%BF%9A%E8%AC%A0&amp;rft.btitle=%E5%9C%B0%E6%96%B9%E9%9D%92%E5%B9%B4%E5%9C%98%E3%81%AE%E7%8F%BE%E5%9C%A8%3Csmall%3E%E5%8F%8A%3C%2Fsmall%3E%E5%B0%86%E6%9D%A5&amp;rft.place=K%C5%8Djimachi%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=454&amp;rft.pub=Rakuy%C5%8Dd%C5%8D&amp;rft.date=1915-07-30&amp;rft.aulast=Amano&amp;rft.aufirst=Fujio&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F953873%2F1%2F248&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" id="mwTeU"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" id="mwTeY"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" id="mwTec"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-tanizaki-1916-401" id="cite_note-tanizaki-1916-401" data-mw-footnote-number="378"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwTeg"><a href="#cite_ref-tanizaki-1916_401-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwTek"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwTeo">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-tanizaki-1916-401" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2389" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwTes" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"><cite id="CITEREFMerezhkovsky1916" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dmitry_Merezhkovsky" title="Dmitry Merezhkovsky" id="mwTew">Merezhkovsky, Dmitry Sergeyevich</a> (5 February 1916). "Книга 4. Шабаш ведьм (1494)" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTe0"><b id="mwTe4">第四編</b> <ruby id="mwTe8">巫女<rp id="mwTfA">(</rp><rt id="mwTfE">みこ</rt><rp id="mwTfI">)</rp></ruby>の安息日——<small id="mwTfM">（千四百九十四年）</small></bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwTfQ">[</span><b id="mwTfU">Book 4.</b> The Witch’s Sabbath——<small id="mwTfY">(1494)</small><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwTfc">]</span>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/953004/1/82" class="external text" id="mwTfg"><i id="mwTfk">Воскресшие боги. Леонардо да Винчи</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTfo">先驅者</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwTfs">[</span><i id="mwTfw"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Romance_of_Leonardo_da_Vinci" title="The Romance of Leonardo da Vinci" id="mwTf0">The Precursor</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwTf4">]</span>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwTf8"><span lang="ja" id="mwTgA">近世文學</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwTgE"> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwTgI">&nbsp;</span>6. Translated by Tanizaki, Seiji. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ushigome" title="Ushigome" id="mwTgM">Ushigome</a>, Tokyo: Waseda University Press. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwTgQ">&nbsp;</span>153. <q id="mwTgU">Обнаженный юноша Вакх открыл объятья Кассандре, и голос его подобен был грому, потрясающему небо и землю:<br id="mwTgY">— Приди, приди, невеста моя, голубица моя непорочная!<br id="mwTgc">Кассандра упала в объятия бога.</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTgg"><ruby id="mwTgk">長<rp id="mwTgo">(</rp><rt id="mwTgs">とこし</rt><rp id="mwTgw">)</rp></ruby>へに<ruby id="mwTg0">若<rp id="mwTg4">(</rp><rt id="mwTg8">わか</rt><rp id="mwThA">)</rp></ruby>いバッカスは<ruby id="mwThE">腕<rp id="mwThI">(</rp><rt id="mwThM">うで</rt><rp id="mwThQ">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwThU">擴<rp id="mwThY">(</rp><rt id="mwThc">ひろ</rt><rp id="mwThg">)</rp></ruby>げてカッサンドラを<ruby id="mwThk">迎<rp id="mwTho">(</rp><rt id="mwThs">むか</rt><rp id="mwThw">)</rp></ruby>へた。<ruby id="mwTh0">雷<rp id="mwTh4">(</rp><rt id="mwTh8">らい</rt><rp id="mwTiA">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTiE">鳴<rp id="mwTiI">(</rp><rt id="mwTiM">めい</rt><rp id="mwTiQ">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwTiU">樣<rp id="mwTiY">(</rp><rt id="mwTic">やう</rt><rp id="mwTig">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwTik">天<rp id="mwTio">(</rp><rt id="mwTis">てん</rt><rp id="mwTiw">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTi0">地<rp id="mwTi4">(</rp><rt id="mwTi8">ち</rt><rp id="mwTjA">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwTjE">撼<rp id="mwTjI">(</rp><rt id="mwTjM">うご</rt><rp id="mwTjQ">)</rp></ruby>かしつゝ<ruby id="mwTjU">彼<rp id="mwTjY">(</rp><rt id="mwTjc">かれ</rt><rp id="mwTjg">)</rp></ruby>は<ruby id="mwTjk">叫<rp id="mwTjo">(</rp><rt id="mwTjs">さけ</rt><rp id="mwTjw">)</rp></ruby>んだ。<br id="mwTj0">『<ruby id="mwTj4">我<rp id="mwTj8">(</rp><rt id="mwTkA">わ</rt><rp id="mwTkE">)</rp></ruby>が<ruby id="mwTkI">花<rp id="mwTkM">(</rp><rt id="mwTkQ">はな</rt><rp id="mwTkU">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTkY">娶<rp id="mwTkc">(</rp><rt id="mwTkg">よめ</rt><rp id="mwTkk">)</rp></ruby>よ、<ruby id="mwTko">無<rp id="mwTks">(</rp><rt id="mwTkw">む</rt><rp id="mwTk0">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTk4">垢<rp id="mwTk8">(</rp><rt id="mwTlA">く</rt><rp id="mwTlE">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwTlI">處<rp id="mwTlM">(</rp><rt id="mwTlQ">しよ</rt><rp id="mwTlU">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTlY">女<rp id="mwTlc">(</rp><rt id="mwTlg">ぢよ</rt><rp id="mwTlk">)</rp></ruby>よ、<ruby id="mwTlo">此<rp id="mwTls">(</rp><rt id="mwTlw">こ</rt><rp id="mwTl0">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTl4">處<rp id="mwTl8">(</rp><rt id="mwTmA">こ</rt><rp id="mwTmE">)</rp></ruby>へ<ruby id="mwTmI">來<rp id="mwTmM">(</rp><rt id="mwTmQ">こ</rt><rp id="mwTmU">)</rp></ruby>よ。』<br id="mwTmY"><ruby id="mwTmc">彼<rp id="mwTmg">(</rp><rt id="mwTmk">か</rt><rp id="mwTmo">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwTms">女<rp id="mwTmw">(</rp><rt id="mwTm0">ぢよ</rt><rp id="mwTm4">)</rp></ruby>は<ruby id="mwTm8">神<rp id="mwTnA">(</rp><rt id="mwTnE">かみ</rt><rp id="mwTnI">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwTnM">抱<rp id="mwTnQ">(</rp><rt id="mwTnU">はう</rt><rp id="mwTnY">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTnc">擁<rp id="mwTng">(</rp><rt id="mwTnk">よう</rt><rp id="mwTno">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwTns">中<rp id="mwTnw">(</rp><rt id="mwTn0">なか</rt><rp id="mwTn4">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwTn8">身<rp id="mwToA">(</rp><rt id="mwToE">み</rt><rp id="mwToI">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwToM">沈<rp id="mwToQ">(</rp><rt id="mwToU">しづ</rt><rp id="mwToY">)</rp></ruby>めた。</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwToc">[</span>The ever young Bacchus opened his arms to Cassandra. He cried, shaking heaven and earth like thunder.<br id="mwTog">“My bride, mine immaculate virgin, come hither.”<br id="mwTok">She sank into the god’s embrace.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwToo">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%D0%9A%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B3%D0%B0+4.+%D0%A8%D0%B0%D0%B1%D0%B0%D1%88+%D0%B2%D0%B5%D0%B4%D1%8C%D0%BC+%281494%29+%E7%AC%AC%E5%9B%9B%E7%B7%A8+%3Cruby%3E%E5%B7%AB%E5%A5%B3%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%BF%E3%81%93%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%E3%81%AE%E5%AE%89%E6%81%AF%E6%97%A5%E2%80%94%E2%80%94%3Csmall%3E%EF%BC%88%E5%8D%83%E5%9B%9B%E7%99%BE%E4%B9%9D%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%B9%B4%EF%BC%89%3C%2Fsmall%3E&amp;rft.btitle=%D0%92%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%88%D0%B8%D0%B5+%D0%B1%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%B8.+%D0%9B%D0%B5%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%80%D0%B4%D0%BE+%D0%B4%D0%B0+%D0%92%D0%B8%D0%BD%D1%87%D0%B8+%E5%85%88%E9%A9%85%E8%80%85&amp;rft.place=Ushigome%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E8%BF%91%E4%B8%96%E6%96%87%E5%AD%B8%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=153&amp;rft.pub=Waseda+University+Press&amp;rft.date=1916-02-05&amp;rft.aulast=Merezhkovsky&amp;rft.aufirst=Dmitry+Sergeyevich&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F953004%2F1%2F82&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" id="mwTos"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" id="mwTow"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" id="mwTo0"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-402" id="cite_note-402" data-mw-footnote-number="379"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwTo4"><a href="#cite_ref-402" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwTo8"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwTpA">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-402" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2394" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwTpE" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"><cite id="CITEREFHaggard1919" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/H._Rider_Haggard" title="H. Rider Haggard" id="mwTpI">Haggard, Henry Rider</a> (17 February 1919). "Chapter XII: Before the Battle" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTpM">一二、愈々戰爭</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwTpQ">[</span>12, War at Last<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwTpU">]</span>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/959451/1/108" class="external text" id="mwTpY"><i id="mwTpc">King Solomon's Mines</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTpg">象狩の後</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwTpk">[</span><i id="mwTpo"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/King_Solomon's_Mines" title="King Solomon's Mines" id="mwTps">After the Elephant Hunt</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwTpw">]</span> (in Japanese). Translated by Katō, Asadori. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Asakusa" title="Asakusa" id="mwTp0">Asakusa</a>, Tokyo: Okamura Shoten. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwTp4">&nbsp;</span><span class="nowrap" id="mwTp8">200–</span>201. <q id="mwTqA"><span class="cs1-kern-left" id="mwTqE"></span>"I am the king; I say to you, I am the king," went on Ignosi, drawing up his great stature to its full, and lifting his broad-bladed battle-axe above his head. "If there be any man among you who says that it is not so, let him stand forth and I will fight him now, and his blood shall be a red token that I tell you true. Let him stand forth, I say"; and he shook the great axe till it flashed in the sunlight.<br id="mwTqI">As nobody seemed inclined to respond to this heroic version of "Dilly, Dilly, come and be killed," our late henchman proceeded with his address.<br id="mwTqM">"I am indeed the king, and should ye stand by my side in the battle, if I win the day, ye shall go with me to victory and honour. I will give you oxen and wives, and ye shall take place of all the regiments; and if ye fall, I will fall with you.<br id="mwTqQ">"And, behold, I give you this promise, that when I sit upon the seat of my fathers, bloodshed shall cease in the land. No longer shall ye cry for justice to find slaughter, no longer shall the witch-finder hunt you out so that ye may be slain without a cause. No man shall die save he who offends against the laws. The 'eating up' of your kraals shall cease; each one of you shall sleep secure in his own hut and fear naught, and justice shall walk blindfold throughout the land. Have ye chosen, chiefs, captains, soldiers, and people?"<span class="cs1-kern-right" id="mwTqU"></span></q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwTqY">「さらば<ruby id="mwTqc">私<rp id="mwTqg">(</rp><rt id="mwTqk">わたし</rt><rp id="mwTqo">)</rp></ruby>は<ruby id="mwTqs">王<rp id="mwTqw">(</rp><rt id="mwTq0">わう</rt><rp id="mwTq4">)</rp></ruby>である。お<ruby id="mwTq8">前<rp id="mwTrA">(</rp><rt id="mwTrE">まへ</rt><rp id="mwTrI">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTrM">等<rp id="mwTrQ">(</rp><rt id="mwTrU">ら</rt><rp id="mwTrY">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwTrc">吿<rp id="mwTrg">(</rp><rt id="mwTrk">つ</rt><rp id="mwTro">)</rp></ruby>げる、<ruby id="mwTrs">私<rp id="mwTrw">(</rp><rt id="mwTr0">わたし</rt><rp id="mwTr4">)</rp></ruby>は<ruby id="mwTr8">王<rp id="mwTsA">(</rp><rt id="mwTsE">わう</rt><rp id="mwTsI">)</rp></ruby>であるぞよ」と<ruby id="mwTsM">云<rp id="mwTsQ">(</rp><rt id="mwTsU">い</rt><rp id="mwTsY">)</rp></ruby>ひながら六<ruby id="mwTsc">尺<rp id="mwTsg">(</rp><rt id="mwTsk">しやく</rt><rp id="mwTso">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwTss">巨<rp id="mwTsw">(</rp><rt id="mwTs0">きよ</rt><rp id="mwTs4">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTs8">身<rp id="mwTtA">(</rp><rt id="mwTtE">しん</rt><rp id="mwTtI">)</rp></ruby>を十<ruby id="mwTtM">分<rp id="mwTtQ">(</rp><rt id="mwTtU">ぶん</rt><rp id="mwTtY">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTtc">伸<rp id="mwTtg">(</rp><rt id="mwTtk">の</rt><rp id="mwTto">)</rp></ruby>ばしておいて<ruby id="mwTts">手<rp id="mwTtw">(</rp><rt id="mwTt0">て</rt><rp id="mwTt4">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwTt8">持<rp id="mwTuA">(</rp><rt id="mwTuE">も</rt><rp id="mwTuI">)</rp></ruby>つた<ruby id="mwTuM">大<rp id="mwTuQ">(</rp><rt id="mwTuU">おほ</rt><rp id="mwTuY">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTuc">鉞<rp id="mwTug">(</rp><rt id="mwTuk">をの</rt><rp id="mwTuo">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwTus">眞<rp id="mwTuw">(</rp><rt id="mwTu0">まつ</rt><rp id="mwTu4">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTu8">甲<rp id="mwTvA">(</rp><rt id="mwTvE">かふ</rt><rp id="mwTvI">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwTvM">振<rp id="mwTvQ">(</rp><rt id="mwTvU">ふ</rt><rp id="mwTvY">)</rp></ruby>り<ruby id="mwTvc">被<rp id="mwTvg">(</rp><rt id="mwTvk">かぶ</rt><rp id="mwTvo">)</rp></ruby>つた。<br id="mwTvs">「<ruby id="mwTvw">今<rp id="mwTv0">(</rp><rt id="mwTv4">いま</rt><rp id="mwTv8">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTwA">若<rp id="mwTwE">(</rp><rt id="mwTwI">も</rt><rp id="mwTwM">)</rp></ruby>しお<ruby id="mwTwQ">前<rp id="mwTwU">(</rp><rt id="mwTwY">まへ</rt><rp id="mwTwc">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwTwg">等<rp id="mwTwk">(</rp><rt id="mwTwo">ら</rt><rp id="mwTws">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwTww">中<rp id="mwTw0">(</rp><rt id="mwTw4">なか</rt><rp id="mwTw8">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwTxA">私<rp id="mwTxE">(</rp><rt id="mwTxI">わたし</rt><rp id="mwTxM">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwTxQ">王<rp id="mwTxU">(</rp><rt id="mwTxY">わう</rt><rp id="mwTxc">)</rp></ruby>たる<ruby id="mwTxg">事<rp id="mwTxk">(</rp><rt id="mwTxo">こと</rt><rp id="mwTxs">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwTxw">拒<rp id="mwTx0">(</rp><rt id="mwTx4">こば</rt><rp id="mwTx8">)</rp></ruby>む<ruby id="mwTyA">者<rp id="mwTyE">(</rp><rt id="mwTyI">もの</rt><rp id="mwTyM">)</rp></ruby>があらば、<ruby id="mwTyQ">憚<rp id="mwTyU">(</rp><rt id="mwTyY">はゞか</rt><rp id="mwTyc">)</rp></ruby>りなく<ruby id="mwTyg">出<rp id="mwTyk">(</rp><rt id="mwTyo">で</rt><rp id="mwTys">)</rp></ruby>て<ruby id="mwTyw">來<rp id="mwTy0">(</rp><rt id="mwTy4">こ</rt><rp id="mwTy8">)</rp></ruby>よ。<ruby id="mwTzA">私<rp id="mwTzE">(</rp><rt id="mwTzI">わたし</rt><rp id="mwTzM">)</rp></ruby>は<ruby id="mwTzQ">其<rp id="mwTzU">(</rp><rt id="mwTzY">そ</rt><rp id="mwTzc">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwTzg">者<rp id="mwTzk">(</rp><rt id="mwTzo">もの</rt><rp id="mwTzs">)</rp></ruby>と一<ruby id="mwTzw">騎<rp id="mwTz0">(</rp><rt id="mwTz4">き</rt><rp id="mwTz8">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwT0A">打<rp id="mwT0E">(</rp><rt id="mwT0I">うち</rt><rp id="mwT0M">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwT0Q">勝<rp id="mwT0U">(</rp><rt id="mwT0Y">しよう</rt><rp id="mwT0c">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwT0g">負<rp id="mwT0k">(</rp><rt id="mwT0o">ぶ</rt><rp id="mwT0s">)</rp></ruby>をしやう。<ruby id="mwT0w">而<rp id="mwT00">(</rp><rt id="mwT04">そ</rt><rp id="mwT08">)</rp></ruby>して<ruby id="mwT1A">注<rp id="mwT1E">(</rp><rt id="mwT1I">そゝ</rt><rp id="mwT1M">)</rp></ruby>がん<ruby id="mwT1Q">血<rp id="mwT1U">(</rp><rt id="mwT1Y">ち</rt><rp id="mwT1c">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwT1g">汐<rp id="mwT1k">(</rp><rt id="mwT1o">しほ</rt><rp id="mwT1s">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwT1w">私<rp id="mwT10">(</rp><rt id="mwT14">わたし</rt><rp id="mwT18">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwT2A">心<rp id="mwT2E">(</rp><rt id="mwT2I">こゝろ</rt><rp id="mwT2M">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwT2Q">證<rp id="mwT2U">(</rp><rt id="mwT2Y">あかし</rt><rp id="mwT2c">)</rp></ruby>にしやう。」<br id="mwT2g">と<ruby id="mwT2k">叫<rp id="mwT2o">(</rp><rt id="mwT2s">さけ</rt><rp id="mwT2w">)</rp></ruby>んで<ruby id="mwT20">彼<rp id="mwT24">(</rp><rt id="mwT28">かれ</rt><rp id="mwT3A">)</rp></ruby>は<ruby id="mwT3E">鉞<rp id="mwT3I">(</rp><rt id="mwT3M">をの</rt><rp id="mwT3Q">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwT3U">前<rp id="mwT3Y">(</rp><rt id="mwT3c">ぜん</rt><rp id="mwT3g">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwT3k">後<rp id="mwT3o">(</rp><rt id="mwT3s">ご</rt><rp id="mwT3w">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwT30">左<rp id="mwT34">(</rp><rt id="mwT38">さ</rt><rp id="mwT4A">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwT4E">右<rp id="mwT4I">(</rp><rt id="mwT4M">いう</rt><rp id="mwT4Q">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwT4U">打<rp id="mwT4Y">(</rp><rt id="mwT4c">う</rt><rp id="mwT4g">)</rp></ruby>ちふりながら<ruby id="mwT4k">敵<rp id="mwT4o">(</rp><rt id="mwT4s">てき</rt><rp id="mwT4w">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwT40">現<rp id="mwT44">(</rp><rt id="mwT48">あらは</rt><rp id="mwT5A">)</rp></ruby>れ<ruby id="mwT5E">出<rp id="mwT5I">(</rp><rt id="mwT5M">で</rt><rp id="mwT5Q">)</rp></ruby>るのを<ruby id="mwT5U">待<rp id="mwT5Y">(</rp><rt id="mwT5c">ま</rt><rp id="mwT5g">)</rp></ruby>ち<ruby id="mwT5k">構<rp id="mwT5o">(</rp><rt id="mwT5s">かま</rt><rp id="mwT5w">)</rp></ruby>へたが、<ruby id="mwT50">誰<rp id="mwT54">(</rp><rt id="mwT58">だれ</rt><rp id="mwT6A">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwT6E">一<rp id="mwT6I">(</rp><rt id="mwT6M">ひと</rt><rp id="mwT6Q">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwT6U">人<rp id="mwT6Y">(</rp><rt id="mwT6c">り</rt><rp id="mwT6g">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwT6k">出<rp id="mwT6o">(</rp><rt id="mwT6s">で</rt><rp id="mwT6w">)</rp></ruby>て<ruby id="mwT60">來<rp id="mwT64">(</rp><rt id="mwT68">く</rt><rp id="mwT7A">)</rp></ruby>る<ruby id="mwT7E">者<rp id="mwT7I">(</rp><rt id="mwT7M">もの</rt><rp id="mwT7Q">)</rp></ruby>もない。<br id="mwT7U">「<ruby id="mwT7Y">私<rp id="mwT7c">(</rp><rt id="mwT7g">わたし</rt><rp id="mwT7k">)</rp></ruby>は<ruby id="mwT7o">眞<rp id="mwT7s">(</rp><rt id="mwT7w">まこと</rt><rp id="mwT70">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwT74">王<rp id="mwT78">(</rp><rt id="mwT8A">わう</rt><rp id="mwT8E">)</rp></ruby>である。<ruby id="mwT8I">而<rp id="mwT8M">(</rp><rt id="mwT8Q">そ</rt><rp id="mwT8U">)</rp></ruby>して<ruby id="mwT8Y">若<rp id="mwT8c">(</rp><rt id="mwT8g">も</rt><rp id="mwT8k">)</rp></ruby>し<ruby id="mwT8o">戰<rp id="mwT8s">(</rp><rt id="mwT8w">たゝかひ</rt><rp id="mwT80">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwT84">勝<rp id="mwT88">(</rp><rt id="mwT9A">か</rt><rp id="mwT9E">)</rp></ruby>たばお<ruby id="mwT9I">前<rp id="mwT9M">(</rp><rt id="mwT9Q">まへ</rt><rp id="mwT9U">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwT9Y">等<rp id="mwT9c">(</rp><rt id="mwT9g">ら</rt><rp id="mwT9k">)</rp></ruby>は<ruby id="mwT9o">凱<rp id="mwT9s">(</rp><rt id="mwT9w">がい</rt><rp id="mwT90">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwT94">旋<rp id="mwT98">(</rp><rt id="mwT-A">せん</rt><rp id="mwT-E">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwT-I">名<rp id="mwT-M">(</rp><rt id="mwT-Q">めい</rt><rp id="mwT-U">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwT-Y">譽<rp id="mwT-c">(</rp><rt id="mwT-g">よ</rt><rp id="mwT-k">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwT-o">着<rp id="mwT-s">(</rp><rt id="mwT-w">き</rt><rp id="mwT-0">)</rp></ruby>、そして<ruby id="mwT-4">其<rp id="mwT-8">(</rp><rt id="mwT_A">そ</rt><rp id="mwT_E">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwT_I">日<rp id="mwT_M">(</rp><rt id="mwT_Q">ひ</rt><rp id="mwT_U">)</rp></ruby>お<ruby id="mwT_Y">前<rp id="mwT_c">(</rp><rt id="mwT_g">まへ</rt><rp id="mwT_k">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwT_o">等<rp id="mwT_s">(</rp><rt id="mwT_w">ら</rt><rp id="mwT_0">)</rp></ruby>は<ruby id="mwT_4">牛<rp id="mwT_8">(</rp><rt id="mwUAA">うし</rt><rp id="mwUAE">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwUAI">得<rp id="mwUAM">(</rp><rt id="mwUAQ">え</rt><rp id="mwUAU">)</rp></ruby>、<ruby id="mwUAY">妻<rp id="mwUAc">(</rp><rt id="mwUAg">つま</rt><rp id="mwUAk">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwUAo">得<rp id="mwUAs">(</rp><rt id="mwUAw">う</rt><rp id="mwUA0">)</rp></ruby>るであらう。<ruby id="mwUA4">然<rp id="mwUA8">(</rp><rt id="mwUBA">しか</rt><rp id="mwUBE">)</rp></ruby>し<ruby id="mwUBI">不<rp id="mwUBM">(</rp><rt id="mwUBQ">ふ</rt><rp id="mwUBU">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwUBY">幸<rp id="mwUBc">(</rp><rt id="mwUBg">こう</rt><rp id="mwUBk">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwUBo">事<rp id="mwUBs">(</rp><rt id="mwUBw">ごと</rt><rp id="mwUB0">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwUB4">失<rp id="mwUB8">(</rp><rt id="mwUCA">しつ</rt><rp id="mwUCE">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwUCI">敗<rp id="mwUCM">(</rp><rt id="mwUCQ">ぱい</rt><rp id="mwUCU">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwUCY">終<rp id="mwUCc">(</rp><rt id="mwUCg">おは</rt><rp id="mwUCk">)</rp></ruby>らんか、<ruby id="mwUCo">其<rp id="mwUCs">(</rp><rt id="mwUCw">そ</rt><rp id="mwUC0">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwUC4">時<rp id="mwUC8">(</rp><rt id="mwUDA">とき</rt><rp id="mwUDE">)</rp></ruby>は<ruby id="mwUDI">私<rp id="mwUDM">(</rp><rt id="mwUDQ">わたし</rt><rp id="mwUDU">)</rp></ruby>もお<ruby id="mwUDY">前<rp id="mwUDc">(</rp><rt id="mwUDg">まへ</rt><rp id="mwUDk">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwUDo">等<rp id="mwUDs">(</rp><rt id="mwUDw">ら</rt><rp id="mwUD0">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwUD4">傍<rp id="mwUD8">(</rp><rt id="mwUEA">そば</rt><rp id="mwUEE">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwUEI">屍<rp id="mwUEM">(</rp><rt id="mwUEQ">かばね</rt><rp id="mwUEU">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwUEY">曝<rp id="mwUEc">(</rp><rt id="mwUEg">さら</rt><rp id="mwUEk">)</rp></ruby>すであらう。で、<ruby id="mwUEo">今<rp id="mwUEs">(</rp><rt id="mwUEw">いま</rt><rp id="mwUE0">)</rp></ruby>お<ruby id="mwUE4">前<rp id="mwUE8">(</rp><rt id="mwUFA">まへ</rt><rp id="mwUFE">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwUFI">等<rp id="mwUFM">(</rp><rt id="mwUFQ">ら</rt><rp id="mwUFU">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwUFY">約<rp id="mwUFc">(</rp><rt id="mwUFg">やく</rt><rp id="mwUFk">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwUFo">束<rp id="mwUFs">(</rp><rt id="mwUFw">そく</rt><rp id="mwUF0">)</rp></ruby>して<ruby id="mwUF4">置<rp id="mwUF8">(</rp><rt id="mwUGA">お</rt><rp id="mwUGE">)</rp></ruby>かう。<ruby id="mwUGI">若<rp id="mwUGM">(</rp><rt id="mwUGQ">も</rt><rp id="mwUGU">)</rp></ruby>し<ruby id="mwUGY">私<rp id="mwUGc">(</rp><rt id="mwUGg">わたし</rt><rp id="mwUGk">)</rp></ruby>が一<ruby id="mwUGo">國<rp id="mwUGs">(</rp><rt id="mwUGw">こく</rt><rp id="mwUG0">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwUG4">統<rp id="mwUG8">(</rp><rt id="mwUHA">とう</rt><rp id="mwUHE">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwUHI">御<rp id="mwUHM">(</rp><rt id="mwUHQ">ぎよ</rt><rp id="mwUHU">)</rp></ruby>するに<ruby id="mwUHY">至<rp id="mwUHc">(</rp><rt id="mwUHg">いた</rt><rp id="mwUHk">)</rp></ruby>つたなら、お<ruby id="mwUHo">前<rp id="mwUHs">(</rp><rt id="mwUHw">まへ</rt><rp id="mwUH0">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwUH4">等<rp id="mwUH8">(</rp><rt id="mwUIA">ら</rt><rp id="mwUIE">)</rp></ruby>は<ruby id="mwUII">今<rp id="mwUIM">(</rp><rt id="mwUIQ">いま</rt><rp id="mwUIU">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwUIY">迄<rp id="mwUIc">(</rp><rt id="mwUIg">まで</rt><rp id="mwUIk">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwUIo">虐<rp id="mwUIs">(</rp><rt id="mwUIw">ぎやく</rt><rp id="mwUI0">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwUI4">刑<rp id="mwUI8">(</rp><rt id="mwUJA">けい</rt><rp id="mwUJE">)</rp></ruby>をまぬかれ、<ruby id="mwUJI">血<rp id="mwUJM">(</rp><rt id="mwUJQ">ち</rt><rp id="mwUJU">)</rp></ruby>まみれの<ruby id="mwUJY">慘<rp id="mwUJc">(</rp><rt id="mwUJg">さん</rt><rp id="mwUJk">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwUJo">事<rp id="mwUJs">(</rp><rt id="mwUJw">じ</rt><rp id="mwUJ0">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwUJ4">見<rp id="mwUJ8">(</rp><rt id="mwUKA">み</rt><rp id="mwUKE">)</rp></ruby>る<ruby id="mwUKI">事<rp id="mwUKM">(</rp><rt id="mwUKQ">こと</rt><rp id="mwUKU">)</rp></ruby>なく、<ruby id="mwUKY">魔<rp id="mwUKc">(</rp><rt id="mwUKg">ま</rt><rp id="mwUKk">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwUKo">女<rp id="mwUKs">(</rp><rt id="mwUKw">ぢよ</rt><rp id="mwUK0">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwUK4">達<rp id="mwUK8">(</rp><rt id="mwULA">たち</rt><rp id="mwULE">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwULI">口<rp id="mwULM">(</rp><rt id="mwULQ">こう</rt><rp id="mwULU">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwULY">舌<rp id="mwULc">(</rp><rt id="mwULg">ぜつ</rt><rp id="mwULk">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwULo">依<rp id="mwULs">(</rp><rt id="mwULw">よ</rt><rp id="mwUL0">)</rp></ruby>つて<ruby id="mwUL4">罪<rp id="mwUL8">(</rp><rt id="mwUMA">つみ</rt><rp id="mwUME">)</rp></ruby>なくして<ruby id="mwUMI">殺<rp id="mwUMM">(</rp><rt id="mwUMQ">ころ</rt><rp id="mwUMU">)</rp></ruby>される<ruby id="mwUMY">憂<rp id="mwUMc">(</rp><rt id="mwUMg">うれひ</rt><rp id="mwUMk">)</rp></ruby>もない。<ruby id="mwUMo">故<rp id="mwUMs">(</rp><rt id="mwUMw">ゆゑ</rt><rp id="mwUM0">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwUM4">夜<rp id="mwUM8">(</rp><rt id="mwUNA">よる</rt><rp id="mwUNE">)</rp></ruby>も<ruby id="mwUNI">安<rp id="mwUNM">(</rp><rt id="mwUNQ">やす</rt><rp id="mwUNU">)</rp></ruby>らかに<ruby id="mwUNY">枕<rp id="mwUNc">(</rp><rt id="mwUNg">まくら</rt><rp id="mwUNk">)</rp></ruby>を<ruby id="mwUNo">高<rp id="mwUNs">(</rp><rt id="mwUNw">たか</rt><rp id="mwUN0">)</rp></ruby>うして<ruby id="mwUN4">眠<rp id="mwUN8">(</rp><rt id="mwUOA">ねむ</rt><rp id="mwUOE">)</rp></ruby>る<ruby id="mwUOI">事<rp id="mwUOM">(</rp><rt id="mwUOQ">こと</rt><rp id="mwUOU">)</rp></ruby>が<ruby id="mwUOY">出<rp id="mwUOc">(</rp><rt id="mwUOg">で</rt><rp id="mwUOk">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwUOo">來<rp id="mwUOs">(</rp><rt id="mwUOw">き</rt><rp id="mwUO0">)</rp></ruby>るであらう。それにしてもお<ruby id="mwUO4">前<rp id="mwUO8">(</rp><rt id="mwUPA">まへ</rt><rp id="mwUPE">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwUPI">等<rp id="mwUPM">(</rp><rt id="mwUPQ">ら</rt><rp id="mwUPU">)</rp></ruby>はこれを<ruby id="mwUPY">擇<rp id="mwUPc">(</rp><rt id="mwUPg">えら</rt><rp id="mwUPk">)</rp></ruby>ぶか、<ruby id="mwUPo">又<rp id="mwUPs">(</rp><rt id="mwUPw">また</rt><rp id="mwUP0">)</rp></ruby>はあれを<ruby id="mwUP4">擇<rp id="mwUP8">(</rp><rt id="mwUQA">えら</rt><rp id="mwUQE">)</rp></ruby>ぶか。」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=Chapter+XII%3A+Before+the+Battle+%E4%B8%80%E4%BA%8C%E3%80%81%E6%84%88%E3%80%85%E6%88%B0%E7%88%AD&amp;rft.btitle=King+Solomon%27s+Mines+%E8%B1%A1%E7%8B%A9%E3%81%AE%E5%BE%8C&amp;rft.place=Asakusa%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=200-201&amp;rft.pub=Okamura+Shoten&amp;rft.date=1919-02-17&amp;rft.aulast=Haggard&amp;rft.aufirst=Henry+Rider&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F959451%2F1%2F108&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" id="mwUQI"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" id="mwUQM"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" id="mwUQQ"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-403" id="cite_note-403" data-mw-footnote-number="380"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwUQU"><a href="#cite_ref-403" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwUQY"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwUQc">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-403" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2399" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwUQg" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"><cite id="CITEREFvon_Goethe1919" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Johann_Wolfgang_von_Goethe" title="Johann Wolfgang von Goethe" id="mwUQk">von Goethe, Johann Wolfgang</a> (4 October 1919). "Erſter Auftritt. Saal. Prinzeſſinn. Taſſo." <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUQo">第一齣 <small id="mwUQs">廣間 公女とタツソー</small></bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUQw">[</span>First Scene. <small id="mwUQ0">A Hall. The Princess and Tasso</small><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUQ4">]</span>. <i id="mwUQ8">Torquato Taſſo. Ein Schauſpiel</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwURA">トルクワト　タツソー　五幕物</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwURE">[</span><i id="mwURI"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Torquato_Tasso_(play)" title="Torquato Tasso (play)" id="mwURM">Torquato Tasso: A Five-Act Play</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwURQ">]</span>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwURU"><span lang="ja" id="mwURY">名脚本集</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwURc"> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwURg">&nbsp;</span>1. Translated by Sekiguchi, Tsugio. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Minamisenju" title="Minamisenju" class="mw-redirect" id="mwURk">Minamisenju</a>, Tokyo: Ibunkan. <q id="mwURo">Taſſo.<br id="mwURs">Unſicher folgen meine Schritte dir,<br id="mwURw">O Fürſtinn, und Gedanken ohne Maß<br id="mwUR0">Und Ordnung regen ſich in meiner Seele.<br id="mwUR4">Mir ſcheint die Einſamkeit zu winken, mich<br id="mwUR8">Gefällig anzulispeln: komm, ich löſe<br id="mwUSA">Die neu erregten Zweifel deiner Bruſt.</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUSE"><b id="mwUSI">タツソー</b>　かくお後へ跡いては參つたと申すものの自分乍ら足許の賴り無さ、おゝ、公女さま、私の頭の中には今や無量の、<span style="text-emphasis:sesame" id="mwUSM">ごつちや</span>に亂れた考が涌いて參りました。孤獨の世界が親しげに囁きつゝ私を手招きして、此方へ來よ、今度またお前の胸に涌いて來た疑惑をおれが解いてやらうと申してゐます。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=Er%C5%BFter+Auftritt.+Saal.+Prinze%C5%BF%C5%BFinn.+Ta%C5%BF%C5%BFo.+%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E9%BD%A3+%3Csmall%3E%E5%BB%A3%E9%96%93+%E5%85%AC%E5%A5%B3%E3%81%A8%E3%82%BF%E3%83%84%E3%82%BD%E3%83%BC%3C%2Fsmall%3E&amp;rft.btitle=Torquato+Ta%C5%BF%C5%BFo.+Ein+Schau%C5%BFpiel.+%E3%83%88%E3%83%AB%E3%82%AF%E3%83%AF%E3%83%88%E3%80%80%E3%82%BF%E3%83%84%E3%82%BD%E3%83%BC%E3%80%80%E4%BA%94%E5%B9%95%E7%89%A9&amp;rft.place=Minamisenju%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E5%90%8D%E8%84%9A%E6%9C%AC%E9%9B%86%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pub=Ibunkan&amp;rft.date=1919-10-04&amp;rft.aulast=von+Goethe&amp;rft.aufirst=Johann+Wolfgang&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" id="mwUSQ"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" id="mwUSU"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" id="mwUSY"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-404" id="cite_note-404" data-mw-footnote-number="381"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwUSc"><a href="#cite_ref-404" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwUSg"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwUSk">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-404" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2404" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwUSo" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"><cite id="CITEREFMaeterlinck1920" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maurice_Maeterlinck" title="Maurice Maeterlinck" id="mwUSs">Maeterlinck, Maurice Polydore Marie Bernard</a> (25 February 1920). "SCÈNE II <span style="font-variant:small-caps" id="mwUSw">Les Mêmes</span>, SILANUS, APPIUS." <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUS0"><b id="mwUS4">第二場</b> <small id="mwUS8">以前の二人、サイラナス、アピアス</small></bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUTA">[</span><b id="mwUTE">Scene III</b> <small id="mwUTI">The Same, Silanus, Appius</small><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUTM">]</span>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/962911/1/34" class="external text" id="mwUTQ"><i id="mwUTU">MARIE-MAGDALEINE <small id="mwUTY">DRAME EN TROIS ACTES</small></i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUTc"><b id="mwUTg">マグダラ</b>の<b id="mwUTk">マリア</b></bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUTo">[</span><i id="mwUTs"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mary_Magdalene_(play)" title="Mary Magdalene (play)" id="mwUTw">Mary Magdalene</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUT0">]</span> (in Japanese). Translated by Wake, Ritsujirō. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shiba_Park" title="Shiba Park" id="mwUT4">Shiba Park</a>, Tokyo: Genbunsha. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUT8">&nbsp;</span>54. <q id="mwUUA"><span style="font-variant:small-caps" id="mwUUE">appius</span><br id="mwUUI">Il a fait une chose qu'aucun homme, aucun dieu n'avait faite jusqu'ici; une chose que je n'aurais pas crue quand dix mille témoins fussent venus l'affirmer au nom des Immortels, mais à laquelle je crois autant que je dois croire à ma propre existence, l'ayant vue de mes yeux, comme je vous vois ici, et presque touchée de mes mains, comme je touche ce vase. Il a dit<span typeof="mw:DisplaySpace" id="mwUUM">&nbsp;</span>: «<span typeof="mw:DisplaySpace" id="mwUUQ">&nbsp;</span>Lève-toi, sors et marche.<span typeof="mw:DisplaySpace" id="mwUUU">&nbsp;</span>» Et le mort s'est levé, est sorti et s'est mis à marcher parmi nous!</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUUY">アピアス。あの男は、如何なる人間も、如何なる神も、曾て爲なかつたことを爲たのです。萬人の證人が、わたしの處へやつて來て、不滅のものの名にかけて誓言しても信じない代りに今わたしがあなたを見るやうに、またこの花瓶に<ruby id="mwUUc">觸<rp id="mwUUg">(</rp><rt id="mwUUk">さは</rt><rp id="mwUUo">)</rp></ruby>るやうに、殆んどそれに觸つて見た上からは、自分自身の存在を信ぜざるを得ないと同樣に、それを確言せざるを得ないやうなことを爲たのです。あの男は、『起きよ、出て來よ』と云つた。すると死人が起きて出て來て、吾吾の間を步きしたのです！</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUUs">[</span><span style="font-variant:small-caps" id="mwUUw">Appius</span>. He has done a thing which no man, no god has ever done. A thing which I would not have believed if ten thousand witnesses had come to me and sworn in the name of the Immortals, but which I cannot but affirm as much as I cannot but believe in my own existence, having seen it as I see you now, and almost touched it as I touch this vase. He said, “Rise, come out.” And the dead man rose, came out and started to walk amongst us!<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUU0">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=SC%C3%88NE+II+%3Cspan+style%3Dfont-variant%3Asmall-caps%3ELes+M%C3%AAmes%3C%2Fspan%3E%2C+SILANUS%2C+APPIUS.+%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E5%A0%B4+%3Csmall%3E%E4%BB%A5%E5%89%8D%E3%81%AE%E4%BA%8C%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E3%82%B5%E3%82%A4%E3%83%A9%E3%83%8A%E3%82%B9%E3%80%81%E3%82%A2%E3%83%94%E3%82%A2%E3%82%B9%3C%2Fsmall%3E&amp;rft.btitle=MARIE-MAGDALEINE+%3Csmall%3EDRAME+EN+TROIS+ACTES%3C%2Fsmall%3E+%E3%83%9E%E3%82%B0%E3%83%80%E3%83%A9%E3%81%AE%E3%83%9E%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2&amp;rft.place=Shiba+Park%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=54&amp;rft.pub=Genbunsha&amp;rft.date=1920-02-25&amp;rft.aulast=Maeterlinck&amp;rft.aufirst=Maurice+Polydore+Marie+Bernard&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F962911%2F1%2F34&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" id="mwUU4"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" id="mwUU8"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" id="mwUVA"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-kishibe-1920-405" id="cite_note-kishibe-1920-405" data-mw-footnote-number="382"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwUVE"><a href="#cite_ref-kishibe-1920_405-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwUVI"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwUVM">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-kishibe-1920-405" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2409" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwUVQ" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"><cite id="CITEREFRyder1920" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arthur_W._Ryder" title="Arthur W. Ryder" id="mwUVU">Ryder, Arthur William</a> (7 April 1920). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/962926/1/78" class="external text" id="mwUVY"><i id="mwUVc">Twenty-two Goblins</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUVg">悪鬼艶物語</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUVk">[</span><i id="mwUVo"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vetala_Panchavimshati" title="Vetala Panchavimshati" id="mwUVs">Romance of the Goblins</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUVw">]</span> (in Japanese). Translated by Kishibe, Yasutarō. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kōjimachi" title="Kōjimachi" id="mwUV0">Kōjimachi</a>, Tokyo: Rakuyōdō. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUV4">&nbsp;</span>120, <span class="nowrap" id="mwUV8">236–</span>237. <q id="mwUWA">When he saw that she was saved, the king cried: "Come, come to me!" and ran forward and embraced her. And he asked her: "What does it mean, dearest? Is this a dream, or an illusion?" And the fairy answered: "My dear, listen to me. It is not a dream, nor an illusion. My father, the king of the fairies, laid this curse upon me. My father had many sons, but he loved me so that he could not eat without me. And I used to come to this deserted spot twice a month to worship <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shiva" title="Shiva" id="mwUWE">Shiva</a>.<br id="mwUWI">[…]<br id="mwUWM">This hermit heard the wailing of the people, and turned to his pupil who begged food for him. Now this pupil was proud and arrogant. And the hermit said: "My boy, what is this wailing we hear? Go outside and find out, then return and tell me why this unheard-of commotion is taking place."<span class="cs1-kern-right" id="mwUWQ"></span></q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUWU">王は乙女の無事なるを見て、聲を揚げて此方へ來よと呼び、走り出てゝ抱き占めながら尋ねた、「可愛き妻よ、こは何事ぞ、夢か幻か」、天つ乙女は答へた、「妾が<ruby id="mwUWY">夫<rp id="mwUWc">(</rp><rt id="mwUWg">つま</rt><rp id="mwUWk">)</rp></ruby>よ、聽き給へ、夢でもなく幻でもありませぬ、神仙の王なる妾の父が、かく妾を呪詛したのであります、事情を申せば、妾の父は<ruby id="mwUWo">數多<rp id="mwUWs">(</rp><rt id="mwUWw">あまた</rt><rp id="mwUW0">)</rp></ruby>の男子がありましたが、妾<ruby id="mwUW4">在<rp id="mwUW8">(</rp><rt id="mwUXA">を</rt><rp id="mwUXE">)</rp></ruby>らでは食も取らぬ程妾を愛しました、又妾は月に二度づゝ<ruby id="mwUXI">溼婆<rp id="mwUXM">(</rp><rt id="mwUXQ">シアア</rt><rp id="mwUXU">)</rp></ruby>神參拜の爲め、この寂しき處へ參るが<ruby id="mwUXY">慣<rp id="mwUXc">(</rp><rt id="mwUXg">ならひ</rt><rp id="mwUXk">)</rp></ruby>でした」。<br id="mwUXo">[…]<br id="mwUXs">この隱者は、人々の泣き叫ぶ聲を聽き、食を求めて居る徒弟にふり向いた、この徒弟は高慢な奴であつた、隱者は彼に言つた、「これ、我等の聽く泣き聲は何である、外に出て見て來よ、そしてこの聽いたことのない騷ぎは、何の爲めか知らせよ」。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=Twenty-two+Goblins+%E6%82%AA%E9%AC%BC%E8%89%B6%E7%89%A9%E8%AA%9E&amp;rft.place=K%C5%8Djimachi%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=120%2C+236-237&amp;rft.pub=Rakuy%C5%8Dd%C5%8D&amp;rft.date=1920-04-07&amp;rft.aulast=Ryder&amp;rft.aufirst=Arthur+William&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F962926%2F1%2F78&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" id="mwUXw"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" id="mwUX0"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" id="mwUX4"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-kosaka-1923-406" id="cite_note-kosaka-1923-406" data-mw-footnote-number="383"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwUX8"><a href="#cite_ref-kosaka-1923_406-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwUYA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwUYE">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-kosaka-1923-406" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2414" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwUYI" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"><cite id="CITEREFvon_Heyse1923" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paul_Heyse" title="Paul Heyse" id="mwUYM">von Heyse, Paul Johann Ludwig</a> (28 March 1923). "Andrea Delfin" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUYQ">アンドレア・デルフィン</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/978000/1/182" class="external text" id="mwUYU"><i id="mwUYY">L'Arrabbiata und andere Novellen</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUYc">ララビアタ</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUYg">[</span><i id="mwUYk">L’Arrabbiata</i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUYo">]</span> (in Japanese). Translated by Kōsaka, Yoshiyuki. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nihonbashi" title="Nihonbashi" id="mwUYs">Nihonbashi</a>, Tokyo: Shunyodo. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUYw">&nbsp;</span>363. <q id="mwUY0">Er zog den Brief aus der Taſche und gab ihn dem Freunde. Die alte Dame beſchwor den Sohn, wenn ihm daran liege, daß ſie je wieder eine Stunde Schlaf fände, ohne Aufenthalt zu ihr zu reiſen. Die Gerüchte aus Venedig, die Stellung, die er dort einnehme und welche ihn mehr als andere gefährde, der Umſtand, daß kaum der dritte ſeiner Briefe an ſie gelange, ſie wiſſe nicht, durch weſſen Schuld — das alles nage an ihrer Ruhe, und ihr Arzt wolle für nichts ſtehen, wenn ſie nicht durch einen Beſuch ihres Sohnes erſt wieder getröſtet und beruhigt worden ſei. Es ging ein Ton grenzenloſer mütterlicher Hingebung und tiefen Kummers durch dieſe Zeilen, daß Andrea ſie nicht ohne Bewegung leſen konnte.</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUY4">彼は衣囊から手紙をとり出して、友人にわたした。年とつた母は、若し母が一時間の睡眠を得ることが大切なことなら、ぐず〲せずに母の許に歸つて來よと命じてゐる。ヴェネチアからくるいろ〱の噂、ヴェネチアでつとめてゐる、そうして彼を他のものよりも餘計に危くするその地位、誰の科かはしらないが彼の三本目の手紙が母の手に達せぬ事情——これらのすべては彼女の平安を非常に痛め、醫者は、息子の訪問によつてやうやく慰められ、落ちつかせられなかつたら、もう保證に立たないといふのであつた。限りない母親らしい<ruby id="mwUY8">諦念<rp id="mwUZA">(</rp><rt id="mwUZE">あきらめ</rt><rp id="mwUZI">)</rp></ruby>と深い憂ひの調子が行間に溢れて、アンドレアも感動せずには讀むことができなかつた。</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUZM">[</span>He took the letter out of his pocket and handed it to his friend. His old mother bade him to come back to her without delay, if it ever mattered to him that she would get an hour of sleep again. The rumors from Venice, the position which he held there and which put him in much more danger than others, the fact that she did not know whose fault it was that a third of his letters would not reach her——all this was grievously hurting her peace of mind, and her physician would not vouch for anything unless she would be comforted and calmed down by a visit of her son. A tone of boundless motherly resignation and deep grief pervaded these lines, so much so that Andrea could not read them without being moved.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUZQ">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=Andrea+Delfin+%E3%82%A2%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%AC%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BB%E3%83%87%E3%83%AB%E3%83%95%E3%82%A3%E3%83%B3&amp;rft.btitle=L%27Arrabbiata+und+andere+Novellen+%E3%83%A9%E3%83%A9%E3%83%93%E3%82%A2%E3%82%BF&amp;rft.place=Nihonbashi%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=363&amp;rft.pub=Shunyodo&amp;rft.date=1923-03-28&amp;rft.aulast=von+Heyse&amp;rft.aufirst=Paul+Johann+Ludwig&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F978000%2F1%2F182&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" id="mwUZU"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" id="mwUZY"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" id="mwUZc"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-407" id="cite_note-407" data-mw-footnote-number="384"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwUZg"><a href="#cite_ref-407" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwUZk"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwUZo">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-407" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2419" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwUZs" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"><cite id="CITEREFKiyomura1927" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source">Kiyomura, Kōnin (20 February 1927).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUZw">第八章 <ruby id="mwUZ0">西<rp id="mwUZ4">(</rp><rt id="mwUZ8">にす</rt><rp id="mwUaA">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwUaE">銘<rp id="mwUaI">(</rp><rt id="mwUaM">めの</rt><rp id="mwUaQ">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwUaU">嘉<rp id="mwUaY">(</rp><rt id="mwUac">か</rt><rp id="mwUag">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwUak">播<rp id="mwUao">(</rp><rt id="mwUas">ば</rt><rp id="mwUaw">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwUa0">親<rp id="mwUa4">(</rp><rt id="mwUa8">にや</rt><rp id="mwUbA">)</rp></ruby>と<ruby id="mwUbE">仲<rp id="mwUbI">(</rp><rt id="mwUbM">なか</rt><rp id="mwUbQ">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwUbU">井<rp id="mwUbY">(</rp><rt id="mwUbc">ゐの</rt><rp id="mwUbg">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwUbk">眞<rp id="mwUbo">(</rp><rt id="mwUbs">ま</rt><rp id="mwUbw">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwUb0">氏<rp id="mwUb4">(</rp><rt id="mwUb8">うず</rt><rp id="mwUcA">)</rp></ruby></bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1027657/1/25" class="external text" id="mwUcE"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwUcI">宮古史傳</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hirara,_Okinawa" title="Hirara, Okinawa" id="mwUcM">Hirara, Okinawa</a>: <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwUcQ"><span lang="ja" id="mwUcU">南島史蹟保存會</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwUcY">. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUcc">&nbsp;</span><span class="nowrap" id="mwUcg">24–</span>25.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUck">すると其の夜中頃に、怪神が來て<ruby id="mwUco">寄<rp id="mwUcs">(</rp><rt id="mwUcw">より</rt><rp id="mwUc0">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwUc4">木<rp id="mwUc8">(</rp><rt id="mwUdA">き</rt><rp id="mwUdE">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwUdI">大<rp id="mwUdM">(</rp><rt id="mwUdQ">おほ</rt><rp id="mwUdU">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwUdY">氏<rp id="mwUdc">(</rp><rt id="mwUdg">うず</rt><rp id="mwUdk">)</rp></ruby>と呼んだ。寄木が<ruby id="mwUdo">應<rp id="mwUds">(</rp><rt id="mwUdw">おう</rt><rp id="mwUd0">)</rp></ruby>と答へると、怪神は今夜仲井の里に兩家にお產があるから共にいつて產兒の運命を定めやうといふので、寄木は、今夜は來客があるから汝一人行つて定めて來よといつた。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E7%AC%AC%E5%85%AB%E7%AB%A0+%3Cruby%3E%E8%A5%BF%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%AB%E3%81%99%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E9%8A%98%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%82%81%E3%81%AE%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E5%98%89%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%8B%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E6%92%AD%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%B0%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E8%A6%AA%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%AB%E3%82%84%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%E3%81%A8%3Cruby%3E%E4%BB%B2%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%AA%E3%81%8B%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E4%BA%95%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%82%90%E3%81%AE%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E7%9C%9E%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%BE%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E%3Cruby%3E%E6%B0%8F%3Crp%3E%28%3C%2Frp%3E%3Crt%3E%E3%81%86%E3%81%9A%3C%2Frt%3E%3Crp%3E%29%3C%2Frp%3E%3C%2Fruby%3E&amp;rft.btitle=%E5%AE%AE%E5%8F%A4%E5%8F%B2%E5%82%B3&amp;rft.place=Hirara%2C+Okinawa&amp;rft.pages=24-25&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E5%8D%97%E5%B3%B6%E5%8F%B2%E8%B9%9F%E4%BF%9D%E5%AD%98%E6%9C%83%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.date=1927-02-20&amp;rft.aulast=Kiyomura&amp;rft.aufirst=K%C5%8Dnin&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1027657%2F1%2F25&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" id="mwUd4"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" id="mwUd8"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" id="mwUeA"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-uchida-1932-408" id="cite_note-uchida-1932-408" data-mw-footnote-number="385"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwUeE"><a href="#cite_ref-uchida-1932_408-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwUeI"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwUeM">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-uchida-1932-408" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2424" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwUeQ" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"><cite id="CITEREFSienkiewicz1932" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Henryk_Sienkiewicz" title="Henryk Sienkiewicz" id="mwUeU">Sienkiewicz, Henryk Adam Aleksander Pius</a> (15 September 1932). "Pójdźmy za Nim!" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUeY">十字架のエス</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUec">[</span>Jesus on the Cross<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUeg">]</span>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1244085/1/67" class="external text" id="mwUek"><i id="mwUeo">Ta trzecia</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUes">二人畫工</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUew">[</span><i id="mwUe0">The Two Painters</i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUe4">]</span>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwUe8"><span lang="ja" id="mwUfA">世界名作文庫</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwUfE"> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUfI">&nbsp;</span>407. Translated by Uchida, Roan. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nihonbashi" title="Nihonbashi" id="mwUfM">Nihonbashi</a>, Tokyo: Shunyodo. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUfQ">&nbsp;</span><span class="nowrap" id="mwUfU">128–</span>129. <q id="mwUfY">W tej chwili centuryon sięgnął włócznią do boku zmarłego. Dziwna rzecz: powrót światła i widok tej śmierci zdawał się uspokajać tłumy. Przysuwały się one teraz coraz bliżej, zwłaszcza, że żołnierze nie bronili już przystępu. Wśród czerni ozwały się głosy:<br id="mwUfc">— Zejdź z krzyża! zejdź z krzyża!<br id="mwUfg">Antea raz jeszcze rzuciła oczyma na tę bladą, zwieszoną głowę, poczem ozwała się cicho, jakby sama do siebie:<br id="mwUfk">— Zali zmartwychwstanie?…<br id="mwUfo">W obec śmierci, kładnącej błękitne piętna na Jego oczy i usta, wobec tych wyciągniętych nad miarę ramion, w obec tego nieruchomego ciała, które już osunęło się ku dołowi ciężarem rzeczy martwych, głos jej drgał rozpaczliwem zwątpieniem.<br id="mwUfs">Niemniejsze zmartwienie targało i duszą Cinny. On również nie wierzył, że Nazarejczyk zmartwychwstanie, ale wierzył, że gdyby żył, On jeden mógłby złą lub dobrą swą mocą uzdrowić Anteę.<br id="mwUfw">A tymczasem coraz liczniejsze głosy wołały naokół:<br id="mwUf0">— Zejdź z krzyża! zejdź z krzyża!<br id="mwUf4">— Zejdź — powtórzył z rozpaczą w duchu Cinna, — uzdrów mi ją, zabierz duszę moją!</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUf8">其時、百人長は死せる豫言者の橫腹へ槍を刺した。<br id="mwUgA">不思議なる哉、日光再び照らして<ruby id="mwUgE">面前<rp id="mwUgI">(</rp><rt id="mwUgM">まのあたり</rt><rp id="mwUgQ">)</rp></ruby>に豫言者の死んだのを見ると、群集の狂亂は漸く鎭まり返つて、警護の兵士の<ruby id="mwUgU">支<rp id="mwUgY">(</rp><rt id="mwUgc">さゝ</rt><rp id="mwUgg">)</rp></ruby>へさるまにまに、段々ヒシ〱と詰寄つた。其人込の中から聲張上げて、<br id="mwUgk">『十字架から降りろ、降りろ、降りろ、十字架から降りろ！』<br id="mwUgo">アンテアは豫言者の<ruby id="mwUgs">首<rp id="mwUgw">(</rp><rt id="mwUg0">うな</rt><rp id="mwUg4">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwUg8">垂<rp id="mwUhA">(</rp><rt id="mwUhE">だ</rt><rp id="mwUhI">)</rp></ruby>れたる<ruby id="mwUhM">面<rp id="mwUhQ">(</rp><rt id="mwUhU">おもて</rt><rp id="mwUhY">)</rp></ruby>をヒタと<ruby id="mwUhc">見<rp id="mwUhg">(</rp><rt id="mwUhk">み</rt><rp id="mwUho">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwUhs">守<rp id="mwUhw">(</rp><rt id="mwUh0">つ</rt><rp id="mwUh4">)</rp></ruby>めつ、自ら語るやうに、<br id="mwUh8">『<ruby id="mwUiA">眞實<rp id="mwUiE">(</rp><rt id="mwUiI">ほんとう</rt><rp id="mwUiM">)</rp></ruby>に蘇生遊ばすか知らん？』<br id="mwUiQ">其<ruby id="mwUiU">眼<rp id="mwUiY">(</rp><rt id="mwUic">め</rt><rp id="mwUig">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwUik">邊<rp id="mwUio">(</rp><rt id="mwUis">もと</rt><rp id="mwUiw">)</rp></ruby>にも<ruby id="mwUi0">口<rp id="mwUi4">(</rp><rt id="mwUi8">くち</rt><rp id="mwUjA">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwUjE">邊<rp id="mwUjI">(</rp><rt id="mwUjM">もと</rt><rp id="mwUjQ">)</rp></ruby>にも靑醒めた色を帶びてゐるを見、其腕のダラリと垂れたのを見、其動かざる<ruby id="mwUjU">骸<rp id="mwUjY">(</rp><rt id="mwUjc">むくろ</rt><rp id="mwUjg">)</rp></ruby>の重みでグタリとしてゐるを見、アンテアの聲は<ruby id="mwUjk">情<rp id="mwUjo">(</rp><rt id="mwUjs">なさけ</rt><rp id="mwUjw">)</rp></ruby>なささうに震へてゐた。<br id="mwUj0">シンナの心に喰込んだ失望も<ruby id="mwUj4">尋常<rp id="mwUj8">(</rp><rt id="mwUkA">ひととほり</rt><rp id="mwUkE">)</rp></ruby>でなかつた。此ナザレの豫言者が死人の中より<ruby id="mwUkI">蘇生<rp id="mwUkM">(</rp><rt id="mwUkQ">よみがへ</rt><rp id="mwUkU">)</rp></ruby>るとは信じないが、若し生きてゐたなら<ruby id="mwUkY">眷<rp id="mwUkc">(</rp><rt id="mwUkg">いと</rt><rp id="mwUkk">)</rp></ruby>しい妻のアンテアを<ruby id="mwUko">以前<rp id="mwUks">(</rp><rt id="mwUkw">もと</rt><rp id="mwUk0">)</rp></ruby>の<ruby id="mwUk4">健康<rp id="mwUk8">(</rp><rt id="mwUlA">からだ</rt><rp id="mwUlE">)</rp></ruby>に<ruby id="mwUlI">復<rp id="mwUlM">(</rp><rt id="mwUlQ">もど</rt><rp id="mwUlU">)</rp></ruby>して吳れるは善惡は知らざれ此ナザレ人の神變不可思議の力ばかりであつたらうと信じた。<br id="mwUlY">其間、種々雜多の聲で、<br id="mwUlc">『十字架を降りて來よ、降りて來よ、十字架を降り玉へや！』<br id="mwUlg">『十字架を降り玉へや！』とシンナも情なささうな聲で繰返した。<br id="mwUlk">『願くば降りて我が妻を<ruby id="mwUlo">醫<rp id="mwUls">(</rp><rt id="mwUlw">いや</rt><rp id="mwUl0">)</rp></ruby>し玉へや、然らざれば我が生命を取り玉へ！』</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUl4">[</span>At this moment, a centurion thrust his spear into the side of the dead prophet.<br id="mwUl8">Amazingly, once the sun shone again and they saw that the prophet had died before their eyes, the crowd’s frenzy finally calmed down, and then they pressed closer and closer, as the guard just let them. Voices rose from among the throng,<br id="mwUmA">“Get down from the cross, get down, get down, get down from the cross!”<br id="mwUmE">Antea stared right at the prophet’s drooping face, and then said as if to herself,<br id="mwUmI">“Will he really come back to life?”<br id="mwUmM">Seeing his eyes and mouth turning tinged with blue, his arms hanging limp, his motionless body dangling by its weight, Antea’s voice trembled with apparent despair.<br id="mwUmQ">Just as inordinate was the disappointment that was eating into Cinna’s heart. He did not believe that the Nazarene prophet would rise from the dead, but he did believe that, had he lived, only the Nazarene’s miraculous and wonderous power, good or evil, would have helped his dear wife Antea to gain back her health.<br id="mwUmU">Meanwhile, there were more numerous voices,<br id="mwUmY">“Come down from the cross, come down, please get down from the cross!”<br id="mwUmc">“Please get down from the cross!” repeated Cinna with despair.<br id="mwUmg">“I beg of you, please get down and cure my wife, or else just take my life!”<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUmk">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=P%C3%B3jd%C5%BAmy+za+Nim%21+%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%97%E6%9E%B6%E3%81%AE%E3%82%A8%E3%82%B9&amp;rft.btitle=Ta+trzecia+%E4%BA%8C%E4%BA%BA%E7%95%AB%E5%B7%A5&amp;rft.place=Nihonbashi%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E5%90%8D%E4%BD%9C%E6%96%87%E5%BA%AB%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=128-129&amp;rft.pub=Shunyodo&amp;rft.date=1932-09-15&amp;rft.aulast=Sienkiewicz&amp;rft.aufirst=Henryk+Adam+Aleksander+Pius&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1244085%2F1%2F67&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" id="mwUmo"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" id="mwUms"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" id="mwUmw"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-hirata-1937-409" id="cite_note-hirata-1937-409" data-mw-footnote-number="386"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwUm0"><a href="#cite_ref-hirata-1937_409-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwUm4"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwUm8">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-hirata-1937-409" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2429" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwUnA" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"><cite id="CITEREFAlcott1937" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Louisa_May_Alcott" title="Louisa May Alcott" id="mwUnE">Alcott, Louisa May</a> (22 March 1937). "CHAPTER II. A Merry Christmas" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUnI"><b id="mwUnM">第二章</b> 樂しいクリスマス</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1037476/1/37" class="external text" id="mwUnQ"><i id="mwUnU">Little Women</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUnY">リットル・ウイメン</bdi></a> (in Japanese). Translated by Hirata, Tokuboku. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hongō,_Tokyo" title="Hongō, Tokyo" id="mwUnc">Hongō, Tokyo</a>: Gaigo Kenkyusha. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUng">&nbsp;</span><span class="nowrap" id="mwUnk">62–</span>63. <q id="mwUno"><span class="cs1-kern-left" id="mwUns"></span>"Hither, hither, from thy home,<br id="mwUnw">Airy sprite, I bid thee come!<br id="mwUn0">Born of roses, fed on dew,<br id="mwUn4">Charms and potions canst thou brew?<br id="mwUn8">Bring me here, with elfin speed,<br id="mwUoA">The fragrant philter which I need;<br id="mwUoE">Make it sweet and swift and strong;<br id="mwUoI">Spirit, answer now my song!"<span class="cs1-kern-right" id="mwUoM"></span></q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUoQ">こちらへ、こちらへ、お前の<ruby id="mwUoU">家<rp id="mwUoY">(</rp><rt id="mwUoc">うち</rt><rp id="mwUog">)</rp></ruby>から、<br id="mwUok">幻しの妖精よ、私はお前に來よと命じる！<br id="mwUoo"><ruby id="mwUos">薔薇<rp id="mwUow">(</rp><rt id="mwUo0">ばら</rt><rp id="mwUo4">)</rp></ruby>から生れ、露で養はれて、<br id="mwUo8"><ruby id="mwUpA">呪<rp id="mwUpE">(</rp><rt id="mwUpI">まじな</rt><rp id="mwUpM">)</rp></ruby>ひ藥や毒の藥をお前は<ruby id="mwUpQ">釀造<rp id="mwUpU">(</rp><rt id="mwUpY">こしら</rt><rp id="mwUpc">)</rp></ruby>へられるのか？<br id="mwUpg">此處へ、私のとこへ持つて來てくれ、魔の速さで、<br id="mwUpk">私が入用な、香り高い惚れ藥をば。<br id="mwUpo">甘く、强く、利き目の速いやうに調合してくれ。<br id="mwUps">精よ、いざ私の歌に答へてよ！</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=CHAPTER+II.+A+Merry+Christmas+%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E7%AB%A0+%E6%A8%82%E3%81%97%E3%81%84%E3%82%AF%E3%83%AA%E3%82%B9%E3%83%9E%E3%82%B9&amp;rft.btitle=Little+Women+%E3%83%AA%E3%83%83%E3%83%88%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%A6%E3%82%A4%E3%83%A1%E3%83%B3&amp;rft.place=Hong%C5%8D%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=62-63&amp;rft.pub=Gaigo+Kenkyusha&amp;rft.date=1937-03-22&amp;rft.aulast=Alcott&amp;rft.aufirst=Louisa+May&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1037476%2F1%2F37&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" id="mwUpw"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" id="mwUp0"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" id="mwUp4"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-410" id="cite_note-410" data-mw-footnote-number="387"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwUp8"><a href="#cite_ref-410" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwUqA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwUqE">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-410" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2434" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwUqI" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"><cite id="CITEREFRose1938" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source">Rose, Cecil (30 June 1938). "Chapter Four. Remaking Men" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUqM">【４】生活の革新</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUqQ">[</span>[4] Reforming Life<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUqU">]</span>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1037521/1/32" class="external text" id="mwUqY"><i id="mwUqc">When Man Listens</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUqg">神に聽く時</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUqk">[</span><i id="mwUqo">When One Listens to God</i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUqs">]</span> (in Japanese). Translated by Yoshimoto, Tadasu. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tennōji-ku,_Osaka" title="Tennōji-ku, Osaka" id="mwUqw">Tennōji, Osaka</a>: Nichiyō Sekai Sha. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUq0">&nbsp;</span>54. <q id="mwUq4"><span style="font-variant:small-caps" id="mwUq8">Christ</span> called men, not just to a life in which He met their need, but to one in which they joined Him in His task. In vivid and homely language which would stir the imagination of fishermen, He asked Simon and Andrew to join Him in an amazing fishing expedition. The catch was to be men.</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUrA">キリストはたゞ<ruby id="mwUrE">救<rp id="mwUrI">(</rp><rt id="mwUrM">すくひ</rt><rp id="mwUrQ">)</rp></ruby>を求むる者をお呼びになつたばかりではなく、共に來つて働く者をお招きになつた。キリストは<ruby id="mwUrU">漁<rp id="mwUrY">(</rp><rt id="mwUrc">れう</rt><rp id="mwUrg">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwUrk">夫<rp id="mwUro">(</rp><rt id="mwUrs">し</rt><rp id="mwUrw">)</rp></ruby>のシモンとアンデレに<ruby id="mwUr0">素<rp id="mwUr4">(</rp><rt id="mwUr8">す</rt><rp id="mwUsA">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwUsE">晴<rp id="mwUsI">(</rp><rt id="mwUsM">ばら</rt><rp id="mwUsQ">)</rp></ruby>しい<ruby id="mwUsU">漁<rp id="mwUsY">(</rp><rt id="mwUsc">れう</rt><rp id="mwUsg">)</rp></ruby>を得させるから、自分に<ruby id="mwUsk">從<rp id="mwUso">(</rp><rt id="mwUss">つ</rt><rp id="mwUsw">)</rp></ruby>いて來よとお命じになつた。<ruby id="mwUs0">漁<rp id="mwUs4">(</rp><rt id="mwUs8">れう</rt><rp id="mwUtA">)</rp></ruby>とは人を<ruby id="mwUtE">漁<rp id="mwUtI">(</rp><rt id="mwUtM">すなど</rt><rp id="mwUtQ">)</rp></ruby>る意味であつた。何といふ<ruby id="mwUtU">生<rp id="mwUtY">(</rp><rt id="mwUtc">い</rt><rp id="mwUtg">)</rp></ruby>き<ruby id="mwUtk">生<rp id="mwUto">(</rp><rt id="mwUts">い</rt><rp id="mwUtw">)</rp></ruby>きした、其の場にしつくりと<ruby id="mwUt0">當<rp id="mwUt4">(</rp><rt id="mwUt8">あて</rt><rp id="mwUuA">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwUuE">嵌<rp id="mwUuI">(</rp><rt id="mwUuM">はま</rt><rp id="mwUuQ">)</rp></ruby>つた言葉であらうか。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=Chapter+Four.+Remaking+Men+%E3%80%90%EF%BC%94%E3%80%91%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB%E3%81%AE%E9%9D%A9%E6%96%B0&amp;rft.btitle=When+Man+Listens+%E7%A5%9E%E3%81%AB%E8%81%BD%E3%81%8F%E6%99%82&amp;rft.place=Tenn%C5%8Dji%2C+Osaka&amp;rft.pages=54&amp;rft.pub=Nichiy%C5%8D+Sekai+Sha&amp;rft.date=1938-06-30&amp;rft.aulast=Rose&amp;rft.aufirst=Cecil&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1037521%2F1%2F32&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" id="mwUuU"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" id="mwUuY"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" id="mwUuc"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-411" id="cite_note-411" data-mw-footnote-number="388"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwUug"><a href="#cite_ref-411" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwUuk"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwUuo">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-411" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2441" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwUus" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"><cite id="CITEREFHatano1940" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source">Hatano, Ken'ichi (20 October 1940).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUuw">第七章 漢</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1148662/1/76" class="external text" id="mwUu0"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwUu4">支那劇大觀</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shiba_Park" title="Shiba Park" id="mwUu8">Shiba Park</a>, Tokyo: Daito Publishing Co. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUvA">&nbsp;</span>102.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUvE">そして剛は斬らず、彼に三千の人馬をくれるから湖北の枉子城に往つて反冦を討伐して來よと命じた。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%83%E7%AB%A0+%E6%BC%A2&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%94%AF%E9%82%A3%E5%8A%87%E5%A4%A7%E8%A7%80&amp;rft.place=Shiba+Park%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=102&amp;rft.pub=Daito+Publishing+Co.&amp;rft.date=1940-10-20&amp;rft.aulast=Hatano&amp;rft.aufirst=Ken%27ichi&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1148662%2F1%2F76&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" id="mwUvI"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" id="mwUvM"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" id="mwUvQ"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-412" id="cite_note-412" data-mw-footnote-number="389"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwUvU"><a href="#cite_ref-412" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwUvY"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwUvc">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-412" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2446" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwUvg" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"><cite id="CITEREFKawamoto1940" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source">Kawamoto, Unosuke (22 December 1940).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUvk">第二章 人類の進化と思想表現手段の發達</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUvo">[</span>Chapter II: Human Evolution and the Development of the Means of Expressing Thoughts<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUvs">]</span>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1440192/1/216" class="external text" id="mwUvw"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwUv0">聾敎育學精説</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUv4">[</span><i id="mwUv8">On <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deaf_education" title="Deaf education" id="mwUwA">Deaf Pedagogy</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUwE">]</span> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meguro" title="Meguro" id="mwUwI">Meguro</a>, Tokyo: Shigarakikai. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUwM">&nbsp;</span>385.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUwQ">然し身振語は、決してタイラーの云ふ如く、それ程共通でない。西洋で「來よ」といふ身振は右手の肘を屈して前膊をあげ、手の甲を先方に向け中指を折る樣にする。然るに日本では之と反對に掌を相手の方にむけて、所謂手招きをする。又日本では男は親指、女は小指を以てあらはすが、西洋では必ずしもさうではない。可なり複雜で男は帽子をとる眞似をし、女は乳のあることを意味する身振をする。日本では貨幣を拇指と食指とで圓を造つてあらはすが、西洋では必ずしもさうでない。又日本では犬を耳が垂れることの眞似をすることによつてあらはし、西洋では股をたたく。これ犬を呼ぶ時の動作より來たものである。右は數例に過ぎないか、精細に比較すれば、大いに異るものが多數あるであらう。然し音聲語に比すれば、共通する所多いことは言ふまでもない。</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUwU">[</span>However, gesture-language is certainly not as universal as <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Edward_Burnett_Tylor" title="Edward Burnett Tylor" id="mwUwY">Tylor</a> claimed. In the West, the gesture for “come here” is made by bending the right elbow and raising the forearm, while directing the back of the hand forwards and curling the middle finger. In Japan, on the other hand, the palm is directed towards the other person to perform the act of so-called <i id="mwUwc">beckoning</i>. Also, the thumb indicates a man and the little finger a woman in Japan, but not so in the West. In a rather convoluted way, those gestures mimic holding a hat for men and signal having breasts for women. Money is indicated by forming a circle with the thumb and the index finger in Japan, but not so in the West. And a dog is indicated by mimicking its floppy ears in Japan, but by tapping one’s lap in the West, which is what one would do when calling one’s dog. If these few examples alone are to be compared in further detail, many more significant differences ought to emerge, but it goes without saying that there is much commonality with word-language.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUwg">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E7%AB%A0+%E4%BA%BA%E9%A1%9E%E3%81%AE%E9%80%B2%E5%8C%96%E3%81%A8%E6%80%9D%E6%83%B3%E8%A1%A8%E7%8F%BE%E6%89%8B%E6%AE%B5%E3%81%AE%E7%99%BC%E9%81%94&amp;rft.btitle=%E8%81%BE%E6%95%8E%E8%82%B2%E5%AD%B8%E7%B2%BE%E8%AA%AC&amp;rft.place=Meguro%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=385&amp;rft.pub=Shigarakikai&amp;rft.date=1940-12-22&amp;rft.aulast=Kawamoto&amp;rft.aufirst=Unosuke&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1440192%2F1%2F216&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" id="mwUwk"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" id="mwUwo"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" id="mwUws"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-413" id="cite_note-413" data-mw-footnote-number="390"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwUww"><a href="#cite_ref-413" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwUw0"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwUw4">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-413" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2451" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwUw8" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"><cite id="CITEREFYokoyama1941" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source">Yokoyama, Kendō (7 April 1941).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUxA">嘉納先生と說敎節</bdi>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUxE">嘉納先生傳</bdi> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Koishikawa" title="Koishikawa" id="mwUxI">Koishikawa</a>, Tokyo: Kōdōkan. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUxM">&nbsp;</span><span class="nowrap" id="mwUxQ">375–</span>376.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUxU">先生は、瀑布が如何して鶯の鳴音をするか、それを硏究して來よと言はれた。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E5%98%89%E7%B4%8D%E5%85%88%E7%94%9F%E3%81%A8%E8%AA%AA%E6%95%8E%E7%AF%80&amp;rft.btitle=%E5%98%89%E7%B4%8D%E5%85%88%E7%94%9F%E5%82%B3&amp;rft.place=Koishikawa%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=375-376&amp;rft.pub=K%C5%8Dd%C5%8Dkan&amp;rft.date=1941-04-07&amp;rft.aulast=Yokoyama&amp;rft.aufirst=Kend%C5%8D&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" id="mwUxY"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" id="mwUxc"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" id="mwUxg"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-414" id="cite_note-414" data-mw-footnote-number="391"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwUxk"><a href="#cite_ref-414" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwUxo"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwUxs">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-414" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2456" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwUxw" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"><cite id="CITEREFYamaguchi1942" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source">Yamaguchi, Takeshi (10 April 1942) [8 October 1933].  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUx0">好色二代男考<small id="mwUx4">（その一）</small></bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1874525/1/78" class="external text" id="mwUx8"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwUyA">江戶文學硏究</bdi></a> (in Japanese) (2nd<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUyE">&nbsp;</span>ed.). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kanda,_Tokyo" title="Kanda, Tokyo" id="mwUyI">Kanda, Tokyo</a>: Tokyodo. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUyM">&nbsp;</span>123.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUyQ">道具は、その女中が女中頭から、餘り遣つて、さきがちびた故、この物賣る店でとりかへて來よといはれた物であつた。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E5%A5%BD%E8%89%B2%E4%BA%8C%E4%BB%A3%E7%94%B7%E8%80%83%3Csmall%3E%EF%BC%88%E3%81%9D%E3%81%AE%E4%B8%80%EF%BC%89%3C%2Fsmall%3E&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%B1%9F%E6%88%B6%E6%96%87%E5%AD%B8%E7%A1%8F%E7%A9%B6&amp;rft.place=Kanda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=123&amp;rft.edition=2nd&amp;rft.pub=Tokyodo&amp;rft.date=1942-04-10&amp;rft.aulast=Yamaguchi&amp;rft.aufirst=Takeshi&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1874525%2F1%2F78&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" id="mwUyU"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" id="mwUyY"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" id="mwUyc"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-415" id="cite_note-415" data-mw-footnote-number="392"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwUyg"><a href="#cite_ref-415" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwUyk"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwUyo">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-415" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2461" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwUys" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"><cite id="CITEREFTakeda1942" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source">Takeda, Yūkichi (5 May 1942).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUyw">萬葉四季物語</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1069544/1/124" class="external text" id="mwUy0"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwUy4">神・人・自然</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ōmori" title="Ōmori" id="mwUy8">Ōmori</a>, Tokyo: Yakumo Shorin. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwUzA">&nbsp;</span>233.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUzE">思ふ人に梅の花が咲いたと吿げてやつたならば來よと言ふに似てゐる。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E8%90%AC%E8%91%89%E5%9B%9B%E5%AD%A3%E7%89%A9%E8%AA%9E&amp;rft.btitle=%E7%A5%9E%E3%83%BB%E4%BA%BA%E3%83%BB%E8%87%AA%E7%84%B6&amp;rft.place=%C5%8Cmori%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=233&amp;rft.pub=Yakumo+Shorin&amp;rft.date=1942-05-05&amp;rft.aulast=Takeda&amp;rft.aufirst=Y%C5%ABkichi&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1069544%2F1%2F124&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" id="mwUzI"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" id="mwUzM"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" id="mwUzQ"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-416" id="cite_note-416" data-mw-footnote-number="393"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwUzU"><a href="#cite_ref-416" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwUzY"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwUzc">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-416" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2466" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwUzg" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"><cite id="CITEREFTakano1944" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tsugi_Takano" title="Tsugi Takano" id="mwUzk">Takano, Tsugi</a> (15 February 1944).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwUzo">紡ぎ姬</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1135458/1/102" class="external text" id="mwUzs"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwUzw">太陽の花</bdi></a> (in Japanese). Higashi, Osaka: <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwUz0"><span lang="ja" id="mwUz4">輝文館</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwUz8">. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU0A">&nbsp;</span>198.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwU0E">「いや、いや、苦しうない。その者をたづねて來よ」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E7%B4%A1%E3%81%8E%E5%A7%AC&amp;rft.btitle=%E5%A4%AA%E9%99%BD%E3%81%AE%E8%8A%B1&amp;rft.place=Higashi%2C+Osaka&amp;rft.pages=198&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E8%BC%9D%E6%96%87%E9%A4%A8%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.date=1944-02-15&amp;rft.aulast=Takano&amp;rft.aufirst=Tsugi&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1135458%2F1%2F102&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" id="mwU0I"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" id="mwU0M"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" id="mwU0Q"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-417" id="cite_note-417" data-mw-footnote-number="394"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwU0U"><a href="#cite_ref-417" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwU0Y"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwU0c">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-417" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2471" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwU0g" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"><cite id="CITEREFAsano1944" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source">Asano, Takayuki (6 April 1944).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwU0k">二つの比喩</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1040479/1/17" class="external text" id="mwU0o"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwU0s">女性と宗敎</bdi></a>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwU0w"><span lang="ja" id="mwU00">婦人文化叢書</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwU04"> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ushigome" title="Ushigome" id="mwU08">Ushigome</a>, Tokyo: Jidaisha. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU1A">&nbsp;</span>18.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwU1E">兎や角と迷ひためらふことなく、ひたすらなる氣持になつて此の道を渡り來よ、必ず水火の難より護つてやらうといふのであります。「行け」の聲は發遣の聲であり、「來よ」の聲は招喚の聲であります。旅人は「行け」の言葉に勵まされ、「來よ」の言葉に力づけられ、水火二河の間に懸る一筋の白道を驀然に進み行き、遂に彼の岸に到つて永く樂しむことが出來たと云ひます。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E4%BA%8C%E3%81%A4%E3%81%AE%E6%AF%94%E5%96%A9&amp;rft.btitle=%E5%A5%B3%E6%80%A7%E3%81%A8%E5%AE%97%E6%95%8E&amp;rft.place=Ushigome%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E5%A9%A6%E4%BA%BA%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96%E5%8F%A2%E6%9B%B8%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=18&amp;rft.pub=Jidaisha&amp;rft.date=1944-04-06&amp;rft.aulast=Asano&amp;rft.aufirst=Takayuki&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1040479%2F1%2F17&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" id="mwU1I"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" id="mwU1M"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" id="mwU1Q"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-418" id="cite_note-418" data-mw-footnote-number="395"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwU1U"><a href="#cite_ref-418" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwU1Y"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwU1c">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-418" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2476" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwU1g" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"><cite id="CITEREFMurou1946" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source">Murou, Saisei (25 July 1946).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwU1k">第十四章 良い心</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1134469/1/92" class="external text" id="mwU1o"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwU1s">作家の手記</bdi></a> (in Japanese). Tanbaichi, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nara_Prefecture" title="Nara Prefecture" id="mwU1w">Nara</a>: Yōtokusha. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU10">&nbsp;</span>178.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwU14">「ぢや、健も來よ。」<br id="mwU18">[…]<br id="mwU2A">母はかういふともう土間に下りて履物を引かけ、健も來よ、と再び呼んだ。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E7%AC%AC%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E7%AB%A0+%E8%89%AF%E3%81%84%E5%BF%83&amp;rft.btitle=%E4%BD%9C%E5%AE%B6%E3%81%AE%E6%89%8B%E8%A8%98&amp;rft.place=Tanbaichi%2C+Nara&amp;rft.pages=178&amp;rft.pub=Y%C5%8Dtokusha&amp;rft.date=1946-07-25&amp;rft.aulast=Murou&amp;rft.aufirst=Saisei&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1134469%2F1%2F92&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" id="mwU2E"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" id="mwU2I"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" id="mwU2M"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-419" id="cite_note-419" data-mw-footnote-number="396"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwU2Q"><a href="#cite_ref-419" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwU2U"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwU2Y">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-419" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2481" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwU2c" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"><cite id="CITEREFKobayashi1947" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source">Kobayashi, Taichirō (1 April 1947).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwU2g">第三章 掘墓と明器の怪</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/3451088/1/70" class="external text" id="mwU2k"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwU2o">漢唐古俗と明器土偶</bdi></a> (in Japanese). Kyoto: Ichijō Shobō. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU2s">&nbsp;</span>88.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwU2w">幼兒は驚いて惠に吿げたので、惠は笑つて木偶を取つて來よと言つた。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E7%AB%A0+%E6%8E%98%E5%A2%93%E3%81%A8%E6%98%8E%E5%99%A8%E3%81%AE%E6%80%AA&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%BC%A2%E5%94%90%E5%8F%A4%E4%BF%97%E3%81%A8%E6%98%8E%E5%99%A8%E5%9C%9F%E5%81%B6&amp;rft.place=Kyoto&amp;rft.pages=88&amp;rft.pub=Ichij%C5%8D+Shob%C5%8D&amp;rft.date=1947-04-01&amp;rft.aulast=Kobayashi&amp;rft.aufirst=Taichir%C5%8D&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F3451088%2F1%2F70&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" id="mwU20"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" id="mwU24"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" id="mwU28"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-420" id="cite_note-420" data-mw-footnote-number="397"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwU3A"><a href="#cite_ref-420" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwU3E"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwU3I">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-420" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2486" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwU3M" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"><cite id="CITEREFOkino1947" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source">Okino, Iwasaburō (10 October 1947).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwU3Q">六 追はれた長髓彥</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/3453752/1/43" class="external text" id="mwU3U"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwU3Y">書き改むべき日本歷史　神武天皇硏究</bdi></a> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU3c">&nbsp;</span>2. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taitō" title="Taitō" id="mwU3g">Taitō</a>, Tokyo: Kinnohoshi Co. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU3k">&nbsp;</span>77.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwU3o">これは兵士が戰ひつかれて飢ゑてゐるから、鵜養のともがらよ早く魚なりとも持つて來よ、といふのである。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E5%85%AD+%E8%BF%BD%E3%81%AF%E3%82%8C%E3%81%9F%E9%95%B7%E9%AB%93%E5%BD%A5&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%9B%B8%E3%81%8D%E6%94%B9%E3%82%80%E3%81%B9%E3%81%8D%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E6%AD%B7%E5%8F%B2%E3%80%80%E7%A5%9E%E6%AD%A6%E5%A4%A9%E7%9A%87%E7%A1%8F%E7%A9%B6&amp;rft.place=Tait%C5%8D%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=77&amp;rft.pub=Kinnohoshi+Co&amp;rft.date=1947-10-10&amp;rft.aulast=Okino&amp;rft.aufirst=Iwasabur%C5%8D&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F3453752%2F1%2F43&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" id="mwU3s"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" id="mwU3w"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" id="mwU30"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-421" id="cite_note-421" data-mw-footnote-number="398"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwU34"><a href="#cite_ref-421" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwU38"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwU4A">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-421" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2491" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwU4E" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;}}"><cite id="CITEREFYanagita1963" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kunio_Yanagita" title="Kunio Yanagita" id="mwU4I">Yanagita, Kunio</a> (25 October 1963).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwU4M">昔話と文學</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/9541736/1/150" class="external text" id="mwU4Q"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwU4U">定本 柳田國男集</bdi></a> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU4Y">&nbsp;</span>6. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiyoda,_Tokyo" title="Chiyoda, Tokyo" id="mwU4c">Chiyoda, Tokyo</a>: Chikumashobo. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU4g">&nbsp;</span>286.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwU4k">梵天國の方では主君の難題の三つまでは容易に解いたが、最後の第四番目の難題が、梵天王のぢきの御判を取つて來よといふので、是だけは流石の天人女房にもよい思案が無い。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E6%98%94%E8%A9%B1%E3%81%A8%E6%96%87%E5%AD%B8&amp;rft.btitle=%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%AC+%E6%9F%B3%E7%94%B0%E5%9C%8B%E7%94%B7%E9%9B%86&amp;rft.place=Chiyoda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=286&amp;rft.pub=Chikumashobo&amp;rft.date=1963-10-25&amp;rft.aulast=Yanagita&amp;rft.aufirst=Kunio&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F9541736%2F1%2F150&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" id="mwU4o"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" id="mwU4s"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" id="mwU4w"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-423" id="cite_note-423" data-mw-footnote-number="399"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwU40"><a href="#cite_ref-423" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwU44"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwU48">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-423" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2543" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwU5A" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:女房（思案をかへた風を裝つて、妹娘に。）　　アーデル、ちよつと一走り、シュルツェんとこに飛んでつて<ruby>來<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>う。丁寧に挨拶するだよ。そして、ちよいと來て下せえと、いふだ、おつ母あが賣りてえもんがあるつてな。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote=<span style=font-variant:small-caps>Frau Wolff</span>. (to Adelheid, feigning to have changed her mind.) Adel, spring quick to Schultze’s. You’ll say hello properly, then tell him to come over a sec, Mama has sump’n to sell.&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=Frau Wolff <small>(ſcheinbar ihren Entſchluß ändernd)</small>. Na Mädel, ſpring a Mal runter zu Schulzen. Sag’n ſchönen Gruß und a ſoll a Mal ruffkommn, de Mutter hätte was zu verkoofen.&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1132183/1/15&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;p=27&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:第一幕&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-chapter=First Act&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=Erſter Akt.&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:喜劇　獺の外套&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=[[The Beaver Coat]]: A Comedy&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Der Biberpelz. Eine Diebskomödie.&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Gerhart Hauptmann&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Gerhart Johann Robert&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Hauptmann&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Tadao&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Hashimoto&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Iwanami Shoten&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|岩波文庫}}&quot;},&quot;21&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=25 August 1942&quot;},&quot;22&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Kanda, Tokyo]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFHauptmann1942" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2543"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gerhart_Hauptmann" title="Gerhart Hauptmann" id="mwU5E">Hauptmann, Gerhart Johann Robert</a> (25 August 1942). "Erſter Akt." <bdi lang="ja" id="mwU5I">第一幕</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU5M">[</span>First Act<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU5Q">]</span>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1132183/1/15" class="external text" id="mwU5U"><i id="mwU5Y">Der Biberpelz. Eine Diebskomödie</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwU5c">喜劇　獺の外套</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU5g">[</span><i id="mwU5k"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Beaver_Coat" title="The Beaver Coat" id="mwU5o">The Beaver Coat</a>: A Comedy</i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU5s">]</span>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwU5w"><span lang="ja" id="mwU50">岩波文庫</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwU54"> (in Japanese). Translated by Hashimoto, Tadao. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kanda,_Tokyo" title="Kanda, Tokyo" id="mwU58">Kanda, Tokyo</a>: Iwanami Shoten. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU6A">&nbsp;</span>27. <q id="mwU6E">Frau Wolff <small id="mwU6I">(ſcheinbar ihren Entſchluß ändernd)</small>. Na Mädel, ſpring a Mal runter zu Schulzen. Sag'n ſchönen Gruß und a ſoll a Mal ruffkommn, de Mutter hätte was zu verkoofen.</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwU6M">女房（思案をかへた風を裝つて、妹娘に。）　　アーデル、ちよつと一走り、シュルツェんとこに飛んでつて<ruby id="mwU6Q">來<rp id="mwU6U">(</rp><rt id="mwU6Y">こ</rt><rp id="mwU6c">)</rp></ruby>う。丁寧に挨拶するだよ。そして、ちよいと來て下せえと、いふだ、おつ母あが賣りてえもんがあるつてな。</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU6g">[</span><span style="font-variant:small-caps" id="mwU6k">Frau Wolff</span>. (to Adelheid, feigning to have changed her mind.) Adel, spring quick to Schultze’s. You’ll say hello properly, then tell him to come over a sec, Mama has sump’n to sell.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU6o">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=Er%C5%BFter+Akt.+%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%95&amp;rft.btitle=Der+Biberpelz.+Eine+Diebskom%C3%B6die.+%E5%96%9C%E5%8A%87%E3%80%80%E7%8D%BA%E3%81%AE%E5%A4%96%E5%A5%97&amp;rft.place=Kanda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E5%B2%A9%E6%B3%A2%E6%96%87%E5%BA%AB%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=27&amp;rft.pub=Iwanami+Shoten&amp;rft.date=1942-08-25&amp;rft.aulast=Hauptmann&amp;rft.aufirst=Gerhart+Johann+Robert&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1132183%2F1%2F15&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2543" id="mwU6s"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2543" id="mwU6w"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2543" id="mwU60"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-424" id="cite_note-424" data-mw-footnote-number="400"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwU64"><a href="#cite_ref-424" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwU68"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwU7A">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-424" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2546" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwU7E" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「ひやあ、このやつがれ！……」と、はいつて來た看視人が喚きたてた、「何たる惡魔が<ruby>助<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けをつたぞな？　グリツコやい、イヴァンやい！　いそぎ<ruby>來<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うよう、拔け出をつたがな。」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=— О, щоб тоби!.. — закричал вошедший сторож. — Який тоби бис помогав! Грицко! Иван! Идите швидче, бо вин развязавсь.&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote=“Urgh, you bastard!……” cried the watchman, coming in, “What the Devil’s helping you? Gritsko, Ivan! Come quick, he’s escaped!”&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;p=32&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1699367/1/18&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:紅い花&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-chapter=A Red Flower&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=Красный цветок&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:紅い花　他四篇&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=A Red Flower, and four other stories&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-link=Kiyoshi Jinzai&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Kiyoshi&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Jinzai&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Vsevolod Mikhailovich Garshin&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Vsevolod Mikhailovich&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Garshin&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|岩波文庫}}&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Iwanami Shoten&quot;},&quot;21&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=30 November 1950&quot;},&quot;22&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;edition=8th&quot;},&quot;23&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;orig-date=15 September 1945&quot;},&quot;24&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Chiyoda, Tokyo]]&quot;},&quot;25&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=1565&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFGarshin1950" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2546"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vsevolod_Mikhailovich_Garshin" title="Vsevolod Mikhailovich Garshin" class="mw-redirect" id="mwU7I">Garshin, Vsevolod Mikhailovich</a> (30 November 1950) [15 September 1945]. "Красный цветок" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwU7M">紅い花</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU7Q">[</span>A Red Flower<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU7U">]</span>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1699367/1/18" class="external text" id="mwU7Y"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwU7c">紅い花　他四篇</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU7g">[</span><i id="mwU7k">A Red Flower, and four other stories</i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU7o">]</span>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwU7s"><span lang="ja" id="mwU7w">岩波文庫</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwU70"> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU74">&nbsp;</span>1565. Translated by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kiyoshi_Jinzai" title="Kiyoshi Jinzai" id="mwU78">Jinzai, Kiyoshi</a> (8th<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU8A">&nbsp;</span>ed.). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiyoda,_Tokyo" title="Chiyoda, Tokyo" id="mwU8E">Chiyoda, Tokyo</a>: Iwanami Shoten. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU8I">&nbsp;</span>32. <q id="mwU8M">— О, щоб тоби!.. — закричал вошедший сторож. — Який тоби бис помогав! Грицко! Иван! Идите швидче, бо вин развязавсь.</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwU8Q">「ひやあ、このやつがれ！……」と、はいつて來た看視人が喚きたてた、「何たる惡魔が<ruby id="mwU8U">助<rp id="mwU8Y">(</rp><rt id="mwU8c">す</rt><rp id="mwU8g">)</rp></ruby>けをつたぞな？　グリツコやい、イヴァンやい！　いそぎ<ruby id="mwU8k">來<rp id="mwU8o">(</rp><rt id="mwU8s">こ</rt><rp id="mwU8w">)</rp></ruby>うよう、拔け出をつたがな。」</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU80">[</span>“Urgh, you bastard!……” cried the watchman, coming in, “What the Devil’s helping you? Gritsko, Ivan! Come quick, he’s escaped!”<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU84">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%D0%9A%D1%80%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9+%D1%86%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BA+%E7%B4%85%E3%81%84%E8%8A%B1&amp;rft.btitle=%E7%B4%85%E3%81%84%E8%8A%B1%E3%80%80%E4%BB%96%E5%9B%9B%E7%AF%87&amp;rft.place=Chiyoda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E5%B2%A9%E6%B3%A2%E6%96%87%E5%BA%AB%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=32&amp;rft.edition=8th&amp;rft.pub=Iwanami+Shoten&amp;rft.date=1950-11-30&amp;rft.aulast=Garshin&amp;rft.aufirst=Vsevolod+Mikhailovich&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1699367%2F1%2F18&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2546" id="mwU88"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2546" id="mwU9A"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2546" id="mwU9E"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-425" id="cite_note-425" data-mw-footnote-number="401"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwU9I"><a href="#cite_ref-425" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwU9M"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwU9Q">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-425" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2549" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwU9U" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote=“Right, right, it’s alright. But will you be comfortable in the barn? I’ll tell the women to lay out a sheet and put you a pillow――Oi, girls!” he cried, getting up. “Here, here‥‥ And you, Fedya, go with them. Women, you know, have no sense.”&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「さあ〱、よろしうごぜえますとも。だけんど、納屋の中なんぞで、ゆつくりお出來になれますかね？　女どもに云ひ付けて、敷布でものべさしたり、枕の一つも置かせませうわい――おい、女ども！」彼は腰を持ち上げながら、かう叫んだ。「こつちだ、こつちだ‥‥それからフェーヂャ、お前も一緒に行つて來う。なんせ、女どもは氣の利かねえもんだでな。」&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=— Милости просимъ. Да покойно ли тебѣ будетъ въ сараѣ? Я прикажу бабамъ постлать тебѣ простыню и положить подушку. — Эй, бабы! вскричалъ онъ, поднимаясь съ мѣста: — сюда, бабы!… А ты, Ѳедя, поди съ ними. Бабы, вѣдь, народъ глупый.&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1690889/1/20&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;p=30&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:ホーリとカリーヌイチ&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=Хорь и Калинычъ.&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-chapter=Khor and Kalinych&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:獵人日記&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=[[A Sportsman's Sketches|A Sportsman’s Sketches]]&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Записки охотника&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=1&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Ivan Turgenev&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Ivan Sergeyevich&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Turgenev&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|新潮文庫}}&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Shinchosha&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Masao&quot;},&quot;21&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Yonekawa&quot;},&quot;22&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=30 December 1951&quot;},&quot;23&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Shinjuku]], Tokyo&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFTurgenev1951" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2549"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ivan_Turgenev" title="Ivan Turgenev" id="mwU9Y">Turgenev, Ivan Sergeyevich</a> (30 December 1951). "Хорь и Калинычъ." <bdi lang="ja" id="mwU9c">ホーリとカリーヌイチ</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU9g">[</span>Khor and Kalinych<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU9k">]</span>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1690889/1/20" class="external text" id="mwU9o"><i id="mwU9s">Записки охотника</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwU9w">獵人日記</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU90">[</span><i id="mwU94"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Sportsman's_Sketches" title="A Sportsman's Sketches" id="mwU98">A Sportsman’s Sketches</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU-A">]</span>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwU-E"><span lang="ja" id="mwU-I">新潮文庫</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwU-M"> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU-Q">&nbsp;</span>1. Translated by Yonekawa, Masao. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shinjuku" title="Shinjuku" id="mwU-U">Shinjuku</a>, Tokyo: Shinchosha. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU-Y">&nbsp;</span>30. <q id="mwU-c">— Милости просимъ. Да покойно ли тебѣ будетъ въ сараѣ? Я прикажу бабамъ постлать тебѣ простыню и положить подушку. — Эй, бабы! вскричалъ онъ, поднимаясь съ мѣста: — сюда, бабы!… А ты, Ѳедя, поди съ ними. Бабы, вѣдь, народъ глупый.</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwU-g">「さあ〱、よろしうごぜえますとも。だけんど、納屋の中なんぞで、ゆつくりお出來になれますかね？　女どもに云ひ付けて、敷布でものべさしたり、枕の一つも置かせませうわい――おい、女ども！」彼は腰を持ち上げながら、かう叫んだ。「こつちだ、こつちだ‥‥それからフェーヂャ、お前も一緒に行つて來う。なんせ、女どもは氣の利かねえもんだでな。」</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU-k">[</span>“Right, right, it’s alright. But will you be comfortable in the barn? I’ll tell the women to lay out a sheet and put you a pillow――Oi, girls!” he cried, getting up. “Here, here‥‥ And you, Fedya, go with them. Women, you know, have no sense.”<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU-o">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%D0%A5%D0%BE%D1%80%D1%8C+%D0%B8+%D0%9A%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%BD%D1%8B%D1%87%D1%8A.+%E3%83%9B%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AA%E3%81%A8%E3%82%AB%E3%83%AA%E3%83%BC%E3%83%8C%E3%82%A4%E3%83%81&amp;rft.btitle=%D0%97%D0%B0%D0%BF%D0%B8%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8+%D0%BE%D1%85%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%B0+%E7%8D%B5%E4%BA%BA%E6%97%A5%E8%A8%98&amp;rft.place=Shinjuku%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E6%96%B0%E6%BD%AE%E6%96%87%E5%BA%AB%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=30&amp;rft.pub=Shinchosha&amp;rft.date=1951-12-30&amp;rft.aulast=Turgenev&amp;rft.aufirst=Ivan+Sergeyevich&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1690889%2F1%2F20&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2549" id="mwU-s"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2549" id="mwU-w"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2549" id="mwU-0"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-426" id="cite_note-426" data-mw-footnote-number="402"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwU-4"><a href="#cite_ref-426" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwU-8"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwU_A">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-426" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2552" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwU_E" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:'''チッバ'''　俺に<ruby>附<rp>(</rp><rt>くツ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>着<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いて來う、<ruby>彼奴<rp>(</rp><rt>きやつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>等<rp>(</rp><rt>ら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と談じてくれう。‥‥（ベンヂーリオーらに）<ruby>諸氏<rp>(</rp><rt>かた〲</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、機嫌よう。一<ruby>言<rp>(</rp><rt>ごん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>申したうござる。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote='''Tyb.''' Follow me close, for I will speak to them.<br/>Gentlemen, good den: a word with one of you.&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:第一場　ヹローナ。街上。&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=Scene I. A public place.&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;p=91&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:ロミオとヂュリエット&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Romeo and Juliet&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=William Shakespeare&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=William&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Shakespeare&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-link=Tsubouchi Shōyō&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Tsubouchi&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Shōyō&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|シェークスピヤ全集}}&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Shinjusha&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=15 July 1957&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Bunkyō]], Tokyo&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1664849/1/51&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="mwU_I" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2552" data-x-id="CITEREFShakespeare1957"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Shakespeare" title="William Shakespeare" id="mwU_M">Shakespeare, William</a> (15 July 1957). "Scene I. A public place." <bdi lang="ja" id="mwU_Q">第一場　ヹローナ。街上。</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1664849/1/51" class="external text" id="mwU_U"><i id="mwU_Y">Romeo and Juliet</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwU_c">ロミオとヂュリエット</bdi></a>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwU_g"><span lang="ja" id="mwU_k">シェークスピヤ全集</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwU_o"> (in Japanese). Translated by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tsubouchi_Shōyō" title="Tsubouchi Shōyō" id="mwU_s">Tsubouchi, Shōyō</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bunkyō" title="Bunkyō" id="mwU_w">Bunkyō</a>, Tokyo: Shinjusha. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwU_0">&nbsp;</span>91. <q id="mwU_4"><b id="mwU_8">Tyb.</b> Follow me close, for I will speak to them.<br id="mwVAA">Gentlemen, good den: a word with one of you.</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwVAE"><b id="mwVAI">チッバ</b>　俺に<ruby id="mwVAM">附<rp id="mwVAQ">(</rp><rt id="mwVAU">くツ</rt><rp id="mwVAY">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwVAc">着<rp id="mwVAg">(</rp><rt id="mwVAk">つ</rt><rp id="mwVAo">)</rp></ruby>いて來う、<ruby id="mwVAs">彼奴<rp id="mwVAw">(</rp><rt id="mwVA0">きやつ</rt><rp id="mwVA4">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwVA8">等<rp id="mwVBA">(</rp><rt id="mwVBE">ら</rt><rp id="mwVBI">)</rp></ruby>と談じてくれう。‥‥（ベンヂーリオーらに）<ruby id="mwVBM">諸氏<rp id="mwVBQ">(</rp><rt id="mwVBU">かた〲</rt><rp id="mwVBY">)</rp></ruby>、機嫌よう。一<ruby id="mwVBc">言<rp id="mwVBg">(</rp><rt id="mwVBk">ごん</rt><rp id="mwVBo">)</rp></ruby>申したうござる。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=Scene+I.+A+public+place.+%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%A0%B4%E3%80%80%E3%83%B9%E3%83%AD%E3%83%BC%E3%83%8A%E3%80%82%E8%A1%97%E4%B8%8A%E3%80%82&amp;rft.btitle=Romeo+and+Juliet+%E3%83%AD%E3%83%9F%E3%82%AA%E3%81%A8%E3%83%82%E3%83%A5%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A8%E3%83%83%E3%83%88&amp;rft.place=Bunky%C5%8D%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E3%82%B7%E3%82%A7%E3%83%BC%E3%82%AF%E3%82%B9%E3%83%94%E3%83%A4%E5%85%A8%E9%9B%86%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=91&amp;rft.pub=Shinjusha&amp;rft.date=1957-07-15&amp;rft.aulast=Shakespeare&amp;rft.aufirst=William&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1664849%2F1%2F51&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2552" id="mwVBs"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2552" id="mwVBw"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2552" id="mwVB0"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-427" id="cite_note-427" data-mw-footnote-number="403"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwVB4"><a href="#cite_ref-427" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwVB8"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwVCA">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-427" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2555" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwVCE" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:'''ホレ'''　ほうい〱！　御前さまいのう。ほうい！<br/>'''ハム'''　ほうい〱！　こゝへ来う。ほうい〱！&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote='''Hor.''' [''Within''] Illo, ho, ho, my lord!<br/>'''Ham.''' Hillo, ho, ho, boy! Come, bird, come.&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;p=42&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=Scene V. Another part of the platform.&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:第五場　高臺の他の一部。&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1664852/1/27&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=Hamlet, Prince of Denmark&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:ハムレット&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=William Shakespeare&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=William&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Shakespeare&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-link=Tsubouchi Shōyō&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Tsubouchi&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Shōyō&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|シェークスピヤ全集}}&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Shinjusha&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=[[Hamlet]]&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=30 April 1958&quot;},&quot;21&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Bunkyō]], Tokyo&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="mwVCI" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2555" data-x-id="CITEREFShakespeare1958"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Shakespeare" title="William Shakespeare" id="mwVCM">Shakespeare, William</a> (30 April 1958). "Scene V. Another part of the platform." <bdi lang="ja" id="mwVCQ">第五場　高臺の他の一部。</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1664852/1/27" class="external text" id="mwVCU"><i id="mwVCY">Hamlet, Prince of Denmark</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwVCc">ハムレット</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwVCg">[</span><i id="mwVCk"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hamlet" title="Hamlet" id="mwVCo">Hamlet</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwVCs">]</span>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwVCw"><span lang="ja" id="mwVC0">シェークスピヤ全集</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwVC4"> (in Japanese). Translated by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tsubouchi_Shōyō" title="Tsubouchi Shōyō" id="mwVC8">Tsubouchi, Shōyō</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bunkyō" title="Bunkyō" id="mwVDA">Bunkyō</a>, Tokyo: Shinjusha. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwVDE">&nbsp;</span>42. <q id="mwVDI"><b id="mwVDM">Hor.</b> [<i id="mwVDQ">Within</i>] Illo, ho, ho, my lord!<br id="mwVDU"><b id="mwVDY">Ham.</b> Hillo, ho, ho, boy! Come, bird, come.</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwVDc"><b id="mwVDg">ホレ</b>　ほうい〱！　御前さまいのう。ほうい！<br id="mwVDk"><b id="mwVDo">ハム</b>　ほうい〱！　こゝへ来う。ほうい〱！</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=Scene+V.+Another+part+of+the+platform.+%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%94%E5%A0%B4%E3%80%80%E9%AB%98%E8%87%BA%E3%81%AE%E4%BB%96%E3%81%AE%E4%B8%80%E9%83%A8%E3%80%82&amp;rft.btitle=Hamlet%2C+Prince+of+Denmark+%E3%83%8F%E3%83%A0%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88&amp;rft.place=Bunky%C5%8D%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E3%82%B7%E3%82%A7%E3%83%BC%E3%82%AF%E3%82%B9%E3%83%94%E3%83%A4%E5%85%A8%E9%9B%86%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=42&amp;rft.pub=Shinjusha&amp;rft.date=1958-04-30&amp;rft.aulast=Shakespeare&amp;rft.aufirst=William&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1664852%2F1%2F27&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2555" id="mwVDs"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2555" id="mwVDw"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2555" id="mwVD0"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-kunieda-1976-mase-428" id="cite_note-kunieda-1976-mase-428" data-mw-footnote-number="404"><span rel="mw:referencedBy" class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwVD4"><a href="#cite_ref-kunieda-1976-mase_428-0" id="mwVD8"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwVEA">1</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-kunieda-1976-mase_428-1" id="mwVEE"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwVEI">2</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-kunieda-1976-mase-428" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2568" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwVEM" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:どうぞお許しくださいまし[…]「夏彦様夏彦様、果たし合いにお勝ちくださりませ！ そうしてどうぞ一刻も早くお城へお帰りくださりませ！ 三点鐘の鳴らぬよう二点鐘の鳴りますように神様お加護くださりませ！」[…]「それではどうぞ江戸の話をお聞かせなされてくださいまし」[…]どうぞお返しくださいませ&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pages=9, 13, 37, 123&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.aozora.gr.jp/cards/000255/files/3041_32480.html&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:八ケ嶽の魔神&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|国枝史郎伝奇文庫}}&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=4&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Kunieda&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Shirō&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=12 April 1976&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Kodansha&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Bunkyō]], Tokyo&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="mwVEQ" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2568" data-x-id="CITEREFKunieda1976">Kunieda, Shirō (12 April 1976). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.aozora.gr.jp/cards/000255/files/3041_32480.html" class="external text" id="mwVEU"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwVEY">八ケ嶽の魔神</bdi></a>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwVEc"><span lang="ja" id="mwVEg">国枝史郎伝奇文庫</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwVEk"> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwVEo">&nbsp;</span>4. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bunkyō" title="Bunkyō" id="mwVEs">Bunkyō</a>, Tokyo: Kodansha. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwVEw">&nbsp;</span>9, 13, 37, 123.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwVE0">どうぞお許しくださいまし[…]「夏彦様夏彦様、果たし合いにお勝ちくださりませ！ そうしてどうぞ一刻も早くお城へお帰りくださりませ！ 三点鐘の鳴らぬよう二点鐘の鳴りますように神様お加護くださりませ！」[…]「それではどうぞ江戸の話をお聞かせなされてくださいまし」[…]どうぞお返しくださいませ</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=%E5%85%AB%E3%82%B1%E5%B6%BD%E3%81%AE%E9%AD%94%E7%A5%9E&amp;rft.place=Bunky%C5%8D%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E5%9B%BD%E6%9E%9D%E5%8F%B2%E9%83%8E%E4%BC%9D%E5%A5%87%E6%96%87%E5%BA%AB%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=9%2C+13%2C+37%2C+123&amp;rft.pub=Kodansha&amp;rft.date=1976-04-12&amp;rft.aulast=Kunieda&amp;rft.aufirst=Shir%C5%8D&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.aozora.gr.jp%2Fcards%2F000255%2Ffiles%2F3041_32480.html&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2568" id="mwVE4"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2568" id="mwVE8"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2568" id="mwVFA"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-kaionji-1989-kudasaimasu-429" id="cite_note-kaionji-1989-kudasaimasu-429" data-mw-footnote-number="405"><span rel="mw:referencedBy" class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwVFE"><a href="#cite_ref-kaionji-1989-kudasaimasu_429-0" id="mwVFI"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwVFM">1</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-kaionji-1989-kudasaimasu_429-1" id="mwVFQ"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwVFU">2</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-kaionji-1989-kudasaimasu-429" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2571" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwVFY" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「お久々でござりまする。いよいよご安泰のご様子、光圀<ruby>珍<rp>(</rp><rt>ちん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>重<rp>(</rp><rt>ちよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に存じまする」[...]「さて、これまでは、手前も失礼をいたしておりましたが、今日よりいささか存ずる<ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>細<rp>(</rp><rt>さい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ござりますれば、あれへご着座くださりまするよう」[...]「わたくし、隣りにひかえておりまする故、ご用の節はお呼びくださりませ」[...]（こらえてくださいまし。あわれと思ってくださいまし。でなくば、わたしの立つ瀬がござりませぬ）[...]「先刻まではさようであった由でござりまするが、見てまいりましょうか」[...]「お待ちくださりませ。殿の仰せられることは拙者もわからぬではございませぬが、よくお考えくださいませ。殿はその御気象なり、また世の見る目も重々しくおわせば、それでよろしゅうございましょう。殿のそのはげしいなされかたのために、御迷惑を蒙らせられるのはご世子様でございますぞ。ご世子様のこと、お家のこと、よくよくお考え下さいませ......」[...]「申訳なく存じまする。ひとえに、拙者のため......」[...]「ははははは、お気にお掛けくださりますなすな。[...]」[...]「[...]この儀おゆるしくださりましょうか」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;pp=10, 54, 67, 85, 215, 237&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:柳沢騒動&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Chōgorō Kaionji&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Chōgorō&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Kaionji&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|時代小説文庫}}&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;volume=162&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Fujimi Shobō&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=1 February 1989&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="mwVFc" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2571" data-x-id="CITEREFKaionji1989"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chōgorō_Kaionji" title="Chōgorō Kaionji" id="mwVFg">Kaionji, Chōgorō</a> (1 February 1989).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwVFk">柳沢騒動</bdi>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwVFo"><span lang="ja" id="mwVFs">時代小説文庫</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwVFw"> (in Japanese). Vol.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwVF0">&nbsp;</span>162. Fujimi Shobō. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwVF4">&nbsp;</span>10, 54, 67, 85, 215, 237.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwVF8">「お久々でござりまする。いよいよご安泰のご様子、光圀<ruby id="mwVGA">珍<rp id="mwVGE">(</rp><rt id="mwVGI">ちん</rt><rp id="mwVGM">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwVGQ">重<rp id="mwVGU">(</rp><rt id="mwVGY">ちよう</rt><rp id="mwVGc">)</rp></ruby>に存じまする」[...]「さて、これまでは、手前も失礼をいたしておりましたが、今日よりいささか存ずる<ruby id="mwVGg">子<rp id="mwVGk">(</rp><rt id="mwVGo">し</rt><rp id="mwVGs">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwVGw">細<rp id="mwVG0">(</rp><rt id="mwVG4">さい</rt><rp id="mwVG8">)</rp></ruby>ござりますれば、あれへご着座くださりまするよう」[...]「わたくし、隣りにひかえておりまする故、ご用の節はお呼びくださりませ」[...]（こらえてくださいまし。あわれと思ってくださいまし。でなくば、わたしの立つ瀬がござりませぬ）[...]「先刻まではさようであった由でござりまするが、見てまいりましょうか」[...]「お待ちくださりませ。殿の仰せられることは拙者もわからぬではございませぬが、よくお考えくださいませ。殿はその御気象なり、また世の見る目も重々しくおわせば、それでよろしゅうございましょう。殿のそのはげしいなされかたのために、御迷惑を蒙らせられるのはご世子様でございますぞ。ご世子様のこと、お家のこと、よくよくお考え下さいませ......」[...]「申訳なく存じまする。ひとえに、拙者のため......」[...]「ははははは、お気にお掛けくださりますなすな。[...]」[...]「[...]この儀おゆるしくださりましょうか」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%9F%B3%E6%B2%A2%E9%A8%92%E5%8B%95&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E6%99%82%E4%BB%A3%E5%B0%8F%E8%AA%AC%E6%96%87%E5%BA%AB%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pages=10%2C+54%2C+67%2C+85%2C+215%2C+237&amp;rft.pub=Fujimi+Shob%C5%8D&amp;rft.date=1989-02-01&amp;rft.aulast=Kaionji&amp;rft.aufirst=Ch%C5%8Dgor%C5%8D&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2571" id="mwVHA"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2571" id="mwVHE"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2571" id="mwVHI"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-430" id="cite_note-430" data-mw-footnote-number="406"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwVHM"><a href="#cite_ref-430" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwVHQ"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwVHU">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-430" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2584" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwVHY" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:えゝ、まゝよ、<ruby>計<rp>(</rp><rt>けい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>略<rp>(</rp><rt>りやく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>があらばあれ、無くば無かれ、こつちは<ruby>擊<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つだけの事よと、『<ruby>鐵<rp>(</rp><rt>てつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>砲<rp>(</rp><rt>ぽう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>擊<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ちかゝれ——』と<ruby>號<rp>(</rp><rt>がう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>令<rp>(</rp><rt>れい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;p=223&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1135897/1/117&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:三十五 順逆論に傾聴す&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=11 February 1943&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Yada&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Sōun&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|天祐書房}}&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Kanda, Tokyo]]&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:太閤記外傳 竹中半兵衞&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFYada1943" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2584">Yada, Sōun (11 February 1943).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwVHc">三十五 順逆論に傾聴す</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1135897/1/117" class="external text" id="mwVHg"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwVHk">太閤記外傳 竹中半兵衞</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kanda,_Tokyo" title="Kanda, Tokyo" id="mwVHo">Kanda, Tokyo</a>: <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwVHs"><span lang="ja" id="mwVHw">天祐書房</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwVH0">. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwVH4">&nbsp;</span>223.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwVH8">えゝ、まゝよ、<ruby id="mwVIA">計<rp id="mwVIE">(</rp><rt id="mwVII">けい</rt><rp id="mwVIM">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwVIQ">略<rp id="mwVIU">(</rp><rt id="mwVIY">りやく</rt><rp id="mwVIc">)</rp></ruby>があらばあれ、無くば無かれ、こつちは<ruby id="mwVIg">擊<rp id="mwVIk">(</rp><rt id="mwVIo">う</rt><rp id="mwVIs">)</rp></ruby>つだけの事よと、『<ruby id="mwVIw">鐵<rp id="mwVI0">(</rp><rt id="mwVI4">てつ</rt><rp id="mwVI8">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwVJA">砲<rp id="mwVJE">(</rp><rt id="mwVJI">ぽう</rt><rp id="mwVJM">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwVJQ">擊<rp id="mwVJU">(</rp><rt id="mwVJY">う</rt><rp id="mwVJc">)</rp></ruby>ちかゝれ——』と<ruby id="mwVJg">號<rp id="mwVJk">(</rp><rt id="mwVJo">がう</rt><rp id="mwVJs">)</rp></ruby><ruby id="mwVJw">令<rp id="mwVJ0">(</rp><rt id="mwVJ4">れい</rt><rp id="mwVJ8">)</rp></ruby>した。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E4%B8%89%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%94+%E9%A0%86%E9%80%86%E8%AB%96%E3%81%AB%E5%82%BE%E8%81%B4%E3%81%99&amp;rft.btitle=%E5%A4%AA%E9%96%A4%E8%A8%98%E5%A4%96%E5%82%B3+%E7%AB%B9%E4%B8%AD%E5%8D%8A%E5%85%B5%E8%A1%9E&amp;rft.place=Kanda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=223&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E5%A4%A9%E7%A5%90%E6%9B%B8%E6%88%BF%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.date=1943-02-11&amp;rft.aulast=Yada&amp;rft.aufirst=S%C5%8Dun&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1135897%2F1%2F117&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2584" id="mwVKA"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2584" id="mwVKE"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2584" id="mwVKI"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-431" id="cite_note-431" data-mw-footnote-number="407"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwVKM"><a href="#cite_ref-431" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwVKQ"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwVKU">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-431" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2587" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwVKY" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;web&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:一つ。<br/>茅ヶ崎の話。今年の浜降祭は、東北のことを考慮し、甚句や鈴鳴らしを自粛し、なるべく静かに行うのであるという。そもそも祭りとは何だ？実りに感謝し、災い無かれと祈る、それが祭りであろう？意気揚々とし、未来を活気づけ、発展へとつなげるものである。それをどうして東北を考慮する？第一、東北の人がこれを聞いたら、むしろ申し訳ないと思うのではないか？&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://ever-chigasaki.com/WPegroup/?column=%E4%BB%8A%E3%80%81%E3%81%93%E3%81%AE%E6%99%82%E3%81%AB%E6%83%B3%E3%81%86%E7%96%91%E5%95%8F%E3%81%A8%E8%A6%9A%E6%82%9F&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:今、この時に想う疑問と覚悟&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;work=Ever Green Home Group&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite class="citation web cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2587" id="mwVKc"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://ever-chigasaki.com/WPegroup/?column=%E4%BB%8A%E3%80%81%E3%81%93%E3%81%AE%E6%99%82%E3%81%AB%E6%83%B3%E3%81%86%E7%96%91%E5%95%8F%E3%81%A8%E8%A6%9A%E6%82%9F" class="external text" id="mwVKg"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwVKk">今、この時に想う疑問と覚悟</bdi></a>. <i id="mwVKo">Ever Green Home Group</i> (in Japanese).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwVKs">一つ。<br id="mwVKw">茅ヶ崎の話。今年の浜降祭は、東北のことを考慮し、甚句や鈴鳴らしを自粛し、なるべく静かに行うのであるという。そもそも祭りとは何だ？実りに感謝し、災い無かれと祈る、それが祭りであろう？意気揚々とし、未来を活気づけ、発展へとつなげるものである。それをどうして東北を考慮する？第一、東北の人がこれを聞いたら、むしろ申し訳ないと思うのではないか？</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Ever+Green+Home+Group&amp;rft.atitle=%E4%BB%8A%E3%80%81%E3%81%93%E3%81%AE%E6%99%82%E3%81%AB%E6%83%B3%E3%81%86%E7%96%91%E5%95%8F%E3%81%A8%E8%A6%9A%E6%82%9F&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fever-chigasaki.com%2FWPegroup%2F%3Fcolumn%3D%25E4%25BB%258A%25E3%2580%2581%25E3%2581%2593%25E3%2581%25AE%25E6%2599%2582%25E3%2581%25AB%25E6%2583%25B3%25E3%2581%2586%25E7%2596%2591%25E5%2595%258F%25E3%2581%25A8%25E8%25A6%259A%25E6%2582%259F&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2587" id="mwVK0"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2587" id="mwVK4"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2587" id="mwVK8"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-432" id="cite_note-432" data-mw-footnote-number="408"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwVLA"><a href="#cite_ref-432" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwVLE"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwVLI">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-432" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2590" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwVLM" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:「それでは呪物だろう。人を呪わば穴二つ。命には命で<ruby>贖<rp>(</rp><rt>あがな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>う。護符は祈りだ。幸多かれと、災い無かれと願うものだ。想いを込める故、命までも注ぎ込む者が無いとは言わぬが、大抵は善き物だよ。五雲国で縁起が良いと言われているものは無いか？それに寄せよう」&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://ncode.syosetu.com/n4174jw/82/&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:第八章 五雲国へ&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=20 May 2025&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:虹霓国の女東宮&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Ukita&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Yōko&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|小説家になろう}}&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFUkita2025" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2590">Ukita, Yōko (20 May 2025).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwVLQ">第八章 五雲国へ</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://ncode.syosetu.com/n4174jw/82/" class="external text" id="mwVLU"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwVLY">虹霓国の女東宮</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwVLc"><span lang="ja" id="mwVLg">小説家になろう</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwVLk">.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwVLo">「それでは呪物だろう。人を呪わば穴二つ。命には命で<ruby id="mwVLs">贖<rp id="mwVLw">(</rp><rt id="mwVL0">あがな</rt><rp id="mwVL4">)</rp></ruby>う。護符は祈りだ。幸多かれと、災い無かれと願うものだ。想いを込める故、命までも注ぎ込む者が無いとは言わぬが、大抵は善き物だよ。五雲国で縁起が良いと言われているものは無いか？それに寄せよう」</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E7%AC%AC%E5%85%AB%E7%AB%A0+%E4%BA%94%E9%9B%B2%E5%9B%BD%E3%81%B8&amp;rft.btitle=%E8%99%B9%E9%9C%93%E5%9B%BD%E3%81%AE%E5%A5%B3%E6%9D%B1%E5%AE%AE&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E5%B0%8F%E8%AA%AC%E5%AE%B6%E3%81%AB%E3%81%AA%E3%82%8D%E3%81%86%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.date=2025-05-20&amp;rft.aulast=Ukita&amp;rft.aufirst=Y%C5%8Dko&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fncode.syosetu.com%2Fn4174jw%2F82%2F&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2590" id="mwVL8"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2590" id="mwVMA"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2590" id="mwVME"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-433" id="cite_note-433" data-mw-footnote-number="409"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwVMI"><a href="#cite_ref-433" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwVMM"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwVMQ">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-433" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2598" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwVMU" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:『私も「そんな男に出來てゐる」のです。』といふ君は、果してどの意味で天上を夢みる人なのであらう。願はくば私自身の如くでは無くあれ。君自身が私に就いて言つたごとく『海底の魚が上層の水に漂ふ光を慕ひ仰ぐ』やうであれ私自身に就いて言へば私はただ淺い泥溝にゐる水蟲が喘ぎ喘ぎ水に浮んだ星影にしたひ寄るやうな者にすぎまい。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;p=4&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/907674/1/7&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:「晴天詩集」の序文として&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:晴天&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Ichiei&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Satō&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=13 October 1922&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|江崎正文堂}}&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Naka-ku, Nagoya|Naka]], [[Nagoya]], [[Aichi Prefecture|Aichi]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFSatō1922" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2598">Satō, Ichiei (13 October 1922).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwVMY">「晴天詩集」の序文として</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/907674/1/7" class="external text" id="mwVMc"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwVMg">晴天</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Naka-ku,_Nagoya" title="Naka-ku, Nagoya" id="mwVMk">Naka</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nagoya" title="Nagoya" id="mwVMo">Nagoya</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aichi_Prefecture" title="Aichi Prefecture" id="mwVMs">Aichi</a>: <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwVMw"><span lang="ja" id="mwVM0">江崎正文堂</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwVM4">. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwVM8">&nbsp;</span>4.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwVNA">『私も「そんな男に出來てゐる」のです。』といふ君は、果してどの意味で天上を夢みる人なのであらう。願はくば私自身の如くでは無くあれ。君自身が私に就いて言つたごとく『海底の魚が上層の水に漂ふ光を慕ひ仰ぐ』やうであれ私自身に就いて言へば私はただ淺い泥溝にゐる水蟲が喘ぎ喘ぎ水に浮んだ星影にしたひ寄るやうな者にすぎまい。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E3%80%8C%E6%99%B4%E5%A4%A9%E8%A9%A9%E9%9B%86%E3%80%8D%E3%81%AE%E5%BA%8F%E6%96%87%E3%81%A8%E3%81%97%E3%81%A6&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%99%B4%E5%A4%A9&amp;rft.place=Naka%2C+Nagoya%2C+Aichi&amp;rft.pages=4&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E6%B1%9F%E5%B4%8E%E6%AD%A3%E6%96%87%E5%A0%82%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.date=1922-10-13&amp;rft.aulast=Sat%C5%8D&amp;rft.aufirst=Ichiei&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F907674%2F1%2F7&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2598" id="mwVNE"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2598" id="mwVNI"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2598" id="mwVNM"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-434" id="cite_note-434" data-mw-footnote-number="410"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwVNQ"><a href="#cite_ref-434" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwVNU"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwVNY">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-434" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2601" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwVNc" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:芭蕉西行の時代は昔のことだ。私の肉體のなかには鐵の齒車がギリギリ廻つてゐる。われわれの文明は、自然をまで支配する。憂ひなくあれといのつた聖者の憂ひは、もはやその無機的社會に何の力もない。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote=The times of [[Bashō]] and [[Saigyō]] are long gone. The iron cogs within my fleshy body are gnashingly turning. Our civilization has mere dominion over nature. The sorrow of the sages, who prayed for none, no longer has power over this inorganic society.&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;p=300&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1068785/1/164&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:何にもならない感想&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:美術隨筆 工房雜記&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=25 October 1942&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Kōshirō Onchi&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Kōshirō&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Onchi&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|興風館}}&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;location=[[Kanda, Tokyo]]&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFOnchi1942" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2601"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kōshirō_Onchi" title="Kōshirō Onchi" id="mwVNg">Onchi, Kōshirō</a> (25 October 1942).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwVNk">何にもならない感想</bdi>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://dl.ndl.go.jp/pid/1068785/1/164" class="external text" id="mwVNo"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwVNs">美術隨筆 工房雜記</bdi></a> (in Japanese). <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kanda,_Tokyo" title="Kanda, Tokyo" id="mwVNw">Kanda, Tokyo</a>: <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwVN0"><span lang="ja" id="mwVN4">興風館</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwVN8">. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwVOA">&nbsp;</span>300.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwVOE">芭蕉西行の時代は昔のことだ。私の肉體のなかには鐵の齒車がギリギリ廻つてゐる。われわれの文明は、自然をまで支配する。憂ひなくあれといのつた聖者の憂ひは、もはやその無機的社會に何の力もない。</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwVOI">[</span>The times of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bashō" title="Bashō" class="mw-redirect" id="mwVOM">Bashō</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saigyō" title="Saigyō" id="mwVOQ">Saigyō</a> are long gone. The iron cogs within my fleshy body are gnashingly turning. Our civilization has mere dominion over nature. The sorrow of the sages, who prayed for none, no longer has power over this inorganic society.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwVOU">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%E4%BD%95%E3%81%AB%E3%82%82%E3%81%AA%E3%82%89%E3%81%AA%E3%81%84%E6%84%9F%E6%83%B3&amp;rft.btitle=%E7%BE%8E%E8%A1%93%E9%9A%A8%E7%AD%86+%E5%B7%A5%E6%88%BF%E9%9B%9C%E8%A8%98&amp;rft.place=Kanda%2C+Tokyo&amp;rft.pages=300&amp;rft.pub=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E8%88%88%E9%A2%A8%E9%A4%A8%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.date=1942-10-25&amp;rft.aulast=Onchi&amp;rft.aufirst=K%C5%8Dshir%C5%8D&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fdl.ndl.go.jp%2Fpid%2F1068785%2F1%2F164&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2601" id="mwVOY"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2601" id="mwVOc"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2601" id="mwVOg"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-435" id="cite_note-435" data-mw-footnote-number="411"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwVOk"><a href="#cite_ref-435" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwVOo"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwVOs">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-435" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2620" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwVOw" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;web&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:時が経過するにつれ、心の中にわだかまっていたエネルギーが動き始めたのが自分でもわかりました。他に対して良くあれと願うのは、自分に対して同じことをしているのだということを、実感できたんです。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://allabout.co.jp/gm/gc/77544/&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:離婚、失明の危機…思い通りにいかないのが人生！ 40代で写真家を目指した女性&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=22 August 2004&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Mizoguchi&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Hiroe&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-work=ja:All About 旅行&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFMizoguchi2004" class="citation web cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2620">Mizoguchi, Hiroe (22 August 2004). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://allabout.co.jp/gm/gc/77544/" class="external text" id="mwVO0"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwVO4">離婚、失明の危機…思い通りにいかないのが人生！ 40代で写真家を目指した女性</bdi></a>.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwVO8">All About 旅行</bdi> (in Japanese).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwVPA">時が経過するにつれ、心の中にわだかまっていたエネルギーが動き始めたのが自分でもわかりました。他に対して良くあれと願うのは、自分に対して同じことをしているのだということを、実感できたんです。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=%E9%9B%A2%E5%A9%9A%E3%80%81%E5%A4%B1%E6%98%8E%E3%81%AE%E5%8D%B1%E6%A9%9F%E2%80%A6%E6%80%9D%E3%81%84%E9%80%9A%E3%82%8A%E3%81%AB%E3%81%84%E3%81%8B%E3%81%AA%E3%81%84%E3%81%AE%E3%81%8C%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%EF%BC%81+40%E4%BB%A3%E3%81%A7%E5%86%99%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%B6%E3%82%92%E7%9B%AE%E6%8C%87%E3%81%97%E3%81%9F%E5%A5%B3%E6%80%A7&amp;rft.date=2004-08-22&amp;rft.aulast=Mizoguchi&amp;rft.aufirst=Hiroe&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fallabout.co.jp%2Fgm%2Fgc%2F77544%2F&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2620" id="mwVPE"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2620" id="mwVPI"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2620" id="mwVPM"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-436" id="cite_note-436" data-mw-footnote-number="412"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwVPQ"><a href="#cite_ref-436" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwVPU"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwVPY">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-436" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2623" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwVPc" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:行為への興味なしの跪拝は無味乾燥でどこへも行き場がない<br/>人生とはそれが良くあれ悪くあれすべて行為からである。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-quote=Prostration without interest in action is dry and leads to nowhere<br/>For life is all action, whether good or bad.&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;quote=سجده بی ذوق عمل خشک و بجائی نرسد<br/>زندگانی همه کردار ، چه زیبا و چه زشت&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-chapter=ja:６　インド人の詩人バルタリーハリーとの会見&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-chapter=6: An Audience with the Indian Poet [[Bhartṛhari|Bartari-Hari]]&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;chapter=بخش ۵۵ – صحبت با شاعر هندی برتری هری&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;title=جاویدنامه&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=[[Book of Eternity]]&quot;},&quot;11&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:永遠の書&quot;},&quot;12&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;authorlink=Muhammad Iqbal&quot;},&quot;13&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Muhammad&quot;},&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Iqbal&quot;},&quot;15&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-link=Hiroji Kataoka&quot;},&quot;16&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-first=Hiroji&quot;},&quot;17&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;translator-last=Kataoka&quot;},&quot;18&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;series={{#invoke:lang|lang|ja|アジアの現代文芸}}&quot;},&quot;19&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=1 January 2022&quot;},&quot;20&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Daido Life Foundation&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFIqbal2022" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2623"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Muhammad_Iqbal" title="Muhammad Iqbal" id="mwVPg">Iqbal, Muhammad</a> (1 January 2022). "بخش ۵۵ – صحبت با شاعر هندی برتری هری" <bdi lang="ja" id="mwVPk">６　インド人の詩人バルタリーハリーとの会見</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwVPo">[</span>6: An Audience with the Indian Poet <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bhartṛhari" title="Bhartṛhari" id="mwVPs">Bartari-Hari</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwVPw">]</span>. <i id="mwVP0">جاویدنامه</i> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwVP4">永遠の書</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwVP8">[</span><i id="mwVQA"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Book_of_Eternity" title="Book of Eternity" class="mw-redirect" id="mwVQE">Book of Eternity</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwVQI">]</span>. <span title="Japanese-language text" id="mwVQM"><span lang="ja" id="mwVQQ">アジアの現代文芸</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Japanese-language_text" id="mwVQU"> (in Japanese). Translated by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hiroji_Kataoka" title="Hiroji Kataoka" id="mwVQY">Kataoka, Hiroji</a>. Daido Life Foundation. <q id="mwVQc">سجده بی ذوق عمل خشک و بجائی نرسد<br id="mwVQg">زندگانی همه کردار ، چه زیبا و چه زشت</q> <bdi lang="ja" id="mwVQk">行為への興味なしの跪拝は無味乾燥でどこへも行き場がない<br id="mwVQo">人生とはそれが良くあれ悪くあれすべて行為からである。</bdi> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwVQs">[</span>Prostration without interest in action is dry and leads to nowhere<br id="mwVQw">For life is all action, whether good or bad.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwVQ0">]</span></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=%D8%A8%D8%AE%D8%B4+%DB%B5%DB%B5+%E2%80%93+%D8%B5%D8%AD%D8%A8%D8%AA+%D8%A8%D8%A7+%D8%B4%D8%A7%D8%B9%D8%B1+%D9%87%D9%86%D8%AF%DB%8C+%D8%A8%D8%B1%D8%AA%D8%B1%DB%8C+%D9%87%D8%B1%DB%8C+%EF%BC%96%E3%80%80%E3%82%A4%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E4%BA%BA%E3%81%AE%E8%A9%A9%E4%BA%BA%E3%83%90%E3%83%AB%E3%82%BF%E3%83%AA%E3%83%BC%E3%83%8F%E3%83%AA%E3%83%BC%E3%81%A8%E3%81%AE%E4%BC%9A%E8%A6%8B&amp;rft.btitle=%D8%AC%D8%A7%D9%88%DB%8C%D8%AF%D9%86%D8%A7%D9%85%D9%87+%E6%B0%B8%E9%81%A0%E3%81%AE%E6%9B%B8&amp;rft.series=%3Cspan+title%3D%22Japanese-language+text%22%3E%3Cspan+lang%3D%22ja%22%3E%E3%82%A2%E3%82%B8%E3%82%A2%E3%81%AE%E7%8F%BE%E4%BB%A3%E6%96%87%E8%8A%B8%3C%2Fspan%3E%3C%2Fspan%3ECategory%3AArticles+containing+Japanese-language+text&amp;rft.pub=Daido+Life+Foundation&amp;rft.date=2022-01-01&amp;rft.aulast=Iqbal&amp;rft.aufirst=Muhammad&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2623" id="mwVQ4"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2623" id="mwVQ8"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2623" id="mwVRA"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-437" id="cite_note-437" data-mw-footnote-number="413"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwVRE"><a href="#cite_ref-437" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwVRI"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwVRM">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-437" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2626" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwVRQ" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;web&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:ゴルフクラブよ、美しく、やさしく、かっこ良くあれ。フォーティーンの14本が紡ぐ、ゴルフのストーリー。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;trans-title=Let Golf Clubs Be Beautiful, Graceful and Stylish. A Golf Story Woven by 14 Fourteen Clubs.&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Yoshiaki&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Takanashi&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=13 April 2023&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.alba.co.jp/articles/category/gear/post/i7g176enjigb/&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;work=ALBA Net Golf&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFTakanashi2023" class="citation web cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2626">Takanashi, Yoshiaki (13 April 2023). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.alba.co.jp/articles/category/gear/post/i7g176enjigb/" class="external text" id="mwVRU"><bdi lang="ja" id="mwVRY">ゴルフクラブよ、美しく、やさしく、かっこ良くあれ。フォーティーンの14本が紡ぐ、ゴルフのストーリー。</bdi></a> <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwVRc">[</span>Let Golf Clubs Be 