<li about="#cite_note-takada-2007-477" id="cite_note-takada-2007-477" data-mw-footnote-number="445"><span rel="mw:referencedBy" class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwV_Y"><a href="#cite_ref-takada-2007_477-0" id="mwV_c"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwV_g">1</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-takada-2007_477-1" id="mwV_k"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwV_o">2</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-takada-2007-477" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2905" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwV_s" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;book&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-quote=ja:もしあなたが心から愛する人、可愛がっている人がいたら、あなたがその人を愛せば愛すほど、その人との別れはつらいものとなります。[...]釈尊の言われることを信ずることで十分なのです。信じる生活を続けると、次第に変わっていきます。&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:明日に希望をつなぐ　東洋のことば&quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Takada&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Akikazu&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=12 December 2007&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Subarusya&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFTakada2007" class="citation book cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2905">Takada, Akikazu (12 December 2007).  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwV_w">明日に希望をつなぐ　東洋のことば</bdi> (in Japanese). Subarusya.  <bdi lang="ja" id="mwV_0">もしあなたが心から愛する人、可愛がっている人がいたら、あなたがその人を愛せば愛すほど、その人との別れはつらいものとなります。[...]釈尊の言われることを信ずることで十分なのです。信じる生活を続けると、次第に変わっていきます。</bdi></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E3%81%AB%E5%B8%8C%E6%9C%9B%E3%82%92%E3%81%A4%E3%81%AA%E3%81%90%E3%80%80%E6%9D%B1%E6%B4%8B%E3%81%AE%E3%81%93%E3%81%A8%E3%81%B0&amp;rft.pub=Subarusya&amp;rft.date=2007-12-12&amp;rft.aulast=Takada&amp;rft.aufirst=Akikazu&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AJapanese+conjugation" class="Z3988" about="#mwt2905" id="mwV_4"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt2905" id="mwV_8"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt2905" id="mwWAA"></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-yamashita-2023-478" id="cite_note-yamashita-2023-478" data-mw-footnote-number="446"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwWAE"><a href="#cite_ref-yamashita-2023_478-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwWAI"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwWAM">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-yamashita-2023-478" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt2916" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwWAQ" data-mw="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;extsrc&quot;:&quot;&quot;},&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;#invoke:cite&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:&quot;invoke&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;journal&quot;},&quot;2&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;lang=ja&quot;},&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;url=https://www.coto.ac.jp/coto/images/2023/%E5%B0%82%E9%96%80%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A1%E6%B9%96%E6%9D%B1%E3%82%AB%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%82%B8%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E8%AA%9E%E6%95%99%E8%82%B2%E7%A0%94%E7%A9%B6%E5%AE%A4%E7%B4%80%E8%A6%812023_%E7%AC%AC3%E5%8F%B7.pdf&quot;},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;page=48 &quot;},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-journal=ja:日本語教育研究室紀要 2023&quot;},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;publisher=Coto College&quot;},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;date=December 2023&quot;},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;script-title=ja:「達します（たっします）」は何グループか&quot;},&quot;9&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;last=Yamashita&quot;},&quot;10&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;first=Akira&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}"><cite id="CITEREFYamashita2023" class="citation journal cs1 cs1-prop-script cs1-prop-foreign-lang-source" about="#mwt2916">Yamashita, Akira (December 2023). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.coto.ac.jp/coto/images/2023/%E5