egory" href="./Category:CS1_uses_Japanese-language_script_(ja)" about="#mwt3755" id="mwZTU"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_Japanese-language_sources_(ja)" about="#mwt3755" id="mwZTY"></span></li>
